('8a50a078-c5e6-b627-d22c-10c6c2773c50', 'en', 'Ichabod, because the glory had departed from Israel'),
('2ccfe5e3-917e-3e14-364b-30c67d624a8b', 'de', 'Drei, wie hineingeworfen worden waren'),
('2ccfe5e3-917e-3e14-364b-30c67d624a8b', 'en', 'Three, as had been thrown in'),
('c08fc59f-ea25-cddd-d8d4-d3f773d31801', 'de', 'Vier, obwohl nur drei hineingeworfen worden waren'),
('c08fc59f-ea25-cddd-d8d4-d3f773d31801', 'en', 'Four, though only three had been thrown in'),
('5b0f3cc9-14d4-23f9-2cd8-46b89a28d4e5', 'de', 'Zwei, denn einer war verbrannt'),
('5b0f3cc9-14d4-23f9-2cd8-46b89a28d4e5', 'en', 'Two, for one had burned'),
('8bf95a8c-7c03-bab0-c88c-8ead4b789cea', 'de', 'Sieben Gestalten im Feuer'),
('8bf95a8c-7c03-bab0-c88c-8ead4b789cea', 'en', 'Seven figures in the fire'),
('159112e3-6d56-855e-95d3-3319d2867259', 'de', 'Folgt mir nach bis zum Kreuz'),
('159112e3-6d56-855e-95d3-3319d2867259', 'en', 'Follow me to the cross'),
('45d6b7ce-85e6-098b-c511-4c814a979b80', 'de', 'Bringt mir Wasser für meinen Durst'),
('45d6b7ce-85e6-098b-c511-4c814a979b80', 'en', 'Bring me water for my thirst'),
('48b8ecda-ea5f-2cd7-9f9e-0af701ba59e3', 'de', 'Weint nicht über mich, sondern über euch und eure Kinder'),
('48b8ecda-ea5f-2cd7-9f9e-0af701ba59e3', 'en', 'Weep not for me, but for yourselves and your children'),
('0cbe3cc4-6064-19da-ae42-a0a5da5e5d76', 'de', 'Kehrt um und betet im Tempel'),
('0cbe3cc4-6064-19da-ae42-a0a5da5e5d76', 'en', 'Turn back and pray in the temple'),
('5b5790eb-82d3-c9d5-c6e3-6991418f9d15', 'de', 'Dass ein neuer Anführer gewählt werde'),
('5b5790eb-82d3-c9d5-c6e3-6991418f9d15', 'en', 'That a new leader be chosen'),
('a34b3f67-112d-25e9-94f6-7c3cc77dc368', 'de', 'Dass das Manna abgeschafft werde'),
('a34b3f67-112d-25e9-94f6-7c3cc77dc368', 'en', 'That the manna be abolished'),
('7e5d7753-b818-05bd-d448-3b0b3ca05a77', 'de', 'Dass auch sie das Priesteramt ausüben dürften'),
('7e5d7753-b818-05bd-d448-3b0b3ca05a77', 'en', 'That they too be allowed the priesthood'),
('0578c4ce-1c8d-8cc6-8a47-9a1fc53d0b7f', 'de', 'Dass sie nach Ägypten zurückkehren'),
('0578c4ce-1c8d-8cc6-8a47-9a1fc53d0b7f', 'en', 'That they return to Egypt'),
('bf2704e7-582a-ceba-482b-92ef7c6a37ff', 'de', 'Er ließ Joab sofort hinrichten'),
('bf2704e7-582a-ceba-482b-92ef7c6a37ff', 'en', 'He had Joab executed at once'),
('846016d7-2206-0583-e70d-35ecf6b38ab2', 'de', 'Er floh aus Hebron nach Jerusalem'),
('846016d7-2206-0583-e70d-35ecf6b38ab2', 'en', 'He fled from Hebron to Jerusalem'),
('1fd45610-c700-0f8d-dfb1-7820058c5b35', 'de', 'Er verbot jede Erwähnung von Abners Namen'),
('1fd45610-c700-0f8d-dfb1-7820058c5b35', 'en', 'He forbade any mention of Abner''s name'),
('8ae444ae-307c-55b5-5299-3799f088abd9', 'de', 'Er trauerte, folgte der Bahre und hielt eine Totenklage'),
('8ae444ae-307c-55b5-5299-3799f088abd9', 'en', 'He mourned, followed the bier, and sang a lament'),
('55eb0043-5c79-5f34-17d5-97e75e029684', 'de', 'Er forderte Belohnung von den Weisen'),
('55eb0043-5c79-5f34-17d5-97e75e029684', 'en', 'He demanded reward from the wise men'),
('9be5f193-6066-efdc-8e35-231c4661a030', 'de', 'Er pries den Gott des Himmels mit einem Lobgebet'),
('9be5f193-6066-efdc-8e35-231c4661a030', 'en', 'He praised the God of heaven with a hymn of thanks'),
('02507b86-045c-e554-9760-17153467661f', 'de', 'Er schrieb es heimlich nieder'),
('02507b86-045c-e554-9760-17153467661f', 'en', 'He wrote it down secretly'),
('dff35dc7-c858-5501-3d6b-d9248fa7d86b', 'de', 'Er eilte sogleich allein zum König'),
('dff35dc7-c858-5501-3d6b-d9248fa7d86b', 'en', 'He rushed alone to the king at once'),
('d9831722-4211-cbd5-93b5-f3c9f936b317', 'de', 'Er starb im Gefängnis in Babel'),
('d9831722-4211-cbd5-93b5-f3c9f936b317', 'en', 'He died in prison in Babylon'),
('c088e9a4-39f7-5aa3-5fce-55d9c5203bd1', 'de', 'Er wurde aus dem Kerker erhoben und aß am Königstisch'),
('c088e9a4-39f7-5aa3-5fce-55d9c5203bd1', 'en', 'He was lifted from prison and ate at the king''s table'),
('84adf667-aaf2-0303-f45d-6cceba4ab7bf', 'de', 'Er wurde zum König von Babel gemacht'),
('84adf667-aaf2-0303-f45d-6cceba4ab7bf', 'en', 'He was made king of Babylon'),
('0c992129-9497-3eff-01b1-db3c607cefdf', 'de', 'Er kehrte nach Jerusalem zurück'),
('0c992129-9497-3eff-01b1-db3c607cefdf', 'en', 'He returned to Jerusalem'),
('70b51e4e-55d7-94fa-7192-95d5a0806e5d', 'de', 'Ich vermag alles durch das Gesetz'),
('70b51e4e-55d7-94fa-7192-95d5a0806e5d', 'en', 'I can do all things through the law'),
('5a27727c-a70c-c2ca-ebc5-705b37a79f7c', 'de', 'Ich vermag alles durch Weisheit'),
('5a27727c-a70c-c2ca-ebc5-705b37a79f7c', 'en', 'I can do all things through wisdom'),
('81923356-caff-ee13-8cfe-a906754cbc38', 'de', 'Ich vermag alles durch Christus'),
('81923356-caff-ee13-8cfe-a906754cbc38', 'en', 'I can do all things through Christ'),
('bd53d6d4-7358-3924-6285-bb985ddc6782', 'de', 'Ich vermag alles aus mir selbst'),
('bd53d6d4-7358-3924-6285-bb985ddc6782', 'en', 'I can do all things by myself'),
('5de446df-d1b0-089f-e717-0d75bbd30d0a', 'de', 'Allein der Unglaube'),
('5de446df-d1b0-089f-e717-0d75bbd30d0a', 'en', 'Only unbelief'),
('4a7f71b4-62ce-d8ee-4493-ec13021ea67f', 'de', 'Weder Tod noch Leben'),
('4a7f71b4-62ce-d8ee-4493-ec13021ea67f', 'en', 'Neither death nor life'),
('18ce91f5-44f0-1606-5bd5-ad14afa54961', 'de', 'Allein der Tod'),
('18ce91f5-44f0-1606-5bd5-ad14afa54961', 'en', 'Only death'),
('887fb9e0-618b-d19d-abf2-107a5486cf87', 'de', 'Allein die Sünde'),
('887fb9e0-618b-d19d-abf2-107a5486cf87', 'en', 'Only sin'),
('aa51b7b3-5e59-5df2-4fc7-ffeda62897ec', 'de', 'Dass das Volk ihn ehren werde'),
('aa51b7b3-5e59-5df2-4fc7-ffeda62897ec', 'en', 'That the people would honor him'),
('a702cfa7-8155-a0e8-763e-6b301b897851', 'de', 'Dass er bald reich und mächtig werde'),
('a702cfa7-8155-a0e8-763e-6b301b897851', 'en', 'That he would soon become rich and mighty'),
('f9ce1592-c0e5-b0b3-5cc8-48e41b0d275d', 'de', 'Dass Gott ihn schon im Mutterleib zum Propheten geheiligt habe'),
('f9ce1592-c0e5-b0b3-5cc8-48e41b0d275d', 'en', 'That God had set him apart as a prophet already in the womb'),
('6150114f-f841-6a5c-0c41-b633b0c1f982', 'de', 'Dass er nie leiden müsse'),
('6150114f-f841-6a5c-0c41-b633b0c1f982', 'en', 'That he would never have to suffer'),
('80814a33-d54a-a4b7-e958-297583cb7d47', 'de', 'Gedanken des Friedens und nicht des Leides, eine Zukunft und Hoffnung'),
('80814a33-d54a-a4b7-e958-297583cb7d47', 'en', 'Thoughts of peace and not of harm, a future and a hope'),
('9271851f-c1ce-815f-f62d-aedaa5c63487', 'de', 'Gedanken des Zorns über alle Geschlechter'),
('9271851f-c1ce-815f-f62d-aedaa5c63487', 'en', 'Thoughts of wrath over all generations'),
('dceb5f2f-aae2-c344-6a14-87c17a52b607', 'de', 'Gedanken, das Volk für immer zu verstoßen'),
('dceb5f2f-aae2-c344-6a14-87c17a52b607', 'en', 'Thoughts to cast off the people forever'),
('b4b6be02-d7a4-1c3e-9b82-40bfdefdabfe', 'de', 'Gedanken, einen neuen Tempel aus Gold zu bauen'),
('b4b6be02-d7a4-1c3e-9b82-40bfdefdabfe', 'en', 'Thoughts to build a new temple of gold'),
('959f2cc6-ef9f-27b8-9084-05d92a3068d6', 'de', 'Er bestach die Wächter von Geschur'),
('959f2cc6-ef9f-27b8-9084-05d92a3068d6', 'en', 'He bribed the guards of Geshur'),
('7c57a99b-2f0a-e73d-2dc7-ad9e76d6ce4d', 'de', 'Er sandte eine kluge Frau aus Tekoa mit einem erdachten Rechtsfall zu David'),
('7c57a99b-2f0a-e73d-2dc7-ad9e76d6ce4d', 'en', 'He sent a wise woman from Tekoa with a made-up legal case to David'),
('81771915-b9da-1645-8828-354214f7ad6d', 'de', 'Er führte ein Heer gegen Talmai'),
('81771915-b9da-1645-8828-354214f7ad6d', 'en', 'He led an army against Talmai'),
('7f9ecaea-9185-e72e-cff9-8522f5b22a08', 'de', 'Er bat David offen um Begnadigung'),
('7f9ecaea-9185-e72e-cff9-8522f5b22a08', 'en', 'He openly asked David for a pardon'),
('93b37687-b10c-f435-1f77-86ad531a352e', 'de', 'Viermal'),
('93b37687-b10c-f435-1f77-86ad531a352e', 'en', 'Four times'),
('4fee5461-bf24-2d70-2315-c3f3e9f20a1d', 'de', 'Zweimal'),
('4fee5461-bf24-2d70-2315-c3f3e9f20a1d', 'en', 'Twice'),
('fbb7eb56-3ca9-f7e0-0e3d-4dca20ed717d', 'de', 'Siebenmal'),
('fbb7eb56-3ca9-f7e0-0e3d-4dca20ed717d', 'en', 'Seven times'),
('c1d7d259-d641-20e8-b0d8-23de5c78ba98', 'de', 'Dreimal'),
('c1d7d259-d641-20e8-b0d8-23de5c78ba98', 'en', 'Three times'),
('447d77a8-85bc-68c2-eb8c-e497a95924fa', 'de', 'Abner durchbohrte ihn mit dem hinteren Ende seines Speers'),
('447d77a8-85bc-68c2-eb8c-e497a95924fa', 'en', 'Abner struck him with the butt end of his spear'),
('2dc2aca9-f1f4-1065-2dd9-ecfd82c0d932', 'de', 'Er fiel von der Stadtmauer Hebrons'),
('2dc2aca9-f1f4-1065-2dd9-ecfd82c0d932', 'en', 'He fell from the wall of Hebron'),
('734fd0a6-4203-d0a3-c286-732b14b6d52c', 'de', 'Die Philister erschlugen ihn in der Schlacht'),
('734fd0a6-4203-d0a3-c286-732b14b6d52c', 'en', 'The Philistines killed him in battle'),
('660d50c6-5285-4225-d56e-4fcaf10d2286', 'de', 'Joab erstach ihn aus Versehen im Gefecht'),
('660d50c6-5285-4225-d56e-4fcaf10d2286', 'en', 'Joab accidentally stabbed him in battle'),
('9f23c486-6ff6-835c-dcc7-4d08ee96c949', 'de', 'Die Erde tat sich auf'),
('9f23c486-6ff6-835c-dcc7-4d08ee96c949', 'en', 'The earth opened up'),
('3404c273-0f11-2599-2979-5d8d52b12a14', 'de', 'Feurige Schlangen kamen und bissen viele zu Tode'),
('3404c273-0f11-2599-2979-5d8d52b12a14', 'en', 'Fiery serpents came and bit many to death'),
('399f53c5-7391-c561-3aa4-688f1ac6117c', 'de', 'Eine Hungersnot brach aus'),
('399f53c5-7391-c561-3aa4-688f1ac6117c', 'en', 'A famine broke out'),
('b7c0a790-792a-2214-7709-ddde59cc0d0a', 'de', 'Eine Wolke verfinsterte das Lager'),
('b7c0a790-792a-2214-7709-ddde59cc0d0a', 'en', 'A cloud darkened the camp'),
('2733293f-fc68-04bc-b18a-f928a1cfb2d1', 'de', 'Es geschieht durch die Engel des Himmels'),
('2733293f-fc68-04bc-b18a-f928a1cfb2d1', 'en', 'It is done through the angels of heaven'),
('9fb4fba3-037c-7a1a-5408-65b7e8646c63', 'de', 'Ein Reich, das mit sich selbst uneins ist, kann nicht bestehen'),
('9fb4fba3-037c-7a1a-5408-65b7e8646c63', 'en', 'A kingdom divided against itself cannot stand'),
('af3701e4-bd22-c1ea-482e-a07b04f6c719', 'de', 'Nur durch das Gesetz Moses geschieht es'),
('af3701e4-bd22-c1ea-482e-a07b04f6c719', 'en', 'It happens only through the law of Moses'),
('5b9fa468-84fe-b26e-f849-0e0a65980419', 'de', 'Niemand kann das Geheimnis verstehen'),
('5b9fa468-84fe-b26e-f849-0e0a65980419', 'en', 'No one can understand the mystery'),
('680d18bf-f2cf-2e60-4a81-ce2a2f25dc81', 'de', 'Wer den Tempel täglich besucht'),
('680d18bf-f2cf-2e60-4a81-ce2a2f25dc81', 'en', 'Whoever visits the temple daily'),
('0f290445-57e3-5eb6-9c70-095b8b7ea539', 'de', 'Wer den Priestern Gaben bringt'),
('0f290445-57e3-5eb6-9c70-095b8b7ea539', 'en', 'Whoever brings gifts to the priests'),
('91360918-feea-ca5f-f259-f2bddd136a9e', 'de', 'Wer das Gesetz auswendig kennt'),
('91360918-feea-ca5f-f259-f2bddd136a9e', 'en', 'Whoever knows the law by heart'),
('40937ecb-beb4-8087-0723-ac523dc9e5b7', 'de', 'Wer Jesu Worte hört und danach handelt'),
('40937ecb-beb4-8087-0723-ac523dc9e5b7', 'en', 'Whoever hears Jesus'' words and acts on them'),
('3474abf3-6fe0-148f-1146-89cfb6c149cb', 'de', 'Meister, wer ist der Größte im Reich?'),
('3474abf3-6fe0-148f-1146-89cfb6c149cb', 'en', 'Master, who is greatest in the kingdom?'),
('b7694725-d6bd-3b1b-f87f-cee11f2b1013', 'de', 'Lehrer, soll ich Steuern zahlen?'),
('b7694725-d6bd-3b1b-f87f-cee11f2b1013', 'en', 'Teacher, should I pay taxes?'),
('624b284c-95cd-4490-123b-c7d3a82bc7e7', 'de', 'Herr, wann kommt das Reich Gottes?'),
('624b284c-95cd-4490-123b-c7d3a82bc7e7', 'en', 'Lord, when will the kingdom of God come?'),
('a7f9bad2-5b2f-53ad-4875-81a723db7f80', 'de', 'Guter Meister, was muss ich tun, um das ewige Leben zu ererben?'),
('a7f9bad2-5b2f-53ad-4875-81a723db7f80', 'en', 'Good teacher, what must I do to inherit eternal life?'),
('d91fa06d-2132-b49d-8f95-6364f42bdb1d', 'de', 'Dieser ist der Sohn Gottes'),
('d91fa06d-2132-b49d-8f95-6364f42bdb1d', 'en', 'This is the Son of God'),
('e3f3f28e-78ec-7eda-5fff-0205448c96f0', 'de', 'Jesus, der Prophet aus Galiläa'),
('e3f3f28e-78ec-7eda-5fff-0205448c96f0', 'en', 'Jesus, the prophet from Galilee'),
('7d3cf932-af43-0d92-2bed-7950d419ca32', 'de', 'Hier stirbt ein Aufrührer Roms'),
('7d3cf932-af43-0d92-2bed-7950d419ca32', 'en', 'Here dies a rebel of Rome'),
('c4d674b1-d031-14dc-daa1-1353ce5fc5a9', 'de', 'Jesus von Nazareth, der König der Juden'),
('c4d674b1-d031-14dc-daa1-1353ce5fc5a9', 'en', 'Jesus of Nazareth, the King of the Jews'),
('9ba6fe6b-324b-191a-6306-557d55fc02e5', 'de', 'Er zerstörte ihre Zelte'),
('9ba6fe6b-324b-191a-6306-557d55fc02e5', 'en', 'He destroyed their tents'),
('7d8267db-a8c4-7259-6170-a2c6d8b58dcd', 'de', 'Er forderte einen Zweikampf Mann gegen Mann'),
('7d8267db-a8c4-7259-6170-a2c6d8b58dcd', 'en', 'He challenged them to single combat man against man'),
('86771f4a-8620-8805-1502-4bcc6bd90625', 'de', 'Er sang Spottlieder über den HERRN'),
('86771f4a-8620-8805-1502-4bcc6bd90625', 'en', 'He sang taunting songs against the LORD'),
('41666fd6-1313-e3b2-9f4e-5bd9f6b2d97c', 'de', 'Er warf Steine ins Lager'),
('41666fd6-1313-e3b2-9f4e-5bd9f6b2d97c', 'en', 'He threw stones into the camp'),
('df36f9d1-6755-e84f-0e41-7a6bca384922', 'de', 'Sie begann zu leuchten'),
('df36f9d1-6755-e84f-0e41-7a6bca384922', 'en', 'It began to shine'),
('1f049cc6-88f2-9785-6b96-aeefcf6637af', 'de', 'Sie wurde aussätzig wie Schnee'),
('1f049cc6-88f2-9785-6b96-aeefcf6637af', 'en', 'It became leprous like snow'),
('ef7c33ce-04cf-7408-0117-7304ce0ee4c2', 'de', 'Sie verwandelte sich in Stein'),
('ef7c33ce-04cf-7408-0117-7304ce0ee4c2', 'en', 'It turned into stone'),
('b4a86ddf-bab2-b8cd-eddc-9bf5856f8cbd', 'de', 'Sie verdorrte und wurde lahm'),
('b4a86ddf-bab2-b8cd-eddc-9bf5856f8cbd', 'en', 'It withered and became lame'),
('11aef0b4-89bd-cd68-a602-a643d6217be0', 'de', 'Auf Levis Rat hin'),
('11aef0b4-89bd-cd68-a602-a643d6217be0', 'en', 'On Levi''s advice'),
('4e15863c-96f7-9031-2eea-84d92ebbd6b8', 'de', 'Auf Judas Rat hin'),
('4e15863c-96f7-9031-2eea-84d92ebbd6b8', 'en', 'On Judah''s advice'),
('b241cb31-7d2c-3275-ed8e-f0f04f8c8fb4', 'de', 'Auf Rubens Rat hin'),
('b241cb31-7d2c-3275-ed8e-f0f04f8c8fb4', 'en', 'On Reuben''s advice'),
('15a366ef-4716-0717-4213-7dd4f22c349b', 'de', 'Auf Simeons Rat hin'),
('15a366ef-4716-0717-4213-7dd4f22c349b', 'en', 'On Simeon''s advice'),
('ac9c0cd0-63f3-e66e-19c8-31eae40c2bc9', 'de', 'Sie pries seine Frömmigkeit vor dem Volk'),
('ac9c0cd0-63f3-e66e-19c8-31eae40c2bc9', 'en', 'She praised his piety before the people'),
('eae97041-4321-5e0e-2c92-eef4791d49cb', 'de', 'Sie verachtete ihn in ihrem Herzen und spottete über sein Verhalten'),
('eae97041-4321-5e0e-2c92-eef4791d49cb', 'en', 'She despised him in her heart and mocked his conduct'),
('745d4921-5870-db07-5945-4ddaa27767b2', 'de', 'Sie tanzte freudig mit ihm zusammen'),
('745d4921-5870-db07-5945-4ddaa27767b2', 'en', 'She joyfully danced together with him'),
('739fb66a-c9d3-4f4d-d3a8-3fb88ebd9569', 'de', 'Sie warf ihm Untreue vor'),
('739fb66a-c9d3-4f4d-d3a8-3fb88ebd9569', 'en', 'She accused him of unfaithfulness'),
('a50f84e7-5670-2c4f-7930-fbb17d583c56', 'de', '… aber Mühe lohnt sich am Ende'),
('a50f84e7-5670-2c4f-7930-fbb17d583c56', 'en', '… but toil pays off in the end'),
('e26f958d-1d4d-c5c5-bb5e-6338d085462b', 'de', '… aber Weisheit bringt Ehre'),
('e26f958d-1d4d-c5c5-bb5e-6338d085462b', 'en', '… but wisdom brings honor'),
('5b8ab5da-c32f-9870-fc67-06f458f65172', 'de', '… aber Gerechtigkeit rettet vom Tod'),
('5b8ab5da-c32f-9870-fc67-06f458f65172', 'en', '… but righteousness delivers from death'),
('0d67a4d0-6f1f-2df5-7cd4-c6585f0583d5', 'de', '… aber der König schützt die Seinen'),
('0d67a4d0-6f1f-2df5-7cd4-c6585f0583d5', 'en', '… but the king protects his own'),
('91f13eb4-d2e2-6d59-9924-d76b27c183d5', 'de', 'Beides als Beute behalten'),
('91f13eb4-d2e2-6d59-9924-d76b27c183d5', 'en', 'Both kept as spoil'),
('24ac8ed0-d172-b35e-eca0-3c2fef5d7e9c', 'de', 'Die Pferde gelähmt und die Wagen verbrannt'),
('24ac8ed0-d172-b35e-eca0-3c2fef5d7e9c', 'en', 'The horses hamstrung and the chariots burned'),
('44691d4a-0fe0-dcc1-78a7-33deeecfdeed', 'de', 'Den Gibeonitern übergeben'),
('44691d4a-0fe0-dcc1-78a7-33deeecfdeed', 'en', 'Handed to the Gibeonites'),
('c28002a4-763c-88eb-e738-16f81e9fd55c', 'de', 'Den Königen zurückgegeben'),
('c28002a4-763c-88eb-e738-16f81e9fd55c', 'en', 'Returned to the kings'),
('2f469e43-200b-d1e1-f6eb-4d10d1830445', 'de', 'Du wirst der Hüter der Fische sein'),
('2f469e43-200b-d1e1-f6eb-4d10d1830445', 'en', 'You will be the keeper of the fish'),
('d322895c-9d71-50e2-a9c3-4d9cb9385006', 'de', 'Von nun an wirst du Menschen fangen'),
('d322895c-9d71-50e2-a9c3-4d9cb9385006', 'en', 'From now on you will catch people'),
('9a71b221-bc83-8213-3123-1e5d7217b31e', 'de', 'Du sollst die Netze für immer ablegen'),
('9a71b221-bc83-8213-3123-1e5d7217b31e', 'en', 'You shall lay down the nets forever'),
('e1f67ec2-198e-2dc2-8003-461498fb10ee', 'de', 'Kehre zu deinem alten Handwerk zurück'),
('e1f67ec2-198e-2dc2-8003-461498fb10ee', 'en', 'Return to your old trade'),
('148df24f-5fcc-8562-e9f7-c7d3794f806b', 'de', 'Es errichtete Götzenbilder'),
('148df24f-5fcc-8562-e9f7-c7d3794f806b', 'en', 'It set up idols'),
('9eaf458f-102b-4f9d-8824-e4f427d17d30', 'de', 'Es schickte falsche Propheten'),
('9eaf458f-102b-4f9d-8824-e4f427d17d30', 'en', 'It sent false prophets'),
('61f9392e-d3f3-b885-6f37-929552df95ab', 'de', 'Es verweigerte den Zehnten'),
('61f9392e-d3f3-b885-6f37-929552df95ab', 'en', 'It withheld the tithe'),
('104df31f-29e0-7c81-c411-90f5659f2bbd', 'de', 'Es stand abseits am Tag der Not seines Bruders'),
('104df31f-29e0-7c81-c411-90f5659f2bbd', 'en', 'It stood aloof on the day of its brother''s distress'),
('80439e67-285d-701a-e52b-af7e7c86699a', 'de', 'Der Prophet Hananja'),
('80439e67-285d-701a-e52b-af7e7c86699a', 'en', 'The prophet Hananiah'),
('6cfb8313-6475-fbd5-b9b1-cded62d0c99c', 'de', 'Der Kuschiter Ebed-Melech, ein Hofbeamter'),
('6cfb8313-6475-fbd5-b9b1-cded62d0c99c', 'en', 'Ebed-Melech the Cushite, a court official'),
('3105ef25-0f7c-2e40-b009-969cecd9bd4c', 'de', 'König Zedekia selbst'),
('3105ef25-0f7c-2e40-b009-969cecd9bd4c', 'en', 'King Zedekiah himself'),
('7658bdb8-6f46-94d7-76bc-48035b33b478', 'de', 'Der Schreiber Baruch'),
('7658bdb8-6f46-94d7-76bc-48035b33b478', 'en', 'The scribe Baruch'),
('4ca503a6-f225-c67c-acb2-035a8213894e', 'de', 'Priscilla, die Zeltmacherin'),
('4ca503a6-f225-c67c-acb2-035a8213894e', 'en', 'Priscilla, the tentmaker'),
('ae3190b0-d3b1-395d-ac7a-48396271ed06', 'de', 'Tabita, die Wohltäterin'),
('ae3190b0-d3b1-395d-ac7a-48396271ed06', 'en', 'Tabitha, the benefactress'),
('f70c73e3-32b1-a779-f223-3d97c0082e16', 'de', 'Damaris aus Athen'),
('f70c73e3-32b1-a779-f223-3d97c0082e16', 'en', 'Damaris of Athens'),
('cbf79389-2ace-1cbf-e5eb-9d29a7e5cdbf', 'de', 'Lydia, die Purpurhändlerin'),
('cbf79389-2ace-1cbf-e5eb-9d29a7e5cdbf', 'en', 'Lydia, the seller of purple'),
('c2e3e0aa-5c50-0952-3005-eb02f6377c81', 'de', 'Er herzte sie und legte ihnen die Hände auf'),
('c2e3e0aa-5c50-0952-3005-eb02f6377c81', 'en', 'He embraced them and laid his hands on them'),
('7d945f89-f2c0-cd14-af9d-313376b822ed', 'de', 'Er lehrte sie das Vaterunser'),
('7d945f89-f2c0-cd14-af9d-313376b822ed', 'en', 'He taught them the Lord''s Prayer'),
('f4a90738-908e-525d-0af7-9fb3a414793f', 'de', 'Er taufte sie im Jordan'),
('f4a90738-908e-525d-0af7-9fb3a414793f', 'en', 'He baptized them in the Jordan'),
('f2a07321-8262-3bbb-d0e3-328d582bd481', 'de', 'Er sandte sie mit Brot fort'),
('f2a07321-8262-3bbb-d0e3-328d582bd481', 'en', 'He sent them away with bread'),
('e7e92a64-f15c-75eb-d1cc-1eacc3cbb832', 'de', 'Er ruht am siebten Tag'),
('e7e92a64-f15c-75eb-d1cc-1eacc3cbb832', 'en', 'He rests on the seventh day'),
('0ea206be-da30-7999-f858-bec1cb1d8b5c', 'de', 'Er wohnt fern in der Höhe'),
('0ea206be-da30-7999-f858-bec1cb1d8b5c', 'en', 'He dwells far away on high'),
('13c48e08-e8b8-5c78-888f-a77f62fe89fa', 'de', 'Er schläft noch schlummert nicht'),
('13c48e08-e8b8-5c78-888f-a77f62fe89fa', 'en', 'He neither slumbers nor sleeps'),
('7250357b-910d-8140-0b74-4fa5e784c51a', 'de', 'Er wendet sein Angesicht ab'),
('7250357b-910d-8140-0b74-4fa5e784c51a', 'en', 'He turns his face away'),
('9745eef9-8842-2c24-2ad1-5498e2ccf86b', 'de', 'Er solle zu Absalom gehen und den Rat Ahitofels vereiteln'),
('9745eef9-8842-2c24-2ad1-5498e2ccf86b', 'en', 'He should go to Absalom and frustrate the counsel of Ahithophel'),
('da81825a-8490-fa71-3b3b-bb632757dc4f', 'de', 'Er solle Absalom heimlich töten'),
('da81825a-8490-fa71-3b3b-bb632757dc4f', 'en', 'He should secretly kill Absalom'),
('292d0094-7fce-f1c9-cd79-b35b108b0f66', 'de', 'Er solle das Heer Davids sammeln'),
('292d0094-7fce-f1c9-cd79-b35b108b0f66', 'en', 'He should gather David''s army'),
('4be5a88c-4f4b-7762-8102-f756def30761', 'de', 'Er solle die Lade aus Jerusalem retten'),
('4be5a88c-4f4b-7762-8102-f756def30761', 'en', 'He should rescue the ark from Jerusalem'),
('820e02b3-c9ff-9101-658f-b68b78cec991', 'de', 'Ein neues Haus für Jesus zu bauen'),
('820e02b3-c9ff-9101-658f-b68b78cec991', 'en', 'To build a new house for Jesus'),
('8bcfa9cf-8375-b3d1-d92c-b03b7264715a', 'de', 'Die Hälfte seiner Güter den Armen zu geben und Betrug vierfach zu erstatten'),
('8bcfa9cf-8375-b3d1-d92c-b03b7264715a', 'en', 'To give half his goods to the poor and repay fraud fourfold'),
('4bc1fdbc-3906-f8f2-24b1-d80829da794a', 'de', 'Nach Jerusalem zu pilgern'),
('4bc1fdbc-3906-f8f2-24b1-d80829da794a', 'en', 'To make a pilgrimage to Jerusalem'),
('c76bf46d-4a58-40e7-73da-f8106b5bb1af', 'de', 'Sein Amt als Zöllner aufzugeben'),
('c76bf46d-4a58-40e7-73da-f8106b5bb1af', 'en', 'To resign from his office as tax collector'),
('2185d419-4497-8e14-5a42-1c8bd9b0612a', 'de', 'Steh auf, nimm dein Bett und geh nach Hause'),
('2185d419-4497-8e14-5a42-1c8bd9b0612a', 'en', 'Rise, take up your bed and go home'),
('84161ab0-44c6-852e-1bff-7a4dc2e7b3a0', 'de', 'Folge mir nach als mein Jünger'),
('84161ab0-44c6-852e-1bff-7a4dc2e7b3a0', 'en', 'Follow me as my disciple'),
('e09c86a7-6b40-7eae-f7a1-38eaa930aae0', 'de', 'Bleib liegen und ruhe bis zum Abend'),
('e09c86a7-6b40-7eae-f7a1-38eaa930aae0', 'en', 'Stay lying down and rest until evening'),
('a2fac727-8974-849a-49d7-136ea44928c7', 'de', 'Verkünde es laut auf dem Marktplatz'),
('a2fac727-8974-849a-49d7-136ea44928c7', 'en', 'Proclaim it loudly in the marketplace'),
('a6fe844f-e154-049c-d81d-1e8be394c37e', 'de', 'Die Liebe ist die geringste Tugend'),
('a6fe844f-e154-049c-d81d-1e8be394c37e', 'en', 'Love is the least virtue'),
('c17d6373-cf3e-107c-6d14-01f174b86c52', 'de', 'Die Liebe ist das Band der Vollkommenheit'),
('c17d6373-cf3e-107c-6d14-01f174b86c52', 'en', 'Love is the bond of perfection'),
('bd5fae96-0617-09c7-dd03-f355d380e8c8', 'de', 'Die Liebe steht unter dem Gesetz'),
('bd5fae96-0617-09c7-dd03-f355d380e8c8', 'en', 'Love is under the law'),
('eb5d00ae-724d-2adb-ba37-70bbc603aa9b', 'de', 'Die Liebe trennt die Gläubigen'),
('eb5d00ae-724d-2adb-ba37-70bbc603aa9b', 'en', 'Love divides the believers'),
('762c4f36-237b-d0a3-4bd0-581363a54c6f', 'de', 'Ihr Lohn ist Reichtum, Ehre und Leben'),
('762c4f36-237b-d0a3-4bd0-581363a54c6f', 'en', 'Their reward is riches, honor, and life'),
('69900b02-1cea-a596-88f0-b8c1852ca6df', 'de', 'Ihr Lohn bleibt dem Menschen verborgen'),
('69900b02-1cea-a596-88f0-b8c1852ca6df', 'en', 'Their reward is hidden from man'),
('c5f01297-ab55-ab97-1f0b-a925ce7fd559', 'de', 'Ihr Lohn ist allein das lange Leben'),
('c5f01297-ab55-ab97-1f0b-a925ce7fd559', 'en', 'Their reward is only long life'),
('abc85f75-c41c-a565-c81e-bbd0439644f6', 'de', 'Ihr Lohn ist Mühe und Verachtung'),
('abc85f75-c41c-a565-c81e-bbd0439644f6', 'en', 'Their reward is toil and contempt'),
('fc695cf5-39e4-2f74-37d2-3cbf5a3c422c', 'de', 'Er vergrub es in der Erde'),
('fc695cf5-39e4-2f74-37d2-3cbf5a3c422c', 'en', 'He buried it in the ground'),
('9d9da764-70ab-8757-7948-0cd7dc244f51', 'de', 'Er gab es den Armen der Stadt'),
('9d9da764-70ab-8757-7948-0cd7dc244f51', 'en', 'He gave it to the poor of the city'),
('2be79f8f-f03f-9c68-d565-3454eac7912c', 'de', 'Er brachte es zu den Wechslern'),
('2be79f8f-f03f-9c68-d565-3454eac7912c', 'en', 'He brought it to the money changers'),
('8ab13955-dbb4-cdf9-e2a3-620dc6ba2ee7', 'de', 'Er handelte und gewann ein weiteres'),
('8ab13955-dbb4-cdf9-e2a3-620dc6ba2ee7', 'en', 'He traded and gained another'),
('15966289-a60f-d4bb-e2a3-8dd4a86b9fbd', 'de', 'Alle Schulden wurden verdoppelt'),
('15966289-a60f-d4bb-e2a3-8dd4a86b9fbd', 'en', 'All debts were doubled'),
('3bf5ce18-545b-48e8-e401-8e563956d858', 'de', 'Das Land wurde neu vermessen und verkauft'),
('3bf5ce18-545b-48e8-e401-8e563956d858', 'en', 'The land was re-measured and sold'),
('786d1984-f999-abb0-1742-da1d43c2384e', 'de', 'Die Priester übernahmen alles Eigentum'),
('786d1984-f999-abb0-1742-da1d43c2384e', 'en', 'The priests took over all property'),
('b3af088a-b524-3f12-8c52-a4b2b8ea1677', 'de', 'Das Land kehrte zurück und Sklaven wurden freigelassen'),
('b3af088a-b524-3f12-8c52-a4b2b8ea1677', 'en', 'The land returned and slaves were set free'),
('0e80ca0d-04df-5dbd-db76-db0f142d64ef', 'de', 'Wehe denen, die ein Haus an das andere ziehen'),
('0e80ca0d-04df-5dbd-db76-db0f142d64ef', 'en', 'Woe to those who join house to house'),
('35dbbfae-5a43-7746-3833-078512fce8a3', 'de', 'Wehe denen, die ihre Knechte vertreiben'),
('35dbbfae-5a43-7746-3833-078512fce8a3', 'en', 'Woe to those who drive out their servants'),
('c2aba1e7-dc0f-a6d8-5d19-c9e7252bc8ce', 'de', 'Wehe denen, die ihre Schätze verbergen'),
('c2aba1e7-dc0f-a6d8-5d19-c9e7252bc8ce', 'en', 'Woe to those who hide their treasures'),
('c0edf2ee-ff72-0088-cbcc-73e7c5a34aca', 'de', 'Wehe denen, die ihre Felder verkaufen'),
('c0edf2ee-ff72-0088-cbcc-73e7c5a34aca', 'en', 'Woe to those who sell their fields'),
('b8e01874-39e8-7b2d-f796-70f8b2cbc528', 'de', 'Aus einer Handvoll Erde'),
('b8e01874-39e8-7b2d-f796-70f8b2cbc528', 'en', 'From a handful of earth'),
('bb4d000a-b928-a781-e134-701f9b713a5f', 'de', 'Aus einer Rippe des Menschen'),
('bb4d000a-b928-a781-e134-701f9b713a5f', 'en', 'From a rib of the man'),
('8624b2a0-ed1b-4855-d54a-d23b4c037c7a', 'de', 'Aus dem Staub wie den Mann'),
('8624b2a0-ed1b-4855-d54a-d23b4c037c7a', 'en', 'From the dust like the man'),
('88da8711-4230-99c0-94e1-a0c92ed3d747', 'de', 'Aus dem Atem des Menschen'),
('88da8711-4230-99c0-94e1-a0c92ed3d747', 'en', 'From the breath of the man'),
('1ae059c7-c9d2-c10f-d222-719774493276', 'de', 'Zehn Söhne und keine Töchter'),
('1ae059c7-c9d2-c10f-d222-719774493276', 'en', 'Ten sons and no daughters'),
('8433b51c-8066-3cda-9201-c9595fea627c', 'de', 'Sieben Söhne und drei Töchter'),
('8433b51c-8066-3cda-9201-c9595fea627c', 'en', 'Seven sons and three daughters'),
('54243c05-1c61-56ab-5d2a-d1453ea3392e', 'de', 'Zwölf Söhne und zwölf Töchter'),
('54243c05-1c61-56ab-5d2a-d1453ea3392e', 'en', 'Twelve sons and twelve daughters'),
('0923fdce-69fa-90db-7f0b-a65731adb17a', 'de', 'Drei Söhne und sieben Töchter'),
('0923fdce-69fa-90db-7f0b-a65731adb17a', 'en', 'Three sons and seven daughters'),
('e71222b5-c096-504e-41e5-e4fe1d280a73', 'de', 'Die törichten Jungfrauen hatten kein Öl mehr'),
('e71222b5-c096-504e-41e5-e4fe1d280a73', 'en', 'The foolish virgins had no more oil'),
('52a00a1a-d0b7-92ca-3495-9b30cc2bae5d', 'de', 'Alle Jungfrauen schliefen weiter'),
('52a00a1a-d0b7-92ca-3495-9b30cc2bae5d', 'en', 'All the virgins kept sleeping'),
('466623d1-d11a-1241-d03e-fb81301b7265', 'de', 'Die klugen Jungfrauen waren fortgegangen'),
('466623d1-d11a-1241-d03e-fb81301b7265', 'en', 'The wise virgins had gone away'),
('de40ec57-5542-e735-999d-bd1ad3a333c1', 'de', 'Die Tür des Festes blieb offen'),
('de40ec57-5542-e735-999d-bd1ad3a333c1', 'en', 'The door of the feast stayed open'),
('20ef06b9-16b4-b312-63b4-ab5c343b0f78', 'de', 'Sie verbergen vor Fremden'),
('20ef06b9-16b4-b312-63b4-ab5c343b0f78', 'en', 'Hide them from strangers'),
('c77d9035-a48b-ceca-5a11-8477f181fab9', 'de', 'Sie mit Öl bestreichen'),
('c77d9035-a48b-ceca-5a11-8477f181fab9', 'en', 'Anoint them with oil'),
('f3afe9b6-5117-a44f-bdf3-8df4a287234e', 'de', 'Sie dort verbrennen'),
('f3afe9b6-5117-a44f-bdf3-8df4a287234e', 'en', 'Burn them there'),
('c53b7b17-522b-d7ab-9306-270dda244216', 'de', 'Sie an die Pfosten der Häuser schreiben'),
('c53b7b17-522b-d7ab-9306-270dda244216', 'en', 'Write them on the doorposts of their houses')
insert into public.answer_option_translations (option_id, lang, text) values
('ddda869f-629d-f1a1-4bcf-8c4b38677d5c', 'de', 'Über die Verteilung des Mannas'),
('ddda869f-629d-f1a1-4bcf-8c4b38677d5c', 'en', 'About the distribution of the manna'),
('7e54d1c2-20f1-e50a-dfb6-538c9604f027', 'de', 'Über die Wahl der Kundschafter'),
('7e54d1c2-20f1-e50a-dfb6-538c9604f027', 'en', 'About the choice of the spies'),
('70c33b50-887f-a7ac-6d47-2bd780cc72e2', 'de', 'Über den Mangel an Wasser'),
('70c33b50-887f-a7ac-6d47-2bd780cc72e2', 'en', 'About the lack of water'),
('4de90e83-3c20-c927-064b-74c37406a4d3', 'de', 'Über seine kuschitische Frau und seine Sonderstellung'),
('4de90e83-3c20-c927-064b-74c37406a4d3', 'en', 'About his Cushite wife and his unique standing'),
('953b3e7e-ec0a-b65e-e1c4-ba6671a115b4', 'de', 'Er ritt prächtig gekleidet voran'),
('953b3e7e-ec0a-b65e-e1c4-ba6671a115b4', 'en', 'He rode ahead splendidly dressed'),
('e8e41cae-6c32-f9e5-c7cc-ce9f53f2a9f2', 'de', 'Er ging barfuß und mit verhülltem Haupt'),
('e8e41cae-6c32-f9e5-c7cc-ce9f53f2a9f2', 'en', 'He went barefoot with his head covered'),
('8b521854-138f-deb2-b12b-2ad89aaac469', 'de', 'Er verfluchte das ganze Volk Israel'),
('8b521854-138f-deb2-b12b-2ad89aaac469', 'en', 'He cursed all the people of Israel'),
('af320bac-4f44-5a89-5892-e8f5e38b28b4', 'de', 'Er sang ein Loblied auf den Herrn'),
('af320bac-4f44-5a89-5892-e8f5e38b28b4', 'en', 'He sang a song of praise to the Lord'),
('0d806609-0de6-d508-ffc1-74be34bf9ba2', 'de', 'Einen Reif aus Gold'),
('0d806609-0de6-d508-ffc1-74be34bf9ba2', 'en', 'A circlet of gold'),
('7a3efe31-6265-ede3-9427-39b0cfb08058', 'de', 'Eine Krone aus Dornen'),
('7a3efe31-6265-ede3-9427-39b0cfb08058', 'en', 'A crown of thorns'),
('eb953aeb-931c-b271-8008-6c923104907d', 'de', 'Einen Kranz aus Lorbeer'),
('eb953aeb-931c-b271-8008-6c923104907d', 'en', 'A wreath of laurel'),
('d47612ac-a730-5ff4-129c-10671ca2258e', 'de', 'Eine Binde aus Purpur'),
('d47612ac-a730-5ff4-129c-10671ca2258e', 'en', 'A band of purple'),
('a1325d6b-97f7-4cd3-26f6-1084317c49ff', 'de', 'Er ließ ihn die feurigen Wagen um sie her sehen'),
('a1325d6b-97f7-4cd3-26f6-1084317c49ff', 'en', 'He let him see the fiery chariots around them'),
('7c98978c-d9e8-c0f0-bd9a-2f9f0389cf5f', 'de', 'Er ließ einen Engel die Tore schließen'),
('7c98978c-d9e8-c0f0-bd9a-2f9f0389cf5f', 'en', 'He had an angel shut the gates'),
('019aedb4-fb6e-db7e-81d2-ed2c1391943a', 'de', 'Er rief Feuer auf das Heer herab'),
('019aedb4-fb6e-db7e-81d2-ed2c1391943a', 'en', 'He called down fire on the army'),
('49a88538-cf9a-4409-3577-71b085007566', 'de', 'Er versteckte ihn in einer Höhle'),
('49a88538-cf9a-4409-3577-71b085007566', 'en', 'He hid him in a cave'),
('e7b93e4c-320a-9bab-875a-b565fedbfca1', 'de', 'Mit einem Wolf im Schafspelz'),
('e7b93e4c-320a-9bab-875a-b565fedbfca1', 'en', 'With a wolf in sheep''s clothing'),
('4be7f8d4-6678-5318-a25f-fcc94ca316bc', 'de', 'Mit einer listigen Schlange im Garten'),
('4be7f8d4-6678-5318-a25f-fcc94ca316bc', 'en', 'With a cunning serpent in the garden'),
('b7551289-69f0-48d2-6c7d-721b1c84931f', 'de', 'Mit einem Dieb in der Nacht'),
('b7551289-69f0-48d2-6c7d-721b1c84931f', 'en', 'With a thief in the night'),
('27694709-41bd-abd8-c691-133c2d4b9b35', 'de', 'Mit einem brüllenden Löwen, der zu verschlingen sucht'),
('27694709-41bd-abd8-c691-133c2d4b9b35', 'en', 'With a roaring lion seeking to devour'),
('3ffd7fc1-da2b-7de4-f69a-2f3d455f1155', 'de', 'Die Bestätigung durch Petrus'),
('3ffd7fc1-da2b-7de4-f69a-2f3d455f1155', 'en', 'Confirmation from Peter'),
('59c7ada4-4f4a-722b-866c-666525ef34e0', 'de', 'Ein Wort vom Hohenpriester'),
('59c7ada4-4f4a-722b-866c-666525ef34e0', 'en', 'A word from the high priest'),
('6fd9daf6-10b2-ec41-da0d-efd8e0dd4abd', 'de', 'Ein neues Zeichen am Himmel'),
('6fd9daf6-10b2-ec41-da0d-efd8e0dd4abd', 'en', 'A new sign in heaven'),
