('74e7ff0b-9aa4-a29d-7299-f44c07f2909b', 'en', 'A figure like a man touched him several times'),
('803ca777-3d8b-6feb-e840-cea3b04aaf8f', 'de', 'Der König Darius'),
('803ca777-3d8b-6feb-e840-cea3b04aaf8f', 'en', 'King Darius'),
('40151988-f395-c70c-2d05-ead727c859ed', 'de', 'Einer der Löwen'),
('40151988-f395-c70c-2d05-ead727c859ed', 'en', 'One of the lions'),
('387387a7-f794-f92f-d417-ffee5754e006', 'de', 'Die Königinmutter'),
('387387a7-f794-f92f-d417-ffee5754e006', 'en', 'The queen mother'),
('867284eb-e050-2c33-275f-7aec514a2a1a', 'de', 'Wen der Herr liebt, den züchtigt er'),
('867284eb-e050-2c33-275f-7aec514a2a1a', 'en', 'Whom the Lord loves, he disciplines'),
('4e58c3c0-5ab2-cd9f-0c8d-ca3227d030e1', 'de', 'Wen der Herr richtet, den verstößt er'),
('4e58c3c0-5ab2-cd9f-0c8d-ca3227d030e1', 'en', 'Whom the Lord judges, he casts away'),
('8adaf4b5-6316-fce5-a5fa-b6e73c97f6e0', 'de', 'Wer leidet, ist von Gott verlassen'),
('8adaf4b5-6316-fce5-a5fa-b6e73c97f6e0', 'en', 'Whoever suffers is forsaken by God'),
('0172784f-1470-de03-9199-24db031e6b84', 'de', 'Wer geprüft wird, hat gesündigt'),
('0172784f-1470-de03-9199-24db031e6b84', 'en', 'Whoever is tested has sinned'),
('d6278769-5bf4-d9dd-cc24-25c588242e48', 'de', 'Mit Aussatz bis zu seinem Tod'),
('d6278769-5bf4-d9dd-cc24-25c588242e48', 'en', 'With leprosy until his death'),
('61ad72e8-044a-5ea4-0a99-0e373ccf80b7', 'de', 'Mit Wahnsinn'),
('61ad72e8-044a-5ea4-0a99-0e373ccf80b7', 'en', 'With madness'),
('28ff06f5-4c12-a7b0-9cd7-6094c9fabcb7', 'de', 'Mit Blindheit'),
('28ff06f5-4c12-a7b0-9cd7-6094c9fabcb7', 'en', 'With blindness'),
('2d2c0c14-6135-2e66-f034-06607cd6cf30', 'de', 'Mit Lähmung der Beine'),
('2d2c0c14-6135-2e66-f034-06607cd6cf30', 'en', 'With paralysis of the legs'),
('b75f975e-84be-6d98-f48b-cf50a80e8ab2', 'de', 'Dass sie bald sterben würde'),
('b75f975e-84be-6d98-f48b-cf50a80e8ab2', 'en', 'That she would soon die'),
('cb723e31-b54f-8d19-5297-d1e5e5418e7e', 'de', 'Dass sie aus Galiläa stammte'),
('cb723e31-b54f-8d19-5297-d1e5e5418e7e', 'en', 'That she came from Galilee'),
('18b8e120-673c-e052-417d-a29426eb8fd4', 'de', 'Dass sie fünf Männer gehabt hatte'),
('18b8e120-673c-e052-417d-a29426eb8fd4', 'en', 'That she had had five husbands'),
('ba0fd9cb-3891-f454-f2a7-09871021dd12', 'de', 'Dass sie eine reiche Erbin war'),
('ba0fd9cb-3891-f454-f2a7-09871021dd12', 'en', 'That she was a wealthy heiress'),
('4c477017-f780-ada2-57d0-f40b708a6784', 'de', 'Die Philister hatten es zerstört'),
('4c477017-f780-ada2-57d0-f40b708a6784', 'en', 'The Philistines had destroyed it'),
('d82905b7-bb61-9dcf-6847-f16cf87681d3', 'de', 'Die Amalekiter hatten es niedergebrannt und alle verschleppt'),
('d82905b7-bb61-9dcf-6847-f16cf87681d3', 'en', 'The Amalekites had burned it and carried everyone off'),
('ae61162d-0d0b-3495-ba3a-1a49a8127f07', 'de', 'Es war von Pest heimgesucht'),
('ae61162d-0d0b-3495-ba3a-1a49a8127f07', 'en', 'It was struck by plague'),
('651c823d-279d-3898-caae-500755f9a84c', 'de', 'Saul hatte es besetzt'),
('651c823d-279d-3898-caae-500755f9a84c', 'en', 'Saul had occupied it'),
('0d828132-bafa-9e2f-f2d0-160e80681f16', 'de', 'Sie hat ihren Reichtum dem Reich Gottes geweiht'),
('0d828132-bafa-9e2f-f2d0-160e80681f16', 'en', 'She has dedicated her wealth to the kingdom'),
('a995d323-59b7-1c46-f562-eb9226b1ca75', 'de', 'Sie hat meinen Leib im Voraus zum Begräbnis gesalbt'),
('a995d323-59b7-1c46-f562-eb9226b1ca75', 'en', 'She has anointed my body beforehand for burial'),
('2f05184b-c416-42c6-8939-462f608bc473', 'de', 'Sie hat das Gesetz Moses erfüllt'),
('2f05184b-c416-42c6-8939-462f608bc473', 'en', 'She has fulfilled the law of Moses'),
('f80e5a22-b01e-af4d-702a-fa4257681fda', 'de', 'Sie hat den Tempel geehrt'),
('f80e5a22-b01e-af4d-702a-fa4257681fda', 'en', 'She has honored the temple'),
('bd7aab74-233e-eeed-29ee-03a987f4afd4', 'de', 'Nichts, alles war einzubringen'),
('bd7aab74-233e-eeed-29ee-03a987f4afd4', 'en', 'Nothing, all was to be gathered'),
('86ca353d-cb83-1584-5df2-6b59b590ad22', 'de', 'Ein Zehntel für den König'),
('86ca353d-cb83-1584-5df2-6b59b590ad22', 'en', 'A tenth for the king'),
('346e93dd-b3c6-da4e-9ab4-9b4aebebbcef', 'de', 'Den ganzen Ertrag für die Priester'),
('346e93dd-b3c6-da4e-9ab4-9b4aebebbcef', 'en', 'The entire yield for the priests'),
('04c201d9-364e-f4fd-ea5c-7e73911d9eb6', 'de', 'Die Ränder und Nachlese für Arme und Fremde'),
('04c201d9-364e-f4fd-ea5c-7e73911d9eb6', 'en', 'The edges and gleanings for the poor and the stranger'),
('4c1abaca-5c0c-3c11-6aa8-26b98d86cffe', 'de', 'Sie verwandelten sich in Licht und verschwanden'),
('4c1abaca-5c0c-3c11-6aa8-26b98d86cffe', 'en', 'They turned to light and vanished'),
('5cb2500c-a45b-7149-baab-9a49f9ae0e55', 'de', 'Sie wurden zerrissen und neu'),
('5cb2500c-a45b-7149-baab-9a49f9ae0e55', 'en', 'They were torn and made new'),
('a278ce75-d821-600c-4720-0809e3421204', 'de', 'Sie wurden weiß und glänzend wie kein Bleicher sie machen kann'),
('a278ce75-d821-600c-4720-0809e3421204', 'en', 'They became dazzling white as no launderer could whiten them'),
('364a3136-e981-5091-91fb-4dde7b99b75c', 'de', 'Sie verbrannten in einem Feuer'),
('364a3136-e981-5091-91fb-4dde7b99b75c', 'en', 'They burned in a fire'),
('17fdadf9-7823-fc44-bb5d-e04face7e141', 'de', 'Die Furcht des Herrn, das ist Weisheit'),
('17fdadf9-7823-fc44-bb5d-e04face7e141', 'en', 'The fear of the Lord, that is wisdom'),
