('412caf9c-d1f3-42dd-429d-811f45320b35', 'en', 'They turned into gold'),
('0f0ef1c6-d157-7ae0-cdc8-449dfb214b74', 'de', 'Sie reichten für das ganze Dorf'),
('0f0ef1c6-d157-7ae0-cdc8-449dfb214b74', 'en', 'They were enough for the whole village'),
('c8cb1411-08a4-44bc-3783-886fc0bde914', 'de', 'Es sei nur ein Versehen des Schicksals gewesen'),
('c8cb1411-08a4-44bc-3783-886fc0bde914', 'en', 'It was merely an accident of fate'),
('0daa7be2-4e10-dfb4-3163-77ecd75a2c4d', 'de', 'Gott habe es zum Guten gewendet, um viele am Leben zu erhalten'),
('0daa7be2-4e10-dfb4-3163-77ecd75a2c4d', 'en', 'God had meant it for good, to keep many people alive'),
('5fefaace-1b33-1fa7-e08c-d67ffec371c3', 'de', 'Es sei eine gerechte Strafe für seinen Stolz gewesen'),
('5fefaace-1b33-1fa7-e08c-d67ffec371c3', 'en', 'It was a just punishment for his pride'),
('539f89f3-1bc5-dedd-d44d-fa6876d1afb7', 'de', 'Er werde es ihnen zu gegebener Zeit vergelten'),
('539f89f3-1bc5-dedd-d44d-fa6876d1afb7', 'en', 'He would repay them in due time'),
('3f33e3bf-1264-22e2-ed3c-5de18ae804bb', 'de', 'Sie begannen sogleich, ihn anzuklagen'),
('3f33e3bf-1264-22e2-ed3c-5de18ae804bb', 'en', 'They began at once to accuse him'),
('3bca2f4c-c0de-1d52-c817-4ab3f54ef1dc', 'de', 'Sie boten ihm Speise und Heilkräuter an'),
('3bca2f4c-c0de-1d52-c817-4ab3f54ef1dc', 'en', 'They offered him food and healing herbs'),
('50c9f4d9-dad3-700b-09bb-c9d07a460fb4', 'de', 'Sie wandten sich ab und gingen fort'),
('50c9f4d9-dad3-700b-09bb-c9d07a460fb4', 'en', 'They turned away and departed'),
