('29861dbb-011b-e848-57f7-3c7d960172ac', 'en', 'That he had secretly served idols'),
('7b20fffc-9b17-bd58-0916-ca388d79efcd', 'de', 'Dass seine Kinder gesündigt hätten'),
('7b20fffc-9b17-bd58-0916-ca388d79efcd', 'en', 'That his children had sinned'),
('1f033f50-db97-4a64-d5de-07d128fa5495', 'de', 'Die Schriftrollen des Gesetzes aus Babels Archiv'),
('1f033f50-db97-4a64-d5de-07d128fa5495', 'en', 'The scrolls of the law from Babylon''s archive'),
('dbbbdabe-0d40-4200-2489-3c91698ab0e2', 'de', 'Eine neue Bundeslade aus persischem Gold'),
('dbbbdabe-0d40-4200-2489-3c91698ab0e2', 'en', 'A new ark of the covenant of Persian gold'),
('60ef3995-06c4-df3e-f9a0-55c40ab1c650', 'de', 'Die Gefäße aus Gold und Silber, die Nebukadnezar entführt hatte'),
('60ef3995-06c4-df3e-f9a0-55c40ab1c650', 'en', 'The gold and silver vessels that Nebuchadnezzar had carried off'),
('db489c72-02be-07cf-7de5-7c3210f26e16', 'de', 'Die Krone des Hohenpriesters aus dem Schatzhaus'),
('db489c72-02be-07cf-7de5-7c3210f26e16', 'en', 'The high priest''s crown from the treasury'),
('53c7098a-52ed-7e1c-3775-702c5d10e4d5', 'de', 'Er warf Salz aus einer neuen Schale hinein'),
('53c7098a-52ed-7e1c-3775-702c5d10e4d5', 'en', 'He threw salt from a new bowl into it'),
('a1d21a56-1a4a-c679-41ab-5ef513a28b6c', 'de', 'Er rührte es mit seinem Stab um'),
('a1d21a56-1a4a-c679-41ab-5ef513a28b6c', 'en', 'He stirred it with his staff'),
('c06de56c-a501-964b-a75d-82036832c8c7', 'de', 'Er warf Mehl in das Wasser'),
('c06de56c-a501-964b-a75d-82036832c8c7', 'en', 'He threw flour into the water'),
('581948db-3a49-ffdc-2786-08d9ac42a51d', 'de', 'Er sprach ein Gebet über der Quelle'),
('581948db-3a49-ffdc-2786-08d9ac42a51d', 'en', 'He prayed a prayer over the spring'),
('099b42b6-8adf-97dd-c9d8-d8a16f0dc461', 'de', 'Ich werde ziehen zu fernen Ufern'),
('099b42b6-8adf-97dd-c9d8-d8a16f0dc461', 'en', 'I will journey to distant shores'),
('11c50746-bafc-d07a-23e7-3476b5081919', 'de', 'Ich werde bleiben im Haus des Herrn immerdar'),
('11c50746-bafc-d07a-23e7-3476b5081919', 'en', 'I will dwell in the house of the Lord forever'),
('37735f07-98f4-9817-8d46-7ef0868f0460', 'de', 'Ich werde herrschen über viele Länder'),
('37735f07-98f4-9817-8d46-7ef0868f0460', 'en', 'I will rule over many lands'),
('4970be71-6c4f-5c14-c93c-ff9310615968', 'de', 'Ich werde ruhen unter den Sternen'),
('4970be71-6c4f-5c14-c93c-ff9310615968', 'en', 'I will rest beneath the stars'),
('60c04100-569c-28eb-1c64-e2f6d977d4e8', 'de', 'Damit sie den Tempel bewachten'),
('60c04100-569c-28eb-1c64-e2f6d977d4e8', 'en', 'So they could guard the temple'),
('27542d6c-5daa-6412-f46e-6a360b5e3998', 'de', 'Damit sie das Evangelium den Heiden predigten'),
('27542d6c-5daa-6412-f46e-6a360b5e3998', 'en', 'So they could preach the gospel to the Gentiles'),
('4aa86aa6-1b3e-ace2-805f-717b59ad986e', 'de', 'Damit sie die Schriften abschrieben'),
('4aa86aa6-1b3e-ace2-805f-717b59ad986e', 'en', 'So they could copy the Scriptures'),
('ae93a443-53b1-1c93-55f6-e6b82fe1f2d0', 'de', 'Damit die Witwen bei der täglichen Versorgung nicht übersehen würden'),
('ae93a443-53b1-1c93-55f6-e6b82fe1f2d0', 'en', 'So the widows would not be overlooked in the daily distribution'),
('20685e99-3962-ed20-d1be-9d1f7ec2a431', 'de', 'Es zerbarst in Stücke'),
('20685e99-3962-ed20-d1be-9d1f7ec2a431', 'en', 'It shattered to pieces'),
('ff5451a5-fb6d-e8f0-d505-4ec3bbcb3cf0', 'de', 'Es öffnete sich von selbst vor ihnen'),
('ff5451a5-fb6d-e8f0-d505-4ec3bbcb3cf0', 'en', 'It opened by itself before them'),
('37d20d3f-fede-0874-4fbb-e3b073138508', 'de', 'Es brannte nieder'),
('37d20d3f-fede-0874-4fbb-e3b073138508', 'en', 'It burned down'),
('72c2eb90-b3fb-5d83-e98b-e7899d73447a', 'de', 'Es blieb verschlossen, bis Petrus klopfte'),
('72c2eb90-b3fb-5d83-e98b-e7899d73447a', 'en', 'It stayed shut until Peter knocked'),
('78800441-0d8d-09ff-a761-d967866f730b', 'de', 'Der König Davids im Glanz'),
('78800441-0d8d-09ff-a761-d967866f730b', 'en', 'King David in splendor'),
('96845c71-5fb6-f710-4038-2b9d82657f8f', 'de', 'Ein Mann, dessen Aussehen war wie Erz, mit einer Messschnur und Rute'),
('96845c71-5fb6-f710-4038-2b9d82657f8f', 'en', 'A man whose appearance was like bronze, with a measuring line and rod'),
('c6c56fff-49ff-17bd-8935-71d9f2a15e9b', 'de', 'Der Hohepriester in weißem Gewand'),
('c6c56fff-49ff-17bd-8935-71d9f2a15e9b', 'en', 'The high priest in white robes'),
('ddc79ff6-2615-b5e0-2bd5-63d00c73ed15', 'de', 'Ein Cherub mit feurigem Schwert'),
('ddc79ff6-2615-b5e0-2bd5-63d00c73ed15', 'en', 'A cherub with a fiery sword'),
('595813dc-ac4d-014f-258a-ae295810c577', 'de', 'Siebenmal'),
('595813dc-ac4d-014f-258a-ae295810c577', 'en', 'Seven times'),
('2986cb16-5429-983e-eb95-3fe0aeb320bc', 'de', 'Einmal'),
('2986cb16-5429-983e-eb95-3fe0aeb320bc', 'en', 'Once'),
('19eab716-4c53-9678-d246-779fc65a96b4', 'de', 'Dreimal'),
('19eab716-4c53-9678-d246-779fc65a96b4', 'en', 'Three times'),
('f524447f-a317-011f-e311-f51a3a97e0f3', 'de', 'Zweimal'),
('f524447f-a317-011f-e311-f51a3a97e0f3', 'en', 'Twice'),
('e035baa0-4c2f-bab5-3e81-20264dc4c8b6', 'de', 'Als Diener des Tempels'),
('e035baa0-4c2f-bab5-3e81-20264dc4c8b6', 'en', 'As servants of the temple'),
('f8974eb3-d797-f6ba-2ce6-9568910541bd', 'de', 'Als Boten des Königs'),
('f8974eb3-d797-f6ba-2ce6-9568910541bd', 'en', 'As messengers of the king'),
('c2602fc2-6e03-2f5e-4ea4-3f8f23a69e78', 'de', 'Als Salz der Erde und Licht der Welt'),
('c2602fc2-6e03-2f5e-4ea4-3f8f23a69e78', 'en', 'As the salt of the earth and the light of the world'),
('1508e3f5-0a81-4d5a-54f9-7b9343ca21f3', 'de', 'Als Hirten der Herde'),
('1508e3f5-0a81-4d5a-54f9-7b9343ca21f3', 'en', 'As shepherds of the flock'),
('4e23761e-89d0-32a3-c867-41bb9fe53362', 'de', 'Er starb an einer Krankheit in Jerusalem'),
('4e23761e-89d0-32a3-c867-41bb9fe53362', 'en', 'He died of an illness in Jerusalem'),
('996b19f8-bcdc-51d3-4477-2eac5ed47c6b', 'de', 'Er fiel vor der Stadtmauer von Rabba im Kampf'),
('996b19f8-bcdc-51d3-4477-2eac5ed47c6b', 'en', 'He fell at the wall of Rabbah in battle'),
('4bc67eca-8e99-8ed5-88ef-4dc1084de261', 'de', 'Er wurde von Joab vergiftet'),
('4bc67eca-8e99-8ed5-88ef-4dc1084de261', 'en', 'He was poisoned by Joab'),
('1a8b57ee-d6c7-c120-71f2-dcd6366a93d2', 'de', 'Er wurde von David eigenhändig erschlagen'),
('1a8b57ee-d6c7-c120-71f2-dcd6366a93d2', 'en', 'He was struck down by David''s own hand'),
('ef29a643-498b-5450-eecf-baa9b902ee7a', 'de', 'Eglon und Balak der Moabiter'),
('ef29a643-498b-5450-eecf-baa9b902ee7a', 'en', 'Eglon and Balak of Moab'),
('79dcfb4b-6e0f-984d-b650-0da0a9601d31', 'de', 'Sisera und Jabin von Hazor'),
('79dcfb4b-6e0f-984d-b650-0da0a9601d31', 'en', 'Sisera and Jabin of Hazor'),
('264a8222-918c-c38a-1ad2-074b654d9b75', 'de', 'Oreb und Seeb, die Anführer der Midianiter'),
('264a8222-918c-c38a-1ad2-074b654d9b75', 'en', 'Oreb and Zeeb, the leaders of Midian'),
('0d3ccd0b-b1dc-5137-078b-2c4a15c59c6b', 'de', 'Sebach und Zalmunna, die beiden Könige'),
('0d3ccd0b-b1dc-5137-078b-2c4a15c59c6b', 'en', 'Zebah and Zalmunna, the two kings'),
('db698f3d-d99a-7dac-cda2-4fc0a996a41e', 'de', 'Es verschlug ihr den Atem'),
('db698f3d-d99a-7dac-cda2-4fc0a996a41e', 'en', 'There was no more spirit in her'),
('74c5c2cc-56ed-d6db-20c2-3edaba88d8be', 'de', 'Sie zweifelte weiterhin an den Berichten'),
('74c5c2cc-56ed-d6db-20c2-3edaba88d8be', 'en', 'She continued to doubt the reports'),
('5e6e0a1d-ee89-2e5a-9c6b-b8418762a03b', 'de', 'Sie forderte einen Beweis durch ein Wunder'),
('5e6e0a1d-ee89-2e5a-9c6b-b8418762a03b', 'en', 'She demanded proof by a miracle'),
('d5b0fa68-dccb-a5d5-3247-6dd081358337', 'de', 'Sie verließ zornig den Palast'),
('d5b0fa68-dccb-a5d5-3247-6dd081358337', 'en', 'She left the palace in anger'),
('162c357f-f838-a455-f717-42e3c9c8f943', 'de', 'Dem, der die Welt im Zorn richtet'),
('162c357f-f838-a455-f717-42e3c9c8f943', 'en', 'To him who judges the world in wrath'),
('e15cf935-626e-f528-c5a8-53805ad93489', 'de', 'Dem, der die Sünder in das Feuer wirft'),
('e15cf935-626e-f528-c5a8-53805ad93489', 'en', 'To him who casts sinners into the fire'),
('639168aa-9656-b5e6-ba49-220b15fed0e8', 'de', 'Dem, der euch ohne Fehl vor seine Herrlichkeit stellen kann'),
('639168aa-9656-b5e6-ba49-220b15fed0e8', 'en', 'To him who can present you without fault before his glory'),
('d487a06f-c1ea-2eea-78d6-3d46ba8994d0', 'de', 'Dem, der die Gerechten allein erwählt'),
('d487a06f-c1ea-2eea-78d6-3d46ba8994d0', 'en', 'To him who chooses the righteous alone'),
('653de458-2f20-4b90-4e49-7f2f206527cd', 'de', 'Ich jage nach der Ehre der Menschen'),
('653de458-2f20-4b90-4e49-7f2f206527cd', 'en', 'I press on toward the honor of men'),
('6bf003ad-6751-0d78-5e01-f54978e57404', 'de', 'Ich jage nach irdischem Reichtum'),
('6bf003ad-6751-0d78-5e01-f54978e57404', 'en', 'I press on toward earthly riches'),
('e8286053-43c0-9da7-6ba0-b7a10ae5d1c5', 'de', 'Ich jage nach dem Kampfpreis der himmlischen Berufung'),
('e8286053-43c0-9da7-6ba0-b7a10ae5d1c5', 'en', 'I press on toward the prize of the heavenly calling'),
('92107c7c-7859-18fa-e215-9590cf198a6f', 'de', 'Ich habe das Ziel bereits ergriffen'),
('92107c7c-7859-18fa-e215-9590cf198a6f', 'en', 'I have already attained the goal'),
('63bf4eb4-b6b9-7f78-048b-681bf28c345b', 'de', 'Dass sie im Namen Jesu lehrten'),
('63bf4eb4-b6b9-7f78-048b-681bf28c345b', 'en', 'That they taught in the name of Jesus'),
('e7864d11-6b74-fdd1-5732-9cec7cca1796', 'de', 'Dass sie das Gesetz brachen'),
('e7864d11-6b74-fdd1-5732-9cec7cca1796', 'en', 'That they broke the law'),
('574f702a-4600-f2f2-231e-d02de18a5a27', 'de', 'Dass sie den Tempel entweiht hätten'),
('574f702a-4600-f2f2-231e-d02de18a5a27', 'en', 'That they had defiled the temple'),
('46760e4a-7b88-e941-3fe8-70a9c7a153ca', 'de', 'Dass sie zur Empörung aufriefen'),
('46760e4a-7b88-e941-3fe8-70a9c7a153ca', 'en', 'That they incited rebellion'),
('915e9ff9-6ca8-c46e-6c1a-6666f7c88d98', 'de', 'Denn dadurch wird man von Pflichten frei'),
('915e9ff9-6ca8-c46e-6c1a-6666f7c88d98', 'en', 'For thereby one is freed from duties'),
('9002e0da-d96a-0843-1567-fb538ee9e580', 'de', 'Denn dadurch haben einige Engel beherbergt'),
('9002e0da-d96a-0843-1567-fb538ee9e580', 'en', 'For thereby some have entertained angels'),
('3cff890c-4990-9bf4-d9aa-7832f0def758', 'de', 'Denn dadurch erwirbt man irdischen Lohn'),
('3cff890c-4990-9bf4-d9aa-7832f0def758', 'en', 'For thereby one earns an earthly reward'),
('8f68f5f8-9c53-c5ef-e159-ef637fc19ae4', 'de', 'Denn dadurch erfüllt man das Zeremonialgesetz'),
('8f68f5f8-9c53-c5ef-e159-ef637fc19ae4', 'en', 'For thereby one fulfills the ceremonial law'),
('0604d45d-bd19-f3b5-3742-aee48459cf20', 'de', 'Wir sind Herren über die Gemeinde'),
('0604d45d-bd19-f3b5-3742-aee48459cf20', 'en', 'We are lords over the church'),
('67d6b5ef-f445-a091-0bad-748bd72d113a', 'de', 'Wir haben keinen Auftrag'),
('67d6b5ef-f445-a091-0bad-748bd72d113a', 'en', 'We have no commission'),
('1d5e3f4b-476e-7ebf-a919-3f67d3807e00', 'de', 'Wir dienen nur uns selbst'),
('1d5e3f4b-476e-7ebf-a919-3f67d3807e00', 'en', 'We serve only ourselves'),
('272e5348-4ac6-67c0-c7a4-355bc735d72e', 'de', 'Wir sind Botschafter an Christi statt'),
('272e5348-4ac6-67c0-c7a4-355bc735d72e', 'en', 'We are ambassadors for Christ'),
('8a2d0454-4fc4-e9c1-3f09-4846d0cce833', 'de', 'Ich bin der gute Hirte'),
('8a2d0454-4fc4-e9c1-3f09-4846d0cce833', 'en', 'I am the good shepherd'),
('a0ac8839-550b-7f58-7523-c43adf7bbd95', 'de', 'So sehr hat Gott die Welt geliebt'),
('a0ac8839-550b-7f58-7523-c43adf7bbd95', 'en', 'For God so loved the world'),
('a6811cd2-fff1-0cdd-a83a-fdc09e47fe22', 'de', 'Im Anfang war das Wort'),
('a6811cd2-fff1-0cdd-a83a-fdc09e47fe22', 'en', 'In the beginning was the Word'),
('d482d7a3-3ff8-b355-63b8-4fb06afe2c25', 'de', 'Selig sind, die da geistlich arm sind'),
('d482d7a3-3ff8-b355-63b8-4fb06afe2c25', 'en', 'Blessed are the poor in spirit'),
('bb19b388-95ce-a1f1-8da7-125404c6ae99', 'de', 'Hanna'),
('bb19b388-95ce-a1f1-8da7-125404c6ae99', 'en', 'Hannah'),
('98df5098-8bc8-c720-5d57-7d8443a195bc', 'de', 'Debora'),
('98df5098-8bc8-c720-5d57-7d8443a195bc', 'en', 'Deborah'),
('a41ec536-3235-5aba-74fd-6af34914ce2b', 'de', 'Mirjam'),
('a41ec536-3235-5aba-74fd-6af34914ce2b', 'en', 'Miriam'),
('51e0b3b4-c87b-02a8-4f5b-359fd65ff782', 'de', 'Achsa'),
('51e0b3b4-c87b-02a8-4f5b-359fd65ff782', 'en', 'Achsah'),
('9063857a-42ce-202d-6eb7-b6ed1ebb5c05', 'de', 'Auch die beim Gepäck Gebliebenen erhielten gleichen Anteil'),
('9063857a-42ce-202d-6eb7-b6ed1ebb5c05', 'en', 'Those who stayed with the baggage got an equal share'),
('a86d8d17-8c87-3648-dee0-625cdcc23fed', 'de', 'Nur die Kämpfer durften teilen'),
('a86d8d17-8c87-3648-dee0-625cdcc23fed', 'en', 'Only the fighters could share'),
('81f03eb2-a109-1ae6-cbb8-830518429e08', 'de', 'Die Beute wurde verbrannt'),
('81f03eb2-a109-1ae6-cbb8-830518429e08', 'en', 'The spoil was burned'),
('b2174490-3ced-39fb-64ae-9b34fd944b36', 'de', 'Alles ging an die Priester'),
('b2174490-3ced-39fb-64ae-9b34fd944b36', 'en', 'Everything went to the priests'),
('0247b2b6-f7e0-7c26-ea01-318c4f5e7903', 'de', 'Er übergab sie den Priestern Baals'),
('0247b2b6-f7e0-7c26-ea01-318c4f5e7903', 'en', 'He handed them to the priests of Baal'),
('b5a933d4-1722-6bf8-081f-a7ebece6808e', 'de', 'Er weihte sie dem HERRN neu'),
('b5a933d4-1722-6bf8-081f-a7ebece6808e', 'en', 'He rededicated them to the LORD'),
('2cbfea0b-00f6-e7b9-b20b-96eba16822c7', 'de', 'Er zerstörte und verunreinigte sie'),
('2cbfea0b-00f6-e7b9-b20b-96eba16822c7', 'en', 'He tore them down and defiled them'),
('df16d274-39d5-a0cc-e4ff-8da0aee7b821', 'de', 'Er ließ sie unangetastet stehen'),
('df16d274-39d5-a0cc-e4ff-8da0aee7b821', 'en', 'He left them untouched'),
('0574a7b0-e2c7-01ed-af9f-a242eddc8f7b', 'de', 'Er brach sofort jubelnd nach Ägypten auf'),
('0574a7b0-e2c7-01ed-af9f-a242eddc8f7b', 'en', 'He set out rejoicing for Egypt at once'),
('e0a1c564-36e7-b421-db9f-070a7e7cbaaa', 'de', 'Er verlangte die Bestrafung der Brüder'),
('e0a1c564-36e7-b421-db9f-070a7e7cbaaa', 'en', 'He called for the brothers to be punished'),
('5779b1d6-a16a-f576-6c5c-6239882a77af', 'de', 'Sein Herz wurde matt, denn er glaubte es zunächst nicht'),
('5779b1d6-a16a-f576-6c5c-6239882a77af', 'en', 'His heart grew faint, for at first he did not believe it'),
('27a22357-5df3-cbdc-4f55-df6baa857057', 'de', 'Er forderte Beweise vom Pharao'),
('27a22357-5df3-cbdc-4f55-df6baa857057', 'en', 'He demanded proof from Pharaoh'),
('a3a46157-90e3-7134-2629-ebc12e8a93d2', 'de', 'Im Feuer, das vor ihm herging'),
('a3a46157-90e3-7134-2629-ebc12e8a93d2', 'en', 'In the fire that passed before him'),
('bf74b4b8-3bb5-aab3-8887-beed2edfec5a', 'de', 'In einem stillen, sanften Sausen'),
('bf74b4b8-3bb5-aab3-8887-beed2edfec5a', 'en', 'In a still small voice'),
('8402a4c8-b933-4d63-fc6d-aa6de89f2752', 'de', 'Im Erdbeben, das den Berg erschütterte'),
('8402a4c8-b933-4d63-fc6d-aa6de89f2752', 'en', 'In the earthquake that shook the mountain'),
('6d7783a4-c55c-e010-fb4c-b0adf055a817', 'de', 'Im Sturmwind, der die Berge zerriss'),
('6d7783a4-c55c-e010-fb4c-b0adf055a817', 'en', 'In the windstorm that tore the mountains'),
('f3919fd6-7b54-ecd7-f533-660ba3f7dc7f', 'de', 'Ein gefangenes israelitisches Mädchen'),
('f3919fd6-7b54-ecd7-f533-660ba3f7dc7f', 'en', 'A captive Israelite girl'),
('cdffcc59-fc10-6379-7d55-1d8b94c0b466', 'de', 'Ein Priester in Damaskus'),
('cdffcc59-fc10-6379-7d55-1d8b94c0b466', 'en', 'A priest in Damascus'),
('cf0c7fce-1f74-3491-d1f1-a511c6ebcd44', 'de', 'Der König von Aram selbst'),
('cf0c7fce-1f74-3491-d1f1-a511c6ebcd44', 'en', 'The king of Aram himself'),
('63163b46-42fe-40a7-7494-64b12f082ad8', 'de', 'Sein Diener Gehasi'),
('63163b46-42fe-40a7-7494-64b12f082ad8', 'en', 'His servant Gehazi'),
('90ada383-eda5-9770-7e82-f5aab92595da', 'de', 'Sie wurden in Stein verwandelt'),
('90ada383-eda5-9770-7e82-f5aab92595da', 'en', 'They were turned to stone'),
('074cda17-4847-77aa-875f-c4f93dcfddc0', 'de', 'Der böse Geist überwältigte sie, sodass sie nackt und verwundet flohen'),
('074cda17-4847-77aa-875f-c4f93dcfddc0', 'en', 'The evil spirit overpowered them, so they fled naked and wounded'),
('d577ce70-bc99-7606-6438-1c911eb50e21', 'de', 'Sie wurden geheilt und bekehrt'),
('d577ce70-bc99-7606-6438-1c911eb50e21', 'en', 'They were healed and converted'),
('10ff41f1-68e3-9092-6c1a-f37ead0ecd64', 'de', 'Sie wurden zu Aposteln berufen'),
('10ff41f1-68e3-9092-6c1a-f37ead0ecd64', 'en', 'They were called as apostles'),
('f0fca701-10f5-dac2-77db-717c97e4a840', 'de', 'Sie bauten den Tempel in Jerusalem wieder auf'),
('f0fca701-10f5-dac2-77db-717c97e4a840', 'en', 'They rebuilt the temple in Jerusalem'),
('c3868d8c-64d8-3041-e1ea-aea97ba9cad7', 'de', 'Sie kehrten nach Assyrien zurück'),
('c3868d8c-64d8-3041-e1ea-aea97ba9cad7', 'en', 'They returned to Assyria'),
('37f49817-0241-fab5-3adf-3a26db3ce6cd', 'de', 'Löwen fielen sie an, weil sie den HERRN nicht ehrten'),
('37f49817-0241-fab5-3adf-3a26db3ce6cd', 'en', 'Lions attacked them because they did not honor the LORD'),
('87f00386-b626-e608-4498-0373f08065f6', 'de', 'Sie wurden alle vertrieben'),
('87f00386-b626-e608-4498-0373f08065f6', 'en', 'They were all driven out'),
('d7f7f25f-583d-a988-e5b5-780bdf54e919', 'de', 'Die Mauern der Stadt sind es, dass wir nicht gar aus sind'),
('d7f7f25f-583d-a988-e5b5-780bdf54e919', 'en', 'It is the walls of the city that we are not consumed'),
('0fc81e67-dab1-fc30-1585-904e73cb6673', 'de', 'Die Güte des Herrn ist es, dass wir nicht gar aus sind'),
('0fc81e67-dab1-fc30-1585-904e73cb6673', 'en', 'It is the steadfast love of the Lord that we are not consumed'),
('451d6e72-d209-b175-ee60-a5fda8c4fd7a', 'de', 'Der Mut der Väter ist es, dass wir nicht gar aus sind'),
('451d6e72-d209-b175-ee60-a5fda8c4fd7a', 'en', 'It is the courage of the fathers that we are not consumed'),
('16cba4d7-f992-4a28-3f07-058e5a7d0e38', 'de', 'Die Stärke des Volkes ist es, dass wir nicht gar aus sind'),
('16cba4d7-f992-4a28-3f07-058e5a7d0e38', 'en', 'It is the strength of the people that we are not consumed'),
('00299908-1674-0dfc-ce7e-f8b51f38368e', 'de', 'Die Krone des Hohenpriesters'),
('00299908-1674-0dfc-ce7e-f8b51f38368e', 'en', 'The crown of the high priest'),
('55a97dad-252b-adec-a26f-5b6ebdbb1a1b', 'de', 'Der Stab des Pharao'),
('55a97dad-252b-adec-a26f-5b6ebdbb1a1b', 'en', 'Pharaoh''s staff'),
('050489a8-d09e-1e7c-6b8f-8eb28e6b1027', 'de', 'Das goldene Kalb in Stücken'),
('050489a8-d09e-1e7c-6b8f-8eb28e6b1027', 'en', 'The golden calf in pieces'),
('07ce4e8d-09a8-e256-7da6-d9bed80cf0c4', 'de', 'Die steinernen Tafeln des Gesetzes'),
('07ce4e8d-09a8-e256-7da6-d9bed80cf0c4', 'en', 'The stone tablets of the law'),
('6d39b26b-ac63-41ca-ab6e-a3e45d32805a', 'de', 'Den Propheten Mose'),
('6d39b26b-ac63-41ca-ab6e-a3e45d32805a', 'en', 'The prophet Moses'),
('f00abedd-dcce-fd0f-8b66-c23337687c8a', 'de', 'Den Propheten Elia'),
('f00abedd-dcce-fd0f-8b66-c23337687c8a', 'en', 'The prophet Elijah'),
('8f8adf56-28ce-14fd-861b-cb2a195bfd2f', 'de', 'Den Propheten Jesaja'),
('8f8adf56-28ce-14fd-861b-cb2a195bfd2f', 'en', 'The prophet Isaiah'),
('63203f3a-350b-1f3d-3ede-ca690b7c8cb2', 'de', 'Den Propheten Samuel'),
('63203f3a-350b-1f3d-3ede-ca690b7c8cb2', 'en', 'The prophet Samuel'),
('3b411a45-5dc2-05ae-f7dc-f884beaaf7a9', 'de', 'Keiner dürfe das Reich verlassen'),
('3b411a45-5dc2-05ae-f7dc-f884beaaf7a9', 'en', 'No one might leave the kingdom'),
('0c39fc18-61d8-14bc-c25f-9780ac15a1be', 'de', 'Dreißig Tage lang nur den König anzubeten'),
('0c39fc18-61d8-14bc-c25f-9780ac15a1be', 'en', 'For thirty days to pray only to the king'),
('30489314-1d9d-8085-2cef-5774d1d93c3a', 'de', 'Niemand dürfe mehr fasten'),
('30489314-1d9d-8085-2cef-5774d1d93c3a', 'en', 'No one might fast anymore'),
('0f9e6d33-5b3f-c511-d339-be55ae0f51f7', 'de', 'Alle müssten dem Bild opfern'),
('0f9e6d33-5b3f-c511-d339-be55ae0f51f7', 'en', 'Everyone must sacrifice to the image'),
('e2eb7a8f-d9dc-9c28-6bd9-5f7b1f08785d', 'de', 'Ein Tag des Fastens ohne Opfer'),
('e2eb7a8f-d9dc-9c28-6bd9-5f7b1f08785d', 'en', 'A day of fasting without offering'),
('998d15ac-3174-3c05-754c-427cd7b780b6', 'de', 'Ein junger Stier als Sündopfer für die Gemeinde'),
('998d15ac-3174-3c05-754c-427cd7b780b6', 'en', 'A young bull as a sin offering for the congregation'),
('ea021ba7-0fbd-d216-c4a1-e4868d0246d2', 'de', 'Verbannung der Schuldigen'),
('ea021ba7-0fbd-d216-c4a1-e4868d0246d2', 'en', 'Banishment of the guilty'),
('626761a2-5318-fe60-301b-a0ef7fc94b12', 'de', 'Ein Lamm je Person'),
('626761a2-5318-fe60-301b-a0ef7fc94b12', 'en', 'A lamb per person'),
('cf723ce1-1dc8-4bbe-37b4-b42b940048ee', 'de', 'Er warf seinen Mantel über ihn'),
('cf723ce1-1dc8-4bbe-37b4-b42b940048ee', 'en', 'He threw his cloak over him'),
('38e7a7e6-5aee-41e5-6a5e-b498e0ebe33e', 'de', 'Er rief seinen Namen dreimal'),
('38e7a7e6-5aee-41e5-6a5e-b498e0ebe33e', 'en', 'He called his name three times'),
('75e5314d-cf09-0b65-112f-d0b700bcd975', 'de', 'Er reichte ihm seinen Stab'),
('75e5314d-cf09-0b65-112f-d0b700bcd975', 'en', 'He handed him his staff'),
('a41775c1-9989-6b8c-2949-495c6a7747cb', 'de', 'Er legte ihm die Hand auf den Kopf'),
('a41775c1-9989-6b8c-2949-495c6a7747cb', 'en', 'He laid his hand on his head'),
('f64e0e66-c1a1-6625-e028-cae81d886619', 'de', 'Er hatte einen Priester geschlagen'),
('f64e0e66-c1a1-6625-e028-cae81d886619', 'en', 'He had struck a priest'),
('040c86d7-0f3e-50fc-9d7e-2a9f85cb679e', 'de', 'Er hatte Geld aus dem Tempel gestohlen'),
('040c86d7-0f3e-50fc-9d7e-2a9f85cb679e', 'en', 'He had stolen money from the temple'),
('47318791-0c0f-3681-fdee-cf9ddc59992d', 'de', 'Er hatte einen Altar umgestoßen'),
('47318791-0c0f-3681-fdee-cf9ddc59992d', 'en', 'He had overturned an altar'),
('958e319b-7479-19c0-008e-c1b948e83784', 'de', 'Man beschuldigte ihn, einen Griechen in den Tempel gebracht zu haben'),
('958e319b-7479-19c0-008e-c1b948e83784', 'en', 'He was accused of bringing a Greek into the temple'),
('4ab16c81-3403-bd24-6c03-65fbb13fe597', 'de', 'Einen neuen Anführer für den Auszug'),
('4ab16c81-3403-bd24-6c03-65fbb13fe597', 'en', 'A new leader for the journey'),
('dc0ef9e4-f3df-3cde-a75c-400ef81b51b5', 'de', 'Die Rückkehr nach Ägypten'),
('dc0ef9e4-f3df-3cde-a75c-400ef81b51b5', 'en', 'A return to Egypt'),
('32d454af-fe72-b325-b433-47757f178807', 'de', 'Brot und Wasser für die Wüste'),
('32d454af-fe72-b325-b433-47757f178807', 'en', 'Bread and water for the desert'),
('3a6eabb2-1617-3f6e-60ef-a7a26dbbb99c', 'de', 'Einen Gott, der vor ihnen herziehe'),
('3a6eabb2-1617-3f6e-60ef-a7a26dbbb99c', 'en', 'A god to go before them'),
('10c13c4d-6f4b-0269-a74e-e888c7339b2a', 'de', 'Mit einem Pfeil, der vom Bogen schnellt'),
('10c13c4d-6f4b-0269-a74e-e888c7339b2a', 'en', 'With an arrow shot from the bow'),
('de20b15c-d4fd-10cb-4a69-f52746f9b3be', 'de', 'Mit einem Schiff auf hoher See'),
('de20b15c-d4fd-10cb-4a69-f52746f9b3be', 'en', 'With a ship on the high sea'),
('3a7b3d7c-7c28-8566-c485-fe91b3e2d942', 'de', 'Mit einem Adler, der zur Höhe steigt'),
('3a7b3d7c-7c28-8566-c485-fe91b3e2d942', 'en', 'With an eagle rising to the heights'),
('ad55402a-866f-c313-e83f-d65e9c6dc6db', 'de', 'Mit einem Bräutigam, der aus seiner Kammer tritt'),
('ad55402a-866f-c313-e83f-d65e9c6dc6db', 'en', 'With a bridegroom coming out of his chamber'),
('19cf53f6-a47f-3c76-3ab2-671693eda350', 'de', 'Mit einem Fluch über die Chaldäer'),
('19cf53f6-a47f-3c76-3ab2-671693eda350', 'en', 'With a curse upon the Chaldeans'),
('a303f792-b28b-b5a5-6404-a649a1776216', 'de', 'Mit Freude und Jubel über den Gott des Heils'),
('a303f792-b28b-b5a5-6404-a649a1776216', 'en', 'With joy and rejoicing in the God of salvation'),
('7d8f68ee-7916-ca14-b3e8-2ad6f2ffa21a', 'de', 'Mit dem Schweigen des Propheten'),
('7d8f68ee-7916-ca14-b3e8-2ad6f2ffa21a', 'en', 'With the silence of the prophet'),
('a24ce801-f94f-c43d-66a6-61cadc91567e', 'de', 'Mit einer Aufzählung der Plagen'),
('a24ce801-f94f-c43d-66a6-61cadc91567e', 'en', 'With a listing of the plagues'),
('f1e1a839-e271-eb32-bb96-13c9c3bc0af1', 'de', 'Von diesem Felsen wirst du das Volk lehren'),
('f1e1a839-e271-eb32-bb96-13c9c3bc0af1', 'en', 'From this rock you will teach the people'),
('86b55b33-fd69-0fdf-2dce-5de33294f970', 'de', 'Auf diesen Felsen will ich meine Gemeinde bauen'),
('86b55b33-fd69-0fdf-2dce-5de33294f970', 'en', 'On this rock I will build my church'),
('5b5e174f-2892-a1a0-c125-26c2a59f0751', 'de', 'Auf diesen Felsen sollst du den Tempel errichten'),
('5b5e174f-2892-a1a0-c125-26c2a59f0751', 'en', 'On this rock you shall erect the temple'),
('9e4536dd-c785-7db0-83df-e30f35527ba5', 'de', 'Auf diesem Felsen wirst du allein stehen'),
('9e4536dd-c785-7db0-83df-e30f35527ba5', 'en', 'On this rock you will stand alone'),
('766f3b7d-af00-24b4-7d68-2f1068a1eda9', 'de', 'An den Wunden seiner Hände'),
('766f3b7d-af00-24b4-7d68-2f1068a1eda9', 'en', 'By the wounds of his hands'),
('c056f9a9-d559-dddf-918b-9e4de71d3956', 'de', 'Als er sie bei ihrem Namen rief'),
('c056f9a9-d559-dddf-918b-9e4de71d3956', 'en', 'When he called her by her name'),
('24d03adf-d743-4667-e258-8211f0d6d943', 'de', 'An seiner Stimme im Gebet'),
('24d03adf-d743-4667-e258-8211f0d6d943', 'en', 'By his voice in prayer'),
('3a2d4fda-7759-f5cf-067a-709ef69eec03', 'de', 'Als er das Brot brach'),
('3a2d4fda-7759-f5cf-067a-709ef69eec03', 'en', 'When he broke the bread'),
('91147a2c-9399-1e21-7d82-893b5af51aae', 'de', 'Niemand kennt sein Grab bis heute'),
('91147a2c-9399-1e21-7d82-893b5af51aae', 'en', 'No one knows his grave to this day'),
('32c81af7-281e-a416-a344-0d14cf6566d9', 'de', 'Sein Grab werde ein Heiligtum sein'),
('32c81af7-281e-a416-a344-0d14cf6566d9', 'en', 'His grave would be a sanctuary'),
('b2f86e2d-9037-5e03-b41b-ad49c613cd8b', 'de', 'Er solle bei den Vätern bestattet werden'),
('b2f86e2d-9037-5e03-b41b-ad49c613cd8b', 'en', 'He should be buried with the fathers'),
('803b09b9-4e8f-dc42-b44a-cec81b00776c', 'de', 'Aaron werde ihn begraben'),
('803b09b9-4e8f-dc42-b44a-cec81b00776c', 'en', 'Aaron would bury him'),
('b29380c2-bdaf-105b-55bb-29aeb51f9bc1', 'de', 'Einen großen Sieg über die Philister'),
('b29380c2-bdaf-105b-55bb-29aeb51f9bc1', 'en', 'A great victory over the Philistines'),
('8970780a-47ef-66be-98cb-4af1137d8995', 'de', 'Das Gericht über das Haus Elis wegen der Sünde seiner Söhne'),
('8970780a-47ef-66be-98cb-4af1137d8995', 'en', 'Judgment on Eli''s house for his sons'' sin'),
('154914fe-74fd-cd75-9a94-c2c19109a13a', 'de', 'Die Salbung eines Königs aus Juda'),
('154914fe-74fd-cd75-9a94-c2c19109a13a', 'en', 'The anointing of a king from Judah'),
('02a21462-4455-d368-f81a-2f9ae2ab9e31', 'de', 'Eine Hungersnot über ganz Israel'),
('02a21462-4455-d368-f81a-2f9ae2ab9e31', 'en', 'A famine over all Israel'),
('dbfaeb18-3ef4-d7f0-4ab6-ad5e3e01fdb7', 'de', 'Sein Arm verdorrte'),
('dbfaeb18-3ef4-d7f0-4ab6-ad5e3e01fdb7', 'en', 'His arm withered'),
('ea64c554-b8e3-3ff0-7b52-8eabfb47435c', 'de', 'Er wurde blind und sah drei Tage lang nichts'),
('ea64c554-b8e3-3ff0-7b52-8eabfb47435c', 'en', 'He became blind and saw nothing for three days'),
('00b230a9-b1da-07d4-349a-8e8ed47f2484', 'de', 'Er verlor die Sprache für eine Woche'),
('00b230a9-b1da-07d4-349a-8e8ed47f2484', 'en', 'He lost his speech for a week'),
('61952007-40e1-58db-175b-d9d1ee6f07ae', 'de', 'Er fiel in einen tiefen Schlaf'),
('61952007-40e1-58db-175b-d9d1ee6f07ae', 'en', 'He fell into a deep sleep'),
('846b8b62-d73e-c5b2-c51d-a3b8d362ef4c', 'de', 'Dass dort ein König gesalbt wurde'),
('846b8b62-d73e-c5b2-c51d-a3b8d362ef4c', 'en', 'That a king was anointed there'),
('7f66666c-80fa-18db-e7f0-8d51be4f4378', 'de', 'Dass dort ein Bund gebrochen wurde'),
('7f66666c-80fa-18db-e7f0-8d51be4f4378', 'en', 'That a covenant was broken there'),
('5019a19b-b95a-c47c-dcbd-b41846f53095', 'de', 'Dass auch die Oststämme Anteil am HERRN haben'),
('5019a19b-b95a-c47c-dcbd-b41846f53095', 'en', 'That the eastern tribes also have a share in the LORD'),
('4796656f-96a1-f34a-365d-b4271ccfc8be', 'de', 'Dass dort eine Schlacht gewonnen wurde'),
('4796656f-96a1-f34a-365d-b4271ccfc8be', 'en', 'That a battle was won there')
insert into public.answer_option_translations (option_id, lang, text) values
('e91a50a1-f88b-b436-1f9a-008bb8be4171', 'de', 'Cornelius der Hauptmann'),
('e91a50a1-f88b-b436-1f9a-008bb8be4171', 'en', 'Cornelius the centurion'),
('ddde2eee-45d3-a28e-2968-eb2f63160cb5', 'de', 'Quirinius von Syrien'),
('ddde2eee-45d3-a28e-2968-eb2f63160cb5', 'en', 'Quirinius of Syria'),
('0eec24f5-fcd6-722b-a0c7-a637cfd245b8', 'de', 'Herodes Antipas'),
('0eec24f5-fcd6-722b-a0c7-a637cfd245b8', 'en', 'Herod Antipas'),
('52fefec4-b998-d536-3889-1ec4b1f5d483', 'de', 'Pontius Pilatus'),
('52fefec4-b998-d536-3889-1ec4b1f5d483', 'en', 'Pontius Pilate'),
('7be978af-3543-cf92-a189-38452e80fdd3', 'de', 'Sie verspotteten ihn lautstark'),
('7be978af-3543-cf92-a189-38452e80fdd3', 'en', 'They loudly mocked him'),
('86e13346-9063-4215-67ac-bd852188495c', 'de', 'Sie zogen sich in die Berge zurück'),
('86e13346-9063-4215-67ac-bd852188495c', 'en', 'They withdrew into the mountains'),
('6609126f-2a59-d1c2-176d-c5327a17c477', 'de', 'Sie fürchteten sich sehr und flohen vor ihm'),
('6609126f-2a59-d1c2-176d-c5327a17c477', 'en', 'They were greatly afraid and fled from him'),
('59c58e99-a863-2c2c-0d19-70192476541c', 'de', 'Sie sandten ihre besten Bogenschützen'),
('59c58e99-a863-2c2c-0d19-70192476541c', 'en', 'They sent their best archers'),
('70fcfca7-9a31-4cba-889e-b5d64f36fd2a', 'de', 'Eine Schriftrolle des Gesetzes'),
('70fcfca7-9a31-4cba-889e-b5d64f36fd2a', 'en', 'A scroll of the law'),
('d62b4cbc-94a8-6679-5584-e4b5890f9cbe', 'de', 'Ein neues Gewand'),
('d62b4cbc-94a8-6679-5584-e4b5890f9cbe', 'en', 'A new garment'),
('d2cce5bc-15ef-dbde-00f8-73fbfce7c424', 'de', 'Das Brot des Lebens'),
('d2cce5bc-15ef-dbde-00f8-73fbfce7c424', 'en', 'The bread of life'),
('8c78f45c-6129-a38c-235c-43ceb515ab2b', 'de', 'Den Heiligen Geist, und sie redeten in Sprachen und weissagten'),
('8c78f45c-6129-a38c-235c-43ceb515ab2b', 'en', 'The Holy Spirit, and they spoke in tongues and prophesied'),
('744e950f-f54a-cb00-e694-8a6193731847', 'de', 'Sende deine Engel, uns zu befreien'),
('744e950f-f54a-cb00-e694-8a6193731847', 'en', 'Send your angels to set us free'),
('c6a321f3-cd16-d744-d204-b5f57b58a947', 'de', 'Steig herab und rette uns beide'),
('c6a321f3-cd16-d744-d204-b5f57b58a947', 'en', 'Come down and save us both'),
('12ccd09e-559f-a200-223e-ddebf4a9ade0', 'de', 'Vergib mir alle meine Sünden vor dem Volk'),
('12ccd09e-559f-a200-223e-ddebf4a9ade0', 'en', 'Forgive me all my sins before the people'),
('20e4dff3-afab-f315-3a6c-ec546d18125f', 'de', 'Gedenke meiner, wenn du in dein Reich kommst'),
('20e4dff3-afab-f315-3a6c-ec546d18125f', 'en', 'Remember me when you come into your kingdom'),
('e3f6bc2a-0e57-ca3e-47c0-8e3e55a37778', 'de', 'Der Herr kommt herab mit Befehlsruf'),
('e3f6bc2a-0e57-ca3e-47c0-8e3e55a37778', 'en', 'The Lord descends with a cry of command'),
('5326ccce-8930-1f27-93fb-39ee84b72259', 'de', 'Der Herr kommt heimlich und unbemerkt'),
('5326ccce-8930-1f27-93fb-39ee84b72259', 'en', 'The Lord comes secretly and unnoticed'),
('cee0b5e2-39a6-b84b-d185-cf8d3d5d3239', 'de', 'Der Herr sendet nur seine Engel'),
('cee0b5e2-39a6-b84b-d185-cf8d3d5d3239', 'en', 'The Lord sends only his angels'),
('b67245c5-3cb5-1a86-8e0c-7f4c98efb851', 'de', 'Der Herr kommt nie wieder'),
('b67245c5-3cb5-1a86-8e0c-7f4c98efb851', 'en', 'The Lord never returns'),
('b2792332-f943-a638-8ff8-b84a5c965be4', 'de', 'Nur durch andere Fürsprecher'),
('b2792332-f943-a638-8ff8-b84a5c965be4', 'en', 'Only through other intercessors'),
('b0e5d768-f595-e3a7-1a7a-a8160522bfda', 'de', 'Mit vielen Worten und langem Gebet'),
('b0e5d768-f595-e3a7-1a7a-a8160522bfda', 'en', 'With many words and long prayer'),
('04f77343-0e99-90a2-a1f6-7a60023f2735', 'de', 'Im Glauben, ohne zu zweifeln'),
('04f77343-0e99-90a2-a1f6-7a60023f2735', 'en', 'In faith, without doubting'),
('102320cf-373d-5a6a-59bc-8c22adcf83be', 'de', 'Erst nach langem Fasten'),
('102320cf-373d-5a6a-59bc-8c22adcf83be', 'en', 'Only after lengthy fasting'),
('a943a6a5-6cb5-1ef8-3966-72f663c7a4b0', 'de', 'Sie waren ganz davon ausgeschlossen'),
('a943a6a5-6cb5-1ef8-3966-72f663c7a4b0', 'en', 'They were entirely excluded from it'),
('97bee2c5-6074-e2f2-e603-de7168a79767', 'de', 'Sie mussten ein Schuldopfer bringen'),
('97bee2c5-6074-e2f2-e603-de7168a79767', 'en', 'They had to bring a guilt offering'),
('a9204d6e-0fda-cd05-b40f-4d6579be0d73', 'de', 'Sie durften es einen Monat später halten'),
('a9204d6e-0fda-cd05-b40f-4d6579be0d73', 'en', 'They could keep it a month later'),
('7efa037f-77c4-4fbd-b0cf-5c0ec5bb30fb', 'de', 'Sie hielten es im nächsten Jahr'),
('7efa037f-77c4-4fbd-b0cf-5c0ec5bb30fb', 'en', 'They kept it the following year'),
('051e7a61-0025-8543-ab06-872b1b76fd67', 'de', 'Asarja'),
('051e7a61-0025-8543-ab06-872b1b76fd67', 'en', 'Azariah'),
('154ef12e-dde1-46d0-f808-eb332c882e61', 'de', 'Joasch'),
('154ef12e-dde1-46d0-f808-eb332c882e61', 'en', 'Joash'),
('d4b84d2a-c979-6602-cb3a-199393dfac38', 'de', 'Ahas'),
('d4b84d2a-c979-6602-cb3a-199393dfac38', 'en', 'Ahaz'),
('6ff2a9c1-6a71-3db5-031e-18ed965c3ce4', 'de', 'Josia'),
('6ff2a9c1-6a71-3db5-031e-18ed965c3ce4', 'en', 'Josiah'),
('79933329-baef-5201-e806-629b3a2ea98d', 'de', 'Samuel, der Prophet'),
('79933329-baef-5201-e806-629b3a2ea98d', 'en', 'Samuel the prophet'),
('9e7d287b-e5ab-b42e-0421-87fc51c703a3', 'de', 'Nabal aus Karmel'),
('9e7d287b-e5ab-b42e-0421-87fc51c703a3', 'en', 'Nabal from Carmel'),
('997ba8f8-bd0e-c525-6063-b8582c33fee8', 'de', 'Jonatan, Sauls Sohn'),
('997ba8f8-bd0e-c525-6063-b8582c33fee8', 'en', 'Jonathan, Saul''s son'),
('a33d59e7-50d7-7fd6-9a5b-5f2777c9e833', 'de', 'Abjatar, der Sohn Ahimelechs'),
('a33d59e7-50d7-7fd6-9a5b-5f2777c9e833', 'en', 'Abiathar, the son of Ahimelech'),
('a518a34b-5746-ee0b-0027-9455e08dcfc2', 'de', 'Sie boten dem König Gold an'),
('a518a34b-5746-ee0b-0027-9455e08dcfc2', 'en', 'They offered the king gold'),
('d1163347-52e9-c16b-f239-b37673960098', 'de', 'Sie nannten den Traum sogleich'),
('d1163347-52e9-c16b-f239-b37673960098', 'en', 'They told the dream at once'),
('030bfea9-6424-bbc1-9491-f2c98d792ff2', 'de', 'Sie erklärten, kein Mensch könne das erfüllen'),
('030bfea9-6424-bbc1-9491-f2c98d792ff2', 'en', 'They declared that no man could fulfill it'),
('75875b52-7796-738b-4987-517b08f1cc41', 'de', 'Sie baten um eine Woche Bedenkzeit'),
('75875b52-7796-738b-4987-517b08f1cc41', 'en', 'They asked for a week to consider'),
('2888a50b-1197-21da-0b3a-e3d96dbc71b4', 'de', 'Er ergriff ihre Hand und richtete sie auf'),
('2888a50b-1197-21da-0b3a-e3d96dbc71b4', 'en', 'He took her by the hand and raised her up'),
('92b7a804-988b-7cbb-c3ff-1f3f642b3c87', 'de', 'Er salbte ihre Stirn mit Öl'),
('92b7a804-988b-7cbb-c3ff-1f3f642b3c87', 'en', 'He anointed her forehead with oil'),
('cb51f397-2e81-ddd6-3b60-18c13ca371b5', 'de', 'Er sandte sie zum Brunnen'),
('cb51f397-2e81-ddd6-3b60-18c13ca371b5', 'en', 'He sent her to the well'),
('d765de77-a006-c75e-8411-c6cd1be34319', 'de', 'Er sprach ein Gebet über dem Haus'),
('d765de77-a006-c75e-8411-c6cd1be34319', 'en', 'He spoke a prayer over the house'),
('92a8e98a-b7e1-db1c-fb3f-398bd34b2a38', 'de', 'Mit zwanzig Gerstenbroten, und es blieb übrig'),
('92a8e98a-b7e1-db1c-fb3f-398bd34b2a38', 'en', 'With twenty barley loaves, and some was left over'),
('5db0e74d-9582-de8b-4550-32193043091c', 'de', 'Manna fiel auf seinen Befehl herab'),
('5db0e74d-9582-de8b-4550-32193043091c', 'en', 'Manna fell at his command'),
('d74a3d06-a892-c77d-c0b7-fe09f5809871', 'de', 'Er verwandelte Steine in Brot'),
('d74a3d06-a892-c77d-c0b7-fe09f5809871', 'en', 'He turned stones into bread'),
('dc226520-a9b1-4bb7-22fc-e822e4818ddc', 'de', 'Mit fünf Broten und zwei Fischen'),
('dc226520-a9b1-4bb7-22fc-e822e4818ddc', 'en', 'With five loaves and two fish'),
('45f1877a-4775-87f6-7af9-cf5396aa1637', 'de', 'Dass die Heuschrecken das Land fressen'),
('45f1877a-4775-87f6-7af9-cf5396aa1637', 'en', 'That locusts devour the land'),
('ffc6eb61-0687-082a-06b1-eb2a8c649d6a', 'de', 'Dass die Könige fliehen mussten'),
('ffc6eb61-0687-082a-06b1-eb2a8c649d6a', 'en', 'That the kings had to flee'),
('9bb15378-dc80-328f-18c0-066cd80aeec9', 'de', 'Dass Gewalt und Unrecht ungestraft bleiben'),
('9bb15378-dc80-328f-18c0-066cd80aeec9', 'en', 'That violence and injustice go unpunished'),
('a995b3d8-2a4e-9fa9-782b-01173a494bb1', 'de', 'Dass der Tempel verfallen ist'),
('a995b3d8-2a4e-9fa9-782b-01173a494bb1', 'en', 'That the temple has fallen into ruin'),
('cdd61be1-41a4-3458-eee0-bdf2c38c7589', 'de', 'Weiß und rot, ausgezeichnet vor Zehntausend'),
('cdd61be1-41a4-3458-eee0-bdf2c38c7589', 'en', 'Radiant and ruddy, outstanding among ten thousand'),
('096a24d6-fe4f-d663-5d66-a4cc7bf73394', 'de', 'Reich und mächtig, gefürchtet von allen'),
('096a24d6-fe4f-d663-5d66-a4cc7bf73394', 'en', 'Rich and mighty, feared by all'),
('5b4eb054-6d48-1e50-3092-5b6b085a2dc7', 'de', 'Alt und weise, geehrt von allen'),
('5b4eb054-6d48-1e50-3092-5b6b085a2dc7', 'en', 'Old and wise, honored by all'),
('6a536c4c-0a33-864b-248d-016c755b8a8c', 'de', 'Klein und still, verborgen vor allen'),
('6a536c4c-0a33-864b-248d-016c755b8a8c', 'en', 'Small and quiet, hidden from all'),
('22f784ad-7f5d-d6cc-0938-72c39b9d49ce', 'de', 'Dass er keinen Menschen für unrein halten sollte'),
('22f784ad-7f5d-d6cc-0938-72c39b9d49ce', 'en', 'That he should call no person unclean'),
('54e269ee-6148-9cbb-d1f0-9ab2074cc4f6', 'de', 'Dass er fasten sollte'),
('54e269ee-6148-9cbb-d1f0-9ab2074cc4f6', 'en', 'That he should fast'),
('c75ed18a-dd2f-2896-ec3a-e188925ab8f3', 'de', 'Dass er Fleisch opfern sollte'),
('c75ed18a-dd2f-2896-ec3a-e188925ab8f3', 'en', 'That he should sacrifice meat'),
('551c1e36-ff07-6b73-72b8-78aabfcfb823', 'de', 'Dass er nach Rom reisen sollte'),
('551c1e36-ff07-6b73-72b8-78aabfcfb823', 'en', 'That he should travel to Rome'),
('b6d71a50-3578-a88f-feba-0828793c13a1', 'de', 'Der König und seine Diener'),
('b6d71a50-3578-a88f-feba-0828793c13a1', 'en', 'The king and his servants'),
('f6f43741-fc65-fece-5265-7252677cf86f', 'de', 'Ein Bote des Propheten Elisa'),
('f6f43741-fc65-fece-5265-7252677cf86f', 'en', 'A messenger of the prophet Elisha'),
('14f9158d-9470-a5bb-7c30-a50cf66b51b6', 'de', 'Vier aussätzige Männer am Stadttor'),
('14f9158d-9470-a5bb-7c30-a50cf66b51b6', 'en', 'Four leprous men at the city gate'),
('93880180-1d68-483c-a14b-d5fb86eba9b2', 'de', 'Die Wächter auf der Mauer'),
('93880180-1d68-483c-a14b-d5fb86eba9b2', 'en', 'The watchmen on the wall'),
('75e07828-6ff9-2c64-47eb-6bf591ab6edb', 'de', 'Er sandte sie zu den Priestern'),
('75e07828-6ff9-2c64-47eb-6bf591ab6edb', 'en', 'He sent her to the priests'),
('b34b299f-b5fe-ec33-82c1-cf6d2bec3ce5', 'de', 'Er sprach nur ein Gebet über sie'),
('b34b299f-b5fe-ec33-82c1-cf6d2bec3ce5', 'en', 'He merely prayed a prayer over her'),
('ad72c09c-e5cc-4fe8-dbd3-cb9842121d69', 'de', 'Er legte ihr die Hände auf und sie wurde sogleich aufgerichtet'),
('ad72c09c-e5cc-4fe8-dbd3-cb9842121d69', 'en', 'He laid his hands on her and she was immediately made straight'),
('038fc99b-3af9-0921-9fd6-6eb076ee2b36', 'de', 'Er gebot ihr zu schweigen'),
('038fc99b-3af9-0921-9fd6-6eb076ee2b36', 'en', 'He commanded her to be silent'),
('ad30a71a-804f-5b3b-face-64023d539304', 'de', 'Vor dem Wein der Zöllner'),
('ad30a71a-804f-5b3b-face-64023d539304', 'en', 'The wine of the tax collectors'),
('e16ea000-b2dc-c4d0-3247-7202690864e5', 'de', 'Vor dem Brot der Samariter'),
('e16ea000-b2dc-c4d0-3247-7202690864e5', 'en', 'The bread of the Samaritans'),
('1594abcd-f7ec-5878-53c3-d1e23d2c00c8', 'de', 'Vor dem Sauerteig der Heiden'),
('1594abcd-f7ec-5878-53c3-d1e23d2c00c8', 'en', 'The leaven of the Gentiles'),
('cb4eecd7-2a28-5b23-4aa6-58fa4bbb6e25', 'de', 'Vor dem Sauerteig der Pharisäer und des Herodes'),
('cb4eecd7-2a28-5b23-4aa6-58fa4bbb6e25', 'en', 'The leaven of the Pharisees and of Herod'),
('72c6b53f-2dd3-9df5-10b4-daed53428506', 'de', 'Sie verschwanden in einer Wolke'),
('72c6b53f-2dd3-9df5-10b4-daed53428506', 'en', 'They vanished in a cloud'),
('9c53979a-6249-6151-e2bd-064c4e48e621', 'de', 'Sie liefen in die Wüste davon'),
('9c53979a-6249-6151-e2bd-064c4e48e621', 'en', 'They ran off into the desert'),
('cb841fe4-c017-b72d-e5d0-a6102bf79723', 'de', 'Sie stürzten den Abhang hinab und ertranken im See'),
('cb841fe4-c017-b72d-e5d0-a6102bf79723', 'en', 'They rushed down the steep bank and drowned in the lake'),
('23507772-0716-55ed-9e3e-12f8f2bd071c', 'de', 'Sie wurden ruhig und weideten weiter'),
('23507772-0716-55ed-9e3e-12f8f2bd071c', 'en', 'They became calm and kept grazing'),
('4aa7f638-41f9-33a9-cd6a-adb1388ed4b7', 'de', 'Keine Zunge wird ihn bekennen'),
('4aa7f638-41f9-33a9-cd6a-adb1388ed4b7', 'en', 'No tongue will confess him'),
('f174a608-c653-603e-206b-a556e39d753e', 'de', 'Jede Zunge wird bekennen, dass Jesus Christus der Herr ist'),
('f174a608-c653-603e-206b-a556e39d753e', 'en', 'Every tongue will confess that Jesus Christ is Lord'),
('864a490c-7d1a-1e81-8b69-b69247b02c62', 'de', 'Nur die Gläubigen werden ihn bekennen'),
('864a490c-7d1a-1e81-8b69-b69247b02c62', 'en', 'Only the believers will confess him'),
('df78d180-09a1-8852-f872-2ff7ecb78f69', 'de', 'Allein die Engel werden ihn bekennen'),
('df78d180-09a1-8852-f872-2ff7ecb78f69', 'en', 'Only the angels will confess him'),
('65ec9e50-7a36-2c87-4d6b-de97421a5d30', 'de', 'Während sie hingingen, um sich den Priestern zu zeigen'),
('65ec9e50-7a36-2c87-4d6b-de97421a5d30', 'en', 'As they went to show themselves to the priests'),
('b53173bd-e116-8ace-4d11-a2a43b6bbb80', 'de', 'Sofort, als sie ihn berührten'),
('b53173bd-e116-8ace-4d11-a2a43b6bbb80', 'en', 'Immediately, when they touched him'),
('71fa75c0-63f9-a0bb-6284-3cff8ac3735b', 'de', 'Erst nach drei Tagen Wartezeit'),
('71fa75c0-63f9-a0bb-6284-3cff8ac3735b', 'en', 'Only after waiting three days'),
('f51d5454-f2d8-d639-bd2b-1931302da578', 'de', 'Als sie ihn um Almosen baten'),
('f51d5454-f2d8-d639-bd2b-1931302da578', 'en', 'When they asked him for alms'),
('f11a3764-2a41-ae94-bfd0-0fe0e9c70159', 'de', 'Sie verließen die Versammlung im Zorn'),
('f11a3764-2a41-ae94-bfd0-0fe0e9c70159', 'en', 'They left the assembly in anger'),
('5280f574-e7c6-0456-2aaf-1dc425101eb4', 'de', 'Sie forderten, das Buch zu verbrennen'),
('5280f574-e7c6-0456-2aaf-1dc425101eb4', 'en', 'They demanded the book be burned'),
('a52c2975-ac02-5a4c-9180-4fbbf15566f8', 'de', 'Sie murrten über die Strenge des Gesetzes'),
('a52c2975-ac02-5a4c-9180-4fbbf15566f8', 'en', 'They grumbled at the severity of the law'),
('5d7ae2e1-3b1b-6505-1c96-d2910fb91211', 'de', 'Sie verstanden die Worte und neigten sich anbetend zum Boden'),
('5d7ae2e1-3b1b-6505-1c96-d2910fb91211', 'en', 'They understood the words and bowed to the ground in worship'),
('e33dfbbb-457b-8585-b3df-335af3028fa7', 'de', 'Zwölf Städte in der Mitte Kanaans'),
('e33dfbbb-457b-8585-b3df-335af3028fa7', 'en', 'Twelve cities in the center of Canaan'),
('232a8c50-986f-15ef-4dbf-7a15f18e1b9a', 'de', 'Eine Stadt je Stamm'),
('232a8c50-986f-15ef-4dbf-7a15f18e1b9a', 'en', 'One city per tribe'),
('a8b27dfe-9b68-8476-56e4-094aa4a38ceb', 'de', 'Achtundvierzig Städte mit Weideland, darunter Zufluchtsstädte'),
('a8b27dfe-9b68-8476-56e4-094aa4a38ceb', 'en', 'Forty-eight cities with pasturelands, including cities of refuge'),
('f43ee2a4-ad90-f1b3-a57f-1037cb6e6e82', 'de', 'Sechs Städte am Jordan'),
('f43ee2a4-ad90-f1b3-a57f-1037cb6e6e82', 'en', 'Six cities by the Jordan'),
('6e0a981d-4080-6847-1551-1eae74c67dd9', 'de', 'Die Städte seien klein und schwach'),
('6e0a981d-4080-6847-1551-1eae74c67dd9', 'en', 'The cities were small and weak'),
('f3f7644d-4495-ec19-ee77-5d69b3e8f08c', 'de', 'Es seien Riesen, gegen die sie wie Heuschrecken seien'),
('f3f7644d-4495-ec19-ee77-5d69b3e8f08c', 'en', 'They were giants, against whom they were like grasshoppers'),
('d8ab7881-876a-9a96-5552-b0d611b2b4da', 'de', 'Das Land sei leer und unbewohnt'),
('d8ab7881-876a-9a96-5552-b0d611b2b4da', 'en', 'The land was empty and uninhabited'),
('76e386ac-cba9-5d78-287c-15887a52a814', 'de', 'Die Völker seien freundlich gesinnt'),
('76e386ac-cba9-5d78-287c-15887a52a814', 'en', 'The peoples were friendly'),
('bb1be876-f60a-42dc-9f32-1b3752153ced', 'de', 'Weil David ihm den Rat gab'),
('bb1be876-f60a-42dc-9f32-1b3752153ced', 'en', 'Because David advised him'),
('d95f4965-3ee2-d39a-03a9-15c8a440d7f5', 'de', 'Weil er den Tod fürchten lernte'),
('d95f4965-3ee2-d39a-03a9-15c8a440d7f5', 'en', 'Because he wanted to learn to fear death'),
('49663615-62cb-e693-76bf-90b57d43abfa', 'de', 'Weil Samuel ihn dorthin schickte'),
('49663615-62cb-e693-76bf-90b57d43abfa', 'en', 'Because Samuel sent him there'),
('bfc54c8c-78e7-db99-51bc-2e4d30d82d6f', 'de', 'Weil Gott ihm nicht mehr antwortete und er verzweifelt war'),
('bfc54c8c-78e7-db99-51bc-2e4d30d82d6f', 'en', 'Because God no longer answered him and he was desperate'),
('57ea87ee-1915-b1ff-c5f9-e320c2a4c297', 'de', 'Auch die Lilien des Feldes werden gekleidet'),
('57ea87ee-1915-b1ff-c5f9-e320c2a4c297', 'en', 'Even the lilies of the field are clothed'),
('76db27db-6e9b-70ec-e1aa-8fadbcb512d2', 'de', 'Auch die Hunde unter dem Tisch essen von den Brosamen der Kinder'),
('76db27db-6e9b-70ec-e1aa-8fadbcb512d2', 'en', 'Even the dogs under the table eat the children''s crumbs'),
('2c3b2ce9-c8ac-c280-b911-ebbfbbdfb6c2', 'de', 'Auch der Sperling findet ein Nest am Altar'),
('2c3b2ce9-c8ac-c280-b911-ebbfbbdfb6c2', 'en', 'Even the sparrow finds a nest at the altar'),
('4a93519c-078c-dd6c-f1fc-63399e6c8027', 'de', 'Auch das verlorene Schaf wird gesucht'),
('4a93519c-078c-dd6c-f1fc-63399e6c8027', 'en', 'Even the lost sheep is sought'),
('8ffc0ba5-ed0c-8066-7ea7-545d9fd82a67', 'de', 'Er sandte es nach Babel'),
('8ffc0ba5-ed0c-8066-7ea7-545d9fd82a67', 'en', 'He sent it to Babylon'),
('c8c51cf5-708f-0fb1-ff82-4a71700e412c', 'de', 'Er zerriss seine Kleider vor Schrecken'),
('c8c51cf5-708f-0fb1-ff82-4a71700e412c', 'en', 'He tore his clothes in dismay'),
('e3e70273-2752-c296-49c3-816b331d809e', 'de', 'Er befahl, das Buch zu verbrennen'),
('e3e70273-2752-c296-49c3-816b331d809e', 'en', 'He ordered the book burned'),
('ed59a2a6-8a41-4a78-0ede-8a4af874da29', 'de', 'Er feierte ein großes Fest'),
('ed59a2a6-8a41-4a78-0ede-8a4af874da29', 'en', 'He held a great feast'),
('bc517bd0-2cf5-9fd6-2b6c-8155e4d4b650', 'de', 'Erst Reichtum für die Reise sammeln'),
('bc517bd0-2cf5-9fd6-2b6c-8155e4d4b650', 'en', 'First gather riches for the journey'),
('bbcf413f-fb48-ecfa-e7f4-806c9116aeb5', 'de', 'Sich selbst verleugnen und sein Kreuz auf sich nehmen'),
('bbcf413f-fb48-ecfa-e7f4-806c9116aeb5', 'en', 'Deny himself and take up his cross'),
('4f8ff530-55b8-0a7d-f5f0-4f91376484b7', 'de', 'Die Schriften der Propheten auswendig lernen'),
('4f8ff530-55b8-0a7d-f5f0-4f91376484b7', 'en', 'Memorize the writings of the prophets'),
('1b9947e0-c4ab-7264-789e-e989a04a6541', 'de', 'Eine Pilgerfahrt nach Jerusalem machen'),
('1b9947e0-c4ab-7264-789e-e989a04a6541', 'en', 'Make a pilgrimage to Jerusalem'),
('5bc17c65-16f8-3c52-ac6d-e869af56e5f1', 'de', 'Zur Beleuchtung der Stadt'),
('5bc17c65-16f8-3c52-ac6d-e869af56e5f1', 'en', 'For the lighting of the city'),
('f1681ebb-e8ef-09ba-031c-0a1124dd2953', 'de', 'Zur Bedeckung der Erde'),
('f1681ebb-e8ef-09ba-031c-0a1124dd2953', 'en', 'For the covering of the earth'),
('99377370-8a87-c4fb-2e79-1080b54cfa08', 'de', 'Zur Heilung der Völker'),
('99377370-8a87-c4fb-2e79-1080b54cfa08', 'en', 'For the healing of the nations'),
('3ef6f0c6-d64d-68b8-24ca-8e3e58e63693', 'de', 'Zur Speisung der Engel'),
('3ef6f0c6-d64d-68b8-24ca-8e3e58e63693', 'en', 'For the feeding of the angels'),
('c9f9aae2-541e-5469-1b7d-45e88e7fd045', 'de', 'Um die Rettung seines Viehs'),
('c9f9aae2-541e-5469-1b7d-45e88e7fd045', 'en', 'For the rescue of his livestock'),
('aa12cde4-3879-aa43-76a6-667d4de02bcc', 'de', 'Um den Tag der Vernichtung hinauszuschieben'),
('aa12cde4-3879-aa43-76a6-667d4de02bcc', 'en', 'To delay the day of destruction'),
('f90612ce-cf91-79a7-06ee-b23aeedab02d', 'de', 'Um einen Vertrag mit dem König'),
('f90612ce-cf91-79a7-06ee-b23aeedab02d', 'en', 'For a treaty with the king'),
('cdbf1ffd-6d8d-0bac-9dc5-41b9abd14400', 'de', 'Um wie viele Gerechte willen die Stadt verschont würde'),
('cdbf1ffd-6d8d-0bac-9dc5-41b9abd14400', 'en', 'For how many righteous the city would be spared'),
('dd21eb7d-1906-6a42-a322-f38401a1c4da', 'de', 'Weil ihre Söhne früh gestorben waren'),
('dd21eb7d-1906-6a42-a322-f38401a1c4da', 'en', 'Because her sons had died young'),
('48491ff8-ce91-74d8-4092-4bca9ae29a6d', 'de', 'Weil sie ihre Heimat verlassen musste'),
('48491ff8-ce91-74d8-4092-4bca9ae29a6d', 'en', 'Because she had to leave her homeland'),
('dcfcf388-a90e-faa9-ad40-7f7c26459d99', 'de', 'Weil ihr Mann sie verstoßen hatte'),
('dcfcf388-a90e-faa9-ad40-7f7c26459d99', 'en', 'Because her husband had cast her out'),
('51e49d38-55ba-7504-5fef-0cb1571c20bd', 'de', 'Weil sie keine Kinder bekommen konnte'),
('51e49d38-55ba-7504-5fef-0cb1571c20bd', 'en', 'Because she could not have children'),
('90cce841-0080-0f29-efe1-edccab85e278', 'de', 'Folge mir nach Galiläa'),
('90cce841-0080-0f29-efe1-edccab85e278', 'en', 'Follow me to Galilee'),
('03612ef1-02b3-47a4-4b65-abed0d030391', 'de', 'Wasch dich im Teich und werde rein'),
('03612ef1-02b3-47a4-4b65-abed0d030391', 'en', 'Wash yourself in the pool and be clean'),
('494436c2-c6d0-1967-3a2e-1bdf45a4cb9e', 'de', 'Zeige dich dem Priester im Tempel'),
('494436c2-c6d0-1967-3a2e-1bdf45a4cb9e', 'en', 'Show yourself to the priest in the temple'),
('c505e3da-0ed9-01eb-5894-e30fdb1f927e', 'de', 'Steh auf, nimm dein Bett und geh'),
('c505e3da-0ed9-01eb-5894-e30fdb1f927e', 'en', 'Rise, take up your bed and walk'),
('6e0668ed-1250-c18e-3ee4-35fc09e58338', 'de', 'Sie erträgt alles und hofft alles'),
('6e0668ed-1250-c18e-3ee4-35fc09e58338', 'en', 'It bears all things and hopes all things'),
('94e0543f-b6d5-ba01-1eab-da52bd0005bf', 'de', 'Sie misstraut allem'),
('94e0543f-b6d5-ba01-1eab-da52bd0005bf', 'en', 'It distrusts all things'),
('16fd5972-9556-66b7-ecca-35adb7f2578f', 'de', 'Sie verachtet alles'),
('16fd5972-9556-66b7-ecca-35adb7f2578f', 'en', 'It despises all things'),
('77deb2a2-ae42-f61f-eb3e-dfd3465d9942', 'de', 'Sie verzweifelt an allem'),
('77deb2a2-ae42-f61f-eb3e-dfd3465d9942', 'en', 'It despairs of all things'),
('79e649ad-8e35-3df8-cbe6-ab45f28700dd', 'de', 'Ach Herr, ich tauge nicht zu reden'),
('79e649ad-8e35-3df8-cbe6-ab45f28700dd', 'en', 'Ah Lord, I am not able to speak'),
('580ac260-06c6-e5a0-d048-1ed8e56be030', 'de', 'Wer kann vor dem Herrn bestehen'),
('580ac260-06c6-e5a0-d048-1ed8e56be030', 'en', 'Who can stand before the Lord'),
('e3014530-7f1b-e010-2c5b-d1dedd3ecf34', 'de', 'Hier bin ich, sende mich'),
('e3014530-7f1b-e010-2c5b-d1dedd3ecf34', 'en', 'Here am I, send me'),
('c61b5040-75f2-d42e-fec0-1c244416ac56', 'de', 'Wehe mir, ich vergehe, denn ich bin ein Mann unreiner Lippen'),
('c61b5040-75f2-d42e-fec0-1c244416ac56', 'en', 'Woe is me, I am undone, for I am a man of unclean lips'),
('49c259a7-fd29-fc2e-315f-63b22d14ca1d', 'de', 'Er machte ihn zum Anführer seiner Leibwache'),
('49c259a7-fd29-fc2e-315f-63b22d14ca1d', 'en', 'He made him commander of his bodyguard'),
('e528ce6a-edd2-0f91-038c-55ab7a97f7b4', 'de', 'Er belohnte ihn reich für die gute Nachricht'),
('e528ce6a-edd2-0f91-038c-55ab7a97f7b4', 'en', 'He richly rewarded him for the good news'),
('d1963c85-46ec-07d5-50b5-785c193ee572', 'de', 'Er schickte ihn als Boten zurück nach Israel'),
('d1963c85-46ec-07d5-50b5-785c193ee572', 'en', 'He sent him back to Israel as a messenger'),
('cb67bbf3-80ba-323f-917a-c9f0e302ccb2', 'de', 'Er ließ ihn hinrichten, weil er Hand an den Gesalbten des Herrn gelegt hatte'),
('cb67bbf3-80ba-323f-917a-c9f0e302ccb2', 'en', 'He had him executed for laying hands on the Lord''s anointed'),
('c22dc564-a087-901a-92f6-86004051c59a', 'de', 'Nur eine einzige Stunde'),
('c22dc564-a087-901a-92f6-86004051c59a', 'en', 'Only a single hour'),
('bcc7f9b7-d1bc-3a79-242f-1a666b91d30a', 'de', 'Drei Tage und drei Nächte'),
('bcc7f9b7-d1bc-3a79-242f-1a666b91d30a', 'en', 'Three days and three nights'),
('0d5d9f4d-7766-3355-b98c-3549623692a4', 'de', 'Vom Morgen bis zur Zeit des Abendopfers'),
('0d5d9f4d-7766-3355-b98c-3549623692a4', 'en', 'From morning until the time of the evening sacrifice'),
('5acf08c8-f8a0-c8ee-3d69-b3fad81a1a22', 'de', 'Vom Abend bis zum Morgengrauen'),
('5acf08c8-f8a0-c8ee-3d69-b3fad81a1a22', 'en', 'From evening until dawn'),
('8f594983-e8d2-d58b-87b2-3d45df715e83', 'de', 'Sie banden ihn an den Mast'),
('8f594983-e8d2-d58b-87b2-3d45df715e83', 'en', 'They tied him to the mast'),
('f51e7232-56dd-e5ca-00c0-318de1897d39', 'de', 'Sie warfen das Los über die Fracht'),
('f51e7232-56dd-e5ca-00c0-318de1897d39', 'en', 'They cast lots over the cargo'),
('d93c7bc3-9a54-6900-3c03-440b5fc650e4', 'de', 'Sie riefen den Herrn an um nicht schuldig zu werden'),
('d93c7bc3-9a54-6900-3c03-440b5fc650e4', 'en', 'They cried out to the Lord not to bear guilt'),
('7fb4ac2f-50ee-cf5a-8e2f-59278add7bbc', 'de', 'Sie verfluchten Jonas Gott'),
('7fb4ac2f-50ee-cf5a-8e2f-59278add7bbc', 'en', 'They cursed Jonah''s God'),
('46d7b8c5-5cb3-3b35-7a32-71ea43a86c46', 'de', 'Sie verlangten ein Zeichen'),
('46d7b8c5-5cb3-3b35-7a32-71ea43a86c46', 'en', 'They demanded a sign'),
('2380ce59-d4a7-9d13-a94c-17ecc2a0c87c', 'de', 'Sie wollten sie steinigen'),
('2380ce59-d4a7-9d13-a94c-17ecc2a0c87c', 'en', 'They wanted to stone them'),
('24c7ed49-3ad2-d782-235e-3122147cf2b2', 'de', 'Sie sagten, die Jünger seien voll süßen Weines'),
('24c7ed49-3ad2-d782-235e-3122147cf2b2', 'en', 'They said the disciples were full of new wine'),
('4ef79bc1-d224-1849-d09e-b9bec683e9dc', 'de', 'Sie liefen zum Tempel'),
('4ef79bc1-d224-1849-d09e-b9bec683e9dc', 'en', 'They ran to the temple'),
('61c94b34-6d13-bc89-1d3b-1516811233fd', 'de', 'Er übergab sie dem König zur Aufbewahrung'),
('61c94b34-6d13-bc89-1d3b-1516811233fd', 'en', 'He gave it to the king for safekeeping'),
('4c48315e-00b5-1714-fe93-f37bd83897d5', 'de', 'Er ließ sie von Baruch in ein irdenes Gefäß legen'),
('4c48315e-00b5-1714-fe93-f37bd83897d5', 'en', 'He had Baruch place it in an earthen jar'),
('9a620c6b-9d77-7452-5d23-b647486c3ee1', 'de', 'Er verbrannte sie als Opfer für Gott'),
('9a620c6b-9d77-7452-5d23-b647486c3ee1', 'en', 'He burned it as an offering to God'),
('d99f58d7-6f85-6b82-3708-1ba0f2258e8b', 'de', 'Er warf sie in den Fluss'),
('d99f58d7-6f85-6b82-3708-1ba0f2258e8b', 'en', 'He threw it into the river'),
('ff9ff6a7-2d74-9229-2ab0-9def8018b029', 'de', 'Mit einer Lilie unter den Dornen'),
('ff9ff6a7-2d74-9229-2ab0-9def8018b029', 'en', 'With a lily among the thorns'),
('11516f05-7872-d8fc-6656-0e2d25794eb2', 'de', 'Mit einer Eiche unter dem Gestrüpp'),
('11516f05-7872-d8fc-6656-0e2d25794eb2', 'en', 'With an oak among the brambles'),
('e9a9f634-0b45-59e4-f67e-31086bce8992', 'de', 'Mit einem Stern unter den Wolken'),
('e9a9f634-0b45-59e4-f67e-31086bce8992', 'en', 'With a star among the clouds'),
('28983382-c912-0903-a964-023470d880ee', 'de', 'Mit einer Quelle in der Wüste'),
('28983382-c912-0903-a964-023470d880ee', 'en', 'With a spring in the desert'),
('6e61d3c6-2ead-dae9-02d7-72659393883d', 'de', 'Er schwieg verlegen'),
('6e61d3c6-2ead-dae9-02d7-72659393883d', 'en', 'He fell silent in embarrassment'),
('572d3111-0164-0200-10c4-95773757c5bb', 'de', 'Er entbrannte zornig und warf David Überheblichkeit vor'),
('572d3111-0164-0200-10c4-95773757c5bb', 'en', 'He grew angry and accused David of arrogance'),
('30d619e6-a0a2-defb-d401-c626ed6e2e25', 'de', 'Er bot ihm seine Rüstung an'),
('30d619e6-a0a2-defb-d401-c626ed6e2e25', 'en', 'He offered him his armor'),
('3a2acdec-2352-4b2d-8d8b-789965e4597c', 'de', 'Er ermutigte ihn zum Kampf'),
('3a2acdec-2352-4b2d-8d8b-789965e4597c', 'en', 'He encouraged him to fight'),
('d1b499f9-6ee6-1292-847c-f551e638bcd1', 'de', 'Zeige dich dem Priester im Tempel'),
('d1b499f9-6ee6-1292-847c-f551e638bcd1', 'en', 'Show yourself to the priest in the temple'),
('93f90e82-d2c1-ed12-ecee-98e197559462', 'de', 'Steh auf und wandle sogleich'),
('93f90e82-d2c1-ed12-ecee-98e197559462', 'en', 'Rise and walk at once'),
('623ff6a1-ce3f-fb52-32ce-2cf70303c8fa', 'de', 'Dein Glaube hat dich geheilt'),
('623ff6a1-ce3f-fb52-32ce-2cf70303c8fa', 'en', 'Your faith has healed you'),
('d10b0eb0-0386-6bea-6b98-f30d6aff5319', 'de', 'Sei getrost, deine Sünden sind dir vergeben'),
('d10b0eb0-0386-6bea-6b98-f30d6aff5319', 'en', 'Take heart, your sins are forgiven'),
('fd5d2b7b-401b-edd7-1bb5-40f041037fe9', 'de', 'Dass ihre Feindin verbannt wurde'),
('fd5d2b7b-401b-edd7-1bb5-40f041037fe9', 'en', 'That her rival was banished'),
('baf75653-ef98-67b9-75fa-107caa8ad9b0', 'de', 'Dass ihr Mann König werden sollte'),
('baf75653-ef98-67b9-75fa-107caa8ad9b0', 'en', 'That her husband would become king'),
('22328049-938b-0ec6-1b2d-e817ab0b529f', 'de', 'Dass der HERR die Niedrigen erhöht und die Stolzen erniedrigt'),
('22328049-938b-0ec6-1b2d-e817ab0b529f', 'en', 'That the LORD lifts the lowly and humbles the proud'),
('6f861e2c-1dd7-0c3f-8a24-365c0c596ab2', 'de', 'Dass sie reich und mächtig geworden war'),
('6f861e2c-1dd7-0c3f-8a24-365c0c596ab2', 'en', 'That she had become rich and powerful'),
('3e008da6-4fb2-22b3-b319-55314d467506', 'de', 'Es sogleich verbrennen'),
('3e008da6-4fb2-22b3-b319-55314d467506', 'en', 'To burn it at once'),
('fba2aaec-2095-2761-72cf-bbd6434583f5', 'de', 'Es dem König übergeben'),
('fba2aaec-2095-2761-72cf-bbd6434583f5', 'en', 'To hand it to the king'),
('e91c3d1c-3de4-2cf5-31c4-9fc374c709d8', 'de', 'Das Buch verschließen und versiegeln bis zur Zeit des Endes'),
('e91c3d1c-3de4-2cf5-31c4-9fc374c709d8', 'en', 'To shut up the book and seal it until the time of the end'),
('51ce3954-5017-8ec7-4d05-8b5ebae71d49', 'de', 'Es öffentlich ausrufen'),
('51ce3954-5017-8ec7-4d05-8b5ebae71d49', 'en', 'To proclaim it publicly'),
('44c49de0-1821-7d9b-123e-79c7d52a3e20', 'de', 'Er hatte vier Flügel'),
('44c49de0-1821-7d9b-123e-79c7d52a3e20', 'en', 'It had four wings'),
('3748051b-01c1-1e94-c67d-3f9d1f4deff2', 'de', 'Er hatte drei Rippen im Maul'),
('3748051b-01c1-1e94-c67d-3f9d1f4deff2', 'en', 'It had three ribs in its mouth'),
('5aaa7269-bf4c-e130-266d-aa3797641b7b', 'de', 'Er trug eine goldene Krone'),
('5aaa7269-bf4c-e130-266d-aa3797641b7b', 'en', 'It wore a golden crown'),
('49fd29c4-5b53-7137-1efe-76b8f99074e1', 'de', 'Er hatte ein ansehnliches Horn zwischen den Augen'),
('49fd29c4-5b53-7137-1efe-76b8f99074e1', 'en', 'It had a conspicuous horn between its eyes'),
('c15bec17-ae1c-bb7a-a8a9-bf6e809d7531', 'de', 'Seine Haut wurde aussätzig'),
('c15bec17-ae1c-bb7a-a8a9-bf6e809d7531', 'en', 'His skin became leprous'),
('d1430a36-909c-92bc-0a5e-d1b0fc59ab59', 'de', 'Seine Haut strahlte hell'),
('d1430a36-909c-92bc-0a5e-d1b0fc59ab59', 'en', 'His skin shone brightly'),
('96ecfb8c-e6dd-c6e3-ff1c-45d2d6fb908d', 'de', 'Sein Bart wurde weiß'),
('96ecfb8c-e6dd-c6e3-ff1c-45d2d6fb908d', 'en', 'His beard turned white'),
('3d539346-b430-5af1-6e64-86dfbb0618f1', 'de', 'Sein Gesicht wurde verhüllt von Asche'),
('3d539346-b430-5af1-6e64-86dfbb0618f1', 'en', 'His face was covered with ash'),
('dcd5e774-c999-612a-c46c-a9be12440d60', 'de', 'In Hebron'),
('dcd5e774-c999-612a-c46c-a9be12440d60', 'en', 'At Hebron'),
('a6fccd9e-cd00-3dd7-1828-3661572e799d', 'de', 'In Sichem'),
('a6fccd9e-cd00-3dd7-1828-3661572e799d', 'en', 'At Shechem'),
('3c9b5ec5-042b-74b5-6950-9fe494125adc', 'de', 'In Gilgal'),
('3c9b5ec5-042b-74b5-6950-9fe494125adc', 'en', 'At Gilgal'),
('70aef295-195c-3efd-c4a7-8760482f9ade', 'de', 'In Silo'),
('70aef295-195c-3efd-c4a7-8760482f9ade', 'en', 'At Shiloh'),
('a8f05b2e-b518-0576-5301-d0a3c11f488b', 'de', 'Zwölf Söhne nach der Zahl der Stämme'),
('a8f05b2e-b518-0576-5301-d0a3c11f488b', 'en', 'Twelve sons after the number of tribes'),
('b96d58fd-0b26-1082-f397-15c8b34789c6', 'de', 'Siebzig Söhne von seinen vielen Frauen'),
('b96d58fd-0b26-1082-f397-15c8b34789c6', 'en', 'Seventy sons from his many wives'),
('b38cf375-b148-059e-2cba-32ca1fe0e943', 'de', 'Vierzig Söhne und ebenso viele Enkel'),
('b38cf375-b148-059e-2cba-32ca1fe0e943', 'en', 'Forty sons and as many grandsons'),
('6cfd1dd0-d2b2-0068-612b-b4fb78252895', 'de', 'Dreißig Söhne, die auf Eseln ritten'),
('6cfd1dd0-d2b2-0068-612b-b4fb78252895', 'en', 'Thirty sons who rode on donkeys'),
('2291d3da-8499-1c04-bfc9-c946c7769d8a', 'de', 'Ein Sturm zerstreute die Knochen'),
('2291d3da-8499-1c04-bfc9-c946c7769d8a', 'en', 'A storm scattered the bones'),
('084e2ea7-ab4b-7179-9f3f-ba775f28d56d', 'de', 'Ein Feuer verzehrte das Tal'),
('084e2ea7-ab4b-7179-9f3f-ba775f28d56d', 'en', 'A fire consumed the valley'),
('212bf524-67cc-b8ad-67e4-c880d12d5706', 'de', 'Die Erschlagenen wurden lebendig und standen als großes Heer auf'),
('212bf524-67cc-b8ad-67e4-c880d12d5706', 'en', 'The slain came to life and stood up as a vast army'),
('b4c646c3-b415-928f-8d52-27c34d37e312', 'de', 'Die Gebeine fielen wieder auseinander'),
('b4c646c3-b415-928f-8d52-27c34d37e312', 'en', 'The bones fell apart again'),
('c47720bf-f813-4656-7d70-98d00c0760e7', 'de', 'Mein Freund sucht mich, doch ich fliehe'),
('c47720bf-f813-4656-7d70-98d00c0760e7', 'en', 'My beloved seeks me, but I flee'),
('255a6338-a911-2ff6-c31d-58f75ababde6', 'de', 'Mein Freund ist fern, und ich bin allein'),
('255a6338-a911-2ff6-c31d-58f75ababde6', 'en', 'My beloved is far, and I am alone'),
('ed5f3add-2ce6-3752-fe92-6e5a818475fd', 'de', 'Mein Freund ist reich, und ich bin arm'),
('ed5f3add-2ce6-3752-fe92-6e5a818475fd', 'en', 'My beloved is rich, and I am poor'),
('057d4330-ff2d-0cbc-7f04-1a474f3daef9', 'de', 'Mein Freund ist mein, und ich bin sein'),
('057d4330-ff2d-0cbc-7f04-1a474f3daef9', 'en', 'My beloved is mine, and I am his'),
('9456233f-9dc0-53ce-eab9-6259f8e61d72', 'de', 'Einen Feigenbaum'),
('9456233f-9dc0-53ce-eab9-6259f8e61d72', 'en', 'A fig tree'),
('402a3ff4-aa91-aa9f-2ad4-7a1da34e9504', 'de', 'Einen Weinstock'),
('402a3ff4-aa91-aa9f-2ad4-7a1da34e9504', 'en', 'A grapevine'),
('70aec171-5bad-19c6-f76f-22a1fabd997b', 'de', 'Eine Zeder vom Libanon'),
('70aec171-5bad-19c6-f76f-22a1fabd997b', 'en', 'A cedar of Lebanon'),
('5af4951b-fcad-6458-44ad-75919afe8d61', 'de', 'Einen Rizinusstrauch'),
('5af4951b-fcad-6458-44ad-75919afe8d61', 'en', 'A castor-oil plant'),
('c72c3420-9bd1-2e02-c7e8-e09a8d02d02a', 'de', 'Aus einem Zweig des Lebensbaumes'),
('c72c3420-9bd1-2e02-c7e8-e09a8d02d02a', 'en', 'From a branch of the tree of life'),
('59fd113e-3902-60d2-b99a-af5f62eed698', 'de', 'Aus dem Lehm des Flussufers'),
('59fd113e-3902-60d2-b99a-af5f62eed698', 'en', 'From the clay of the riverbank'),
('874a8635-b69b-b2ba-c170-d0afb10b3b6d', 'de', 'Aus dem Staub des Erdbodens'),
('874a8635-b69b-b2ba-c170-d0afb10b3b6d', 'en', 'From the dust of the ground'),
('1d61d767-f8f4-2f1e-d60d-93b460e53abc', 'de', 'Aus dem Wasser des Stroms'),
('1d61d767-f8f4-2f1e-d60d-93b460e53abc', 'en', 'From the water of the river'),
('2afc3875-84df-6c04-7118-c057576058ac', 'de', 'Er bestraft es für sein Weglaufen'),
('2afc3875-84df-6c04-7118-c057576058ac', 'en', 'He punishes it for running away'),
('5c6294ee-f219-7548-82a1-32d0f8df8a47', 'de', 'Er bindet es an die übrige Herde'),
('5c6294ee-f219-7548-82a1-32d0f8df8a47', 'en', 'He ties it to the rest of the flock'),
('bf2fac43-45c2-eeaf-52b2-5a81a36d4925', 'de', 'Er legt es voll Freude auf seine Schultern'),
('bf2fac43-45c2-eeaf-52b2-5a81a36d4925', 'en', 'He joyfully lays it on his shoulders'),
('c3cc8890-f5e9-55af-4309-b8103ca516ec', 'de', 'Er verkauft es sofort weiter'),
('c3cc8890-f5e9-55af-4309-b8103ca516ec', 'en', 'He sells it off at once'),
('df294aca-9327-1a70-3149-d1aa8ce0042c', 'de', 'Jakobus, Johannes und Thomas'),
('df294aca-9327-1a70-3149-d1aa8ce0042c', 'en', 'James, John and Thomas'),
('e83877a5-759c-7ac6-e83f-bf7336be36f9', 'de', 'Petrus, Andreas und Matthäus'),
('e83877a5-759c-7ac6-e83f-bf7336be36f9', 'en', 'Peter, Andrew and Matthew'),
('a7875862-749f-c1cf-8947-80d4f0eca77a', 'de', 'Andreas, Philippus und Thomas'),
('a7875862-749f-c1cf-8947-80d4f0eca77a', 'en', 'Andrew, Philip and Thomas'),
('a622146d-544d-e477-79c1-a96dc10c608b', 'de', 'Petrus, Jakobus und Johannes'),
('a622146d-544d-e477-79c1-a96dc10c608b', 'en', 'Peter, James and John'),
('5211fb3f-961d-505c-9625-1232044f9d47', 'de', 'Eine fliegende Schriftrolle'),
