('df930349-b90f-b7e0-5715-53ce5ab98cdb', 'de', 'Er fragte, ob er je jemanden betrogen oder bestochen habe'),
('df930349-b90f-b7e0-5715-53ce5ab98cdb', 'en', 'He asked whether he had ever cheated or taken a bribe'),
