('9a8028ae-e6fa-3b9c-5c1b-bc73a7e3d60c', 'en', 'The water returned and drowned them'),
('a2c52a00-35ea-f190-7d60-c3b82317518f', 'de', 'Sie klagte David vor dem Volk an'),
('a2c52a00-35ea-f190-7d60-c3b82317518f', 'en', 'She accused David before the people'),
('ef8de33b-527d-5592-f71f-f9af39095940', 'de', 'Sie floh mit den Leichen nach Gibeon'),
('ef8de33b-527d-5592-f71f-f9af39095940', 'en', 'She fled with the bodies to Gibeon'),
('4d0c24b5-3851-74ba-3994-e6f96a09607b', 'de', 'Sie wehrte Monate lang die Vögel und Tiere von den Leichen ab'),
('4d0c24b5-3851-74ba-3994-e6f96a09607b', 'en', 'She kept the birds and beasts off the bodies for months'),
('75c95ac3-7e03-6894-f8e3-539b71a7094b', 'de', 'Sie begrub sie heimlich in der Nacht'),
('75c95ac3-7e03-6894-f8e3-539b71a7094b', 'en', 'She buried them secretly at night'),
('6b31849a-45d9-abf4-df09-b2f437f25c6c', 'de', 'Ihn zu lieben wie sich selbst, denn Israel war fremd in Ägypten'),
('6b31849a-45d9-abf4-df09-b2f437f25c6c', 'en', 'To love him as oneself, for Israel was a stranger in Egypt'),
('aa4cd4c9-1258-f1e8-64af-ee78c96013de', 'de', 'Ihn höher zu besteuern'),
('aa4cd4c9-1258-f1e8-64af-ee78c96013de', 'en', 'To tax him more heavily'),
('518b8bc7-5b3e-b466-b311-23d93867bc5a', 'de', 'Ihm kein Land zu geben'),
('518b8bc7-5b3e-b466-b311-23d93867bc5a', 'en', 'To give him no land'),
('717dfbd1-4071-0eb3-bc14-75a2209dfe45', 'de', 'Ihn vom Lager fernzuhalten'),
('717dfbd1-4071-0eb3-bc14-75a2209dfe45', 'en', 'To keep him away from the camp'),
('3c3c587b-e6ca-c93f-2bbd-c51943ba94b6', 'de', 'Den, der den Tempel weiht und reinigt'),
('3c3c587b-e6ca-c93f-2bbd-c51943ba94b6', 'en', 'The one who dedicates and cleanses the temple'),
('690bdede-d924-c6c2-cec1-aeb9b123e59d', 'de', 'Den, der Frieden verkündigt und Gutes predigt'),
('690bdede-d924-c6c2-cec1-aeb9b123e59d', 'en', 'The one who proclaims peace and preaches good news'),
('84fcd4ac-d9d3-5f97-3c45-6bc0c826e76f', 'de', 'Den, der den König krönt und ihn salbt'),
('84fcd4ac-d9d3-5f97-3c45-6bc0c826e76f', 'en', 'The one who crowns the king and anoints him'),
('6886df02-f798-7fe5-3a17-fd0ff4d67721', 'de', 'Den, der die Völker richtet und straft'),
('6886df02-f798-7fe5-3a17-fd0ff4d67721', 'en', 'The one who judges and punishes the nations'),
('95f7c68c-dd07-4f78-7134-ae55206653f5', 'de', 'Bete im Tempel für ihr Leben'),
('95f7c68c-dd07-4f78-7134-ae55206653f5', 'en', 'Pray in the temple for her life'),
('9c7f88e5-6d92-c600-6483-b2920441c856', 'de', 'Komm und lege ihr die Hände auf, dass sie gesund werde'),
('9c7f88e5-6d92-c600-6483-b2920441c856', 'en', 'Come and lay your hands on her that she may be made well'),
('c9a8b030-77ae-4525-0beb-e6d9c0b61659', 'de', 'Sende einen deiner Jünger zu ihr'),
('c9a8b030-77ae-4525-0beb-e6d9c0b61659', 'en', 'Send one of your disciples to her'),
('e310b1e3-661b-cecd-5149-36bb766b20e5', 'de', 'Sprich nur ein Wort von ferne'),
('e310b1e3-661b-cecd-5149-36bb766b20e5', 'en', 'Just speak a word from afar'),
('c5fa3095-7ec7-a9ef-525c-432c59668143', 'de', 'Wie ein Löwe mit Adlerflügeln'),
('c5fa3095-7ec7-a9ef-525c-432c59668143', 'en', 'Like a lion with eagle''s wings'),
('ceacc9dd-e6bd-651d-68c9-b0eb3596005b', 'de', 'Wie ein Bär mit drei Rippen'),
('ceacc9dd-e6bd-651d-68c9-b0eb3596005b', 'en', 'Like a bear with three ribs'),
('8f06fc09-bf58-489a-e946-24488acf0233', 'de', 'Wie ein Tier mit eisernen Zähnen'),
('8f06fc09-bf58-489a-e946-24488acf0233', 'en', 'Like a beast with iron teeth'),
('0d438c3b-4163-816e-081a-e585fba0163a', 'de', 'Wie ein Leopard mit vier Köpfen'),
('0d438c3b-4163-816e-081a-e585fba0163a', 'en', 'Like a leopard with four heads'),
('775042a7-7c81-e2e1-3319-baa4cce7a852', 'de', 'Das Holz Judas und das Holz Josefs, für ein vereintes Volk'),
('775042a7-7c81-e2e1-3319-baa4cce7a852', 'en', 'The stick of Judah and the stick of Joseph, for a united people'),
('4245b86b-4b8e-a924-1318-033b892d067b', 'de', 'Zwei Balken vom Tempeldach'),
('4245b86b-4b8e-a924-1318-033b892d067b', 'en', 'Two beams from the temple roof'),
('c62b8a4a-ddf5-e914-d626-8fecb8d140b8', 'de', 'Zwei trockene Äste vom Ölbaum'),
('c62b8a4a-ddf5-e914-d626-8fecb8d140b8', 'en', 'Two dry branches from an olive tree'),
('5ce55862-f663-4321-447c-26b7a35c6b86', 'de', 'Das Zepter und den Hirtenstab'),
('5ce55862-f663-4321-447c-26b7a35c6b86', 'en', 'The scepter and the shepherd''s staff'),
('5f98549a-bcc3-1a8e-0516-9fcff6620636', 'de', '… aber Reichtum bleibt für immer'),
('5f98549a-bcc3-1a8e-0516-9fcff6620636', 'en', '… but riches remain forever'),
('0a1ca764-b4d4-df0b-1f78-100b4e3f94dc', 'de', '… aber Klugheit allein zählt'),
('0a1ca764-b4d4-df0b-1f78-100b4e3f94dc', 'en', '… but cleverness alone counts'),
('4a422ad1-c99c-69e1-e89b-ee45778c1746', 'de', '… aber ein Weib, das den HERRN fürchtet, soll man rühmen'),
('4a422ad1-c99c-69e1-e89b-ee45778c1746', 'en', '… but a woman who fears the LORD is to be praised'),
('6152ad48-7256-bdbd-6a3f-c0353ca62b26', 'de', '… aber die Jugend dauert ewig'),
('6152ad48-7256-bdbd-6a3f-c0353ca62b26', 'en', '… but youth lasts forever'),
('b622d935-58ad-b5d7-8aa6-30d6399e36de', 'de', 'Der morgige Tag ist niemandem gewiss'),
('b622d935-58ad-b5d7-8aa6-30d6399e36de', 'en', 'Tomorrow is certain to no one'),
('94fadcd5-d7eb-48c2-9a41-130ee22bd443', 'de', 'Der morgige Tag bringt stets Gefahr'),
('94fadcd5-d7eb-48c2-9a41-130ee22bd443', 'en', 'Tomorrow always brings danger'),
('c3dbaa3c-93a0-9165-55b8-e7d1a6e640fd', 'de', 'Der morgige Tag ist in der Hand der Feinde'),
('c3dbaa3c-93a0-9165-55b8-e7d1a6e640fd', 'en', 'Tomorrow is in the hands of enemies'),
('f6380f79-3f72-863f-9fe7-8909eea1baa1', 'de', 'Der morgige Tag wird für das Seine sorgen'),
('f6380f79-3f72-863f-9fe7-8909eea1baa1', 'en', 'Tomorrow will worry about itself'),
('18ad5cfe-bd64-a262-b1b0-e7540448fcbd', 'de', 'Sie meinten, nur Gott könne Sünden vergeben'),
('18ad5cfe-bd64-a262-b1b0-e7540448fcbd', 'en', 'They thought only God could forgive sins'),
('3aa1d96f-27c6-609c-823a-806c3e2ee92e', 'de', 'Sie warfen ihm Sabbatbruch vor'),
('3aa1d96f-27c6-609c-823a-806c3e2ee92e', 'en', 'They accused him of breaking the Sabbath'),
('3095348d-7b30-35de-873d-07dce71b02c2', 'de', 'Sie tadelten seine Berührung des Kranken'),
('3095348d-7b30-35de-873d-07dce71b02c2', 'en', 'They blamed him for touching the sick'),
('585dbfa1-d2ce-5589-0fc6-c23f82bd2758', 'de', 'Sie hielten ihn für einen Aufrührer'),
('585dbfa1-d2ce-5589-0fc6-c23f82bd2758', 'en', 'They held him to be a rebel'),
('d3979a89-77de-5776-e91a-9f5475f3a4f0', 'de', 'Ich bin das Brot, ihr seid die Gäste'),
('d3979a89-77de-5776-e91a-9f5475f3a4f0', 'en', 'I am the bread, you are the guests'),
('80d67a9b-e8c9-1388-67a4-c371060d60fb', 'de', 'Ich bin der Weinstock, ihr seid die Reben'),
('80d67a9b-e8c9-1388-67a4-c371060d60fb', 'en', 'I am the vine, you are the branches'),
('d13fc14f-45bd-39a2-c342-a8954da2cba7', 'de', 'Ich bin der gute Hirte, ihr seid die Herde'),
('d13fc14f-45bd-39a2-c342-a8954da2cba7', 'en', 'I am the good shepherd, you are the flock'),
('c10a2c35-3f7d-e698-ed86-0b0eca5893fa', 'de', 'Ich bin das Licht, ihr seid die Lampen'),
('c10a2c35-3f7d-e698-ed86-0b0eca5893fa', 'en', 'I am the light, you are the lamps'),
('fd925773-deaf-bce6-836d-a201a0c2a568', 'de', 'Der Weinstock und der Granatapfelbaum'),
('fd925773-deaf-bce6-836d-a201a0c2a568', 'en', 'The grapevine and the pomegranate tree'),
('719ad859-30e7-6bb4-1f79-1eb60f9caeb1', 'de', 'Der Zedernbaum und der Palmbaum'),
('719ad859-30e7-6bb4-1f79-1eb60f9caeb1', 'en', 'The cedar tree and the palm tree'),
('fc7fc5c3-7283-de32-3d6e-15ba35aba900', 'de', 'Der Baum des Lebens und der Baum der Erkenntnis'),
('fc7fc5c3-7283-de32-3d6e-15ba35aba900', 'en', 'The tree of life and the tree of knowledge'),
('671d269b-7eb6-9ea1-c6df-ac894d2db220', 'de', 'Der Ölbaum und der Feigenbaum'),
('671d269b-7eb6-9ea1-c6df-ac894d2db220', 'en', 'The olive tree and the fig tree'),
('3d27a54c-561d-48c6-cd75-861a7b374815', 'de', 'Das Reich der Welt ist unseres Herrn geworden'),
('3d27a54c-561d-48c6-cd75-861a7b374815', 'en', 'The kingdom of the world has become our Lord''s'),
('c410ca15-f27d-b21b-69f8-c6969c1902f2', 'de', 'Gefallen, gefallen ist Babylon, die große Stadt'),
('c410ca15-f27d-b21b-69f8-c6969c1902f2', 'en', 'Fallen, fallen is Babylon, the great city'),
('ae83c5c7-a04d-33f0-7f3d-316681d86e7e', 'de', 'Heilig, heilig, heilig ist der Herr, der allmächtige Gott'),
('ae83c5c7-a04d-33f0-7f3d-316681d86e7e', 'en', 'Holy, holy, holy is the Lord, the almighty God'),
('a21f4c18-aed0-b881-5a41-9f76a172f459', 'de', 'Würdig ist das Lamm, das geschlachtet wurde'),
('a21f4c18-aed0-b881-5a41-9f76a172f459', 'en', 'Worthy is the Lamb that was slain'),
('12bd849e-7b7c-46fc-710b-4a2d89cea616', 'de', 'Er erhob eine Sondersteuer von allen Stämmen'),
('12bd849e-7b7c-46fc-710b-4a2d89cea616', 'en', 'He levied a special tax on all the tribes'),
('0e9fbeba-b139-9444-8ec3-758e2b058b2a', 'de', 'Er ließ die Bäume des Libanon im Geheimen fällen'),
('0e9fbeba-b139-9444-8ec3-758e2b058b2a', 'en', 'He had the cedars of Lebanon felled in secret'),
('67b3af70-e985-da6f-af7a-defa2c8934c7', 'de', 'Er sammelte Gold, Silber, Erz, Eisen und Steine in Menge'),
('67b3af70-e985-da6f-af7a-defa2c8934c7', 'en', 'He gathered gold, silver, bronze, iron and stones in abundance'),
('52938b1d-3188-9426-0cbd-c54f9e9dde89', 'de', 'Er nahm die Schätze der Nachbarvölker als Tribut'),
('52938b1d-3188-9426-0cbd-c54f9e9dde89', 'en', 'He took the treasures of neighboring nations as tribute'),
('309c27df-cfdd-fece-9378-9df90f7c9400', 'de', 'Suchet mich, so werdet ihr leben'),
('309c27df-cfdd-fece-9378-9df90f7c9400', 'en', 'Seek me and you shall live'),
('5913eeef-2fe6-83f0-18f3-34eafa42e28c', 'de', 'Fürchtet euch nicht vor dem Tag'),
('5913eeef-2fe6-83f0-18f3-34eafa42e28c', 'en', 'Do not fear the day'),
('789f7d13-918c-d575-6ac0-7a7a5e0eec78', 'de', 'Tragt eure Lasten zum Tempel'),
('789f7d13-918c-d575-6ac0-7a7a5e0eec78', 'en', 'Carry your burdens to the temple'),
('63e8eabf-27af-f7a6-7dfa-2309b32059d6', 'de', 'Versammelt euch auf dem Berg Zion'),
('63e8eabf-27af-f7a6-7dfa-2309b32059d6', 'en', 'Gather on Mount Zion'),
('57f0ef35-b445-dc40-2ef4-3fd43a0224c0', 'de', 'Eine Quelle zu graben'),
('57f0ef35-b445-dc40-2ef4-3fd43a0224c0', 'en', 'To dig a well'),
('cdd717ae-dbf5-42ee-7590-1041ddcd4923', 'de', 'Den Felsen zweimal zu schlagen'),
('cdd717ae-dbf5-42ee-7590-1041ddcd4923', 'en', 'To strike the rock twice'),
('1e2bd659-5939-9d40-5315-2e18dcebbcac', 'de', 'Das Volk zur Buße zu rufen'),
('1e2bd659-5939-9d40-5315-2e18dcebbcac', 'en', 'To call the people to repent'),
('30107a47-cb5b-1782-f755-e76b7d626c14', 'de', 'Zum Felsen zu reden, damit er Wasser gebe'),
('30107a47-cb5b-1782-f755-e76b7d626c14', 'en', 'To speak to the rock so it would give water'),
('b85a510e-0b82-bb90-a5d8-46c2cff61ab4', 'de', 'Die Erde tat sich auf und verschlang das Opfer'),
('b85a510e-0b82-bb90-a5d8-46c2cff61ab4', 'en', 'The earth opened and swallowed the offering'),
('d1ae11a2-4b8c-fb40-b449-659d056d60f6', 'de', 'Ein Sturm löschte die Altäre der Baalspropheten'),
('d1ae11a2-4b8c-fb40-b449-659d056d60f6', 'en', 'A storm extinguished the altars of Baal''s prophets'),
('309dbcfd-f04d-72ce-24fd-cb23c1b6c3e1', 'de', 'Feuer des HERRN fiel herab und verzehrte Opfer, Holz und Wasser'),
('309dbcfd-f04d-72ce-24fd-cb23c1b6c3e1', 'en', 'The fire of the LORD fell and consumed offering, wood, and water'),
('54019fe6-3468-8b87-7612-92991a9dad39', 'de', 'Eine Stimme rief aus den Wolken'),
('54019fe6-3468-8b87-7612-92991a9dad39', 'en', 'A voice called out from the clouds'),
('4a910b92-cbda-c1f7-37e2-f44d48ea83da', 'de', 'Seinen Thron aus Saphir'),
('4a910b92-cbda-c1f7-37e2-f44d48ea83da', 'en', 'His throne of sapphire'),
('d609807f-4271-59b9-7fb6-594e82fb5a7c', 'de', 'Seinen Rücken, während er vorüberzog'),
('d609807f-4271-59b9-7fb6-594e82fb5a7c', 'en', 'His back as he passed by'),
('c4fcdf4a-eba8-e3c4-a476-116ebfce66f7', 'de', 'Seine Hände im Licht'),
('c4fcdf4a-eba8-e3c4-a476-116ebfce66f7', 'en', 'His hands in the light'),
('2073868c-5acd-ed92-eb94-ba3c3e41a566', 'de', 'Seine Krone aus Feuer'),
('2073868c-5acd-ed92-eb94-ba3c3e41a566', 'en', 'His crown of fire'),
('31471295-d78e-89ee-b8a0-07e86b6fccb0', 'de', 'Rut, die treu bei Noomi blieb'),
('31471295-d78e-89ee-b8a0-07e86b6fccb0', 'en', 'Ruth, who stayed faithful to Naomi'),
('2b0e8ce5-953a-05a2-f236-ba7ce89a359e', 'de', 'Orpa, die ihre Schwiegermutter küsste und ging'),
('2b0e8ce5-953a-05a2-f236-ba7ce89a359e', 'en', 'Orpah, who kissed her mother-in-law and left'),
('511a417f-a2cc-9385-2ca6-44d5bfba3d15', 'de', 'Beide gingen gemeinsam zurück'),
('511a417f-a2cc-9385-2ca6-44d5bfba3d15', 'en', 'Both went back together'),
('433edd44-ddc6-e4c5-782a-5b1ab478c70d', 'de', 'Keine von beiden verließ Noomi'),
('433edd44-ddc6-e4c5-782a-5b1ab478c70d', 'en', 'Neither of them left Naomi'),
('6d0ea0c2-07c5-d213-17ed-abc354a53165', 'de', 'Etwa zweitausend Menschen'),
('6d0ea0c2-07c5-d213-17ed-abc354a53165', 'en', 'About two thousand people'),
('9e27d3ad-3a52-2d10-2029-13b5d5fb19c5', 'de', 'Etwa viertausend Männer'),
('9e27d3ad-3a52-2d10-2029-13b5d5fb19c5', 'en', 'About four thousand men'),
('543513c0-c1d8-4659-10f8-e4434e3ecfae', 'de', 'Etwa zwölf Jünger'),
('543513c0-c1d8-4659-10f8-e4434e3ecfae', 'en', 'About twelve disciples'),
('4220235e-21ba-3124-67ce-7549fdd96470', 'de', 'Etwa fünftausend Männer'),
('4220235e-21ba-3124-67ce-7549fdd96470', 'en', 'About five thousand men'),
('e54683f0-c9c1-ce9f-3347-93f56e110b47', 'de', 'Eine Finsternis fiel über das Land'),
('e54683f0-c9c1-ce9f-3347-93f56e110b47', 'en', 'Darkness fell over the land'),
('18557f2f-2379-0662-598d-50f0b15dfbf1', 'de', 'Frösche bedeckten das Land'),
('18557f2f-2379-0662-598d-50f0b15dfbf1', 'en', 'Frogs covered the land'),
('b9a566a1-aa35-bce0-b240-2ea8e464ffe6', 'de', 'Das Wasser des Nils wurde zu Blut'),
('b9a566a1-aa35-bce0-b240-2ea8e464ffe6', 'en', 'The water of the Nile turned to blood'),
('8c1f045a-d7e6-e2e5-bde2-dcfd06e812fb', 'de', 'Hagel zerschlug die Ernte'),
('8c1f045a-d7e6-e2e5-bde2-dcfd06e812fb', 'en', 'Hail destroyed the harvest'),
('3b90a1e2-2c6f-e400-a98c-27bbc1cf618d', 'de', 'Man fand nichts, und der Bau wurde endgültig verboten'),
('3b90a1e2-2c6f-e400-a98c-27bbc1cf618d', 'en', 'Nothing was found, and the building was finally forbidden'),
('e7d75c39-acd2-be30-2e2d-7206ac36893d', 'de', 'Man fand eine Klage gegen Serubbabel'),
('e7d75c39-acd2-be30-2e2d-7206ac36893d', 'en', 'A complaint against Zerubbabel was found'),
('8000562a-cc9a-9d8f-c6be-95c9060b3006', 'de', 'Man fand die Schriftrolle, und der Bau durfte weitergehen'),
('8000562a-cc9a-9d8f-c6be-95c9060b3006', 'en', 'The scroll was found, and the building was allowed to continue'),
('75124002-d0ac-850f-611a-2938b3f1697d', 'de', 'Man fand einen Befehl, die Heimkehrer zu vertreiben'),
('75124002-d0ac-850f-611a-2938b3f1697d', 'en', 'An order to expel the returnees was found'),
('1055fd0b-9fdf-89f5-1cba-34991a4e9bc9', 'de', 'Es war ihm wie kaltes Wasser'),
('1055fd0b-9fdf-89f5-1cba-34991a4e9bc9', 'en', 'It was to him like cold water'),
('094ec126-3ffa-b33c-fd8e-eb4d8b23dd69', 'de', 'Es war ihm fremd und unverständlich'),
('094ec126-3ffa-b33c-fd8e-eb4d8b23dd69', 'en', 'It was to him strange and unintelligible'),
('96a18299-e62a-692e-49d5-e88185d11592', 'de', 'Es war ihm wie eine schwere Last ohne Trost'),
('96a18299-e62a-692e-49d5-e88185d11592', 'en', 'It was to him like a heavy burden without comfort'),
('7c32c40c-d5f1-7eec-e25d-7836b31460ed', 'de', 'Es war ihm eine Freude und Wonne seines Herzens'),
('7c32c40c-d5f1-7eec-e25d-7836b31460ed', 'en', 'It was to him a joy and the delight of his heart'),
('db82172c-790f-7628-ab8d-dfe579c918ee', 'de', 'Am Stand der Sonne'),
('db82172c-790f-7628-ab8d-dfe579c918ee', 'en', 'By the position of the sun'),
('c391ee26-37bc-1be4-2013-b335c766c786', 'de', 'Am Fallen des Mannas'),
('c391ee26-37bc-1be4-2013-b335c766c786', 'en', 'By the falling of the manna'),
('6f17e683-a3ba-0345-07f7-3f91238a4a44', 'de', 'An einem Hornsignal der Priester'),
('6f17e683-a3ba-0345-07f7-3f91238a4a44', 'en', 'By a horn signal of the priests'),
('14f034e0-9a3d-e4c8-65e2-e65f5b06f7bd', 'de', 'An der Wolke über der Stiftshütte'),
('14f034e0-9a3d-e4c8-65e2-e65f5b06f7bd', 'en', 'By the cloud over the tabernacle'),
('d5cfa513-be88-8701-d5b5-1860280f625f', 'de', 'Dass das Gesetz vollendet wurde'),
('d5cfa513-be88-8701-d5b5-1860280f625f', 'en', 'That the law was completed'),
('c09fb72e-563e-9692-b450-b06b5297ce62', 'de', 'Dass die Welt im Frieden ruht'),
('c09fb72e-563e-9692-b450-b06b5297ce62', 'en', 'That the world rests in peace'),
('912f12ee-46f8-ed08-de24-f5006168c363', 'de', 'Dass die Gerechten belohnt wurden'),
('912f12ee-46f8-ed08-de24-f5006168c363', 'en', 'That the righteous were rewarded'),
('a21aa54d-5fa0-e8c8-e7fa-2f92697a2e6c', 'de', 'Dass Gott seinen einzigen Sohn gesandt hat'),
('a21aa54d-5fa0-e8c8-e7fa-2f92697a2e6c', 'en', 'That God sent his only Son'),
('61b83efd-5bac-769a-b06d-99710db1bb82', 'de', 'Sie werden satt werden'),
('61b83efd-5bac-769a-b06d-99710db1bb82', 'en', 'They shall be filled'),
('fdb53b3b-03a3-fd03-482a-7f79f5515599', 'de', 'Sie werden Gott schauen'),
('fdb53b3b-03a3-fd03-482a-7f79f5515599', 'en', 'They shall see God'),
('ee0fef46-f590-aa71-813d-04eb91299f05', 'de', 'Sie sollen getröstet werden'),
('ee0fef46-f590-aa71-813d-04eb91299f05', 'en', 'They shall be comforted'),
('f5b98cb8-deac-7619-afae-fb01f05d00e0', 'de', 'Sie werden das Erdreich besitzen'),
('f5b98cb8-deac-7619-afae-fb01f05d00e0', 'en', 'They shall inherit the earth'),
('b9a868b9-d771-7cf3-a791-a9ceaa4fc9d4', 'de', 'Sie kam zu Jesus und folgte ihm nach'),
('b9a868b9-d771-7cf3-a791-a9ceaa4fc9d4', 'en', 'She came to Jesus and followed him'),
('899e5a2a-e44f-9792-f3d2-17789f1188ba', 'de', 'Sie wurde sehend und konnte gehen'),
('899e5a2a-e44f-9792-f3d2-17789f1188ba', 'en', 'She received sight and could walk'),
('dc2b49a6-aacd-31bd-6c7f-877efbe4036b', 'de', 'Der Dämon war ausgefahren, sie lag ruhig auf dem Bett'),
('dc2b49a6-aacd-31bd-6c7f-877efbe4036b', 'en', 'The demon had gone out, she lay quietly on the bed'),
('2dc2fa63-aa3e-e6bf-da78-fe76888e862d', 'de', 'Sie war gestorben und wurde auferweckt'),
('2dc2fa63-aa3e-e6bf-da78-fe76888e862d', 'en', 'She had died and was raised'),
('0f1d340b-1f33-40a7-e6a1-25915a80479a', 'de', '… als ein leeres Haus voll Frieden'),
('0f1d340b-1f33-40a7-e6a1-25915a80479a', 'en', '… than an empty house full of peace'),
('0a12b93f-03ab-9a2c-7068-cd88b9e2bc71', 'de', '… als ein langes Leben ohne Gott'),
('0a12b93f-03ab-9a2c-7068-cd88b9e2bc71', 'en', '… than a long life without God'),
('ae3bf698-d755-904b-46b6-b9550ce7d1ae', 'de', '… als die Weisheit ohne Ehre'),
('ae3bf698-d755-904b-46b6-b9550ce7d1ae', 'en', '… than wisdom without honor'),
('090f3c8d-ccea-ec48-cb5a-c840b10e2733', 'de', '… als ein großer Schatz, bei dem Unruhe ist'),
('090f3c8d-ccea-ec48-cb5a-c840b10e2733', 'en', '… than great treasure with turmoil'),
('da31080f-acf2-f17b-50fd-55e4273424a8', 'de', 'Er werde von Feinden erschlagen'),
('da31080f-acf2-f17b-50fd-55e4273424a8', 'en', 'He would be slain by enemies'),
('02799bf5-5c50-68bb-ad9b-570f69165b07', 'de', 'Er werde es um seinen Erstgeborenen und Jüngsten bauen'),
('02799bf5-5c50-68bb-ad9b-570f69165b07', 'en', 'He would lay its foundation at the cost of his firstborn and youngest'),
('1e44525e-b042-f120-3758-e74b20c46e25', 'de', 'Das Land werde ihn verschlingen'),
('1e44525e-b042-f120-3758-e74b20c46e25', 'en', 'The land would swallow him'),
('5cadd7f1-a388-dfa9-6c67-f4efe36db0db', 'de', 'Sein Geschlecht werde aussterben'),
('5cadd7f1-a388-dfa9-6c67-f4efe36db0db', 'en', 'His line would die out'),
('b2761b3f-08bf-4258-c930-f315daf90f97', 'de', 'Er würde von den Philistern abgerissen werden'),
('b2761b3f-08bf-4258-c930-f315daf90f97', 'en', 'It would be torn down by the Philistines'),
('9afac44e-c79b-b22a-d42b-52148190b719', 'de', 'Er würde mit Gold überzogen werden'),
('9afac44e-c79b-b22a-d42b-52148190b719', 'en', 'It would be overlaid with gold'),
('42b5e0e2-05a2-5bac-bcb3-e3c3e4d29748', 'de', 'Ein Sohn namens Josia würde darauf die Priester opfern'),
('42b5e0e2-05a2-5bac-bcb3-e3c3e4d29748', 'en', 'A son named Josiah would sacrifice the priests on it'),
('13fda213-3164-4547-9b05-e207f8fe8dda', 'de', 'Er würde von einem Erdbeben verschlungen werden'),
('13fda213-3164-4547-9b05-e207f8fe8dda', 'en', 'It would be swallowed by an earthquake'),
('2cc0c9cf-63c0-60ad-4c4b-2105a53ba706', 'de', 'Sie solle dem König sofort von Haman erzählen'),
('2cc0c9cf-63c0-60ad-4c4b-2105a53ba706', 'en', 'She should at once tell the king about Haman'),
('389dd6f8-5eee-ebeb-1b9b-7d077ba8f94e', 'de', 'Sie solle ihr Volk und ihre Verwandtschaft nicht verraten'),
('389dd6f8-5eee-ebeb-1b9b-7d077ba8f94e', 'en', 'She should not reveal her people and her kindred'),
('4b8e4c76-625c-8bb0-1562-71f97b2082e0', 'de', 'Sie solle den König um Reichtum für ihr Volk bitten'),
('4b8e4c76-625c-8bb0-1562-71f97b2082e0', 'en', 'She should ask the king for riches for her people'),
('43ed7892-9bb4-9072-dacb-733ac1c94e60', 'de', 'Sie solle heimlich aus dem Palast fliehen'),
('43ed7892-9bb4-9072-dacb-733ac1c94e60', 'en', 'She should secretly flee from the palace'),
('d35b815c-b2bd-3c6c-7974-38e705ade0b2', 'de', 'Er sandte sie zu ihrer Familie zurück'),
('d35b815c-b2bd-3c6c-7974-38e705ade0b2', 'en', 'He sent her back to her family'),
('c92326b5-8545-b809-de52-5d7f1bc1accb', 'de', 'Er holte Batseba in sein Haus und machte sie zur Frau'),
('c92326b5-8545-b809-de52-5d7f1bc1accb', 'en', 'He brought Bathsheba into his house and made her his wife'),
('a46413d1-895c-cd87-6a65-ca35e4a7fcdf', 'de', 'Er ließ Joab für den Tod Urias bestrafen'),
('a46413d1-895c-cd87-6a65-ca35e4a7fcdf', 'en', 'He had Joab punished for Uriah''s death'),
('d7ed02ce-74b5-9130-b545-2f7e7a4fb1fb', 'de', 'Er gestand dem Volk seine Schuld'),
('d7ed02ce-74b5-9130-b545-2f7e7a4fb1fb', 'en', 'He confessed his guilt to the people'),
('2fc62c9f-32cc-4e83-ac92-73b3ebf4d652', 'de', 'Die Stadt wird zerstört und verwüstet werden'),
('2fc62c9f-32cc-4e83-ac92-73b3ebf4d652', 'en', 'The city will be destroyed and laid waste'),
('38c650fe-56e8-b705-88ce-948d08f55d55', 'de', 'Die Stadt wird Buße tun und gerettet'),
('38c650fe-56e8-b705-88ce-948d08f55d55', 'en', 'The city will repent and be saved'),
('c593c7c1-e04e-68d2-ef95-929b27fd5b93', 'de', 'Die Stadt wird Israel unterwerfen'),
('c593c7c1-e04e-68d2-ef95-929b27fd5b93', 'en', 'The city will subdue Israel'),
('65e4beef-db00-0376-7e5e-4d060fc1b9e9', 'de', 'Die Stadt wird zur Hauptstadt werden'),
('65e4beef-db00-0376-7e5e-4d060fc1b9e9', 'en', 'The city will become a capital'),
('62aef64c-20ac-2800-fc2c-67a481db3695', 'de', 'Wer hat den Zehnten erfunden?'),
('62aef64c-20ac-2800-fc2c-67a481db3695', 'en', 'Who invented the tithe?'),
('28d10739-b10c-e4e9-c3c6-0916802540dd', 'de', 'Wann begann der Zehnte?'),
('28d10739-b10c-e4e9-c3c6-0916802540dd', 'en', 'When did the tithe begin?'),
('00631a07-f898-cadd-09f0-ce672a096976', 'de', 'Darf ein Mensch Gott berauben?'),
('00631a07-f898-cadd-09f0-ce672a096976', 'en', 'Will a man rob God?'),
('be60c4a0-283e-0a0a-1912-d506ec9c63fb', 'de', 'Wie viel ist genug?'),
('be60c4a0-283e-0a0a-1912-d506ec9c63fb', 'en', 'How much is enough?'),
('ebb2b3bb-24ea-5c50-e92e-511c30d48980', 'de', 'Sich sogleich abwenden und fliehen'),
('ebb2b3bb-24ea-5c50-e92e-511c30d48980', 'en', 'Turn away at once and flee'),
('62c49780-28e5-9085-b281-d211ca85c16b', 'de', 'Auch die andere Wange hinhalten'),
('62c49780-28e5-9085-b281-d211ca85c16b', 'en', 'Turn the other cheek as well'),
('d8bf9006-8cac-5fec-2df6-3b584d9f21ec', 'de', 'Mit gleichem Schlag vergelten'),
('d8bf9006-8cac-5fec-2df6-3b584d9f21ec', 'en', 'Repay with an equal blow'),
('d4bebc25-fa3d-4e73-c0f4-4f4ac8f24eb9', 'de', 'Den Schläger vor das Gericht bringen'),
('d4bebc25-fa3d-4e73-c0f4-4f4ac8f24eb9', 'en', 'Bring the striker before the court'),
('ac1fbfba-4842-b5a4-cca9-c13d0370fc83', 'de', 'Das Wasser aus dem Felsen'),
('ac1fbfba-4842-b5a4-cca9-c13d0370fc83', 'en', 'The water from the rock'),
('277278d0-ae24-257b-3c66-66031f6b9ddb', 'de', 'Die von Mose erhöhte Schlange'),
('277278d0-ae24-257b-3c66-66031f6b9ddb', 'en', 'The serpent Moses lifted up'),
('48c34563-d1e5-9c78-9ab3-db2ec3919fdd', 'de', 'Die Wolkensäule am Tag'),
('48c34563-d1e5-9c78-9ab3-db2ec3919fdd', 'en', 'The pillar of cloud by day'),
('92f939a5-2dda-7f8e-6f2d-c5337b64a4bc', 'de', 'Das Manna vom Himmel'),
('92f939a5-2dda-7f8e-6f2d-c5337b64a4bc', 'en', 'The manna from heaven'),
('cd79e061-5c56-706d-d49e-17f00be117c3', 'de', 'Wie furchtbar ist dein Heiligtum, Herr'),
('cd79e061-5c56-706d-d49e-17f00be117c3', 'en', 'How fearful is your sanctuary, O Lord'),
('512101ce-ee3d-0ec3-2003-7bc4e03888e9', 'de', 'Wie fern sind deine Wohnungen, o Gott'),
('512101ce-ee3d-0ec3-2003-7bc4e03888e9', 'en', 'How distant are your dwellings, O God'),
('ca19bb5d-399c-bb24-70b1-16e42b35f331', 'de', 'Wie lieblich sind deine Wohnungen, Herr Zebaoth'),
('ca19bb5d-399c-bb24-70b1-16e42b35f331', 'en', 'How lovely is your dwelling place, O Lord of hosts'),
('698dae52-6c58-bbe2-ae9e-5f377d998c1e', 'de', 'Wie verschlossen sind deine Tore, o Gott'),
('698dae52-6c58-bbe2-ae9e-5f377d998c1e', 'en', 'How shut are your gates, O God'),
('6db6051e-111f-0787-4955-8422a843414c', 'de', 'Er gab ihm seine Krone'),
('6db6051e-111f-0787-4955-8422a843414c', 'en', 'He gave him his crown'),
('b72b5933-00e3-5c72-b08d-99229518800b', 'de', 'Er gab ihm sein Obergewand, Schwert, Bogen und Gürtel'),
('b72b5933-00e3-5c72-b08d-99229518800b', 'en', 'He gave him his robe, sword, bow and belt'),
('30b716dd-a857-c67c-becb-126f860d419e', 'de', 'Er überließ ihm sein Streitross'),
('30b716dd-a857-c67c-becb-126f860d419e', 'en', 'He handed over his war horse'),
('a88eda18-641a-4516-529d-9b010f3bd948', 'de', 'Er schenkte ihm Gold und Silber'),
('a88eda18-641a-4516-529d-9b010f3bd948', 'en', 'He gave him gold and silver'),
('acf5f268-cd28-ad40-0563-3a0cda5a19bd', 'de', 'Gott ist ein verzehrendes Feuer'),
('acf5f268-cd28-ad40-0563-3a0cda5a19bd', 'en', 'God is a consuming fire'),
('9cb10265-577c-173b-1cc1-aabb79983168', 'de', 'Gott ist unsre Zuversicht und Stärke'),
('9cb10265-577c-173b-1cc1-aabb79983168', 'en', 'God is our refuge and strength'),
('9a03d9cc-31c4-dd5e-ba9c-cbefca68c048', 'de', 'Gott ist Richter über die Völker'),
('9a03d9cc-31c4-dd5e-ba9c-cbefca68c048', 'en', 'God is judge over the nations'),
('38e374b3-0a70-ea5d-b0e9-71b298fd19f7', 'de', 'Gott ist fern in der Höhe'),
('38e374b3-0a70-ea5d-b0e9-71b298fd19f7', 'en', 'God is far off on high'),
('088fe010-acc6-993c-c619-11d9c2207335', 'de', 'Petrus und Johannes'),
('088fe010-acc6-993c-c619-11d9c2207335', 'en', 'Peter and John'),
('06357448-0212-c0a2-7732-e08a810cf7ff', 'de', 'Barnabas und Saulus'),
('06357448-0212-c0a2-7732-e08a810cf7ff', 'en', 'Barnabas and Saul'),
('c4230944-cd9c-6bdd-04d4-a33baf8e8c9c', 'de', 'Paulus und Silas'),
('c4230944-cd9c-6bdd-04d4-a33baf8e8c9c', 'en', 'Paul and Silas'),
('02ff5576-f432-d925-b0c3-e7b6a26343a2', 'de', 'Timotheus und Titus'),
('02ff5576-f432-d925-b0c3-e7b6a26343a2', 'en', 'Timothy and Titus'),
('8f35060d-82d9-fd10-4a47-2920b8c39ab8', 'de', 'In Binden mit Gold durchwirkt'),
('8f35060d-82d9-fd10-4a47-2920b8c39ab8', 'en', 'In bands woven with gold'),
('8c1482fd-daaf-702c-b87b-89f272ad5dab', 'de', 'In ein Gewand aus Purpur'),
('8c1482fd-daaf-702c-b87b-89f272ad5dab', 'en', 'In a robe of purple'),
('bce0a5fd-8e16-9cb8-6e80-3273efed14bf', 'de', 'In ein reines Leinentuch'),
('bce0a5fd-8e16-9cb8-6e80-3273efed14bf', 'en', 'In a clean linen cloth'),
('1cc0bfc9-a253-0026-3dac-f2f0a5dad12f', 'de', 'In ein Tuch aus Wolle'),
('1cc0bfc9-a253-0026-3dac-f2f0a5dad12f', 'en', 'In a cloth of wool'),
('88d80ca1-3811-0efa-6918-31d484582bc2', 'de', 'Er weigerte sich, die Stadt zu verlassen'),
('88d80ca1-3811-0efa-6918-31d484582bc2', 'en', 'He refused to leave the city'),
('f548b7a4-b0a9-92cc-a797-f3befb70e09d', 'de', 'Er zog aus, ohne zu wissen, wohin er kam'),
('f548b7a4-b0a9-92cc-a797-f3befb70e09d', 'en', 'He went out not knowing where he was going'),
('2c9ae6a9-31f2-d9f7-2fe3-8056fca5d6a9', 'de', 'Er kehrte enttäuscht in sein Land zurück'),
('2c9ae6a9-31f2-d9f7-2fe3-8056fca5d6a9', 'en', 'He returned disappointed to his land'),
('c0fa1dca-6ec9-7921-2085-bacd522d4805', 'de', 'Er forderte zuerst ein sichtbares Zeichen'),
('c0fa1dca-6ec9-7921-2085-bacd522d4805', 'en', 'He first demanded a visible sign'),
('36f2e54e-f175-aa8d-91f1-1c912e709cb7', 'de', 'Die Weisen aus dem Morgenland'),
('36f2e54e-f175-aa8d-91f1-1c912e709cb7', 'en', 'The wise men from the East'),
('b159ae48-7ac8-3e71-fe68-384144d80ea6', 'de', 'Eine Stimme vom Himmel her'),
('b159ae48-7ac8-3e71-fe68-384144d80ea6', 'en', 'A voice from heaven'),
('86d76d14-735d-a1bc-385c-78dbed2d47ee', 'de', 'Ein Engel des Herrn im Traum'),
('86d76d14-735d-a1bc-385c-78dbed2d47ee', 'en', 'An angel of the Lord in a dream'),
('c1a1e6c8-6430-faff-57b7-8aee0de800c9', 'de', 'Ein Schriftgelehrter aus Jerusalem'),
('c1a1e6c8-6430-faff-57b7-8aee0de800c9', 'en', 'A scribe from Jerusalem'),
('f73be150-53de-493e-70d0-f7e7cac25092', 'de', 'Er zerschmetterte sie am Fuß des Berges'),
('f73be150-53de-493e-70d0-f7e7cac25092', 'en', 'He shattered them at the foot of the mountain'),
('8a90b741-548c-e5e4-b367-748e2baa82f7', 'de', 'Er las laut die Gebote vor'),
('8a90b741-548c-e5e4-b367-748e2baa82f7', 'en', 'He read the commandments aloud'),
('e4bf5790-f3f0-b070-eac9-f36cf660d0f8', 'de', 'Er verbarg sie in der Lade'),
('e4bf5790-f3f0-b070-eac9-f36cf660d0f8', 'en', 'He hid them in the ark'),
('f1fc95cc-1aa3-f6e0-7880-04ece06b5e97', 'de', 'Er gab sie Aaron zur Aufbewahrung'),
('f1fc95cc-1aa3-f6e0-7880-04ece06b5e97', 'en', 'He gave them to Aaron for safekeeping'),
('4de271e1-ad92-dae0-3b92-0ca12c2116c8', 'de', 'Als König über alle Stämme'),
('4de271e1-ad92-dae0-3b92-0ca12c2116c8', 'en', 'As king over all the tribes'),
('bd5c2a44-4633-7341-3575-80a4f95f57a6', 'de', 'Als Richter über die Völker'),
('bd5c2a44-4633-7341-3575-80a4f95f57a6', 'en', 'As judge over the nations'),
('a69c1194-8bf5-602d-feee-e4bd571847bd', 'de', 'Als obersten Priester am Tempel'),
('a69c1194-8bf5-602d-feee-e4bd571847bd', 'en', 'As high priest at the temple'),
('509f631d-8793-310b-0406-d41c2e5f1f48', 'de', 'Als Wächter, der das Volk vor Gott warnen soll'),
('509f631d-8793-310b-0406-d41c2e5f1f48', 'en', 'As a watchman to warn the people on God''s behalf'),
('b377e60f-f244-ed56-8d02-fe84fe73be51', 'de', 'Er heilte seine Lähmung'),
('b377e60f-f244-ed56-8d02-fe84fe73be51', 'en', 'He healed his paralysis'),
('214e04a8-8041-652f-78f2-75ee5ef8b57b', 'de', 'Er schlug ihn mit Blindheit für eine Zeit'),
('214e04a8-8041-652f-78f2-75ee5ef8b57b', 'en', 'He struck him blind for a time'),
('d9b96016-3a26-d352-5b7b-1425eea4edfa', 'de', 'Er verwandelte seinen Stab in eine Schlange'),
('d9b96016-3a26-d352-5b7b-1425eea4edfa', 'en', 'He turned his staff into a serpent'),
('1c928da2-e923-1f36-23c3-52a37558788e', 'de', 'Er ließ Feuer auf ihn fallen'),
('1c928da2-e923-1f36-23c3-52a37558788e', 'en', 'He called down fire on him'),
('9cee040f-278a-9b78-446c-d7c9a7ad1122', 'de', 'In der vierten Nachtwache'),
('9cee040f-278a-9b78-446c-d7c9a7ad1122', 'en', 'In the fourth watch of the night'),
('6ec1d73a-1bf9-2364-c4f0-4bb6ff7915c2', 'de', 'Beim ersten Hahnenschrei'),
('6ec1d73a-1bf9-2364-c4f0-4bb6ff7915c2', 'en', 'At the first cockcrow'),
('8b6e8d11-6259-7882-db10-2033d2c607c5', 'de', 'Zur Mittagsstunde'),
('8b6e8d11-6259-7882-db10-2033d2c607c5', 'en', 'At the noon hour'),
('5cdb0172-07df-f283-da8f-addb7e1ae33d', 'de', 'Bei Sonnenuntergang'),
('5cdb0172-07df-f283-da8f-addb7e1ae33d', 'en', 'At sunset'),
('233aedcb-0db9-53ce-79db-8b8a9ab1f725', 'de', 'Schweige und sage es niemandem'),
('233aedcb-0db9-53ce-79db-8b8a9ab1f725', 'en', 'Be silent and tell no one'),
('ffc0a40f-3b1f-57d9-fcf0-45051c57ac73', 'de', 'Folge mir nach Galiläa'),
('ffc0a40f-3b1f-57d9-fcf0-45051c57ac73', 'en', 'Follow me to Galilee'),
('bfc4fceb-d111-3f55-de17-b6dbda4d46a4', 'de', 'Bringe ein Opfer im Tempel dar'),
('bfc4fceb-d111-3f55-de17-b6dbda4d46a4', 'en', 'Bring an offering in the temple'),
('200e90cf-d8e4-cbbb-0755-ca189364a3f4', 'de', 'Geh hin und sündige hinfort nicht mehr'),
('200e90cf-d8e4-cbbb-0755-ca189364a3f4', 'en', 'Go and sin no more'),
('f2e93f77-6220-38c5-33f4-1c46c7508323', 'de', 'Man erntet stets das Gegenteil'),
('f2e93f77-6220-38c5-33f4-1c46c7508323', 'en', 'One always reaps the opposite'),
('9e79a0d4-218b-83f7-9c9f-a3b85655aa93', 'de', 'Die Ernte hängt nicht von der Saat ab'),
('9e79a0d4-218b-83f7-9c9f-a3b85655aa93', 'en', 'The harvest does not depend on the sowing'),
('8f222b7d-8fa6-9c1a-a45f-5ac44eac6153', 'de', 'Niemand erntet, was er sät'),
('8f222b7d-8fa6-9c1a-a45f-5ac44eac6153', 'en', 'No one reaps what he sows'),
('25c7abe9-e0da-20c4-3cd8-b7b2d0dfd788', 'de', 'Was der Mensch sät, das wird er ernten'),
('25c7abe9-e0da-20c4-3cd8-b7b2d0dfd788', 'en', 'Whatever a person sows, that he will reap'),
('a0ba4ede-f445-868d-ac86-cea4f630bf49', 'de', 'Saul fiel zu Boden'),
('a0ba4ede-f445-868d-ac86-cea4f630bf49', 'en', 'Saul fell to the ground'),
('6e5743ea-d4f4-34a3-0d2f-a3492402ebce', 'de', 'Samuel segnete ihn doch noch'),
('6e5743ea-d4f4-34a3-0d2f-a3492402ebce', 'en', 'Samuel blessed him after all'),
('9e24780f-cc42-1201-c4da-e52ed9b413cf', 'de', 'Der Saum riss ab, ein Zeichen für das zerrissene Königtum'),
('9e24780f-cc42-1201-c4da-e52ed9b413cf', 'en', 'The hem tore off, a sign of the torn kingdom'),
('ebad3cfe-da8e-f0e4-666c-404fdbe5246e', 'de', 'Das Gewand begann zu leuchten'),
('ebad3cfe-da8e-f0e4-666c-404fdbe5246e', 'en', 'The robe began to glow'),
('b6973f4e-43da-259d-7b08-e5027d00b714', 'de', 'Peniel, sein Vertrauter'),
('b6973f4e-43da-259d-7b08-e5027d00b714', 'en', 'Peniel, his confidant'),
('6fb9fd16-5dac-d752-251e-aaac9ded3ad6', 'de', 'Abimelech, der Erstgeborene'),
('6fb9fd16-5dac-d752-251e-aaac9ded3ad6', 'en', 'Abimelech, the firstborn'),
('5774c4f4-8a1f-2bf6-68e6-16b2febf0bad', 'de', 'Jotam, der jüngste, der dem Tod entkam'),
('5774c4f4-8a1f-2bf6-68e6-16b2febf0bad', 'en', 'Jotham, the youngest, who escaped death'),
('828bdbca-f93a-a32b-45d0-ae650fb1be01', 'de', 'Joasch, sein Vater'),
('828bdbca-f93a-a32b-45d0-ae650fb1be01', 'en', 'Joash, his father')
insert into public.answer_option_translations (option_id, lang, text) values
('ebdebc2c-2700-a37a-b983-8cd15afc0e9a', 'de', 'Sie wusch damit Simons Hände'),
('ebdebc2c-2700-a37a-b983-8cd15afc0e9a', 'en', 'She washed Simon''s hands with them'),
('9f4754e1-48e2-9ee0-9bbc-9d41c135504c', 'de', 'Sie benetzte damit seine Füße und trocknete sie mit ihrem Haar'),
('9f4754e1-48e2-9ee0-9bbc-9d41c135504c', 'en', 'She wet his feet with them and dried them with her hair'),
('b91845cb-af3c-c625-4e75-1ec4cdf31b64', 'de', 'Sie weinte über das vergossene Salböl'),
('b91845cb-af3c-c625-4e75-1ec4cdf31b64', 'en', 'She wept over the spilled ointment'),
('92d81094-d6d2-dabe-c666-9929f6fde0b0', 'de', 'Sie netzte den Boden des Hauses'),
('92d81094-d6d2-dabe-c666-9929f6fde0b0', 'en', 'She wet the floor of the house'),
('ba670a71-4689-d747-9049-dbf48a475214', 'de', 'Einen hellen Stern am Himmel'),
('ba670a71-4689-d747-9049-dbf48a475214', 'en', 'A bright star in the sky'),
('ee1488c5-bd3e-42e5-a39a-27cf2c3bc6eb', 'de', 'Den Regenbogen in den Wolken'),
('ee1488c5-bd3e-42e5-a39a-27cf2c3bc6eb', 'en', 'The rainbow in the clouds'),
('19909b50-c553-785c-31a6-7d7c357c3991', 'de', 'Eine Säule aus Wolken'),
('19909b50-c553-785c-31a6-7d7c357c3991', 'en', 'A pillar of cloud'),
('7f4f806d-d16a-d0a1-aec2-8eeb136ed094', 'de', 'Ein Feuer auf dem Berg'),
('7f4f806d-d16a-d0a1-aec2-8eeb136ed094', 'en', 'A fire on the mountain'),
('9d4feffe-5342-0824-7e55-bd8cb7eb7c5a', 'de', 'Ihre Felder wurden geraubt'),
('9d4feffe-5342-0824-7e55-bd8cb7eb7c5a', 'en', 'Her fields were plundered'),
('55646884-87bb-dded-4c4e-d139031174a0', 'de', 'Sie wurde aus dem Dorf vertrieben'),
('55646884-87bb-dded-4c4e-d139031174a0', 'en', 'She was driven from the village'),
('ba348410-10f1-874c-59eb-96a6771d5a45', 'de', 'Ihr Haus brannte nieder'),
('ba348410-10f1-874c-59eb-96a6771d5a45', 'en', 'Her house burned down'),
('2fe09a1c-896b-0b21-5cb4-8385e6b1003e', 'de', 'Ihr Mann und ihre beiden Söhne starben'),
('2fe09a1c-896b-0b21-5cb4-8385e6b1003e', 'en', 'Her husband and both her sons died'),
('3aa74623-8c30-7379-1567-cb5218902365', 'de', 'Ein Erdbeben erschütterte das Haus'),
('3aa74623-8c30-7379-1567-cb5218902365', 'en', 'An earthquake shook the house'),
('06f03f03-7a19-7a9c-4cbd-dee190f283b5', 'de', 'Der Heilige Geist fiel auf alle, die das Wort hörten'),
('06f03f03-7a19-7a9c-4cbd-dee190f283b5', 'en', 'The Holy Spirit fell on all who heard the word'),
('f95e43d6-cde4-6543-045c-cf1934af94c3', 'de', 'Ein Engel erschien in der Tür'),
('f95e43d6-cde4-6543-045c-cf1934af94c3', 'en', 'An angel appeared in the doorway'),
('b293829c-7ff7-2f7c-a864-1820590a9d25', 'de', 'Die Sonne verfinsterte sich'),
('b293829c-7ff7-2f7c-a864-1820590a9d25', 'en', 'The sun was darkened'),
('04bcd21e-af8c-2817-f9c0-08189f2c6115', 'de', 'Wer sie ansah, wurde von den Schlangenbissen geheilt'),
('04bcd21e-af8c-2817-f9c0-08189f2c6115', 'en', 'Whoever looked at it was healed of the snakebites'),
('da667535-10c9-80e4-5592-f5605d69bbc6', 'de', 'Sie wies dem Volk den Weg durch die Wüste'),
('da667535-10c9-80e4-5592-f5605d69bbc6', 'en', 'It showed the people the way through the wilderness'),
('aa428467-1814-7b23-9323-2e156f9ef628', 'de', 'Sie spendete Wasser für das Volk'),
('aa428467-1814-7b23-9323-2e156f9ef628', 'en', 'It provided water for the people'),
('e330f89b-5f7d-28a5-3e70-b5fb6144264a', 'de', 'Sie vertrieb die Feinde aus dem Lager'),
('e330f89b-5f7d-28a5-3e70-b5fb6144264a', 'en', 'It drove the enemies from the camp'),
('ddf95899-c032-38b1-15c0-3cdb1a9de93c', 'de', 'Er fiel in tiefen Schlaf'),
('ddf95899-c032-38b1-15c0-3cdb1a9de93c', 'en', 'He fell into a deep sleep'),
('47071790-bc20-a762-19c5-ef5036f0ab9b', 'de', 'Er wurde unsichtbar'),
('47071790-bc20-a762-19c5-ef5036f0ab9b', 'en', 'He became invisible'),
('39b2e3c1-eaf1-80bb-79e5-a57291bf3a5a', 'de', 'Er verlor seine Stimme'),
('39b2e3c1-eaf1-80bb-79e5-a57291bf3a5a', 'en', 'He lost his voice'),
('0dd28cf0-9c05-ecb0-849b-5cbdde987923', 'de', 'Der Geist Gottes kam über ihn und er weissagte mit'),
('0dd28cf0-9c05-ecb0-849b-5cbdde987923', 'en', 'The Spirit of God came on him and he prophesied too'),
('62eafc52-0a6f-f29f-e456-dcc51d35dd25', 'de', 'Er ist stark und vollkommen'),
('62eafc52-0a6f-f29f-e456-dcc51d35dd25', 'en', 'It is strong and complete'),
('2f38ce0f-1982-7c9a-b4ba-ea2c1aecfdb8', 'de', 'Er ist tot und nutzlos'),
('2f38ce0f-1982-7c9a-b4ba-ea2c1aecfdb8', 'en', 'It is dead and useless'),
('58b56e29-e123-d59b-7dd2-d5e9c9c511dc', 'de', 'Er ist ein verborgener Schatz'),
('58b56e29-e123-d59b-7dd2-d5e9c9c511dc', 'en', 'It is a hidden treasure'),
('1f89661c-07e3-1ffe-a01f-57ea4a517b04', 'de', 'Er ist wie ein Senfkorn'),
('1f89661c-07e3-1ffe-a01f-57ea4a517b04', 'en', 'It is like a mustard seed'),
('60c7416d-acab-fb28-aebf-93af8ac8fc12', 'de', 'Sie verbrannten sie öffentlich'),
('60c7416d-acab-fb28-aebf-93af8ac8fc12', 'en', 'They burned them publicly'),
('cdffb769-d2d8-4cf9-e27c-69615e5c65cd', 'de', 'Sie versteckten sie im Tempel'),
('cdffb769-d2d8-4cf9-e27c-69615e5c65cd', 'en', 'They hid them in the temple'),
('d954c710-2bb1-36ba-488d-f80dfb41b9c6', 'de', 'Sie verkauften sie an die Heiden'),
('d954c710-2bb1-36ba-488d-f80dfb41b9c6', 'en', 'They sold them to the Gentiles'),
('ca1ede64-054e-63d3-1423-0cc759f5aca3', 'de', 'Sie übergaben sie den Priestern'),
('ca1ede64-054e-63d3-1423-0cc759f5aca3', 'en', 'They gave them to the priests'),
('9be74a95-1cd2-fd95-31ff-8c8471f73771', 'de', 'Es lebe der Tempel'),
('9be74a95-1cd2-fd95-31ff-8c8471f73771', 'en', 'Long live the temple'),
('ac9a06b2-10f4-34e8-0553-fd5f49eb498e', 'de', 'Heil dem Kaiser von Rom'),
('ac9a06b2-10f4-34e8-0553-fd5f49eb498e', 'en', 'Hail to the Caesar of Rome'),
('5931f80b-4fed-0fc0-da63-f4bd260581a1', 'de', 'Groß ist die Artemis der Epheser'),
('5931f80b-4fed-0fc0-da63-f4bd260581a1', 'en', 'Great is Artemis of the Ephesians'),
('59bd95f0-4c22-21df-5c1a-f71ed4c04a5e', 'de', 'Tod den Christen'),
('59bd95f0-4c22-21df-5c1a-f71ed4c04a5e', 'en', 'Death to the Christians'),
('51961dd9-8fc8-1c64-a2db-0751be89ab41', 'de', 'Der HERR selbst war ihr Erbe'),
('51961dd9-8fc8-1c64-a2db-0751be89ab41', 'en', 'The LORD himself was their inheritance'),
('d37c86db-b0c5-52c8-8e67-7f12bd15a104', 'de', 'Die Weinberge der Stämme'),
('d37c86db-b0c5-52c8-8e67-7f12bd15a104', 'en', 'The vineyards of the tribes'),
('0d4551b4-722c-91cc-dc24-7a29e44f9de1', 'de', 'Ein Zehntel aller Beute'),
('0d4551b4-722c-91cc-dc24-7a29e44f9de1', 'en', 'A tenth of all spoil'),
('e1ed3b41-6c82-b7d2-738d-a4f2e7e40cfb', 'de', 'Die Hauptstadt des Landes'),
('e1ed3b41-6c82-b7d2-738d-a4f2e7e40cfb', 'en', 'The capital of the land'),
('5d7e2a12-dd71-fd88-48b5-3d1b709289fb', 'de', 'Der Wein stillt allen Streit'),
('5d7e2a12-dd71-fd88-48b5-3d1b709289fb', 'en', 'Wine settles all strife'),
('ec511f3a-abb4-b75a-a2cd-9f59fef70c29', 'de', 'Der Wein macht zum Spötter, der Rauschtrank macht wild'),
('ec511f3a-abb4-b75a-a2cd-9f59fef70c29', 'en', 'Wine is a mocker, strong drink is a brawler'),
('6398d488-0377-b366-7422-d303a19a6fb2', 'de', 'Der Wein mehrt die Erkenntnis'),
('6398d488-0377-b366-7422-d303a19a6fb2', 'en', 'Wine increases knowledge'),
('7c1f8323-3e0b-6e04-e159-6b66994c017e', 'de', 'Der Wein schenkt dem Weisen die Ehre'),
('7c1f8323-3e0b-6e04-e159-6b66994c017e', 'en', 'Wine grants honor to the wise'),
('8dae7372-7cc1-2a92-377b-6a1ed3d19005', 'de', 'Wo warst du, als ich die Erde gründete?'),
('8dae7372-7cc1-2a92-377b-6a1ed3d19005', 'en', 'Where were you when I laid the earth''s foundations?'),
('85d0d2a7-ef7f-e6b7-1073-77d68fab56c8', 'de', 'Wer hat dir deinen Reichtum gegeben?'),
('85d0d2a7-ef7f-e6b7-1073-77d68fab56c8', 'en', 'Who gave you your wealth?'),
('fc10f814-155c-7345-73fa-831c38b17e60', 'de', 'Wann wirst du deine Sünde bekennen?'),
('fc10f814-155c-7345-73fa-831c38b17e60', 'en', 'When will you confess your sin?'),
('2b350ac9-aecf-61ac-16e8-d4f8026da418', 'de', 'Warum hast du an mir gezweifelt?'),
('2b350ac9-aecf-61ac-16e8-d4f8026da418', 'en', 'Why did you doubt me?'),
('56c53795-5b9a-e4bd-634f-c5565ea0e54f', 'de', 'Er wollte einen neuen Altar in Hebron errichten'),
('56c53795-5b9a-e4bd-634f-c5565ea0e54f', 'en', 'He wanted to erect a new altar in Hebron'),
('7883b99e-b23a-1a7f-ccdb-af2d04f43227', 'de', 'Er wollte ein großes Opferfest ausrichten'),
('7883b99e-b23a-1a7f-ccdb-af2d04f43227', 'en', 'He wanted to hold a great sacrificial feast'),
('e948ea13-f78b-af8a-cdac-30dc25151ebe', 'de', 'Er wollte dem Herrn ein Haus aus Zedern bauen'),
('e948ea13-f78b-af8a-cdac-30dc25151ebe', 'en', 'He wanted to build the Lord a house of cedar'),
('e279478c-6ec0-6063-c48a-ab27f7715084', 'de', 'Er wollte die Lade nach Gibeon zurückbringen'),
('e279478c-6ec0-6063-c48a-ab27f7715084', 'en', 'He wanted to return the ark to Gibeon'),
('40c6932a-4bb7-9c58-1054-7b8af3b2c71b', 'de', 'Man solle ihn drei Tage fasten lassen'),
('40c6932a-4bb7-9c58-1054-7b8af3b2c71b', 'en', 'He should be made to fast three days'),
('5de25410-9b84-868b-8e00-a050fe3a22fa', 'de', 'Man solle ihm die Augen verbinden'),
('5de25410-9b84-868b-8e00-a050fe3a22fa', 'en', 'He should be blindfolded'),
('d61ecd1f-73bc-e6a7-4681-c45a5699639f', 'de', 'Man solle ihm einen Ring abnehmen'),
('d61ecd1f-73bc-e6a7-4681-c45a5699639f', 'en', 'A ring should be taken from him'),
('76a354ac-40c9-b5e8-683c-eb9ede5eeb39', 'de', 'Man solle ihn mit sieben frischen Seilen binden'),
('76a354ac-40c9-b5e8-683c-eb9ede5eeb39', 'en', 'He should be bound with seven fresh cords'),
('520062ac-dd5e-b093-1e40-9432d4eb3be9', 'de', 'Singet dem Herrn ein neues Lied'),
('520062ac-dd5e-b093-1e40-9432d4eb3be9', 'en', 'Sing to the Lord a new song'),
('dbe6c3bb-6faf-ba2b-e342-f478fcf23105', 'de', 'Höret, ihr Himmel, und merke auf, du Erde'),
('dbe6c3bb-6faf-ba2b-e342-f478fcf23105', 'en', 'Hear, O heavens, and give ear, O earth'),
('2c192957-4573-69af-e940-a7a7bcb39f9f', 'de', 'Auf, werde licht, denn dein Licht kommt'),
('2c192957-4573-69af-e940-a7a7bcb39f9f', 'en', 'Arise, shine, for your light has come'),
('b1bbf49d-1848-3abd-3be6-20a61c9472e5', 'de', 'Tröstet, tröstet mein Volk, spricht euer Gott'),
('b1bbf49d-1848-3abd-3be6-20a61c9472e5', 'en', 'Comfort, comfort my people, says your God'),
('26beb0ed-7a4c-62d7-960b-162b9658355b', 'de', 'Seinen Sohn Isaak als Opfer darzubringen'),
('26beb0ed-7a4c-62d7-960b-162b9658355b', 'en', 'To offer up his son Isaac as a sacrifice'),
('853aa553-81e5-9aaf-170a-2c2697e9d1a4', 'de', 'Einen Altar in Ägypten zu bauen'),
('853aa553-81e5-9aaf-170a-2c2697e9d1a4', 'en', 'To build an altar in Egypt'),
('30343392-2162-e870-c05f-8bbce6d6cc58', 'de', 'Sein ganzes Vieh zu verschenken'),
('30343392-2162-e870-c05f-8bbce6d6cc58', 'en', 'To give away all his livestock'),
('79291b48-4a4c-b12f-2597-e457ba456db2', 'de', 'Vierzig Tage zu fasten'),
('79291b48-4a4c-b12f-2597-e457ba456db2', 'en', 'To fast for forty days'),
('be0b570d-30c8-eda6-2931-3d66a555828b', 'de', 'Er lachte ihn aus'),
('be0b570d-30c8-eda6-2931-3d66a555828b', 'en', 'He laughed at him'),
('d1343b04-e1c6-4e34-5aba-336977bd3651', 'de', 'Er weinte und bekannte, David sei gerechter als er'),
('d1343b04-e1c6-4e34-5aba-336977bd3651', 'en', 'He wept and confessed David was more righteous than he'),
('03439a7b-904c-1926-cd4c-1f22ddd0b4e2', 'de', 'Er warf erneut den Speer'),
('03439a7b-904c-1926-cd4c-1f22ddd0b4e2', 'en', 'He hurled his spear again'),
('0e0f403d-473c-b988-0196-e51269fdef42', 'de', 'Er befahl seine sofortige Verhaftung'),
('0e0f403d-473c-b988-0196-e51269fdef42', 'en', 'He ordered his immediate arrest'),
('9abaf515-26cc-a3a7-aa34-9523e311bf50', 'de', 'Manasse, Ephraim und Levi'),
('9abaf515-26cc-a3a7-aa34-9523e311bf50', 'en', 'Manasseh, Ephraim and Levi'),
('a55a0176-158d-938f-0ec6-d3a7c60104c1', 'de', 'Saul, David und Salomo'),
('a55a0176-158d-938f-0ec6-d3a7c60104c1', 'en', 'Saul, David and Solomon'),
('032923f7-f134-c5c7-9053-4af13081d1f3', 'de', 'Isaak, Jakob und Esau'),
('032923f7-f134-c5c7-9053-4af13081d1f3', 'en', 'Isaac, Jacob and Esau'),
('6d03bf98-a866-e539-3ef4-ec0cda49152b', 'de', 'Jesreel, Lo-Ruhama und Lo-Ammi'),
('6d03bf98-a866-e539-3ef4-ec0cda49152b', 'en', 'Jezreel, Lo-Ruhamah and Lo-Ammi'),
('a8abccb9-7909-28dc-bac6-9f7e7fb34847', 'de', 'Bekleidung mit weißen Kleidern'),
('a8abccb9-7909-28dc-bac6-9f7e7fb34847', 'en', 'Clothing in white garments'),
('0d67c304-ee2a-5fc4-867d-b360448745fe', 'de', 'Macht über die Völker mit eisernem Stab'),
('0d67c304-ee2a-5fc4-867d-b360448745fe', 'en', 'Power over the nations with an iron rod'),
('caf2a54d-1a01-e5ce-d4f1-c40410da5cdc', 'de', 'Verborgenes Manna und einen weißen Stein'),
('caf2a54d-1a01-e5ce-d4f1-c40410da5cdc', 'en', 'Hidden manna and a white stone'),
('baeb609d-6e76-6e28-82a7-afbcfde17988', 'de', 'Zu essen vom Baum des Lebens im Paradies Gottes'),
('baeb609d-6e76-6e28-82a7-afbcfde17988', 'en', 'To eat from the tree of life in the paradise of God'),
('4156a7d8-c522-526e-66eb-3c3abbdbd269', 'de', 'Aus Neid, weil er sich über alle auszeichnete'),
('4156a7d8-c522-526e-66eb-3c3abbdbd269', 'en', 'Out of envy, because he distinguished himself above all'),
('f0d3e807-9328-585c-6ef5-f550e87a31cc', 'de', 'Weil er den König betrogen hatte'),
('f0d3e807-9328-585c-6ef5-f550e87a31cc', 'en', 'Because he had cheated the king'),
('1dfc83b7-e3ce-aa5f-b9fe-90907a836bcd', 'de', 'Weil er Steuern unterschlug'),
('1dfc83b7-e3ce-aa5f-b9fe-90907a836bcd', 'en', 'Because he embezzled taxes'),
('eb6fe839-1dc2-e214-ed44-5d91c88fe612', 'de', 'Weil er den Götzen opferte'),
('eb6fe839-1dc2-e214-ed44-5d91c88fe612', 'en', 'Because he sacrificed to idols'),
('5ff4af8a-f101-3474-f711-92c49062994f', 'de', 'Es ist sanft wie der Tau am Morgen'),
('5ff4af8a-f101-3474-f711-92c49062994f', 'en', 'It is gentle like the morning dew'),
('525b9289-b7f3-70ba-68d5-2856bf8bd58b', 'de', 'Es ist starr und unveränderlich wie Stein'),
('525b9289-b7f3-70ba-68d5-2856bf8bd58b', 'en', 'It is rigid and unchanging like stone'),
('4ffb5256-8216-63a4-f578-484f1854eebc', 'de', 'Es ist lebendig und schärfer als ein Schwert'),
('4ffb5256-8216-63a4-f578-484f1854eebc', 'en', 'It is living and sharper than a sword'),
