('52d549d7-dede-f502-930e-a0c8bfb43d92', 'de', 'Sie ist eine Quelle des Segens'),
('52d549d7-dede-f502-930e-a0c8bfb43d92', 'en', 'It is a source of blessing'),
('275a817e-8334-ffdd-c8bc-2027a97cb22c', 'de', 'Sofortige Vernichtung durch Feuer'),
('275a817e-8334-ffdd-c8bc-2027a97cb22c', 'en', 'Immediate destruction by fire'),
('2cda6b00-e90e-40d6-207c-7012c4278ecf', 'de', 'Krankheit, Niederlage und Zerstreuung unter die Völker'),
('2cda6b00-e90e-40d6-207c-7012c4278ecf', 'en', 'Disease, defeat and scattering among the nations'),
('f6a276a7-4ba8-7e5c-b59f-8735f076b55f', 'de', 'Die Wegnahme der Stiftshütte'),
('f6a276a7-4ba8-7e5c-b59f-8735f076b55f', 'en', 'The removal of the tabernacle'),
('afa8294d-a26d-dabd-d302-f5477d5306b1', 'de', 'Verlust des Mannas allein'),
('afa8294d-a26d-dabd-d302-f5477d5306b1', 'en', 'Loss of the manna alone'),
('da022b05-ef79-0eaa-33bd-89ba46bc4a41', 'de', 'Maulwurf, Maus und Eidechse und ähnliches Gewimmel'),
('da022b05-ef79-0eaa-33bd-89ba46bc4a41', 'en', 'The mole, mouse, lizard and such swarming things'),
('14ecb758-13ac-ab24-8c74-5f5404504771', 'de', 'Rind, Schaf und Ziege'),
('14ecb758-13ac-ab24-8c74-5f5404504771', 'en', 'Cattle, sheep and goat'),
('e17dad5b-a26b-3ebd-aa45-b270a44e2615', 'de', 'Taube, Turteltaube und Sperling'),
('e17dad5b-a26b-3ebd-aa45-b270a44e2615', 'en', 'Dove, turtledove and sparrow'),
('3539ca23-4fc5-4146-d221-20f16082733c', 'de', 'Heuschrecke und Grille allein'),
('3539ca23-4fc5-4146-d221-20f16082733c', 'en', 'Locust and cricket alone'),
('b3511a38-4cc4-eef4-3e6e-43836eef6250', 'de', 'Er gebot dem Trauerzug zu warten'),
('b3511a38-4cc4-eef4-3e6e-43836eef6250', 'en', 'He commanded the procession to wait'),
('a6529bcb-0ccd-1b3a-3ede-9ad4b3d0cfd4', 'de', 'Er ließ ihn von den Jüngern tragen'),
('a6529bcb-0ccd-1b3a-3ede-9ad4b3d0cfd4', 'en', 'He had the disciples carry him'),
('71c815cd-6f7c-d083-cbdc-ea5e68c2ab87', 'de', 'Er salbte ihn und legte ihn ins Grab'),
('71c815cd-6f7c-d083-cbdc-ea5e68c2ab87', 'en', 'He anointed him and laid him in the grave'),
('7e93c7d9-7110-d19f-b479-45bba8eef9ac', 'de', 'Er sprach, Jüngling, ich sage dir, steh auf, und der Tote richtete sich auf'),
('7e93c7d9-7110-d19f-b479-45bba8eef9ac', 'en', 'He said, young man, arise, and the dead man sat up'),
('0036e6d9-be10-5e2e-94c6-5734a49d5271', 'de', 'Er wartete auf Recht, siehe, da war Schlechtigkeit'),
('0036e6d9-be10-5e2e-94c6-5734a49d5271', 'en', 'He looked for justice, but behold, there was bloodshed'),
('ce271867-311a-2424-9a76-ecb3a655710c', 'de', 'Er wartete auf Frucht, siehe, da war Überfluss'),
('ce271867-311a-2424-9a76-ecb3a655710c', 'en', 'He looked for fruit, but behold, there was abundance'),
('64f69b18-0d30-4d0c-4ee8-d861a8a2e75e', 'de', 'Er wartete auf Wein, siehe, da war Honig'),
('64f69b18-0d30-4d0c-4ee8-d861a8a2e75e', 'en', 'He looked for wine, but behold, there was honey'),
('a89572c7-42c6-7b5d-0a3c-67a00461dc91', 'de', 'Er wartete auf Ernte, siehe, da war Segen'),
('a89572c7-42c6-7b5d-0a3c-67a00461dc91', 'en', 'He looked for harvest, but behold, there was blessing'),
('698e5cd0-a7a4-f6be-4de9-ee2f53eae541', 'de', 'Steig sofort herab, du gehörst nicht hierher'),
('698e5cd0-a7a4-f6be-4de9-ee2f53eae541', 'en', 'Get down at once, you do not belong here'),
('d2bfe4e4-e2b9-8ef5-33fe-844123c081a3', 'de', 'Folge mir nach Jerusalem'),
('d2bfe4e4-e2b9-8ef5-33fe-844123c081a3', 'en', 'Follow me to Jerusalem'),
('e9d9929f-57d9-78f5-5ffb-e94470caa1ca', 'de', 'Komm schnell herab, heute muss ich in deinem Haus bleiben'),
('e9d9929f-57d9-78f5-5ffb-e94470caa1ca', 'en', 'Come down quickly, today I must stay at your house'),
('75a69422-15b9-b539-689d-8f7cafa8c2f8', 'de', 'Bleib oben und höre meiner Predigt zu'),
('75a69422-15b9-b539-689d-8f7cafa8c2f8', 'en', 'Stay up there and listen to my sermon'),
('6dde3b14-6d78-f274-cb71-908893ab10ba', 'de', 'Er weihte es einem fremden Gott'),
('6dde3b14-6d78-f274-cb71-908893ab10ba', 'en', 'He dedicated it to a foreign god'),
('8cb34098-5765-23e0-4a37-39a69ddee737', 'de', 'Er ließ es unversehrt stehen'),
('8cb34098-5765-23e0-4a37-39a69ddee737', 'en', 'He left it unharmed'),
('c5732866-6bf5-2455-bce7-4c7065edb4cd', 'de', 'Er verbrannte das Haus des HERRN'),
('c5732866-6bf5-2455-bce7-4c7065edb4cd', 'en', 'He burned the house of the LORD'),
('7ea0d3b7-2bc7-c62b-0cfc-3743a6200a53', 'de', 'Er baute es größer wieder auf'),
('7ea0d3b7-2bc7-c62b-0cfc-3743a6200a53', 'en', 'He rebuilt it larger'),
('4b89a528-c155-b9a5-4689-b1cae1cdfcb0', 'de', 'Gedenke des Sabbattages, dass du ihn heiligst'),
('4b89a528-c155-b9a5-4689-b1cae1cdfcb0', 'en', 'Remember the Sabbath day, to keep it holy'),
('ce218e6b-c955-5dff-f046-2ac6b6b5926f', 'de', 'Du sollst nicht begehren deines Nächsten Haus'),
('ce218e6b-c955-5dff-f046-2ac6b6b5926f', 'en', 'You shall not covet your neighbor''s house'),
('48c2884b-d218-fd50-1396-afb867792d28', 'de', 'Du sollst nicht falsch Zeugnis reden'),
('48c2884b-d218-fd50-1396-afb867792d28', 'en', 'You shall not bear false witness'),
('91c4abb4-6f7e-de8d-6c20-7dfec86c949b', 'de', 'Du sollst deinen Vater und deine Mutter ehren'),
('91c4abb4-6f7e-de8d-6c20-7dfec86c949b', 'en', 'You shall honor your father and mother'),
('b70b3de3-22e3-bf35-409b-c516c943a55a', 'de', 'Hur'),
('b70b3de3-22e3-bf35-409b-c516c943a55a', 'en', 'Hur'),
('3088eb96-48a5-f335-79c0-254e80121dab', 'de', 'Bezalel'),
('3088eb96-48a5-f335-79c0-254e80121dab', 'en', 'Bezalel'),
('3fa98722-d2b9-fb1b-8d9c-1e2e0a9ff950', 'de', 'Itamar'),
('3fa98722-d2b9-fb1b-8d9c-1e2e0a9ff950', 'en', 'Ithamar'),
('6fc2179c-06e5-70b3-7c14-e4cd9c75a8fe', 'de', 'Josua'),
('6fc2179c-06e5-70b3-7c14-e4cd9c75a8fe', 'en', 'Joshua'),
('e1d9b5c7-bce7-b913-3847-5f27fba825c9', 'de', 'Mit Danken und mit Loben'),
('e1d9b5c7-bce7-b913-3847-5f27fba825c9', 'en', 'With thanksgiving and with praise'),
('48c85e92-45d0-4e85-2c6b-bee7a61af13e', 'de', 'Mit Furcht und mit Zittern'),
('48c85e92-45d0-4e85-2c6b-bee7a61af13e', 'en', 'With fear and with trembling'),
('34b7d0f6-7e2e-5876-4315-73a54a9d5ee0', 'de', 'Mit Schwert und mit Schild'),
('34b7d0f6-7e2e-5876-4315-73a54a9d5ee0', 'en', 'With sword and with shield'),
('53f52320-4693-1e54-0949-091947855b38', 'de', 'Mit Gold und mit Weihrauch'),
('53f52320-4693-1e54-0949-091947855b38', 'en', 'With gold and with incense'),
('e4662c42-c443-cc5f-d202-f8c5599edae8', 'de', 'Du bist der Christus'),
('e4662c42-c443-cc5f-d202-f8c5599edae8', 'en', 'You are the Christ'),
('5796a974-1f15-213e-19a0-462dabb3a395', 'de', 'Du bist ein Prophet aus Galiläa'),
('5796a974-1f15-213e-19a0-462dabb3a395', 'en', 'You are a prophet from Galilee'),
('e01270c0-2009-1bea-9154-6d2a6ba23e38', 'de', 'Du bist Johannes der Täufer'),
('e01270c0-2009-1bea-9154-6d2a6ba23e38', 'en', 'You are John the Baptist'),
('1f0dabd6-79a6-6da1-4fd8-deec6e8b9f2f', 'de', 'Du bist Elia, der wiederkam'),
('1f0dabd6-79a6-6da1-4fd8-deec6e8b9f2f', 'en', 'You are Elijah returned'),
('5b84a5f0-3358-2221-34a9-0e9657142ee5', 'de', 'Eine fremde Königin werde Hilfe bringen'),
('5b84a5f0-3358-2221-34a9-0e9657142ee5', 'en', 'A foreign queen would bring relief'),
('b9748144-2062-b723-4fa7-80a0ac4ad08a', 'de', 'Feuer werde die Belagerer verzehren'),
('b9748144-2062-b723-4fa7-80a0ac4ad08a', 'en', 'Fire would consume the besiegers'),
('156abf57-d372-f970-a9a8-411fd0326973', 'de', 'Morgen werde Mehl im Tor billig verkauft'),
('156abf57-d372-f970-a9a8-411fd0326973', 'en', 'Tomorrow flour would sell cheaply in the gate'),
('d8520384-67c6-717e-efd9-c4b6a3e42ea3', 'de', 'Der König werde ermordet werden'),
('d8520384-67c6-717e-efd9-c4b6a3e42ea3', 'en', 'The king would be assassinated'),
('68477f41-d092-df6f-9a92-6370c1666b15', 'de', 'Er rief die Ältesten herbei'),
('68477f41-d092-df6f-9a92-6370c1666b15', 'en', 'He summoned the elders'),
('1a57b7d5-1bd2-1150-098c-df37ae5c4482', 'de', 'Er betete eine Stunde im Stillen'),
('1a57b7d5-1bd2-1150-098c-df37ae5c4482', 'en', 'He prayed for an hour in silence'),
('3579771b-2d57-98ae-7cce-b7eb7d066070', 'de', 'Er trieb die weinende Menge hinaus'),
('3579771b-2d57-98ae-7cce-b7eb7d066070', 'en', 'He put the weeping crowd outside'),
('c6274081-076c-051a-d733-3f4698fe671c', 'de', 'Er salbte sie mit Öl'),
('c6274081-076c-051a-d733-3f4698fe671c', 'en', 'He anointed her with oil'),
('aaa2ae0a-9d68-2983-3127-8204a8ac5897', 'de', 'Er sprang hinein und holte es herauf'),
('aaa2ae0a-9d68-2983-3127-8204a8ac5897', 'en', 'He dove in and brought it up'),
('656f9109-0c8b-4556-9541-a8026c678184', 'de', 'Er warf ein Holz an die Stelle, und es schwamm'),
('656f9109-0c8b-4556-9541-a8026c678184', 'en', 'He threw a stick at the spot, and it floated'),
('1f87438d-f225-b26b-1386-f933962c7960', 'de', 'Er befahl dem Fluss, es zurückzugeben'),
('1f87438d-f225-b26b-1386-f933962c7960', 'en', 'He commanded the river to return it'),
('9bc0e6cd-00f6-d6fd-1eb7-09f3b7b701d1', 'de', 'Er sprach, und das Wasser wich zurück'),
('9bc0e6cd-00f6-d6fd-1eb7-09f3b7b701d1', 'en', 'He spoke, and the water drew back'),
('6655c940-641f-3c6c-5ee2-76d9a344c94b', 'de', 'Sie sollten umkehren und sogleich geheilt werden'),
('6655c940-641f-3c6c-5ee2-76d9a344c94b', 'en', 'They would repent and at once be healed'),
('e590189a-f94a-4d39-689d-43b9dc67b602', 'de', 'Sie sollten jubeln und den Herrn von Herzen loben'),
('e590189a-f94a-4d39-689d-43b9dc67b602', 'en', 'They would rejoice and praise the Lord sincerely'),
('503e294c-4e80-ec46-cb96-541ce9f6184b', 'de', 'Sie sollten erschrecken und in die Berge fliehen'),
('503e294c-4e80-ec46-cb96-541ce9f6184b', 'en', 'They would be terrified and flee to the mountains'),
('1f554e5f-9679-06d4-efb5-a440ac25c461', 'de', 'Sie sollten hören und doch nicht verstehen, sehen und doch nicht erkennen'),
('1f554e5f-9679-06d4-efb5-a440ac25c461', 'en', 'They would hear yet not understand, see yet not perceive'),
('538c7dcd-ea42-6db6-c22b-8b059c4428df', 'de', 'Mit dem Öl der Salbung'),
('538c7dcd-ea42-6db6-c22b-8b059c4428df', 'en', 'With the oil of anointing'),
('85e939db-7612-5a1a-1752-5ccbc4dcdda5', 'de', 'Mit der Asche des Opfers'),
('85e939db-7612-5a1a-1752-5ccbc4dcdda5', 'en', 'With the ashes of the offering'),
('602b3f17-5e83-1ce3-f9a6-916e6b672815', 'de', 'Mit dem Blut des Lammes'),
('602b3f17-5e83-1ce3-f9a6-916e6b672815', 'en', 'With the blood of the lamb'),
('1be2a721-9a41-a314-8c3e-b4b0bb45c916', 'de', 'Mit dem Saft der Trauben'),
('1be2a721-9a41-a314-8c3e-b4b0bb45c916', 'en', 'With the juice of grapes'),
('9b91d9f1-db8f-d275-16ee-b615da8e15d6', 'de', 'Sie werden Kinder Gottes heißen'),
('9b91d9f1-db8f-d275-16ee-b615da8e15d6', 'en', 'They shall be called children of God'),
('5e3c1cc2-3e08-12c0-6f26-4cbdbed45db7', 'de', 'Sie werden das Erdreich besitzen'),
('5e3c1cc2-3e08-12c0-6f26-4cbdbed45db7', 'en', 'They shall inherit the earth'),
('ab700540-8594-236b-8546-7c2591b9b0b6', 'de', 'Sie werden gesättigt werden'),
('ab700540-8594-236b-8546-7c2591b9b0b6', 'en', 'They shall be filled'),
('929d674b-50fc-c46e-aa44-df9d232a9f9f', 'de', 'Sie werden Gott schauen'),
('929d674b-50fc-c46e-aa44-df9d232a9f9f', 'en', 'They shall see God'),
('b579c70e-86b8-bf27-ff8f-1c16829256df', 'de', 'Er sprach prophetische Worte'),
('b579c70e-86b8-bf27-ff8f-1c16829256df', 'en', 'He spoke prophetic words'),
('d1c6630b-9b6e-99ad-4ba0-ed66b5d7fc39', 'de', 'Er verschwand spurlos im Grab'),
('d1c6630b-9b6e-99ad-4ba0-ed66b5d7fc39', 'en', 'He vanished without a trace in the grave'),
('e4a02671-ad7a-5702-6290-abfe42967b78', 'de', 'Er wurde lebendig und stand auf seine Füße'),
('e4a02671-ad7a-5702-6290-abfe42967b78', 'en', 'He came to life and stood on his feet'),
('e5742ae9-1ef5-a22a-4206-dafef70e6081', 'de', 'Er wurde zu Staub'),
('e5742ae9-1ef5-a22a-4206-dafef70e6081', 'en', 'He turned to dust'),
('7bbae816-4517-d31d-e135-f53c8e21eaa5', 'de', 'Ein heller Stern über einem Stall'),
('7bbae816-4517-d31d-e135-f53c8e21eaa5', 'en', 'A bright star over a stable'),
('be8efd27-aa49-2c0f-63e2-c440cfbb5f81', 'de', 'Ein Kind, das von Königen umgeben ist'),
('be8efd27-aa49-2c0f-63e2-c440cfbb5f81', 'en', 'A child surrounded by kings'),
('1179b6f1-5563-086e-3d99-29058ed593df', 'de', 'Ein Lamm, das neben dem Kind ruht'),
('1179b6f1-5563-086e-3d99-29058ed593df', 'en', 'A lamb resting beside the child'),
('0922dd02-babf-a298-2759-dccdabe59512', 'de', 'Ein Kind in Windeln gewickelt und in einer Krippe liegend'),
('0922dd02-babf-a298-2759-dccdabe59512', 'en', 'A child wrapped in cloths and lying in a manger'),
('0171e96a-2891-7661-749a-1f99040ecb60', 'de', 'Nur einmal in der Nacht'),
('0171e96a-2891-7661-749a-1f99040ecb60', 'en', 'Only once in the night'),
('eced90c7-147a-099c-0a7a-f13b469a8dfe', 'de', 'Dreimal täglich kniend am offenen Fenster gen Jerusalem'),
('eced90c7-147a-099c-0a7a-f13b469a8dfe', 'en', 'Three times a day kneeling at the open window toward Jerusalem'),
('9caef0bb-269f-40ce-e9a3-c09a8edf6b62', 'de', 'Im Tempel vor allem Volk'),
('9caef0bb-269f-40ce-e9a3-c09a8edf6b62', 'en', 'In the temple before all the people'),
('d17e40cb-3706-db4c-dcd2-eeb06e14e3ef', 'de', 'Heimlich im verschlossenen Keller'),
('d17e40cb-3706-db4c-dcd2-eeb06e14e3ef', 'en', 'Secretly in a locked cellar'),
('edaa5f42-e869-a14a-f843-c6816a9fab9f', 'de', 'Die Liebe'),
('edaa5f42-e869-a14a-f843-c6816a9fab9f', 'en', 'Love'),
('031dfed1-fde1-6a7c-9c93-969c450a9f74', 'de', 'Die Erkenntnis'),
('031dfed1-fde1-6a7c-9c93-969c450a9f74', 'en', 'Knowledge'),
('5b7c8454-ce69-d8f6-01c4-6baf40dbffd7', 'de', 'Die Hoffnung'),
('5b7c8454-ce69-d8f6-01c4-6baf40dbffd7', 'en', 'Hope'),
('2c5f69ab-a5de-8128-8257-38992591b43f', 'de', 'Der Glaube'),
('2c5f69ab-a5de-8128-8257-38992591b43f', 'en', 'Faith'),
('3c9ed494-987b-457f-38ce-02cf1f103a1a', 'de', 'Er forderte das doppelte Geschenk'),
('3c9ed494-987b-457f-38ce-02cf1f103a1a', 'en', 'He demanded double the gift'),
('aaadd07d-c777-dfd4-06e5-149a481631da', 'de', 'Er nahm die Gaben sogleich an und schwieg'),
('aaadd07d-c777-dfd4-06e5-149a481631da', 'en', 'He took the gifts at once and stayed silent'),
('5dcca709-a1d4-9138-1995-089bab28bcdd', 'de', 'Er deutete die Schrift, lehnte aber die Gaben nicht ab'),
('5dcca709-a1d4-9138-1995-089bab28bcdd', 'en', 'He interpreted the writing but did not refuse the gifts outright'),
('25f615f6-2a95-7c30-8cf8-48692d961926', 'de', 'Er floh aus dem Saal'),
('25f615f6-2a95-7c30-8cf8-48692d961926', 'en', 'He fled from the hall'),
('a9d72edb-ec13-c1ae-d514-df125280ae57', 'de', 'Fürchtet euch und kehret um'),
('a9d72edb-ec13-c1ae-d514-df125280ae57', 'en', 'Fear and turn back'),
('db338004-6e4a-e6bd-7097-2504d8688ff7', 'de', 'Ehre sei Gott in der Höhe und Friede auf Erden'),
('db338004-6e4a-e6bd-7097-2504d8688ff7', 'en', 'Glory to God in the highest and peace on earth'),
('bc9c3eda-6864-63b3-4baa-b741c0f54a6b', 'de', 'Folget dem Licht nach Jerusalem'),
('bc9c3eda-6864-63b3-4baa-b741c0f54a6b', 'en', 'Follow the light to Jerusalem'),
('3135e264-2c03-3990-98c2-3cc670e35280', 'de', 'Bringet Opfer im Tempel dar'),
('3135e264-2c03-3990-98c2-3cc670e35280', 'en', 'Bring sacrifices in the temple'),
('caba9521-ac8a-6442-d971-9c08bb8dff47', 'de', 'Löwen werden im Tempel ruhen'),
('caba9521-ac8a-6442-d971-9c08bb8dff47', 'en', 'Lions will rest in the temple'),
('6548d9a6-f54a-302d-0d7c-787e63d71f1e', 'de', 'Die Wüste wird zum Garten'),
('6548d9a6-f54a-302d-0d7c-787e63d71f1e', 'en', 'The desert will become a garden'),
('4810fca9-bfd4-acdb-f49f-89d7697bb2f8', 'de', 'Schwerter werden zu Pflugscharen umgeschmiedet'),
('4810fca9-bfd4-acdb-f49f-89d7697bb2f8', 'en', 'Swords will be beaten into plowshares'),
('a1780376-b1b9-f677-651f-5fd75415ba18', 'de', 'Die Sonne wird nicht mehr untergehen'),
('a1780376-b1b9-f677-651f-5fd75415ba18', 'en', 'The sun will no longer set'),
('49209d83-25fe-762d-e93c-895dcebe7270', 'de', 'Sie war süß wie Honig'),
('49209d83-25fe-762d-e93c-895dcebe7270', 'en', 'It was sweet as honey'),
('3c1df5e5-d70f-3276-d4ea-edef2c6b9534', 'de', 'Sie war bitter wie Galle'),
('3c1df5e5-d70f-3276-d4ea-edef2c6b9534', 'en', 'It was bitter as gall'),
('defda354-a3e1-9001-bbc6-58a09245cbd2', 'de', 'Sie war scharf wie Feuer'),
('defda354-a3e1-9001-bbc6-58a09245cbd2', 'en', 'It was hot as fire'),
('eb78d5b2-1857-83f2-82a1-08865a2204d8', 'de', 'Sie war ohne jeden Geschmack'),
('eb78d5b2-1857-83f2-82a1-08865a2204d8', 'en', 'It was without any taste'),
('2354e680-574f-e152-6547-baaf84bacfaf', 'de', 'Er streute sie über sein Heer'),
('2354e680-574f-e152-6547-baaf84bacfaf', 'en', 'He scattered it over his army'),
('6de1d5e2-7ef2-44ad-ab6d-bcf8c6f162fa', 'de', 'Er warf sie in den Jordan zurück'),
('6de1d5e2-7ef2-44ad-ab6d-bcf8c6f162fa', 'en', 'He threw it back into the Jordan'),
('11a53992-6233-9d7c-5034-79e0f27797a7', 'de', 'Er gab sie Elisa als Geschenk'),
('11a53992-6233-9d7c-5034-79e0f27797a7', 'en', 'He gave it to Elisha as a gift'),
('3e95e00a-5994-1d5c-d653-827f9153fc32', 'de', 'Er nahm zwei Maultierlasten mit, um dem HERRN zu opfern'),
('3e95e00a-5994-1d5c-d653-827f9153fc32', 'en', 'He took two mule-loads to sacrifice to the LORD'),
('4d304be8-17a4-27d2-d9ce-898cab3c55e6', 'de', 'Raben brachten ihm erneut Speise'),
('4d304be8-17a4-27d2-d9ce-898cab3c55e6', 'en', 'Ravens brought him food again'),
('dcf6c1bb-8a6f-67e9-54af-11076705ed8a', 'de', 'Eine Quelle entsprang neben ihm'),
('dcf6c1bb-8a6f-67e9-54af-11076705ed8a', 'en', 'A spring burst forth beside him'),
('599ce4d0-36f5-b614-65a2-dd9ffb10a10a', 'de', 'Eine Wolke spendete ihm Schatten und Tau'),
('599ce4d0-36f5-b614-65a2-dd9ffb10a10a', 'en', 'A cloud gave him shade and dew'),
('5e01c73f-12c4-c460-cb76-70b570471c6d', 'de', 'Ein Engel weckte ihn und gab ihm Brot und einen Krug Wasser'),
('5e01c73f-12c4-c460-cb76-70b570471c6d', 'en', 'An angel woke him and gave him bread and a jar of water'),
('fd5b709f-6a3e-f09c-fbbe-8cb337f2dc29', 'de', 'Sie dienten ihm nur halbherzig'),
('fd5b709f-6a3e-f09c-fbbe-8cb337f2dc29', 'en', 'They served only halfheartedly'),
('bf6da957-e949-5389-f32e-b5c64e7a1452', 'de', 'Sie zerstritten sich untereinander'),
('bf6da957-e949-5389-f32e-b5c64e7a1452', 'en', 'They quarreled among themselves'),
('02ad6cf3-1e25-ff71-0478-a9b3a169216e', 'de', 'Sie fielen sofort zu Götzen ab'),
('02ad6cf3-1e25-ff71-0478-a9b3a169216e', 'en', 'They fell at once to idols'),
('7f2a99e2-3960-2657-2dbf-865db4c86d21', 'de', 'Sie dienten dem HERRN treu'),
('7f2a99e2-3960-2657-2dbf-865db4c86d21', 'en', 'They served the LORD faithfully'),
('99a56d6f-8513-d9de-2cb5-a41c178b2dea', 'de', 'Sie klopfte an seine Tür um Hilfe'),
('99a56d6f-8513-d9de-2cb5-a41c178b2dea', 'en', 'She knocked at his door for help'),
('a7167205-a447-32d3-f5e3-5ab192ef4165', 'de', 'Sie kam zum Bach, um Wasser zu schöpfen'),
('a7167205-a447-32d3-f5e3-5ab192ef4165', 'en', 'She came to the brook to draw water'),
('aa9ffa91-8503-8e33-4582-7f078a25f37d', 'de', 'Sie sammelte Holz am Stadttor, als er um Wasser bat'),
('aa9ffa91-8503-8e33-4582-7f078a25f37d', 'en', 'She was gathering sticks at the city gate when he asked for water'),
('7cbf9a82-8a40-fdee-b93e-be83d02fb518', 'de', 'Sie verkaufte Brot auf dem Markt'),
('7cbf9a82-8a40-fdee-b93e-be83d02fb518', 'en', 'She was selling bread in the market'),
('518888b3-ab35-ad65-8110-dd618eb61f59', 'de', 'Er solle ihm Michal, Sauls Tochter, zurückbringen'),
('518888b3-ab35-ad65-8110-dd618eb61f59', 'en', 'He must bring back Michal, Saul''s daughter'),
('28365470-e304-6e1a-a3db-1b8f35668e8e', 'de', 'Er solle in Hebron auf den Thron verzichten'),
('28365470-e304-6e1a-a3db-1b8f35668e8e', 'en', 'He must renounce the throne in Hebron'),
('c5597b40-1796-a2ee-b850-21c6f8605636', 'de', 'Er solle Isch-Boschet ausliefern'),
('c5597b40-1796-a2ee-b850-21c6f8605636', 'en', 'He must hand over Ish-bosheth'),
('17a6bf5c-99ff-de65-d23c-a87dec07e223', 'de', 'Er solle das ganze Heer mitbringen'),
('17a6bf5c-99ff-de65-d23c-a87dec07e223', 'en', 'He must bring the whole army with him'),
('2eba0e08-b044-d22b-d531-e6a692d54364', 'de', 'Sie waren voll Furcht und priesen Gott'),
('2eba0e08-b044-d22b-d531-e6a692d54364', 'en', 'They were filled with awe and praised God'),
('fcabf963-2b22-e1c7-c773-a9d9ef4bffe9', 'de', 'Sie wollten ihn zum König machen'),
('fcabf963-2b22-e1c7-c773-a9d9ef4bffe9', 'en', 'They wanted to make him king'),
('9a194a19-748e-3f86-507e-7ee4ba1b3c88', 'de', 'Sie zerstreuten sich schweigend'),
('9a194a19-748e-3f86-507e-7ee4ba1b3c88', 'en', 'They scattered in silence'),
('0ce69105-ff88-bb4b-2241-c52f74722783', 'de', 'Sie warfen Steine auf ihn'),
('0ce69105-ff88-bb4b-2241-c52f74722783', 'en', 'They cast stones at him'),
('b3d22adb-d75a-32da-6dfe-97f472e14718', 'de', 'Ein Statthalter von Achaia'),
('b3d22adb-d75a-32da-6dfe-97f472e14718', 'en', 'A governor of Achaia'),
('84c8c486-d9e1-cc7b-9cb9-7dfbac5ef32c', 'de', 'Ein beredter Jude aus Alexandria, mächtig in der Schrift'),
('84c8c486-d9e1-cc7b-9cb9-7dfbac5ef32c', 'en', 'An eloquent Jew from Alexandria, mighty in the Scriptures'),
('26434e85-299e-523f-6752-42189ff8066d', 'de', 'Ein Silberschmied aus Ephesus'),
('26434e85-299e-523f-6752-42189ff8066d', 'en', 'A silversmith from Ephesus'),
('d50d2774-8938-8bb5-a6f0-744e2430fd17', 'de', 'Ein römischer Hauptmann aus Italien'),
('d50d2774-8938-8bb5-a6f0-744e2430fd17', 'en', 'A Roman centurion from Italy'),
('811c1ef5-34bc-f48c-9a9b-3307d9e0aef8', 'de', 'Sie blieb bis zu ihrem Tod ohne Kinder'),
('811c1ef5-34bc-f48c-9a9b-3307d9e0aef8', 'en', 'She remained childless until the day of her death'),
('b8e49efe-e15a-943f-7a47-6e5eb489b2b7', 'de', 'Sie floh zu den Philistern'),
('b8e49efe-e15a-943f-7a47-6e5eb489b2b7', 'en', 'She fled to the Philistines'),
('6e3b563c-6b70-6f6a-4cd3-d336b6e48778', 'de', 'David ließ sie in den Palast einsperren'),
('6e3b563c-6b70-6f6a-4cd3-d336b6e48778', 'en', 'David had her confined in the palace'),
('10d61ab4-1797-0462-5c22-f27344747158', 'de', 'David verstieß sie und sandte sie fort'),
('10d61ab4-1797-0462-5c22-f27344747158', 'en', 'David divorced her and sent her away')
insert into public.answer_option_translations (option_id, lang, text) values
('42657d61-488b-14e9-3c10-507a1800c4f5', 'de', 'Ein Buch mit allen Namen'),
('42657d61-488b-14e9-3c10-507a1800c4f5', 'en', 'A book with all the names'),
('82ccc1d4-3238-5d57-0ef0-33e7822a9190', 'de', 'Eine Krone aus Licht'),
('82ccc1d4-3238-5d57-0ef0-33e7822a9190', 'en', 'A crown of light'),
('1480ca12-3fa3-a775-1dc5-88f653dffa09', 'de', 'Die Zehn Gebote auf steinernen Tafeln'),
('1480ca12-3fa3-a775-1dc5-88f653dffa09', 'en', 'The Ten Commandments on stone tablets'),
('957f5b5e-9153-df2d-768b-775780790791', 'de', 'Einen goldenen Stab der Herrschaft'),
('957f5b5e-9153-df2d-768b-775780790791', 'en', 'A golden staff of rule'),
('b6b07579-a805-673c-b907-47def0ba2860', 'de', '… so ist Reichtum nach langer Mühe'),
('b6b07579-a805-673c-b907-47def0ba2860', 'en', '… is wealth after long toil'),
('8b1ed03e-2bdd-7bca-36cf-effe55fd6004', 'de', '… so ist Ehre nach dem Sieg'),
('8b1ed03e-2bdd-7bca-36cf-effe55fd6004', 'en', '… is honor after victory'),
('6f978eef-8538-4b7c-ef4b-af050439161f', 'de', '… so ist Ruhe nach dem Werk'),
('6f978eef-8538-4b7c-ef4b-af050439161f', 'en', '… is rest after labor'),
('0e95944b-9578-c3f9-5211-9600483e4ae3', 'de', '… so ist gute Nachricht aus fernem Land'),
('0e95944b-9578-c3f9-5211-9600483e4ae3', 'en', '… is good news from a distant land'),
('1df8dff2-21f6-0ea0-6c22-3889bf08a0f5', 'de', 'Aus dem Busch floss Wasser'),
('1df8dff2-21f6-0ea0-6c22-3889bf08a0f5', 'en', 'Water flowed from the bush'),
('5f6fe3fa-0b04-6641-e397-c2523483e7a9', 'de', 'Der Busch sprach mit menschlicher Stimme allein'),
('5f6fe3fa-0b04-6641-e397-c2523483e7a9', 'en', 'The bush spoke with a human voice alone'),
('53b18d52-8053-d511-9e10-58dddb03fa0a', 'de', 'Der Busch brannte, verbrannte aber nicht'),
('53b18d52-8053-d511-9e10-58dddb03fa0a', 'en', 'The bush burned but was not consumed'),
('46f0c954-1d96-3bd0-b51d-46cdcc0a7e23', 'de', 'Der Busch verwandelte sich in Gold'),
('46f0c954-1d96-3bd0-b51d-46cdcc0a7e23', 'en', 'The bush turned into gold'),
('23ddc586-1543-d840-1e56-377e47165159', 'de', 'Hiskia'),
('23ddc586-1543-d840-1e56-377e47165159', 'en', 'Hezekiah'),
('11fadd63-7f72-8010-a702-deb97b386224', 'de', 'Josia'),
('11fadd63-7f72-8010-a702-deb97b386224', 'en', 'Josiah'),
('09dd9e0a-dca4-8ab0-66e7-5e64a32ec3a0', 'de', 'Manasse'),
('09dd9e0a-dca4-8ab0-66e7-5e64a32ec3a0', 'en', 'Manasseh'),
('ca28de93-2d89-9ba9-ca9c-b2ffc51126a7', 'de', 'Joschafat'),
('ca28de93-2d89-9ba9-ca9c-b2ffc51126a7', 'en', 'Jehoshaphat'),
('a39d3eea-88b9-0f98-08f2-0b5ab5338517', 'de', 'Wie ist das Gold so hell geworden und das feine Gold so rein'),
('a39d3eea-88b9-0f98-08f2-0b5ab5338517', 'en', 'How the gold has grown bright, how the fine gold has become pure'),
('34b4fb55-fac3-14c4-d766-541d129ebeb9', 'de', 'Wie ist das Gold so dunkel geworden und das feine Gold so verändert'),
('34b4fb55-fac3-14c4-d766-541d129ebeb9', 'en', 'How the gold has grown dim, how the fine gold has changed'),
('eeb7aed4-5361-e0a1-2b2e-b98e27885b2c', 'de', 'Wie ist das Gold so reichlich geworden im Schatz des Tempels'),
('eeb7aed4-5361-e0a1-2b2e-b98e27885b2c', 'en', 'How the gold has grown plentiful in the temple''s treasure'),
('25845972-5d84-3c3d-e6cc-ebd8a2cc574d', 'de', 'Wie ist das Gold so kostbar geworden in den Händen der Fürsten'),
('25845972-5d84-3c3d-e6cc-ebd8a2cc574d', 'en', 'How the gold has grown precious in the hands of the princes'),
('44e07bc1-3c17-7451-37ed-d3869f994800', 'de', 'Er forderte einen höheren Brautpreis'),
('44e07bc1-3c17-7451-37ed-d3869f994800', 'en', 'He demanded a higher bride price'),
('529b119d-d44b-7959-543d-8fdbeb5d2d93', 'de', 'Er verzögerte die Hochzeit um Jahre'),
('529b119d-d44b-7959-543d-8fdbeb5d2d93', 'en', 'He delayed the wedding for years'),
('e116e540-add5-bf5a-cdcb-b8d3837a7e13', 'de', 'Er gab ihm Lea statt Rahel'),
('e116e540-add5-bf5a-cdcb-b8d3837a7e13', 'en', 'He gave him Leah instead of Rachel'),
('1f1e6832-16c2-4988-6425-ad3ccb48519f', 'de', 'Er verbarg Rahel im Zelt'),
('1f1e6832-16c2-4988-6425-ad3ccb48519f', 'en', 'He hid Rachel in the tent'),
('a759081a-5878-5cbe-687f-036cd95cb0b0', 'de', 'Sie hat die erste Liebe verlassen'),
('a759081a-5878-5cbe-687f-036cd95cb0b0', 'en', 'It has abandoned its first love'),
('92cfb187-f705-7013-fafd-9fbb42360f65', 'de', 'Sie trägt den Namen, dass sie lebe, ist aber tot'),
('92cfb187-f705-7013-fafd-9fbb42360f65', 'en', 'It bears a name of being alive, but is dead'),
('bb061680-4649-93f9-b122-7d2f0a98cd9a', 'de', 'Sie ist weder kalt noch heiß'),
('bb061680-4649-93f9-b122-7d2f0a98cd9a', 'en', 'It is neither cold nor hot'),
('15f07af7-d09d-e2d3-d9e9-f7d5e6d79799', 'de', 'Sie duldet die Lehre Isebels'),
('15f07af7-d09d-e2d3-d9e9-f7d5e6d79799', 'en', 'It tolerates the teaching of Jezebel'),
('6b4274bb-4641-b148-dd64-fa4c976204c8', 'de', 'Sie verließ verärgert das Haus'),
('6b4274bb-4641-b148-dd64-fa4c976204c8', 'en', 'She left the house in anger'),
('bba99295-17b0-ebbb-5916-359a0a981c91', 'de', 'Sie beklagte sich, dass Maria sie allein dienen ließ'),
('bba99295-17b0-ebbb-5916-359a0a981c91', 'en', 'She complained that Mary left her to serve alone'),
('d4e5e908-ce59-fd80-1ae3-734ad781caec', 'de', 'Sie setzte sich schweigend dazu'),
('d4e5e908-ce59-fd80-1ae3-734ad781caec', 'en', 'She sat down quietly beside them'),
('3fa25943-66ae-b5da-1d9a-cf8fbe7d663e', 'de', 'Sie schickte Maria in die Küche'),
('3fa25943-66ae-b5da-1d9a-cf8fbe7d663e', 'en', 'She sent Mary to the kitchen'),
('bef3ac18-0476-c210-16e9-aad1a865ae3b', 'de', 'Er ließ sie nur am Rand arbeiten'),
('bef3ac18-0476-c210-16e9-aad1a865ae3b', 'en', 'He let her work only at the edge'),
('360d22f5-593c-e99a-e557-c2bc94e9c5b1', 'de', 'Er befahl den Knechten, sie nicht zu belästigen'),
('360d22f5-593c-e99a-e557-c2bc94e9c5b1', 'en', 'He ordered the young men not to molest her'),
('d18b44e7-6a7d-1780-183b-a999eb04c460', 'de', 'Er verbot ihr, mit anderen zu sprechen'),
('d18b44e7-6a7d-1780-183b-a999eb04c460', 'en', 'He forbade her to speak with others'),
('ad4304ed-3b1c-d819-c86c-117febe8e3d5', 'de', 'Er stellte ihr eine eigene Wache bei'),
('ad4304ed-3b1c-d819-c86c-117febe8e3d5', 'en', 'He set a personal guard beside her'),
('850af923-c8d6-332c-1245-916ac71d4fb3', 'de', 'Niederknien und beten'),
('850af923-c8d6-332c-1245-916ac71d4fb3', 'en', 'Kneel down and pray'),
('3c78d228-8c4f-252c-443e-db391b020231', 'de', 'Ein Opfer darbringen'),
('3c78d228-8c4f-252c-443e-db391b020231', 'en', 'Offer a sacrifice'),
('9ce5db75-03d7-34a2-228f-e3428ad8c5ea', 'de', 'Das Angesicht verhüllen'),
('9ce5db75-03d7-34a2-228f-e3428ad8c5ea', 'en', 'Cover his face'),
('a10cdd39-9d29-d122-dc6a-07e31e6cecc1', 'de', 'Die Schuhe von den Füßen ziehen'),
('a10cdd39-9d29-d122-dc6a-07e31e6cecc1', 'en', 'Take the sandals off his feet'),
('24dea374-c22c-7f06-d6e0-79bb667fe410', 'de', 'Die Liebe hört niemals auf'),
('24dea374-c22c-7f06-d6e0-79bb667fe410', 'en', 'Love never ends'),
('f48e5aed-bc07-01a4-328b-38ac65eaf238', 'de', 'Die Liebe ist nur für diese Welt'),
('f48e5aed-bc07-01a4-328b-38ac65eaf238', 'en', 'Love is only for this world'),
('c157fdcd-de5a-ab07-9558-5d781e879367', 'de', 'Die Liebe vergeht mit der Zeit'),
('c157fdcd-de5a-ab07-9558-5d781e879367', 'en', 'Love passes away with time'),
('09523640-c669-4220-7e64-489a4924d416', 'de', 'Die Liebe endet mit dem Glauben'),
('09523640-c669-4220-7e64-489a4924d416', 'en', 'Love ends with faith'),
('382f2a50-3ee4-aa7f-9e0b-a63e2a1e4195', 'de', 'Zwölfmal'),
('382f2a50-3ee4-aa7f-9e0b-a63e2a1e4195', 'en', 'Twelve times'),
('90b21182-cd60-328c-859f-b14d1cd85ed2', 'de', 'Einmal'),
('90b21182-cd60-328c-859f-b14d1cd85ed2', 'en', 'Once'),
('790090b4-de35-2855-a302-e4820cc1737d', 'de', 'Siebenmal'),
('790090b4-de35-2855-a302-e4820cc1737d', 'en', 'Seven times'),
('dbad0cee-4bd1-a3f2-6874-4b44f51abac3', 'de', 'Dreimal'),
('dbad0cee-4bd1-a3f2-6874-4b44f51abac3', 'en', 'Three times'),
('df597751-a11b-ee92-992f-6654c1c09b99', 'de', 'Balak, der Sohn Zippors'),
('df597751-a11b-ee92-992f-6654c1c09b99', 'en', 'Balak, son of Zippor'),
('e219abd4-25e3-0ddc-9c6d-6e313eb1eba7', 'de', 'Sihon, der Amoriter'),
('e219abd4-25e3-0ddc-9c6d-6e313eb1eba7', 'en', 'Sihon the Amorite'),
('411145ea-22e8-8d6b-11c6-1298e328da21', 'de', 'Arad, der Kanaaniter'),
('411145ea-22e8-8d6b-11c6-1298e328da21', 'en', 'Arad the Canaanite'),
('95fa4f01-fd0f-e8c4-506b-a8246c1175de', 'de', 'Og von Baschan'),
('95fa4f01-fd0f-e8c4-506b-a8246c1175de', 'en', 'Og of Bashan'),
('0839f958-d18b-7833-c5b5-f89db1e63080', 'de', 'Hundert Goldstücke'),
('0839f958-d18b-7833-c5b5-f89db1e63080', 'en', 'A hundred pieces of gold'),
('7420b75d-8177-73ac-7f67-45faffc3e957', 'de', 'Sieben Talente Silber'),
('7420b75d-8177-73ac-7f67-45faffc3e957', 'en', 'Seven talents of silver'),
('bf0f4673-6b46-b5a1-cc76-b13639cba5d3', 'de', 'Dreißig Silberstücke'),
('bf0f4673-6b46-b5a1-cc76-b13639cba5d3', 'en', 'Thirty pieces of silver'),
('f9283d25-1bbe-9e46-966e-78c03c88a641', 'de', 'Tausend Schekel Gold'),
('f9283d25-1bbe-9e46-966e-78c03c88a641', 'en', 'A thousand shekels of gold'),
('62458f0b-c666-9778-3e96-a597e42f9a45', 'de', 'Fünf wurden geheilt, alle kehrten zurück'),
('62458f0b-c666-9778-3e96-a597e42f9a45', 'en', 'Five were healed, all returned'),
('2c819c11-6e3c-e877-ab8e-44ffb7671e09', 'de', 'Zwölf wurden geheilt, keiner kehrte zurück'),
('2c819c11-6e3c-e877-ab8e-44ffb7671e09', 'en', 'Twelve were healed, none returned'),
('02047397-61fe-e3e0-d6f0-61ed0e555890', 'de', 'Zehn wurden geheilt, nur einer kehrte zurück'),
('02047397-61fe-e3e0-d6f0-61ed0e555890', 'en', 'Ten were healed, only one returned'),
('556456a0-dca6-f76e-2d4a-ceaafb4b8e5c', 'de', 'Sieben wurden geheilt, drei kehrten zurück'),
('556456a0-dca6-f76e-2d4a-ceaafb4b8e5c', 'en', 'Seven were healed, three returned'),
('d8d94383-7dc7-a689-559c-6234166cdcb0', 'de', 'Ihn untersuchen und für rein oder unrein erklären'),
('d8d94383-7dc7-a689-559c-6234166cdcb0', 'en', 'Examine him and declare him clean or unclean'),
('36a9a9aa-a743-c541-82ad-eb475843ee79', 'de', 'Ihn mit Öl salben'),
('36a9a9aa-a743-c541-82ad-eb475843ee79', 'en', 'Anoint him with oil'),
('8bececaa-9cfe-fa13-bf88-2b45314d29c7', 'de', 'Ihn sofort aus dem Lager treiben'),
('8bececaa-9cfe-fa13-bf88-2b45314d29c7', 'en', 'Drive him from the camp at once'),
