('66ec423b-42e4-8a74-18c1-8adec1314f83', 'en', 'That the people had taken foreign wives and intermingled'),
('6c949953-b25e-3873-c09f-99c006e4c601', 'de', 'Dass der Tempel völlig zerstört am Boden lag'),
('6c949953-b25e-3873-c09f-99c006e4c601', 'en', 'That the temple lay completely destroyed on the ground'),
('3904e3e1-c027-c361-08c2-64584058e6df', 'de', 'Dass die Stadtmauer noch nicht angefangen war'),
('3904e3e1-c027-c361-08c2-64584058e6df', 'en', 'That the city wall had not yet been begun'),
('4dd2e325-8439-0446-56bc-e97a186b3cf5', 'de', 'Dass die Priester die Opfer ganz aufgegeben hatten'),
('4dd2e325-8439-0446-56bc-e97a186b3cf5', 'en', 'That the priests had wholly abandoned the sacrifices'),
