('643c624e-8d1a-1ab9-284e-f528dbdd6958', 'de', 'Weil der Stall geheizt war'),
('643c624e-8d1a-1ab9-284e-f528dbdd6958', 'en', 'Because the stable was heated'),
('13458d0d-cd4b-8809-39c1-177470abacf2', 'de', 'Er solle öffentlich zu den Nebenfrauen seines Vaters eingehen'),
('13458d0d-cd4b-8809-39c1-177470abacf2', 'en', 'He should publicly go in to his father''s concubines'),
('b4952b9d-f1d7-07d0-b2a9-1bdd70071763', 'de', 'Er solle die Lade verbrennen'),
('b4952b9d-f1d7-07d0-b2a9-1bdd70071763', 'en', 'He should burn the ark'),
('d8cbc1b8-3d14-4ae2-2959-5e49dbc666ec', 'de', 'Er solle das Heer Davids bestechen'),
('d8cbc1b8-3d14-4ae2-2959-5e49dbc666ec', 'en', 'He should bribe David''s army'),
('79c3992a-8d06-6c86-3e89-6fa8299ba7d8', 'de', 'Er solle David sofort gefangen nehmen'),
('79c3992a-8d06-6c86-3e89-6fa8299ba7d8', 'en', 'He should capture David at once'),
('a5c84cfe-8454-b450-8031-b1683851b84d', 'de', 'Einen Strom, der sich in zwei teilte'),
('a5c84cfe-8454-b450-8031-b1683851b84d', 'en', 'A river that split into two'),
('bad8bce0-3d00-45c4-759a-5f790f2038ac', 'de', 'Ein brennendes Feld in der Ferne'),
('bad8bce0-3d00-45c4-759a-5f790f2038ac', 'en', 'A burning field in the distance'),
('805db33b-c5b9-217d-5a59-37d58db1847b', 'de', 'Einen Berg, der zum Himmel wuchs'),
('805db33b-c5b9-217d-5a59-37d58db1847b', 'en', 'A mountain growing up to heaven'),
('867e8d76-02b4-7500-38bc-19bba65b3d9a', 'de', 'Eine Leiter, auf der Engel auf- und niederstiegen'),
('867e8d76-02b4-7500-38bc-19bba65b3d9a', 'en', 'A ladder on which angels ascended and descended'),
('ffac867e-a9c9-f81a-c8b8-324ed0df26e8', 'de', 'Er wolle die Lade nach Hebron bringen'),
('ffac867e-a9c9-f81a-c8b8-324ed0df26e8', 'en', 'That he wished to bring the ark to Hebron'),
('cfbebc28-3e2c-4976-f679-a8faca0cdbfa', 'de', 'Er wolle dort Gericht halten'),
('cfbebc28-3e2c-4976-f679-a8faca0cdbfa', 'en', 'That he wished to hold court there'),
('8eec3dc1-3442-580b-37d5-a29554fb251b', 'de', 'Er wolle das Heer gegen Aram sammeln'),
('8eec3dc1-3442-580b-37d5-a29554fb251b', 'en', 'That he wished to gather the army against Aram'),
('7c388005-fc29-ce0e-8b2f-2d37e550bf9b', 'de', 'Er wolle ein Gelübde an den Herrn einlösen'),
('7c388005-fc29-ce0e-8b2f-2d37e550bf9b', 'en', 'That he wished to fulfill a vow to the Lord'),
('12959da1-5915-dca3-86ec-026f7e6cb319', 'de', 'Sie warf sich ihm zu Füßen'),
('12959da1-5915-dca3-86ec-026f7e6cb319', 'en', 'She threw herself at his feet'),
('800ecf78-f468-e3ad-2271-b409196a7c0c', 'de', 'Sie berührte heimlich den Saum seines Gewandes'),
('800ecf78-f468-e3ad-2271-b409196a7c0c', 'en', 'She secretly touched the hem of his garment'),
('57cb3ba0-e826-255e-3028-4a8edfa74673', 'de', 'Sie rief laut nach Jesus'),
('57cb3ba0-e826-255e-3028-4a8edfa74673', 'en', 'She cried out loudly to Jesus'),
('3fb9a8bf-6f34-c895-c8e1-a14d83013051', 'de', 'Sie sandte einen Boten zu ihm'),
('3fb9a8bf-6f34-c895-c8e1-a14d83013051', 'en', 'She sent a messenger to him'),
('c680ceaf-ea32-8200-ad6b-bc536915fb29', 'de', 'Wehe denen, die ruhig wohnen'),
('c680ceaf-ea32-8200-ad6b-bc536915fb29', 'en', 'Woe to those who dwell at ease'),
('1c51b2e5-4f23-7712-3cd0-1aedb12e6f08', 'de', 'Höret das Wort vom Berge'),
('1c51b2e5-4f23-7712-3cd0-1aedb12e6f08', 'en', 'Hear the word from the mountain'),
('19493816-b697-2e83-3725-de8bbaaa0aa8', 'de', 'Um dreier und um vierer Frevel willen'),
('19493816-b697-2e83-3725-de8bbaaa0aa8', 'en', 'For three transgressions and for four'),
('bf7aeec1-90cc-98e8-e6cf-b7e34eaa6413', 'de', 'So spricht der König der Heere'),
('bf7aeec1-90cc-98e8-e6cf-b7e34eaa6413', 'en', 'Thus says the king of hosts'),
('1344f0f6-60df-b288-cdce-bfb47a741512', 'de', 'Bleibet doch und ruhet, ob jemand Ruhe finden mag'),
('1344f0f6-60df-b288-cdce-bfb47a741512', 'en', 'Stay and rest, if anyone may find rest'),
('e1629315-23a6-da09-046b-fb75a8e8a0d1', 'de', 'Kommet doch und tröstet, ob jemand Trost zu geben hat'),
('e1629315-23a6-da09-046b-fb75a8e8a0d1', 'en', 'Come and comfort, if anyone has comfort to give'),
('803dd594-3cab-346e-aa59-889ca3d8521f', 'de', 'Höret doch und merket, ob irgendein Volk so glücklich sei'),
('803dd594-3cab-346e-aa59-889ca3d8521f', 'en', 'Hear and mark if any nation is as happy as I'),
('96a14b08-91f8-d90d-fe27-9a434d74afe7', 'de', 'Schauet doch und sehet, ob irgendein Schmerz sei wie mein Schmerz'),
('96a14b08-91f8-d90d-fe27-9a434d74afe7', 'en', 'Look and see if there is any sorrow like my sorrow'),
('8a9f9d53-8ada-a1c6-2411-e4deb3f8c3db', 'de', 'Ein Strom von Blut'),
('8a9f9d53-8ada-a1c6-2411-e4deb3f8c3db', 'en', 'A stream of blood'),
('a3bf742d-7411-6bf0-7161-f365b075fe4d', 'de', 'Ein Strom von Feuer'),
('a3bf742d-7411-6bf0-7161-f365b075fe4d', 'en', 'A stream of fire'),
('a0763be3-5335-4ea5-162a-388f1399a35a', 'de', 'Ein Strom von Gold'),
('a0763be3-5335-4ea5-162a-388f1399a35a', 'en', 'A stream of gold'),
('bdddcc84-9e2f-6414-124c-bace31db879c', 'de', 'Ein Strom von Wasser'),
('bdddcc84-9e2f-6414-124c-bace31db879c', 'en', 'A stream of water'),
('87cc05e4-7d85-0a6f-ac5c-b6c0a776867e', 'de', 'Thomas'),
('87cc05e4-7d85-0a6f-ac5c-b6c0a776867e', 'en', 'Thomas'),
('fd324369-3cdc-8665-b86b-4fd3225bb3e5', 'de', 'Johannes'),
('fd324369-3cdc-8665-b86b-4fd3225bb3e5', 'en', 'John'),
('cb8f958f-1da4-ba0f-9c3d-e94c9c0fe811', 'de', 'Andreas'),
('cb8f958f-1da4-ba0f-9c3d-e94c9c0fe811', 'en', 'Andrew'),
('4468b8e9-dae9-7e76-56a9-5ca6d509bb1a', 'de', 'Petrus'),
('4468b8e9-dae9-7e76-56a9-5ca6d509bb1a', 'en', 'Peter'),
('4c2d924a-ff8a-b12a-6666-6dbf7264278d', 'de', 'Abram solle mit ihrer Magd Hagar einen Sohn zeugen'),
('4c2d924a-ff8a-b12a-6666-6dbf7264278d', 'en', 'Abram should father a son through her maid Hagar'),
('ece2b317-745d-3229-38fa-07ed3d09aabd', 'de', 'Abram solle eine zweite Frau aus Ägypten nehmen'),
('ece2b317-745d-3229-38fa-07ed3d09aabd', 'en', 'Abram should take a second wife from Egypt'),
('94d9d900-149f-cd9e-05af-f52505a56e32', 'de', 'Sie wolle ein fremdes Kind annehmen'),
('94d9d900-149f-cd9e-05af-f52505a56e32', 'en', 'She would adopt a foreign child'),
('d8831255-49a8-704b-549c-695ea64d64b8', 'de', 'Sie wolle Gott um ein Zeichen bitten'),
('d8831255-49a8-704b-549c-695ea64d64b8', 'en', 'She would ask God for a sign'),
('07464a7a-845e-015d-f1cf-7b94bdde503b', 'de', 'Er sang ein Klagelied über Ninive'),
('07464a7a-845e-015d-f1cf-7b94bdde503b', 'en', 'He sang a lament over Nineveh'),
('4f8436ae-4d33-b052-2a5f-9781d33bf064', 'de', 'Er schwieg drei Tage lang'),
('4f8436ae-4d33-b052-2a5f-9781d33bf064', 'en', 'He kept silent for three days'),
('8636832f-d4ce-9ea1-1c17-ddadea8f1e33', 'de', 'Er betete zum Herrn um Rettung'),
('8636832f-d4ce-9ea1-1c17-ddadea8f1e33', 'en', 'He prayed to the Lord for deliverance'),
('96328bae-598e-a7b5-e932-644d7d9ae683', 'de', 'Er verfluchte den Tag seiner Geburt'),
('96328bae-598e-a7b5-e932-644d7d9ae683', 'en', 'He cursed the day of his birth'),
('6723b886-93ba-dbc1-64cf-bc15b1bf2c13', 'de', 'Sie vergiftete ihm die Milch'),
('6723b886-93ba-dbc1-64cf-bc15b1bf2c13', 'en', 'She poisoned his milk'),
('863a714b-5425-554a-2b23-af2cee5e42b7', 'de', 'Sie trieb ihm einen Zeltpflock durch die Schläfe'),
('863a714b-5425-554a-2b23-af2cee5e42b7', 'en', 'She drove a tent peg through his temple'),
('6dbc214a-4d7f-9170-b398-516957678c30', 'de', 'Sie erwürgte ihn im Schlaf mit einem Strick'),
('6dbc214a-4d7f-9170-b398-516957678c30', 'en', 'She strangled him in his sleep with a cord'),
('015e5dcd-698f-4c86-75b9-85cb8cdadd60', 'de', 'Sie erstach ihn mit seinem eigenen Schwert'),
('015e5dcd-698f-4c86-75b9-85cb8cdadd60', 'en', 'She stabbed him with his own sword'),
('56af49ed-5095-c48a-c833-2ed260d9194c', 'de', 'Es vergisst die Beschneidung'),
('56af49ed-5095-c48a-c833-2ed260d9194c', 'en', 'They forget circumcision'),
('a63060d7-6973-eb1e-e486-70f033583f3b', 'de', 'Es verachtet die Könige'),
('a63060d7-6973-eb1e-e486-70f033583f3b', 'en', 'They despise the kings'),
('be633a06-6dbb-4b43-8e75-ee1c6a34dd58', 'de', 'Es verlässt das Land'),
('be633a06-6dbb-4b43-8e75-ee1c6a34dd58', 'en', 'They abandon the land'),
('be62af26-f45c-616e-74f0-ae5ce5288217', 'de', 'Es geht zugrunde aus Mangel an Erkenntnis'),
('be62af26-f45c-616e-74f0-ae5ce5288217', 'en', 'They are destroyed for lack of knowledge'),
('bf8cb79e-ca91-1c37-3409-5ca2960168d8', 'de', 'Er floh zu den Philistern'),
('bf8cb79e-ca91-1c37-3409-5ca2960168d8', 'en', 'He fled to the Philistines'),
('3b00c8d9-c6f7-0919-815a-47fd13c81fbb', 'de', 'Er ritt heim, ordnete sein Haus und erhängte sich'),
('3b00c8d9-c6f7-0919-815a-47fd13c81fbb', 'en', 'He rode home, set his house in order, and hanged himself'),
('9b1af916-b020-19a3-d358-61256281534a', 'de', 'Er bat David um Vergebung'),
('9b1af916-b020-19a3-d358-61256281534a', 'en', 'He begged David for forgiveness'),
('217d61ce-04cf-c736-ee00-e874c9c964bd', 'de', 'Er kämpfte an Absaloms Seite weiter'),
('217d61ce-04cf-c736-ee00-e874c9c964bd', 'en', 'He kept fighting at Absalom''s side'),
('9a92934e-bd37-783e-6845-90f8605b8f84', 'de', 'Verbringe die Jugend in Sorge und Mühe'),
('9a92934e-bd37-783e-6845-90f8605b8f84', 'en', 'Spend your youth in worry and toil'),
('cda374a1-e71d-f055-aa05-dd716433cafd', 'de', 'Die Jugend dauert ewig ohne Ende'),
('cda374a1-e71d-f055-aa05-dd716433cafd', 'en', 'Youth lasts forever without end'),
('455b7b39-dbc2-6d04-786a-802e634e5129', 'de', 'Meide alle Freude, um weise zu sein'),
('455b7b39-dbc2-6d04-786a-802e634e5129', 'en', 'Avoid all joy to be wise'),
('cd1a7aa4-44dc-4b79-3784-2d0bed0ce378', 'de', 'Freue dich in der Jugend, doch wisse, dass Gott dich richtet'),
('cd1a7aa4-44dc-4b79-3784-2d0bed0ce378', 'en', 'Rejoice in your youth, but know that God will judge you'),
