('a151736f-1a91-ce2f-13e7-b4333e4b2f47', 'en', 'The roads to Zion are full of pilgrim nations'),
('bda07d0c-7384-a848-15cc-600754e92a9e', 'de', 'Die Wege nach Zion führen geradewegs zum Tempel'),
('bda07d0c-7384-a848-15cc-600754e92a9e', 'en', 'The roads to Zion lead straight to the temple'),
('f16e7ad9-191a-2a3f-55fc-432a523b44b7', 'de', 'Die Wege nach Zion blühen im Frühling der Hoffnung'),
('f16e7ad9-191a-2a3f-55fc-432a523b44b7', 'en', 'The roads to Zion bloom in the spring of hope'),
('d7e0424a-9c81-d782-e716-315dc8aa930b', 'de', 'Die Wege nach Zion liegen verödet, weil niemand zum Fest kommt'),
('d7e0424a-9c81-d782-e716-315dc8aa930b', 'en', 'The roads to Zion mourn, for no one comes to the feasts'),
('b56fd349-7725-2fe8-2806-777f63eede01', 'de', 'Mit einem brennenden Feuer'),
('b56fd349-7725-2fe8-2806-777f63eede01', 'en', 'With a burning fire'),
('8fc61bed-2bf6-5263-aa1a-87000ed106e7', 'de', 'Mit dem Wind, der weht, wo er will'),
('8fc61bed-2bf6-5263-aa1a-87000ed106e7', 'en', 'With the wind that blows where it wishes'),
('a2ba0435-5f30-035d-56c2-c656f7443703', 'de', 'Mit einem fließenden Strom'),
('a2ba0435-5f30-035d-56c2-c656f7443703', 'en', 'With a flowing river'),
('cf358e4b-8586-ed96-bdf8-e4dfb1a65a15', 'de', 'Mit dem Licht der aufgehenden Sonne'),
('cf358e4b-8586-ed96-bdf8-e4dfb1a65a15', 'en', 'With the light of the rising sun'),
('163820fc-6451-d7ac-743e-5865d88f8cbd', 'de', 'Sieben Tage'),
('163820fc-6451-d7ac-743e-5865d88f8cbd', 'en', 'Seven days'),
('55fe6fe4-10ee-3839-2a9e-fdc414ad4684', 'de', 'Drei Tage'),
('55fe6fe4-10ee-3839-2a9e-fdc414ad4684', 'en', 'Three days'),
('62b56003-5098-35f7-fb43-bfa1aa70b403', 'de', 'Einen Tag'),
('62b56003-5098-35f7-fb43-bfa1aa70b403', 'en', 'One day'),
('cc5d2ee1-991d-5d34-eae7-1030df39425a', 'de', 'Vier Tage'),
('cc5d2ee1-991d-5d34-eae7-1030df39425a', 'en', 'Four days'),
('6d5302ff-af97-a0e9-93b8-c3a2ed48b8a0', 'de', 'Er berief sich darauf, ein römischer Bürger zu sein'),
('6d5302ff-af97-a0e9-93b8-c3a2ed48b8a0', 'en', 'He claimed to be a Roman citizen'),
('5cf92327-537b-97bb-4b0b-940225824e64', 'de', 'Er bestach die Soldaten'),
('5cf92327-537b-97bb-4b0b-940225824e64', 'en', 'He bribed the soldiers'),
('6c44a28b-d9ca-ae42-98df-94c21b323242', 'de', 'Er floh über die Mauer'),
('6c44a28b-d9ca-ae42-98df-94c21b323242', 'en', 'He fled over the wall'),
('088284c3-425f-2f16-e3a0-4022d09277cd', 'de', 'Er rief einen Engel zu Hilfe'),
('088284c3-425f-2f16-e3a0-4022d09277cd', 'en', 'He called an angel to help'),
('dd2fc2d6-6d00-4943-1efc-70bd35616a6b', 'de', 'Sie mussten ein Schuldopfer bringen'),
('dd2fc2d6-6d00-4943-1efc-70bd35616a6b', 'en', 'They had to bring a guilt offering'),
('afe6bfa0-99b6-1e00-f289-19ba5ab35561', 'de', 'Sie wurden mit Aussatz geschlagen'),
('afe6bfa0-99b6-1e00-f289-19ba5ab35561', 'en', 'They were struck with leprosy'),
('ddd69af0-1619-99c9-dc84-2d1d3b11059e', 'de', 'Sie durften das Volk nicht ins gelobte Land führen'),
('ddd69af0-1619-99c9-dc84-2d1d3b11059e', 'en', 'They could not lead the people into the Promised Land'),
('d33cbe04-6627-967c-7551-723b06b7aa17', 'de', 'Sie verloren das Priesteramt'),
('d33cbe04-6627-967c-7551-723b06b7aa17', 'en', 'They lost the priesthood'),
('9297368d-b05f-9746-5c5d-7a4c774e7aa9', 'de', 'Er verbarg sich im Tempelvorhof'),
('9297368d-b05f-9746-5c5d-7a4c774e7aa9', 'en', 'He hid in the temple courtyard'),
('a9def497-0f81-d04e-b664-72bd5251d0f5', 'de', 'Er floh aus der Stadt hinaus'),
('a9def497-0f81-d04e-b664-72bd5251d0f5', 'en', 'He fled out of the city'),
('a4f66b7c-d430-7556-c726-ebecbb274aa3', 'de', 'Er ging hinaus und weinte bitterlich'),
('a4f66b7c-d430-7556-c726-ebecbb274aa3', 'en', 'He went out and wept bitterly'),
('089a0ddc-6786-2274-2711-30590df67381', 'de', 'Er kehrte zu den Jüngern zurück'),
('089a0ddc-6786-2274-2711-30590df67381', 'en', 'He returned to the disciples'),
('d1d7af82-854b-13c8-538f-15f7fee997d0', 'de', 'Damit sie ihm als Kundschafter Nachricht über Absalom senden konnten'),
('d1d7af82-854b-13c8-538f-15f7fee997d0', 'en', 'So they could send him news about Absalom as informants'),
('65fed82d-d07d-4d56-9dc3-73425f0e988f', 'de', 'Damit sie Absalom zum König salbten'),
('65fed82d-d07d-4d56-9dc3-73425f0e988f', 'en', 'So they could anoint Absalom as king'),
('19906390-e993-f1de-e887-d7a7be43c784', 'de', 'Damit sie die Stadt verteidigten'),
('19906390-e993-f1de-e887-d7a7be43c784', 'en', 'So they could defend the city'),
('eb7ff402-5cae-8758-05e2-a206bf635093', 'de', 'Damit sie die Lade vor Absalom verbargen'),
('eb7ff402-5cae-8758-05e2-a206bf635093', 'en', 'So they could hide the ark from Absalom'),
('98b30246-e201-40b7-cf1b-0c1dac42a6cc', 'de', 'Sie floh nach Juda ins Exil'),
('98b30246-e201-40b7-cf1b-0c1dac42a6cc', 'en', 'She fled into exile in Judah'),
('e414d545-32dc-84ce-94d1-6f1500cda7a1', 'de', 'Sie übergab die Macht den Priestern'),
('e414d545-32dc-84ce-94d1-6f1500cda7a1', 'en', 'She handed power to the priests'),
('c924b007-1f1a-4566-730f-7a9c019fa827', 'de', 'Sie ließ die ganze Königsnachkommenschaft umbringen'),
('c924b007-1f1a-4566-730f-7a9c019fa827', 'en', 'She had the whole royal offspring put to death'),
('a167d861-d368-921f-d79d-b6d0dabf2575', 'de', 'Sie rief das Volk zum Tempel'),
('a167d861-d368-921f-d79d-b6d0dabf2575', 'en', 'She summoned the people to the temple'),
('d4f24fb2-7340-a331-1265-82112ebf6131', 'de', 'Damit er ehrenvoll begraben werde'),
('d4f24fb2-7340-a331-1265-82112ebf6131', 'en', 'So he would be buried honorably'),
('a58df986-ac1a-ec40-8cb2-5a6ec42a7c57', 'de', 'Damit seine Söhne die Macht erbten'),
('a58df986-ac1a-ec40-8cb2-5a6ec42a7c57', 'en', 'So his sons would inherit power'),
('6f6a5b7e-adef-0a26-754a-956e40fda8da', 'de', 'Damit er Tebez doch noch erobere'),
('6f6a5b7e-adef-0a26-754a-956e40fda8da', 'en', 'So he might still conquer Thebez'),
('db79c1cc-fe39-8ac4-032c-61d3508e75bc', 'de', 'Damit man nicht sage, eine Frau habe ihn getötet'),
('db79c1cc-fe39-8ac4-032c-61d3508e75bc', 'en', 'So none would say a woman had killed him'),
('c3b6f351-8871-0629-e3fe-018069fea5cf', 'de', 'Die Ausgießung des Geistes'),
('c3b6f351-8871-0629-e3fe-018069fea5cf', 'en', 'The outpouring of the Spirit'),
('26dc4cfa-bd90-cdcc-01a8-50c2ca294af3', 'de', 'Der Untergang Edoms'),
('26dc4cfa-bd90-cdcc-01a8-50c2ca294af3', 'en', 'The fall of Edom'),
('674a0c64-bc34-6435-7752-bbfeb6b32218', 'de', 'Der Tag des Herrn'),
('674a0c64-bc34-6435-7752-bbfeb6b32218', 'en', 'The day of the Lord'),
('e8c104b2-6339-7df9-05c5-ed7abf00479c', 'de', 'Der Wiederaufbau des Tempels'),
('e8c104b2-6339-7df9-05c5-ed7abf00479c', 'en', 'The rebuilding of the temple'),
('fd646680-0879-578d-29d8-c7e8178826e2', 'de', 'Er sandte sie zum Teich Siloah'),
('fd646680-0879-578d-29d8-c7e8178826e2', 'en', 'He sent her to the pool of Siloam'),
('67d551af-c6d9-a65c-f4bf-fc9c8cc61020', 'de', 'Er sprach nur von der Tür aus'),
('67d551af-c6d9-a65c-f4bf-fc9c8cc61020', 'en', 'He spoke only from the door'),
('f28d61de-dc35-c8d2-c1fb-65fb78a2ae31', 'de', 'Er trat zu ihr, ergriff ihre Hand, und das Fieber verließ sie'),
('f28d61de-dc35-c8d2-c1fb-65fb78a2ae31', 'en', 'He came to her, took her hand, and the fever left her'),
('adfc24d8-0112-6ec0-32cd-e97c638a52ac', 'de', 'Er bestrich ihre Stirn mit Öl'),
('adfc24d8-0112-6ec0-32cd-e97c638a52ac', 'en', 'He anointed her forehead with oil'),
('41f49b80-ee0d-7694-6624-bdd8a90b7357', 'de', 'Einen plötzlichen Wind aus der Wüste'),
('41f49b80-ee0d-7694-6624-bdd8a90b7357', 'en', 'A sudden wind from the desert'),
('f974a7c7-47c1-7174-cc8e-73e24d1ef9cc', 'de', 'Eine Wolke, so klein wie eine Menschenhand, aus dem Meer'),
('f974a7c7-47c1-7174-cc8e-73e24d1ef9cc', 'en', 'A cloud as small as a man''s hand rising from the sea'),
('727bbea1-a25d-8eb3-883e-4ec555501da4', 'de', 'Einen Blitz am östlichen Himmel'),
('727bbea1-a25d-8eb3-883e-4ec555501da4', 'en', 'Lightning in the eastern sky'),
('190e9cb9-938d-e5cd-77d2-fda3fbba4ca3', 'de', 'Einen Regenbogen über dem Gebirge'),
('190e9cb9-938d-e5cd-77d2-fda3fbba4ca3', 'en', 'A rainbow over the mountains'),
('8adfa9c8-1121-e3d7-2ac6-fab0027d2c6a', 'de', 'Mit umgürteten Lenden, Schuhen und Stab in der Hand'),
('8adfa9c8-1121-e3d7-2ac6-fab0027d2c6a', 'en', 'With belts fastened, sandals on, and staff in hand'),
('c56a9a83-0d5b-d57a-610e-13b91c93b99c', 'de', 'Schweigend bei verschlossenen Türen'),
('c56a9a83-0d5b-d57a-610e-13b91c93b99c', 'en', 'In silence behind locked doors'),
('5e35134c-38b2-0e0f-b98e-1ed508e1aa52', 'de', 'Nach dem Bad in weißen Gewändern'),
('5e35134c-38b2-0e0f-b98e-1ed508e1aa52', 'en', 'After bathing, in white garments'),
('739e260e-464f-ecbf-e8a6-21c7284c9673', 'de', 'Liegend am Tisch in festlicher Ruhe'),
('739e260e-464f-ecbf-e8a6-21c7284c9673', 'en', 'Reclining at the table in festive calm'),
('b25995e3-62b4-407b-8fd3-97dba46a3a13', 'de', 'Er ist schwächer als der Wind'),
('b25995e3-62b4-407b-8fd3-97dba46a3a13', 'en', 'It is weaker than the wind'),
('22af8e42-8a0d-9416-bac6-2472d2a4e7d5', 'de', 'Er ist bitterer als die Myrrhe'),
('22af8e42-8a0d-9416-bac6-2472d2a4e7d5', 'en', 'It is more bitter than myrrh'),
('f76085d1-a639-1429-9828-003169de5442', 'de', 'Er ist köstlicher als aller Wohlgeruch'),
('f76085d1-a639-1429-9828-003169de5442', 'en', 'It is more delightful than all spices'),
('4cc94f3e-deae-ffc1-85f6-c6603a5c56e4', 'de', 'Er vergeht schneller als der Tau'),
('4cc94f3e-deae-ffc1-85f6-c6603a5c56e4', 'en', 'It fades faster than the dew'),
('83e925d3-71d1-6be1-eb88-3acaf5b7df52', 'de', 'Das Volk, das verloren war, wird heimgeführt'),
('83e925d3-71d1-6be1-eb88-3acaf5b7df52', 'en', 'The people who were lost shall be brought home'),
('754c5347-a8a3-64fe-b490-028195858b13', 'de', 'Das Volk, das im Finstern wandelt, sieht ein großes Licht'),
('754c5347-a8a3-64fe-b490-028195858b13', 'en', 'The people who walk in darkness see a great light'),
('5ba97f1f-e0bd-6ccc-25c0-86a71bcc4bce', 'de', 'Das Volk, das gefangen war, wird befreit werden'),
('5ba97f1f-e0bd-6ccc-25c0-86a71bcc4bce', 'en', 'The people who were captive shall be set free'),
('d1d0d698-a770-f8ff-88f7-4401378fabf2', 'de', 'Das Volk, das traurig ist, wird getröstet werden'),
('d1d0d698-a770-f8ff-88f7-4401378fabf2', 'en', 'The people who mourn shall be comforted'),
('a5bd11b5-0085-0102-8467-482b72cb426d', 'de', 'Drei, nach den Erzvätern'),
('a5bd11b5-0085-0102-8467-482b72cb426d', 'en', 'Three, according to the patriarchs'),
('08761893-7d52-d8d6-c602-82acbc1c71a5', 'de', 'Sieben, nach den Tagen der Woche'),
('08761893-7d52-d8d6-c602-82acbc1c71a5', 'en', 'Seven, according to the days of the week'),
('cfd24488-ad08-10f3-a440-5f723f0be539', 'de', 'Zwölf, nach der Zahl der Stämme Jakobs'),
('cfd24488-ad08-10f3-a440-5f723f0be539', 'en', 'Twelve, according to the number of the tribes of Jacob'),
('cd56fe7c-cb10-d925-ac6a-bbaa925f2530', 'de', 'Vierzig, nach den Tagen der Wüste'),
('cd56fe7c-cb10-d925-ac6a-bbaa925f2530', 'en', 'Forty, according to the days in the wilderness'),
('71696889-f4f4-eb2b-8e42-853f5dd5db99', 'de', 'Sie vergeht wie die Blume des Feldes'),
('71696889-f4f4-eb2b-8e42-853f5dd5db99', 'en', 'It fades like the flower of the field'),
('021a5d38-4b75-3c3e-f18c-e3a9d033808e', 'de', 'Sie kommt von oben, vom Vater des Lichts'),
('021a5d38-4b75-3c3e-f18c-e3a9d033808e', 'en', 'It comes from above, from the Father of lights'),
('5699ba73-4c27-d10d-c4e5-d30cf9fd68d0', 'de', 'Sie ist den Weisen allein vorbehalten'),
('5699ba73-4c27-d10d-c4e5-d30cf9fd68d0', 'en', 'It is reserved for the wise alone'),
('11310865-eaa4-eabc-36c1-d44209367a1b', 'de', 'Sie wird durch eigenes Mühen verdient'),
('11310865-eaa4-eabc-36c1-d44209367a1b', 'en', 'It is earned by one''s own labor'),
('a220a828-3ab8-03d9-6379-57769d00a1bd', 'de', 'Bis zum Einbruch der Nacht'),
('a220a828-3ab8-03d9-6379-57769d00a1bd', 'en', 'Until nightfall'),
('037bd7b0-cbbd-1b6e-ad22-389b0f5d03b7', 'de', 'Sieben Runden täglich'),
('037bd7b0-cbbd-1b6e-ad22-389b0f5d03b7', 'en', 'Seven circuits daily'),
('5c267b3f-36a1-1290-b355-de8f04a335ac', 'de', 'Dreimal an jedem Tag'),
('5c267b3f-36a1-1290-b355-de8f04a335ac', 'en', 'Three times each day'),
('5ae03935-f657-57f4-1d7d-c2016fd4f70e', 'de', 'Einmal an sechs Tagen'),
('5ae03935-f657-57f4-1d7d-c2016fd4f70e', 'en', 'Once on each of six days'),
('0b28ee53-fae2-c0ae-ebe2-e9e1a7f4474a', 'de', 'Sollte ich mich nicht über die große Stadt erbarmen?'),
('0b28ee53-fae2-c0ae-ebe2-e9e1a7f4474a', 'en', 'Should I not have pity on the great city?'),
('6e7275e1-4ba9-96e9-f71f-20a570cfaccf', 'de', 'Warum hast du mich verlassen?'),
('6e7275e1-4ba9-96e9-f71f-20a570cfaccf', 'en', 'Why have you forsaken me?'),
('a2d89f57-61c3-8bfe-2add-d3d7239ccc2d', 'de', 'Wer hat dich zum Propheten gemacht?'),
('a2d89f57-61c3-8bfe-2add-d3d7239ccc2d', 'en', 'Who made you a prophet?'),
('235db94b-004a-2800-2e73-46ea3158050d', 'de', 'Wohin willst du nun fliehen?'),
('235db94b-004a-2800-2e73-46ea3158050d', 'en', 'Where will you flee now?'),
('a3104fd2-82f8-a0e5-ec5f-9c2b9a8d777b', 'de', 'Er lief weg vor Furcht'),
('a3104fd2-82f8-a0e5-ec5f-9c2b9a8d777b', 'en', 'He ran away in fear'),
('2ca20de8-9526-fa9c-8723-5601b08a2609', 'de', 'Er fiel vor Petrus auf die Knie'),
('2ca20de8-9526-fa9c-8723-5601b08a2609', 'en', 'He fell on his knees before Peter'),
('27821376-2531-0504-e511-0e5ff5f7495d', 'de', 'Er schwieg vor Staunen'),
('27821376-2531-0504-e511-0e5ff5f7495d', 'en', 'He was silent with astonishment'),
('49052a35-c994-9151-f677-c0a2197236a5', 'de', 'Er sprang auf, ging umher und lobte Gott'),
('49052a35-c994-9151-f677-c0a2197236a5', 'en', 'He leaped up, walked, and praised God'),
('77036947-2e71-df9c-b1e2-78e103348d58', 'de', 'Gott ist ein Feuer, das niemand schaut'),
('77036947-2e71-df9c-b1e2-78e103348d58', 'en', 'God is a fire that no one beholds'),
('ec25a472-74f8-406c-ed35-579af6cbfcaf', 'de', 'Gott ist Licht, und keine Finsternis ist in ihm'),
('ec25a472-74f8-406c-ed35-579af6cbfcaf', 'en', 'God is light, and there is no darkness in him'),
('78538f2b-01a6-223d-45e8-493285babcec', 'de', 'Gott ist ein Schatten über den Wassern'),
('78538f2b-01a6-223d-45e8-493285babcec', 'en', 'God is a shadow over the waters'),
('155d5673-5edf-85a3-912c-ac71d71f46d4', 'de', 'Gott ist verhüllt in tiefem Dunkel'),
('155d5673-5edf-85a3-912c-ac71d71f46d4', 'en', 'God is veiled in deep darkness'),
('4afee068-57ac-8ffe-ef55-79bbfe32289c', 'de', 'Weil Hiob seinen Reichtum betrauerte'),
('4afee068-57ac-8ffe-ef55-79bbfe32289c', 'en', 'Because Job mourned his wealth'),
('6e90931f-afe1-41fb-670b-5783ef32c464', 'de', 'Weil Hiob sich selbst gerechter machte als Gott'),
('6e90931f-afe1-41fb-670b-5783ef32c464', 'en', 'Because Job justified himself rather than God'),
('41412261-382b-359b-a97b-98f12a5d39f7', 'de', 'Weil Hiob die Freunde beschimpft hatte'),
('41412261-382b-359b-a97b-98f12a5d39f7', 'en', 'Because Job had insulted the friends'),
('5b3504b7-7987-e2d1-ba67-7e531bf8efb8', 'de', 'Weil Hiob das Opfer versäumt hatte'),
('5b3504b7-7987-e2d1-ba67-7e531bf8efb8', 'en', 'Because Job had neglected the sacrifice'),
('87c9a8f8-1989-ebe3-6785-59b353037a9f', 'de', 'Wasche dich im Jordan'),
('87c9a8f8-1989-ebe3-6785-59b353037a9f', 'en', 'Wash yourself in the Jordan'),
('a85ad561-a4ac-8a00-a494-42e20bf729b2', 'de', 'Zeige dich dem Priester'),
('a85ad561-a4ac-8a00-a494-42e20bf729b2', 'en', 'Show yourself to the priest'),
('e9cec74b-f5ce-8129-ff08-a704a68c1657', 'de', 'Hebe deine Arme zum Himmel'),
('e9cec74b-f5ce-8129-ff08-a704a68c1657', 'en', 'Lift your arms to heaven'),
('9ec608cf-5232-a592-a1df-d4073052108f', 'de', 'Strecke deine Hand aus'),
('9ec608cf-5232-a592-a1df-d4073052108f', 'en', 'Stretch out your hand'),
('ba86c350-5c24-5de3-b369-791f196e41ad', 'de', 'Die singende Lerche'),
('ba86c350-5c24-5de3-b369-791f196e41ad', 'en', 'The singing lark'),
('45416c57-935e-611d-5ec6-1a8c68bf1703', 'de', 'Den heulenden Wolf'),
('45416c57-935e-611d-5ec6-1a8c68bf1703', 'en', 'The howling wolf'),
('d408395d-898d-eef6-0ef5-a12f04b01426', 'de', 'Den brüllenden Löwen'),
('d408395d-898d-eef6-0ef5-a12f04b01426', 'en', 'The roaring lion'),
('42e038a6-7410-d434-19bf-434bb135cc4c', 'de', 'Den krähenden Hahn'),
('42e038a6-7410-d434-19bf-434bb135cc4c', 'en', 'The crowing rooster'),
('35af26eb-d628-035a-3be9-e6aeca292288', 'de', 'Dreißig Jahre alt, und er regierte vierzig Jahre'),
('35af26eb-d628-035a-3be9-e6aeca292288', 'en', 'Thirty years old, and he reigned forty years'),
('81b4dd8c-3903-09bb-e6fd-5efd9c8d49e7', 'de', 'Zwanzig Jahre alt, und er regierte dreißig Jahre'),
('81b4dd8c-3903-09bb-e6fd-5efd9c8d49e7', 'en', 'Twenty years old, and he reigned thirty years'),
('ae96edbc-fc5d-eb21-0b79-935fd2e3c668', 'de', 'Fünfundzwanzig Jahre alt, und er regierte fünfzig Jahre'),
('ae96edbc-fc5d-eb21-0b79-935fd2e3c668', 'en', 'Twenty-five years old, and he reigned fifty years'),
('e2608790-caf5-bd01-1372-46034d767aa8', 'de', 'Vierzig Jahre alt, und er regierte zwanzig Jahre'),
('e2608790-caf5-bd01-1372-46034d767aa8', 'en', 'Forty years old, and he reigned twenty years'),
('13541ff5-7a26-05da-3e23-0d4fc03141bd', 'de', 'Mit dem Lernen vieler Sprachen'),
('13541ff5-7a26-05da-3e23-0d4fc03141bd', 'en', 'With learning many languages'),
('4c0de905-117e-8710-fed8-327be5f99eb6', 'de', 'Mit dem Streben nach Reichtum'),
('4c0de905-117e-8710-fed8-327be5f99eb6', 'en', 'With the pursuit of riches'),
('4c6c0373-134c-bbed-3853-44c1cb2def83', 'de', 'Mit der Ehre der Menschen'),
('4c6c0373-134c-bbed-3853-44c1cb2def83', 'en', 'With the honor of people'),
('9984f005-acba-8886-704b-1b0ba745a2db', 'de', 'Mit der Furcht des HERRN'),
('9984f005-acba-8886-704b-1b0ba745a2db', 'en', 'With the fear of the LORD'),
('dc67f08b-eef3-57a1-0e88-c9eb714efe8f', 'de', 'Das erste Passah in Ägypten'),
('dc67f08b-eef3-57a1-0e88-c9eb714efe8f', 'en', 'The first Passover in Egypt'),
('49a861d1-8f0a-a0d2-5e33-803db875a8eb', 'de', 'Das Passah nach Aarons Tod'),
('49a861d1-8f0a-a0d2-5e33-803db875a8eb', 'en', 'The Passover after Aaron''s death'),
('d31696c8-c9ff-5d60-7c36-00af7a000729', 'de', 'Das Passah im gelobten Land'),
('d31696c8-c9ff-5d60-7c36-00af7a000729', 'en', 'The Passover in the Promised Land'),
('93d201f4-40af-e460-0078-e46ee2155312', 'de', 'Das Passah zur festgesetzten Zeit nach dem Auszug'),
('93d201f4-40af-e460-0078-e46ee2155312', 'en', 'The Passover at the appointed time after the Exodus'),
('3d000036-b83a-9811-3e9b-b62e8c5cbcf6', 'de', 'Ein eifernder und rächender Gott'),
('3d000036-b83a-9811-3e9b-b62e8c5cbcf6', 'en', 'A jealous and avenging God'),
('d7dcec37-f4c0-0fcd-e45c-d0f64c106c62', 'de', 'Ein ferner und schweigender Gott'),
('d7dcec37-f4c0-0fcd-e45c-d0f64c106c62', 'en', 'A distant and silent God'),
('d36d5143-a904-9ef9-683c-c6d8d24af04f', 'de', 'Ein verborgener und unbekannter Gott'),
('d36d5143-a904-9ef9-683c-c6d8d24af04f', 'en', 'A hidden and unknown God'),
('b7990d60-cdad-e316-f9d1-ffc685fb613b', 'de', 'Ein milder und nachsichtiger Gott'),
('b7990d60-cdad-e316-f9d1-ffc685fb613b', 'en', 'A mild and lenient God'),
('1452cf3e-f72d-aa26-6d0c-b6bce67c77c5', 'de', 'Sein Antlitz erbleichte und seine Knie schlugen aneinander'),
('1452cf3e-f72d-aa26-6d0c-b6bce67c77c5', 'en', 'His face turned pale and his knees knocked together'),
('dc2bac6c-02f4-1978-faa6-3c7847c7787a', 'de', 'Er setzte das Gelage ruhig fort'),
('dc2bac6c-02f4-1978-faa6-3c7847c7787a', 'en', 'He calmly continued the banquet'),
('583287da-9f33-eb5e-bee0-6c7fef1e5785', 'de', 'Er befahl, die Wand zu zerstören'),
('583287da-9f33-eb5e-bee0-6c7fef1e5785', 'en', 'He ordered the wall destroyed'),
('c51e7fb8-62ab-8ba2-0bad-f89b5d2ca864', 'de', 'Er lachte über die Erscheinung'),
('c51e7fb8-62ab-8ba2-0bad-f89b5d2ca864', 'en', 'He laughed at the apparition'),
('bbc5dfd5-435b-e54c-e979-87216eb85379', 'de', 'Die Hand des HERRN kam über ihn und er lief vor Ahabs Wagen her'),
('bbc5dfd5-435b-e54c-e979-87216eb85379', 'en', 'The hand of the LORD came on him and he ran before Ahab''s chariot'),
('0c2e0d0c-a4cc-b896-2cae-eac4f7dc768c', 'de', 'Er ritt auf einem feurigen Pferd'),
('0c2e0d0c-a4cc-b896-2cae-eac4f7dc768c', 'en', 'He rode on a fiery horse'),
('6dccffeb-5757-f78f-2b07-4216f2dafae9', 'de', 'Ein Engel trug ihn durch die Luft'),
('6dccffeb-5757-f78f-2b07-4216f2dafae9', 'en', 'An angel carried him through the air'),
('cb917d47-7178-87aa-d563-28dc856f8c10', 'de', 'Er nahm eine geheime Abkürzung durch die Berge'),
('cb917d47-7178-87aa-d563-28dc856f8c10', 'en', 'He took a secret shortcut through the mountains'),
('68c08c8d-5013-e1b2-4fd6-432d50c67288', 'de', 'Er stellte sich wahnsinnig und kratzte an den Türen'),
('68c08c8d-5013-e1b2-4fd6-432d50c67288', 'en', 'He pretended to be insane and scratched at the doors'),
('5c0c09f1-9337-fdc4-35a1-9992f8e4c936', 'de', 'Er bestach den König mit Beute'),
('5c0c09f1-9337-fdc4-35a1-9992f8e4c936', 'en', 'He bribed the king with spoils'),
('ea45ace4-bd9a-5dd4-dd9f-278cd2eaea06', 'de', 'Er bot sich als Söldner an'),
('ea45ace4-bd9a-5dd4-dd9f-278cd2eaea06', 'en', 'He offered himself as a mercenary'),
('63039434-07f0-06f2-0972-e907a388e43b', 'de', 'Er floh bei Nacht über die Mauer'),
('63039434-07f0-06f2-0972-e907a388e43b', 'en', 'He fled over the wall by night'),
('f325aca3-18df-bec8-3da6-e8621130cb63', 'de', 'Er gab ihm den Thron über Israel zurück'),
('f325aca3-18df-bec8-3da6-e8621130cb63', 'en', 'He returned the throne over Israel to him'),
('3bb664c2-9153-e7d1-d011-b7cb6429c3a7', 'de', 'Er erwies dem lahmen Mefiboschet Güte und ließ ihn an seiner Tafel essen'),
('3bb664c2-9153-e7d1-d011-b7cb6429c3a7', 'en', 'He showed kindness to the lame Mephibosheth and let him eat at his table'),
('3c9fb67c-fca4-c071-a6b8-d9d81f70ebdb', 'de', 'Er sandte ihn als Gesandten nach Tyrus'),
('3c9fb67c-fca4-c071-a6b8-d9d81f70ebdb', 'en', 'He sent him as an envoy to Tyre'),
('a539c778-df32-2a90-79eb-1f1596bd31f8', 'de', 'Er machte ihn zum Heerführer von Juda'),
('a539c778-df32-2a90-79eb-1f1596bd31f8', 'en', 'He made him commander of Judah''s army'),
('2caa5073-924c-2a5d-f9dc-c3db28ab8595', 'de', 'Zu ruhen im einmal empfangenen Glauben'),
('2caa5073-924c-2a5d-f9dc-c3db28ab8595', 'en', 'To rest in the faith once received'),
('5311b840-4e14-f16c-4796-2fc7e7254033', 'de', 'Zu fliehen vor allen schweren Fragen'),
('5311b840-4e14-f16c-4796-2fc7e7254033', 'en', 'To flee from all hard questions'),
('4bfeca15-fc93-a42f-7af6-0e0dda53170f', 'de', 'Zu schweigen über die empfangene Lehre'),
('4bfeca15-fc93-a42f-7af6-0e0dda53170f', 'en', 'To be silent about the teaching received'),
('5e628e25-20aa-e249-e1a1-daf6d8060bfc', 'de', 'Zu wachsen in der Gnade und Erkenntnis Jesu Christi'),
('5e628e25-20aa-e249-e1a1-daf6d8060bfc', 'en', 'To grow in the grace and knowledge of Jesus Christ'),
('3e2263e0-0949-fb0e-5a9b-16f1669428c1', 'de', 'Dein Wille geschehe wie im Himmel, so auf Erden'),
('3e2263e0-0949-fb0e-5a9b-16f1669428c1', 'en', 'Your will be done, on earth as it is in heaven'),
('d040ff9e-c37c-2f75-a1fa-940b3ece0b6f', 'de', 'Gib uns Frieden in unseren Tagen'),
('d040ff9e-c37c-2f75-a1fa-940b3ece0b6f', 'en', 'Give us peace in our days'),
('0ba6f6e1-54df-3ed8-3250-14ae5eb1c086', 'de', 'Führe uns in dein Heiligtum'),
('0ba6f6e1-54df-3ed8-3250-14ae5eb1c086', 'en', 'Lead us into your sanctuary'),
('7dc14bbc-59aa-aea6-2969-91df16dc138d', 'de', 'Bewahre uns vor den Feinden'),
('7dc14bbc-59aa-aea6-2969-91df16dc138d', 'en', 'Keep us from our enemies'),
('19063e27-d754-262a-887c-8655d5316a7f', 'de', 'Er segnete nur den Erstgeborenen Manasse'),
('19063e27-d754-262a-887c-8655d5316a7f', 'en', 'He blessed only the firstborn Manasseh'),
('fb6dc792-1743-539b-842d-ec72e02a5690', 'de', 'Er legte beiden gleichzeitig beide Hände auf'),
('fb6dc792-1743-539b-842d-ec72e02a5690', 'en', 'He laid both hands on each at the same time'),
('083e287a-db01-c54c-27eb-4902979d070c', 'de', 'Er weigerte sich, beide zu segnen'),
('083e287a-db01-c54c-27eb-4902979d070c', 'en', 'He refused to bless either of them'),
('40ad2041-172f-88cd-9aa7-b9d494b68bab', 'de', 'Er kreuzte die Hände und gab dem Jüngeren den größeren Segen'),
('40ad2041-172f-88cd-9aa7-b9d494b68bab', 'en', 'He crossed his hands and gave the younger the greater blessing'),
('4d1458c9-5942-a1c2-156e-e6e24cd130c3', 'de', 'Sie werden Gottes Kinder heißen'),
('4d1458c9-5942-a1c2-156e-e6e24cd130c3', 'en', 'They shall be called children of God'),
('73e02c12-ab8c-ae9a-e897-be78bdb61e19', 'de', 'Sie werden Barmherzigkeit erlangen'),
('73e02c12-ab8c-ae9a-e897-be78bdb61e19', 'en', 'They shall obtain mercy'),
('49b14683-fb57-e68f-3f7f-442cc67b854f', 'de', 'Sie werden getröstet werden'),
('49b14683-fb57-e68f-3f7f-442cc67b854f', 'en', 'They shall be comforted'),
('af8ccf43-2841-a3bc-c99f-f8a03839dba3', 'de', 'Sie werden das Erdreich besitzen'),
('af8ccf43-2841-a3bc-c99f-f8a03839dba3', 'en', 'They shall inherit the earth'),
('26ceeb24-0ab6-f56e-c11d-bb3a8c23ea84', 'de', 'Reichtum und Armut'),
('26ceeb24-0ab6-f56e-c11d-bb3a8c23ea84', 'en', 'Wealth and poverty'),
('042d7c28-5cd4-6e0e-953f-308206dae1c8', 'de', 'Krieg und Frieden'),
('042d7c28-5cd4-6e0e-953f-308206dae1c8', 'en', 'War and peace'),
('59bad10b-fe99-a607-25f8-d8a4d9f530ba', 'de', 'Ruhe und Mühsal'),
('59bad10b-fe99-a607-25f8-d8a4d9f530ba', 'en', 'Rest and toil'),
('99f89e69-6c73-929a-7c04-c9c0e98fda60', 'de', 'Leben und Tod, Segen und Fluch'),
('99f89e69-6c73-929a-7c04-c9c0e98fda60', 'en', 'Life and death, blessing and curse'),
('a57cb0be-f388-0d60-f15d-e3e05fd6a64b', 'de', 'Aaron'),
('a57cb0be-f388-0d60-f15d-e3e05fd6a64b', 'en', 'Aaron'),
('e9fec5bb-34b0-ae04-9be6-0a15e30d9dc2', 'de', 'Kaleb'),
('e9fec5bb-34b0-ae04-9be6-0a15e30d9dc2', 'en', 'Caleb'),
('3c2e3898-140d-676d-0525-e9e0aeaa9af0', 'de', 'Josua'),
('3c2e3898-140d-676d-0525-e9e0aeaa9af0', 'en', 'Joshua'),
('d1c0b870-ae09-eb87-badc-b39a097e2c93', 'de', 'Hur'),
('d1c0b870-ae09-eb87-badc-b39a097e2c93', 'en', 'Hur'),
('4b501f71-db4f-df31-d8d9-8315b68a85aa', 'de', 'Verkaufe ihn an einen anderen'),
('4b501f71-db4f-df31-d8d9-8315b68a85aa', 'en', 'Sell him to another'),
('4e68a968-290b-88cc-1d6e-20e0da3dab94', 'de', 'Nimm ihn auf wie mich selbst'),
('4e68a968-290b-88cc-1d6e-20e0da3dab94', 'en', 'Receive him as you would receive me'),
('ef2924d2-0a55-ee7f-0140-82203ec8b589', 'de', 'Bestrafe ihn nach dem Gesetz'),
('ef2924d2-0a55-ee7f-0140-82203ec8b589', 'en', 'Punish him by the law'),
('38457478-ff84-67c0-d830-46a6009c6efd', 'de', 'Halte ihn fern von dir'),
('38457478-ff84-67c0-d830-46a6009c6efd', 'en', 'Keep him far from you'),
('c373be2b-9039-510b-41fc-e5f47e57ce3e', 'de', 'Um mit seinem Harfenspiel den geplagten Saul zu beruhigen'),
('c373be2b-9039-510b-41fc-e5f47e57ce3e', 'en', 'To soothe the troubled Saul with his harp playing'),
('d14fb39e-1195-27cc-f8b8-86876eefc4f3', 'de', 'Um Sauls Heer zu befehligen'),
('d14fb39e-1195-27cc-f8b8-86876eefc4f3', 'en', 'To command Saul''s army'),
('8be304dd-9c2c-caf0-5a89-8e7f6b6f4ea7', 'de', 'Um Botschaften zu überbringen'),
('8be304dd-9c2c-caf0-5a89-8e7f6b6f4ea7', 'en', 'To deliver messages'),
('14ab5a49-e034-f8af-00c8-01af081ceece', 'de', 'Um die Schafe des Königs zu hüten'),
('14ab5a49-e034-f8af-00c8-01af081ceece', 'en', 'To tend the king''s sheep'),
('c846aafd-7f26-41f1-1ce1-5218d9856a4c', 'de', 'Geh hin und sündige nicht mehr'),
('c846aafd-7f26-41f1-1ce1-5218d9856a4c', 'en', 'Go and sin no more'),
('26e1581e-2094-3b0e-4242-c0635f2015a9', 'de', 'Deine Sünden sind dir vergeben'),
('26e1581e-2094-3b0e-4242-c0635f2015a9', 'en', 'Your sins are forgiven you'),
('8959ad30-d3d1-a2b8-444d-985e98fde581', 'de', 'Sei stark und fürchte dich nicht'),
('8959ad30-d3d1-a2b8-444d-985e98fde581', 'en', 'Be strong and do not fear'),
('1634c56d-1e81-0d32-23b6-394094d5972a', 'de', 'Steh auf und nimm dein Bett'),
('1634c56d-1e81-0d32-23b6-394094d5972a', 'en', 'Rise and take up your bed'),
('b6dd1857-3c7d-05ac-842e-a0ae7389757a', 'de', 'Siehe, ich will ein Neues schaffen, jetzt wächst es auf'),
('b6dd1857-3c7d-05ac-842e-a0ae7389757a', 'en', 'Behold, I am doing a new thing, now it springs forth'),
('df1eb4f0-c47d-f840-c4ad-974667d9b9fa', 'de', 'Siehe, ich will die Erde zerstören und neu beginnen'),
('df1eb4f0-c47d-f840-c4ad-974667d9b9fa', 'en', 'Behold, I will destroy the earth and start anew'),
('166c00b8-f6d9-fcd5-73e0-46a8afd6936a', 'de', 'Siehe, ich will das Alte wiederbringen, wie es einst war'),
('166c00b8-f6d9-fcd5-73e0-46a8afd6936a', 'en', 'Behold, I will bring back the old as it once was'),
('0e2c4d9c-6fb8-faf8-86d8-0072aa4a11f5', 'de', 'Siehe, ich will das Volk verstoßen, das mich verließ'),
('0e2c4d9c-6fb8-faf8-86d8-0072aa4a11f5', 'en', 'Behold, I will cast off the people who forsook me'),
('5003fa3d-3c84-4cc8-28c4-2424b03a654c', 'de', 'Am ersten Tag der Woche'),
('5003fa3d-3c84-4cc8-28c4-2424b03a654c', 'en', 'On the first day of the week'),
('7784ed76-a10b-66f2-5608-56bfb9b5a561', 'de', 'Am Rüsttag vor dem Fest'),
('7784ed76-a10b-66f2-5608-56bfb9b5a561', 'en', 'On the day of preparation before the feast'),
('e4ce9137-65ab-419f-41ec-21d12542f21b', 'de', 'Am dritten Tag des Monats'),
('e4ce9137-65ab-419f-41ec-21d12542f21b', 'en', 'On the third day of the month'),
('8177143a-af3e-6706-0437-b2a123e75735', 'de', 'Am Tag des Sabbats'),
('8177143a-af3e-6706-0437-b2a123e75735', 'en', 'On the day of the Sabbath'),
('ed753da7-49cc-c03f-ca1d-733d581eace4', 'de', 'Der Spötter sucht eifrig die Zucht'),
('ed753da7-49cc-c03f-ca1d-733d581eace4', 'en', 'The mocker eagerly seeks correction'),
('4a3bb5e4-6772-46e4-3ff2-ea54766ab2f0', 'de', 'Der Spötter liebt es nicht, dass man ihn zurechtweist'),
('4a3bb5e4-6772-46e4-3ff2-ea54766ab2f0', 'en', 'The mocker does not love to be corrected'),
('717773b8-1a9b-5f30-3f6e-c8ff52017f63', 'de', 'Der Spötter ehrt den Weisen'),
('717773b8-1a9b-5f30-3f6e-c8ff52017f63', 'en', 'The mocker honors the wise'),
('0b359619-290a-d4d9-728b-7b0072cc07b5', 'de', 'Der Spötter dankt dem, der ihn tadelt'),
('0b359619-290a-d4d9-728b-7b0072cc07b5', 'en', 'The mocker thanks the one who rebukes him'),
('c1ab244f-6308-c7bd-4cf7-c61ea3af2606', 'de', '… verbergen'),
('c1ab244f-6308-c7bd-4cf7-c61ea3af2606', 'en', '… hide love'),
('fa9bfb28-0a2f-f50a-4fa1-1577bba25b04', 'de', '… auslöschen'),
('fa9bfb28-0a2f-f50a-4fa1-1577bba25b04', 'en', '… quench love'),
('29fc1dde-6e13-c2fc-9d19-af263ad5150e', 'de', '… kühlen'),
('29fc1dde-6e13-c2fc-9d19-af263ad5150e', 'en', '… cool love'),
('b613e84c-1c19-7ae8-0c53-7ab560dd9c00', 'de', '… mehren'),
('b613e84c-1c19-7ae8-0c53-7ab560dd9c00', 'en', '… increase love'),
('438f348d-627c-0c62-652e-299bda65f591', 'de', 'Fest wie die ewigen Berge'),
('438f348d-627c-0c62-652e-299bda65f591', 'en', 'Firm as the eternal mountains'),
('d51eb0c2-b3d6-7fb9-f559-db20e5311bed', 'de', 'Beständig wie der Lauf der Sonne'),
('d51eb0c2-b3d6-7fb9-f559-db20e5311bed', 'en', 'Steady as the course of the sun'),
('091b8516-89c6-9316-99e4-17628e31870f', 'de', 'Schneller als ein Weberschiffchen'),
('091b8516-89c6-9316-99e4-17628e31870f', 'en', 'Swifter than a weaver''s shuttle'),
('caf47a94-5da4-c45f-1d95-bc7e487c736a', 'de', 'Tief wie die Wasser des Meeres'),
('caf47a94-5da4-c45f-1d95-bc7e487c736a', 'en', 'Deep as the waters of the sea'),
('b2492e1d-d802-1034-885d-35bff8521837', 'de', '… aber der Ehre geht Demut voraus'),
('b2492e1d-d802-1034-885d-35bff8521837', 'en', '… but humility comes before honor'),
('72d26b45-60f5-f4c7-d248-6fd8191a0985', 'de', '… aber der Weisheit folgt die Torheit'),
('72d26b45-60f5-f4c7-d248-6fd8191a0985', 'en', '… but folly follows wisdom'),
('cca2a404-cfed-9134-7559-e409a4614559', 'de', '… aber dem Reichtum folgt der Fall'),
('cca2a404-cfed-9134-7559-e409a4614559', 'en', '… but riches follow the fall'),
('c262fe7b-0de6-0d2c-86e0-d45b8fc6bc69', 'de', '… aber dem Stolz folgt die Ehre'),
('c262fe7b-0de6-0d2c-86e0-d45b8fc6bc69', 'en', '… but honor follows pride')
insert into public.answer_option_translations (option_id, lang, text) values
('3749cd7e-8569-3bfc-cf23-b132884a2001', 'de', 'Er bestrich seine Augen mit einem Brei aus Erde'),
('3749cd7e-8569-3bfc-cf23-b132884a2001', 'en', 'He smeared his eyes with mud paste'),
('7e5208ea-6bb4-dabd-3254-9d414c39620c', 'de', 'Er speichelte auf seine Augen und legte zweimal die Hände auf'),
('7e5208ea-6bb4-dabd-3254-9d414c39620c', 'en', 'He spat on his eyes and laid hands on him twice'),
('234f9adb-ee3f-84a2-673a-8c92cfdf9aa9', 'de', 'Er sprach ein einziges Wort aus der Ferne'),
('234f9adb-ee3f-84a2-673a-8c92cfdf9aa9', 'en', 'He spoke a single word from afar'),
('21442e9b-66c7-a076-9628-9ffff50fb502', 'de', 'Er sandte ihn zum Waschen an den Jordan'),
('21442e9b-66c7-a076-9628-9ffff50fb502', 'en', 'He sent him to wash in the Jordan'),
('b3730d1e-37af-8a8d-6454-af38a11ec2b9', 'de', 'Gehasi sollte den König holen'),
('b3730d1e-37af-8a8d-6454-af38a11ec2b9', 'en', 'Gehazi was to fetch the king'),
('94df77c9-789d-065e-8683-a44fd6bae802', 'de', 'Gehasi sollte ein Grab graben'),
('94df77c9-789d-065e-8683-a44fd6bae802', 'en', 'Gehazi was to dig a grave'),
('67c493f6-2d37-6e86-f509-9b5f5ec3d6b3', 'de', 'Gehasi sollte mit dem Stab aufs Gesicht des Kindes legen'),
('67c493f6-2d37-6e86-f509-9b5f5ec3d6b3', 'en', 'Gehazi was to lay the staff on the child''s face'),
('bf5c92d8-f509-0d1b-9559-fd482ed5dd9d', 'de', 'Gehasi sollte Öl bringen'),
('bf5c92d8-f509-0d1b-9559-fd482ed5dd9d', 'en', 'Gehazi was to bring oil'),
('73aa534e-1871-5952-9585-5e1529ad1122', 'de', 'Judas, der Verräter'),
('73aa534e-1871-5952-9585-5e1529ad1122', 'en', 'Judas, the betrayer'),
('371fbf38-d82a-5a3d-d62e-af8bd15a6e31', 'de', 'Ein Pharisäer in der Menge'),
('371fbf38-d82a-5a3d-d62e-af8bd15a6e31', 'en', 'A Pharisee in the crowd'),
('d147c8d2-4b63-fdf5-86bb-8f54a3939f53', 'de', 'Einer der Jünger zog das Schwert'),
('d147c8d2-4b63-fdf5-86bb-8f54a3939f53', 'en', 'One of the disciples drew the sword'),
('68743573-414b-e03d-8f04-8e445bb03d20', 'de', 'Ein römischer Soldat'),
('68743573-414b-e03d-8f04-8e445bb03d20', 'en', 'A Roman soldier'),
('ef84f482-51bc-5c16-f4eb-9001a3ff4896', 'de', 'Ich mache dich zum Licht der Heiden, dass mein Heil bis ans Ende der Erde reiche'),
('ef84f482-51bc-5c16-f4eb-9001a3ff4896', 'en', 'I make you a light to the nations, that my salvation may reach the ends of the earth'),
('ade0cbfa-ea4c-b09e-b90d-78d83e7c6f52', 'de', 'Ich mache dich zum Schrecken der Heiden, dass sie vor dir fliehen'),
('ade0cbfa-ea4c-b09e-b90d-78d83e7c6f52', 'en', 'I make you a terror to the nations, that they flee before you'),
('60aa3a02-0ed7-d02d-4ba5-06700ad78955', 'de', 'Ich mache dich zum Richter der Heiden, dass du sie strafest'),
('60aa3a02-0ed7-d02d-4ba5-06700ad78955', 'en', 'I make you a judge of the nations, that you may punish them'),
('10cf8626-63a5-b024-4e32-96841fd6b070', 'de', 'Ich mache dich zum Herrn der Heiden, dass sie dir Tribut bringen'),
('10cf8626-63a5-b024-4e32-96841fd6b070', 'en', 'I make you a lord of the nations, that they bring you tribute'),
('559dfb50-6679-ab34-d75f-30b69b1b9438', 'de', 'Er war von den Wurzeln an verdorrt'),
('559dfb50-6679-ab34-d75f-30b69b1b9438', 'en', 'It was withered from the roots up'),
('5f5fbf38-6e4f-9ca5-2e0e-ca8ccfef1e8f', 'de', 'Er stand grün und unverändert'),
('5f5fbf38-6e4f-9ca5-2e0e-ca8ccfef1e8f', 'en', 'It stood green and unchanged'),
('d5c4b8c9-3747-852a-45bb-059c13761c49', 'de', 'Er trug plötzlich reife Früchte'),
('d5c4b8c9-3747-852a-45bb-059c13761c49', 'en', 'It suddenly bore ripe fruit'),
('295f649c-7ee2-c181-10a6-d48a2e5eab45', 'de', 'Er war über Nacht umgestürzt'),
('295f649c-7ee2-c181-10a6-d48a2e5eab45', 'en', 'It had fallen over in the night'),
('f04e971e-9f07-3443-0301-82bbff0276b2', 'de', 'Hanna und Peninna, die Nebenfrauen'),
('f04e971e-9f07-3443-0301-82bbff0276b2', 'en', 'Hannah and Peninnah, the co-wives'),
('87fffbd5-4bba-0af7-1297-dc48807358ec', 'de', 'Lea und Rahel, die Schwestern'),
('87fffbd5-4bba-0af7-1297-dc48807358ec', 'en', 'Leah and Rachel, the sisters'),
('37987e87-27fb-59eb-c0ee-5c9cdbc93b51', 'de', 'Orpa und Rut, die Moabiterinnen'),
('37987e87-27fb-59eb-c0ee-5c9cdbc93b51', 'en', 'Orpah and Ruth, the Moabite women'),
('532e70fe-e0c7-67f3-88e2-e6f0391cc8e0', 'de', 'Milka und Jiska, die Verwandten'),
('532e70fe-e0c7-67f3-88e2-e6f0391cc8e0', 'en', 'Milcah and Iscah, the relatives'),
('c5fd119d-e65b-355c-813b-5a8043aebd30', 'de', 'Er gehorchte sogleich und folgte Jesus'),
('c5fd119d-e65b-355c-813b-5a8043aebd30', 'en', 'He obeyed at once and followed Jesus'),
('a3eb6233-24f3-eb36-1d8b-8d8ce068e99b', 'de', 'Er lachte über die Forderung'),
('a3eb6233-24f3-eb36-1d8b-8d8ce068e99b', 'en', 'He laughed at the demand'),
('7da22402-7543-850f-588d-ce573551425b', 'de', 'Er bot stattdessen die Hälfte an'),
('7da22402-7543-850f-588d-ce573551425b', 'en', 'He offered half instead'),
('3b033cba-6ed5-5c55-3a47-5a5b700d752f', 'de', 'Er wurde traurig, denn er war sehr reich'),
('3b033cba-6ed5-5c55-3a47-5a5b700d752f', 'en', 'He became sad, for he was very rich'),
('db7f2333-68fb-256f-b286-47a03c464789', 'de', 'Er verachtet die Reichen'),
('db7f2333-68fb-256f-b286-47a03c464789', 'en', 'He despises the rich'),
('9ea16697-3f29-2e54-af10-f31310bc3a5e', 'de', 'Bei einem Sünder ist er eingekehrt'),
('9ea16697-3f29-2e54-af10-f31310bc3a5e', 'en', 'He has gone in to stay with a sinner'),
('61747dbe-89c2-60fb-4782-166a3863529d', 'de', 'Er bricht das Gesetz des Sabbats'),
('61747dbe-89c2-60fb-4782-166a3863529d', 'en', 'He breaks the law of the Sabbath'),
('5cbd5980-2573-b70b-d59b-7e2abe68d2c4', 'de', 'Er meidet die Armen'),
('5cbd5980-2573-b70b-d59b-7e2abe68d2c4', 'en', 'He avoids the poor'),
('2ca5fc7f-269b-3ed8-7fec-78ef6199051a', 'de', 'Zwölf gegen zwölf kämpften und fielen alle gemeinsam'),
('2ca5fc7f-269b-3ed8-7fec-78ef6199051a', 'en', 'Twelve against twelve fought and all fell together'),
('f270f761-2b41-a819-882a-bcb70bc205f0', 'de', 'Abners Männer flohen ohne Kampf'),
('f270f761-2b41-a819-882a-bcb70bc205f0', 'en', 'Abner''s men fled without a fight'),
('4cf0216a-f837-c3de-aaa6-042b3b9b798d', 'de', 'Joab nahm Abner gefangen ohne Blutvergießen'),
('4cf0216a-f837-c3de-aaa6-042b3b9b798d', 'en', 'Joab captured Abner without bloodshed'),
('43478d54-5f4d-f2dd-c414-8d31d8d97d9f', 'de', 'Sie schlossen sofort einen Friedensbund'),
('43478d54-5f4d-f2dd-c414-8d31d8d97d9f', 'en', 'They immediately made a peace covenant'),
('d78b8ad5-2591-25db-82ae-b9a1920377ed', 'de', 'In die Festung von Hazor'),
('d78b8ad5-2591-25db-82ae-b9a1920377ed', 'en', 'In the stronghold of Hazor'),
('c5e7e163-c24e-a02e-35ff-42e611c2fb8f', 'de', 'In die Berge von Juda'),
('c5e7e163-c24e-a02e-35ff-42e611c2fb8f', 'en', 'In the mountains of Judah'),
('0d220de8-2b79-3b2c-21a6-bd1a765f713e', 'de', 'In eine Höhle bei Makkeda'),
('0d220de8-2b79-3b2c-21a6-bd1a765f713e', 'en', 'In a cave at Makkedah'),
('6f427099-9237-5a0b-100a-7894e2abbe08', 'de', 'In den Wald von Ephraim'),
('6f427099-9237-5a0b-100a-7894e2abbe08', 'en', 'In the forest of Ephraim'),
('b013d7a5-c99e-b25a-c305-de92f14265a6', 'de', 'Tag und Nacht darüber nachsinnen'),
('b013d7a5-c99e-b25a-c305-de92f14265a6', 'en', 'Meditate on it day and night'),
('db329180-a0d5-ae71-00f0-4d21ce5dcb6d', 'de', 'Es nur den Priestern anvertrauen'),
('db329180-a0d5-ae71-00f0-4d21ce5dcb6d', 'en', 'Entrust it only to the priests'),
('9e02a50f-4056-0d19-81f9-6fa59d35e8f5', 'de', 'Es einmal im Jahr verlesen'),
('9e02a50f-4056-0d19-81f9-6fa59d35e8f5', 'en', 'Read it once a year'),
('b0e0e43d-85f1-fba5-56ad-bf26879baaa0', 'de', 'Es im Heiligtum verschließen'),
('b0e0e43d-85f1-fba5-56ad-bf26879baaa0', 'en', 'Lock it in the sanctuary'),
('a2319d06-ccfa-a683-ca8b-d2fc88152739', 'de', 'Er solle die Streitenden wegschicken'),
('a2319d06-ccfa-a683-ca8b-d2fc88152739', 'en', 'He should send the litigants away'),
('676086be-9b53-fdbe-e680-1d3fdbf265a3', 'de', 'Er solle nur am Sabbat richten'),
('676086be-9b53-fdbe-e680-1d3fdbf265a3', 'en', 'He should judge only on the Sabbath'),
('6c640e7f-823a-ee1b-2f47-cdfd4df487f8', 'de', 'Er solle fähige Männer als Vorsteher einsetzen'),
('6c640e7f-823a-ee1b-2f47-cdfd4df487f8', 'en', 'He should appoint capable men as officials'),
('0a314495-d45a-5d31-2290-179c156e1796', 'de', 'Er solle das Richten ganz aufgeben'),
('0a314495-d45a-5d31-2290-179c156e1796', 'en', 'He should give up judging entirely'),
('5265a48c-547c-92a1-ab46-e24319d7104f', 'de', 'Als Tag des Zorns, der Finsternis und des Dunkels'),
('5265a48c-547c-92a1-ab46-e24319d7104f', 'en', 'As a day of wrath, darkness and gloom'),
('181db28e-19ec-5fc9-ca70-0b3a2cbdd970', 'de', 'Als Tag der Ernte und des Überflusses'),
('181db28e-19ec-5fc9-ca70-0b3a2cbdd970', 'en', 'As a day of harvest and abundance'),
('39a949ff-ab50-d397-a038-032f8691807f', 'de', 'Als Tag der Hochzeit und Freude'),
('39a949ff-ab50-d397-a038-032f8691807f', 'en', 'As a day of wedding and joy'),
('b4bcd946-21dc-287a-8db7-9de3664ea0ef', 'de', 'Als Tag der Ruhe und des Sabbats'),
('b4bcd946-21dc-287a-8db7-9de3664ea0ef', 'en', 'As a day of rest and Sabbath'),
('683d8b00-b1cd-4a15-ca45-e8b081053540', 'de', 'Wandelt als Kinder des Lichts'),
('683d8b00-b1cd-4a15-ca45-e8b081053540', 'en', 'Walk as children of light'),
('0b025697-a3ba-5a98-229d-0a7327a43229', 'de', 'Wandelt in der Finsternis'),
('0b025697-a3ba-5a98-229d-0a7327a43229', 'en', 'Walk in darkness'),
('875d4be2-7c50-7ed4-1bb6-8b1f9bd54343', 'de', 'Wandelt nach dem Fleisch'),
('875d4be2-7c50-7ed4-1bb6-8b1f9bd54343', 'en', 'Walk according to the flesh'),
('81a46093-2b03-9c05-48b5-8cbd2e1061ae', 'de', 'Wandelt ohne ein Ziel'),
('81a46093-2b03-9c05-48b5-8cbd2e1061ae', 'en', 'Walk without a goal'),
('205c0fd4-3a2a-4e03-2e0a-cfbe88a94753', 'de', 'Er machte sie zu Anführerinnen'),
('205c0fd4-3a2a-4e03-2e0a-cfbe88a94753', 'en', 'He made them leaders'),
('4b7fa1c8-21af-2f59-affb-5d090557217a', 'de', 'Er erwies ihnen Gutes und schenkte ihnen Nachkommen'),
('4b7fa1c8-21af-2f59-affb-5d090557217a', 'en', 'He dealt well with them and gave them families'),
('bf7009eb-5365-4917-70a3-48214641a689', 'de', 'Er gab ihnen Gold und Silber'),
('bf7009eb-5365-4917-70a3-48214641a689', 'en', 'He gave them gold and silver'),
('f9fcc585-816d-8f10-4b5e-7922fad65e56', 'de', 'Er ließ sie nach Midian fliehen'),
('f9fcc585-816d-8f10-4b5e-7922fad65e56', 'en', 'He let them flee to Midian'),
('559396a5-ade0-5ee4-443e-002d5a5221d1', 'de', 'Sie verlangten einen König wie die anderen Völker'),
('559396a5-ade0-5ee4-443e-002d5a5221d1', 'en', 'They demanded a king like the other nations'),
('b1f04f94-4cf8-7409-6360-16d088d40f27', 'de', 'Sie verlangten die Absetzung der Priester'),
('b1f04f94-4cf8-7409-6360-16d088d40f27', 'en', 'They demanded the removal of the priests'),
('0ae5983d-d5e9-9cef-0455-e2c1861065e1', 'de', 'Sie verlangten die Rückkehr nach Ägypten'),
('0ae5983d-d5e9-9cef-0455-e2c1861065e1', 'en', 'They demanded a return to Egypt'),
('48bf2bae-213f-d447-c181-b9d8ac2de92c', 'de', 'Sie verlangten den Bau eines neuen Tempels'),
('48bf2bae-213f-d447-c181-b9d8ac2de92c', 'en', 'They demanded the building of a new temple'),
('8f498afd-8e52-a5ff-0f31-87dc781f723b', 'de', 'Wachet, denn ihr wisst weder Tag noch Stunde'),
('8f498afd-8e52-a5ff-0f31-87dc781f723b', 'en', 'Watch, for you know neither the day nor the hour'),
('c6f58057-8ab6-cc2a-e837-ea35fecbcf76', 'de', 'Bleibet nahe bei dem Tempel'),
('c6f58057-8ab6-cc2a-e837-ea35fecbcf76', 'en', 'Stay near the temple'),
('4da0edbc-0f91-b646-4475-55deadddd07e', 'de', 'Eilet stets dem Bräutigam voran'),
('4da0edbc-0f91-b646-4475-55deadddd07e', 'en', 'Always hasten ahead of the bridegroom'),
('3737a727-e9c7-2576-8b07-b4400e49d611', 'de', 'Teilet euer Öl mit den Bedürftigen'),
('3737a727-e9c7-2576-8b07-b4400e49d611', 'en', 'Share your oil with the needy'),
('26b3ba62-337a-9ae3-4ea8-95b55d88968d', 'de', 'Den Fremden widersteht er, den Verwandten gibt er Gnade'),
('26b3ba62-337a-9ae3-4ea8-95b55d88968d', 'en', 'He resists the stranger and gives grace to kin'),
('95afaac4-b71b-ea0b-e7e9-ac92235bce30', 'de', 'Den Schwachen widersteht er, den Starken gibt er Gnade'),
('95afaac4-b71b-ea0b-e7e9-ac92235bce30', 'en', 'He resists the weak and gives grace to the strong'),
('d967f22f-c82a-47b2-8a3a-e83d691d5cb6', 'de', 'Den Hochmütigen widersteht er, den Demütigen gibt er Gnade'),
('d967f22f-c82a-47b2-8a3a-e83d691d5cb6', 'en', 'He resists the proud and gives grace to the humble'),
('851e611c-4001-6da8-bbf8-c20bd8d1f3b4', 'de', 'Den Armen widersteht er, den Reichen gibt er Gnade'),
('851e611c-4001-6da8-bbf8-c20bd8d1f3b4', 'en', 'He resists the poor and gives grace to the rich'),
('db785338-e136-79c5-23b9-ee2239e3c1c8', 'de', 'Der Versöhnungstag'),
('db785338-e136-79c5-23b9-ee2239e3c1c8', 'en', 'The Day of Atonement'),
('c24c7082-600f-54e9-5b6c-6d26229a4190', 'de', 'Das Wochenfest'),
('c24c7082-600f-54e9-5b6c-6d26229a4190', 'en', 'The Feast of Weeks'),
('d1f62716-a668-df3e-c219-fab9ae29e88f', 'de', 'Das Passahfest'),
('d1f62716-a668-df3e-c219-fab9ae29e88f', 'en', 'The Passover'),
('52aa35d5-e05b-a5e2-a58b-a2d05b59fae5', 'de', 'Das Laubhüttenfest'),
('52aa35d5-e05b-a5e2-a58b-a2d05b59fae5', 'en', 'The Feast of Tabernacles'),
('ac1c9f7b-9762-1fc6-73aa-fcbd79691ed8', 'de', 'Er führte sie zum Pharao zurück'),
('ac1c9f7b-9762-1fc6-73aa-fcbd79691ed8', 'en', 'He brought them back to Pharaoh'),
('048ea6ba-1401-e5db-aebf-11ab44b1af0c', 'de', 'Er baute ihnen einen neuen Brunnen'),
('048ea6ba-1401-e5db-aebf-11ab44b1af0c', 'en', 'He built them a new well'),
('0f958f15-0e50-9c73-9773-a6b67764e04a', 'de', 'Er vertrieb sie selbst vom Wasser'),
('0f958f15-0e50-9c73-9773-a6b67764e04a', 'en', 'He drove them from the water himself'),
('1179bb1e-d9ad-1865-27a5-4ace66f35f0f', 'de', 'Er half ihnen und tränkte ihre Herde'),
('1179bb1e-d9ad-1865-27a5-4ace66f35f0f', 'en', 'He helped them and watered their flock'),
('0fcae5aa-79fc-03a6-09f3-114ebd232d8b', 'de', 'Sie kennen seine Stimme und folgen ihm'),
('0fcae5aa-79fc-03a6-09f3-114ebd232d8b', 'en', 'They know his voice and follow him'),
('d452507f-110c-b8ab-1761-b40f7c10630e', 'de', 'Sie laufen jedem Fremden nach'),
('d452507f-110c-b8ab-1761-b40f7c10630e', 'en', 'They run after every stranger'),
('ef3c56cf-1734-ee49-923a-a9c97d11e522', 'de', 'Sie fürchten sich vor seiner Nähe'),
('ef3c56cf-1734-ee49-923a-a9c97d11e522', 'en', 'They are afraid of his nearness'),
('74e39e57-80bc-2b12-23ec-092e6e4da77c', 'de', 'Sie bleiben stumm im Stall'),
('74e39e57-80bc-2b12-23ec-092e6e4da77c', 'en', 'They stay silent in the fold'),
('c07b668f-d4a7-3892-6e15-e1a0a2515bfe', 'de', 'Seine Söhne würden nie sündigen'),
('c07b668f-d4a7-3892-6e15-e1a0a2515bfe', 'en', 'His sons would never sin'),
('482a5935-3a8c-9e3c-9d4c-5aed3afa97c3', 'de', 'Sein Reich werde nach ihm geteilt werden'),
('482a5935-3a8c-9e3c-9d4c-5aed3afa97c3', 'en', 'His kingdom would be divided after him'),
('54e0185e-33d6-1c34-7c67-2f5efcd5ba08', 'de', 'Er werde tausend Jahre selbst regieren'),
('54e0185e-33d6-1c34-7c67-2f5efcd5ba08', 'en', 'He himself would reign a thousand years'),
('8f2ac6cf-c174-3483-8abb-e46b5c97fad5', 'de', 'Sein Königtum und sein Thron sollten ewig bestehen bleiben'),
('8f2ac6cf-c174-3483-8abb-e46b5c97fad5', 'en', 'His kingdom and his throne would endure forever'),
('239ae018-9897-2f71-c8d9-758464292c0c', 'de', 'Sie kaufte das Amt mit dem Vermögen ihres Onkels'),
('239ae018-9897-2f71-c8d9-758464292c0c', 'en', 'She bought the office with her uncle''s fortune'),
('d00994f6-cd1e-062a-2f69-4ab32c07eb89', 'de', 'Sie wurde durch das Los unter den Frauen bestimmt'),
('d00994f6-cd1e-062a-2f69-4ab32c07eb89', 'en', 'She was chosen by lot among the women'),
('281ee57b-df26-9862-d528-69fa84df5ce2', 'de', 'Sie gefiel dem König mehr als alle anderen Jungfrauen'),
('281ee57b-df26-9862-d528-69fa84df5ce2', 'en', 'She pleased the king more than all the other maidens'),
('1ef246c9-2545-300d-8aee-769f6e312c77', 'de', 'Mordechai bot sie dem König als Braut an'),
('1ef246c9-2545-300d-8aee-769f6e312c77', 'en', 'Mordecai offered her to the king as a bride'),
('798c403e-615d-950b-3bad-cc4598f3d083', 'de', 'Wer Werke tut, wird gerettet'),
('798c403e-615d-950b-3bad-cc4598f3d083', 'en', 'Whoever does works is saved'),
('432a032f-ef97-461b-378d-953f8b93fcf7', 'de', 'Wer das Gesetz hält, wird gerettet'),
('432a032f-ef97-461b-378d-953f8b93fcf7', 'en', 'Whoever keeps the law is saved'),
('a3621bbe-e6a5-00ac-b4b0-2ac0846293ac', 'de', 'Wer schweigt, wird gerettet'),
('a3621bbe-e6a5-00ac-b4b0-2ac0846293ac', 'en', 'Whoever stays silent is saved'),
('9fc25034-7584-568d-2ffb-3e0b519e25ee', 'de', 'Wer mit dem Mund bekennt, wird gerettet'),
('9fc25034-7584-568d-2ffb-3e0b519e25ee', 'en', 'Whoever confesses with the mouth is saved'),
('84d0c95c-427a-1b1d-c9b2-6079ff781b84', 'de', 'Es gibt keine Zeit für die Mühe'),
('84d0c95c-427a-1b1d-c9b2-6079ff781b84', 'en', 'There is no time for toil'),
('ae7e499d-5c8f-f6c4-1ad1-4df795924d89', 'de', 'Jede Zeit ist gleich'),
('ae7e499d-5c8f-f6c4-1ad1-4df795924d89', 'en', 'Every time is the same'),
('fdd060aa-2b43-bfc1-cfdf-e750cf804243', 'de', 'Die Zeit gehört allein dem Weisen'),
('fdd060aa-2b43-bfc1-cfdf-e750cf804243', 'en', 'Time belongs to the wise alone'),
('70af6a6a-5602-c39c-89ac-a57d3d45dfa5', 'de', 'Für alles gibt es eine bestimmte Zeit'),
('70af6a6a-5602-c39c-89ac-a57d3d45dfa5', 'en', 'For everything there is a season'),
('29f97319-9278-8ba4-0589-29dac989b51c', 'de', 'Fürchtet euch nicht'),
('29f97319-9278-8ba4-0589-29dac989b51c', 'en', 'Do not be afraid'),
('3266405e-269c-002a-bb17-faad3e73ded1', 'de', 'Friede sei mit euch'),
('3266405e-269c-002a-bb17-faad3e73ded1', 'en', 'Peace be with you'),
('d9d1f2e2-e050-bfa1-1dd0-be1b267315db', 'de', 'Selig seid ihr'),
('d9d1f2e2-e050-bfa1-1dd0-be1b267315db', 'en', 'Blessed are you'),
('62f156ac-877b-30b7-4660-1aa67e73ff41', 'de', 'Folget mir nach'),
('62f156ac-877b-30b7-4660-1aa67e73ff41', 'en', 'Follow me'),
('90259620-902b-ec64-53ce-17553395268c', 'de', 'Durch ein Treffen im Tempel'),
('90259620-902b-ec64-53ce-17553395268c', 'en', 'By a meeting in the temple'),
('065cb10f-d7bf-fd79-2349-77596ec23057', 'de', 'Durch einen heimlichen Brief'),
('065cb10f-d7bf-fd79-2349-77596ec23057', 'en', 'By a secret letter'),
('95f9d419-ad1b-64bd-845a-dd4fa3c99636', 'de', 'Durch eine Botschaft an Michal'),
('95f9d419-ad1b-64bd-845a-dd4fa3c99636', 'en', 'By a message to Michal'),
('64fc6669-818f-64fb-f133-a39ca985dce0', 'de', 'Durch ein verabredetes Zeichen mit Pfeilen auf dem Feld'),
('64fc6669-818f-64fb-f133-a39ca985dce0', 'en', 'By a prearranged sign with arrows in the field'),
('1c07071c-bad2-7c69-9b30-386c005ef244', 'de', 'Samaria werde ohne Kampf fallen'),
('1c07071c-bad2-7c69-9b30-386c005ef244', 'en', 'Samaria would fall without a fight'),
('8ac1e6ba-cb70-203e-3f01-1750db2354f9', 'de', 'Der Staub Samarias reiche nicht für eine Handvoll seines Volkes'),
('8ac1e6ba-cb70-203e-3f01-1750db2354f9', 'en', 'The dust of Samaria would not suffice for a handful of his people'),
('a72417f1-d9a1-f57c-6442-ac31613e6482', 'de', 'Israels Gott sei zu schwach für den Krieg'),
('a72417f1-d9a1-f57c-6442-ac31613e6482', 'en', 'Israel''s God was too weak for war'),
('e6f10955-5505-e442-80ce-4506a323daa0', 'de', 'Ahabs Heer bestehe nur aus Kindern'),
('e6f10955-5505-e442-80ce-4506a323daa0', 'en', 'Ahab''s army was made up only of children'),
('52db4d0b-d501-cfbc-cf90-a222076e249a', 'de', 'Er rief ein Fasten aus, um Gott um Schutz zu suchen'),
('52db4d0b-d501-cfbc-cf90-a222076e249a', 'en', 'He proclaimed a fast to seek God for protection'),
('a48b0410-5338-cf2f-97ba-98f3ca9daffa', 'de', 'Er heuerte heimlich Söldner aus der Stadt an'),
('a48b0410-5338-cf2f-97ba-98f3ca9daffa', 'en', 'He secretly hired mercenaries from the city'),
('c551a789-eeb8-15fb-0dce-beaf5b375457', 'de', 'Er wählte einen anderen, längeren Weg über das Gebirge'),
('c551a789-eeb8-15fb-0dce-beaf5b375457', 'en', 'He chose another, longer route over the mountains'),
('13d43ac5-6cba-acdf-6bd1-557fd41d11f0', 'de', 'Er sandte Boten voraus, die Geleit erbitten sollten'),
('13d43ac5-6cba-acdf-6bd1-557fd41d11f0', 'en', 'He sent messengers ahead to request an escort'),
('1c2a6155-17e2-cb17-39a6-bbf69b4340c4', 'de', 'Ich kehre stets zum Alten zurück'),
('1c2a6155-17e2-cb17-39a6-bbf69b4340c4', 'en', 'I always return to the old things'),
('f005752d-fbf8-382a-b108-7cd99dd5a1b2', 'de', 'Ich halte fest, was dahinten ist'),
('f005752d-fbf8-382a-b108-7cd99dd5a1b2', 'en', 'I cling to what lies behind'),
('bba7118c-0d23-dd52-5138-82c46db2d0c4', 'de', 'Ich vergesse, was dahinten ist'),
('bba7118c-0d23-dd52-5138-82c46db2d0c4', 'en', 'I forget what lies behind'),
('ab26713e-55ac-4abc-a8b4-26cd339258c9', 'de', 'Ich rühme mich meiner Herkunft'),
('ab26713e-55ac-4abc-a8b4-26cd339258c9', 'en', 'I boast in my heritage'),
('e369428c-63e6-44d1-3fe3-0d5ff1d8f06b', 'de', 'Mit den Fischen im Meer'),
('e369428c-63e6-44d1-3fe3-0d5ff1d8f06b', 'en', 'To the fish in the sea'),
('5bc9a65e-2bd8-2148-4b8e-531db008754a', 'de', 'Mit den Sternen am Himmel'),
('5bc9a65e-2bd8-2148-4b8e-531db008754a', 'en', 'To the stars in the sky'),
('d80b2b54-2597-2d1e-fa1c-f8dc25ebca50', 'de', 'Mit den Blättern der Bäume'),
('d80b2b54-2597-2d1e-fa1c-f8dc25ebca50', 'en', 'To the leaves of the trees'),
('9676933c-ecca-779c-5338-9f8a9a98a227', 'de', 'Mit den Tropfen des Regens'),
('9676933c-ecca-779c-5338-9f8a9a98a227', 'en', 'To the drops of rain'),
('be66c4dc-c75a-89f0-2769-da3b6744b14e', 'de', 'Den Stein aus dem Wege'),
('be66c4dc-c75a-89f0-2769-da3b6744b14e', 'en', 'The stone from the path'),
('e6500cce-47b2-7325-9a8d-1908ae974f1b', 'de', 'Den Schleier vom Gesicht'),
('e6500cce-47b2-7325-9a8d-1908ae974f1b', 'en', 'The veil from the face'),
('58bec6c2-58cd-2d35-7cbe-3050dd6c0b6e', 'de', 'Den Balken im eigenen Auge'),
('58bec6c2-58cd-2d35-7cbe-3050dd6c0b6e', 'en', 'The plank in one''s own eye'),
('7a82ba06-bdfa-be97-f3ab-65ae1d87fa03', 'de', 'Den Staub von den Füßen'),
('7a82ba06-bdfa-be97-f3ab-65ae1d87fa03', 'en', 'The dust from the feet'),
('035ae1a9-e833-d392-42d9-b781c15421af', 'de', 'Als er die Schriften auslegte'),
('035ae1a9-e833-d392-42d9-b781c15421af', 'en', 'When he explained the scriptures'),
('e1330db3-6804-aed1-3f0f-611be8c73bff', 'de', 'Als er sie beim Namen rief'),
('e1330db3-6804-aed1-3f0f-611be8c73bff', 'en', 'When he called them by name'),
('8c6f6ca7-3362-264d-0cc6-e57069afd584', 'de', 'Als er das Brot brach und es ihnen gab'),
('8c6f6ca7-3362-264d-0cc6-e57069afd584', 'en', 'When he broke the bread and gave it to them'),
('9d4cea5a-c3de-1a20-faa7-217368fd356b', 'de', 'Als er den Weg wies'),
('9d4cea5a-c3de-1a20-faa7-217368fd356b', 'en', 'When he showed the way'),
('038ba7b3-a801-db41-42ed-1ee11cacc0df', 'de', 'Der erste Tag des Passafestes'),
('038ba7b3-a801-db41-42ed-1ee11cacc0df', 'en', 'The first day of the Passover feast'),
('dfb7d3c3-d3e3-ed96-c685-cb924bb2080d', 'de', 'Der Tag der Tempelweihe'),
('dfb7d3c3-d3e3-ed96-c685-cb924bb2080d', 'en', 'The day of the temple dedication'),
('89ae1a93-b33e-cc2b-931f-834899ff568d', 'de', 'Der Tag nach dem Sabbat'),
('89ae1a93-b33e-cc2b-931f-834899ff568d', 'en', 'The day after the Sabbath'),
('bf5b615b-0033-1371-c4f1-d9a3b2f28b2d', 'de', 'Der Rüsttag vor dem Sabbat'),
('bf5b615b-0033-1371-c4f1-d9a3b2f28b2d', 'en', 'The day of preparation before the Sabbath'),
('9666be07-9a44-ff55-841b-d4ad9edd35d7', 'de', 'Wie ein Hirte die Wölfe vertreibt'),
('9666be07-9a44-ff55-841b-d4ad9edd35d7', 'en', 'As a shepherd drives away wolves'),
('8b9d68b7-5f74-d9a0-9f98-50fe6e46e38e', 'de', 'Wie ein König die Völker richtet'),
('8b9d68b7-5f74-d9a0-9f98-50fe6e46e38e', 'en', 'As a king judges the nations'),
('a3ce6bbc-311b-0873-cb1c-5a3393cc3f79', 'de', 'Wie sich ein Vater über Kinder erbarmt'),
('a3ce6bbc-311b-0873-cb1c-5a3393cc3f79', 'en', 'As a father has compassion on his children'),
('158ee37d-5415-66a5-b500-27be0bd383eb', 'de', 'Wie ein Krieger die Feinde schlägt'),
('158ee37d-5415-66a5-b500-27be0bd383eb', 'en', 'As a warrior strikes the enemies'),
('0bcbe502-7684-4adb-504b-2765bc95cadc', 'de', 'Man bat die Menge, Platz zu machen'),
('0bcbe502-7684-4adb-504b-2765bc95cadc', 'en', 'They asked the crowd to make room'),
('240ff51b-99e9-3670-0da3-9ff6ee5de458', 'de', 'Man wartete bis zum Abend'),
('240ff51b-99e9-3670-0da3-9ff6ee5de458', 'en', 'They waited until evening'),
('9e4c82e8-02b3-2f68-e0df-0cdc177aa674', 'de', 'Man trug ihn durch eine Seitentür'),
('9e4c82e8-02b3-2f68-e0df-0cdc177aa674', 'en', 'They carried him through a side door'),
('e07f1bff-1544-1410-23df-024b370fb699', 'de', 'Man ließ ihn durch das aufgedeckte Dach hinab'),
('e07f1bff-1544-1410-23df-024b370fb699', 'en', 'They lowered him through the opened roof'),
('fecabf37-cd1f-0b0c-7d08-8d7b2983d6ab', 'de', 'Sie opferten im Tempel'),
('fecabf37-cd1f-0b0c-7d08-8d7b2983d6ab', 'en', 'They offered sacrifices in the temple'),
