('24b13c17-2fe1-03c1-67e0-823d90129854', 'de', 'Jeder tat, was in seinen Augen recht war, ohne König'),
('24b13c17-2fe1-03c1-67e0-823d90129854', 'en', 'Everyone did what was right in his own eyes, with no king'),
('de08cb03-c3b4-6580-7210-3ff1b24f9c24', 'de', 'Israel hatte endlich Frieden unter einem König'),
('de08cb03-c3b4-6580-7210-3ff1b24f9c24', 'en', 'Israel finally had peace under a king'),
('1691aca5-c85b-34e3-b58e-d23be8f44e40', 'de', 'Die Stämme vereinigten sich unter einem Hohenpriester'),
('1691aca5-c85b-34e3-b58e-d23be8f44e40', 'en', 'The tribes united under a high priest'),
('6bf5db69-fc96-2a0e-048a-72e3128f7bf4', 'de', 'Sie weinte am lautesten vor dem König'),
('6bf5db69-fc96-2a0e-048a-72e3128f7bf4', 'en', 'She wept the loudest before the king'),
('3d655096-efd8-f38f-78fd-697a6e082481', 'de', 'Sie wollte lieber das Kind hergeben, als es getötet zu sehen'),
('3d655096-efd8-f38f-78fd-697a6e082481', 'en', 'She would rather give the child up than see it killed'),
('7576c6f4-14b3-5657-cb89-a6c6a84cfffc', 'de', 'Sie nannte zuerst den Namen des Kindes'),
('7576c6f4-14b3-5657-cb89-a6c6a84cfffc', 'en', 'She named the child first'),
