('59014a3d-7568-227a-2b20-36b1e148cd28', 'en', 'The tax collector, for he had humbled himself'),
('60b7c2b9-f04c-2f71-48df-cec78de6d234', 'de', 'Beide gleichermaßen'),
('60b7c2b9-f04c-2f71-48df-cec78de6d234', 'en', 'Both equally'),
('35939ed3-4500-07f0-f836-a566e7452cc0', 'de', 'Keiner von beiden'),
('35939ed3-4500-07f0-f836-a566e7452cc0', 'en', 'Neither of them'),
('21970f9e-5b0a-0ce0-e6a5-cf3317c72702', 'de', 'Den Reichtum anzuzeigen'),
('21970f9e-5b0a-0ce0-e6a5-cf3317c72702', 'en', 'To indicate wealth'),
('5c336a41-f374-0147-1d5d-800321e41462', 'de', 'Vor wilden Tieren zu schützen'),
('5c336a41-f374-0147-1d5d-800321e41462', 'en', 'To protect from wild animals'),
('33950fe4-6128-f14d-b850-850148150319', 'de', 'An die Gebote des HERRN zu erinnern und sie zu halten'),
('33950fe4-6128-f14d-b850-850148150319', 'en', 'To remember the LORD''s commands and keep them'),
('79aba4a7-b73c-4519-319a-3513677d6d5b', 'de', 'Die Stämme voneinander zu unterscheiden'),
('79aba4a7-b73c-4519-319a-3513677d6d5b', 'en', 'To distinguish the tribes from one another'),
('0f2da17c-a1ef-8732-f8db-7990eb919a1f', 'de', 'Du sollst dich ergeben und die Stadt übergeben'),
('0f2da17c-a1ef-8732-f8db-7990eb919a1f', 'en', 'You shall surrender and hand over the city'),
('dcc3b457-b515-bf94-9611-b8b5bbdb6cb9', 'de', 'Der Tempel wird verbrannt und zerstört werden'),
('dcc3b457-b515-bf94-9611-b8b5bbdb6cb9', 'en', 'The temple shall be burned and destroyed'),
('5c5dea33-5675-0d8c-a64a-aa07c0a910d7', 'de', 'Das Volk wird nach Babel weggeführt werden'),
('5c5dea33-5675-0d8c-a64a-aa07c0a910d7', 'en', 'The people shall be carried away to Babylon'),
('02bf753b-2fab-4b7f-10ba-e8ce81705c90', 'de', 'Der König von Assyrien wird nicht in diese Stadt kommen'),
('02bf753b-2fab-4b7f-10ba-e8ce81705c90', 'en', 'The king of Assyria shall not come into this city'),
('f9c72c96-3bf8-8334-55ba-5d6cd37d59fa', 'de', 'Ihr Wert ist weit über Perlen'),
('f9c72c96-3bf8-8334-55ba-5d6cd37d59fa', 'en', 'Her worth is far above pearls'),
('fe905a8a-e4a0-d105-94ca-16d459467e6b', 'de', 'Ihr Wert liegt allein in der Schönheit'),
('fe905a8a-e4a0-d105-94ca-16d459467e6b', 'en', 'Her worth lies in beauty alone'),
('08541b60-2cdb-f8b3-db16-4932f5b3ca27', 'de', 'Ihr Wert übertrifft jeden König'),
('08541b60-2cdb-f8b3-db16-4932f5b3ca27', 'en', 'Her worth surpasses any king'),
('5098d59f-489d-99c3-8a72-ba6f88e5ff8c', 'de', 'Ihr Wert ist gleich dem Gold'),
('5098d59f-489d-99c3-8a72-ba6f88e5ff8c', 'en', 'Her worth equals gold'),
('54749ad9-eab5-91a1-7786-41561bab8339', 'de', 'Seine Augen wie Feuerflammen und sein Antlitz wie die Sonne'),
('54749ad9-eab5-91a1-7786-41561bab8339', 'en', 'His eyes like flames of fire and his face like the sun'),
('a764a9c0-b9a2-2040-c9dd-f655ce9232e7', 'de', 'Seine Hände wie Eisenstäbe und sein Mund wie ein Schwert aus Gold'),
('a764a9c0-b9a2-2040-c9dd-f655ce9232e7', 'en', 'His hands like iron rods and his mouth like a sword of gold'),
('d31bc5f7-a4d6-c856-384c-0a81993431a4', 'de', 'Seine Füße wie Wolken und sein Haupt wie ein Sturm'),
('d31bc5f7-a4d6-c856-384c-0a81993431a4', 'en', 'His feet like clouds and his head like a storm'),
('e5438af3-aba4-055a-a248-669b5789a5a5', 'de', 'Seine Stimme wie Donner und seine Krone wie der Mond'),
('e5438af3-aba4-055a-a248-669b5789a5a5', 'en', 'His voice like thunder and his crown like the moon'),
('9f91dc55-523a-23fd-acb9-d82f299fd739', 'de', 'Sieben Jahre wie eine Hungersnot'),
('9f91dc55-523a-23fd-acb9-d82f299fd739', 'en', 'Seven years like a famine'),
('b39696d5-e23c-6dbf-259e-7b98a775b28a', 'de', 'Zehn Jahre ohne festen Wohnsitz'),
('b39696d5-e23c-6dbf-259e-7b98a775b28a', 'en', 'Ten years without a settled home'),
('c0946a83-9519-b05f-72b8-a880d88f9fb5', 'de', 'Vierzig Jahre, ein Jahr für jeden Tag'),
('c0946a83-9519-b05f-72b8-a880d88f9fb5', 'en', 'Forty years, a year for each day'),
('b3b71e1d-8b7b-e4b6-702f-72ac7dd4719c', 'de', 'Zwölf Jahre, einer für jeden Stamm'),
('b3b71e1d-8b7b-e4b6-702f-72ac7dd4719c', 'en', 'Twelve years, one for each tribe'),
('917c0588-b760-9390-01b1-cb7503293865', 'de', 'Sie lief in die Stadt und erzählte den Leuten von ihm'),
('917c0588-b760-9390-01b1-cb7503293865', 'en', 'She ran to the town and told the people about him'),
('94d799fa-8834-3981-6baf-18d78dc205f5', 'de', 'Sie blieb schweigend am Brunnen zurück'),
('94d799fa-8834-3981-6baf-18d78dc205f5', 'en', 'She stayed silent at the well'),
('558a44f1-e9d5-5511-8af9-0165c414298f', 'de', 'Sie brachte ihm ein Opfer dar'),
('558a44f1-e9d5-5511-8af9-0165c414298f', 'en', 'She brought him a sacrifice'),
('3aa3b690-752b-c8d4-59a1-0be55cc7c4d7', 'de', 'Sie folgte Jesus nach Galiläa'),
('3aa3b690-752b-c8d4-59a1-0be55cc7c4d7', 'en', 'She followed Jesus to Galilee'),
('c77883c4-d88e-44ab-0a72-ee5a41281678', 'de', 'Er ließ den Bau für einen Monat ganz ruhen'),
('c77883c4-d88e-44ab-0a72-ee5a41281678', 'en', 'He halted the building entirely for a month'),
('d83f0917-0b14-c2b4-538b-bfed6528f257', 'de', 'Die Hälfte arbeitete, die andere stand bewaffnet bereit'),
('d83f0917-0b14-c2b4-538b-bfed6528f257', 'en', 'Half worked while the other half stood armed and ready'),
('efbb7ee7-14e0-560b-82db-6703c3777a14', 'de', 'Er schickte alle Familien aus der Stadt fort'),
('efbb7ee7-14e0-560b-82db-6703c3777a14', 'en', 'He sent all the families away from the city'),
('cb542608-3ad6-0fe8-be07-24dfcb093b04', 'de', 'Er baute zuerst nur die Türme und Tore'),
('cb542608-3ad6-0fe8-be07-24dfcb093b04', 'en', 'He built only the towers and gates first'),
('b21113f4-50d6-115b-6361-7c72b92b7911', 'de', 'Sie verteilten das Opferfleisch an die Armen'),
('b21113f4-50d6-115b-6361-7c72b92b7911', 'en', 'They gave the offering meat to the poor'),
('6fdce5d0-43f5-46be-a512-5ed75e558093', 'de', 'Sie flohen vor den Philistern'),
('6fdce5d0-43f5-46be-a512-5ed75e558093', 'en', 'They fled from the Philistines'),
('af81b2b3-be51-b122-05a2-f6aa1bc756e8', 'de', 'Sie waren besonders fromm und gewissenhaft'),
('af81b2b3-be51-b122-05a2-f6aa1bc756e8', 'en', 'They were especially devout and careful'),
('708b116c-bfb2-d6f0-0af1-de2be2d68524', 'de', 'Sie missbrauchten ihr Priesteramt und verachteten die Opfer'),
('708b116c-bfb2-d6f0-0af1-de2be2d68524', 'en', 'They abused their priestly office and despised the offerings'),
('117bb77a-2c28-e4ac-5068-1e5e71165de3', 'de', 'Mit Wasser aus dem Becken'),
('117bb77a-2c28-e4ac-5068-1e5e71165de3', 'en', 'With water from the basin'),
('db5c4ceb-5cac-ee74-a06e-e6a6db9bf7f3', 'de', 'Mit dem Öl der Salbung'),
('db5c4ceb-5cac-ee74-a06e-e6a6db9bf7f3', 'en', 'With the oil of anointing'),
('b4fd6097-c777-c66b-3768-1c70d6394be6', 'de', 'Mit dem Saum seines Gewandes'),
('b4fd6097-c777-c66b-3768-1c70d6394be6', 'en', 'With the hem of his robe'),
('739d5930-4354-1154-0770-03a127c66b48', 'de', 'Mit einer glühenden Kohle vom Altar'),
('739d5930-4354-1154-0770-03a127c66b48', 'en', 'With a glowing coal from the altar'),
('bba58f63-e278-392d-fea3-53ffa7b8466e', 'de', 'Er wurde in den Löwengraben geworfen'),
('bba58f63-e278-392d-fea3-53ffa7b8466e', 'en', 'He was thrown into the lions'' den'),
('2b5bf2b0-39c7-46c9-6577-85e20b720f81', 'de', 'Er starb im hohen Alter friedlich'),
('2b5bf2b0-39c7-46c9-6577-85e20b720f81', 'en', 'He died peacefully at a great age'),
('56b9b319-a999-ac85-7c20-b5b7664114d1', 'de', 'Er wurde entrückt, ohne den Tod zu sehen'),
('56b9b319-a999-ac85-7c20-b5b7664114d1', 'en', 'He was taken away without seeing death'),
('f7b41bd1-a074-8bbc-b332-e7bec484faea', 'de', 'Er wurde im Feuerwagen aufgenommen'),
('f7b41bd1-a074-8bbc-b332-e7bec484faea', 'en', 'He was taken up in a chariot of fire'),
('e944d1da-1d28-e3bf-4887-7b8342c49488', 'de', 'Er leitete den Jordan in die Stadt'),
('e944d1da-1d28-e3bf-4887-7b8342c49488', 'en', 'He diverted the Jordan into the city'),
('e944420d-2954-8877-2e3d-d3ca9474f028', 'de', 'Er ließ einen Tunnel und Teich für das Wasser anlegen'),
('e944420d-2954-8877-2e3d-d3ca9474f028', 'en', 'He built a tunnel and pool to bring the water in'),
('f209c086-8691-57a6-dd41-c707d9a734d3', 'de', 'Er stapelte Krüge in den Vorratshäusern'),
('f209c086-8691-57a6-dd41-c707d9a734d3', 'en', 'He stacked jars in the storehouses'),
('cdcd9747-9bc7-1e37-0767-2994986c15e6', 'de', 'Er grub Brunnen im Tempelhof'),
('cdcd9747-9bc7-1e37-0767-2994986c15e6', 'en', 'He dug wells in the temple court'),
('d3e55edc-d3c4-5756-2689-3ec3069dbfc4', 'de', 'Alles geschehe ohne Rücksicht'),
('d3e55edc-d3c4-5756-2689-3ec3069dbfc4', 'en', 'Let all be done without regard'),
('9bf4ee3a-0e67-e5fd-e508-1b3231f3b840', 'de', 'Alles geschehe bei euch nach dem Gesetz'),
('9bf4ee3a-0e67-e5fd-e508-1b3231f3b840', 'en', 'Let all you do be done by the law'),
('26bc821d-4853-db7a-0a23-2b08842c9649', 'de', 'Alles geschehe zur eigenen Ehre'),
('26bc821d-4853-db7a-0a23-2b08842c9649', 'en', 'Let all be done for your own honor'),
('3d04c62f-55e6-d54c-2b2e-6bf3b72be2a8', 'de', 'Alles geschehe bei euch in Liebe'),
('3d04c62f-55e6-d54c-2b2e-6bf3b72be2a8', 'en', 'Let all that you do be done in love'),
('35594c17-0266-4543-7e30-1d461558837b', 'de', 'Bewahre meinen Tempel'),
('35594c17-0266-4543-7e30-1d461558837b', 'en', 'Guard my temple'),
('ac597217-b6a2-42b9-23ab-b7a29326fb76', 'de', 'Sammle meine Zwölf'),
('ac597217-b6a2-42b9-23ab-b7a29326fb76', 'en', 'Gather my Twelve'),
('f9dee970-50bb-2a49-78b9-7eafe7bb491e', 'de', 'Verkünde mein Gericht'),
('f9dee970-50bb-2a49-78b9-7eafe7bb491e', 'en', 'Proclaim my judgment'),
('0bfa7985-5522-321f-a6eb-5c3aff74d1d9', 'de', 'Weide meine Schafe'),
('0bfa7985-5522-321f-a6eb-5c3aff74d1d9', 'en', 'Feed my sheep'),
('1f2a4713-9ccd-1092-4e1c-595d857d2732', 'de', 'Sie werde größer sein als die des früheren Hauses'),
('1f2a4713-9ccd-1092-4e1c-595d857d2732', 'en', 'It would be greater than that of the former house'),
('8ef53359-d409-20da-97e2-912f8a7a74bf', 'de', 'Er werde von Engeln bewacht'),
('8ef53359-d409-20da-97e2-912f8a7a74bf', 'en', 'It would be guarded by angels'),
('4eca9ff1-973f-21db-98fa-57e36a8f9853', 'de', 'Er werde nie wieder zerstört'),
('4eca9ff1-973f-21db-98fa-57e36a8f9853', 'en', 'It would never again be destroyed'),
('f720d197-b1b7-6d9c-c4f7-acaf325e12ba', 'de', 'Er werde aus reinem Gold gebaut'),
('f720d197-b1b7-6d9c-c4f7-acaf325e12ba', 'en', 'It would be built of pure gold'),
('6e736fec-33c4-d394-b20a-8d8af3cc7664', 'de', 'Er heilte ihn, dass er Früchte trug'),
('6e736fec-33c4-d394-b20a-8d8af3cc7664', 'en', 'He healed it so it bore fruit'),
('0bbe5388-aa93-5729-ae89-667b1f2689d8', 'de', 'Er verfluchte ihn, dass nie wieder Frucht von ihm käme'),
('0bbe5388-aa93-5729-ae89-667b1f2689d8', 'en', 'He cursed it, that no fruit would ever come from it again'),
('829df899-20c4-bbea-97d9-906735bf4ff0', 'de', 'Er pflanzte ihn an einen besseren Ort'),
('829df899-20c4-bbea-97d9-906735bf4ff0', 'en', 'He planted it in a better place'),
('6cfc2477-62ca-346f-3fc4-c89886ed5294', 'de', 'Er band ihn an einen Pfahl'),
('6cfc2477-62ca-346f-3fc4-c89886ed5294', 'en', 'He tied it to a stake'),
('7fad640f-516f-7b12-9d78-6f00ab3b5a28', 'de', 'Gesetz, Opfer und Gebot'),
('7fad640f-516f-7b12-9d78-6f00ab3b5a28', 'en', 'Law, sacrifice and command'),
('8e064428-06cb-7f35-7c23-4a2c64533d29', 'de', 'Macht, Reichtum und Ehre'),
('8e064428-06cb-7f35-7c23-4a2c64533d29', 'en', 'Power, wealth and honor'),
('1e651ec7-6fe6-22a6-0777-e243f53f6474', 'de', 'Weisheit, Wissen und Reden'),
('1e651ec7-6fe6-22a6-0777-e243f53f6474', 'en', 'Wisdom, knowledge and speech'),
('296dcf2f-0415-af07-ee89-6a4d1ff377a8', 'de', 'Glaube, Hoffnung und Liebe'),
('296dcf2f-0415-af07-ee89-6a4d1ff377a8', 'en', 'Faith, hope and love'),
('10f48a1f-9264-91d5-0d15-96aa3d24bab4', 'de', 'Ein brennendes Licht in der Mitte'),
('10f48a1f-9264-91d5-0d15-96aa3d24bab4', 'en', 'A burning light in the middle'),
('fa68e2df-c584-d4cc-ab88-a090ef3a271f', 'de', 'Der gewälzte Stein im Eingang'),
('fa68e2df-c584-d4cc-ab88-a090ef3a271f', 'en', 'The rolled stone in the entrance'),
('a4c13c04-1880-9153-2e67-960be72b1e74', 'de', 'Die zurückgelassenen Leinentücher'),
('a4c13c04-1880-9153-2e67-960be72b1e74', 'en', 'The linen cloths left behind'),
('635aa445-31d5-d532-6dd5-e571a3ad0c8e', 'de', 'Die Dornenkrone auf dem Boden'),
('635aa445-31d5-d532-6dd5-e571a3ad0c8e', 'en', 'The crown of thorns on the floor'),
('761a39c2-2111-4165-5ff5-c33c5407dbc1', 'de', 'Er kennt alle Wege Gottes'),
('761a39c2-2111-4165-5ff5-c33c5407dbc1', 'en', 'He knows all the ways of God'),
('2def0d0f-2036-28d1-7c1a-104f118700f7', 'de', 'Er ist kurzlebig und voller Unruhe'),
('2def0d0f-2036-28d1-7c1a-104f118700f7', 'en', 'He is of few days and full of trouble'),
('9547c806-b4bf-1ed4-1992-d59370872921', 'de', 'Er ist stark und bleibt für immer'),
('9547c806-b4bf-1ed4-1992-d59370872921', 'en', 'He is strong and remains forever'),
('da592f63-b80a-dd11-0156-8d68045e04d4', 'de', 'Er ist von Geburt an gerecht'),
('da592f63-b80a-dd11-0156-8d68045e04d4', 'en', 'He is righteous from birth'),
('04eb9f99-5631-2c93-d9dc-335b5314eefd', 'de', 'Sei getrost und unverzagt'),
('04eb9f99-5631-2c93-d9dc-335b5314eefd', 'en', 'Be strong and courageous'),
('8c92ae9b-992a-14a7-3a11-23514618a4ae', 'de', 'Sammle reichlich Vorräte'),
('8c92ae9b-992a-14a7-3a11-23514618a4ae', 'en', 'Gather plenty of provisions'),
('166717df-51e4-107f-dfcc-2bf42ab1a988', 'de', 'Schone keinen der Feinde'),
('166717df-51e4-107f-dfcc-2bf42ab1a988', 'en', 'Spare none of the enemies'),
('e2e92be5-8137-c154-19b6-2b1291ea0c83', 'de', 'Eile dem Volk voran'),
('e2e92be5-8137-c154-19b6-2b1291ea0c83', 'en', 'Hasten ahead of the people'),
('c6a0622d-e8c4-69a7-84cf-7b7676631dc0', 'de', 'Sie murrten über die Verschwendung des kostbaren Öls'),
('c6a0622d-e8c4-69a7-84cf-7b7676631dc0', 'en', 'They grumbled at the waste of the costly oil'),
('33708bb1-e335-3c79-a1a8-048933393186', 'de', 'Sie baten selbst um Salbung'),
('33708bb1-e335-3c79-a1a8-048933393186', 'en', 'They asked to be anointed themselves'),
('cbad5a92-b8d7-6644-bd09-77325697e284', 'de', 'Sie lobten die Frau für ihre Hingabe'),
('cbad5a92-b8d7-6644-bd09-77325697e284', 'en', 'They praised the woman for her devotion'),
('c07c58fa-9e17-ecb5-118e-d0d630569115', 'de', 'Sie verließen empört das Haus'),
('c07c58fa-9e17-ecb5-118e-d0d630569115', 'en', 'They left the house in indignation'),
('e2804b3d-59c6-c453-2d49-2e756acc2a30', 'de', 'Diese Art fährt nur durch Gebet aus'),
('e2804b3d-59c6-c453-2d49-2e756acc2a30', 'en', 'This kind comes out only through prayer'),
('86a262d6-4097-a4c7-20b8-b73a3a65806d', 'de', 'Ihr habt die falschen Worte gesprochen'),
('86a262d6-4097-a4c7-20b8-b73a3a65806d', 'en', 'You spoke the wrong words'),
('3897c0d9-61b5-26b8-287c-f9a708827720', 'de', 'Der Knabe war zu lange krank'),
('3897c0d9-61b5-26b8-287c-f9a708827720', 'en', 'The boy had been ill too long'),
('16bd3feb-0479-00c2-f7f9-816c76165df6', 'de', 'Es war noch nicht die rechte Stunde'),
('16bd3feb-0479-00c2-f7f9-816c76165df6', 'en', 'It was not yet the right hour'),
('28cbdc39-8564-dd5d-4b32-36e9f0b35a33', 'de', 'Regen zur rechten Zeit, Ernte und Frieden im Land'),
('28cbdc39-8564-dd5d-4b32-36e9f0b35a33', 'en', 'Rain in season, harvest and peace in the land'),
('ba6b2748-0ed9-732e-8373-c160e1d0dea7', 'de', 'Ewiges Leben ohne Tod'),
('ba6b2748-0ed9-732e-8373-c160e1d0dea7', 'en', 'Eternal life without death'),
('9bbe8c53-6bb8-793d-6e98-4f3fe905111d', 'de', 'Unermesslichen Goldschatz'),
('9bbe8c53-6bb8-793d-6e98-4f3fe905111d', 'en', 'Immeasurable treasure of gold'),
('3043bb7a-786a-f79d-0b67-adcc5025d2ba', 'de', 'Herrschaft über alle Völker der Erde'),
('3043bb7a-786a-f79d-0b67-adcc5025d2ba', 'en', 'Rule over all peoples of the earth'),
('8f68fd30-5a06-89a6-73b3-acd8a04cd70b', 'de', 'David im Auftrag Sauls'),
('8f68fd30-5a06-89a6-73b3-acd8a04cd70b', 'en', 'David on Saul''s orders'),
('99986168-4435-0d52-260a-d53bc87ad11b', 'de', 'Samuel selbst vor dem HERRN'),
('99986168-4435-0d52-260a-d53bc87ad11b', 'en', 'Samuel himself before the LORD'),
('b5669dd8-c6fb-ba0e-a711-c4a2eeb8c142', 'de', 'Saul auf Gottes Befehl'),
('b5669dd8-c6fb-ba0e-a711-c4a2eeb8c142', 'en', 'Saul at God''s command'),
('3277b6ee-a7f3-5ef4-e1b9-0ca3b5ecda3f', 'de', 'Jonatan im Kampf'),
('3277b6ee-a7f3-5ef4-e1b9-0ca3b5ecda3f', 'en', 'Jonathan in battle'),
('800f6993-4102-b75e-a177-bf5bb9473f2b', 'de', 'Er lebte noch genau vierzig Jahre'),
('800f6993-4102-b75e-a177-bf5bb9473f2b', 'en', 'He lived exactly forty more years'),
('c7e1c2cc-a21c-f0e4-2223-3a8eaf4e7ee0', 'de', 'Er lebte noch hundertvierzig Jahre'),
('c7e1c2cc-a21c-f0e4-2223-3a8eaf4e7ee0', 'en', 'He lived another hundred and forty years'),
('c169c94e-a048-f24a-ee16-3b3fec947605', 'de', 'Er lebte noch siebzig Jahre'),
('c169c94e-a048-f24a-ee16-3b3fec947605', 'en', 'He lived seventy more years'),
('fbad02db-0571-615b-d4bf-558099bccbcd', 'de', 'Er starb bald nach der Wiederherstellung'),
('fbad02db-0571-615b-d4bf-558099bccbcd', 'en', 'He died soon after the restoration'),
('a4f4a464-fa79-d683-f0c4-174508f7eb65', 'de', 'Den Klang der Posaunen aus Jerusalem'),
('a4f4a464-fa79-d683-f0c4-174508f7eb65', 'en', 'The sound of trumpets from Jerusalem'),
('1015d4d0-0f00-6618-8238-b25f061ef328', 'de', 'Den Aufgang des Morgensterns'),
('1015d4d0-0f00-6618-8238-b25f061ef328', 'en', 'The rising of the morning star'),
('934aa5e8-baac-c4f2-c90e-e077ae04e030', 'de', 'Das Rauschen in den Wipfeln der Balsambäume'),
('934aa5e8-baac-c4f2-c90e-e077ae04e030', 'en', 'The sound of marching in the tops of the balsam trees'),
('7e00eb3f-61e4-0c08-bb40-6ec8527fa567', 'de', 'Den Donner über dem Tal Refaim'),
('7e00eb3f-61e4-0c08-bb40-6ec8527fa567', 'en', 'The thunder over the Valley of Rephaim'),
('ad957e84-2640-6a5f-db51-ffde85dd0da1', 'de', 'Durch das Los vor dem HERRN'),
('ad957e84-2640-6a5f-db51-ffde85dd0da1', 'en', 'By lot before the LORD'),
('88a43ba0-7d11-8f38-bd6e-a67ef4710ff6', 'de', 'Nach der Größe der Stämme'),
('88a43ba0-7d11-8f38-bd6e-a67ef4710ff6', 'en', 'According to the size of the tribes'),
('a51a9454-4197-8c49-d22a-9be3230e03bb', 'de', 'Durch Kauf von den Bewohnern'),
('a51a9454-4197-8c49-d22a-9be3230e03bb', 'en', 'By purchase from the inhabitants'),
('5a3c0085-a6de-1e54-672d-bd001e319d74', 'de', 'Nach dem Willen Josuas'),
('5a3c0085-a6de-1e54-672d-bd001e319d74', 'en', 'According to Joshua''s will'),
('afb71f01-59a0-b401-65e3-640ceaeb842b', 'de', 'Die Völker werden alle vertrieben'),
('afb71f01-59a0-b401-65e3-640ceaeb842b', 'en', 'All nations will be driven out'),
('26510c90-adf8-4476-aa9f-8b2e84eb6e69', 'de', 'Die Berge werden zu Ebenen'),
('26510c90-adf8-4476-aa9f-8b2e84eb6e69', 'en', 'The mountains will become plains'),
('928678b0-5b32-1371-a80b-799817ba4dcb', 'de', 'Der Tempel wird mit Gold gefüllt'),
('928678b0-5b32-1371-a80b-799817ba4dcb', 'en', 'The temple will be filled with gold'),
('8df9ef0c-b45e-9179-0c1c-3bc60d5279e4', 'de', 'Die Erde wird voll werden von der Erkenntnis der Herrlichkeit'),
('8df9ef0c-b45e-9179-0c1c-3bc60d5279e4', 'en', 'The earth will be filled with the knowledge of his glory'),
('ad975fd6-2983-6ee3-9030-c19aadb9e1bb', 'de', 'Jesus salbte ihn mit Öl'),
('ad975fd6-2983-6ee3-9030-c19aadb9e1bb', 'en', 'Jesus anointed him with oil'),
('65894b8c-8631-b764-8235-6bfcd352b196', 'de', 'Der Mann floh schreiend aus der Stadt'),
('65894b8c-8631-b764-8235-6bfcd352b196', 'en', 'The man fled screaming from the city'),
('f36a6ea3-3271-d23e-2dbc-76021a92e9bc', 'de', 'Jesus gebot dem Geist zu schweigen und auszufahren'),
('f36a6ea3-3271-d23e-2dbc-76021a92e9bc', 'en', 'Jesus commanded the spirit to be silent and come out'),
('f64c9b6b-1c92-4382-d5b3-c883ff0a91c7', 'de', 'Die Leute warfen ihn hinaus'),
('f64c9b6b-1c92-4382-d5b3-c883ff0a91c7', 'en', 'The people cast him out'),
('282f9684-3f6a-0a5a-d28e-5da8cfaee8ec', 'de', 'Wie ein Strom, der das Land überflutet'),
('282f9684-3f6a-0a5a-d28e-5da8cfaee8ec', 'en', 'Like a river flooding the land'),
('ad7cd1b2-bbea-e8bd-e474-21df7b263dc7', 'de', 'Wie ein Berg, der fest gegründet ist'),
('ad7cd1b2-bbea-e8bd-e474-21df7b263dc7', 'en', 'Like a mountain firmly founded'),
('36243992-4cee-091b-8b7d-af38c1fbe088', 'de', 'Wie ein Tropfen am Eimer und ein Stäubchen auf der Waage'),
('36243992-4cee-091b-8b7d-af38c1fbe088', 'en', 'Like a drop from a bucket and a speck of dust on the scales'),
('695b2f0c-7fe7-c3c2-44aa-ddd539568afb', 'de', 'Wie ein Heer, das mächtig vor dem Herrn steht'),
('695b2f0c-7fe7-c3c2-44aa-ddd539568afb', 'en', 'Like an army standing mighty before the Lord'),
('14b86027-e66d-ca78-dd3b-2ec7238bfc31', 'de', 'Die Lade zu holen und zu beten'),
('14b86027-e66d-ca78-dd3b-2ec7238bfc31', 'en', 'To fetch the ark and pray'),
('bc8493d6-3ec0-3335-12f5-13704440dab2', 'de', 'Sich schlafen zu legen und nicht zu antworten'),
('bc8493d6-3ec0-3335-12f5-13704440dab2', 'en', 'To lie down and not answer'),
('006cfd09-fa7c-0272-1efc-b8b54ded1b61', 'de', 'Zu antworten: Rede, HERR, denn dein Knecht hört'),
('006cfd09-fa7c-0272-1efc-b8b54ded1b61', 'en', 'To answer: Speak, LORD, for your servant hears'),
('ed2d3388-5483-2149-d63c-418060b3a410', 'de', 'Zum Altar zu gehen und zu opfern'),
('ed2d3388-5483-2149-d63c-418060b3a410', 'en', 'To go to the altar and sacrifice'),
('fae06b84-d017-5fe2-7821-d26ceb79bc9f', 'de', 'Sie hielten ein Fasten von sieben Tagen Trauer'),
('fae06b84-d017-5fe2-7821-d26ceb79bc9f', 'en', 'They held a fast of seven days of mourning'),
('692b0269-4e1a-4deb-0ad8-536ba40eb0a5', 'de', 'Sie zogen schweigend in einer Prozession durch die Stadt'),
('692b0269-4e1a-4deb-0ad8-536ba40eb0a5', 'en', 'They marched silently in procession through the city'),
('7993d19f-26ed-41ba-8ff0-48fa5fb3b61d', 'de', 'Sie weihten das Haus Gottes mit Freude und Opfern ein'),
('7993d19f-26ed-41ba-8ff0-48fa5fb3b61d', 'en', 'They dedicated the house of God with joy and sacrifices'),
('0ae1b090-3c11-8fa7-8299-7163660fd3dd', 'de', 'Sie verschlossen das Haus, bis ein König käme'),
('0ae1b090-3c11-8fa7-8299-7163660fd3dd', 'en', 'They sealed the house until a king should come'),
('d001fad0-fd7b-a46e-4813-e4f59fafd18c', 'de', 'Wie der Winzer die Reben beschneidet'),
('d001fad0-fd7b-a46e-4813-e4f59fafd18c', 'en', 'As the vinedresser prunes the vines'),
('5b5951a5-1103-dd01-fba6-cb7630f701e0', 'de', 'Wie der Hirt die Schafe von den Böcken scheidet'),
('5b5951a5-1103-dd01-fba6-cb7630f701e0', 'en', 'As the shepherd separates the sheep from the goats'),
('1d1ed6aa-1153-3fbe-2557-b190f61db129', 'de', 'Wie der Fischer die Netze einzieht'),
('1d1ed6aa-1153-3fbe-2557-b190f61db129', 'en', 'As the fisherman draws in the nets'),
('2313e5da-b9cd-498b-c20a-656aefb6b83c', 'de', 'Wie der Bauer die Spreu vom Weizen sondert'),
('2313e5da-b9cd-498b-c20a-656aefb6b83c', 'en', 'As the farmer sifts the chaff from the wheat'),
('eeac781d-cc26-700d-dfd9-c90bb7063f53', 'de', '… eine Zeit zum Verlieren'),
('eeac781d-cc26-700d-dfd9-c90bb7063f53', 'en', '… a time to give up as lost'),
('cf1d8a7d-b82d-aa38-4439-9b1de1e41917', 'de', '… eine Zeit zum Bewahren'),
('cf1d8a7d-b82d-aa38-4439-9b1de1e41917', 'en', '… a time to keep'),
('7c22b97b-64f5-fb0e-5264-b13b33868624', 'de', '… eine Zeit zum Finden'),
('7c22b97b-64f5-fb0e-5264-b13b33868624', 'en', '… a time to find'),
('e44306d6-b802-7c23-b712-5fb75df97b24', 'de', '… eine Zeit zum Ruhen'),
('e44306d6-b802-7c23-b712-5fb75df97b24', 'en', '… a time to rest'),
('071c99dd-06e3-707f-1877-a9b56ddb7c19', 'de', 'Er schickte reiche Gaben'),
('071c99dd-06e3-707f-1877-a9b56ddb7c19', 'en', 'He sent rich gifts'),
('5fa9c856-c78f-498b-086a-fe01ee36a711', 'de', 'Er beleidigte David und wies seine Boten schroff ab'),
('5fa9c856-c78f-498b-086a-fe01ee36a711', 'en', 'He insulted David and harshly turned his men away'),
('a74fe0a9-189c-92ff-832d-8281669c52ef', 'de', 'Er lud David zum Mahl ein'),
('a74fe0a9-189c-92ff-832d-8281669c52ef', 'en', 'He invited David to a feast'),
('487c8e20-7dbd-51ff-c542-31a70dd7a615', 'de', 'Er bot ihm seine Tochter an'),
('487c8e20-7dbd-51ff-c542-31a70dd7a615', 'en', 'He offered him his daughter'),
('ee0aca78-6e55-4f11-8098-9a242e887716', 'de', 'Seinen Ring vom Finger'),
('ee0aca78-6e55-4f11-8098-9a242e887716', 'en', 'His ring from his finger'),
('f8316cdd-d6e4-84bb-1f30-04bfa7bd0582', 'de', 'Seinen Stab aus der Hand'),
('f8316cdd-d6e4-84bb-1f30-04bfa7bd0582', 'en', 'His staff from his hand'),
('68574f83-fc5e-b526-00fd-531dfca51f6e', 'de', 'Seine Sandalen an der Tür'),
('68574f83-fc5e-b526-00fd-531dfca51f6e', 'en', 'His sandals at the door'),
('b4cc427c-d45b-a516-22c7-91ddd3a46346', 'de', 'Sein Gewand, das sie festgehalten hatte'),
('b4cc427c-d45b-a516-22c7-91ddd3a46346', 'en', 'His garment, which she had grabbed'),
('cca1efcc-c685-8f48-e21c-e2bb1123736e', 'de', 'Sieben Jahre lang'),
('cca1efcc-c685-8f48-e21c-e2bb1123736e', 'en', 'For seven years'),
('ff45495d-16e9-e7a2-c7fc-05772ef672cd', 'de', 'Achtzehn Jahre lang'),
('ff45495d-16e9-e7a2-c7fc-05772ef672cd', 'en', 'For eighteen years'),
('5022352e-45e8-ea55-d2b7-53ba507808f7', 'de', 'Zwölf Jahre lang'),
('5022352e-45e8-ea55-d2b7-53ba507808f7', 'en', 'For twelve years'),
('cee2718b-568e-a8cd-d4be-2e19f20d4818', 'de', 'Drei Jahre lang'),
('cee2718b-568e-a8cd-d4be-2e19f20d4818', 'en', 'For three years'),
('83e3e770-6638-ccd0-6ff1-36d233881071', 'de', 'Wie ein Tier mit eisernen Zähnen'),
('83e3e770-6638-ccd0-6ff1-36d233881071', 'en', 'Like a beast with iron teeth'),
('af6d9ad2-f0b2-1f47-d85c-8e3051bd8fae', 'de', 'Wie ein Löwe mit Menschenherz'),
('af6d9ad2-f0b2-1f47-d85c-8e3051bd8fae', 'en', 'Like a lion with a human heart'),
('db0e606a-485c-5a39-2020-f15f5a473139', 'de', 'Wie ein Bär mit drei Rippen'),
('db0e606a-485c-5a39-2020-f15f5a473139', 'en', 'Like a bear with three ribs'),
('fa2cc70d-7526-604d-cbcb-7a6b89242b15', 'de', 'Wie ein Leopard mit vier Flügeln und vier Köpfen'),
('fa2cc70d-7526-604d-cbcb-7a6b89242b15', 'en', 'Like a leopard with four wings and four heads'),
('26dfb5f3-20ce-a416-4633-0a861c71296c', 'de', 'Das Manna, das ihnen täglich gegeben wurde'),
('26dfb5f3-20ce-a416-4633-0a861c71296c', 'en', 'The manna given to them daily'),
('f9ae1113-dcb2-e12b-dafa-7b6a5cd11885', 'de', 'Das Brot der Priester'),
('f9ae1113-dcb2-e12b-dafa-7b6a5cd11885', 'en', 'The bread of the priests'),
('93bebaf3-f44c-dafa-4c1e-641e52daf94e', 'de', 'Die Erstlinge der Ernte'),
('93bebaf3-f44c-dafa-4c1e-641e52daf94e', 'en', 'The firstfruits of the harvest'),
('42b932be-40af-88a2-6701-9416fa90442f', 'de', 'Das Fleisch der Opfertiere'),
('42b932be-40af-88a2-6701-9416fa90442f', 'en', 'The flesh of the sacrifices'),
('d6c2b365-b9c6-4c18-c98a-4f0015956507', 'de', 'Er fiel in tiefen, friedlichen Schlaf'),
('d6c2b365-b9c6-4c18-c98a-4f0015956507', 'en', 'He fell into a deep, peaceful sleep'),
('6a744cb4-756b-383e-dcbb-5d126531136a', 'de', 'Er sprang sogleich auf und tanzte'),
('6a744cb4-756b-383e-dcbb-5d126531136a', 'en', 'He at once leapt up and danced'),
('13898223-f7b4-084c-6f51-607d5458d3ea', 'de', 'Er rannte in das Haus seines Vaters'),
('13898223-f7b4-084c-6f51-607d5458d3ea', 'en', 'He ran into his father''s house'),
('eab01eaa-c1be-75a3-af6a-2bf9063bcc81', 'de', 'Er wurde wie tot, sodass viele sagten, er sei gestorben'),
('eab01eaa-c1be-75a3-af6a-2bf9063bcc81', 'en', 'He became like a corpse, so many said he was dead'),
('1f12e66a-eecc-b8b8-a5ab-e86b4c4feb28', 'de', 'Vierzig Jahre alt'),
('1f12e66a-eecc-b8b8-a5ab-e86b4c4feb28', 'en', 'Forty years old'),
('2c4c661a-0ddb-1c60-7fe4-652c5d6a2636', 'de', 'Fünfundachtzig Jahre alt'),
('2c4c661a-0ddb-1c60-7fe4-652c5d6a2636', 'en', 'Eighty-five years old'),
('ce954027-4ef8-d7af-2d85-6c0dfb49cd1b', 'de', 'Siebzig Jahre alt'),
('ce954027-4ef8-d7af-2d85-6c0dfb49cd1b', 'en', 'Seventy years old'),
('0a679501-717d-14c6-a4d9-1b9f21ebb2d9', 'de', 'Hundert Jahre alt'),
('0a679501-717d-14c6-a4d9-1b9f21ebb2d9', 'en', 'One hundred years old'),
('72c4ab76-cdf4-90fe-4fe7-9b9353a6fe50', 'de', 'Warum hast du nicht mehr gewagt'),
('72c4ab76-cdf4-90fe-4fe7-9b9353a6fe50', 'en', 'Why did you not dare more'),
('c0f574cb-0e2a-6809-fae1-ffd5048e0c67', 'de', 'Geh und teile mit den anderen'),
('c0f574cb-0e2a-6809-fae1-ffd5048e0c67', 'en', 'Go and share with the others'),
('e16c950f-cd0c-7ae0-17fd-4bbcff8c928c', 'de', 'Du hast zu wenig gewonnen'),
('e16c950f-cd0c-7ae0-17fd-4bbcff8c928c', 'en', 'You have gained too little'),
('ef51e19f-e0c8-8fa2-1cb2-89f6a90a9bf9', 'de', 'Recht so, du guter und treuer Knecht'),
('ef51e19f-e0c8-8fa2-1cb2-89f6a90a9bf9', 'en', 'Well done, good and faithful servant')
insert into public.answer_option_translations (option_id, lang, text) values
('d7e5d838-1fe2-6325-e1a2-fe1371700dd1', 'de', 'Sie werden auf den sehen, den sie durchbohrt haben'),
('d7e5d838-1fe2-6325-e1a2-fe1371700dd1', 'en', 'They will look on him whom they have pierced'),
('1aea1198-5270-61a3-0f64-a5fd16645ba7', 'de', 'Sie werden den fliehen sehen, der sie verließ'),
('1aea1198-5270-61a3-0f64-a5fd16645ba7', 'en', 'They will see the one flee who left them'),
('06113355-9f4c-5a69-064b-b5cabb8d1054', 'de', 'Sie werden den Hirten suchen, der entkam'),
('06113355-9f4c-5a69-064b-b5cabb8d1054', 'en', 'They will seek the shepherd who escaped'),
('ab69f037-22b1-88e6-4248-bec65b689619', 'de', 'Sie werden den König krönen, den sie verwarfen'),
('ab69f037-22b1-88e6-4248-bec65b689619', 'en', 'They will crown the king they rejected'),
('588caa0d-1f65-54df-b2ee-447722b41a10', 'de', 'Die Herrlichkeit Gottes, und das Lamm ist seine Leuchte'),
('588caa0d-1f65-54df-b2ee-447722b41a10', 'en', 'The glory of God, and the Lamb is its lamp'),
('da26f6c4-d8e9-4d38-4072-df8f7614b78c', 'de', 'Ein Meer von Kristall, das alles erhellt'),
('da26f6c4-d8e9-4d38-4072-df8f7614b78c', 'en', 'A sea of crystal that lights everything'),
('be91e9f8-76ae-81ae-3c28-a88423388c72', 'de', 'Ein Strom aus Feuer rings um die Mauern'),
('be91e9f8-76ae-81ae-3c28-a88423388c72', 'en', 'A river of fire around the walls'),
('6afaf661-9408-3177-4f22-64b021209398', 'de', 'Ein Baum mit Blättern aus reinem Gold'),
('6afaf661-9408-3177-4f22-64b021209398', 'en', 'A tree with leaves of pure gold'),
('7494f569-f30f-44cc-2cc6-8c9b716b62a6', 'de', 'Einen siedenden Topf über dem Feuer'),
('7494f569-f30f-44cc-2cc6-8c9b716b62a6', 'en', 'A boiling pot over the fire'),
('a6801126-9b67-3642-5580-bf917e7cfb8b', 'de', 'Einen Sturmwind, eine große Wolke und loderndes Feuer'),
('a6801126-9b67-3642-5580-bf917e7cfb8b', 'en', 'A stormwind, a great cloud and flashing fire'),
('01aab58b-a89e-5cbc-f257-a6ccf34a983c', 'de', 'Vier Reiter auf farbigen Pferden'),
('01aab58b-a89e-5cbc-f257-a6ccf34a983c', 'en', 'Four riders on colored horses'),
('87c0c9c0-df90-8297-a4a1-db557e9f240d', 'de', 'Eine Leiter, die zum Himmel reichte'),
('87c0c9c0-df90-8297-a4a1-db557e9f240d', 'en', 'A ladder reaching to heaven'),
('994c1498-85ab-f0f7-e55f-f6150a10c304', 'de', 'Das Volk verdarb sich wieder und diente fremden Göttern'),
('994c1498-85ab-f0f7-e55f-f6150a10c304', 'en', 'The people corrupted themselves again and served foreign gods'),
('02e62fd9-0a32-0bb1-1193-f4aa03b618e6', 'de', 'Das Land hatte vierzig Jahre Frieden'),
('02e62fd9-0a32-0bb1-1193-f4aa03b618e6', 'en', 'The land had forty years of peace'),
('282fc0b4-f7c4-9ca7-4e18-bb610e5dcbff', 'de', 'Ein König wurde sofort gesalbt'),
('282fc0b4-f7c4-9ca7-4e18-bb610e5dcbff', 'en', 'A king was immediately anointed'),
('dcb308f4-2e02-12e8-36e1-bc8b829eddd0', 'de', 'Die Stämme zogen nach Ägypten zurück'),
('dcb308f4-2e02-12e8-36e1-bc8b829eddd0', 'en', 'The tribes returned to Egypt'),
('ec187f87-4785-3d37-b5ce-1f084d187beb', 'de', 'Um das Purim-Fest zu begründen'),
('ec187f87-4785-3d37-b5ce-1f084d187beb', 'en', 'To establish the festival of Purim'),
('113fab30-7064-62f1-75e2-45419ff953f3', 'de', 'Um seinen neuen Thronfolger einzusetzen'),
('113fab30-7064-62f1-75e2-45419ff953f3', 'en', 'To install his new heir to the throne'),
('62e21ee1-2f82-41d0-ddf1-a1721d0584d3', 'de', 'Um seinen Sieg über die Griechen zu feiern'),
('62e21ee1-2f82-41d0-ddf1-a1721d0584d3', 'en', 'To celebrate his victory over the Greeks'),
('a8596799-fd35-81aa-5b93-b46d894119df', 'de', 'Um den Reichtum und Glanz seines Königreichs zu zeigen'),
('a8596799-fd35-81aa-5b93-b46d894119df', 'en', 'To display the wealth and splendor of his kingdom'),
('1597be65-b01b-ccc0-9eaf-bda89f5a9208', 'de', 'Dass die Stadt verschont bleibe'),
('1597be65-b01b-ccc0-9eaf-bda89f5a9208', 'en', 'That the city might be spared'),
('abd962e1-59d2-d9c2-5343-2c98130d9b7e', 'de', 'Dass das Feuer vom Himmel falle'),
('abd962e1-59d2-d9c2-5343-2c98130d9b7e', 'en', 'That fire might fall from heaven'),
('5686c8b0-5eb1-4183-216d-b8c792074420', 'de', 'Dass der Kelch an ihm vorübergehe'),
('5686c8b0-5eb1-4183-216d-b8c792074420', 'en', 'That the cup might pass from him'),
('89ab2173-9568-6307-6efa-cda9876992b1', 'de', 'Dass die Engel ihn befreien mögen'),
('89ab2173-9568-6307-6efa-cda9876992b1', 'en', 'That the angels might set him free'),
('bc2c1e50-1a8d-7b8c-0fe4-8011daa0de4a', 'de', 'Als ein furchtloser Held'),
('bc2c1e50-1a8d-7b8c-0fe4-8011daa0de4a', 'en', 'As a fearless hero'),
('063a6b07-8fbb-f71e-a128-bb1589d4d497', 'de', 'Als ein treuer Knecht Babels'),
('063a6b07-8fbb-f71e-a128-bb1589d4d497', 'en', 'As a faithful servant of Babylon'),
('2896555e-636d-d157-8ecf-c0881c77f6c0', 'de', 'Als ein vielgeliebter Mann'),
('2896555e-636d-d157-8ecf-c0881c77f6c0', 'en', 'As a man greatly beloved'),
('8d687011-5374-dc41-26c5-29cdb878bf2f', 'de', 'Als ein großer König'),
('8d687011-5374-dc41-26c5-29cdb878bf2f', 'en', 'As a great king'),
('bf4e521e-ad21-8211-2015-178e6b31db08', 'de', 'Friede den Völkern der Erde'),
('bf4e521e-ad21-8211-2015-178e6b31db08', 'en', 'Peace to the peoples of the earth'),
('24fbd409-24d6-c445-31d6-9868eb1aebcd', 'de', 'Gelobt sei der Hohepriester'),
('24fbd409-24d6-c445-31d6-9868eb1aebcd', 'en', 'Praised be the high priest'),
('7c1dfced-9da9-b3d1-c98c-bc92a3a55172', 'de', 'Heil dem König der Römer'),
('7c1dfced-9da9-b3d1-c98c-bc92a3a55172', 'en', 'Hail to the king of the Romans'),
('e0edb24f-f52b-f5bc-de06-9d834884b541', 'de', 'Hosanna dem Sohne Davids'),
('e0edb24f-f52b-f5bc-de06-9d834884b541', 'en', 'Hosanna to the Son of David'),
('45415144-375f-87f9-54c4-6c88c3c34ab4', 'de', 'Es ist eitel und ohne jeden Wert'),
('45415144-375f-87f9-54c4-6c88c3c34ab4', 'en', 'It is vanity and without any worth'),
('ed9e8f97-722c-6390-c26f-c77bbdd49886', 'de', 'Es bringt nur Kummer und Mühe'),
('ed9e8f97-722c-6390-c26f-c77bbdd49886', 'en', 'It brings only sorrow and toil'),
('1f235189-7884-a3f4-dc28-51c505194233', 'de', 'Es soll man meiden, um weise zu sein'),
('1f235189-7884-a3f4-dc28-51c505194233', 'en', 'It should be avoided to be wise'),
('5cb9f840-ddd3-63ac-330e-dc85fed095cc', 'de', 'Es ist eine Gabe Gottes, sich daran zu freuen'),
('5cb9f840-ddd3-63ac-330e-dc85fed095cc', 'en', 'It is a gift of God to find joy in it'),
('413812e8-95e0-a501-4820-ca672aff60b7', 'de', 'Er wurde traurig'),
('413812e8-95e0-a501-4820-ca672aff60b7', 'en', 'He became grieved'),
('53cfc90b-bffe-0025-76bd-52d41696ca2d', 'de', 'Er wandte sich ab'),
('53cfc90b-bffe-0025-76bd-52d41696ca2d', 'en', 'He turned away'),
('ee3a99b3-ec06-a62b-2469-38e7e0f6fe08', 'de', 'Er schwieg verlegen'),
('ee3a99b3-ec06-a62b-2469-38e7e0f6fe08', 'en', 'He fell silent in embarrassment'),
('17da5d6b-66b2-d1cc-00f4-d0180b872d8b', 'de', 'Er lachte erleichtert'),
('17da5d6b-66b2-d1cc-00f4-d0180b872d8b', 'en', 'He laughed in relief'),
('bd08aecd-d6fd-28d3-8ca7-496558ccbfd7', 'de', 'Sie warteten, bis der König alle Kosten trug'),
('bd08aecd-d6fd-28d3-8ca7-496558ccbfd7', 'en', 'They waited until the king bore all the costs'),
('c0b8e888-adac-7b46-6a06-f074a4e0c203', 'de', 'Sie verkauften ihr Land in Babel für den Bau'),
('c0b8e888-adac-7b46-6a06-f074a4e0c203', 'en', 'They sold their land in Babylon for the building'),
('b11668db-940a-48a1-16c8-0f07a9e20867', 'de', 'Sie zogen erst eine Steuer von den Nachbarvölkern ein'),
('b11668db-940a-48a1-16c8-0f07a9e20867', 'en', 'They first collected a tax from neighboring peoples'),
('d9d94010-df11-ff80-6558-76f65ffa505c', 'de', 'Sie gaben nach ihrem Vermögen Gold, Silber und Geräte'),
('d9d94010-df11-ff80-6558-76f65ffa505c', 'en', 'They gave gold, silver and vessels according to their means'),
('c2a9be0d-7b77-a52a-a754-ad1c3b960bf7', 'de', 'Vor dem Gericht der zwölf Stämme'),
('c2a9be0d-7b77-a52a-a754-ad1c3b960bf7', 'en', 'Before the court of the twelve tribes'),
('0fa70b6b-6d44-75a8-24a8-6189ac3da012', 'de', 'Vor dem Hohen Rat'),
('0fa70b6b-6d44-75a8-24a8-6189ac3da012', 'en', 'Before the Sanhedrin'),
('7dbe1286-6b3b-b248-7e09-cb4e8c8462b1', 'de', 'Vor dem Ältestenrat von Galiläa'),
('7dbe1286-6b3b-b248-7e09-cb4e8c8462b1', 'en', 'Before the council of elders of Galilee'),
('e4ef9cfd-7c15-6d31-63cf-6cc2d59e16df', 'de', 'Vor der Versammlung der Schriftgelehrten in Bethanien'),
('e4ef9cfd-7c15-6d31-63cf-6cc2d59e16df', 'en', 'Before the assembly of scribes in Bethany'),
('bf22ab04-db8b-f9f8-692a-09ef144504fd', 'de', 'So weit der Tag von der Nacht'),
('bf22ab04-db8b-f9f8-692a-09ef144504fd', 'en', 'As far as the day from the night'),
('a1487094-30ae-d00a-618d-b4ba3e80019f', 'de', 'So fern der Osten ist vom Westen'),
('a1487094-30ae-d00a-618d-b4ba3e80019f', 'en', 'As far as the east is from the west'),
('38953579-d948-401a-05b1-13ae24ec4890', 'de', 'So tief das Meer in seinen Gründen'),
('38953579-d948-401a-05b1-13ae24ec4890', 'en', 'As deep as the sea in its depths'),
('910ee5af-880b-5b96-71df-e45ea982335b', 'de', 'So hoch der Himmel über den Sternen'),
('910ee5af-880b-5b96-71df-e45ea982335b', 'en', 'As high as the heaven above the stars'),
('7a9ca144-6bd3-ab33-babe-a4c0c21d6c99', 'de', 'Sie flohen aus dem Lager'),
('7a9ca144-6bd3-ab33-babe-a4c0c21d6c99', 'en', 'They fled from the camp'),
('ed95f1b5-e495-db84-a958-79acd61c23d9', 'de', 'Sie wurden von der Erde verschlungen'),
('ed95f1b5-e495-db84-a958-79acd61c23d9', 'en', 'They were swallowed by the earth'),
('8f40455a-8bd7-a9e4-cd13-7e8112585210', 'de', 'Sie wurden mit Aussatz geschlagen'),
('8f40455a-8bd7-a9e4-cd13-7e8112585210', 'en', 'They were struck with leprosy'),
('2222fba3-14e7-3714-d897-dc5af57bfe5c', 'de', 'Feuer verzehrte sie vom HERRN'),
('2222fba3-14e7-3714-d897-dc5af57bfe5c', 'en', 'Fire from the LORD consumed them'),
('b8214c73-c29d-4b55-fe4d-9a429bc365b1', 'de', 'Der Kerkermeister gab ihnen die Schlüssel'),
('b8214c73-c29d-4b55-fe4d-9a429bc365b1', 'en', 'The jailer gave them the keys'),
('f8af31af-9162-c631-4c3b-393da9b20498', 'de', 'Ein Erdbeben öffnete alle Türen und löste die Fesseln'),
('f8af31af-9162-c631-4c3b-393da9b20498', 'en', 'An earthquake opened all the doors and loosed the chains'),
('0b3cba56-f9dd-acef-442d-d62e89f3d212', 'de', 'Ein Licht erfüllte den Kerker'),
('0b3cba56-f9dd-acef-442d-d62e89f3d212', 'en', 'A light filled the cell'),
('31666766-fde5-052a-9911-fcd524480be3', 'de', 'Ein Engel führte sie hinaus'),
('31666766-fde5-052a-9911-fcd524480be3', 'en', 'An angel led them out'),
('dddb15a3-50d7-103a-92bd-d4eaf58c5a58', 'de', 'In das Haus Abinadabs in Kirjat-Jearim'),
('dddb15a3-50d7-103a-92bd-d4eaf58c5a58', 'en', 'To the house of Abinadab in Kiriath-jearim'),
('614a606c-d203-070f-1620-9f7573404045', 'de', 'Zurück nach Silo'),
('614a606c-d203-070f-1620-9f7573404045', 'en', 'Back to Shiloh'),
('0d1c178e-9dc6-d3c0-ccd5-7baca41f0603', 'de', 'In die Stadt Gibea'),
('0d1c178e-9dc6-d3c0-ccd5-7baca41f0603', 'en', 'To the city of Gibeah'),
('4f23812c-9818-10c6-8862-b53244b9b08f', 'de', 'In den Tempel zu Jerusalem'),
('4f23812c-9818-10c6-8862-b53244b9b08f', 'en', 'To the temple in Jerusalem'),
('27894a5a-c0c5-e85d-ba90-2abd57d4f810', 'de', 'Ihre Kleider zu zerreißen'),
('27894a5a-c0c5-e85d-ba90-2abd57d4f810', 'en', 'Tearing their garments'),
('7eacecc6-b91e-3930-c443-225da0377589', 'de', 'In der Nacht zu opfern'),
('7eacecc6-b91e-3930-c443-225da0377589', 'en', 'Sacrificing at night'),
('fb400222-ead2-e979-1439-bd87dc9ff584', 'de', 'Wein und starkes Getränk zu trinken'),
('fb400222-ead2-e979-1439-bd87dc9ff584', 'en', 'Drinking wine and strong drink'),
('03ef1660-78fb-6a37-d0a4-1460509d0fc2', 'de', 'Die Asche zu berühren'),
('03ef1660-78fb-6a37-d0a4-1460509d0fc2', 'en', 'Touching the ashes'),
('4070c263-3729-fd47-7463-4ffad319eafe', 'de', 'Die Gebeine Jakobs'),
('4070c263-3729-fd47-7463-4ffad319eafe', 'en', 'The bones of Jacob'),
('4851b850-8c6f-ba18-aab0-11abad126c67', 'de', 'Die Gebeine Josefs'),
('4851b850-8c6f-ba18-aab0-11abad126c67', 'en', 'The bones of Joseph'),
('d3c45142-2443-34c1-9c05-148a2d48969b', 'de', 'Die Gebeine Isaaks'),
('d3c45142-2443-34c1-9c05-148a2d48969b', 'en', 'The bones of Isaac'),
('df53ad3b-8e27-3365-ede8-c44e23f3a7d2', 'de', 'Die Gebeine Abrahams'),
('df53ad3b-8e27-3365-ede8-c44e23f3a7d2', 'en', 'The bones of Abraham'),
('bd9e7c4d-36ff-3869-2178-0402a6f279ba', 'de', 'Weil am Sabbat keins fallen würde'),
('bd9e7c4d-36ff-3869-2178-0402a6f279ba', 'en', 'Because none would fall on the Sabbath'),
('c6ac5ef4-92d2-66cc-a43d-a5874bed36e2', 'de', 'Weil es sonst verderben würde'),
('c6ac5ef4-92d2-66cc-a43d-a5874bed36e2', 'en', 'Because it would otherwise spoil'),
('79d4ed63-dac6-c2a9-bb54-9c8b1829b029', 'de', 'Weil es nur einmal in der Woche kam'),
('79d4ed63-dac6-c2a9-bb54-9c8b1829b029', 'en', 'Because it came only once a week'),
('0a9807bc-d052-1377-707c-ab4da478bdfe', 'de', 'Weil am siebten Tag Fest war'),
('0a9807bc-d052-1377-707c-ab4da478bdfe', 'en', 'Because the seventh day was a feast'),
('cfdfb92f-114f-464e-dd05-4d95aa7927b6', 'de', 'Es hatte große eiserne Zähne und zehn Hörner'),
('cfdfb92f-114f-464e-dd05-4d95aa7927b6', 'en', 'It had great iron teeth and ten horns'),
('3bcc81a3-9d5e-3307-18d2-a113054143bf', 'de', 'Es konnte fliegen'),
('3bcc81a3-9d5e-3307-18d2-a113054143bf', 'en', 'It could fly'),
('ebf4b086-92bc-ad75-61ba-952f33b6c957', 'de', 'Es spie Feuer'),
('ebf4b086-92bc-ad75-61ba-952f33b6c957', 'en', 'It breathed fire'),
('806cbfd2-c18b-eed4-4707-bd141e2abd33', 'de', 'Es hatte vier Köpfe'),
('806cbfd2-c18b-eed4-4707-bd141e2abd33', 'en', 'It had four heads'),
('0d3a8ba2-8d36-223f-45f7-9ef60a7e61a8', 'de', 'Gideon, der Niederreißer'),
('0d3a8ba2-8d36-223f-45f7-9ef60a7e61a8', 'en', 'Gideon the demolisher'),
('53a8a782-d8a3-93c0-bbd5-0a2b6ab29b3f', 'de', 'Bedan, der Befreier'),
('53a8a782-d8a3-93c0-bbd5-0a2b6ab29b3f', 'en', 'Bedan the deliverer'),
('db052380-ca76-21bf-911a-8b05775558c4', 'de', 'Israel, weil er mit Gott gerungen hat'),
('db052380-ca76-21bf-911a-8b05775558c4', 'en', 'Israel, because he wrestled with God'),
('a0946743-2f16-91fe-0415-654652b4a2ff', 'de', 'Jerubbaal, weil Baal mit ihm streiten möge'),
('a0946743-2f16-91fe-0415-654652b4a2ff', 'en', 'Jerubbaal, because let Baal contend with him'),
('b50ce520-eea6-18f7-ab0f-88274e7b1efa', 'de', 'Über seine Fähigkeit zu heilen'),
('b50ce520-eea6-18f7-ab0f-88274e7b1efa', 'en', 'At his ability to heal'),
('1de94233-9431-8bb5-3ee1-79aa99c90d91', 'de', 'Über seine Kenntnis fremder Sprachen'),
('1de94233-9431-8bb5-3ee1-79aa99c90d91', 'en', 'At his knowledge of foreign languages'),
('41aefa4c-ac02-dba1-d552-6f449bd88319', 'de', 'Über seinen Verstand und seine Antworten'),
('41aefa4c-ac02-dba1-d552-6f449bd88319', 'en', 'At his understanding and his answers'),
('6b30c474-6767-9e75-fcd4-bd4218405f77', 'de', 'Über seine kostbare Kleidung'),
('6b30c474-6767-9e75-fcd4-bd4218405f77', 'en', 'At his costly clothing'),
('01b34178-c236-83bf-84d7-7a7f18f211ba', 'de', 'Nicht ich lebe, sondern Christus lebt in mir'),
('01b34178-c236-83bf-84d7-7a7f18f211ba', 'en', 'It is no longer I who live, but Christ lives in me'),
('c1769c6a-8ed1-2765-e3aa-d038f36a47d1', 'de', 'Nicht Christus, sondern ich lebe allein'),
('c1769c6a-8ed1-2765-e3aa-d038f36a47d1', 'en', 'Not Christ, but I alone live'),
('7d3b2eee-9ebd-f73c-96ca-389f66db2e55', 'de', 'Ich lebe für die Ehre der Menschen'),
('7d3b2eee-9ebd-f73c-96ca-389f66db2e55', 'en', 'I live for the honor of men'),
('b583a542-5ac9-4ade-65a7-bc1b238f5388', 'de', 'Ich lebe nur für das Gesetz'),
('b583a542-5ac9-4ade-65a7-bc1b238f5388', 'en', 'I live only for the law'),
('1edc2fd3-9814-8d99-7510-0609fbd33a40', 'de', 'Zum Bau eines neuen Palastes'),
('1edc2fd3-9814-8d99-7510-0609fbd33a40', 'en', 'For building a new palace'),
('febe31dd-d36a-b1bd-1d00-0ba2cd0c9126', 'de', 'Zur Bezahlung von Söldnern'),
('febe31dd-d36a-b1bd-1d00-0ba2cd0c9126', 'en', 'For paying mercenaries'),
('6f164213-3a02-e9ec-59f1-a253bc835dde', 'de', 'Für Opfer an fremde Götter'),
('6f164213-3a02-e9ec-59f1-a253bc835dde', 'en', 'For offerings to foreign gods'),
('2c1177bb-7fcf-6a0e-bf97-3c2c793486c6', 'de', 'Zur Ausbesserung des Tempels des HERRN'),
('2c1177bb-7fcf-6a0e-bf97-3c2c793486c6', 'en', 'For repairing the temple of the LORD'),
('0688e015-f8a8-7abe-c181-2d5dc992d1e1', 'de', 'Drei, die seine Vertrauten waren'),
('0688e015-f8a8-7abe-c181-2d5dc992d1e1', 'en', 'Three, who were his close friends'),
('8459b3b3-c601-ce4c-d6ef-1c881d9a2c10', 'de', 'Siebzig, die er aussandte'),
('8459b3b3-c601-ce4c-d6ef-1c881d9a2c10', 'en', 'Seventy, whom he sent out'),
('1a59837e-a19d-930a-2268-e660eff0b842', 'de', 'Zwölf, die er auch Apostel nannte'),
('1a59837e-a19d-930a-2268-e660eff0b842', 'en', 'Twelve, whom he also named apostles'),
('83f48f5d-cead-272a-0061-9b21d6453c30', 'de', 'Sieben, die er als Diener wählte'),
('83f48f5d-cead-272a-0061-9b21d6453c30', 'en', 'Seven, whom he chose as servants'),
('8740cc9b-f3ce-4a6c-55da-3bc2e3b6a19e', 'de', 'Ihn gegen das eigene Volk aufzubringen'),
('8740cc9b-f3ce-4a6c-55da-3bc2e3b6a19e', 'en', 'To turn him against his own people'),
('5d5a2c05-a214-6aeb-f5cd-a14a0ed11176', 'de', 'Ihn zur Aufgabe der Mundschenk-Stelle zu drängen'),
('5d5a2c05-a214-6aeb-f5cd-a14a0ed11176', 'en', 'To pressure him to give up the cupbearer post'),
('048999cd-8dca-1e89-8360-8b0832ec6efc', 'de', 'Ihn zu verlocken, nach Persien zurückzukehren'),
('048999cd-8dca-1e89-8360-8b0832ec6efc', 'en', 'To entice him to return to Persia'),
('b928b56f-07d9-e02d-3daa-d19182312916', 'de', 'Ihn zu erschrecken, er plane Aufruhr und mache sich zum König'),
('b928b56f-07d9-e02d-3daa-d19182312916', 'en', 'To frighten him, claiming he plotted revolt to make himself king'),
('5eba1ad6-9d46-8285-2e8c-88a5e5ad3e28', 'de', 'Er blieb reich und teilte nichts'),
('5eba1ad6-9d46-8285-2e8c-88a5e5ad3e28', 'en', 'He stayed rich and shared nothing'),
('daa28569-4d74-eff2-dd77-15bd6aca1c33', 'de', 'Er wurde reich, um uns arm zu lassen'),
('daa28569-4d74-eff2-dd77-15bd6aca1c33', 'en', 'He became rich to leave us poor'),
('46445f0d-4e8b-0e05-44eb-b59ff9db9aa2', 'de', 'Er verlangte unseren Reichtum'),
('46445f0d-4e8b-0e05-44eb-b59ff9db9aa2', 'en', 'He demanded our riches'),
('931ac362-ac28-f028-332f-3525f04ecf37', 'de', 'Er wurde arm, damit wir reich würden'),
('931ac362-ac28-f028-332f-3525f04ecf37', 'en', 'He became poor so that we might become rich'),
('d83a239d-afeb-909e-c8b7-191ebf0a4cd3', 'de', 'Sie ließ die übrigen Münzen zählen'),
('d83a239d-afeb-909e-c8b7-191ebf0a4cd3', 'en', 'She had the remaining coins counted'),
('a35ddec7-0b9e-9932-856c-b4b3c555e7d7', 'de', 'Sie ging zu den Nachbarn um Geld zu leihen'),
('a35ddec7-0b9e-9932-856c-b4b3c555e7d7', 'en', 'She went to the neighbors to borrow money'),
('75f6ce7c-2c28-ade7-195f-f8c26234d4ad', 'de', 'Sie zündete ein Licht an und kehrte das ganze Haus'),
('75f6ce7c-2c28-ade7-195f-f8c26234d4ad', 'en', 'She lit a lamp and swept the whole house'),
('05a28e8b-4426-c5e4-1a96-6908a0a01135', 'de', 'Sie wartete bis zum Morgenlicht'),
('05a28e8b-4426-c5e4-1a96-6908a0a01135', 'en', 'She waited until morning light'),
('cb5fcce6-8706-b999-f301-b864537b8044', 'de', 'Den Rat, die Priester zu töten'),
('cb5fcce6-8706-b999-f301-b864537b8044', 'en', 'The counsel to kill the priests'),
('eef7df3f-e736-fbb6-435e-9aa0fc843c2b', 'de', 'Den Rat, Absalom selbst zu krönen'),
('eef7df3f-e736-fbb6-435e-9aa0fc843c2b', 'en', 'The counsel to crown Absalom himself'),
('77d35131-c342-90db-137a-85d828a18ab6', 'de', 'Den Rat, Jerusalem niederzubrennen'),
('77d35131-c342-90db-137a-85d828a18ab6', 'en', 'The counsel to burn down Jerusalem'),
('3a74a6fc-52c5-b23f-9e3f-0acc015b5e78', 'de', 'Den Rat, David noch in der Nacht mit zwölftausend Mann zu schlagen'),
('3a74a6fc-52c5-b23f-9e3f-0acc015b5e78', 'en', 'The counsel to strike David that very night with twelve thousand men'),
('f7e41173-2176-f1ff-8da3-c8016f5c0a3e', 'de', 'Mit einem erhobenen Schwert'),
('f7e41173-2176-f1ff-8da3-c8016f5c0a3e', 'en', 'With a raised sword'),
('a52016c1-55cb-e6b8-c837-65c1f1f61612', 'de', 'Mit einem Kuss'),
('a52016c1-55cb-e6b8-c837-65c1f1f61612', 'en', 'With a kiss'),
('fc7b0dcf-09f4-0f60-af61-0abf9eadd5cc', 'de', 'Mit einem geschriebenen Brief'),
('fc7b0dcf-09f4-0f60-af61-0abf9eadd5cc', 'en', 'With a written letter'),
('e19b260f-e91f-2953-a4b4-2e331c246770', 'de', 'Mit einem gegebenen Zeichen aus Feuer'),
('e19b260f-e91f-2953-a4b4-2e331c246770', 'en', 'With a sign given by fire'),
