('ef83227a-a62b-0340-fa4e-438cb3afa558', 'de', 'Dass er und seine Söhne sterben und Israel verlieren werde'),
('ef83227a-a62b-0340-fa4e-438cb3afa558', 'en', 'That he and his sons would die and Israel would lose'),
