('01e1c286-2fa1-114f-c52e-5f99a17dd410', 'en', 'God despises them because of the people''s injustice'),
('69b3e11e-2b01-6bd1-03ea-ccfc48f4f32d', 'de', 'Sie waren zu selten geworden'),
