('47b7928e-eb87-2952-44aa-cbfa2efcd42b', 'en', 'It was given to the people to eat'),
('65ed2da9-496e-f200-0ab7-085b723fea80', 'de', 'Das Gesetz rettet aus sich selbst'),
('65ed2da9-496e-f200-0ab7-085b723fea80', 'en', 'The law saves by itself'),
('ffebd9f6-2fe3-c96c-20ac-8b6438a0b629', 'de', 'Der Glaube ist ohne Wert'),
('ffebd9f6-2fe3-c96c-20ac-8b6438a0b629', 'en', 'Faith is worthless'),
('13944a67-91ed-c412-38f8-86022049f22a', 'de', 'Das Gesetz ersetzt den Glauben'),
('13944a67-91ed-c412-38f8-86022049f22a', 'en', 'The law replaces faith'),
('df42205c-df67-7479-73ad-54b1d422f7f1', 'de', 'Das Gesetz war ein Erzieher hin zu Christus'),
('df42205c-df67-7479-73ad-54b1d422f7f1', 'en', 'The law was a guardian to lead to Christ'),
('b2918ecd-661a-1e57-5189-e7cf6cbfe6bd', 'de', 'Wir haben Reichtum in der Welt'),
('b2918ecd-661a-1e57-5189-e7cf6cbfe6bd', 'en', 'We have wealth in the world'),
('8892670e-3a7e-6ab0-34be-d4fd466532e8', 'de', 'Wir haben Ehre vor Menschen'),
('8892670e-3a7e-6ab0-34be-d4fd466532e8', 'en', 'We have honor before men'),
('ba831986-d217-1409-693d-3586e8342b51', 'de', 'Wir haben Frieden mit Gott'),
('ba831986-d217-1409-693d-3586e8342b51', 'en', 'We have peace with God'),
('c756a6c6-52d5-2b0f-976c-54fa5caa4f9f', 'de', 'Wir haben Macht über andere'),
('c756a6c6-52d5-2b0f-976c-54fa5caa4f9f', 'en', 'We have power over others'),
('b3b89465-a1d8-df32-8bca-aef337fd8a51', 'de', 'Er soll über die anderen herrschen'),
('b3b89465-a1d8-df32-8bca-aef337fd8a51', 'en', 'He shall rule over the others'),
('8036c530-e207-bbf5-e462-f2856cc574a2', 'de', 'Er soll viele Gaben sammeln'),
('8036c530-e207-bbf5-e462-f2856cc574a2', 'en', 'He shall gather many gifts'),
('d174a9e6-aaa0-c866-07d0-ebaf402df45c', 'de', 'Er soll am Tisch oben sitzen'),
('d174a9e6-aaa0-c866-07d0-ebaf402df45c', 'en', 'He shall sit at the head of the table'),
('aecc43bb-94e7-a68b-b546-23c8f2ef0c07', 'de', 'Er soll euer Diener sein'),
('aecc43bb-94e7-a68b-b546-23c8f2ef0c07', 'en', 'He shall be your servant'),
('9321b352-9958-1f40-dc6e-240077cab02e', 'de', 'Er weihte ihn dem HERRN allein'),
('9321b352-9958-1f40-dc6e-240077cab02e', 'en', 'He dedicated it to the LORD alone'),
('052e9541-3ad1-f564-844a-41fe2f9686d2', 'de', 'Er zerstörte den Tempelaltar ganz'),
('052e9541-3ad1-f564-844a-41fe2f9686d2', 'en', 'He destroyed the temple altar entirely'),
('fc08dced-4967-f990-2dd0-667ff1e1fbca', 'de', 'Er ließ ihn nachbauen und im Tempel aufstellen'),
('fc08dced-4967-f990-2dd0-667ff1e1fbca', 'en', 'He had it copied and set up in the temple'),
('49b0d2d3-f468-89a0-69b6-863bf1f9db88', 'de', 'Er stellte ihn vor das Stadttor'),
('49b0d2d3-f468-89a0-69b6-863bf1f9db88', 'en', 'He placed it before the city gate'),
('fa164420-ce0e-fc9b-a059-2d424074150a', 'de', 'Weil David ihm das Betreten verbot'),
('fa164420-ce0e-fc9b-a059-2d424074150a', 'en', 'Because David forbade him to enter'),
('7526e5bf-0e45-f9f0-1ba0-9d50edd1dac0', 'de', 'Weil die Lade und das Heer im Feld lagerten und er nicht ruhen wollte'),
('7526e5bf-0e45-f9f0-1ba0-9d50edd1dac0', 'en', 'Because the ark and the army were in the field and he would not rest'),
('4db77671-c04c-1771-6ddb-f216731b7a6a', 'de', 'Weil er Batseba der Untreue verdächtigte'),
('4db77671-c04c-1771-6ddb-f216731b7a6a', 'en', 'Because he suspected Bathsheba of unfaithfulness'),
('a1183bc5-e1be-4415-96f6-449c4b961242', 'de', 'Weil er sofort wieder ins Feld zurückeilte'),
('a1183bc5-e1be-4415-96f6-449c4b961242', 'en', 'Because he hurried straight back to the field'),
('2a4665e1-1ab6-07de-72ad-41f3eba5ffba', 'de', 'Weil sie heimlich fremde Götter angebetet hatte'),
('2a4665e1-1ab6-07de-72ad-41f3eba5ffba', 'en', 'Because she had secretly worshiped foreign gods'),
('1fd32e58-9c0d-2daa-c8bb-af1b1382dd9f', 'de', 'Weil sie das Volk gegen den König aufwiegelte'),
('1fd32e58-9c0d-2daa-c8bb-af1b1382dd9f', 'en', 'Because she stirred the people against the king'),
('7d72450b-83f4-b487-bb2f-2409bf68ceb9', 'de', 'Weil sie sich weigerte, auf seinen Befehl zu erscheinen'),
('7d72450b-83f4-b487-bb2f-2409bf68ceb9', 'en', 'Because she refused to appear at his command'),
('788a4fee-9a08-5860-d532-8d746eada3af', 'de', 'Weil sie einen anderen Mann begünstigt hatte'),
('788a4fee-9a08-5860-d532-8d746eada3af', 'en', 'Because she had favored another man'),
('1136ac1c-b375-29bf-b8c8-b2bfb7d49738', 'de', 'Mit einem Strom von lebendigem Wasser'),
('1136ac1c-b375-29bf-b8c8-b2bfb7d49738', 'en', 'With a stream of living water'),
('acccd6f2-ae91-4058-a39c-49c7cc66e722', 'de', 'Mit einer Schar von Hirten auf dem Feld'),
('acccd6f2-ae91-4058-a39c-49c7cc66e722', 'en', 'With a band of shepherds in the field'),
('9991c4f4-7beb-29ca-1ed7-92d4c02e0dc4', 'de', 'Mit einem Heer von Engeln am Himmel'),
('9991c4f4-7beb-29ca-1ed7-92d4c02e0dc4', 'en', 'With a host of angels in heaven'),
('2dc2682d-4102-36d2-58ec-390740df0835', 'de', 'Mit einer großen Wolke von Zeugen'),
('2dc2682d-4102-36d2-58ec-390740df0835', 'en', 'With a great cloud of witnesses'),
('eec19a31-bdf8-b96e-db90-555a4cd294fe', 'de', 'Wenn sie doppelten Zehnten zahlten'),
('eec19a31-bdf8-b96e-db90-555a4cd294fe', 'en', 'If they paid a double tithe'),
('4d4032d2-d997-200a-2921-5888061f157c', 'de', 'Wenn sie ein eigenes Heiligtum bauten'),
('4d4032d2-d997-200a-2921-5888061f157c', 'en', 'If they built their own sanctuary'),
('c353812c-0dce-8ce8-39a9-b39a1da3e3d0', 'de', 'Wenn sie bewaffnet mit Israel in den Kampf zögen'),
('c353812c-0dce-8ce8-39a9-b39a1da3e3d0', 'en', 'If they went armed into battle with Israel'),
('8ab5d535-f945-02bd-d8ac-f19970cabbf1', 'de', 'Wenn sie die Leviten versorgten'),
('8ab5d535-f945-02bd-d8ac-f19970cabbf1', 'en', 'If they provided for the Levites'),
('80ed580b-47c2-b831-72a2-62f32d2c7bf8', 'de', 'Thomas'),
('80ed580b-47c2-b831-72a2-62f32d2c7bf8', 'en', 'Thomas'),
('483f24cd-44ca-bd45-708e-4dd3d2223ba7', 'de', 'Philippus'),
('483f24cd-44ca-bd45-708e-4dd3d2223ba7', 'en', 'Philip'),
('861780cf-e7e0-3e24-be3c-89dee014c5e4', 'de', 'Petrus'),
('861780cf-e7e0-3e24-be3c-89dee014c5e4', 'en', 'Peter'),
('c7aee738-55f0-479f-b1cc-0f0acdda3d24', 'de', 'Johannes'),
('c7aee738-55f0-479f-b1cc-0f0acdda3d24', 'en', 'John'),
('47cddd72-5afb-d0c7-5913-989db8a59c68', 'de', 'Selig sind, die da Leid tragen'),
('47cddd72-5afb-d0c7-5913-989db8a59c68', 'en', 'Blessed are those who mourn'),
('504f8dcd-04a7-8915-d32b-6b638bf562a9', 'de', 'Liebet eure Feinde'),
('504f8dcd-04a7-8915-d32b-6b638bf562a9', 'en', 'Love your enemies'),
('22a399f1-e383-e6e9-16dd-a01182b71b72', 'de', 'Tut Buße, denn das Himmelreich ist nahe herbeigekommen'),
('22a399f1-e383-e6e9-16dd-a01182b71b72', 'en', 'Repent, for the kingdom of heaven is at hand'),
('63b30d7d-4690-c4d2-2148-2939a9f34451', 'de', 'Folget mir nach'),
('63b30d7d-4690-c4d2-2148-2939a9f34451', 'en', 'Follow me'),
('dd0be0e8-961a-53b3-eee9-344f84ff90ec', 'de', 'Die Aschera am Tempel'),
('dd0be0e8-961a-53b3-eee9-344f84ff90ec', 'en', 'The Asherah at the temple'),
('49931e0d-743f-a3ee-ee39-e6b4762f11e9', 'de', 'Den Altar Baals'),
('49931e0d-743f-a3ee-ee39-e6b4762f11e9', 'en', 'The altar of Baal'),
('e85caf86-ca97-6001-b199-ad6b30a647c0', 'de', 'Die eherne Schlange Moses'),
('e85caf86-ca97-6001-b199-ad6b30a647c0', 'en', 'The bronze serpent of Moses'),
('c708af43-5321-9e80-1005-9c485c92046f', 'de', 'Das goldene Kalb'),
('c708af43-5321-9e80-1005-9c485c92046f', 'en', 'The golden calf'),
('66215b91-da37-f8d4-5d76-34e44aac227c', 'de', 'Als Erinnerungszeichen für die Kinder'),
('66215b91-da37-f8d4-5d76-34e44aac227c', 'en', 'As a memorial sign for the children'),
('6bc2f61f-7ea6-e589-38bd-ef269c58238c', 'de', 'Als Grenzmal des Landes'),
('6bc2f61f-7ea6-e589-38bd-ef269c58238c', 'en', 'As a boundary marker of the land'),
('4f47b7d8-d46c-b412-df1d-cffc08f42357', 'de', 'Als Altar für Brandopfer'),
('4f47b7d8-d46c-b412-df1d-cffc08f42357', 'en', 'As an altar for burnt offerings'),
('b5e89b70-f224-548f-0f48-b590ededeb26', 'de', 'Als Fundament eines Heiligtums'),
('b5e89b70-f224-548f-0f48-b590ededeb26', 'en', 'As the foundation of a sanctuary'),
('b9dfee5a-e52d-a07c-ca79-0fbe6f83a272', 'de', 'Sie zerschlug Pflanzen, Bäume und Menschen im Freien'),
('b9dfee5a-e52d-a07c-ca79-0fbe6f83a272', 'en', 'It struck down plants, trees and people in the open'),
('eca39647-789d-6676-e111-3ceb7aacd7c7', 'de', 'Sie verdunkelte den Himmel drei Tage lang'),
('eca39647-789d-6676-e111-3ceb7aacd7c7', 'en', 'It darkened the sky for three days'),
('d9f9e2c3-a1e4-45ed-14d8-1a56c046b276', 'de', 'Sie ließ den Nil zu Blut werden'),
('d9f9e2c3-a1e4-45ed-14d8-1a56c046b276', 'en', 'It turned the Nile to blood'),
('ba4e2aa7-8fa9-6882-cb8a-f7096dfc5026', 'de', 'Sie tötete alle Erstgeborenen'),
('ba4e2aa7-8fa9-6882-cb8a-f7096dfc5026', 'en', 'It killed all the firstborn'),
('f6db13c8-c434-e2bc-1c39-96edc34e0c43', 'de', 'Sie flohen über den Jordan'),
('f6db13c8-c434-e2bc-1c39-96edc34e0c43', 'en', 'They fled across the Jordan'),
('7cab2ede-e7c8-8716-09f4-3978a38cd5ae', 'de', 'Sie holten die Leichname von der Mauer und bestatteten sie'),
('7cab2ede-e7c8-8716-09f4-3978a38cd5ae', 'en', 'They retrieved the bodies from the wall and buried them'),
('64e8583d-c16f-b687-438d-4c2776015551', 'de', 'Sie übergaben die Stadt den Philistern'),
('64e8583d-c16f-b687-438d-4c2776015551', 'en', 'They handed the city to the Philistines'),
('72969e6d-2874-9416-c452-b3bdc4395d4d', 'de', 'Sie krönten David zum König'),
('72969e6d-2874-9416-c452-b3bdc4395d4d', 'en', 'They crowned David king'),
('7b46c634-d7da-f51a-7e35-062256f03189', 'de', 'Andreas, Matthäus und Bartholomäus'),
('7b46c634-d7da-f51a-7e35-062256f03189', 'en', 'Andrew, Matthew and Bartholomew'),
('f1f59945-04a6-de66-7170-b58d09bd9d51', 'de', 'Petrus, Andreas und Philippus'),
('f1f59945-04a6-de66-7170-b58d09bd9d51', 'en', 'Peter, Andrew and Philip'),
('b86895d3-3ec7-333e-894b-8b1aab698719', 'de', 'Petrus, Jakobus und Johannes'),
('b86895d3-3ec7-333e-894b-8b1aab698719', 'en', 'Peter, James and John'),
('3cc7b4e8-cf0e-0037-8f3c-5909f755d228', 'de', 'Jakobus, Johannes und Thomas'),
('3cc7b4e8-cf0e-0037-8f3c-5909f755d228', 'en', 'James, John and Thomas'),
('1a7f2cae-98c6-9a4a-9d0b-a5d338414a1c', 'de', 'Waffen und Wagen'),
('1a7f2cae-98c6-9a4a-9d0b-a5d338414a1c', 'en', 'Weapons and chariots'),
('d376f5ac-be07-79bd-fbae-0956e0aea8ca', 'de', 'Schafe und Rinder'),
('d376f5ac-be07-79bd-fbae-0956e0aea8ca', 'en', 'Sheep and cattle'),
('a31dd622-0c2f-4534-9b00-764cfdfb789d', 'de', 'Brot und Wein'),
('a31dd622-0c2f-4534-9b00-764cfdfb789d', 'en', 'Bread and wine'),
('692d8ce4-25dc-8014-6b30-49f029b1de9c', 'de', 'Silber, Gold und Kleider'),
('692d8ce4-25dc-8014-6b30-49f029b1de9c', 'en', 'Silver, gold and clothing'),
('3112d8f0-b0c6-1fd4-b5a9-be5eea574bf5', 'de', 'Dem Engel des Gerichts'),
('3112d8f0-b0c6-1fd4-b5a9-be5eea574bf5', 'en', 'To the angel of judgment'),
('2c0bdcf9-e66f-e38a-dadc-764c3fe418e6', 'de', 'Dem Propheten der Endzeit'),
('2c0bdcf9-e66f-e38a-dadc-764c3fe418e6', 'en', 'To the prophet of the end'),
('583b9878-5dd9-65b3-e2bb-e6ee10b54f1a', 'de', 'Dem König der Völker'),
('583b9878-5dd9-65b3-e2bb-e6ee10b54f1a', 'en', 'To the king of the nations'),
('fa9ca435-1a1d-2f61-35e6-ee30f44c45ca', 'de', 'Dem Menschensohn selbst'),
('fa9ca435-1a1d-2f61-35e6-ee30f44c45ca', 'en', 'To the Son of Man himself'),
('cf6f63ee-162f-c027-c116-a40fdf261a6a', 'de', 'Tod und Leben liegen in der Macht der Zunge'),
('cf6f63ee-162f-c027-c116-a40fdf261a6a', 'en', 'Death and life are in the power of the tongue'),
('acec38e8-adc6-b906-b627-e46c922c962f', 'de', 'Die Zunge entscheidet über den Reichtum'),
('acec38e8-adc6-b906-b627-e46c922c962f', 'en', 'The tongue decides over riches'),
('e10c3702-a84c-18ea-708a-156c09072d74', 'de', 'Die Zunge bewahrt nur das Leben'),
('e10c3702-a84c-18ea-708a-156c09072d74', 'en', 'The tongue preserves only life'),
('2b023d5d-84f3-aff2-b80b-7dfcd7e8abc2', 'de', 'Die Zunge bringt allein den Tod'),
('2b023d5d-84f3-aff2-b80b-7dfcd7e8abc2', 'en', 'The tongue brings only death'),
('99f5e416-6049-e025-0bd7-0f9083542eae', 'de', 'Er treibt die Herde zurück in den Stall'),
('99f5e416-6049-e025-0bd7-0f9083542eae', 'en', 'He drives the flock back to the fold'),
('cca65478-49f4-6e29-7541-d141478e18e0', 'de', 'Er wartet, bis das Schaf von selbst zurückkehrt'),
('cca65478-49f4-6e29-7541-d141478e18e0', 'en', 'He waits for the sheep to return on its own'),
('9e959e61-6c5c-7c51-10c7-b594064cb841', 'de', 'Er kauft sich ein neues Schaf am Markt'),
('9e959e61-6c5c-7c51-10c7-b594064cb841', 'en', 'He buys a new sheep at the market'),
('97445830-af5f-449d-3561-ddbc9c4941f1', 'de', 'Er lässt die neunundneunzig zurück und sucht das verlorene'),
('97445830-af5f-449d-3561-ddbc9c4941f1', 'en', 'He leaves the ninety-nine and seeks the lost one'),
('bcc507b2-f57f-cdcd-5396-caacbc7217c5', 'de', 'Er grub sich unter der Mauer hindurch'),
('bcc507b2-f57f-cdcd-5396-caacbc7217c5', 'en', 'He dug himself under the wall'),
('7ccefe11-155e-4b85-db57-0af25580705e', 'de', 'Er sprang von der Mauer in den Graben'),
('7ccefe11-155e-4b85-db57-0af25580705e', 'en', 'He leapt from the wall into the moat'),
('20d3eaf0-03b4-87a2-7371-b5bc760c3ae1', 'de', 'Er bestach die Wächter mit Gold'),
('20d3eaf0-03b4-87a2-7371-b5bc760c3ae1', 'en', 'He bribed the guards with gold'),
('aef6681f-f91d-0c74-a1ec-e92162b10d61', 'de', 'Er trug die Stadttore samt Pfosten auf den Berg'),
('aef6681f-f91d-0c74-a1ec-e92162b10d61', 'en', 'He carried the city gates and posts up the hill'),
('01f1840b-b2d2-7e6c-238b-36a9de609fea', 'de', 'In Simons Haus, wo sie mit Fieber lag'),
('01f1840b-b2d2-7e6c-238b-36a9de609fea', 'en', 'In Simon''s house, where she lay with a fever'),
('06e2a6cf-4653-8ad9-dc46-97eae8ae7c08', 'de', 'Am Ufer des Sees Genezareth'),
('06e2a6cf-4653-8ad9-dc46-97eae8ae7c08', 'en', 'On the shore of the Sea of Galilee'),
('01dd8cf9-b5dd-8d18-782e-c4ab052efec7', 'de', 'Auf dem Weg nach Betsaida'),
('01dd8cf9-b5dd-8d18-782e-c4ab052efec7', 'en', 'On the way to Bethsaida'),
('9528d0e4-536a-3be0-4eb1-07da7b31db35', 'de', 'In der Synagoge von Kapernaum'),
('9528d0e4-536a-3be0-4eb1-07da7b31db35', 'en', 'In the synagogue of Capernaum'),
('12e6987d-366c-07a6-66a9-9c0fd8795804', 'de', 'Er lockte sie in einen Hinterhalt am Jordan'),
('12e6987d-366c-07a6-66a9-9c0fd8795804', 'en', 'He lured them into an ambush at the Jordan'),
('8ffbe509-48a3-8f98-bf43-bcbd44b7e5ae', 'de', 'Er griff sie nachts mit Fackeln an'),
('8ffbe509-48a3-8f98-bf43-bcbd44b7e5ae', 'en', 'He attacked them at night with torches'),
('f6ac1a67-11c6-175c-8b5c-cbc36363aaa1', 'de', 'Er schloss zuvor einen Bund mit Hiram'),
('f6ac1a67-11c6-175c-8b5c-cbc36363aaa1', 'en', 'He first made a covenant with Hiram'),
('c2761ae0-a3c1-5c98-d9c0-ce3ab62e109b', 'de', 'Er fragte den Herrn und durchbrach sie wie ein Wasserdurchbruch'),
('c2761ae0-a3c1-5c98-d9c0-ce3ab62e109b', 'en', 'He inquired of the Lord and broke through them like a flood of water'),
('ba46c941-8499-cc0c-d2bc-e49cf25e9dc3', 'de', 'Die Wundmale Jesu zu sehen und zu berühren'),
('ba46c941-8499-cc0c-d2bc-e49cf25e9dc3', 'en', 'To see and touch the wounds of Jesus'),
('bbbb930b-18f2-2aa8-8d80-427a2474f007', 'de', 'Ein Zeichen vom Himmel zu empfangen'),
('bbbb930b-18f2-2aa8-8d80-427a2474f007', 'en', 'To receive a sign from heaven'),
('c4867dfe-5f5b-ad3c-d42e-c32109ad45b0', 'de', 'Die Stimme eines Engels zu hören'),
('c4867dfe-5f5b-ad3c-d42e-c32109ad45b0', 'en', 'To hear the voice of an angel'),
('975b90b5-aafd-ae16-d035-adec8374c713', 'de', 'Das leere Grab selbst zu betreten'),
('975b90b5-aafd-ae16-d035-adec8374c713', 'en', 'To enter the empty tomb himself')
insert into public.answer_option_translations (option_id, lang, text) values
('51a9101d-cfeb-0d8d-5cca-73a6633a63b1', 'de', 'Wie bist du erhöht worden über die Wolken hinaus'),
('51a9101d-cfeb-0d8d-5cca-73a6633a63b1', 'en', 'How you have been raised above the clouds'),
('ddfff305-84ba-6100-bb55-7dd51c044765', 'de', 'Wie bist du vom Himmel gefallen, du schöner Morgenstern'),
('ddfff305-84ba-6100-bb55-7dd51c044765', 'en', 'How you have fallen from heaven, O bright morning star'),
('eac6ac22-0fec-c715-9eb3-0df7c8b8c2a6', 'de', 'Wie bist du erloschen in der Tiefe der Nacht'),
('eac6ac22-0fec-c715-9eb3-0df7c8b8c2a6', 'en', 'How you have been extinguished in the depth of night'),
('a00ef504-bce9-1b2b-e015-a7af46dedd9a', 'de', 'Wie bist du erblasst vor dem Glanz der Sonne'),
('a00ef504-bce9-1b2b-e015-a7af46dedd9a', 'en', 'How you have paled before the brightness of the sun'),
('d57f59f9-cc82-9931-9278-662913b3c2cc', 'de', 'Abgrund, denn ich bin verloren'),
('d57f59f9-cc82-9931-9278-662913b3c2cc', 'en', 'Abyss, for I am lost'),
('99ba6aef-2f7a-1f30-eddd-d9e470638afc', 'de', 'Schatten, denn ich bin tot'),
('99ba6aef-2f7a-1f30-eddd-d9e470638afc', 'en', 'Shadow, for I am dead'),
('7eab8096-11e0-43c6-9e2f-cb8d735659ee', 'de', 'Sturm, denn ich bin zerrissen'),
('7eab8096-11e0-43c6-9e2f-cb8d735659ee', 'en', 'Storm, for I am torn'),
('405c87d8-9f65-2fd8-4709-6a37ab8d85ea', 'de', 'Legion, denn wir sind viele'),
('405c87d8-9f65-2fd8-4709-6a37ab8d85ea', 'en', 'Legion, for we are many'),
('1963f82a-762d-d104-d9f9-106a76335106', 'de', 'Der Tote setzte sich auf und begann zu reden'),
('1963f82a-762d-d104-d9f9-106a76335106', 'en', 'The dead man sat up and began to speak'),
('d3770ae9-2767-a2f5-b562-85da48045640', 'de', 'Er verschwand sogleich in der Menge'),
('d3770ae9-2767-a2f5-b562-85da48045640', 'en', 'He vanished at once into the crowd'),
('fb90367c-ac9f-528d-1af8-0eb81fc88635', 'de', 'Er folgte Jesus als Jünger nach'),
('fb90367c-ac9f-528d-1af8-0eb81fc88635', 'en', 'He followed Jesus as a disciple'),
('571cd166-111f-0dc8-97af-d5ad4eda991a', 'de', 'Er bat um Brot und Wein'),
('571cd166-111f-0dc8-97af-d5ad4eda991a', 'en', 'He asked for bread and wine'),
('f8aced1d-2fa3-c2e7-505b-6eade88a2cc0', 'de', 'Frische Trauben vom Weinstock'),
('f8aced1d-2fa3-c2e7-505b-6eade88a2cc0', 'en', 'Fresh grapes from the vine'),
('f45b2e9d-0524-11ed-8dce-939761943ef9', 'de', 'Ein Kohlenfeuer mit Fisch und Brot'),
('f45b2e9d-0524-11ed-8dce-939761943ef9', 'en', 'A charcoal fire with fish and bread'),
('d9a8073f-55cc-eade-12e7-9f9511fb4aa7', 'de', 'Einen gedeckten Tisch mit Wein'),
('d9a8073f-55cc-eade-12e7-9f9511fb4aa7', 'en', 'A set table with wine'),
('7ad0412a-b73d-4c66-5457-964de31e4cd3', 'de', 'Wasser und Öl zur Salbung'),
('7ad0412a-b73d-4c66-5457-964de31e4cd3', 'en', 'Water and oil for anointing'),
('86c6bd62-62de-a91b-e346-bb1241751423', 'de', 'Ein Engel brachte ihm täglich Speise'),
('86c6bd62-62de-a91b-e346-bb1241751423', 'en', 'An angel brought him food daily'),
('dbc0f740-b854-766d-2fdc-0dc54861db41', 'de', 'Raben brachten ihm Brot und Fleisch morgens und abends'),
('dbc0f740-b854-766d-2fdc-0dc54861db41', 'en', 'Ravens brought him bread and meat morning and evening'),
('130d251a-78e6-5a50-766f-66ae2bfb4c02', 'de', 'Eine Witwe schickte ihm Vorräte'),
('130d251a-78e6-5a50-766f-66ae2bfb4c02', 'en', 'A widow sent him supplies'),
('e853ee53-8f3f-1ddd-2b9e-ed4223c32e35', 'de', 'Er aß von den Früchten des Feldes'),
('e853ee53-8f3f-1ddd-2b9e-ed4223c32e35', 'en', 'He ate from the fruit of the field'),
('4a101f14-ab33-a9b4-d95d-6d1e8d18d02b', 'de', 'Ein Herz von Fleisch statt eines Herzens von Stein'),
('4a101f14-ab33-a9b4-d95d-6d1e8d18d02b', 'en', 'A heart of flesh instead of a heart of stone'),
('a3ee466f-8655-f630-3df1-b650caaa740f', 'de', 'Ein Herz aus reinem Gold'),
('a3ee466f-8655-f630-3df1-b650caaa740f', 'en', 'A heart of pure gold'),
('300d6bd5-6e4c-1bc8-48d1-1b76cc6e4506', 'de', 'Ein Herz wie das eines Löwen'),
('300d6bd5-6e4c-1bc8-48d1-1b76cc6e4506', 'en', 'A heart like that of a lion'),
