('ceadff4c-0f3d-171f-3e64-88295f3fd676', 'en', 'With doves'),
('619f3af8-9b6a-b6d7-ee52-ab197a430482', 'de', 'Mit Edelsteinen'),
('619f3af8-9b6a-b6d7-ee52-ab197a430482', 'en', 'With jewels'),
('14c05177-75ab-80ad-8633-d05ddf23a749', 'de', 'Haman solle Mordechai sofort heimlich töten lassen'),
('14c05177-75ab-80ad-8633-d05ddf23a749', 'en', 'Haman should have Mordecai secretly killed at once'),
('6e7d5190-711b-023c-3f06-c4833e4da080', 'de', 'Haman solle zum König um Gnade bitten'),
('6e7d5190-711b-023c-3f06-c4833e4da080', 'en', 'Haman should beg the king for mercy'),
('5c987ba4-0757-1a0d-ee91-72e38c423904', 'de', 'Haman solle aus Susa fliehen, solange er könne'),
('5c987ba4-0757-1a0d-ee91-72e38c423904', 'en', 'Haman should flee Susa while he could'),
('33f69267-76f5-edaf-2472-62d1fed5728b', 'de', 'Wenn Mordechai von den Juden sei, werde Haman gewiss fallen'),
('33f69267-76f5-edaf-2472-62d1fed5728b', 'en', 'If Mordecai is of the Jews, Haman will surely fall'),
('24499ced-dfbf-b5fe-4a77-82ec3e63d6a5', 'de', 'Mit goldener Krone und Zepter'),
('24499ced-dfbf-b5fe-4a77-82ec3e63d6a5', 'en', 'With golden crown and scepter'),
('4f251dd0-02ff-cbea-abe1-e746282e6fb4', 'de', 'In Leinen gekleidet, mit Augen wie Feuerfackeln'),
('4f251dd0-02ff-cbea-abe1-e746282e6fb4', 'en', 'Clothed in linen, with eyes like flaming torches'),
('599ba888-958b-be6d-5e74-41f00bfb71d5', 'de', 'Mit dem Gesicht eines Löwen'),
('599ba888-958b-be6d-5e74-41f00bfb71d5', 'en', 'With the face of a lion'),
('9ad52ac9-f6b0-1a39-b2a9-18b1241f23a5', 'de', 'In Lumpen gehüllt und schwach'),
('9ad52ac9-f6b0-1a39-b2a9-18b1241f23a5', 'en', 'Wrapped in rags and weak'),
('7662fae9-f781-3375-8548-99e96d7bffad', 'de', 'Er teilte es unter dem ganzen Heer'),
('7662fae9-f781-3375-8548-99e96d7bffad', 'en', 'He shared it among the whole army'),
('8afbe2c5-dca0-563c-5ee3-796c4f70530b', 'de', 'Er goss es als Trankopfer vor dem Herrn aus, statt es zu trinken'),
('8afbe2c5-dca0-563c-5ee3-796c4f70530b', 'en', 'He poured it out as an offering before the Lord rather than drink it'),
('98c58907-f033-73e3-d357-fcf295741348', 'de', 'Er bewahrte es im Heiligtum auf'),
('98c58907-f033-73e3-d357-fcf295741348', 'en', 'He kept it in the sanctuary'),
('0d60c7fe-6483-5c1f-3956-b5a9f0242062', 'de', 'Er trank es voller Dankbarkeit'),
('0d60c7fe-6483-5c1f-3956-b5a9f0242062', 'en', 'He drank it full of gratitude'),
('25e650cb-35c5-e73b-47a3-0bec04e222aa', 'de', 'Mit dem Duft von Weihrauch und Myrrhe'),
('25e650cb-35c5-e73b-47a3-0bec04e222aa', 'en', 'With the fragrance of incense and myrrh'),
('334eb890-8bb5-6e96-87fb-7a23462c727e', 'de', 'Mit Licht, das heller war als die Sonne'),
('334eb890-8bb5-6e96-87fb-7a23462c727e', 'en', 'With light brighter than the sun'),
('28b900f2-73ae-8ea9-e245-eeffabff0647', 'de', 'Mit dem Klang von Posaunen und Harfen'),
('28b900f2-73ae-8ea9-e245-eeffabff0647', 'en', 'With the sound of trumpets and harps'),
('a53bef97-4b76-e268-4d7a-d95c60eb6054', 'de', 'Mit Rauch, und die Schwellen bebten von der Stimme'),
('a53bef97-4b76-e268-4d7a-d95c60eb6054', 'en', 'With smoke, and the thresholds shook at the voice'),
('061ea8ea-8589-8575-d500-0948c27b5b7d', 'de', 'Sie werden auf Felsen stehen und nicht wanken'),
('061ea8ea-8589-8575-d500-0948c27b5b7d', 'en', 'They shall stand on rock and not be shaken'),
('39ebb893-b14a-682f-317c-287cebbc7be4', 'de', 'Sie werden niemals mehr hungern noch dürsten'),
('39ebb893-b14a-682f-317c-287cebbc7be4', 'en', 'They shall never hunger nor thirst again'),
('5beb888a-d14f-335d-28cf-fc106430b059', 'de', 'Sie werden ruhen unter dem Schatten seiner Flügel'),
('5beb888a-d14f-335d-28cf-fc106430b059', 'en', 'They shall rest in the shadow of his wings'),
('53db31fa-28e0-ef13-5489-90e685e92068', 'de', 'Sie kriegen neue Kraft und fahren auf mit Flügeln wie Adler'),
('53db31fa-28e0-ef13-5489-90e685e92068', 'en', 'They renew their strength and mount up with wings like eagles'),
('dbbb80c0-a2d4-bcab-92ce-2f3968e3b997', 'de', 'Heuschrecken zum Essen'),
('dbbb80c0-a2d4-bcab-92ce-2f3968e3b997', 'en', 'Locusts to eat'),
('4a0fb104-8378-1331-f0cf-9ae502e50ee2', 'de', 'Fische sprangen aus dem Sand'),
('4a0fb104-8378-1331-f0cf-9ae502e50ee2', 'en', 'Fish leaped from the sand'),
('054d9b45-36b7-2e79-8c3d-5276bc0b1ad0', 'de', 'Wachteln bedeckten das Lager'),
('054d9b45-36b7-2e79-8c3d-5276bc0b1ad0', 'en', 'Quail covered the camp'),
('fcda34f8-7dc2-b64e-5c1a-c3d882e47efd', 'de', 'Tauben fielen vom Himmel'),
('fcda34f8-7dc2-b64e-5c1a-c3d882e47efd', 'en', 'Doves fell from the sky'),
('8f286806-276f-83bc-1b5b-c9e7fb5020ce', 'de', 'Ein Statthalter über die Provinz Babel'),
('8f286806-276f-83bc-1b5b-c9e7fb5020ce', 'en', 'A governor over the province of Babylon'),
('8e5cdf78-ba4f-d223-628a-7d193b870afe', 'de', 'Ein Schriftgelehrter, kundig im Gesetz des Mose'),
('8e5cdf78-ba4f-d223-628a-7d193b870afe', 'en', 'A scribe skilled in the law of Moses'),
('e2734ca6-f1df-349d-39ed-219e57aa8d9a', 'de', 'Ein Feldherr des persischen Heeres'),
('e2734ca6-f1df-349d-39ed-219e57aa8d9a', 'en', 'A commander of the Persian army'),
('56ab64f5-fa1f-ab83-a8e4-77260d968b68', 'de', 'Ein Mundschenk des Königs von Persien'),
('56ab64f5-fa1f-ab83-a8e4-77260d968b68', 'en', 'A cupbearer of the king of Persia'),
('25dc75a1-ee6c-5c0a-a993-528888377795', 'de', 'Die des Mundschenks und des Bäckers des Pharao'),
('25dc75a1-ee6c-5c0a-a993-528888377795', 'en', 'Those of Pharaoh''s cupbearer and baker'),
('b4605020-6a6f-2c4e-80b9-93512d594d17', 'de', 'Die zweier Mitgefangener aus Kanaan'),
('b4605020-6a6f-2c4e-80b9-93512d594d17', 'en', 'Those of two fellow prisoners from Canaan'),
('69b1eeef-7f85-3e44-42d0-bc4be00f75a8', 'de', 'Die des Gefängnisaufsehers'),
('69b1eeef-7f85-3e44-42d0-bc4be00f75a8', 'en', 'Those of the prison warden'),
('b1f6446f-13d8-906f-ed65-53c3101e924c', 'de', 'Die zweier Wächter des Gefängnisses'),
('b1f6446f-13d8-906f-ed65-53c3101e924c', 'en', 'Those of two prison guards'),
('c3f51d40-f5e5-3651-d7ad-65333167e81b', 'de', 'Die zehn Stämme fielen von ihm ab und machten Jerobeam zum König'),
('c3f51d40-f5e5-3651-d7ad-65333167e81b', 'en', 'The ten tribes revolted and made Jeroboam king'),
('5c38a1a6-7e6c-62bc-e7bb-e06aa97e3f36', 'de', 'Sie flohen alle nach Ägypten'),
('5c38a1a6-7e6c-62bc-e7bb-e06aa97e3f36', 'en', 'They all fled to Egypt'),
('b726a9ee-ff84-2430-4e48-e043ee7a6a7f', 'de', 'Sie baten ihn um Gnade und blieben treu'),
('b726a9ee-ff84-2430-4e48-e043ee7a6a7f', 'en', 'They begged him for mercy and stayed loyal'),
('df8c0a0a-caf0-21b6-4021-358d29f9e7ab', 'de', 'Sie zogen in den Krieg gegen Juda und siegten'),
('df8c0a0a-caf0-21b6-4021-358d29f9e7ab', 'en', 'They went to war against Judah and won'),
('ea13e31b-51a0-d730-fa81-dd767b0339d5', 'de', 'Eine eherne Säule'),
('ea13e31b-51a0-d730-fa81-dd767b0339d5', 'en', 'A bronze pillar'),
('82743a11-6105-af22-55bc-8add003dee0e', 'de', 'Einen großen Stein unter einer Eiche'),
('82743a11-6105-af22-55bc-8add003dee0e', 'en', 'A large stone under an oak'),
('903b9a9f-cd28-cc60-1c2d-3427ab9b1cea', 'de', 'Ein Banner aus Leinen'),
('903b9a9f-cd28-cc60-1c2d-3427ab9b1cea', 'en', 'A banner of linen'),
('d29d68a7-bce8-0dca-4f78-966952d4050a', 'de', 'Einen Altar aus zwölf Steinen'),
('d29d68a7-bce8-0dca-4f78-966952d4050a', 'en', 'An altar of twelve stones'),
('1fd60fdd-17d0-3892-bd63-56371126d46d', 'de', 'Gott selbst versucht zum Bösen'),
('1fd60fdd-17d0-3892-bd63-56371126d46d', 'en', 'God himself tempts to evil'),
('09da7115-90e5-f739-9efb-9389be43e311', 'de', 'Gott gibt mit der Versuchung einen Ausweg'),
('09da7115-90e5-f739-9efb-9389be43e311', 'en', 'With the temptation God provides a way out'),
('76cc0150-aced-508b-e782-c91e2896f08a', 'de', 'Gott überlässt den Menschen der Versuchung'),
('76cc0150-aced-508b-e782-c91e2896f08a', 'en', 'God leaves a person to the temptation'),
('be17ef70-0e0b-6391-4434-8fddb03bcca7', 'de', 'Es gibt aus der Versuchung kein Entkommen'),
('be17ef70-0e0b-6391-4434-8fddb03bcca7', 'en', 'There is no escape from temptation'),
('ea7505e2-ed4c-fa98-396e-735fa62e95e4', 'de', 'Er vergisst die Väter nach kurzer Zeit'),
('ea7505e2-ed4c-fa98-396e-735fa62e95e4', 'en', 'He forgets the fathers after a short time'),
('28fcc516-bfab-9553-7172-e07c461e2b43', 'de', 'Er bindet sich an kein Volk'),
('28fcc516-bfab-9553-7172-e07c461e2b43', 'en', 'He binds himself to no people'),
('0c465fc0-d985-05b4-04f9-44768d49faa7', 'de', 'Er hält Bund und Gnade denen, die ihn lieben'),
('0c465fc0-d985-05b4-04f9-44768d49faa7', 'en', 'He keeps covenant and mercy with those who love him'),
('45048ba1-b836-9595-4693-dcf38f307863', 'de', 'Er segnet nur das gegenwärtige Geschlecht'),
('45048ba1-b836-9595-4693-dcf38f307863', 'en', 'He blesses only the present generation'),
('c7d81a77-8980-be14-a887-33a4e404cdfd', 'de', 'Sie verlangte zuerst Hamans Absetzung'),
('c7d81a77-8980-be14-a887-33a4e404cdfd', 'en', 'She first demanded Haman''s removal'),
('2cb4c18c-40f4-706c-c037-333e2c2375b4', 'de', 'Sie wandte ein, wer ungerufen komme, dem drohe der Tod'),
('2cb4c18c-40f4-706c-c037-333e2c2375b4', 'en', 'She objected that whoever comes unsummoned faces death'),
('19843f8a-84d6-0674-7b1b-8be2d5e7d139', 'de', 'Sie bat, aus dem Palast fliehen zu dürfen'),
('19843f8a-84d6-0674-7b1b-8be2d5e7d139', 'en', 'She asked to be allowed to flee the palace'),
('873246e2-eadb-6ade-0c32-970091bf5241', 'de', 'Sie willigte sofort ohne Zögern ein'),
('873246e2-eadb-6ade-0c32-970091bf5241', 'en', 'She agreed at once without hesitation'),
('dd46e3a6-0698-c368-db51-4613fa5d669e', 'de', 'Er sandte Paulus nach Rom'),
('dd46e3a6-0698-c368-db51-4613fa5d669e', 'en', 'He sent Paul to Rome'),
('e1047ede-afb0-da8d-4f9b-d13f3fd9bc0a', 'de', 'Er sprach das Todesurteil'),
('e1047ede-afb0-da8d-4f9b-d13f3fd9bc0a', 'en', 'He pronounced a death sentence'),
('e2489eb6-8a26-9731-8cd5-16b969b8eff3', 'de', 'Er ließ Paulus geißeln'),
('e2489eb6-8a26-9731-8cd5-16b969b8eff3', 'en', 'He had Paul scourged'),
('75c1ee9a-8556-8a86-9435-4475842e2532', 'de', 'Er wies die Klage ab und kümmerte sich nicht darum'),
('75c1ee9a-8556-8a86-9435-4475842e2532', 'en', 'He dismissed the case and paid no attention to it'),
('aa34f430-5afb-96dd-920b-4b7c2905fcef', 'de', 'Er stritt die Tat entschieden ab'),
('aa34f430-5afb-96dd-920b-4b7c2905fcef', 'en', 'He firmly denied the deed'),
('4a8cf330-9072-43cd-0028-0b5738e30257', 'de', 'Er beschuldigte Batseba der Verführung'),
('4a8cf330-9072-43cd-0028-0b5738e30257', 'en', 'He blamed Bathsheba for the seduction'),
('daf5e420-3448-319b-e35b-35a6f9539b4a', 'de', 'Er bekannte: „Ich habe gegen den Herrn gesündigt“'),
('daf5e420-3448-319b-e35b-35a6f9539b4a', 'en', 'He confessed: ''I have sinned against the Lord'''),
('8ed986c0-fc6f-eece-122d-1a792e79028c', 'de', 'Er ließ Natan aus dem Palast vertreiben'),
('8ed986c0-fc6f-eece-122d-1a792e79028c', 'en', 'He had Nathan driven from the palace'),
('7c59a4d5-b404-17ce-d045-86ffe51548ef', 'de', 'Eine Klage über den Tod Sauls'),
('7c59a4d5-b404-17ce-d045-86ffe51548ef', 'en', 'A lament over the death of Saul'),
('93776370-a93f-268b-d337-28e4b0ca9ec8', 'de', 'Ein Loblied auf seinen eigenen Sieg'),
('93776370-a93f-268b-d337-28e4b0ca9ec8', 'en', 'A song praising his own victory'),
('b9d6ee0e-8769-5870-6c2d-dad9a70e3ce4', 'de', 'Ein Danklied, das den Herrn seinen Fels und seine Burg nennt'),
('b9d6ee0e-8769-5870-6c2d-dad9a70e3ce4', 'en', 'A song of thanks calling the Lord his rock and his fortress'),
('c8bcb051-63e1-edd7-26c5-506836bed93e', 'de', 'Ein Bittgebet um Vergebung der Sünde'),
('c8bcb051-63e1-edd7-26c5-506836bed93e', 'en', 'A prayer for forgiveness of sin'),
('9f9fa673-3679-335a-f548-0734632e0872', 'de', 'Sie leuchteten doppelt so hell'),
('9f9fa673-3679-335a-f548-0734632e0872', 'en', 'They shone twice as bright'),
('2b6fb06d-40da-8dc4-28e4-5c1cc8a56332', 'de', 'Sie standen still fast einen ganzen Tag'),
('2b6fb06d-40da-8dc4-28e4-5c1cc8a56332', 'en', 'They stood still for almost a whole day'),
('a14aa39b-1840-c92c-ca13-7c2b11eaee5b', 'de', 'Sie verfinsterten sich plötzlich'),
('a14aa39b-1840-c92c-ca13-7c2b11eaee5b', 'en', 'They suddenly went dark'),
('8583c4f5-030c-7b70-bb0b-cfe44b742609', 'de', 'Sie kehrten am Himmel zurück'),
('8583c4f5-030c-7b70-bb0b-cfe44b742609', 'en', 'They turned back in the sky'),
('5435e469-ecce-808e-34c8-a1dd47852957', 'de', 'Ich bleibe, bis ein neuer Mann kommt'),
('5435e469-ecce-808e-34c8-a1dd47852957', 'en', 'I will stay until a new husband comes'),
('fab531f2-69bd-d5bc-82e1-e072f68372a5', 'de', 'Dein Volk ist mein Volk und dein Gott mein Gott'),
('fab531f2-69bd-d5bc-82e1-e072f68372a5', 'en', 'Your people are my people and your God my God'),
('7ba365e5-2913-d2bd-9e6b-3b717e6622b3', 'de', 'Lass mich noch ein Jahr bei meiner Mutter'),
('7ba365e5-2913-d2bd-9e6b-3b717e6622b3', 'en', 'Let me stay a year longer with my mother'),
('45fa05fa-3069-be66-c7ff-7ce339435c39', 'de', 'Ich will gehen, doch erst nach der Ernte'),
('45fa05fa-3069-be66-c7ff-7ce339435c39', 'en', 'I will go, but only after the harvest'),
('0312b003-8324-8ef3-bd3c-ba95392b987d', 'de', 'Sie mussten makellos und ohne Gebrechen sein'),
('0312b003-8324-8ef3-bd3c-ba95392b987d', 'en', 'They had to be unblemished and without defect'),
('40801834-9b89-e456-b252-b9beba5f673a', 'de', 'Sie mussten alt und groß sein'),
('40801834-9b89-e456-b252-b9beba5f673a', 'en', 'They had to be old and large'),
('7975b5ca-3702-5b53-a0dd-69e98b6cc9cd', 'de', 'Sie mussten weiß gefärbt sein'),
('7975b5ca-3702-5b53-a0dd-69e98b6cc9cd', 'en', 'They had to be white in color'),
('79f84b1b-0b55-6d6a-79c5-3de7f524df25', 'de', 'Sie mussten erstgeboren sein'),
('79f84b1b-0b55-6d6a-79c5-3de7f524df25', 'en', 'They had to be firstborn'),
('1798d890-8c35-273b-74e0-c38434f19efe', 'de', 'Im Haus des Pharisäers Simon'),
('1798d890-8c35-273b-74e0-c38434f19efe', 'en', 'In the house of Simon the Pharisee'),
('3c637dc9-1c96-fcc2-1670-6fbd2be2deb8', 'de', 'Im Haus des Lazarus'),
('3c637dc9-1c96-fcc2-1670-6fbd2be2deb8', 'en', 'In the house of Lazarus'),
('92625900-3fb0-ef74-0b7d-6d5928267611', 'de', 'Im Haus der Maria und Marta'),
('92625900-3fb0-ef74-0b7d-6d5928267611', 'en', 'In the house of Mary and Martha'),
('a7fa7a62-79b2-57ce-aef8-4d9fd7bf9650', 'de', 'Im Haus Simons des Aussätzigen'),
('a7fa7a62-79b2-57ce-aef8-4d9fd7bf9650', 'en', 'In the house of Simon the leper'),
('cec74b0c-4a16-c164-81c3-70ccdeadcf9d', 'de', 'Alles bleibt für immer, was es ist'),
('cec74b0c-4a16-c164-81c3-70ccdeadcf9d', 'en', 'All remains forever what it is'),
('8877b9ce-579c-103a-4a97-10a9f7f6c27e', 'de', 'Allein der Mensch entgeht dem Staub'),
('8877b9ce-579c-103a-4a97-10a9f7f6c27e', 'en', 'Only man escapes the dust'),
('ccc8d01a-2b04-a822-35af-0d497355e58c', 'de', 'Nichts kehrt je zum Staub zurück'),
('ccc8d01a-2b04-a822-35af-0d497355e58c', 'en', 'Nothing ever returns to dust'),
('3cb821fb-e0d5-4691-60eb-a6ae3beeab2b', 'de', 'Alles ist aus dem Staub, und alles kehrt zum Staub zurück'),
('3cb821fb-e0d5-4691-60eb-a6ae3beeab2b', 'en', 'All is from dust, and all returns to dust'),
('42150bce-cd94-909c-41eb-e44b687c9d6c', 'de', 'Das Buch des Gesetzes'),
('42150bce-cd94-909c-41eb-e44b687c9d6c', 'en', 'The Book of the Law'),
('67d926fe-7776-e77d-5de3-c7008827a366', 'de', 'Ein verschollener Königsthron'),
('67d926fe-7776-e77d-5de3-c7008827a366', 'en', 'A lost royal throne'),
('80bbb15c-4c93-3f7f-dcc1-db4bba681924', 'de', 'Die Bundeslade'),
('80bbb15c-4c93-3f7f-dcc1-db4bba681924', 'en', 'The Ark of the Covenant'),
('57976184-00a7-d10f-09fe-2be82ce0af82', 'de', 'Ein Brief des Propheten Elia'),
('57976184-00a7-d10f-09fe-2be82ce0af82', 'en', 'A letter from the prophet Elijah'),
('706cc640-74ea-4027-f9c5-5183bca1abf4', 'de', 'Er ließ sich Wagen und Reiter und fünfzig Vorläufer beschaffen'),
('706cc640-74ea-4027-f9c5-5183bca1abf4', 'en', 'He provided himself chariots, horsemen, and fifty runners'),
('ec507d64-b320-f45b-c6e4-86e47edcbe79', 'de', 'Er ließ sich von den Philistern salben'),
('ec507d64-b320-f45b-c6e4-86e47edcbe79', 'en', 'He had himself anointed by the Philistines'),
('907bd17f-f59e-36e9-2f75-3214939cf1f0', 'de', 'Er bestach die Tempelwächter'),
('907bd17f-f59e-36e9-2f75-3214939cf1f0', 'en', 'He bribed the temple guards'),
('636e00f9-377b-3fb4-32b0-c9c4117052d3', 'de', 'Er nahm heimlich die Krone aus dem Palast'),
('636e00f9-377b-3fb4-32b0-c9c4117052d3', 'en', 'He secretly took the crown from the palace'),
('783631fe-03d7-c249-0915-163e3f0223aa', 'de', 'Er werde ihn sofort vom Thron stoßen'),
('783631fe-03d7-c249-0915-163e3f0223aa', 'en', 'He would cast him from the throne at once'),
('943e4555-c71b-c053-99f1-3498ea4d089b', 'de', 'Er werde sein Reich den Philistern geben'),
('943e4555-c71b-c053-99f1-3498ea4d089b', 'en', 'He would give his kingdom to the Philistines'),
('16968385-99bf-2029-d12f-dcb36b1e80f3', 'de', 'Er werde ihn kinderlos sterben lassen'),
('16968385-99bf-2029-d12f-dcb36b1e80f3', 'en', 'He would let him die childless'),
('cfc2daf3-34ab-c844-9e10-0ec85e7840d8', 'de', 'Er werde ihn mit Menschenruten züchtigen, aber seine Gnade nicht von ihm nehmen'),
('cfc2daf3-34ab-c844-9e10-0ec85e7840d8', 'en', 'He would chastise him with the rod of men but not remove his mercy'),
('22637fad-d0c6-f0d5-c3e3-b27a422003af', 'de', 'Zwölf Scharen aus den zwölf Stämmen'),
('22637fad-d0c6-f0d5-c3e3-b27a422003af', 'en', 'Twelve multitudes from the twelve tribes'),
('e078cab7-822a-d47c-cca0-b62e5c90683c', 'de', 'Eine große Schar, die niemand zählen konnte'),
('e078cab7-822a-d47c-cca0-b62e5c90683c', 'en', 'A great multitude that no one could count'),
('ff7034b7-3424-e984-146a-066156c41f2b', 'de', 'Genau hundertvierundvierzigtausend Erlöste'),
('ff7034b7-3424-e984-146a-066156c41f2b', 'en', 'Exactly one hundred forty-four thousand redeemed'),
('5211ddab-1b00-a882-98f5-8a9ccc26c858', 'de', 'Sieben Scharen aus den sieben Gemeinden'),
('5211ddab-1b00-a882-98f5-8a9ccc26c858', 'en', 'Seven multitudes from the seven churches'),
('4da9e54e-7576-3676-d32d-bd763b805ee7', 'de', 'Der Tempel wird mit Herrlichkeit erfüllt werden'),
('4da9e54e-7576-3676-d32d-bd763b805ee7', 'en', 'The temple shall be filled with glory'),
('05d6a3c2-2bee-3e10-d4bc-c898e28766e1', 'de', 'Die Sonne wird sich am Mittag verfinstern'),
('05d6a3c2-2bee-3e10-d4bc-c898e28766e1', 'en', 'The sun shall darken at noon'),
('4e88c420-4077-e55f-ae82-ff92165b15b3', 'de', 'Ein Stern wird über dem Land aufgehen'),
('4e88c420-4077-e55f-ae82-ff92165b15b3', 'en', 'A star shall rise over the land'),
('b38fda5a-1c9b-984c-b79c-aa6b42976393', 'de', 'Eine Jungfrau wird schwanger werden und einen Sohn gebären'),
('b38fda5a-1c9b-984c-b79c-aa6b42976393', 'en', 'A virgin shall conceive and bear a son'),
('66152980-d06b-714c-816d-3c04acc16cdb', 'de', 'Wir erkennen jetzt alles vollkommen'),
('66152980-d06b-714c-816d-3c04acc16cdb', 'en', 'Now we know everything fully'),
('717198e0-2450-5170-a01e-1b0be685b4c8', 'de', 'Wir wissen jetzt nichts von Gott'),
('717198e0-2450-5170-a01e-1b0be685b4c8', 'en', 'Now we know nothing of God'),
('7395a2ba-8852-a8a3-2c27-5bb82ff759db', 'de', 'Wir sehen jetzt von Angesicht zu Angesicht'),
('7395a2ba-8852-a8a3-2c27-5bb82ff759db', 'en', 'Now we see face to face'),
('4163ca21-c889-13ae-6501-f4763558d138', 'de', 'Wir sehen jetzt durch einen Spiegel in einem dunklen Bild'),
('4163ca21-c889-13ae-6501-f4763558d138', 'en', 'Now we see through a mirror dimly'),
('c07fbdbe-9d07-862a-7fdb-57f0afa00bfe', 'de', 'Er erstarrte und konnte nicht sprechen'),
('c07fbdbe-9d07-862a-7fdb-57f0afa00bfe', 'en', 'He froze and could not speak'),
('b77aae28-2685-588f-b302-f0977e1188cd', 'de', 'Er versank in tiefen Schlaf'),
('b77aae28-2685-588f-b302-f0977e1188cd', 'en', 'He sank into a deep sleep'),
('90156d56-a179-6b93-e196-c545fea2d1cf', 'de', 'Er fiel zu Boden, wälzte sich und schäumte'),
('90156d56-a179-6b93-e196-c545fea2d1cf', 'en', 'He fell to the ground, rolled and foamed'),
('4bdc027a-debc-16dd-3aba-8589e76fcd35', 'de', 'Er rannte schreiend in die Wüste'),
('4bdc027a-debc-16dd-3aba-8589e76fcd35', 'en', 'He ran screaming into the desert'),
('d8df5085-00de-b9ed-2216-2f0f0c1681f8', 'de', 'Sieh, ich faste und gebe den Zehnten'),
('d8df5085-00de-b9ed-2216-2f0f0c1681f8', 'en', 'See, I fast and give a tenth'),
('d43d615d-4a15-f62f-0402-f7d495067ed5', 'de', 'Ich danke dir für deine Gaben'),
('d43d615d-4a15-f62f-0402-f7d495067ed5', 'en', 'I thank you for your gifts'),
('7eabcda3-f780-9e82-3da1-f76a1ab0df51', 'de', 'Gott, sei mir Sünder gnädig'),
('7eabcda3-f780-9e82-3da1-f76a1ab0df51', 'en', 'God, be merciful to me a sinner'),
('22f3f917-27d1-48d1-0d2d-eeea7def60c6', 'de', 'Herr, mach mich gerecht wie die Frommen'),
('22f3f917-27d1-48d1-0d2d-eeea7def60c6', 'en', 'Lord, make me righteous like the devout'),
('de97ad24-1141-65c2-ded1-106b67c6feb5', 'de', 'Er flehte schweigend ohne Opfer'),
('de97ad24-1141-65c2-ded1-106b67c6feb5', 'en', 'He pleaded silently without sacrifice'),
('9b0db509-78a6-86e4-862e-6c57e6a16594', 'de', 'Er nahm die Tenne als Geschenk an'),
('9b0db509-78a6-86e4-862e-6c57e6a16594', 'en', 'He accepted the threshing floor as a gift'),
('58555244-351f-f003-a511-3fefa6326c08', 'de', 'Er kaufte die Tenne, baute einen Altar und brachte Opfer dar'),
('58555244-351f-f003-a511-3fefa6326c08', 'en', 'He bought the threshing floor, built an altar, and offered sacrifices'),
('692d9182-6f66-c8b6-db8e-cd98063fd0f9', 'de', 'Er ließ dort sofort den Tempel errichten'),
('692d9182-6f66-c8b6-db8e-cd98063fd0f9', 'en', 'He had the temple built there at once'),
('70bc87af-daf5-44e6-14e2-ce874de60663', 'de', 'Sie wurden von der Erde verschlungen'),
('70bc87af-daf5-44e6-14e2-ce874de60663', 'en', 'They were swallowed by the earth'),
('6701865a-064c-5052-d7d6-b8576a31a5fe', 'de', 'Sie kehrten siegreich zum Lager zurück'),
('6701865a-064c-5052-d7d6-b8576a31a5fe', 'en', 'They returned victorious to the camp'),
('82827c6d-4cb9-a910-2cf7-77a16466eef0', 'de', 'Sie eroberten das Land im Sturm'),
('82827c6d-4cb9-a910-2cf7-77a16466eef0', 'en', 'They took the land by storm'),
('d3b7e92c-fc88-c3ad-64ac-df7e879a942f', 'de', 'Die Amalekiter und Kanaaniter schlugen sie zurück'),
('d3b7e92c-fc88-c3ad-64ac-df7e879a942f', 'en', 'The Amalekites and Canaanites struck them back'),
('65f443ce-309e-5cc5-36fb-e62e4283719a', 'de', 'Saul hat versagt im Krieg'),
('65f443ce-309e-5cc5-36fb-e62e4283719a', 'en', 'Saul has failed in war'),
('6f82e7b7-c677-6685-1162-aa553f2b32e3', 'de', 'David ist tapferer als Saul'),
('6f82e7b7-c677-6685-1162-aa553f2b32e3', 'en', 'David is braver than Saul'),
('14e494e8-ebf2-c318-e0e1-47449370b283', 'de', 'Saul schlug tausend, David aber zehntausend'),
('14e494e8-ebf2-c318-e0e1-47449370b283', 'en', 'Saul has slain his thousands, David his ten thousands'),
('c008ede4-0e56-1420-a4f5-37bcc7c1bc79', 'de', 'David soll König werden'),
('c008ede4-0e56-1420-a4f5-37bcc7c1bc79', 'en', 'David shall be king'),
('3d466dfa-0529-ecff-2a95-1e04a6e7563c', 'de', 'Dass sie seine Gebeine aus Ägypten hinaufbrächten'),
('3d466dfa-0529-ecff-2a95-1e04a6e7563c', 'en', 'That they carry his bones up out of Egypt'),
('3cb055a5-7bbc-59c8-9508-b07e399d4e79', 'de', 'Dass sie ihm einen Tempel errichteten'),
('3cb055a5-7bbc-59c8-9508-b07e399d4e79', 'en', 'That they build him a temple'),
('af5debd2-8c1b-2d0d-c6f4-e139f82eca18', 'de', 'Dass sie das Land Goschen verließen'),
('af5debd2-8c1b-2d0d-c6f4-e139f82eca18', 'en', 'That they leave the land of Goshen'),
('c8ab468b-4e3e-a7de-ebf9-4c1552ffe1e0', 'de', 'Dass sie ihn neben dem Pharao bestatteten'),
('c8ab468b-4e3e-a7de-ebf9-4c1552ffe1e0', 'en', 'That they bury him beside Pharaoh'),
('86abbee3-736b-a6cc-5614-03f3b89b3afc', 'de', 'Dass die Stadt von einer Seuche befallen sei'),
('86abbee3-736b-a6cc-5614-03f3b89b3afc', 'en', 'That the city was struck by a plague'),
('1a0bb246-0725-23af-fac6-7dc8d5c15e56', 'de', 'Dass Serubbabel sich selbst zum König mache'),
('1a0bb246-0725-23af-fac6-7dc8d5c15e56', 'en', 'That Zerubbabel made himself king'),
('99193648-eb5e-d4c0-8f92-ee91d4f615c1', 'de', 'Dass die Juden den König heimlich ermorden wollten'),
('99193648-eb5e-d4c0-8f92-ee91d4f615c1', 'en', 'That the Jews secretly plotted to kill the king'),
('f85a095a-51ce-0c57-eaa0-036f1d908ce8', 'de', 'Dass die aufständische Stadt dem König keinen Tribut mehr zahle'),
('f85a095a-51ce-0c57-eaa0-036f1d908ce8', 'en', 'That the rebellious city would pay the king no more tribute'),
('c1034e04-c97f-7c94-5f2c-7d3bdb16c148', 'de', 'Sie sollten als Heer in den Kampf ziehen'),
('c1034e04-c97f-7c94-5f2c-7d3bdb16c148', 'en', 'They were to go out to war as an army'),
('ced2afa4-55af-d82b-4a47-d51271107d12', 'de', 'Sie sollten den Dienst am Haus des HERRN versehen'),
('ced2afa4-55af-d82b-4a47-d51271107d12', 'en', 'They were to perform the service at the house of the LORD'),
('b00cfe81-f20d-bfd2-62e1-09ad0b20fe2c', 'de', 'Sie sollten das Land neu unter die Stämme aufteilen'),
('b00cfe81-f20d-bfd2-62e1-09ad0b20fe2c', 'en', 'They were to redivide the land among the tribes'),
('268e319f-692a-12c7-c734-e3cbe593c220', 'de', 'Sie sollten die Lade an ihren alten Ort zurückbringen'),
('268e319f-692a-12c7-c734-e3cbe593c220', 'en', 'They were to return the ark to its old place'),
('c7d26e7b-9355-d79e-b6db-994462e39cb4', 'de', 'Die Propheten Hosea und Joel'),
('c7d26e7b-9355-d79e-b6db-994462e39cb4', 'en', 'The prophets Hosea and Joel'),
('04cda7b1-5c00-fc63-74b9-85c16d3a451c', 'de', 'Die Propheten Haggai und Sacharja'),
('04cda7b1-5c00-fc63-74b9-85c16d3a451c', 'en', 'The prophets Haggai and Zechariah'),
('259caeb1-9994-1cf2-a871-1e271e4978f5', 'de', 'Die Propheten Elia und Elisa'),
('259caeb1-9994-1cf2-a871-1e271e4978f5', 'en', 'The prophets Elijah and Elisha'),
('b2b27a8f-8ff9-ae83-d790-824ab898260f', 'de', 'Die Propheten Jesaja und Jeremia'),
('b2b27a8f-8ff9-ae83-d790-824ab898260f', 'en', 'The prophets Isaiah and Jeremiah'),
('9398ff6f-d84e-645c-bc29-61e0a1f36736', 'de', 'Maranata, das heißt: Unser Herr kommt'),
('9398ff6f-d84e-645c-bc29-61e0a1f36736', 'en', 'Maranatha, that is: Our Lord comes'),
('e5113675-a47b-8dac-aee0-63ff4fb693b6', 'de', 'Effata, das heißt: Tu dich auf'),
('e5113675-a47b-8dac-aee0-63ff4fb693b6', 'en', 'Ephphatha, that is: Be opened'),
('4c96ba32-4d25-7a06-44c3-76f1aab5cf58', 'de', 'Talita kum, das heißt: Steh auf'),
('4c96ba32-4d25-7a06-44c3-76f1aab5cf58', 'en', 'Talitha cumi, that is: Arise'),
('1abdcbd6-098d-8d08-0b15-8431fab8fb98', 'de', 'Schalom, das heißt: Friede sei mit dir'),
('1abdcbd6-098d-8d08-0b15-8431fab8fb98', 'en', 'Shalom, that is: Peace be with you'),
('bba74f62-dab4-fbcc-3e66-bf19009f42f7', 'de', 'Er ließ Schimi gefangen nehmen'),
('bba74f62-dab4-fbcc-3e66-bf19009f42f7', 'en', 'He had Shimei taken captive'),
('505241f9-db34-2129-5ec1-761420379e51', 'de', 'Er belohnte Abischai für den Vorschlag'),
('505241f9-db34-2129-5ec1-761420379e51', 'en', 'He rewarded Abishai for the suggestion'),
('240a8133-bfd8-3daf-76b4-61eed065ae88', 'de', 'Er hielt ihn zurück, vielleicht habe der Herr es Schimi geheißen'),
('240a8133-bfd8-3daf-76b4-61eed065ae88', 'en', 'He restrained him, perhaps the Lord had told Shimei to do it'),
('f18bb296-0aa9-5d71-a3a1-8a9b930b590e', 'de', 'Er stimmte sofort der Hinrichtung zu'),
('f18bb296-0aa9-5d71-a3a1-8a9b930b590e', 'en', 'He immediately agreed to the execution'),
('cbbf5c3b-574c-c1a4-7089-104063bf5b72', 'de', 'Aus dem Allerheiligsten nach Westen'),
('cbbf5c3b-574c-c1a4-7089-104063bf5b72', 'en', 'From the Most Holy Place toward the west'),
('f5b6543b-5a80-c3e0-0fa7-905d943cc326', 'de', 'Aus dem Brandopferaltar nach oben'),
('f5b6543b-5a80-c3e0-0fa7-905d943cc326', 'en', 'From the burnt-offering altar upward'),
('5f8d2310-e6ac-7ef4-c174-8e4fd8e5ab49', 'de', 'Aus dem Vorhof nach Süden'),
('5f8d2310-e6ac-7ef4-c174-8e4fd8e5ab49', 'en', 'From the courtyard toward the south'),
('478391dc-7006-924a-e797-461bd654962a', 'de', 'Unter der Schwelle des Tempels nach Osten hin'),
('478391dc-7006-924a-e797-461bd654962a', 'en', 'From under the threshold of the temple toward the east'),
('7c4d3cd4-3597-c49f-6209-2a2637f00a3c', 'de', 'Engel über dem Grab schweben'),
('7c4d3cd4-3597-c49f-6209-2a2637f00a3c', 'en', 'Angels hovering over the tomb'),
('1a10bac2-d130-4072-2115-86ae90783ffa', 'de', 'Den Leichnam noch im Grab liegen'),
('1a10bac2-d130-4072-2115-86ae90783ffa', 'en', 'The body still lying in the tomb'),
('3a980431-bd48-1642-d6cf-8ecf16f0df8f', 'de', 'Den Stein vom Grab weggenommen'),
('3a980431-bd48-1642-d6cf-8ecf16f0df8f', 'en', 'The stone taken away from the tomb'),
('6c797880-0a77-61c4-6da7-4a4f85890afc', 'de', 'Die Wächter vor dem Grab schlafen'),
('6c797880-0a77-61c4-6da7-4a4f85890afc', 'en', 'The guards asleep before the tomb'),
('fb797423-1f16-e1a3-6b20-c18820073d22', 'de', 'Sie diente ihnen am Tisch'),
('fb797423-1f16-e1a3-6b20-c18820073d22', 'en', 'She served them at the table'),
('c2733f4e-2091-846f-ac12-340557e45eaa', 'de', 'Sie ging in die Synagoge beten'),
('c2733f4e-2091-846f-ac12-340557e45eaa', 'en', 'She went to pray in the synagogue'),
('78385739-d9e8-e352-5b55-d1daeac63e8d', 'de', 'Sie weinte vor Freude am Boden'),
('78385739-d9e8-e352-5b55-d1daeac63e8d', 'en', 'She wept for joy on the ground'),
('94bfde25-bc6b-89f3-3235-644aba1c7194', 'de', 'Sie verkündete das Wunder im Dorf'),
('94bfde25-bc6b-89f3-3235-644aba1c7194', 'en', 'She proclaimed the miracle in the village'),
('d0ff1e2d-2f83-2ca7-81a8-54a8f2e80126', 'de', 'Dass jeder Mensch seinen eigenen Weg wählen dürfe'),
('d0ff1e2d-2f83-2ca7-81a8-54a8f2e80126', 'en', 'That every man may choose his own way'),
('e4a9f59e-6423-6af1-8c0c-172d32e47bc5', 'de', 'Dass die Priester neue Gefäße herstellen sollten'),
('e4a9f59e-6423-6af1-8c0c-172d32e47bc5', 'en', 'That the priests should make new vessels'),
('8310f251-e2c3-2be5-7030-1fe77850c95e', 'de', 'Dass Gott mit Israel verfahren kann wie der Töpfer mit dem Ton'),
('8310f251-e2c3-2be5-7030-1fe77850c95e', 'en', 'That God can deal with Israel as the potter does with the clay'),
('92d6f041-5ed9-852d-cdc8-3cf8a2d574f9', 'de', 'Dass das Volk niemals zerbrechen werde'),
('92d6f041-5ed9-852d-cdc8-3cf8a2d574f9', 'en', 'That the people would never be broken'),
('6dcc0766-8960-5108-c795-c6f35729eca4', 'de', 'Heiliger König Israels'),
('6dcc0766-8960-5108-c795-c6f35729eca4', 'en', 'Holy King of Israel'),
('0877cb06-ab8c-af97-2150-dc6168a0ed88', 'de', 'Höchster über allen Völkern'),
('0877cb06-ab8c-af97-2150-dc6168a0ed88', 'en', 'Most High over all peoples'),
('1ee52ecc-8e83-dca5-b210-5d1729114918', 'de', 'Herr und Gott der Heerscharen'),
('1ee52ecc-8e83-dca5-b210-5d1729114918', 'en', 'Lord and God of hosts'),
('cf4e8e68-81fc-e72d-184c-feba1c3d27d5', 'de', 'Unser Vater im Himmel'),
('cf4e8e68-81fc-e72d-184c-feba1c3d27d5', 'en', 'Our Father in heaven'),
('39921f07-6092-3c5f-dbc6-96ea970a30f1', 'de', 'Er opferte ein Lamm im Tempel'),
('39921f07-6092-3c5f-dbc6-96ea970a30f1', 'en', 'He sacrificed a lamb in the temple'),
('c34ee06b-c077-cef4-0922-0b86fabe51c0', 'de', 'Er wusch seine Hände in Wasser'),
('c34ee06b-c077-cef4-0922-0b86fabe51c0', 'en', 'He washed his hands in water'),
('4d0b0146-c8f4-5a68-93ff-432076bc99cb', 'de', 'Er verhüllte sein Haupt'),
('4d0b0146-c8f4-5a68-93ff-432076bc99cb', 'en', 'He veiled his head'),
('c0118219-ed58-6cfa-b9cc-8511bd9a8115', 'de', 'Er zerriss sein Gewand'),
('c0118219-ed58-6cfa-b9cc-8511bd9a8115', 'en', 'He tore his robe'),
('939f95d8-6616-e4d5-62e2-660ab82b05fe', 'de', 'Sie planten ihre Flucht'),
('939f95d8-6616-e4d5-62e2-660ab82b05fe', 'en', 'They planned their escape'),
('6ab35e51-dbc3-1f1c-cc1c-45a435af9bed', 'de', 'Sie schliefen tief und fest'),
('6ab35e51-dbc3-1f1c-cc1c-45a435af9bed', 'en', 'They slept deeply'),
('40c253aa-debb-5c05-7c04-f5fbc5e4a59d', 'de', 'Sie beteten und lobten Gott mit Lobliedern'),
('40c253aa-debb-5c05-7c04-f5fbc5e4a59d', 'en', 'They prayed and praised God with hymns'),
('9047d77f-85a1-2d02-bf39-a1fac4ea7bd4', 'de', 'Sie verfluchten ihre Wächter'),
('9047d77f-85a1-2d02-bf39-a1fac4ea7bd4', 'en', 'They cursed their guards'),
('0ade524d-41b3-5fba-34c9-a67466d69b6c', 'de', 'Aufgeschobene Hoffnung macht das Herz krank'),
('0ade524d-41b3-5fba-34c9-a67466d69b6c', 'en', 'Hope deferred makes the heart sick'),
('c26d8b17-509a-4641-0d9f-a685b17868f5', 'de', 'Aufgeschobene Hoffnung mehrt die Weisheit'),
('c26d8b17-509a-4641-0d9f-a685b17868f5', 'en', 'Hope deferred increases wisdom'),
('40284263-4830-301b-d47a-387cc70c7f05', 'de', 'Aufgeschobene Hoffnung stärkt das Herz'),
('40284263-4830-301b-d47a-387cc70c7f05', 'en', 'Hope deferred strengthens the heart'),
('1d5fcc7f-32d9-bd57-c5b2-0331ff8fe225', 'de', 'Aufgeschobene Hoffnung bringt Reichtum'),
('1d5fcc7f-32d9-bd57-c5b2-0331ff8fe225', 'en', 'Hope deferred brings riches'),
('bde79f7d-ebe1-c16f-12a5-d49eb76f2c3e', 'de', 'Er fordert den Tod jedes Sünders sofort'),
('bde79f7d-ebe1-c16f-12a5-d49eb76f2c3e', 'en', 'He demands the death of every sinner at once'),
('8dac5756-1887-dfae-27c1-5ae920103dcd', 'de', 'Er freut sich über den Untergang der Gottlosen'),
('8dac5756-1887-dfae-27c1-5ae920103dcd', 'en', 'He rejoices in the downfall of the wicked'),
('62df44ee-98d5-74ca-9d2f-f1ffa0fd3c01', 'de', 'Er übergibt das Urteil den Priestern'),
('62df44ee-98d5-74ca-9d2f-f1ffa0fd3c01', 'en', 'He hands the judgment over to the priests'),
('eee6b3bc-a2ba-b84a-4038-3521884310bc', 'de', 'Er hat kein Gefallen am Tod, sondern dass er sich bekehre und lebe'),
('eee6b3bc-a2ba-b84a-4038-3521884310bc', 'en', 'He has no pleasure in death, but that he turn and live'),
('7f18dcb2-ed0d-f7eb-f5df-507e42b56a0e', 'de', 'Zwei der Jünger'),
('7f18dcb2-ed0d-f7eb-f5df-507e42b56a0e', 'en', 'Two of the disciples'),
('9108f6a9-f4a1-be3f-88a9-d42cee510404', 'de', 'Zwei römische Soldaten'),
('9108f6a9-f4a1-be3f-88a9-d42cee510404', 'en', 'Two Roman soldiers'),
('76cf49fc-222b-1f00-6369-f24b1c650452', 'de', 'Zwei Übeltäter'),
('76cf49fc-222b-1f00-6369-f24b1c650452', 'en', 'Two criminals'),
('08b9d2e5-0a3b-9b74-e06d-45933543dccd', 'de', 'Zwei falsche Propheten'),
('08b9d2e5-0a3b-9b74-e06d-45933543dccd', 'en', 'Two false prophets'),
('f3670986-e494-3fe2-2784-33bd499361ab', 'de', 'Die drei Freunde zu entlassen'),
('f3670986-e494-3fe2-2784-33bd499361ab', 'en', 'To dismiss the three friends'),
('be4f0789-895a-9da1-a6ca-48ba67a2d463', 'de', 'Einen neuen Tempel zu bauen'),
('be4f0789-895a-9da1-a6ca-48ba67a2d463', 'en', 'To build a new temple'),
('435018e9-f08f-514a-0c29-be802a55c49b', 'de', 'Sünde durch Gerechtigkeit und Barmherzigkeit abzulegen'),
('435018e9-f08f-514a-0c29-be802a55c49b', 'en', 'To break off his sins by righteousness and mercy'),
('6fc82eaf-5cf3-f9ae-2f1d-28efc2831407', 'de', 'Dem goldenen Bild zu opfern'),
('6fc82eaf-5cf3-f9ae-2f1d-28efc2831407', 'en', 'To sacrifice to the golden image'),
('63289856-8736-e1ba-4c9b-87b2debb7c95', 'de', 'Mit Wasser bis oben hin'),
('63289856-8736-e1ba-4c9b-87b2debb7c95', 'en', 'With water to the brim'),
('e6c22a39-20f8-30e6-ff2c-91f3a7039568', 'de', 'Mit Öl für die Lampen'),
('e6c22a39-20f8-30e6-ff2c-91f3a7039568', 'en', 'With oil for the lamps'),
('4e56d108-e415-e463-a361-196b5b4ae8b8', 'de', 'Mit altem, saurem Wein'),
('4e56d108-e415-e463-a361-196b5b4ae8b8', 'en', 'With old, sour wine'),
('094215eb-5eb7-0387-6a11-b814be3a43dd', 'de', 'Mit frischem Most'),
('094215eb-5eb7-0387-6a11-b814be3a43dd', 'en', 'With fresh grape juice'),
('b27be8ee-7ce4-ab0f-1f1a-db1ba6ae50b3', 'de', 'Siehe, du bist schön, meine Freundin'),
('b27be8ee-7ce4-ab0f-1f1a-db1ba6ae50b3', 'en', 'Behold, you are beautiful, my love'),
('a115be27-c9c3-5971-6719-2e4fd6be7962', 'de', 'Siehe, du bist stark, meine Freundin'),
('a115be27-c9c3-5971-6719-2e4fd6be7962', 'en', 'Behold, you are strong, my love'),
('a061abb9-c228-db46-9118-b1e9cb2de11c', 'de', 'Siehe, du bist weise, meine Freundin'),
('a061abb9-c228-db46-9118-b1e9cb2de11c', 'en', 'Behold, you are wise, my love'),
('b8af1661-714d-19d4-77ec-23cf1494e881', 'de', 'Siehe, du bist reich, meine Freundin'),
('b8af1661-714d-19d4-77ec-23cf1494e881', 'en', 'Behold, you are rich, my love')
insert into public.answer_option_translations (option_id, lang, text) values
('70860ac0-9412-873d-172c-f033f5bdb1ee', 'de', 'In deine Hände befehle ich meinen Geist'),
('70860ac0-9412-873d-172c-f033f5bdb1ee', 'en', 'Into your hands I commit my spirit'),
('f6be009e-b7a9-a3da-4290-fad02848a20e', 'de', 'Mich dürstet nach Gerechtigkeit'),
('f6be009e-b7a9-a3da-4290-fad02848a20e', 'en', 'I thirst for righteousness'),
('cd9ce3b2-51df-1937-e56e-7779354f4b9f', 'de', 'Selig sind, die da glauben'),
('cd9ce3b2-51df-1937-e56e-7779354f4b9f', 'en', 'Blessed are those who believe'),
('fbaebd8f-3ad2-31ed-7d47-fd48d342a549', 'de', 'Es ist vollbracht'),
('fbaebd8f-3ad2-31ed-7d47-fd48d342a549', 'en', 'It is finished'),
('7503f6f0-37b6-45f3-82a7-13ab7c6721b2', 'de', 'Weil Saul der Gesalbte des HERRN war'),
('7503f6f0-37b6-45f3-82a7-13ab7c6721b2', 'en', 'Because Saul was the LORD''s anointed'),
('cb6263cc-efac-fa79-5cf7-8d50eaf9a5c4', 'de', 'Weil er Angst vor Jonatan hatte'),
('cb6263cc-efac-fa79-5cf7-8d50eaf9a5c4', 'en', 'Because he feared Jonathan'),
('346a53da-5644-31e1-64dd-97be1469ea75', 'de', 'Weil seine Männer es verboten'),
('346a53da-5644-31e1-64dd-97be1469ea75', 'en', 'Because his men forbade it'),
('98bd1c87-819f-2df8-e495-b9cbc4ed0864', 'de', 'Weil er Saul nicht erkannte'),
('98bd1c87-819f-2df8-e495-b9cbc4ed0864', 'en', 'Because he did not recognize Saul'),
('ed8e2dde-c491-935a-3f20-b0ca836ea803', 'de', 'Zum Löschen des Altarfeuers'),
('ed8e2dde-c491-935a-3f20-b0ca836ea803', 'en', 'For extinguishing the altar fire'),
('e68ee027-0e4a-4788-c753-9e6ce68cd0bb', 'de', 'Zur Salbung der Priester'),
('e68ee027-0e4a-4788-c753-9e6ce68cd0bb', 'en', 'For anointing the priests'),
('486685a8-d9c7-faf7-b015-1917303a5faf', 'de', 'Zum Trinken in der Wüste'),
('486685a8-d9c7-faf7-b015-1917303a5faf', 'en', 'For drinking in the wilderness'),
('1425a5e5-e657-56cc-afd0-8fc2fe76522a', 'de', 'Zur Reinigung von der Unreinheit durch einen Toten'),
('1425a5e5-e657-56cc-afd0-8fc2fe76522a', 'en', 'For purification from defilement by a corpse'),
('3bc42119-ce0d-94f1-dae4-f60c84d42ad7', 'de', 'Den Hungrigen speisen und den Fremden aufnehmen'),
('3bc42119-ce0d-94f1-dae4-f60c84d42ad7', 'en', 'Feeding the hungry and welcoming the stranger'),
('7ad60673-4dd5-1e50-68b1-a90056aedff6', 'de', 'Die Steuern zahlen und Gelübde erfüllen'),
('7ad60673-4dd5-1e50-68b1-a90056aedff6', 'en', 'Paying the taxes and fulfilling vows'),
('7de6c9c8-595a-c4b7-7a88-a74aabdbccca', 'de', 'Den Tempel bauen und Opfer bringen'),
('7de6c9c8-595a-c4b7-7a88-a74aabdbccca', 'en', 'Building the temple and bringing offerings'),
('363d7ac2-5bf4-5d05-7bf1-6a29a3a1f442', 'de', 'Das Gesetz lehren und Feste halten'),
('363d7ac2-5bf4-5d05-7bf1-6a29a3a1f442', 'en', 'Teaching the law and keeping the feasts'),
('926f0f0f-668a-dddd-f94b-bc171b505cd8', 'de', 'Seine Haut wurde grün wie Gras'),
('926f0f0f-668a-dddd-f94b-bc171b505cd8', 'en', 'His skin turned green like grass'),
('8ac8b64f-f25b-e62c-0492-61c46b94d5d1', 'de', 'Er schrumpfte zu einem Zwerg'),
('8ac8b64f-f25b-e62c-0492-61c46b94d5d1', 'en', 'He shrank to a dwarf'),
('befe9172-63e4-47d2-6df0-f036ae5a426e', 'de', 'Er wurde steinern und reglos'),
('befe9172-63e4-47d2-6df0-f036ae5a426e', 'en', 'He turned to stone and motionless'),
('8812ed74-4f0a-6483-6164-dbf2c690a59c', 'de', 'Sein Haar wuchs wie Adlerfedern, die Nägel wie Vogelkrallen'),
('8812ed74-4f0a-6483-6164-dbf2c690a59c', 'en', 'His hair grew like eagles'' feathers, his nails like birds'' claws'),
('5c3e2a77-0782-eeb3-7418-291e00d4dc65', 'de', 'Mose und Elia'),
('5c3e2a77-0782-eeb3-7418-291e00d4dc65', 'en', 'Moses and Elijah'),
('18c89b67-786b-48fc-2e9f-59f422b39fc4', 'de', 'Henoch und Noah'),
('18c89b67-786b-48fc-2e9f-59f422b39fc4', 'en', 'Enoch and Noah'),
('d5926a03-f54b-4e30-9a02-eb868c27225a', 'de', 'Abraham und David'),
('d5926a03-f54b-4e30-9a02-eb868c27225a', 'en', 'Abraham and David'),
('260cdc1a-3bfa-a010-b15d-81a7518c75d7', 'de', 'Jesaja und Jeremia'),
('260cdc1a-3bfa-a010-b15d-81a7518c75d7', 'en', 'Isaiah and Jeremiah'),
('16e930b4-ca2a-646b-c325-6e2d4e49de77', 'de', 'Abischag, die Sunamiterin'),
('16e930b4-ca2a-646b-c325-6e2d4e49de77', 'en', 'Abishag, the Shunammite'),
('a03b2121-da4e-b4d7-c020-999f5b5413fc', 'de', 'Michal, die Tochter Sauls'),
('a03b2121-da4e-b4d7-c020-999f5b5413fc', 'en', 'Michal, the daughter of Saul'),
('4fd8296a-5fff-0cbb-b0d5-478477c6db96', 'de', 'Batseba, die Frau Davids'),
('4fd8296a-5fff-0cbb-b0d5-478477c6db96', 'en', 'Bathsheba, the wife of David'),
('14076ab9-5db2-00f2-e20b-d867d5ca2820', 'de', 'Abigajil, die Karmeliterin'),
('14076ab9-5db2-00f2-e20b-d867d5ca2820', 'en', 'Abigail, the Carmelite'),
('dd5aedd6-64f8-1614-83e7-f535e4b24f5a', 'de', 'Baue meine Gemeinde'),
('dd5aedd6-64f8-1614-83e7-f535e4b24f5a', 'en', 'Build my church'),
('787df913-2a77-a06a-9735-dd3a6d237a4c', 'de', 'Weide meine Schafe'),
('787df913-2a77-a06a-9735-dd3a6d237a4c', 'en', 'Feed my sheep'),
('6891c194-aefc-4154-399c-8025dab51e76', 'de', 'Verkaufe deine Netze'),
('6891c194-aefc-4154-399c-8025dab51e76', 'en', 'Sell your nets'),
('8c25b4bc-0561-690b-5a52-bd13f15bee4b', 'de', 'Taufe alle Völker'),
('8c25b4bc-0561-690b-5a52-bd13f15bee4b', 'en', 'Baptize all nations'),
('4aadaa3b-58a4-e23f-79fd-b91686309643', 'de', 'Schweigt zu allen Zeiten'),
('4aadaa3b-58a4-e23f-79fd-b91686309643', 'en', 'Be silent at all times'),
('22e0020c-f45c-3112-a263-0145dbbe4398', 'de', 'Redet nur in der Versammlung'),
('22e0020c-f45c-3112-a263-0145dbbe4398', 'en', 'Speak only in the assembly'),
('042e9a21-cadb-ca41-098e-d440e82a4393', 'de', 'Redet, wie es euch beliebt'),
('042e9a21-cadb-ca41-098e-d440e82a4393', 'en', 'Speak however you please'),
('947f4d7c-20d7-6640-9567-fac0fc0e66a5', 'de', 'Kein faules Wort gehe aus eurem Mund'),
('947f4d7c-20d7-6640-9567-fac0fc0e66a5', 'en', 'Let no corrupt word come out of your mouth'),
('1a0a24aa-7ab3-77cc-c573-3a2b84249981', 'de', 'Eine Brücke aus Steinen erschien'),
('1a0a24aa-7ab3-77cc-c573-3a2b84249981', 'en', 'A bridge of stones appeared'),
('269fd268-3ef0-6e4b-8f03-fca721bf857d', 'de', 'Das Wasser wurde zu Blut'),
('269fd268-3ef0-6e4b-8f03-fca721bf857d', 'en', 'The water turned to blood'),
('52de23fe-7230-f164-5a89-41012ec85352', 'de', 'Das Wasser staute sich und blieb stehen'),
('52de23fe-7230-f164-5a89-41012ec85352', 'en', 'The water piled up and stood still'),
('97237928-ca33-d8c1-1433-1743a5751a40', 'de', 'Das Wasser teilte sich nach beiden Seiten'),
('97237928-ca33-d8c1-1433-1743a5751a40', 'en', 'The water parted to both sides'),
('0ba2a79f-817f-09e9-5580-251b14037edb', 'de', 'Deine Tochter ist genesen, komm schnell heim'),
('0ba2a79f-817f-09e9-5580-251b14037edb', 'en', 'Your daughter has recovered, come home quickly'),
('50fdade2-6edd-54db-d36c-d696b1feeb68', 'de', 'Deine Tochter ist gestorben, bemühe den Meister nicht weiter'),
('50fdade2-6edd-54db-d36c-d696b1feeb68', 'en', 'Your daughter is dead, trouble the Teacher no further'),
('ba076382-bebc-0a12-6bd3-a1b08eba9504', 'de', 'Das Haus wird von Feinden bedroht'),
('ba076382-bebc-0a12-6bd3-a1b08eba9504', 'en', 'The house is threatened by enemies'),
('669d9fa4-9c82-d385-7467-06e00c9f3e3b', 'de', 'Die Ältesten rufen dich zum Rat'),
('669d9fa4-9c82-d385-7467-06e00c9f3e3b', 'en', 'The elders call you to the council'),
('84b0b285-ecc9-943d-7cb4-f9a68350cbb3', 'de', 'Einen Wolf und einen Leoparden'),
('84b0b285-ecc9-943d-7cb4-f9a68350cbb3', 'en', 'A wolf and a leopard'),
('5b020081-c3dd-cb27-5488-508ec1ccada2', 'de', 'Einen Stier und einen Eber'),
('5b020081-c3dd-cb27-5488-508ec1ccada2', 'en', 'A bull and a boar'),
('907ba28e-9e25-76af-28af-eaae7fc627f3', 'de', 'Eine Schlange und einen Adler'),
('907ba28e-9e25-76af-28af-eaae7fc627f3', 'en', 'A serpent and an eagle'),
('232213da-abef-2d6d-6028-08e6d4b930d8', 'de', 'Einen Löwen und einen Bären'),
('232213da-abef-2d6d-6028-08e6d4b930d8', 'en', 'A lion and a bear'),
('e2bc345c-e192-bd1b-4fc8-97935398f85c', 'de', 'Der Gotteslästerung'),
('e2bc345c-e192-bd1b-4fc8-97935398f85c', 'en', 'Of blasphemy'),
('1cd138a6-b664-fc69-bc06-d34c2d9dc8df', 'de', 'Der Zauberei'),
('1cd138a6-b664-fc69-bc06-d34c2d9dc8df', 'en', 'Of sorcery'),
('e2730e5d-4662-8f6e-2d87-fd0cd2fe1f64', 'de', 'Des Aufruhrs gegen Rom'),
('e2730e5d-4662-8f6e-2d87-fd0cd2fe1f64', 'en', 'Of rebellion against Rome'),
('2ebcb338-4de3-2142-7acc-fca2c2a0f4c5', 'de', 'Des Diebstahls am Tempel'),
('2ebcb338-4de3-2142-7acc-fca2c2a0f4c5', 'en', 'Of theft from the temple'),
('fe8282f1-b36b-89d3-eebd-f2ff8f996654', 'de', 'Der Stab verwandelte sich in Wasser'),
('fe8282f1-b36b-89d3-eebd-f2ff8f996654', 'en', 'The staff turned into water'),
('4a6eb5d7-1caa-1758-ac6e-6e8af004bf89', 'de', 'Der Stab wurde zu Feuer'),
('4a6eb5d7-1caa-1758-ac6e-6e8af004bf89', 'en', 'The staff became fire'),
('0736e8ad-20bd-7298-bba6-c1ece0bd1c83', 'de', 'Der Stab wurde zu einer Schlange'),
('0736e8ad-20bd-7298-bba6-c1ece0bd1c83', 'en', 'The staff became a serpent'),
('ba779197-9d5f-1350-9277-859850ced64c', 'de', 'Der Stab blühte und trug Mandeln'),
('ba779197-9d5f-1350-9277-859850ced64c', 'en', 'The staff blossomed and bore almonds'),
('cb1c86a6-3e0a-df70-5382-591bbe61ed69', 'de', 'Er fiel von einer Mauer'),
('cb1c86a6-3e0a-df70-5382-591bbe61ed69', 'en', 'He fell from a wall'),
('00531f4c-465d-01cf-c7fb-b45d6cb994ed', 'de', 'Er wurde mit dem Schwert erschlagen'),
('00531f4c-465d-01cf-c7fb-b45d6cb994ed', 'en', 'He was slain with the sword'),
('1390c30a-2e91-1731-d420-08d61377b22a', 'de', 'Ein Engel des Herrn schlug ihn, und er wurde von Würmern zerfressen'),
('1390c30a-2e91-1731-d420-08d61377b22a', 'en', 'An angel of the Lord struck him, and he was eaten by worms'),
('d7d32770-c215-c624-83ca-ef08cbd35eb9', 'de', 'Er ertrank im Meer'),
('d7d32770-c215-c624-83ca-ef08cbd35eb9', 'en', 'He drowned in the sea'),
('1b6b7981-5fd4-5b06-72b0-4f5d770bb29e', 'de', 'Israels Untreue gegenüber Gott'),
('1b6b7981-5fd4-5b06-72b0-4f5d770bb29e', 'en', 'Israel''s unfaithfulness toward God'),
('c77200ff-b62f-8e81-bca1-707b7f8c352e', 'de', 'Die Sünde der Priester'),
('c77200ff-b62f-8e81-bca1-707b7f8c352e', 'en', 'The sin of the priests'),
('31a0d73e-a3bd-3ae9-6e77-a7422eb096e5', 'de', 'Das kommende Exil nach Ägypten'),
('31a0d73e-a3bd-3ae9-6e77-a7422eb096e5', 'en', 'The coming exile to Egypt'),
('2bd6045a-d42e-14d2-a478-265e5308bae1', 'de', 'Gottes Bund mit den Heiden'),
('2bd6045a-d42e-14d2-a478-265e5308bae1', 'en', 'God''s covenant with the nations'),
('3e7a9b1a-9c4f-90c5-80ac-16593287cbb4', 'de', 'Bis zu zehn Gerechten'),
('3e7a9b1a-9c4f-90c5-80ac-16593287cbb4', 'en', 'Down to ten righteous'),
('c3a7b3f5-5e13-51e8-29e7-55e5f139321e', 'de', 'Bis zu drei Gerechten'),
('c3a7b3f5-5e13-51e8-29e7-55e5f139321e', 'en', 'Down to three righteous'),
('4cfc9ca4-163e-7f68-c9ab-17b78c67b16d', 'de', 'Bis zu fünf Gerechten'),
('4cfc9ca4-163e-7f68-c9ab-17b78c67b16d', 'en', 'Down to five righteous'),
('b585dd29-fc93-3205-aa35-352689532651', 'de', 'Bis zu zwanzig Gerechten'),
('b585dd29-fc93-3205-aa35-352689532651', 'en', 'Down to twenty righteous'),
('2e646996-740e-b946-fcef-4f8813f5bcb5', 'de', 'Der Frau des Pilatus'),
('2e646996-740e-b946-fcef-4f8813f5bcb5', 'en', 'The wife of Pilate'),
('2a64df68-6099-976a-5628-e4eaed07cb51', 'de', 'Einer Frau aus Magdala'),
('2a64df68-6099-976a-5628-e4eaed07cb51', 'en', 'A woman from Magdala'),
('b170db09-4d68-b990-51ac-1f217dab0361', 'de', 'Der kanaanäischen (syrophönizischen) Frau'),
('b170db09-4d68-b990-51ac-1f217dab0361', 'en', 'The Canaanite (Syrophoenician) woman'),
('64c619c7-3f7c-5cc0-3a30-8daa49430428', 'de', 'Der Witwe von Nain'),
('64c619c7-3f7c-5cc0-3a30-8daa49430428', 'en', 'The widow of Nain'),
('c08fe166-44c8-e009-ddbe-dff4a1c7d273', 'de', 'Siehe, das sind deine Götter, die dich aus Ägypten geführt haben'),
('c08fe166-44c8-e009-ddbe-dff4a1c7d273', 'en', 'Behold your gods who brought you up out of Egypt'),
('cd226686-165f-c9be-dffe-0f63bae6df51', 'de', 'Bringt ihnen all euer Gold als Opfer dar'),
('cd226686-165f-c9be-dffe-0f63bae6df51', 'en', 'Bring them all your gold as an offering'),
('7fabbae0-58f8-53df-b95c-57eec3d32db0', 'de', 'Diese Kälber bewahren euch vor dem Krieg'),
('7fabbae0-58f8-53df-b95c-57eec3d32db0', 'en', 'These calves will keep you from war'),
('0f8e30b1-005f-6c1e-52cd-02415eb95f49', 'de', 'Betet diese Bilder an, oder ihr werdet sterben'),
('0f8e30b1-005f-6c1e-52cd-02415eb95f49', 'en', 'Worship these images or you will die'),
('50ac8e35-ad5c-3fbc-bb40-515bdc391a4d', 'de', 'Sie werden ihre Heere für immer auflösen'),
('50ac8e35-ad5c-3fbc-bb40-515bdc391a4d', 'en', 'They shall disband their armies forever'),
('eed2ce8d-020e-338d-d46b-0f24cb661d93', 'de', 'Sie werden ihre Waffen ins Meer werfen'),
('eed2ce8d-020e-338d-d46b-0f24cb661d93', 'en', 'They shall throw their weapons into the sea'),
('ef3cb1b1-2080-67c9-68ee-8fab74a19326', 'de', 'Sie werden hinfort nicht mehr lernen, Krieg zu führen'),
('ef3cb1b1-2080-67c9-68ee-8fab74a19326', 'en', 'They shall learn war no more'),
('4762a776-119b-87e0-3f22-61c65278667f', 'de', 'Sie werden ihre Festungen niederreißen'),
('4762a776-119b-87e0-3f22-61c65278667f', 'en', 'They shall tear down their fortresses'),
('05353afb-9c17-5681-720b-3a3075faf765', 'de', 'Ihr Mann werde reich gesegnet werden'),
('05353afb-9c17-5681-720b-3a3075faf765', 'en', 'Her husband would be richly blessed'),
('eb0f0ea1-ad8a-9db9-3b1a-7d5fec2ca3b0', 'de', 'Ihr Haus werde nie zerstört werden'),
('eb0f0ea1-ad8a-9db9-3b1a-7d5fec2ca3b0', 'en', 'Her house would never be destroyed'),
('d1d91ac4-d1cf-90cc-e766-054b5889a9ea', 'de', 'Sie werde Königin in Samaria werden'),
('d1d91ac4-d1cf-90cc-e766-054b5889a9ea', 'en', 'She would become queen in Samaria'),
('b23536a9-4aed-fd57-d8f8-fd8c4c63a373', 'de', 'Sie werde im nächsten Jahr einen Sohn umarmen'),
('b23536a9-4aed-fd57-d8f8-fd8c4c63a373', 'en', 'She would embrace a son the next year'),
('9892efb2-be4a-f5b4-894a-cf4432fc682c', 'de', 'Er wurde zum Heerführer des Reiches'),
('9892efb2-be4a-f5b4-894a-cf4432fc682c', 'en', 'He became commander of the kingdom''s army'),
('53cce857-e171-97ca-e126-cb4bcf2e87ff', 'de', 'Er wurde zum Statthalter über Juda ernannt'),
('53cce857-e171-97ca-e126-cb4bcf2e87ff', 'en', 'He was appointed governor over Judah'),
('d8623180-fa3f-21ce-6af7-8bb0f5460c6e', 'de', 'Er wurde Hoherpriester am Tempel'),
('d8623180-fa3f-21ce-6af7-8bb0f5460c6e', 'en', 'He became high priest at the temple'),
('9a502ad7-13cd-e089-c26b-af8a5ff08ede', 'de', 'Er wurde der Zweite nach dem König Xerxes'),
('9a502ad7-13cd-e089-c26b-af8a5ff08ede', 'en', 'He became second after King Xerxes'),
('d3cd75e0-a2cc-7b1c-6342-543f9509d105', 'de', 'Ein Ort des Opfers'),
('d3cd75e0-a2cc-7b1c-6342-543f9509d105', 'en', 'A place of sacrifice'),
('70c15fc7-4a89-61e5-a290-9d261583da32', 'de', 'Ein Schatz der Priester'),
('70c15fc7-4a89-61e5-a290-9d261583da32', 'en', 'A treasury of the priests'),
('36a94ea5-be10-9a6b-1a50-412fbaa509f2', 'de', 'Ein Sitz der Lehre'),
('36a94ea5-be10-9a6b-1a50-412fbaa509f2', 'en', 'A seat of teaching'),
('12a40480-1010-0411-b94d-d35f31199487', 'de', 'Ein Haus des Gebets'),
('12a40480-1010-0411-b94d-d35f31199487', 'en', 'A house of prayer'),
('1631d46b-c844-e5a9-e0ce-9d0c9c7e56fa', 'de', 'Sie sollten nur einen Stab nehmen, kein Brot und kein Geld'),
('1631d46b-c844-e5a9-e0ce-9d0c9c7e56fa', 'en', 'They were to take only a staff, no bread and no money'),
('b56af47d-59d0-ba94-09a6-512ccc2d92be', 'de', 'Sie sollten Bücher und Schriftrollen tragen'),
('b56af47d-59d0-ba94-09a6-512ccc2d92be', 'en', 'They were to carry books and scrolls'),
('05ca6202-a635-e6e5-0a23-8dfbc07c1bdc', 'de', 'Sie sollten Schwerter zum Schutz tragen'),
('05ca6202-a635-e6e5-0a23-8dfbc07c1bdc', 'en', 'They were to carry swords for protection'),
('b647d8cc-80f4-ba3a-0f09-95f94720d2d1', 'de', 'Sie sollten Vorräte und Geld mitnehmen'),
('b647d8cc-80f4-ba3a-0f09-95f94720d2d1', 'en', 'They were to take provisions and money'),
('bce0964a-6a93-ef26-d324-237c4bf73164', 'de', 'Zwölf Bäume des Feldes'),
('bce0964a-6a93-ef26-d324-237c4bf73164', 'en', 'Twelve trees of the field'),
('561ba235-56b4-c857-39a8-ad3f2b0c5681', 'de', 'Sieben fette Kühe'),
('561ba235-56b4-c857-39a8-ad3f2b0c5681', 'en', 'Seven fat cows'),
('25679410-edc2-70ff-4a5a-27abadf8e8f4', 'de', 'Die Berge ringsum'),
('25679410-edc2-70ff-4a5a-27abadf8e8f4', 'en', 'The surrounding mountains'),
('384bbe8b-7d09-47a5-8d41-e8908142fe6f', 'de', 'Die Sonne, der Mond und elf Sterne'),
('384bbe8b-7d09-47a5-8d41-e8908142fe6f', 'en', 'The sun, the moon, and eleven stars'),
('afd82352-0c67-1a43-7738-be493d307e84', 'de', 'Weil der Sabbat schon begonnen hatte'),
('afd82352-0c67-1a43-7738-be493d307e84', 'en', 'Because the Sabbath had already begun'),
('260c3845-138c-801d-c662-b3670cb96223', 'de', 'Weil er schon gestorben war'),
('260c3845-138c-801d-c662-b3670cb96223', 'en', 'Because he had already died'),
('a3cba44b-8f36-7bea-6932-f8de0aada488', 'de', 'Weil das Volk es verlangte'),
('a3cba44b-8f36-7bea-6932-f8de0aada488', 'en', 'Because the people demanded it'),
('e4a6c080-fc98-10bb-aba0-67b574ba9f00', 'de', 'Weil Pilatus es verboten hatte'),
('e4a6c080-fc98-10bb-aba0-67b574ba9f00', 'en', 'Because Pilate had forbidden it'),
('f5bea44d-afc6-a42d-3627-c86910ce392a', 'de', 'Er fiel sofort tot um'),
('f5bea44d-afc6-a42d-3627-c86910ce392a', 'en', 'He fell down dead at once'),
('937d200b-7341-486f-3df2-1d70143243ce', 'de', 'Sein Arm schwoll an für viele Tage'),
('937d200b-7341-486f-3df2-1d70143243ce', 'en', 'His arm swelled for many days'),
('3ae55e9f-5961-9559-d29e-8d23e656bb05', 'de', 'Er wurde von der Insel verbannt'),
('3ae55e9f-5961-9559-d29e-8d23e656bb05', 'en', 'He was banished from the island'),
('870eb9ae-cba3-9b16-61ec-ef4055028018', 'de', 'Er schüttelte sie ins Feuer und nahm keinen Schaden'),
('870eb9ae-cba3-9b16-61ec-ef4055028018', 'en', 'He shook it off into the fire and took no harm'),
('3b605e47-ad92-30fa-146b-37821df3ee9c', 'de', 'Der Stamm Levi'),
('3b605e47-ad92-30fa-146b-37821df3ee9c', 'en', 'The tribe of Levi'),
('f9f5beb7-d793-0014-7629-01d847e9390b', 'de', 'Der Stamm Juda'),
('f9f5beb7-d793-0014-7629-01d847e9390b', 'en', 'The tribe of Judah'),
('ee9bd33d-3b8e-4d0c-0f3f-e500f12a902f', 'de', 'Der Stamm Gad'),
('ee9bd33d-3b8e-4d0c-0f3f-e500f12a902f', 'en', 'The tribe of Gad'),
('29ec5dba-f0bd-79a0-07e3-d739fd75043f', 'de', 'Der Stamm Benjamin'),
('29ec5dba-f0bd-79a0-07e3-d739fd75043f', 'en', 'The tribe of Benjamin'),
('975cf777-cb15-24fc-15c7-95b5315d5385', 'de', 'Der Geist Gottes des Herrn ist auf mir, den Elenden gute Botschaft zu bringen'),
('975cf777-cb15-24fc-15c7-95b5315d5385', 'en', 'The Spirit of the Lord God is upon me to bring good news to the poor'),
('be1ac30c-4f44-61ec-ed80-1670cdb00e51', 'de', 'So spricht der Herr, der Himmel und Erde gemacht hat'),
('be1ac30c-4f44-61ec-ed80-1670cdb00e51', 'en', 'Thus says the Lord, who made heaven and earth'),
('3fac93fc-f419-66de-e314-2d5af2015726', 'de', 'Wachet auf, ihr Schlafenden, und der Herr wird euch erleuchten'),
('3fac93fc-f419-66de-e314-2d5af2015726', 'en', 'Awake, you who sleep, and the Lord will give you light'),
('74ab36c9-c64c-15cb-0285-817b39f3faf8', 'de', 'Friede, Friede denen in der Ferne und denen in der Nähe'),
('74ab36c9-c64c-15cb-0285-817b39f3faf8', 'en', 'Peace, peace to those far off and those near'),
('24633eed-306d-9158-2b1d-466976d0966c', 'de', 'Er lehrte mit Vollmacht, nicht wie die Schriftgelehrten'),
('24633eed-306d-9158-2b1d-466976d0966c', 'en', 'He taught with authority, not like the scribes'),
('fc7111dc-7853-116f-fec0-fa1ca7fa5d38', 'de', 'Er lehrte allein in Gleichnissen'),
('fc7111dc-7853-116f-fec0-fa1ca7fa5d38', 'en', 'He taught only in parables'),
('f8d33023-66ea-acc8-6ea7-ddfa3465b36b', 'de', 'Er lehrte in fremden Sprachen'),
('f8d33023-66ea-acc8-6ea7-ddfa3465b36b', 'en', 'He taught in foreign tongues'),
('f4dc2113-acb9-e1ea-17ba-a0ce4fa69dfd', 'de', 'Er lehrte wie die Propheten der Vorzeit'),
('f4dc2113-acb9-e1ea-17ba-a0ce4fa69dfd', 'en', 'He taught like the prophets of old'),
('193764f7-c8d7-e002-f099-05919fd4ae80', 'de', 'Ein Denar, der nur für Petrus reichte'),
('193764f7-c8d7-e002-f099-05919fd4ae80', 'en', 'A denarius, enough only for Peter'),
('fcc551cd-8ce8-0dc5-4445-f16532a0a613', 'de', 'Ein Stater, der für Jesus und Petrus reichte'),
('fcc551cd-8ce8-0dc5-4445-f16532a0a613', 'en', 'A stater, enough for Jesus and Peter'),
('f99ad81d-a9b1-fc9c-d3c9-cc5b2fb53c85', 'de', 'Ein Goldstück, das dem Tempel gehörte'),
('f99ad81d-a9b1-fc9c-d3c9-cc5b2fb53c85', 'en', 'A gold piece belonging to the temple'),
('1d1f1dae-35d6-34d7-0d2d-5764c00c28ac', 'de', 'Eine Drachme, die für alle Jünger reichte'),
('1d1f1dae-35d6-34d7-0d2d-5764c00c28ac', 'en', 'A drachma, enough for all the disciples'),
('4fa34b8c-091e-db9a-028d-1c313aa5e712', 'de', 'Ihr Herren, was muss ich tun, dass ich gerettet werde?'),
('4fa34b8c-091e-db9a-028d-1c313aa5e712', 'en', 'Sirs, what must I do to be saved?'),
('1d9a1a97-0a9d-74a9-ff1a-76a8f9c55c64', 'de', 'Wer hat die Türen geöffnet?'),
('1d9a1a97-0a9d-74a9-ff1a-76a8f9c55c64', 'en', 'Who opened the doors?'),
('a0235673-3b45-8059-58af-cc6132658242', 'de', 'Geht hinaus und lasst mich in Ruhe'),
('a0235673-3b45-8059-58af-cc6132658242', 'en', 'Go out and leave me in peace'),
('27376ca7-2d29-9832-9828-9dfbb26be972', 'de', 'Bringt mir Licht herbei'),
('27376ca7-2d29-9832-9828-9dfbb26be972', 'en', 'Bring me a light'),
('13fe0bc5-691a-1595-efaf-b8bc4a59ccd3', 'de', 'Er legte ihm eine Salbe auf die Hand'),
('13fe0bc5-691a-1595-efaf-b8bc4a59ccd3', 'en', 'He placed an ointment on his hand'),
('ab207d72-9e12-a211-5047-2ed92c4af836', 'de', 'Er bestrich die Hand mit Speichel'),
('ab207d72-9e12-a211-5047-2ed92c4af836', 'en', 'He smeared the hand with saliva'),
('811f2e18-d5fe-e58a-fde2-01bd4f1e4a5f', 'de', 'Er sprach: Strecke deine Hand aus, und sie wurde gesund'),
('811f2e18-d5fe-e58a-fde2-01bd4f1e4a5f', 'en', 'He said: Stretch out your hand, and it was restored'),
('bfcb6ed4-8e11-ecad-39cf-bf158430fae8', 'de', 'Er sandte ihn zum Teich Bethesda'),
('bfcb6ed4-8e11-ecad-39cf-bf158430fae8', 'en', 'He sent him to the pool of Bethesda'),
('c7c0acfd-ecb0-0772-f994-abf4a2c3d580', 'de', 'Die Beschneidung'),
('c7c0acfd-ecb0-0772-f994-abf4a2c3d580', 'en', 'Circumcision'),
('f3d2b2a2-5ec1-d412-025c-3c4899040b02', 'de', 'Das Fasten am Neumond'),
('f3d2b2a2-5ec1-d412-025c-3c4899040b02', 'en', 'Fasting at the new moon'),
('41eebd81-7bcc-b2d8-cf4e-a328405d12ce', 'de', 'Das Aufrichten einer Säule'),
('41eebd81-7bcc-b2d8-cf4e-a328405d12ce', 'en', 'The raising of a pillar'),
('075305aa-269c-1402-1b90-1b1a4313a28e', 'de', 'Das Tragen eines Stirnbandes'),
('075305aa-269c-1402-1b90-1b1a4313a28e', 'en', 'The wearing of a headband'),
('40a93308-235b-43d1-82a1-76f3f1863577', 'de', 'Die Füße'),
('40a93308-235b-43d1-82a1-76f3f1863577', 'en', 'The feet'),
('74a01d98-dc99-d093-277a-04d0bab7053e', 'de', 'Die Brust und die Arme'),
('74a01d98-dc99-d093-277a-04d0bab7053e', 'en', 'The chest and arms'),
('58ded980-f418-473f-3f69-b27ce59b306f', 'de', 'Der Bauch und die Lenden'),
('58ded980-f418-473f-3f69-b27ce59b306f', 'en', 'The belly and thighs'),
('7e2ddd9a-b05d-8eae-8f25-90b1764d6d53', 'de', 'Das Haupt'),
('7e2ddd9a-b05d-8eae-8f25-90b1764d6d53', 'en', 'The head'),
('f3d36488-0541-995c-8e98-9cf217481fbf', 'de', 'Er sandte sie zum Teich Bethesda'),
('f3d36488-0541-995c-8e98-9cf217481fbf', 'en', 'He sent her to the pool of Bethesda'),
('962f7665-b00b-1860-5692-ef952602a7e7', 'de', 'Er legte ihr die Hände auf, und sie richtete sich auf'),
('962f7665-b00b-1860-5692-ef952602a7e7', 'en', 'He laid his hands on her, and she straightened up'),
('1768c701-01b4-288b-04b4-eee6644dbd9d', 'de', 'Er ließ sie sieben Tage fasten'),
('1768c701-01b4-288b-04b4-eee6644dbd9d', 'en', 'He had her fast seven days'),
('f65b05b1-4cec-8f76-38b8-f5111bfc5313', 'de', 'Er bestrich ihren Rücken mit Salbe'),
('f65b05b1-4cec-8f76-38b8-f5111bfc5313', 'en', 'He anointed her back with ointment'),
('b502b737-66b5-9d03-2d95-247203a4aec6', 'de', 'Du sollst Mutter vieler Völker werden'),
('b502b737-66b5-9d03-2d95-247203a4aec6', 'en', 'You shall become mother of many nations'),
('a40c6c1d-c635-ea0c-9da3-9f554f79dc33', 'de', 'Der Herr lohne dir, unter dessen Flügeln du Zuflucht suchst'),
('a40c6c1d-c635-ea0c-9da3-9f554f79dc33', 'en', 'May the Lord reward you, under whose wings you seek refuge'),
('62118fbe-dccf-0418-0557-95cadb237d34', 'de', 'Dein Name werde groß in Israel'),
('62118fbe-dccf-0418-0557-95cadb237d34', 'en', 'Your name shall be great in Israel'),
('5452837a-0cce-0c58-15d6-c8a0f52a3c42', 'de', 'Du wirst Königin über Juda sein'),
('5452837a-0cce-0c58-15d6-c8a0f52a3c42', 'en', 'You will be queen over Judah'),
('afbcfeb9-2ab7-2db2-f5f5-5dda563fc06b', 'de', 'Er erblindete für sieben Jahre'),
('afbcfeb9-2ab7-2db2-f5f5-5dda563fc06b', 'en', 'He went blind for seven years'),
('419809b0-e476-a65f-a1ea-b212e4d09698', 'de', 'Naamans Aussatz haftete an ihm und seinem Geschlecht'),
('419809b0-e476-a65f-a1ea-b212e4d09698', 'en', 'Naaman''s leprosy clung to him and his descendants'),
('8fc1c0ba-e3c1-9c91-f6c1-b5fdda98cddf', 'de', 'Er wurde aus dem Land verbannt'),
('8fc1c0ba-e3c1-9c91-f6c1-b5fdda98cddf', 'en', 'He was banished from the land'),
('89585dc7-782f-5ad0-36fe-d9826a44c36d', 'de', 'Er verlor seine Stimme für immer'),
('89585dc7-782f-5ad0-36fe-d9826a44c36d', 'en', 'He lost his voice forever'),
('7c3c600e-4d81-b629-6631-52503ce5af16', 'de', 'Er verließ zornig das Heiligtum'),
('7c3c600e-4d81-b629-6631-52503ce5af16', 'en', 'He left the sanctuary in anger'),
('cfa151e7-acf3-284e-f2f6-50558ffdfba6', 'de', 'Er zerriss seine Kleider laut klagend'),
('cfa151e7-acf3-284e-f2f6-50558ffdfba6', 'en', 'He tore his clothes wailing loudly'),
('92c30c14-42f3-77d9-f2c7-f83aa5ac986b', 'de', 'Er schwieg und sagte nichts'),
('92c30c14-42f3-77d9-f2c7-f83aa5ac986b', 'en', 'He remained silent and said nothing'),
('b321c23c-877e-d2e9-0c74-6634a7e1acf8', 'de', 'Er forderte Rache von Mose'),
('b321c23c-877e-d2e9-0c74-6634a7e1acf8', 'en', 'He demanded vengeance from Moses'),
('7e6671fe-06c4-e767-f72c-a96183b5dbff', 'de', 'Dass einer von ihnen ihn verraten werde'),
('7e6671fe-06c4-e767-f72c-a96183b5dbff', 'en', 'That one of them would betray him'),
('68ae0450-79af-9032-e393-6405eb65304f', 'de', 'Dass einer von ihnen fliehen werde nach Galiläa'),
('68ae0450-79af-9032-e393-6405eb65304f', 'en', 'That one of them would flee to Galilee'),
('9f3f9276-91af-24a3-58ec-8829772e5ca6', 'de', 'Dass einer von ihnen das Schwert ergreifen werde'),
('9f3f9276-91af-24a3-58ec-8829772e5ca6', 'en', 'That one of them would take up the sword'),
('538590e3-ccd2-6005-7a8e-f3b3f46032f4', 'de', 'Dass einer von ihnen ihn richten werde'),
('538590e3-ccd2-6005-7a8e-f3b3f46032f4', 'en', 'That one of them would judge him'),
('4f9c9f47-eb1e-ffda-8f1b-e85efb4f0cb5', 'de', 'Wer dem Armen gibt, verarmt selbst'),
('4f9c9f47-eb1e-ffda-8f1b-e85efb4f0cb5', 'en', 'Whoever gives to the poor becomes poor'),
('1fc2a2b5-47f1-7133-e276-c23d746ea7de', 'de', 'Wer den Armen meidet, wird geehrt'),
('1fc2a2b5-47f1-7133-e276-c23d746ea7de', 'en', 'Whoever avoids the poor is honored'),
('e7133d2f-a5f1-95a5-5e8c-8eafe89de8fd', 'de', 'Wer sich des Armen erbarmt, leiht dem HERRN'),
('e7133d2f-a5f1-95a5-5e8c-8eafe89de8fd', 'en', 'Whoever is kind to the poor lends to the LORD'),
('c0829a85-9a35-40c3-aa79-cd824ef47f64', 'de', 'Wer den Armen verachtet, wird reich'),
('c0829a85-9a35-40c3-aa79-cd824ef47f64', 'en', 'Whoever despises the poor grows rich'),
('7e11c224-fb61-37a4-7a71-f446e20c72c8', 'de', 'Mit seiner Hand und legte ihm seine Worte in den Mund'),
('7e11c224-fb61-37a4-7a71-f446e20c72c8', 'en', 'With his hand and put his words in his mouth'),
('8565c376-c572-03d0-a9c6-88320199aae3', 'de', 'Mit Öl aus dem heiligen Horn'),
('8565c376-c572-03d0-a9c6-88320199aae3', 'en', 'With oil from the holy horn'),
('cf92297d-dc93-9a1c-3891-0877e3175982', 'de', 'Mit einer aufgerollten Schriftrolle'),
('cf92297d-dc93-9a1c-3891-0877e3175982', 'en', 'With a rolled-up scroll'),
('cb715313-1040-eed8-b967-ff5fd90a5af8', 'de', 'Mit einer glühenden Kohle vom Altar'),
('cb715313-1040-eed8-b967-ff5fd90a5af8', 'en', 'With a burning coal from the altar'),
('8044c250-d2c3-d0df-4de6-c9a3923824d0', 'de', 'Aus dem Erdbeben in der Nacht'),
('8044c250-d2c3-d0df-4de6-c9a3923824d0', 'en', 'Out of an earthquake in the night'),
('d454205a-2c46-c5ce-d0c2-9b3e4523c1af', 'de', 'Aus einer Wolke von Feuer'),
('d454205a-2c46-c5ce-d0c2-9b3e4523c1af', 'en', 'Out of a cloud of fire'),
('90bf7a21-ab78-8a8e-1118-5465bbbd9e59', 'de', 'Aus dem brennenden Dornbusch'),
('90bf7a21-ab78-8a8e-1118-5465bbbd9e59', 'en', 'Out of the burning bush'),
('e222039a-57ad-fce1-8dc4-fa3fd4fe982a', 'de', 'Aus dem Sturmwind heraus'),
('e222039a-57ad-fce1-8dc4-fa3fd4fe982a', 'en', 'Out of the whirlwind'),
('04bf6ca7-020b-75a8-cdbb-09f61defef5b', 'de', 'Er fiel nieder und ehrte Daniel und seinen Gott'),
('04bf6ca7-020b-75a8-cdbb-09f61defef5b', 'en', 'He fell down and honored Daniel and his God'),
('8f2aae40-2c8a-390a-2b87-05f87418ec6c', 'de', 'Er ließ Daniel sogleich hinrichten'),
('8f2aae40-2c8a-390a-2b87-05f87418ec6c', 'en', 'He had Daniel executed at once'),
('57dc8b9a-c57a-5a80-0c53-5d697691726e', 'de', 'Er lachte und glaubte ihm nicht'),
('57dc8b9a-c57a-5a80-0c53-5d697691726e', 'en', 'He laughed and did not believe him'),
('0794bfe0-fb48-4c13-42ac-539406862131', 'de', 'Er verbannte Daniel aus dem Land'),
('0794bfe0-fb48-4c13-42ac-539406862131', 'en', 'He banished Daniel from the land'),
('8d75d72f-c0a7-3d56-ce76-823bd3e22983', 'de', 'Bewunderung für ihren Mut'),
('8d75d72f-c0a7-3d56-ce76-823bd3e22983', 'en', 'Admiration for their courage'),
('66a53c15-0e06-04d0-34ea-140d13b39c12', 'de', 'Gleichgültigkeit'),
('66a53c15-0e06-04d0-34ea-140d13b39c12', 'en', 'Indifference'),
('c43b115f-dcd5-66c2-b505-c86ebf024d7b', 'de', 'Mitleid und Nachsicht'),
('c43b115f-dcd5-66c2-b505-c86ebf024d7b', 'en', 'Pity and leniency'),
('d8631c4d-a6c4-f411-1f0e-7fd181500001', 'de', 'Zorn und Grimm, weil sie sein Bild nicht anbeteten'),
('d8631c4d-a6c4-f411-1f0e-7fd181500001', 'en', 'Rage and fury because they would not worship his image'),
('b649fc0c-a0a5-c972-fcec-7765f7be2b65', 'de', 'Er wird über Engel gebieten'),
('b649fc0c-a0a5-c972-fcec-7765f7be2b65', 'en', 'He will command angels'),
('87c18b38-f3fc-3517-0c36-a1965ecf6584', 'de', 'Er wird niemals krank werden'),
('87c18b38-f3fc-3517-0c36-a1965ecf6584', 'en', 'He will never become sick'),
('970dbfcd-e604-061b-99a5-b6bc93c218c9', 'de', 'Er wird das Licht des Lebens haben'),
('970dbfcd-e604-061b-99a5-b6bc93c218c9', 'en', 'He will have the light of life'),
('3a2bb1e9-3ebe-6e52-aca6-4a43b24b6b51', 'de', 'Er wird Reichtum empfangen'),
('3a2bb1e9-3ebe-6e52-aca6-4a43b24b6b51', 'en', 'He will receive riches'),
('05191b1f-a476-03b8-206f-52dae0e86991', 'de', 'Dies Volk faltet die Hände, aber sein Sinn ist taub'),
('05191b1f-a476-03b8-206f-52dae0e86991', 'en', 'This people folds their hands, but their mind is deaf'),
('6b42a04d-e699-37cc-ed91-7e8ac27a335c', 'de', 'Dies Volk verbeugt sich tief, aber seine Augen sind blind'),
('6b42a04d-e699-37cc-ed91-7e8ac27a335c', 'en', 'This people bows low, but their eyes are blind'),
('5f063d24-37cc-2874-9e7e-15f00db51f78', 'de', 'Dies Volk singt mit der Zunge, aber seine Hände sind leer'),
('5f063d24-37cc-2874-9e7e-15f00db51f78', 'en', 'This people sings with the tongue, but their hands are empty'),
('4260d2b2-d6a9-eda1-1bee-9da36310274d', 'de', 'Dies Volk naht sich mit dem Munde, aber ihr Herz ist fern von mir'),
('4260d2b2-d6a9-eda1-1bee-9da36310274d', 'en', 'This people draws near with their mouth, but their heart is far from me'),
('e81cc781-6193-ec13-0ab9-6d89497ea73b', 'de', 'Ob er das Ross gefüttert habe'),
('e81cc781-6193-ec13-0ab9-6d89497ea73b', 'en', 'Whether he had fed the horse'),
('6612b2ac-8f4a-b057-122d-a5498c78b44d', 'de', 'Ob er das Ross gezähmt habe für den Pflug'),
('6612b2ac-8f4a-b057-122d-a5498c78b44d', 'en', 'Whether he had tamed the horse for the plow'),
('20e60475-613a-c22b-4f3c-091b5630b94f', 'de', 'Ob er das Ross je habe laufen sehen'),
('20e60475-613a-c22b-4f3c-091b5630b94f', 'en', 'Whether he had ever seen the horse run'),
('e60e7556-aeb2-d39c-e7ea-61ae44041237', 'de', 'Ob er dem Ross seine Stärke verliehen habe'),
('e60e7556-aeb2-d39c-e7ea-61ae44041237', 'en', 'Whether he had given the horse its strength'),
('26f0f6e7-288d-e17e-03e2-db2022b467c0', 'de', 'Sie ist zur Braut geschmückt und wartet auf ihren Herrn'),
('26f0f6e7-288d-e17e-03e2-db2022b467c0', 'en', 'She is adorned as a bride and waits for her Lord'),
('38591841-7dba-1022-8cbd-662b782c92f9', 'de', 'Sie ist zur Mutter geworden und nährt ihre Kinder'),
('38591841-7dba-1022-8cbd-662b782c92f9', 'en', 'She has become a mother and nourishes her children'),
('cbe80b27-f9bb-9595-2084-e38539dbe279', 'de', 'Sie ist zur Königin erhoben und herrscht über die Völker'),
('cbe80b27-f9bb-9595-2084-e38539dbe279', 'en', 'She has been raised to queen and rules over the nations'),
('4ec314d3-ccb0-65ba-8850-e1ea8301a52a', 'de', 'Sie ist zur Witwe geworden und muss nun Frondienst leisten'),
('4ec314d3-ccb0-65ba-8850-e1ea8301a52a', 'en', 'She has become a widow and must now do forced labor'),
('fdd6bdc4-404c-fdd5-3581-fd26de4b9adf', 'de', 'Er kniete zum Gebet im Hof nieder'),
('fdd6bdc4-404c-fdd5-3581-fd26de4b9adf', 'en', 'He knelt in prayer in the courtyard'),
('86c0b79c-831d-ab08-08e3-6411e3055779', 'de', 'Er salbte die Tote mit Öl'),
('86c0b79c-831d-ab08-08e3-6411e3055779', 'en', 'He anointed the dead with oil'),
('2224182b-1f20-0582-bcb4-a957f5f5306f', 'de', 'Er rief sogleich das Mädchen beim Namen'),
('2224182b-1f20-0582-bcb4-a957f5f5306f', 'en', 'He immediately called the girl by name'),
('c76d8fa3-1910-164c-82ca-ccec02afe8b6', 'de', 'Er schickte die weinende Menge hinaus'),
('c76d8fa3-1910-164c-82ca-ccec02afe8b6', 'en', 'He sent the weeping crowd outside'),
('feea8468-080e-35b3-5d2f-f662590798dd', 'de', 'Sie sind ohne Gaben'),
('feea8468-080e-35b3-5d2f-f662590798dd', 'en', 'They are without gifts'),
('a0119be4-059c-7e9d-52b2-d820b454ef50', 'de', 'Sie sind ein Leib in Christus'),
('a0119be4-059c-7e9d-52b2-d820b454ef50', 'en', 'They are one body in Christ'),
('a951a28a-2f3e-f490-e4ac-7a20f1eaf2c4', 'de', 'Sie haben alle dasselbe Amt'),
('a951a28a-2f3e-f490-e4ac-7a20f1eaf2c4', 'en', 'They all have the same office'),
('eb11c745-c929-9431-0cb5-5a11c586595b', 'de', 'Sie sind getrennte Einzelne'),
('eb11c745-c929-9431-0cb5-5a11c586595b', 'en', 'They are separate individuals'),
('3e1f7092-33a3-c0c8-258a-5134b7ed4cd8', 'de', 'Sieben Jahre Überfluss und sieben Jahre Hungersnot'),
('3e1f7092-33a3-c0c8-258a-5134b7ed4cd8', 'en', 'Seven years of plenty and seven years of famine'),
('91979229-ca8f-c5b3-35f7-09d9600ef9e4', 'de', 'Sieben Flüsse und sieben Wüsten'),
('91979229-ca8f-c5b3-35f7-09d9600ef9e4', 'en', 'Seven rivers and seven deserts'),
('96752917-8700-8e96-ffe8-1ce7f48d4f81', 'de', 'Sieben Siege und sieben Niederlagen'),
('96752917-8700-8e96-ffe8-1ce7f48d4f81', 'en', 'Seven victories and seven defeats'),
('212ddb0a-7f27-0f58-9d55-ee852008c697', 'de', 'Sieben Könige und sieben Feinde'),
('212ddb0a-7f27-0f58-9d55-ee852008c697', 'en', 'Seven kings and seven enemies'),
('7231b80a-0f3e-d04d-b538-5deb7ca866ca', 'de', 'Einen Berg aus glühendem Feuer'),
('7231b80a-0f3e-d04d-b538-5deb7ca866ca', 'en', 'A mountain of glowing fire'),
('03772579-033c-5437-1f4f-6806159857f0', 'de', 'Eine Schar von Engeln mit goldenen Harfen'),
('03772579-033c-5437-1f4f-6806159857f0', 'en', 'A host of angels with golden harps'),
('afa66662-fa8b-6210-2ae6-0b07da1d0e76', 'de', 'Die Seelen derer, die um des Wortes Gottes willen getötet wurden'),
('afa66662-fa8b-6210-2ae6-0b07da1d0e76', 'en', 'The souls of those slain for the word of God'),
('0f3095db-d737-6051-243d-e69f52be9c43', 'de', 'Einen Strom von lebendigem Wasser'),
('0f3095db-d737-6051-243d-e69f52be9c43', 'en', 'A stream of living water'),
('6b828ad9-38ef-7965-1516-87ddd7129835', 'de', 'Er fischte am See Genezareth'),
('6b828ad9-38ef-7965-1516-87ddd7129835', 'en', 'He fished at the Sea of Galilee'),
('4bc3361d-f35e-3e3f-3a93-2e2b5087565d', 'de', 'Er saß am Zoll als Zöllner'),
('4bc3361d-f35e-3e3f-3a93-2e2b5087565d', 'en', 'He sat at the tax booth as a tax collector'),
('a4c7b235-3dac-b861-df4a-a03e2858e9c4', 'de', 'Er lehrte in der Synagoge'),
('a4c7b235-3dac-b861-df4a-a03e2858e9c4', 'en', 'He taught in the synagogue'),
('5a2546cf-c2f8-9a3e-aea1-ed3c74bd3d97', 'de', 'Er hütete Schafe auf dem Feld'),
('5a2546cf-c2f8-9a3e-aea1-ed3c74bd3d97', 'en', 'He tended sheep in the field'),
('2732318f-5960-6cc5-40d5-c7bb295de9a3', 'de', '… wird müde'),
('2732318f-5960-6cc5-40d5-c7bb295de9a3', 'en', '… grows weary'),
('3d7a6511-3705-eb1c-c833-c3314f7295d7', 'de', '… wird weise'),
('3d7a6511-3705-eb1c-c833-c3314f7295d7', 'en', '… becomes wise'),
('ef280158-0c9c-991c-9949-ff12d59bfbf1', 'de', '… wird geehrt'),
('ef280158-0c9c-991c-9949-ff12d59bfbf1', 'en', '… is honored'),
('b086c52b-c394-c9c3-4581-815e31837faa', 'de', '… wird reich'),
('b086c52b-c394-c9c3-4581-815e31837faa', 'en', '… becomes rich'),
('1525d989-4c60-c1b9-024a-50d483b249bb', 'de', 'Er breitete ihn im Tempel vor dem HERRN aus'),
('1525d989-4c60-c1b9-024a-50d483b249bb', 'en', 'He spread it out before the LORD in the temple'),
('706ddce5-150b-c39e-26f7-2bc52f4423c3', 'de', 'Er floh aus Jerusalem'),
('706ddce5-150b-c39e-26f7-2bc52f4423c3', 'en', 'He fled from Jerusalem'),
('28b5a68a-adf6-d7e6-8a97-28d688eb50b2', 'de', 'Er verbrannte ihn vor dem Volk'),
('28b5a68a-adf6-d7e6-8a97-28d688eb50b2', 'en', 'He burned it before the people'),
('9fb21f5c-5866-9241-a322-c02400fadd10', 'de', 'Er sandte sofort Tribut nach Assyrien'),
('9fb21f5c-5866-9241-a322-c02400fadd10', 'en', 'He at once sent tribute to Assyria'),
('afb2a740-a425-3a7c-34c5-b02d174f1c89', 'de', 'Wie goldene Tropfen'),
('afb2a740-a425-3a7c-34c5-b02d174f1c89', 'en', 'Like golden drops'),
('7121fe05-1d1d-cf1a-41cd-32bd5f201238', 'de', 'Wie flache, dunkle Brote'),
('7121fe05-1d1d-cf1a-41cd-32bd5f201238', 'en', 'Like flat, dark loaves'),
('34ece9df-c66a-22a3-8bed-4389ed375d48', 'de', 'Wie rote Beeren am Strauch'),
('34ece9df-c66a-22a3-8bed-4389ed375d48', 'en', 'Like red berries on a bush'),
('ac00076c-cd09-c768-2485-2fc98451db0b', 'de', 'Wie weißer Reif, klein und körnig'),
('ac00076c-cd09-c768-2485-2fc98451db0b', 'en', 'Like white frost, small and grain-like'),
('b2ce8cd1-39fe-97d7-7176-ac0497904246', 'de', 'Er wurde mit Aussatz geschlagen'),
('b2ce8cd1-39fe-97d7-7176-ac0497904246', 'en', 'He was struck with leprosy'),
('a2b8f6c1-8dd3-bb9e-6a5c-c9955fe3b7dd', 'de', 'Er fiel im Kampf gegen die Aramäer'),
('a2b8f6c1-8dd3-bb9e-6a5c-c9955fe3b7dd', 'en', 'He fell in battle against the Arameans'),
('0f776af9-4eb5-f5d2-df51-49b6c85a953b', 'de', 'Er floh und kehrte nie zurück'),
('0f776af9-4eb5-f5d2-df51-49b6c85a953b', 'en', 'He fled and never returned'),
('abfbd27a-01bc-5876-b432-b2ba4c33bba2', 'de', 'Er wurde im Tor zertreten und sah es, aß aber nicht davon'),
('abfbd27a-01bc-5876-b432-b2ba4c33bba2', 'en', 'He was trampled in the gate and saw it but did not eat'),
('bfb97562-2434-6e39-4a19-6c48de7be839', 'de', 'In der Nacht'),
('bfb97562-2434-6e39-4a19-6c48de7be839', 'en', 'At night'),
('3b1f64f1-7e82-a084-752a-df225f226cbd', 'de', 'Am Abend nach dem Mahl'),
('3b1f64f1-7e82-a084-752a-df225f226cbd', 'en', 'In the evening after the meal'),
('b3141951-9578-6de5-1c88-6b03df642498', 'de', 'Am frühen Morgen'),
('b3141951-9578-6de5-1c88-6b03df642498', 'en', 'Early in the morning'),
('aeb3b435-8fa8-57e7-fa7c-cb6f9f51b5f8', 'de', 'Zur Mittagsstunde'),
('aeb3b435-8fa8-57e7-fa7c-cb6f9f51b5f8', 'en', 'At the noon hour'),
('cba46f84-eb69-3ec0-356b-9104651a1878', 'de', 'Um ihn mit schwierigen Rätselfragen auf die Probe zu stellen'),
('cba46f84-eb69-3ec0-356b-9104651a1878', 'en', 'To test him with hard questions'),
('03c558e8-9023-6b50-260b-35d56dd2894e', 'de', 'Um ein Bündnis gegen Ägypten zu schließen'),
('03c558e8-9023-6b50-260b-35d56dd2894e', 'en', 'To form an alliance against Egypt'),
('5dc31281-0448-c3ae-634c-24d93c385a34', 'de', 'Um Zuflucht vor ihren Feinden zu suchen'),
('5dc31281-0448-c3ae-634c-24d93c385a34', 'en', 'To seek refuge from her enemies'),
('edfe5b63-e9f6-80e0-f50c-b7ac21a59297', 'de', 'Um seine Tochter zur Frau zu erbitten'),
('edfe5b63-e9f6-80e0-f50c-b7ac21a59297', 'en', 'To request his daughter in marriage'),
('c51e7c72-f725-f2e2-57ca-2bd28607e483', 'de', 'Sie liefen den Berg hinauf'),
('c51e7c72-f725-f2e2-57ca-2bd28607e483', 'en', 'They ran up the mountain'),
('ef43eadc-d821-3cea-3bef-c3e8047370be', 'de', 'Sie sangen Loblieder'),
('ef43eadc-d821-3cea-3bef-c3e8047370be', 'en', 'They sang songs of praise'),
('39c8799f-123c-8905-faac-98a8928b16f2', 'de', 'Sie warfen ihren Schmuck weg'),
('39c8799f-123c-8905-faac-98a8928b16f2', 'en', 'They threw away their jewelry'),
('291d2d2c-18db-847d-0d26-d197d268f83d', 'de', 'Sie zitterten und blieben in der Ferne stehen'),
('291d2d2c-18db-847d-0d26-d197d268f83d', 'en', 'They trembled and stood far off'),
('da56f818-e204-8c5e-1f4b-c2cdb850b4a5', 'de', 'Er nannte sogleich Mordechais Namen'),
('da56f818-e204-8c5e-1f4b-c2cdb850b4a5', 'en', 'He named Mordecai at once'),
('12f164ec-5b45-cfde-0b03-6065187bd30d', 'de', 'Er dachte, er selbst sei gemeint, und schlug große Ehren vor'),
('12f164ec-5b45-cfde-0b03-6065187bd30d', 'en', 'He thought himself meant and proposed great honors'),
('a3752a08-da17-0bf7-e837-7989f12f4e2a', 'de', 'Er bat um Bedenkzeit bis zum Abend'),
('a3752a08-da17-0bf7-e837-7989f12f4e2a', 'en', 'He asked for time to think until evening'),
('69d2d81f-821c-3056-52a0-2f1873c9899f', 'de', 'Er riet dem König, niemanden zu ehren'),
('69d2d81f-821c-3056-52a0-2f1873c9899f', 'en', 'He advised the king to honor no one'),
('d7c3efdf-d4f9-0b9f-eb5a-5d8fbe310def', 'de', 'Auf das Dach der Stiftshütte'),
('d7c3efdf-d4f9-0b9f-eb5a-5d8fbe310def', 'en', 'On the roof of the tabernacle'),
('09912420-4642-ea0b-a325-70bfacdf5f5d', 'de', 'Auf den Altar'),
('09912420-4642-ea0b-a325-70bfacdf5f5d', 'en', 'On the altar'),
('c89ad6ca-4ca8-5b34-0503-2d273a9bdb7c', 'de', 'Auf einen Felsen'),
('c89ad6ca-4ca8-5b34-0503-2d273a9bdb7c', 'en', 'On a rock'),
('561b925d-fb2a-d331-d5f1-aecc46ac7c82', 'de', 'Auf eine Stange'),
('561b925d-fb2a-d331-d5f1-aecc46ac7c82', 'en', 'On a pole'),
('2292ba29-9f49-d72a-0dbc-8fc61420d03f', 'de', 'Sie gab ihm ein frisches Pferd zur Flucht'),
('2292ba29-9f49-d72a-0dbc-8fc61420d03f', 'en', 'She gave him a fresh horse to flee'),
('80471c0c-ef1d-ab98-1b2b-5fde1b09e781', 'de', 'Sie reichte ihm Brot und Wein'),
('80471c0c-ef1d-ab98-1b2b-5fde1b09e781', 'en', 'She handed him bread and wine'),
('c3fe4719-7ee7-2cb5-3311-3ff9205d4c24', 'de', 'Sie bot ihm einen Platz auf dem Wachturm'),
('c3fe4719-7ee7-2cb5-3311-3ff9205d4c24', 'en', 'She offered him a place on the watchtower'),
('fb7167b6-08a0-5d22-356f-6b9e898a8455', 'de', 'Sie gab ihm Milch statt des erbetenen Wassers'),
('fb7167b6-08a0-5d22-356f-6b9e898a8455', 'en', 'She gave him milk instead of the requested water'),
('7ec80f5c-faaa-8da2-7992-b5868e7b984f', 'de', 'Er sollte den Tempel verlassen für immer'),
('7ec80f5c-faaa-8da2-7992-b5868e7b984f', 'en', 'He was to leave the temple forever'),
('df00b2f9-585f-a0a9-ff1f-e560367f40d4', 'de', 'Er durfte nicht trauern, wie Israel über den Tempel nicht trauern sollte'),
('df00b2f9-585f-a0a9-ff1f-e560367f40d4', 'en', 'He was not to mourn, as Israel was not to mourn over the temple'),
('e5149e11-a23f-c5f0-7de1-a0f942d99479', 'de', 'Er sollte ein Trauerlied singen'),
('e5149e11-a23f-c5f0-7de1-a0f942d99479', 'en', 'He was to sing a song of mourning'),
('1d82dd58-5e5b-0bc7-e1f2-07d7671a9e3b', 'de', 'Er sollte sieben Tage öffentlich weinen'),
('1d82dd58-5e5b-0bc7-e1f2-07d7671a9e3b', 'en', 'He was to weep publicly for seven days'),
('8d76522e-33bb-60e7-301e-31289e8d1a86', 'de', 'Sie sollten ihn sofort töten'),
('8d76522e-33bb-60e7-301e-31289e8d1a86', 'en', 'They should kill him at once'),
('06d3537c-32dd-fa14-a32b-270f6a9d3348', 'de', 'Sie sollten ihn nach Jerusalem zurückbringen'),
('06d3537c-32dd-fa14-a32b-270f6a9d3348', 'en', 'They should bring him back to Jerusalem'),
('fe03c7e0-5321-20db-4d84-24e3412fac25', 'de', 'Sie sollten schonend mit dem jungen Absalom umgehen'),
('fe03c7e0-5321-20db-4d84-24e3412fac25', 'en', 'They should deal gently with the young man Absalom'),
('bfb67cf8-1ae0-dc47-2e6e-a699c434aef5', 'de', 'Sie sollten ihn lebendig gefangen nehmen'),
('bfb67cf8-1ae0-dc47-2e6e-a699c434aef5', 'en', 'They should take him alive as a prisoner'),
('a4353402-ca69-d63b-d862-0f809e498bbb', 'de', 'Alle Stämme lagerten östlich der Stiftshütte'),
('a4353402-ca69-d63b-d862-0f809e498bbb', 'en', 'All tribes camped east of the tabernacle'),
('2afbeca3-aa7b-8a50-b029-3185af735cd4', 'de', 'Die Stiftshütte stand am Rand des Lagers'),
('2afbeca3-aa7b-8a50-b029-3185af735cd4', 'en', 'The tabernacle stood at the camp''s edge'),
('b75196b2-e549-2a5c-58f8-5f7f21480895', 'de', 'Die Stämme lagerten in vier Gruppen um die Stiftshütte'),
('b75196b2-e549-2a5c-58f8-5f7f21480895', 'en', 'The tribes camped in four groups around the tabernacle'),
('7f9f591e-7881-884f-2b29-274f7a7b3359', 'de', 'Die Stämme lagerten ohne feste Ordnung'),
('7f9f591e-7881-884f-2b29-274f7a7b3359', 'en', 'The tribes camped without fixed order'),
('bad104f4-1c74-b1e7-310b-73935c3b8193', 'de', 'Wir gingen alle in die Irre wie Schafe, ein jeder sah auf seinen Weg'),
('bad104f4-1c74-b1e7-310b-73935c3b8193', 'en', 'We all went astray like sheep, each looking to his own way'),
('9372a9ac-a3bf-62d6-b76b-27a90a84073b', 'de', 'Wir folgten dem Hirten wie Schafe auf grüner Aue'),
('9372a9ac-a3bf-62d6-b76b-27a90a84073b', 'en', 'We followed the shepherd like sheep in green pastures'),
('76963f63-5a43-e66a-5646-b3bf0af99d44', 'de', 'Wir versammelten uns wie Schafe in den Stall'),
('76963f63-5a43-e66a-5646-b3bf0af99d44', 'en', 'We gathered like sheep into the fold'),
('723f844c-0bbb-e212-29d8-3fed8f6973ec', 'de', 'Wir wurden geweidet wie Schafe an Wasserbächen'),
('723f844c-0bbb-e212-29d8-3fed8f6973ec', 'en', 'We were fed like sheep by streams of water'),
('3428f497-8a6f-22d9-249b-9a91e9d1fc83', 'de', 'Er entkam nach Ägypten'),
('3428f497-8a6f-22d9-249b-9a91e9d1fc83', 'en', 'He escaped to Egypt'),
('fc67cf5d-324c-cc67-8aeb-d0a1f1965a91', 'de', 'Er fiel im Kampf an der Mauer'),
('fc67cf5d-324c-cc67-8aeb-d0a1f1965a91', 'en', 'He fell in battle at the wall'),
('a66155a3-027f-1627-93d3-26c40e80d30a', 'de', 'Seine Augen wurden geblendet, nachdem man seine Söhne tötete'),
('a66155a3-027f-1627-93d3-26c40e80d30a', 'en', 'His eyes were blinded after his sons were killed'),
('7c1e9d1c-b01b-5aa9-5c57-1ac4713c0fc6', 'de', 'Er wurde im Tempel verschont'),
('7c1e9d1c-b01b-5aa9-5c57-1ac4713c0fc6', 'en', 'He was spared in the temple'),
('071134b5-8799-7265-7d56-199ab1a2e126', 'de', 'Er gab sich weinend zu erkennen und sagte: Ich bin Josef'),
('071134b5-8799-7265-7d56-199ab1a2e126', 'en', 'He revealed himself weeping and said: I am Joseph'),
('f5e49647-b089-a14e-9823-e397218e746d', 'de', 'Er schickte ihnen einen Brief nach Kanaan'),
('f5e49647-b089-a14e-9823-e397218e746d', 'en', 'He sent them a letter to Canaan'),
('91def475-2ec7-1413-e6b1-39b755b1a5a1', 'de', 'Er zeigte ihnen das blutige Gewand'),
('91def475-2ec7-1413-e6b1-39b755b1a5a1', 'en', 'He showed them the bloody robe'),
('a6278c47-73ac-efa7-cca3-29c971f3f040', 'de', 'Er ließ sie vor dem Pharao niederknien'),
('a6278c47-73ac-efa7-cca3-29c971f3f040', 'en', 'He had them kneel before Pharaoh'),
('700a5622-6e66-074d-c1ab-240e46539f73', 'de', 'Sein Vater sandte ihn mit Proviant zu seinen Brüdern'),
('700a5622-6e66-074d-c1ab-240e46539f73', 'en', 'His father sent him with provisions for his brothers'),
('08330918-f005-d008-3b5b-cfcfe6016ec5', 'de', 'Er war als Bote des Königs unterwegs'),
('08330918-f005-d008-3b5b-cfcfe6016ec5', 'en', 'He came as the king''s messenger'),
('4a4bf68e-ba74-b161-bcc1-704c475d9a3d', 'de', 'Er sollte das Lager bewachen'),
('4a4bf68e-ba74-b161-bcc1-704c475d9a3d', 'en', 'He was to guard the camp'),
('a083cdb6-247a-f025-2326-629a29c455a9', 'de', 'Saul rief ihn zum Kampf'),
('a083cdb6-247a-f025-2326-629a29c455a9', 'en', 'Saul summoned him to fight'),
('d23c7973-c38e-9c12-8de1-e95903863945', 'de', 'Mit einem Felsen im stürmenden Meer'),
('d23c7973-c38e-9c12-8de1-e95903863945', 'en', 'With a rock in the raging sea'),
('43ec05f9-b422-be67-05b8-286338e9480c', 'de', 'Mit einer Lampe auf dem Leuchter'),
('43ec05f9-b422-be67-05b8-286338e9480c', 'en', 'With a lamp on the lampstand'),
('c47175e7-de40-6fbc-a6df-5d6b14b231c6', 'de', 'Mit einem Baum am Wasser gepflanzt'),
('c47175e7-de40-6fbc-a6df-5d6b14b231c6', 'en', 'With a tree planted by the water'),
('f37926bc-016d-8de0-c518-899511904992', 'de', 'Mit einer Meereswoge, vom Wind getrieben'),
('f37926bc-016d-8de0-c518-899511904992', 'en', 'With a wave of the sea, driven by the wind'),
('d30ecd13-e754-8970-a38a-e1b8f8029969', 'de', 'Er werde Regen sieben Jahre senden'),
('d30ecd13-e754-8970-a38a-e1b8f8029969', 'en', 'He will send rain for seven years'),
('2ffc3028-d47c-5619-9bd1-a7fb50e6ade8', 'de', 'Er werde die Fenster des Himmels öffnen'),
('2ffc3028-d47c-5619-9bd1-a7fb50e6ade8', 'en', 'He will open the windows of heaven'),
('3276d2ba-912d-fb6f-05fa-13782816886d', 'de', 'Er werde alle Feinde vertreiben'),
('3276d2ba-912d-fb6f-05fa-13782816886d', 'en', 'He will drive out all enemies'),
('0f46587c-1cec-3de9-182e-d839df9ba172', 'de', 'Er werde den Tempel mit Gold füllen'),
('0f46587c-1cec-3de9-182e-d839df9ba172', 'en', 'He will fill the temple with gold'),
('d5ddcefb-0f9f-e745-74a5-62d5773a6d44', 'de', 'Bewahre die Reinheit des Gesetzes'),
('d5ddcefb-0f9f-e745-74a5-62d5773a6d44', 'en', 'Keep the purity of the law'),
('29dfd777-669e-c10a-c2f0-c65f6a1069ac', 'de', 'Geh hin nach Cäsarea'),
('29dfd777-669e-c10a-c2f0-c65f6a1069ac', 'en', 'Go to Caesarea'),
('5225725f-c8ee-1482-8d6e-f91329580200', 'de', 'Fürchte dich nicht vor den Heiden'),
('5225725f-c8ee-1482-8d6e-f91329580200', 'en', 'Do not fear the Gentiles'),
('6f87cf91-9362-0f99-d401-4b7cba315f09', 'de', 'Steh auf, Petrus, schlachte und iss'),
('6f87cf91-9362-0f99-d401-4b7cba315f09', 'en', 'Rise, Peter, kill and eat'),
('92d87dbd-f4f9-2496-6c41-59226992748a', 'de', 'Fastend, ohne Schlaf und ohne Unterhaltung'),
('92d87dbd-f4f9-2496-6c41-59226992748a', 'en', 'Fasting, without sleep and without entertainment'),
('c8fc5495-1167-14a9-30f9-0f05f4332192', 'de', 'Beim Opfer an seine Götter'),
('c8fc5495-1167-14a9-30f9-0f05f4332192', 'en', 'Sacrificing to his gods'),
('0461eee7-0010-c45e-fd7c-6f4aa6dc66fd', 'de', 'In ruhigem, festem Schlaf'),
('0461eee7-0010-c45e-fd7c-6f4aa6dc66fd', 'en', 'In calm and sound sleep'),
('afc26244-a059-840a-6ad9-1db059e6bc91', 'de', 'Feiernd mit einem Gelage'),
('afc26244-a059-840a-6ad9-1db059e6bc91', 'en', 'Celebrating with a banquet'),
('9d328454-569d-13af-31a5-e0f3bf3d51e9', 'de', 'Sein treuer Waffenträger'),
('9d328454-569d-13af-31a5-e0f3bf3d51e9', 'en', 'His faithful armor-bearer'),
('2bd5c731-9a05-16bd-b839-82f4e0ab1493', 'de', 'Seine einzige Tochter mit Pauken und Reigen'),
('2bd5c731-9a05-16bd-b839-82f4e0ab1493', 'en', 'His only daughter with timbrels and dances'),
('463a6b32-28e3-4805-1623-ee415e9c3fe9', 'de', 'Ein Knecht aus seinem Haus'),
('463a6b32-28e3-4805-1623-ee415e9c3fe9', 'en', 'A servant from his house'),
('c2688221-03c9-b768-711b-11a41405df2f', 'de', 'Sein ältester Sohn mit dem Heer'),
('c2688221-03c9-b768-711b-11a41405df2f', 'en', 'His eldest son with the army'),
('a458ff4b-874a-16b5-49cc-683bd87f884d', 'de', 'Zwei Körbe mit goldenen Feigen'),
('a458ff4b-874a-16b5-49cc-683bd87f884d', 'en', 'Two baskets of golden figs'),
('efa4f0f1-5526-ffc6-96a1-af024e0fd2e4', 'de', 'Einen Korb voll Feigen und einen voll Trauben'),
('efa4f0f1-5526-ffc6-96a1-af024e0fd2e4', 'en', 'A basket of figs and a basket of grapes'),
('82ed55c3-494a-df74-808f-c6948b3baf44', 'de', 'Zwei leere Körbe ohne Frucht'),
('82ed55c3-494a-df74-808f-c6948b3baf44', 'en', 'Two empty baskets without fruit'),
('c89bdb73-929c-eebf-490c-446714d86d7d', 'de', 'Einen Korb mit sehr guten und einen mit sehr schlechten Feigen'),
('c89bdb73-929c-eebf-490c-446714d86d7d', 'en', 'A basket of very good and a basket of very bad figs'),
('7da9aecc-1ce7-fa6c-9d0a-dbdc4f45153b', 'de', 'Er verkaufte seine Herde'),
('7da9aecc-1ce7-fa6c-9d0a-dbdc4f45153b', 'en', 'He sold his flock'),
