('5dad209c-bba2-0b15-bfda-08758c2ffbd7', 'de', 'Er gab sein eigenes Hochzeitsgewand her'),
('5dad209c-bba2-0b15-bfda-08758c2ffbd7', 'en', 'He gave up his own wedding robe'),
