('55ac23ff-7995-8929-6cec-4a1ff92cbce5', 'en', 'In the name of Jesus Christ of Nazareth, rise up and walk'),
('aac5b687-daa6-d96b-b666-ed78cf9affe3', 'de', 'Dein Glaube hat dich gesund gemacht'),
('aac5b687-daa6-d96b-b666-ed78cf9affe3', 'en', 'Your faith has made you well'),
('50a95f5a-9798-db47-acff-ac4df7658eb0', 'de', 'Nimm dein Bett und geh nach Hause'),
('50a95f5a-9798-db47-acff-ac4df7658eb0', 'en', 'Take up your bed and go home'),
('d54f5a55-a0bc-61fb-c0a8-aa1a589af2f0', 'de', 'Salomo solle ihn in Hebron errichten'),
('d54f5a55-a0bc-61fb-c0a8-aa1a589af2f0', 'en', 'Solomon should build it in Hebron'),
('df33cc1b-45f8-ad78-acbd-adb13f175f15', 'de', 'Der Tempel solle niemals gebaut werden'),
('df33cc1b-45f8-ad78-acbd-adb13f175f15', 'en', 'The temple should never be built'),
('1d9b756d-95ac-9584-a85d-af6e0b829510', 'de', 'Er solle sofort mit dem Bau beginnen'),
('1d9b756d-95ac-9584-a85d-af6e0b829510', 'en', 'He should begin building at once'),
('04c4cf15-0946-5d11-5264-cca80d093539', 'de', 'Nicht er, sondern sein Sohn werde dem Herrn ein Haus bauen'),
('04c4cf15-0946-5d11-5264-cca80d093539', 'en', 'Not he, but his son would build a house for the Lord'),
('3bccdc20-fa1d-b93a-e297-014d60b3a133', 'de', 'Mit Blumen von den Feldern'),
('3bccdc20-fa1d-b93a-e297-014d60b3a133', 'en', 'With flowers from the fields'),
('df2a20fe-4266-7e9a-85fb-e8ac49d892b5', 'de', 'Mit ihren Kleidern und Zweigen von den Bäumen'),
('df2a20fe-4266-7e9a-85fb-e8ac49d892b5', 'en', 'With their cloaks and branches from the trees'),
('8c4875e3-8b0e-7a97-8369-2441b2aeeeb9', 'de', 'Mit Tüchern aus feinem Leinen'),
('8c4875e3-8b0e-7a97-8369-2441b2aeeeb9', 'en', 'With cloths of fine linen'),
('b0f03828-b59e-e881-0182-68d990849187', 'de', 'Mit Teppichen aus dem Tempel'),
('b0f03828-b59e-e881-0182-68d990849187', 'en', 'With carpets from the temple'),
('a80b1a0b-ab62-973a-0b9d-dc53da7f48a9', 'de', 'Der Ältere werde dem Jüngeren dienen'),
('a80b1a0b-ab62-973a-0b9d-dc53da7f48a9', 'en', 'The older would serve the younger'),
('fe75855d-3e67-c021-3ad9-57bf24528110', 'de', 'Beide würden große Könige werden'),
('fe75855d-3e67-c021-3ad9-57bf24528110', 'en', 'Both would become great kings'),
('95e4e926-b889-214e-0016-b7150da140ee', 'de', 'Der Jüngere werde früh sterben'),
('95e4e926-b889-214e-0016-b7150da140ee', 'en', 'The younger would die young'),
('b54f261e-7085-0b2a-0b3a-a841f80bd3c4', 'de', 'Sie würden ihr Land verlassen'),
('b54f261e-7085-0b2a-0b3a-a841f80bd3c4', 'en', 'They would leave their land'),
('4d65c4a1-16d9-4c28-e007-4639d3c1c781', 'de', 'Sie sammelten Schätze für den Tempel'),
('4d65c4a1-16d9-4c28-e007-4639d3c1c781', 'en', 'They gathered treasures for the temple'),
('68b42a38-a06c-ad3e-04ca-4fe61b81bd56', 'de', 'Sie zogen sich in die Wüste zurück'),
('68b42a38-a06c-ad3e-04ca-4fe61b81bd56', 'en', 'They withdrew into the wilderness'),
('06d2a276-e5a9-404d-34dc-abcb01aa25ad', 'de', 'Sie hatten alle Dinge gemeinsam und teilten ihren Besitz'),
('06d2a276-e5a9-404d-34dc-abcb01aa25ad', 'en', 'They had all things in common and shared their possessions'),
('ef139cd7-051f-5b67-66af-ce99f6b794a6', 'de', 'Sie lebten getrennt nach Stämmen'),
('ef139cd7-051f-5b67-66af-ce99f6b794a6', 'en', 'They lived separated by tribes'),
('57c28e4e-56e1-0c96-72b9-60a24f829e1f', 'de', 'Um eine Frau aus seinem Haus'),
('57c28e4e-56e1-0c96-72b9-60a24f829e1f', 'en', 'A wife from his household'),
('a3bc1d42-87db-171b-0834-6594c8987c2e', 'de', 'Um ein Stück Land'),
('a3bc1d42-87db-171b-0834-6594c8987c2e', 'en', 'A piece of land'),
('cda80d50-3395-1c8b-3574-d4b20b29ea34', 'de', 'Um militärische Hilfe'),
('cda80d50-3395-1c8b-3574-d4b20b29ea34', 'en', 'Military assistance'),
('537b0cad-10a9-89a3-6493-32a946fa9295', 'de', 'Um Verpflegung für seine Männer zur Festzeit'),
('537b0cad-10a9-89a3-6493-32a946fa9295', 'en', 'Provisions for his men at festival time'),
('5e7e6f03-de3f-fefb-c1f1-9914acd34789', 'de', 'Er war Priester in Bethel'),
('5e7e6f03-de3f-fefb-c1f1-9914acd34789', 'en', 'He was a priest in Bethel'),
('3c4ee4cd-0eb3-64d6-1780-9336c9b41c50', 'de', 'Er war Soldat in Samaria'),
('3c4ee4cd-0eb3-64d6-1780-9336c9b41c50', 'en', 'He was a soldier in Samaria'),
('74dec71e-2a28-7f86-be2a-a8b92e1d911e', 'de', 'Er war Schreiber am Königshof'),
('74dec71e-2a28-7f86-be2a-a8b92e1d911e', 'en', 'He was a scribe at the royal court'),
('659f2a45-8a35-cee8-9ba6-caf2e9b43828', 'de', 'Er war Hirte und Maulbeerfeigenzüchter'),
('659f2a45-8a35-cee8-9ba6-caf2e9b43828', 'en', 'He was a herdsman and tender of sycamore figs'),
('5ff4b699-43cd-919e-58b5-dd4b3cd62006', 'de', 'Purpurgewand, goldene Kette und Rang als Dritter im Reich'),
('5ff4b699-43cd-919e-58b5-dd4b3cd62006', 'en', 'A purple robe, a gold chain, and rank as third in the kingdom'),
('d42ad6ac-715c-cbae-a546-e0de8d583625', 'de', 'Die Hälfte aller Schätze'),
('d42ad6ac-715c-cbae-a546-e0de8d583625', 'en', 'Half of all the treasures'),
('d13ed452-4cb3-ee74-0515-44160bde2499', 'de', 'Die Hand seiner Tochter'),
('d13ed452-4cb3-ee74-0515-44160bde2499', 'en', 'The hand of his daughter'),
('11e70389-869d-2319-d320-8d5a943afabc', 'de', 'Die Freiheit aller Gefangenen'),
('11e70389-869d-2319-d320-8d5a943afabc', 'en', 'Freedom for all the captives'),
('4904de0d-b63c-5e79-138c-a8a4c94b7f05', 'de', 'Er deckte das Mordkomplott zweier Türhüter auf'),
('4904de0d-b63c-5e79-138c-a8a4c94b7f05', 'en', 'He uncovered the assassination plot of two doorkeepers'),
('6433ccd4-e6f3-7c36-2f6f-3d1e678b3177', 'de', 'Er warnte den König vor vergiftetem Wein'),
('6433ccd4-e6f3-7c36-2f6f-3d1e678b3177', 'en', 'He warned the king of poisoned wine'),
('a4cee00d-ae9a-7919-085e-f41986d3834d', 'de', 'Er führte das Heer gegen die Aufrührer'),
('a4cee00d-ae9a-7919-085e-f41986d3834d', 'en', 'He led the army against the rebels'),
('2f35be89-77b6-af43-ff19-43ba323ca2ff', 'de', 'Er bekämpfte allein einen feindlichen Attentäter'),
('2f35be89-77b6-af43-ff19-43ba323ca2ff', 'en', 'He fought off an enemy assassin alone'),
('041ff018-e267-a0b4-6973-31ebdb48a384', 'de', 'Er ließ das Boot ans Land treiben'),
('041ff018-e267-a0b4-6973-31ebdb48a384', 'en', 'He let the boat drift to land'),
('96b614ca-4a12-7f48-970c-9433a2aff2a8', 'de', 'Er ruderte selbst ans Ufer'),
('96b614ca-4a12-7f48-970c-9433a2aff2a8', 'en', 'He rowed to shore himself'),
('b0842429-98c9-15b0-f1d1-1670d0aef2ae', 'de', 'Er bedrohte den Wind und das Meer'),
('b0842429-98c9-15b0-f1d1-1670d0aef2ae', 'en', 'He rebuked the wind and the sea'),
('3e6efa7f-88eb-3236-869d-9f51dd53d00b', 'de', 'Er warf einen Anker in die Tiefe'),
('3e6efa7f-88eb-3236-869d-9f51dd53d00b', 'en', 'He cast an anchor into the deep'),
('8e3842b8-5379-cd72-6cc0-617c6af20e7c', 'de', '… findet die Weisheit'),
('8e3842b8-5379-cd72-6cc0-617c6af20e7c', 'en', '… finds wisdom'),
('b8f2c023-938c-a6e0-5931-52f17252e84d', 'de', '… mehrt seinen Reichtum'),
('b8f2c023-938c-a6e0-5931-52f17252e84d', 'en', '… increases his riches'),
('ca1dcfda-e997-5c25-f52d-9b0b554edb32', 'de', '… bewahrt sein Leben'),
('ca1dcfda-e997-5c25-f52d-9b0b554edb32', 'en', '… preserves his life'),
('dc883a62-2bf7-0def-cec2-ced77f6c2f91', 'de', '… verliert seine Ehre'),
('dc883a62-2bf7-0def-cec2-ced77f6c2f91', 'en', '… loses his honor'),
('0d93036b-767f-9834-2e7b-1d451e11060b', 'de', 'Er ließ Nabot sofort verhaften'),
('0d93036b-767f-9834-2e7b-1d451e11060b', 'en', 'He had Naboth arrested at once'),
('60cb9edb-98bb-f299-f6ec-2676223f0fc1', 'de', 'Er zog mit dem Heer gegen ihn'),
('60cb9edb-98bb-f299-f6ec-2676223f0fc1', 'en', 'He marched against him with the army'),
('2cb75bcd-1efd-f461-6200-75c13cc18914', 'de', 'Er legte sich missmutig aufs Bett und wollte nicht essen'),
('2cb75bcd-1efd-f461-6200-75c13cc18914', 'en', 'He lay down sullen on his bed and would not eat'),
('52612773-b300-0272-6271-c0fffa147f20', 'de', 'Er bot ihm den doppelten Preis'),
('52612773-b300-0272-6271-c0fffa147f20', 'en', 'He offered him double the price'),
('a89b1588-1eb7-e9b7-657e-057f7747e20b', 'de', 'Wer darf in den Tempel eintreten?'),
('a89b1588-1eb7-e9b7-657e-057f7747e20b', 'en', 'Who may enter the temple?'),
('dc3c6e10-cafb-3e0f-6e0c-439800ec45af', 'de', 'Wann kommt das Reich Gottes?'),
('dc3c6e10-cafb-3e0f-6e0c-439800ec45af', 'en', 'When will the kingdom of God come?'),
('73475d04-1053-e785-c8b4-e76e59db47b6', 'de', 'Wer ist denn mein Nächster?'),
('73475d04-1053-e785-c8b4-e76e59db47b6', 'en', 'And who is my neighbor?'),
('6b0ac490-69d5-1cef-faee-a7a8068c5392', 'de', 'Soll man dem Kaiser Steuern zahlen?'),
('6b0ac490-69d5-1cef-faee-a7a8068c5392', 'en', 'Should one pay taxes to Caesar?'),
('3f14b4fd-09da-4e41-a474-49cef745fe90', 'de', 'Er nahm die Einladung an und schloss Frieden'),
('3f14b4fd-09da-4e41-a474-49cef745fe90', 'en', 'He accepted the invitation and made peace'),
('fb303b3e-cd79-9fbb-d553-c2817178f435', 'de', 'Er sandte Joab an seiner Stelle hin'),
('fb303b3e-cd79-9fbb-d553-c2817178f435', 'en', 'He sent Joab in his place'),
('ddc3c871-357b-c0b1-277b-12f3dadb996d', 'de', 'Er sagte, er tue ein großes Werk und könne nicht hinabkommen'),
('ddc3c871-357b-c0b1-277b-12f3dadb996d', 'en', 'He said he was doing a great work and could not come down'),
('3c6bb13f-ee38-b2c4-e87b-5e4632a1f8a9', 'de', 'Er ging bewaffnet hin, um sie zu stellen'),
('3c6bb13f-ee38-b2c4-e87b-5e4632a1f8a9', 'en', 'He went armed to confront them'),
('9cef7e2d-4063-f348-a48c-a19442b8a614', 'de', 'Ich bin der wahre Weinstock'),
('9cef7e2d-4063-f348-a48c-a19442b8a614', 'en', 'I am the true vine'),
('9eab23c5-1acc-b7dd-fa7c-528e47e3a414', 'de', 'Ich bin das Brot des Lebens'),
('9eab23c5-1acc-b7dd-fa7c-528e47e3a414', 'en', 'I am the bread of life'),
('2aa8d391-26df-7e0e-6237-976cfc23ae36', 'de', 'Ich bin das Licht der Welt'),
('2aa8d391-26df-7e0e-6237-976cfc23ae36', 'en', 'I am the light of the world'),
('4fffed31-c4ce-fcbb-3482-fa1c4d595f9e', 'de', 'Ich bin die Tür zu den Schafen'),
('4fffed31-c4ce-fcbb-3482-fa1c4d595f9e', 'en', 'I am the door of the sheep'),
('fc49d3b5-9695-4f44-ae70-b44e987e8ba7', 'de', 'Ein Heiligtum für viele Götter errichten'),
('fc49d3b5-9695-4f44-ae70-b44e987e8ba7', 'en', 'To erect a sanctuary for many gods'),
('487683f7-5fe1-a8de-319e-781368323b2e', 'de', 'Sich vor einer neuen Flut schützen'),
('487683f7-5fe1-a8de-319e-781368323b2e', 'en', 'To protect themselves from another flood'),
('832b7d08-45c5-0b3c-bb4a-12e5baeedd8d', 'de', 'Sich einen Namen machen und nicht zerstreut werden'),
('832b7d08-45c5-0b3c-bb4a-12e5baeedd8d', 'en', 'To make a name for themselves and not be scattered'),
('6c950153-9af3-545a-17e9-d00f1e61cadf', 'de', 'Den Himmel mit Pfeilen beschießen'),
('6c950153-9af3-545a-17e9-d00f1e61cadf', 'en', 'To shoot arrows at the heavens'),
('15480e02-3faf-0b7d-b578-1202773dd417', 'de', 'Sie singt des Nachts und tröstet sich mit Liedern'),
('15480e02-3faf-0b7d-b578-1202773dd417', 'en', 'She sings in the night and comforts herself with songs'),
('e3190c0f-0489-872c-bfd2-f18575e8a885', 'de', 'Sie wacht des Nachts und hält Wache am Tor'),
('e3190c0f-0489-872c-bfd2-f18575e8a885', 'en', 'She keeps watch in the night and guards the gate'),
('eee9b740-f848-c38b-3724-19642207b10f', 'de', 'Sie schläft des Nachts in Frieden hinter den Mauern'),
('eee9b740-f848-c38b-3724-19642207b10f', 'en', 'She sleeps in peace at night behind the walls'),
('c436a5d1-09bb-be31-1081-2e5077e46b97', 'de', 'Sie weint des Nachts, dass ihr die Tränen über die Wangen laufen'),
('c436a5d1-09bb-be31-1081-2e5077e46b97', 'en', 'She weeps bitterly in the night, tears on her cheeks'),
('08fc91f9-7ed6-e948-62ea-dde3986a9bf3', 'de', 'Zwölf, an der Zahl der Stämme'),
('08fc91f9-7ed6-e948-62ea-dde3986a9bf3', 'en', 'Twelve, the number of the tribes'),
('bde88462-482f-2c99-0f0c-da92bf97b6fd', 'de', 'Zehn, fünf kluge und fünf törichte'),
('bde88462-482f-2c99-0f0c-da92bf97b6fd', 'en', 'Ten, five wise and five foolish'),
('e4f5a651-0630-5b99-8a36-ba75b5349824', 'de', 'Drei, die am Tor wachten'),
('e4f5a651-0630-5b99-8a36-ba75b5349824', 'en', 'Three, who watched at the gate'),
('180bd7cb-75a7-c1f1-c907-0e1249a7d017', 'de', 'Sieben, mit brennenden Fackeln'),
('180bd7cb-75a7-c1f1-c907-0e1249a7d017', 'en', 'Seven, with burning torches'),
('43be20fd-6313-51ed-89ac-5c39c62ab9c6', 'de', 'Die bronzenen Räucherpfannen der Rebellen'),
('43be20fd-6313-51ed-89ac-5c39c62ab9c6', 'en', 'The bronze censers of the rebels'),
('b1900f71-a746-1a82-3f28-b8cc16dd6390', 'de', 'Die Steine vom Felsen Meriba'),
('b1900f71-a746-1a82-3f28-b8cc16dd6390', 'en', 'The stones from the rock of Meribah'),
('5b813d3d-04fb-8c88-1413-7bf5136dfccf', 'de', 'Die Quasten der Kleider'),
('5b813d3d-04fb-8c88-1413-7bf5136dfccf', 'en', 'The tassels of the garments'),
('c2fe10e4-0fde-4f34-d40a-82e4c56f7f48', 'de', 'Das Silber der Volkszählung'),
('c2fe10e4-0fde-4f34-d40a-82e4c56f7f48', 'en', 'The silver from the census'),
('9d82ceb4-5d67-86ce-8cea-464b2eab463b', 'de', 'Er bestrich ihn mit Öl und Asche'),
('9d82ceb4-5d67-86ce-8cea-464b2eab463b', 'en', 'He anointed him with oil and ashes'),
('e3504b65-d9a8-cd5f-2ba4-8f885445bdd8', 'de', 'Er bedrohte den unreinen Geist, der ausfuhr'),
('e3504b65-d9a8-cd5f-2ba4-8f885445bdd8', 'en', 'He rebuked the unclean spirit, which came out'),
('15041ba1-82da-fcb4-038a-92357d0156ed', 'de', 'Er sandte den Knaben zum Teich Siloah'),
('15041ba1-82da-fcb4-038a-92357d0156ed', 'en', 'He sent the boy to the pool of Siloam'),
('96fb9d0e-a727-ffa4-6eeb-20c9235c844f', 'de', 'Er ließ ihn drei Tage fasten'),
('96fb9d0e-a727-ffa4-6eeb-20c9235c844f', 'en', 'He had him fast for three days'),
('0924287a-9220-8569-8d14-93f15aedf39f', 'de', 'Auf den Tempelvorhof'),
('0924287a-9220-8569-8d14-93f15aedf39f', 'en', 'To the temple court'),
('3d3dcc85-9e74-bfa4-54c6-ee722986d95e', 'de', 'Auf den Berg Tabor'),
('3d3dcc85-9e74-bfa4-54c6-ee722986d95e', 'en', 'Onto Mount Tabor'),
('e3b9eb82-11d4-079e-089f-48ef6d701136', 'de', 'In die Wüste'),
('e3b9eb82-11d4-079e-089f-48ef6d701136', 'en', 'Into the wilderness'),
('0a4362e1-df69-e92d-ab29-e46765981fe4', 'de', 'An das Ufer des Sees'),
('0a4362e1-df69-e92d-ab29-e46765981fe4', 'en', 'To the shore of the sea'),
('8ef997f3-7a19-01e4-5350-fc3a5ff6764d', 'de', 'Die Garben seiner Brüder verneigten sich vor seiner Garbe'),
('8ef997f3-7a19-01e4-5350-fc3a5ff6764d', 'en', 'His brothers'' sheaves bowed down to his sheaf'),
('c83d486e-8840-f629-f761-4aee23154d4e', 'de', 'Die Garben verwandelten sich in Sterne'),
('c83d486e-8840-f629-f761-4aee23154d4e', 'en', 'The sheaves turned into stars'),
('f39418ee-ccb5-bb5c-5e50-dd666fea2578', 'de', 'Die Garben verbrannten in der Sonne'),
('f39418ee-ccb5-bb5c-5e50-dd666fea2578', 'en', 'The sheaves burned in the sun'),
('ad7bf905-b50f-bc37-68be-d780e9cd1894', 'de', 'Die Garben wurden vom Wind verweht'),
('ad7bf905-b50f-bc37-68be-d780e9cd1894', 'en', 'The sheaves were scattered by the wind'),
('8f6ddc80-9da4-8046-7e74-9c59049d058a', 'de', 'Sieben Jahre lang'),
('8f6ddc80-9da4-8046-7e74-9c59049d058a', 'en', 'For seven years'),
('b84a8c86-7254-590c-f6a3-f2d9d317bf21', 'de', 'Zwei volle Jahre lang'),
('b84a8c86-7254-590c-f6a3-f2d9d317bf21', 'en', 'For two full years'),
('b46a5595-fa99-ba4b-c215-79057cf4b43e', 'de', 'Bis zu Davids Tod'),
('b46a5595-fa99-ba4b-c215-79057cf4b43e', 'en', 'Until David''s death'),
('e52d0fa2-15be-b656-e95b-22777d0cfab3', 'de', 'Sechs Monate lang'),
('e52d0fa2-15be-b656-e95b-22777d0cfab3', 'en', 'For six months'),
('f421dd15-0cfd-aaa0-24b6-f13a648bdad5', 'de', 'Tamar, die Schwiegertochter'),
('f421dd15-0cfd-aaa0-24b6-f13a648bdad5', 'en', 'Tamar, the daughter-in-law'),
('8aa493f0-62ba-6292-2913-b63f654c9ff7', 'de', 'Rahab aus Jericho'),
('8aa493f0-62ba-6292-2913-b63f654c9ff7', 'en', 'Rahab of Jericho'),
('bb33508a-40da-7f48-3cd1-238d5baae65d', 'de', 'Gomer, die Tochter Diblaims'),
('bb33508a-40da-7f48-3cd1-238d5baae65d', 'en', 'Gomer, the daughter of Diblaim'),
('bf4e478c-0ca8-608d-1e19-a7be82ef6b98', 'de', 'Delila aus dem Tal Sorek'),
('bf4e478c-0ca8-608d-1e19-a7be82ef6b98', 'en', 'Delilah of the valley of Sorek'),
('b38080ca-c52f-3ec8-bd9b-f64a90a4afa5', 'de', 'Das ganze Heer Israels aufzubieten'),
('b38080ca-c52f-3ec8-bd9b-f64a90a4afa5', 'en', 'To muster all the army of Israel'),
('87cc244f-267b-0858-4d55-6b6706a55392', 'de', 'Die Propheten Baals und Ascheras zum Karmel zu versammeln'),
('87cc244f-267b-0858-4d55-6b6706a55392', 'en', 'To gather the prophets of Baal and Asherah at Carmel'),
('7b7f4cee-5cd1-8a90-5185-7f77357f122a', 'de', 'Isebel vor das Volk zu bringen'),
('7b7f4cee-5cd1-8a90-5185-7f77357f122a', 'en', 'To bring Jezebel before the people'),
('2f8f032f-58df-8cba-838a-0b7977f7a072', 'de', 'Den Tempel in Samaria niederzureißen'),
('2f8f032f-58df-8cba-838a-0b7977f7a072', 'en', 'To tear down the temple in Samaria'),
('47ad4ec2-e85a-e0e0-08c8-e25d464e813c', 'de', 'Wegen Sauls Blutschuld an den Gibeonitern'),
('47ad4ec2-e85a-e0e0-08c8-e25d464e813c', 'en', 'Because of Saul''s bloodguilt against the Gibeonites'),
('eb9dc13a-1be0-1947-38a7-7a2206f5b75d', 'de', 'Wegen Davids Sünde mit Batseba'),
('eb9dc13a-1be0-1947-38a7-7a2206f5b75d', 'en', 'Because of David''s sin with Bathsheba'),
('d433330b-dfd1-1d6b-ad9f-86446a8ac410', 'de', 'Wegen des Aufstands Absaloms'),
('d433330b-dfd1-1d6b-ad9f-86446a8ac410', 'en', 'Because of Absalom''s revolt'),
('42dd1df4-2d35-f4e8-f7e5-b385c3012f84', 'de', 'Wegen der Volkszählung Davids'),
('42dd1df4-2d35-f4e8-f7e5-b385c3012f84', 'en', 'Because of David''s census'),
('c6b8660a-1332-3e01-9e0c-1dd50ce72b01', 'de', 'Die Verehrung des wahren Gottes'),
('c6b8660a-1332-3e01-9e0c-1dd50ce72b01', 'en', 'The worship of the true God'),
('c3026100-07b9-28af-8a7b-a2818221ad77', 'de', 'Übermäßiges Fasten und Beten'),
('c3026100-07b9-28af-8a7b-a2818221ad77', 'en', 'Excessive fasting and prayer'),
('80c07861-5118-8f07-0024-e0fb2ab0023b', 'de', 'Blutvergießen, Götzendienst und Unterdrückung der Armen'),
('80c07861-5118-8f07-0024-e0fb2ab0023b', 'en', 'Bloodshed, idolatry and oppression of the poor'),
('c2d42d94-95a7-4808-692f-14a8979323d9', 'de', 'Den Bau eines zu großen Tempels'),
('c2d42d94-95a7-4808-692f-14a8979323d9', 'en', 'The building of too great a temple'),
('79d084be-74f2-7806-6886-ae77f256cd32', 'de', 'An ihrer Stimme erkannte er sie sofort'),
('79d084be-74f2-7806-6886-ae77f256cd32', 'en', 'He recognized her at once by her voice'),
('fd813d23-04d1-de8d-4c27-82dbac325544', 'de', 'Ein Diener verriet ihm ihren Namen'),
('fd813d23-04d1-de8d-4c27-82dbac325544', 'en', 'A servant told him her name'),
('0b40cc17-4937-b6bb-dd39-753492ad95d5', 'de', 'An ihrem königlichen Gewand'),
('0b40cc17-4937-b6bb-dd39-753492ad95d5', 'en', 'By her royal garment'),
('21347988-9cb3-f622-5322-fb78aeda777e', 'de', 'Der HERR hatte ihm ihr Kommen offenbart, obwohl seine Augen erblindet waren'),
('21347988-9cb3-f622-5322-fb78aeda777e', 'en', 'The LORD had revealed her coming, though his eyes were dim with age'),
('1be164b9-29a0-9665-dd95-662ca4227337', 'de', 'Es leuchtete wie das Angesicht eines Engels'),
('1be164b9-29a0-9665-dd95-662ca4227337', 'en', 'It shone like the face of an angel'),
('29cc6c4b-7522-fd92-4b32-6f0e1472add3', 'de', 'Es war von Tränen bedeckt'),
('29cc6c4b-7522-fd92-4b32-6f0e1472add3', 'en', 'It was covered with tears'),
('442510eb-726d-cd74-8337-2ac3c965a33a', 'de', 'Es war von einem Tuch verhüllt'),
('442510eb-726d-cd74-8337-2ac3c965a33a', 'en', 'It was covered by a cloth'),
('b1dc8c87-4503-1d86-da82-720ef8bac6d7', 'de', 'Es wurde aschfahl vor Furcht'),
('b1dc8c87-4503-1d86-da82-720ef8bac6d7', 'en', 'It turned ashen with fear'),
('d4d318f1-7eea-e5cd-9a7c-04c9d8fc5d9e', 'de', 'Bis ihr grau werdet, will ich von euch schweigen'),
('d4d318f1-7eea-e5cd-9a7c-04c9d8fc5d9e', 'en', 'Even to your old age I will be silent toward you'),
('767306f1-5e48-a047-9303-821d589a1966', 'de', 'Bis ihr grau werdet, will ich euch tragen und erretten'),
('767306f1-5e48-a047-9303-821d589a1966', 'en', 'Even to your old age I will carry you and save you'),
('faae4e3c-517a-c71d-ce97-3817f266a6f6', 'de', 'Bis ihr grau werdet, sollt ihr euch selbst tragen'),
('faae4e3c-517a-c71d-ce97-3817f266a6f6', 'en', 'Even to your old age you shall carry yourselves'),
('c10b2a62-ed85-64ea-1fb5-c52015d401d4', 'de', 'Bis ihr grau werdet, will ich euch prüfen und strafen'),
('c10b2a62-ed85-64ea-1fb5-c52015d401d4', 'en', 'Even to your old age I will test and punish you'),
('5860d220-d30c-febb-b5ff-72d98418a1a4', 'de', 'Sie blieb für immer gelähmt'),
('5860d220-d30c-febb-b5ff-72d98418a1a4', 'en', 'It remained paralyzed forever'),
('4c0dbb40-dc10-62b8-1c7a-0c5ee1e41875', 'de', 'Sie wurde mit Aussatz bedeckt'),
('4c0dbb40-dc10-62b8-1c7a-0c5ee1e41875', 'en', 'It was covered with leprosy'),
('71d2b0ff-e371-77d7-2a39-7d30646b3225', 'de', 'Sie wurde wieder gesund wie zuvor'),
('71d2b0ff-e371-77d7-2a39-7d30646b3225', 'en', 'It was restored as it was before'),
('6b721158-96d4-1741-a313-85ab42022e3b', 'de', 'Sie verwandelte sich in Stein'),
('6b721158-96d4-1741-a313-85ab42022e3b', 'en', 'It turned to stone'),
('ca6b0bb6-c678-ae7f-804a-3edf48b77ad6', 'de', 'Dreißig Tage lang'),
('ca6b0bb6-c678-ae7f-804a-3edf48b77ad6', 'en', 'For thirty days'),
('af7ab98f-0501-f1fa-4f5f-c6ece3a4afa2', 'de', 'Vierzig Tage lang'),
('af7ab98f-0501-f1fa-4f5f-c6ece3a4afa2', 'en', 'For forty days'),
('03fd016a-3eb9-28c6-f338-0980b8f830ac', 'de', 'Drei Tage lang'),
('03fd016a-3eb9-28c6-f338-0980b8f830ac', 'en', 'For three days'),
('d664ce06-20bf-f247-f54a-d4dfeb19293e', 'de', 'Sieben Tage lang'),
('d664ce06-20bf-f247-f54a-d4dfeb19293e', 'en', 'For seven days'),
('0121b99e-b626-6bdf-310b-f22ff4d768ba', 'de', 'Er wurde von der Menge fortgejagt'),
('0121b99e-b626-6bdf-310b-f22ff4d768ba', 'en', 'He was driven away by the crowd'),
('e530246b-c29a-2546-dc21-5113f60d259d', 'de', 'Er floh hinaus in die Wüste'),
('e530246b-c29a-2546-dc21-5113f60d259d', 'en', 'He fled out into the wilderness'),
('5e05a744-86a7-56f1-fc08-f0bc916ceddf', 'de', 'Er saß bekleidet und vernünftig zu Jesu Füßen'),
('5e05a744-86a7-56f1-fc08-f0bc916ceddf', 'en', 'He sat clothed and in his right mind at Jesus'' feet'),
('4aa13064-f1f9-40db-97f6-f35d5cd0ad23', 'de', 'Er stürzte ebenfalls in den See'),
('4aa13064-f1f9-40db-97f6-f35d5cd0ad23', 'en', 'He too plunged into the lake'),
('d9aa8c53-f009-eda4-aec3-fd98835cb4ad', 'de', 'Ob Frauen lehren dürfen'),
('d9aa8c53-f009-eda4-aec3-fd98835cb4ad', 'en', 'Whether women may teach'),
('fb3a616c-4428-06b6-398c-e09c5c0d1cc7', 'de', 'Wer der Nachfolger des Petrus wird'),
('fb3a616c-4428-06b6-398c-e09c5c0d1cc7', 'en', 'Who would succeed Peter'),
('d7d761f1-c290-7c10-0592-6481a1d9e441', 'de', 'Ob die Heidenchristen beschnitten werden müssen'),
('d7d761f1-c290-7c10-0592-6481a1d9e441', 'en', 'Whether Gentile believers must be circumcised'),
('47c27e05-834f-8401-8c72-5fe37bb67282', 'de', 'Ob man am Sabbat fasten soll'),
('47c27e05-834f-8401-8c72-5fe37bb67282', 'en', 'Whether one should fast on the Sabbath'),
('1120b930-02ea-a078-f265-a227f04b8aca', 'de', 'Er ließ ihn vor Gericht steinigen'),
('1120b930-02ea-a078-f265-a227f04b8aca', 'en', 'He had him stoned by a court'),
('eaf4d699-60af-a433-5abc-941c5cb0fc1f', 'de', 'Er erschoss ihn mit dem Bogen von der Mauer'),
('eaf4d699-60af-a433-5abc-941c5cb0fc1f', 'en', 'He shot him with a bow from the wall'),
('96c6fb09-9702-5d41-ccd3-1fc04012314d', 'de', 'Er vergiftete ihn beim Mahl'),
('96c6fb09-9702-5d41-ccd3-1fc04012314d', 'en', 'He poisoned him at a meal'),
('b273cbf3-92e3-a76a-5a7a-73a644279f89', 'de', 'Er stach ihn heimlich im Tor in den Bauch'),
('b273cbf3-92e3-a76a-5a7a-73a644279f89', 'en', 'He stabbed him secretly in the belly in the gateway'),
('30ec876a-5d9b-1265-9595-5201ab18dcfb', 'de', 'Mit einem Brunnen voll süßen Wassers'),
('30ec876a-5d9b-1265-9595-5201ab18dcfb', 'en', 'With a well full of sweet water'),
('c579b6a4-3c88-eb07-4409-97b18151848e', 'de', 'Mit einem sanften Wind über dem Wasser'),
('c579b6a4-3c88-eb07-4409-97b18151848e', 'en', 'With a gentle wind over the water'),
('d5d41d7e-3645-0e2a-c9b9-177b031b1f4b', 'de', 'Mit einem festen Anker in der Tiefe'),
('d5d41d7e-3645-0e2a-c9b9-177b031b1f4b', 'en', 'With a firm anchor in the deep'),
('6d9f7807-b6bb-1625-951f-56addd40fe58', 'de', 'Mit einem kleinen Feuer, das einen Wald entzündet'),
('6d9f7807-b6bb-1625-951f-56addd40fe58', 'en', 'With a small fire that sets a forest ablaze'),
('6859ccf9-8ad5-b127-cc6a-f350dfb52281', 'de', 'Mit Schwertern und Lanzen, bis das Blut floss'),
('6859ccf9-8ad5-b127-cc6a-f350dfb52281', 'en', 'With swords and lances until the blood gushed out'),
('6862aacd-1417-4027-5664-cb9316cf1fee', 'de', 'Mit den Hörnern des Altars'),
('6862aacd-1417-4027-5664-cb9316cf1fee', 'en', 'With the horns of the altar'),
('7344889b-9574-a879-b6a7-6a9df13dec30', 'de', 'Mit Dornenzweigen'),
('7344889b-9574-a879-b6a7-6a9df13dec30', 'en', 'With thorn branches'),
('820010f6-84f2-bc1f-800f-558d2c6ba6a0', 'de', 'Mit glühenden Kohlen'),
('820010f6-84f2-bc1f-800f-558d2c6ba6a0', 'en', 'With glowing coals'),
('a047c617-f7d7-19e8-3280-e15af8016cfb', 'de', 'Öl der ersten Trauben'),
('a047c617-f7d7-19e8-3280-e15af8016cfb', 'en', 'Oil of the first grapes'),
('7ea7f3aa-40af-aa8b-032d-92b80f35e42e', 'de', 'Reines, gestoßenes Olivenöl'),
('7ea7f3aa-40af-aa8b-032d-92b80f35e42e', 'en', 'Pure, beaten olive oil'),
('196caa04-9775-a54a-5188-692d40385a0a', 'de', 'Geschmolzenes Fett der Opfer'),
('196caa04-9775-a54a-5188-692d40385a0a', 'en', 'Melted fat of the sacrifices'),
('3e02100e-b1f6-d1ea-ca3b-210346ad1dbe', 'de', 'Öl der Myrrhe und Zimt'),
('3e02100e-b1f6-d1ea-ca3b-210346ad1dbe', 'en', 'Oil of myrrh and cinnamon'),
('9a926461-f356-0796-ad36-c89be30e1287', 'de', 'Sie verwandelte sich in Regen'),
('9a926461-f356-0796-ad36-c89be30e1287', 'en', 'It turned into rain'),
('e5cfbb43-7f97-b569-2c12-7cdc1a209bc7', 'de', 'Sie verschwand für eine Nacht'),
('e5cfbb43-7f97-b569-2c12-7cdc1a209bc7', 'en', 'It vanished for a night'),
('061c0304-b38f-0266-51f2-32acebd8e854', 'de', 'Sie stellte sich trennend zwischen die Heere'),
('061c0304-b38f-0266-51f2-32acebd8e854', 'en', 'It moved to stand between the two armies'),
('435f3958-682b-6fae-2719-49c0b3ed291e', 'de', 'Sie führte das Volk ins Wasser'),
('435f3958-682b-6fae-2719-49c0b3ed291e', 'en', 'It led the people into the water'),
('7b487f73-d6cf-f484-e3d3-0e8dbca4ed80', 'de', 'Er ergriff die Hörner des Altars und bat um Gnade'),
('7b487f73-d6cf-f484-e3d3-0e8dbca4ed80', 'en', 'He grabbed the horns of the altar and begged for mercy'),
('491d5fbb-4d46-4565-021c-9aec93a5f90b', 'de', 'Er ließ sich zum Priester weihen'),
('491d5fbb-4d46-4565-021c-9aec93a5f90b', 'en', 'He had himself consecrated as a priest'),
('7927c6f3-5a3f-26c7-fc7a-0fd57a40615e', 'de', 'Er wurde noch am selben Tag hingerichtet'),
('7927c6f3-5a3f-26c7-fc7a-0fd57a40615e', 'en', 'He was executed that same day'),
('a39d80c0-fafe-36f2-b5d4-1c55d2c57063', 'de', 'Er floh sofort zu den Philistern'),
('a39d80c0-fafe-36f2-b5d4-1c55d2c57063', 'en', 'He fled at once to the Philistines'),
('6d450592-88a1-6daf-602b-a81cf4c4aa1c', 'de', 'Er sandte ihn zum Teich Bethesda'),
('6d450592-88a1-6daf-602b-a81cf4c4aa1c', 'en', 'He sent him to the pool of Bethesda'),
('f0064a6a-ea8f-0bc4-215c-ad39d07476ac', 'de', 'Er legte ihm die Finger in die Ohren und berührte seine Zunge'),
('f0064a6a-ea8f-0bc4-215c-ad39d07476ac', 'en', 'He put his fingers in the man''s ears and touched his tongue'),
('1be0c7fa-347d-490e-c28a-44a855cd488e', 'de', 'Er legte ihm beide Hände auf das Haupt'),
('1be0c7fa-347d-490e-c28a-44a855cd488e', 'en', 'He laid both hands on his head'),
('905a4bfe-ca61-9f5b-dd65-bc98d744e31f', 'de', 'Er sprach nur ein Wort aus der Ferne'),
('905a4bfe-ca61-9f5b-dd65-bc98d744e31f', 'en', 'He spoke only a word from afar'),
('423a49c7-c7de-5e19-2eaa-0789fab888ba', 'de', 'Nabals aus Karmel'),
('423a49c7-c7de-5e19-2eaa-0789fab888ba', 'en', 'Nabal of Carmel''s'),
('c6ac8455-dba8-9a0c-4194-6ff66aa580ae', 'de', 'Urias, des Hetiters'),
('c6ac8455-dba8-9a0c-4194-6ff66aa580ae', 'en', 'Uriah, the Hittite''s'),
('1d2759b4-9a98-819a-a6da-dfa134cdcd45', 'de', 'Ahitofels, des Ratgebers'),
('1d2759b4-9a98-819a-a6da-dfa134cdcd45', 'en', 'Ahithophel, the counselor''s'),
('760d0632-5b2e-69f7-667f-31e7d47d0199', 'de', 'Joabs, des Heerführers'),
('760d0632-5b2e-69f7-667f-31e7d47d0199', 'en', 'Joab, the army commander''s'),
('786b0345-458a-8666-3b3e-dd4a60846807', 'de', 'Sie wurden dem Volk verteilt'),
('786b0345-458a-8666-3b3e-dd4a60846807', 'en', 'They were distributed to the people'),
('d5189487-c89e-4d4c-a5a8-c6e06ab76f7c', 'de', 'Sie wurden auf dem Altar verbrannt'),
('d5189487-c89e-4d4c-a5a8-c6e06ab76f7c', 'en', 'They were burned on the altar'),
('ff170a7c-dc93-a8b7-3f04-a01f9380cc5a', 'de', 'Sie wurden außerhalb des Lagers vergraben'),
('ff170a7c-dc93-a8b7-3f04-a01f9380cc5a', 'en', 'They were buried outside the camp'),
('968ceca2-172c-c8c5-8c58-3b94f9e11838', 'de', 'Sie wurden den Priestern gegeben'),
('968ceca2-172c-c8c5-8c58-3b94f9e11838', 'en', 'They were given to the priests'),
('71d5aca7-3077-1304-06c3-dbeb1d36c67a', 'de', 'Weil Isch-Boschet ihn des Verrats anklagte'),
('71d5aca7-3077-1304-06c3-dbeb1d36c67a', 'en', 'Because Ish-bosheth accused him of treason'),
('2488c594-0d49-31d9-2a2a-6024bea834a3', 'de', 'Wegen des Vorwurfs, er habe sich an Sauls Nebenfrau Rizpa vergangen'),
('2488c594-0d49-31d9-2a2a-6024bea834a3', 'en', 'Over the charge that he had gone in to Saul''s concubine Rizpah'),
('f5443a8f-aaf2-e248-ddde-53dac6fa7fa5', 'de', 'Weil er die Schlacht bei Gibeon verloren hatte'),
('f5443a8f-aaf2-e248-ddde-53dac6fa7fa5', 'en', 'Because he had lost the battle at Gibeon'),
('745e332c-2b6b-3fdd-bf6c-526913143a1a', 'de', 'Weil David ihm das Heer Israels anbot'),
('745e332c-2b6b-3fdd-bf6c-526913143a1a', 'en', 'Because David offered him command of Israel''s army'),
('2dee7abe-b0bd-7352-af89-80dc28c7c709', 'de', 'Er ließ Vieh aus den Felsen kommen'),
('2dee7abe-b0bd-7352-af89-80dc28c7c709', 'en', 'He brought cattle out of the rocks'),
('d0207698-b797-aef4-dbfb-ef97db39c5fc', 'de', 'Er sandte Manna in doppelter Menge'),
('d0207698-b797-aef4-dbfb-ef97db39c5fc', 'en', 'He sent a double portion of manna'),
('cb3a2294-4c4c-cd0b-82db-aaf7473accc6', 'de', 'Er ließ Wachteln in großer Menge herbeiwehen'),
('cb3a2294-4c4c-cd0b-82db-aaf7473accc6', 'en', 'He brought quail in great abundance'),
('e70d1663-00d9-1b3a-19ad-74285592fce8', 'de', 'Er gab ihnen Fische aus dem Himmel'),
('e70d1663-00d9-1b3a-19ad-74285592fce8', 'en', 'He gave them fish from the sky'),
('0a64cc91-ca0b-06d7-6fbe-2ae655c150a2', 'de', 'Für ein Linsengericht'),
('0a64cc91-ca0b-06d7-6fbe-2ae655c150a2', 'en', 'For a dish of lentils'),
('4f5368f6-946e-42ce-25c4-df861792b712', 'de', 'Für einen Becher Wein'),
('4f5368f6-946e-42ce-25c4-df861792b712', 'en', 'For a cup of wine'),
('0dea3e96-c6ba-7451-cb98-ef946718778d', 'de', 'Für ein Lammfell'),
('0dea3e96-c6ba-7451-cb98-ef946718778d', 'en', 'For a lambskin'),
('b0352428-18a8-c5db-5b56-202609a4f352', 'de', 'Für ein Stück Brot allein'),
('b0352428-18a8-c5db-5b56-202609a4f352', 'en', 'For a piece of bread alone'),
('e3a9be3e-8b39-b7a7-2e56-c0b28bf131af', 'de', 'Er habe Gott nie wirklich gefürchtet'),
('e3a9be3e-8b39-b7a7-2e56-c0b28bf131af', 'en', 'He had never truly feared God'),
('3253e8b4-817f-51c8-e4ac-4878dcd12797', 'de', 'Er habe Gott von Jugend auf vollkommen gekannt'),
('3253e8b4-817f-51c8-e4ac-4878dcd12797', 'en', 'He had known God perfectly from his youth'),
('01cabb95-5076-f880-6669-0ffc01b5c3ce', 'de', 'Zuvor hörte er nur, nun aber sah ihn sein Auge'),
('01cabb95-5076-f880-6669-0ffc01b5c3ce', 'en', 'Before he had only heard, but now his eye had seen him'),
('db648cb3-1eb0-0608-45aa-75252b473ca0', 'de', 'Er habe Gott in den Sternen gesucht'),
('db648cb3-1eb0-0608-45aa-75252b473ca0', 'en', 'He had sought God in the stars'),
('b9b03470-8529-e57f-9d89-c3e4328f5805', 'de', 'Eine Hungersnot lag über dem Land Bethlehem'),
('b9b03470-8529-e57f-9d89-c3e4328f5805', 'en', 'A famine lay over the land of Bethlehem'),
('891d0d3b-ff8f-939e-38f0-e7d650cf7520', 'de', 'Eine Seuche brach in der Stadt aus'),
('891d0d3b-ff8f-939e-38f0-e7d650cf7520', 'en', 'A plague broke out in the city'),
('0feb2358-fba4-eca5-154a-b84deb78a165', 'de', 'Ein Streit mit den Nachbarn'),
('0feb2358-fba4-eca5-154a-b84deb78a165', 'en', 'A quarrel with the neighbors'),
('24c426c0-8464-6422-5465-4bec8958e3ee', 'de', 'Ein Krieg vertrieb sie aus Juda'),
('24c426c0-8464-6422-5465-4bec8958e3ee', 'en', 'A war drove them out of Judah'),
('a6e706b4-110a-780c-8bdb-453eec728307', 'de', 'Dort blieb es stets dunkel'),
('a6e706b4-110a-780c-8bdb-453eec728307', 'en', 'It remained dark there always'),
('562e2f73-0c89-dd4d-ed58-37f8d88fa40d', 'de', 'Dort regnete es Manna'),
('562e2f73-0c89-dd4d-ed58-37f8d88fa40d', 'en', 'Manna rained down there'),
('afe75d3f-b29b-2516-599e-f0238a63bd83', 'de', 'Dort traten die Plagen nicht auf'),
('afe75d3f-b29b-2516-599e-f0238a63bd83', 'en', 'The plagues did not occur there'),
('454f22a6-b946-3065-1742-0f353fe72d80', 'de', 'Dort waren die Plagen besonders schwer'),
('454f22a6-b946-3065-1742-0f353fe72d80', 'en', 'The plagues were especially severe there'),
('66d7fa47-5995-3865-a67b-70d2fd1f1ec2', 'de', 'Tod den Midianitern im Tal'),
('66d7fa47-5995-3865-a67b-70d2fd1f1ec2', 'en', 'Death to the Midianites in the valley'),
('ae3c2dfe-e706-d77b-34a9-3d9f424f1b75', 'de', 'Schwert für den Herrn und für Gideon'),
('ae3c2dfe-e706-d77b-34a9-3d9f424f1b75', 'en', 'A sword for the Lord and for Gideon'),
('5e9db3b5-b11f-f7c7-8a03-a52e18593ebf', 'de', 'Heil dem König von Israel'),
('5e9db3b5-b11f-f7c7-8a03-a52e18593ebf', 'en', 'Hail to the king of Israel'),
('0eec7147-5f7e-2b10-2bd8-39f5cd7b8ecd', 'de', 'Auf, denn Gott zieht voran'),
('0eec7147-5f7e-2b10-2bd8-39f5cd7b8ecd', 'en', 'Arise, for God goes before us'),
('02090aba-7c42-d613-13a0-e1b376066434', 'de', 'Er machte ihn zum Hauptmann'),
('02090aba-7c42-d613-13a0-e1b376066434', 'en', 'He made him a captain'),
('7940a0fa-3d95-a351-e618-f8bb19983832', 'de', 'Er verbannte ihn aus dem Land'),
('7940a0fa-3d95-a351-e618-f8bb19983832', 'en', 'He banished him from the land'),
('e63f5c14-0090-f0c6-c65c-e7c1ac084c95', 'de', 'Er schwor ihm, dass er nicht sterben werde'),
('e63f5c14-0090-f0c6-c65c-e7c1ac084c95', 'en', 'He swore to him that he would not die'),
('c3052db6-5d90-0f64-d2b1-0ed07af85ac7', 'de', 'Er ließ ihn sofort hinrichten'),
('c3052db6-5d90-0f64-d2b1-0ed07af85ac7', 'en', 'He had him executed at once'),
('e453dc70-51cd-82df-b80b-9eb27529fc3c', 'de', 'Einen Korb mit reifem Obst'),
('e453dc70-51cd-82df-b80b-9eb27529fc3c', 'en', 'A basket of ripe summer fruit'),
('108b2b7c-a614-d3e4-0d68-1771a8c68a5b', 'de', 'Einen zerbrochenen Krug'),
('108b2b7c-a614-d3e4-0d68-1771a8c68a5b', 'en', 'A broken jar'),
('e949489b-c9f2-a9ff-8b2f-65df30e15a38', 'de', 'Ein loderndes Feuer im Heiligtum'),
('e949489b-c9f2-a9ff-8b2f-65df30e15a38', 'en', 'A blazing fire in the sanctuary'),
('6a33c713-9750-bc06-bae9-2f518c9241f8', 'de', 'Eine Schlange im Tempel'),
('6a33c713-9750-bc06-bae9-2f518c9241f8', 'en', 'A serpent in the temple'),
('a337a811-cbda-4864-63c9-e57af1543029', 'de', 'Sie gehen mit aufgerichtetem Hals und buhlen mit den Augen'),
('a337a811-cbda-4864-63c9-e57af1543029', 'en', 'They walk with outstretched necks and flirting eyes'),
('c9167aff-6529-4b5b-be39-6c949561513a', 'de', 'Sie verbergen ihr Gesicht und meiden das Licht'),
('c9167aff-6529-4b5b-be39-6c949561513a', 'en', 'They hide their faces and shun the light'),
('4bfc8c24-b561-6f37-d31f-501e62297953', 'de', 'Sie singen im Tempel und tanzen vor dem Volk'),
('4bfc8c24-b561-6f37-d31f-501e62297953', 'en', 'They sing in the temple and dance before the people'),
('9c0f9c97-d8a4-39db-1922-9a271eb9fe27', 'de', 'Sie weinen am Tor und zerreißen ihre Kleider'),
('9c0f9c97-d8a4-39db-1922-9a271eb9fe27', 'en', 'They weep at the gate and tear their garments'),
('3980b7be-b461-a14d-8c09-64fddec0e4e4', 'de', 'Nur ein Geldopfer'),
('3980b7be-b461-a14d-8c09-64fddec0e4e4', 'en', 'Only a money offering'),
('300e1ea9-9ecc-7cee-beb5-87e5fa8f53ed', 'de', 'Zwei lebende Vögel, Zedernholz, Karmesin und Ysop'),
('300e1ea9-9ecc-7cee-beb5-87e5fa8f53ed', 'en', 'Two live birds, cedar wood, scarlet yarn and hyssop'),
('0fe6bb0a-eba2-fcb6-d862-f3a29441a1e8', 'de', 'Sieben Lämmer und Öl'),
('0fe6bb0a-eba2-fcb6-d862-f3a29441a1e8', 'en', 'Seven lambs and oil'),
('5b0b4b48-2ce1-14a1-ff78-3cf793788870', 'de', 'Ein junges Rind allein'),
('5b0b4b48-2ce1-14a1-ff78-3cf793788870', 'en', 'A young bull alone'),
('1c3bbe94-dfdd-0d7e-cc9f-60d23dd22599', 'de', '… zerreißt nicht so bald'),
('1c3bbe94-dfdd-0d7e-cc9f-60d23dd22599', 'en', '… is not quickly broken'),
('391ba903-69ff-e1b4-58d4-1a1cb50d54f0', 'de', '… bindet keinen Streit'),
('391ba903-69ff-e1b4-58d4-1a1cb50d54f0', 'en', '… binds no strife'),
('7804421a-a4f7-db18-675d-0c75c378eebf', 'de', '… verliert sich im Wind'),
('7804421a-a4f7-db18-675d-0c75c378eebf', 'en', '… is lost in the wind'),
('905ce0b8-cde4-b409-ef97-0abf9f471e14', 'de', '… hält nur den Tag'),
('905ce0b8-cde4-b409-ef97-0abf9f471e14', 'en', '… holds only a day'),
('2ec0a442-07e2-60a8-303b-2f35d458fe0f', 'de', 'Nach Damaskus'),
('2ec0a442-07e2-60a8-303b-2f35d458fe0f', 'en', 'To Damascus'),
('3cb41d17-0f5b-213e-b10b-594c5bac7afd', 'de', 'Nach Tarsis'),
('3cb41d17-0f5b-213e-b10b-594c5bac7afd', 'en', 'To Tarshish'),
('3b90777d-8262-3d6f-3310-317adc862185', 'de', 'Nach Ninive'),
('3b90777d-8262-3d6f-3310-317adc862185', 'en', 'To Nineveh'),
('b2d375ff-e622-5502-2665-f80bcc01f57e', 'de', 'Nach Babylon'),
('b2d375ff-e622-5502-2665-f80bcc01f57e', 'en', 'To Babylon'),
('8b31dffc-d770-8ae4-692f-85e2bc56c244', 'de', 'Es sollte den Fremden gehören'),
('8b31dffc-d770-8ae4-692f-85e2bc56c244', 'en', 'It was to belong to the foreigners'),
('b13d8cc0-728c-c615-7be8-1d134977730d', 'de', 'Es sollte doppelt bestellt werden'),
('b13d8cc0-728c-c615-7be8-1d134977730d', 'en', 'It was to be sown twice'),
('a774cdaf-9326-c1bb-08d8-fa8ea5d5a3ad', 'de', 'Es sollte ruhen und unbestellt bleiben'),
('a774cdaf-9326-c1bb-08d8-fa8ea5d5a3ad', 'en', 'It was to rest and lie fallow'),
('7376f977-12b5-d2c8-c6ac-bb2c8fd0a499', 'de', 'Es sollte verkauft werden'),
('7376f977-12b5-d2c8-c6ac-bb2c8fd0a499', 'en', 'It was to be sold'),
('97c4b67c-2e4f-c57d-40ed-65da581b274b', 'de', 'Er bat das Volk um Vergebung'),
('97c4b67c-2e4f-c57d-40ed-65da581b274b', 'en', 'He begged the people for forgiveness'),
('90519e37-043c-83bf-0e11-52b3dc91f28f', 'de', 'Er drohte, sie härter als sein Vater zu züchtigen'),
('90519e37-043c-83bf-0e11-52b3dc91f28f', 'en', 'He threatened to discipline them harder than his father'),
('d44c581c-136c-30a7-ab7c-66d6dc536d2e', 'de', 'Er entließ seine Berater'),
('d44c581c-136c-30a7-ab7c-66d6dc536d2e', 'en', 'He dismissed his advisers'),
('f33eb9f4-a0a6-16d7-a202-a877f7630a63', 'de', 'Er versprach, alle Lasten zu erleichtern'),
('f33eb9f4-a0a6-16d7-a202-a877f7630a63', 'en', 'He promised to ease all their burdens'),
('bfe47911-825d-2dea-45d7-810897a95df9', 'de', 'Er ernannte ihn zum Priester von On'),
('bfe47911-825d-2dea-45d7-810897a95df9', 'en', 'He appointed him priest of On'),
('ffa8d74b-f686-b42c-7d4e-24d8c9d83e66', 'de', 'Er gab ihm die Aufsicht über die Gefängnisse'),
('ffa8d74b-f686-b42c-7d4e-24d8c9d83e66', 'en', 'He gave him charge of the prisons'),
('45c7e516-9f7e-5ab2-ae21-ed3db77c09b0', 'de', 'Er machte ihn zum Hauptmann des Heeres'),
('45c7e516-9f7e-5ab2-ae21-ed3db77c09b0', 'en', 'He made him captain of the army'),
('22d4c656-918e-afdf-8760-9ba24da62672', 'de', 'Er setzte ihn über das ganze Land Ägypten'),
('22d4c656-918e-afdf-8760-9ba24da62672', 'en', 'He set him over all the land of Egypt'),
('6b43a386-1034-4dd4-3dfc-d83a6c974ae5', 'de', 'Sie schoren ihnen den halben Bart und schnitten ihre Gewänder ab'),
('6b43a386-1034-4dd4-3dfc-d83a6c974ae5', 'en', 'They shaved off half their beards and cut off their garments'),
('2b590d7f-df96-2dd9-152f-d8831ff037d4', 'de', 'Sie töteten sie auf der Stelle'),
('2b590d7f-df96-2dd9-152f-d8831ff037d4', 'en', 'They killed them on the spot'),
('df7bd86f-1727-e7da-5219-dae5676d7897', 'de', 'Sie überhäuften sie mit Geschenken'),
('df7bd86f-1727-e7da-5219-dae5676d7897', 'en', 'They showered them with gifts'),
('91c526d0-738f-51a2-a371-f10048e757bc', 'de', 'Sie nahmen sie als Geiseln gefangen'),
('91c526d0-738f-51a2-a371-f10048e757bc', 'en', 'They took them captive as hostages'),
('cbb7cf9a-1a8f-cfcd-dc9f-071a37f8f11a', 'de', 'Meine Gnade genügt dir'),
('cbb7cf9a-1a8f-cfcd-dc9f-071a37f8f11a', 'en', 'My grace is sufficient for you'),
('314be480-5e07-c842-e248-949203fa4ec8', 'de', 'Meine Gnade gilt nur den Würdigen'),
('314be480-5e07-c842-e248-949203fa4ec8', 'en', 'My grace is only for the worthy'),
('5b1038a1-6cb1-55a6-e234-170888ccbd35', 'de', 'Meine Gnade verlässt dich'),
('5b1038a1-6cb1-55a6-e234-170888ccbd35', 'en', 'My grace abandons you'),
('6850e7b4-107f-edc0-14c3-7a9773b78244', 'de', 'Meine Gnade ist für die Starken'),
('6850e7b4-107f-edc0-14c3-7a9773b78244', 'en', 'My grace is for the strong'),
('aa288a7e-9233-5fa6-8ea1-35747229f669', 'de', 'Sie sollte auf dem Bauch kriechen und Staub fressen'),
('aa288a7e-9233-5fa6-8ea1-35747229f669', 'en', 'It would crawl on its belly and eat dust'),
('439721ae-dce9-46ef-3e6c-57d3b2d94145', 'de', 'Sie sollte ihre Stimme für immer verlieren'),
('439721ae-dce9-46ef-3e6c-57d3b2d94145', 'en', 'It would lose its voice forever'),
('fcc3b7d3-9f95-6d7c-e0ed-d3c797a217c1', 'de', 'Sie sollte in die Wüste verbannt werden'),
('fcc3b7d3-9f95-6d7c-e0ed-d3c797a217c1', 'en', 'It would be banished to the desert'),
('3c424708-f91b-da96-1c38-ffe03c9689e0', 'de', 'Sie sollte vom Feuer verzehrt werden'),
('3c424708-f91b-da96-1c38-ffe03c9689e0', 'en', 'It would be consumed by fire'),
('ae318e4e-7ed9-8c8f-f2e8-7023b58429ab', 'de', 'Weil sie ihm kein Opfer dargebracht hatten'),
('ae318e4e-7ed9-8c8f-f2e8-7023b58429ab', 'en', 'Because they had brought him no offering'),
('34d7202c-b485-a441-046b-4986c165ade4', 'de', 'Damit sie das Wasser nicht stauen konnten'),
('34d7202c-b485-a441-046b-4986c165ade4', 'en', 'So they could not dam the waters'),
('4f502819-1db7-458b-b505-9ce6ac3fc145', 'de', 'Damit sie sich nicht verständigen und den Turm nicht vollenden konnten'),
('4f502819-1db7-458b-b505-9ce6ac3fc145', 'en', 'So they could not understand each other and finish the tower'),
('4e92a5b0-c860-2d08-4e0d-de3bc5af2fa7', 'de', 'Weil sie den Sabbat nicht hielten'),
('4e92a5b0-c860-2d08-4e0d-de3bc5af2fa7', 'en', 'Because they did not keep the Sabbath'),
('d5a25d81-5970-03c1-82f8-63570a735c65', 'de', 'Mein Genügen kommt aus dem Reichtum'),
('d5a25d81-5970-03c1-82f8-63570a735c65', 'en', 'My contentment comes from wealth'),
('bd6d44d0-6220-d3aa-ec7f-6223aa3340b7', 'de', 'Ich bin nie mit etwas zufrieden'),
('bd6d44d0-6220-d3aa-ec7f-6223aa3340b7', 'en', 'I am never satisfied with anything'),
('c002549a-d4df-c0bb-cdd5-a7efb1622c5f', 'de', 'Ich brauche stets mehr Besitz'),
('c002549a-d4df-c0bb-cdd5-a7efb1622c5f', 'en', 'I always need more possessions'),
('b013d428-03f4-2b2a-496a-18f1b095ba41', 'de', 'Ich habe gelernt, mir genügen zu lassen'),
('b013d428-03f4-2b2a-496a-18f1b095ba41', 'en', 'I have learned to be content'),
('dcab59fd-6a1d-7f88-0556-1b12bce72725', 'de', 'Er führt geradewegs in die Finsternis'),
('dcab59fd-6a1d-7f88-0556-1b12bce72725', 'en', 'It leads straight into darkness'),
('adb6e942-2752-2500-9c7d-7a7ecd098784', 'de', 'Er ist wie das Licht des Morgens, das heller wird'),
('adb6e942-2752-2500-9c7d-7a7ecd098784', 'en', 'It is like the light of dawn growing brighter'),
('99af23c1-f72d-df58-93c0-01728bf53f4e', 'de', 'Er endet stets im Reichtum'),
('99af23c1-f72d-df58-93c0-01728bf53f4e', 'en', 'It always ends in riches'),
('b5e4bf25-4ada-3226-da66-1f44690d26b5', 'de', 'Er ist kürzer als der Weg des Bösen'),
('b5e4bf25-4ada-3226-da66-1f44690d26b5', 'en', 'It is shorter than the way of the wicked'),
('526b4a20-e055-31a3-e157-9242a46754b7', 'de', 'Er hielt den Bau aus Furcht eine Weile an'),
('526b4a20-e055-31a3-e157-9242a46754b7', 'en', 'He paused the building for a while out of fear'),
('2c1c3672-acf8-f8a1-1fe3-6c50dcc939b5', 'de', 'Er betete zu Gott und ließ das Volk weiterbauen'),
('2c1c3672-acf8-f8a1-1fe3-6c50dcc939b5', 'en', 'He prayed to God and had the people keep building'),
('85fb14bc-527f-09c5-c314-cdae06a24954', 'de', 'Er sandte Gesandte, um Frieden zu erkaufen'),
('85fb14bc-527f-09c5-c314-cdae06a24954', 'en', 'He sent envoys to buy peace'),
('ec65c521-7024-3dd1-e053-ec2b6d5bc311', 'de', 'Er forderte Sanballat zum Zweikampf heraus'),
('ec65c521-7024-3dd1-e053-ec2b6d5bc311', 'en', 'He challenged Sanballat to single combat'),
('0da2f3c7-0592-0b07-b764-3a57a4edab88', 'de', 'Er lässt sein Leben für die Schafe'),
('0da2f3c7-0592-0b07-b764-3a57a4edab88', 'en', 'He lays down his life for the sheep'),
('92146ca2-c872-505b-f8aa-338695ec9cad', 'de', 'Er sammelt sie an einem Ort'),
('92146ca2-c872-505b-f8aa-338695ec9cad', 'en', 'He gathers them in one place'),
('db3b3503-81a0-6d2d-d737-645e1a850405', 'de', 'Er versteckt sie vor den Wölfen'),
('db3b3503-81a0-6d2d-d737-645e1a850405', 'en', 'He hides them from the wolves'),
('b7772fa2-b8df-b4be-953b-7f73ccb11439', 'de', 'Er verkauft sie auf dem Markt'),
('b7772fa2-b8df-b4be-953b-7f73ccb11439', 'en', 'He sells them at the market'),
('37ac4d48-18d0-5cbf-2ab4-b96cf317d177', 'de', 'Er hatte selbst kein Recht auf das Land'),
('37ac4d48-18d0-5cbf-2ab4-b96cf317d177', 'en', 'He had no right to the land himself'),
('4b3095e6-b79f-1a84-a214-6e72e5bb4d1c', 'de', 'Er misstraute den Absichten Araunas'),
('4b3095e6-b79f-1a84-a214-6e72e5bb4d1c', 'en', 'He distrusted Araunah''s intentions'),
('2f526b68-2bd0-6c9a-e097-ebd3413d8f76', 'de', 'Er wollte dem Herrn kein Opfer bringen, das ihn nichts kostete'),
('2f526b68-2bd0-6c9a-e097-ebd3413d8f76', 'en', 'He would not offer the Lord a sacrifice that cost him nothing'),
('18fc5fad-a6dd-da4d-8838-62c8a767de4d', 'de', 'Joab hatte ihm davon abgeraten'),
('18fc5fad-a6dd-da4d-8838-62c8a767de4d', 'en', 'Joab had advised him against it'),
('395f3588-f6db-87da-0bef-86cb3e2cedb8', 'de', 'Die Jünger sangen einen Lobgesang'),
('395f3588-f6db-87da-0bef-86cb3e2cedb8', 'en', 'The disciples sang a song of praise'),
('aaa8d668-2a1a-a1a7-5472-fb13fa04bb76', 'de', 'Die Jünger ruderten schweigend weiter'),
('aaa8d668-2a1a-a1a7-5472-fb13fa04bb76', 'en', 'The disciples rowed on in silence'),
('2a540db7-51c7-ad8d-5ac1-6c61d27e6020', 'de', 'Die Jünger schliefen sogleich ein'),
('2a540db7-51c7-ad8d-5ac1-6c61d27e6020', 'en', 'The disciples fell asleep at once'),
('003b968f-f386-f8b6-9226-1649c8c7d79d', 'de', 'Die Jünger entsetzten sich über die Maßen'),
('003b968f-f386-f8b6-9226-1649c8c7d79d', 'en', 'The disciples were utterly astounded'),
('be52b622-84aa-aa99-de5a-2946ca07d498', 'de', 'So werde das Volk in Reichtum erstrahlen'),
('be52b622-84aa-aa99-de5a-2946ca07d498', 'en', 'So would the people shine in riches'),
('2aabeccc-7798-d2ee-32b1-8f7a370454aa', 'de', 'So werde der Tempel neu geschmückt'),
('2aabeccc-7798-d2ee-32b1-8f7a370454aa', 'en', 'So would the temple be newly adorned'),
('59703c69-c270-f2e6-d41c-b9a6724523ec', 'de', 'So werde der Feind gebunden und gefangen'),
('59703c69-c270-f2e6-d41c-b9a6724523ec', 'en', 'So would the enemy be bound and captured'),
('593a04f5-a553-46c6-962c-34b8360b11d8', 'de', 'So werde Gott den Hochmut Judas und Jerusalems verderben'),
('593a04f5-a553-46c6-962c-34b8360b11d8', 'en', 'So would God ruin the pride of Judah and Jerusalem'),
('f673b53e-8e51-9edf-4342-254bb9f2f5d9', 'de', 'Eine Seuche brach unter dem Volk Jerusalems aus'),
('f673b53e-8e51-9edf-4342-254bb9f2f5d9', 'en', 'A plague broke out among the people of Jerusalem'),
('d73b9808-c481-07df-1a43-dcf5812a93f9', 'de', 'Ein Erdbeben verschlang die assyrischen Soldaten'),
('d73b9808-c481-07df-1a43-dcf5812a93f9', 'en', 'An earthquake swallowed the Assyrian soldiers'),
('604db5c4-e0f5-f3eb-40b2-07f415117922', 'de', 'Ein Sturm zerstreute das Heer in alle Winde'),
('604db5c4-e0f5-f3eb-40b2-07f415117922', 'en', 'A storm scattered the army to all the winds'),
('9786c0e9-02eb-1c11-51a2-cca6d4ecf7b2', 'de', 'Der Engel des Herrn schlug im Lager der Assyrer in einer Nacht'),
('9786c0e9-02eb-1c11-51a2-cca6d4ecf7b2', 'en', 'The angel of the Lord struck the Assyrian camp in one night'),
('1a555277-b043-ec23-4144-f2e95e681385', 'de', 'Genauso wie die übrigen jungen Männer'),
('1a555277-b043-ec23-4144-f2e95e681385', 'en', 'Just like the other young men'),
('99e59ea4-4a37-f31e-6e9a-2bfe406ad787', 'de', 'Schöner und wohlgenährter als alle anderen'),
('99e59ea4-4a37-f31e-6e9a-2bfe406ad787', 'en', 'Healthier and better nourished than all the others'),
('75dd292d-dc91-4900-393f-86deb0a814df', 'de', 'Krank und kraftlos vom Verzicht'),
('75dd292d-dc91-4900-393f-86deb0a814df', 'en', 'Sick and weak from abstaining'),
('f1921031-3e4d-649b-6219-59ea1f76eac7', 'de', 'Bleich und ausgezehrt vom Fasten'),
('f1921031-3e4d-649b-6219-59ea1f76eac7', 'en', 'Pale and gaunt from fasting'),
('d79367b0-dfee-f75b-d6bb-1d0f92cac44e', 'de', 'Er fiel rücklings vom Stuhl und brach das Genick'),
('d79367b0-dfee-f75b-d6bb-1d0f92cac44e', 'en', 'He fell backward off his seat and broke his neck'),
('f9437df4-3a10-bdd2-8152-77fc0d28f9fc', 'de', 'Er ertrank im Jordan auf der Flucht'),
('f9437df4-3a10-bdd2-8152-77fc0d28f9fc', 'en', 'He drowned in the Jordan while fleeing'),
('d3f4f31c-60c5-a94a-56bc-5c8a0cf24a15', 'de', 'Er wurde von den Philistern erschlagen'),
('d3f4f31c-60c5-a94a-56bc-5c8a0cf24a15', 'en', 'He was slain by the Philistines'),
('cdf1fb1f-6ea2-7426-f69c-4a531a3eeac8', 'de', 'Er erlitt einen Herzanfall beim Opfer'),
('cdf1fb1f-6ea2-7426-f69c-4a531a3eeac8', 'en', 'He had a heart attack at the altar')
insert into public.answer_option_translations (option_id, lang, text) values
('cb0a0241-3604-ea4f-f979-b4569ec4b701', 'de', 'Zuletzt mehrt er die Weisheit'),
('cb0a0241-3604-ea4f-f979-b4569ec4b701', 'en', 'In the end it increases wisdom'),
('061de058-69ee-be30-cbae-3e302094d4e4', 'de', 'Zuletzt bringt er Reichtum'),
('061de058-69ee-be30-cbae-3e302094d4e4', 'en', 'In the end it brings riches'),
('b4ce25c5-6966-e2c8-5b8c-7dfc54cefb0a', 'de', 'Zuletzt schenkt er dauerhafte Freude'),
('b4ce25c5-6966-e2c8-5b8c-7dfc54cefb0a', 'en', 'In the end it gives lasting joy'),
('c79bb4fe-e83e-8ed9-e7b5-a813982c591b', 'de', 'Zuletzt beißt er wie eine Schlange'),
('c79bb4fe-e83e-8ed9-e7b5-a813982c591b', 'en', 'In the end it bites like a serpent'),
('dce26968-72fd-6609-148a-59017cfd3ab3', 'de', 'Einen Weg durch das Meer'),
('dce26968-72fd-6609-148a-59017cfd3ab3', 'en', 'A way through the sea'),
('1bc367a6-db01-ee0a-e1cb-7212e57c5419', 'de', 'Einen Tisch, reich gedeckt'),
('1bc367a6-db01-ee0a-e1cb-7212e57c5419', 'en', 'A table, richly set'),
('ec8ca3ba-c1a3-e8a1-7f11-55c20dbdca0d', 'de', 'Ein Heer von Engeln'),
('ec8ca3ba-c1a3-e8a1-7f11-55c20dbdca0d', 'en', 'An army of angels'),
('61dbb99a-b0b3-ffad-8477-5320608cac81', 'de', 'Eine Stadt mit hohen Mauern'),
('61dbb99a-b0b3-ffad-8477-5320608cac81', 'en', 'A city with high walls'),
('096d7d92-d903-d9c2-7fb6-cafecc76e0ca', 'de', 'Petrus bestimmte ihn durch Handauflegung'),
('096d7d92-d903-d9c2-7fb6-cafecc76e0ca', 'en', 'Peter appointed him by laying on of hands'),
('2325ce9c-1e7d-3a17-24ba-0deb107869ac', 'de', 'Ein Engel nannte seinen Namen'),
('2325ce9c-1e7d-3a17-24ba-0deb107869ac', 'en', 'An angel named him'),
('7dc55f35-7fe3-4f8f-6640-bfab1e27196f', 'de', 'Sie warfen das Los, und es fiel auf Matthias'),
('7dc55f35-7fe3-4f8f-6640-bfab1e27196f', 'en', 'They cast lots, and it fell on Matthias'),
('3b6e4506-c0c6-9561-93dc-f43f5d11c2f6', 'de', 'Sie ließen die Gemeinde abstimmen'),
('3b6e4506-c0c6-9561-93dc-f43f5d11c2f6', 'en', 'They let the congregation vote'),
('0317583f-d1fa-8a2b-b256-af032af339bd', 'de', 'Er schrie laut und bitterlich auf'),
('0317583f-d1fa-8a2b-b256-af032af339bd', 'en', 'He cried out loudly and bitterly'),
('c9555e0f-3ff0-8fd4-d9ae-344508aaf2ea', 'de', 'Er bat seinen Vater um Geld'),
('c9555e0f-3ff0-8fd4-d9ae-344508aaf2ea', 'en', 'He asked his father for money'),
('601ab8a8-1f4f-ac67-ccfd-07daa5c7cdb5', 'de', 'Er verzieh seinem Bruder sofort'),
('601ab8a8-1f4f-ac67-ccfd-07daa5c7cdb5', 'en', 'He forgave his brother at once'),
('9f13c3dc-742d-8b08-e081-2927e3224aa2', 'de', 'Er zog schweigend in die Wüste'),
('9f13c3dc-742d-8b08-e081-2927e3224aa2', 'en', 'He went silently into the desert'),
('a94de309-a3ce-41de-003d-33a652383789', 'de', 'Er rief ''Unrein, unrein'' und wohnte außerhalb des Lagers'),
('a94de309-a3ce-41de-003d-33a652383789', 'en', 'He cried ''Unclean, unclean'' and lived outside the camp'),
('12d32e66-a860-9654-be02-df0a9faaa68f', 'de', 'Er trug eine weiße Kleidung im Lager'),
('12d32e66-a860-9654-be02-df0a9faaa68f', 'en', 'He wore white clothing inside the camp'),
('6fe3ef6c-6a54-eded-4118-64159cb245d2', 'de', 'Er opferte täglich im Heiligtum'),
('6fe3ef6c-6a54-eded-4118-64159cb245d2', 'en', 'He sacrificed daily in the sanctuary'),
('0a91c877-3b84-1c4c-c8c5-21bc7be72f5c', 'de', 'Er durfte nur nachts unter Menschen sein'),
('0a91c877-3b84-1c4c-c8c5-21bc7be72f5c', 'en', 'He could only be among people at night'),
('af4a57fd-cd29-9d75-6705-b5f4a8b014b1', 'de', 'Er ließ sie sofort nach Jerusalem bringen'),
('af4a57fd-cd29-9d75-6705-b5f4a8b014b1', 'en', 'He had it brought to Jerusalem at once'),
('7e88e2a0-d6d1-9fda-00eb-c241656b0def', 'de', 'Er stellte die Lade drei Monate im Haus Obed-Edoms unter'),
('7e88e2a0-d6d1-9fda-00eb-c241656b0def', 'en', 'He left the ark three months in the house of Obed-edom'),
('b9616da7-51ec-e0cb-2176-0191c1414cd1', 'de', 'Er gab sie den Philistern zurück'),
('b9616da7-51ec-e0cb-2176-0191c1414cd1', 'en', 'He returned it to the Philistines'),
('79f5c7c8-0bf5-ba50-e7a8-cea51686a313', 'de', 'Er ließ sie verbrennen aus Furcht'),
('79f5c7c8-0bf5-ba50-e7a8-cea51686a313', 'en', 'He had it burned out of fear'),
('c0085477-56b0-30b1-13c7-626d2e73bf64', 'de', 'Sie forderten den Abbruch des neuen Fundaments'),
('c0085477-56b0-30b1-13c7-626d2e73bf64', 'en', 'They demanded the new foundation be torn down'),
('9d757bdf-dc3a-5ace-adfb-92f107aa9c85', 'de', 'Sie weinten laut, weil sie den ersten Tempel gekannt hatten'),
('9d757bdf-dc3a-5ace-adfb-92f107aa9c85', 'en', 'They wept aloud because they had known the first temple'),
('f95be6cb-d18c-db1b-69ac-62f3a95abc5c', 'de', 'Sie verlangten die Rückkehr nach Babel'),
('f95be6cb-d18c-db1b-69ac-62f3a95abc5c', 'en', 'They demanded a return to Babylon'),
('d720081c-0a2c-5a79-85b3-9f4de04c2e02', 'de', 'Sie verließen zornig die Baustelle in Jerusalem'),
('d720081c-0a2c-5a79-85b3-9f4de04c2e02', 'en', 'They angrily left the building site in Jerusalem'),
('619ba7d0-61bc-fce4-ed0d-d3b923cbc980', 'de', 'Er trat mit Räucherwerk zwischen Tote und Lebende'),
('619ba7d0-61bc-fce4-ed0d-d3b923cbc980', 'en', 'He stood with incense between the dead and the living'),
('4cc5b516-85e4-7d30-01a3-15ac1fb7dc9f', 'de', 'Er errichtete einen neuen Altar'),
('4cc5b516-85e4-7d30-01a3-15ac1fb7dc9f', 'en', 'He built a new altar'),
('cbe12152-c1b9-2929-5bdb-b57b33b2dfa6', 'de', 'Er rief das Volk zur Umkehr auf'),
('cbe12152-c1b9-2929-5bdb-b57b33b2dfa6', 'en', 'He called the people to repentance'),
('ef8b63a8-95c2-dcbc-f0d8-7e23a4c9c821', 'de', 'Er betete vierzig Tage und Nächte'),
('ef8b63a8-95c2-dcbc-f0d8-7e23a4c9c821', 'en', 'He prayed forty days and nights'),
('e7201fc4-907c-cbef-0088-6a633e2ab696', 'de', 'Wer nicht arbeitet, wird dennoch versorgt'),
('e7201fc4-907c-cbef-0088-6a633e2ab696', 'en', 'One who does not work is still provided for'),
('c2977a2d-c538-d28f-ff9c-49cabf75be90', 'de', 'Arbeit ist für die Gläubigen verboten'),
('c2977a2d-c538-d28f-ff9c-49cabf75be90', 'en', 'Work is forbidden for believers'),
('23cc5b07-3d9a-8b84-cd22-2cc428dda598', 'de', 'Wer nicht arbeiten will, soll auch nicht essen'),
('23cc5b07-3d9a-8b84-cd22-2cc428dda598', 'en', 'If anyone will not work, let him not eat'),
('97df1965-a6dd-47e7-5721-734ff3adcabd', 'de', 'Müßiggang ist eine Tugend'),
