('ea0eccef-31a3-e5bc-f04a-574b38af0815', 'de', 'Seine Herrschaft wird verborgen und still im Lande sein'),
('ea0eccef-31a3-e5bc-f04a-574b38af0815', 'en', 'His rule shall be hidden and quiet in the land'),
('be711e1a-5159-539f-5284-9b82921388b7', 'de', 'Seine Herrschaft wird groß und des Friedens kein Ende sein'),
('be711e1a-5159-539f-5284-9b82921388b7', 'en', 'His government shall be great, and of his peace there shall be no end'),
('91e9c954-4425-9a5b-f517-aa3b1ab1093c', 'de', 'Ich bin die Tür zu den Schafen'),
('91e9c954-4425-9a5b-f517-aa3b1ab1093c', 'en', 'I am the door of the sheep'),
('6995398c-f8aa-3e4d-463b-6ac1513b4e51', 'de', 'Ich bin der gute Hirte'),
('6995398c-f8aa-3e4d-463b-6ac1513b4e51', 'en', 'I am the good shepherd'),
('bc64bcdd-1668-de2f-4ea9-a5936142cb1b', 'de', 'Ich bin die Auferstehung und das Leben'),
('bc64bcdd-1668-de2f-4ea9-a5936142cb1b', 'en', 'I am the resurrection and the life'),
('49fa9ad2-969c-9aab-f727-fe6b3ba0d8f5', 'de', 'Ich bin das Licht der Welt'),
('49fa9ad2-969c-9aab-f727-fe6b3ba0d8f5', 'en', 'I am the light of the world'),
('b6de0122-8508-7ae0-decb-549f9072faaf', 'de', 'Der Dornbusch lud die Bäume ein, unter ihm Schutz zu suchen'),
('b6de0122-8508-7ae0-decb-549f9072faaf', 'en', 'The bramble invited the trees to seek shade under it'),
('b3d16f8b-7a9e-0c9b-fd27-729c01ad37a8', 'de', 'Der Weinstock mit seinem erfreuenden Wein'),
('b3d16f8b-7a9e-0c9b-fd27-729c01ad37a8', 'en', 'The vine with its cheering wine'),
('f8a294eb-bcff-406e-ba51-3af23afefc29', 'de', 'Der Ölbaum, der sein Öl nicht lassen wollte'),
('f8a294eb-bcff-406e-ba51-3af23afefc29', 'en', 'The olive tree, unwilling to give up its oil'),
('2f1c38c4-efea-e9f9-9b2e-b27c510c463a', 'de', 'Der Feigenbaum mit seiner süßen Frucht'),
('2f1c38c4-efea-e9f9-9b2e-b27c510c463a', 'en', 'The fig tree with its sweet fruit'),
('a78ba01e-a5a6-a721-68ba-ca8616df30b7', 'de', 'Absichtlich Ähren für sie liegen zu lassen'),
('a78ba01e-a5a6-a721-68ba-ca8616df30b7', 'en', 'To deliberately leave ears of grain for her'),
('eed540c0-3695-233c-3fcc-1436c7becd3f', 'de', 'Ihr das halbe Tagewerk abzunehmen'),
('eed540c0-3695-233c-3fcc-1436c7becd3f', 'en', 'To take over half her day''s work'),
('5d1ea5ef-a1b3-8488-ab92-1d9dd98bf714', 'de', 'Ihr einen eigenen Acker zuzuteilen'),
('5d1ea5ef-a1b3-8488-ab92-1d9dd98bf714', 'en', 'To assign her a field of her own'),
('6fafd573-6ef9-d103-015d-d6ab6f7d1527', 'de', 'Sie vor Mittag heimzuschicken'),
('6fafd573-6ef9-d103-015d-d6ab6f7d1527', 'en', 'To send her home before noon'),
('0407177e-554f-918c-3c9b-86afb67ef4a2', 'de', 'Sie an Fremde verkaufen'),
('0407177e-554f-918c-3c9b-86afb67ef4a2', 'en', 'Sell them to strangers'),
('ab2bfec3-aaca-77e2-110c-a6a7b518bb07', 'de', 'Sie in Tempeln aufstellen'),
('ab2bfec3-aaca-77e2-110c-a6a7b518bb07', 'en', 'Set them up in temples'),
('b979eec5-c105-08e0-6357-12a847801dab', 'de', 'Sie als Beute behalten'),
('b979eec5-c105-08e0-6357-12a847801dab', 'en', 'Keep them as spoil'),
('aa027c50-b3a2-9c0c-786b-82b84fa870f3', 'de', 'Sie mit Feuer verbrennen und nichts davon begehren'),
('aa027c50-b3a2-9c0c-786b-82b84fa870f3', 'en', 'Burn them with fire and covet nothing of them'),
('9d8e9558-f9e6-0087-087a-59ff71d954c5', 'de', 'Sie sprachen nur Segensworte über sie'),
('9d8e9558-f9e6-0087-087a-59ff71d954c5', 'en', 'They only spoke words of blessing over them'),
('6a6dfd1e-ad39-eb36-5c0f-d2e84a3246d2', 'de', 'Sie salbten viele Kranke mit Öl und heilten sie'),
('6a6dfd1e-ad39-eb36-5c0f-d2e84a3246d2', 'en', 'They anointed many sick with oil and healed them'),
('0b3ed000-f7fb-9b0b-4564-8b248f3a536f', 'de', 'Sie führten sie zum Teich zum Waschen'),
('0b3ed000-f7fb-9b0b-4564-8b248f3a536f', 'en', 'They led them to a pool to wash'),
('63b46cf9-87de-84ea-0d80-11a69b467277', 'de', 'Sie legten ihnen Schriftrollen auf'),
('63b46cf9-87de-84ea-0d80-11a69b467277', 'en', 'They placed scrolls upon them'),
('c6aa7260-fb57-a947-d5ed-90502061eda6', 'de', '… so wirst du reich werden'),
('c6aa7260-fb57-a947-d5ed-90502061eda6', 'en', '… and you will become rich'),
('54ffd1e2-dbd7-1cc9-905a-550af6124c1c', 'de', '… so endet jede Mühe'),
('54ffd1e2-dbd7-1cc9-905a-550af6124c1c', 'en', '… and all toil will end'),
('ced56935-c0bc-10c8-9437-4997ce57f973', 'de', '… so werden deine Pläne gelingen'),
('ced56935-c0bc-10c8-9437-4997ce57f973', 'en', '… and your plans will succeed'),
('81a5d744-dfe5-e028-757c-f49439d8e228', 'de', '… so bleibst du verborgen'),
('81a5d744-dfe5-e028-757c-f49439d8e228', 'en', '… and you will remain hidden'),
('4526cff6-d2f9-75fe-10c3-d163137ca3a4', 'de', 'Wer schläft, erlangt die Weisheit'),
('4526cff6-d2f9-75fe-10c3-d163137ca3a4', 'en', 'Whoever sleeps gains wisdom'),
('1440bd77-0c42-10d8-2ad2-714b3629427c', 'de', 'Schlummer schenkt dem Faulen Ehre'),
('1440bd77-0c42-10d8-2ad2-714b3629427c', 'en', 'Slumber grants the lazy honor'),
('89774ac8-446b-b158-5e23-62a2769b3396', 'de', 'Ein wenig Schlaf, ein wenig Schlummer — so kommt die Armut'),
('89774ac8-446b-b158-5e23-62a2769b3396', 'en', 'A little sleep, a little slumber — so poverty comes'),
('589b501a-3653-1798-058d-3dd368e42a9e', 'de', 'Viel Schlaf bringt großen Reichtum'),
('589b501a-3653-1798-058d-3dd368e42a9e', 'en', 'Much sleep brings great riches'),
('15b44a47-70bf-90b1-6589-6719f1d626f4', 'de', 'Vierzig Tage'),
('15b44a47-70bf-90b1-6589-6719f1d626f4', 'en', 'Forty days'),
('2d06c5e8-5acb-6a29-a4ce-a8c3ede72b29', 'de', 'Einen einzigen Tag'),
('2d06c5e8-5acb-6a29-a4ce-a8c3ede72b29', 'en', 'A single day'),
('148fbb18-8fb3-ab76-e018-20a1ee7cd9eb', 'de', 'Drei volle Wochen'),
('148fbb18-8fb3-ab76-e018-20a1ee7cd9eb', 'en', 'Three full weeks'),
('60966051-3f41-9717-f00b-630f166ef8d1', 'de', 'Sieben Tage'),
('60966051-3f41-9717-f00b-630f166ef8d1', 'en', 'Seven days'),
('85e8cc7f-5a04-dead-223a-9559ed4ea200', 'de', 'Damit sie nicht trauerten, denn die Freude am HERRN sei ihre Stärke'),
('85e8cc7f-5a04-dead-223a-9559ed4ea200', 'en', 'So they would not mourn, for the joy of the LORD was their strength'),
('d7033580-6bf1-b333-ca1f-c22afffdd871', 'de', 'Damit sie das ganze Gesetz an einem Tag auswendig lernten'),
('d7033580-6bf1-b333-ca1f-c22afffdd871', 'en', 'So they would memorize the whole law in one day'),
('cb527c61-e34a-5237-1522-03d34efc5223', 'de', 'Damit sie die Schuldigen aus dem Volk vertrieben'),
('cb527c61-e34a-5237-1522-03d34efc5223', 'en', 'So they would expel the guilty from the people'),
('c36b2826-eedc-7c3b-a16f-cb99b5bb2584', 'de', 'Damit sie sofort Opfer auf dem Altar darbrächten'),
('c36b2826-eedc-7c3b-a16f-cb99b5bb2584', 'en', 'So they would at once offer sacrifices on the altar'),
('d52990ab-dce0-8470-7487-d6a23c64f4fd', 'de', 'Für dreißig Silberlinge'),
('d52990ab-dce0-8470-7487-d6a23c64f4fd', 'en', 'For thirty pieces of silver'),
('247f4a92-8ee2-feb3-1a46-38625f5d8d1d', 'de', 'Für zehn Goldstücke'),
('247f4a92-8ee2-feb3-1a46-38625f5d8d1d', 'en', 'For ten gold pieces'),
('f73f8b96-8e92-9e5f-cf57-60ae982a69e0', 'de', 'Für fünfzig Schekel Silber'),
('f73f8b96-8e92-9e5f-cf57-60ae982a69e0', 'en', 'For fifty shekels of silver'),
('3b21d2ca-8f4e-63f3-bfd8-b85484d2839f', 'de', 'Für hundert Denare'),
('3b21d2ca-8f4e-63f3-bfd8-b85484d2839f', 'en', 'For a hundred denarii'),
('039321dd-b1b3-509d-e608-35d026a01877', 'de', 'Nur die Priester dürfen Gott erkennen'),
('039321dd-b1b3-509d-e608-35d026a01877', 'en', 'Only the priests may know God'),
('d696ba8b-e330-7bd2-8050-aa44000d2aaa', 'de', 'Gott schreibt sein Gesetz in die Herzen und vergibt die Schuld'),
('d696ba8b-e330-7bd2-8050-aa44000d2aaa', 'en', 'God writes his law on the hearts and forgives the guilt'),
('ed10468e-9edd-f642-3b57-3ee5eae03909', 'de', 'Das Volk muss jährlich Opfer im Tempel bringen'),
('ed10468e-9edd-f642-3b57-3ee5eae03909', 'en', 'The people must bring yearly sacrifices in the temple'),
('9350f3dc-a35b-3920-3b0b-4a5f0f89e41b', 'de', 'Der Bund gilt allein für das Königshaus David'),
('9350f3dc-a35b-3920-3b0b-4a5f0f89e41b', 'en', 'The covenant applies only to the house of David'),
('388be2a2-f9d2-a58b-838b-6a86c39ae2c6', 'de', 'Sieben Siegel der Buchrolle'),
('388be2a2-f9d2-a58b-838b-6a86c39ae2c6', 'en', 'Seven seals of the scroll'),
('20dae878-280b-19aa-1f6c-1b25fec5d5a3', 'de', 'Sieben Posaunen aus Gold'),
('20dae878-280b-19aa-1f6c-1b25fec5d5a3', 'en', 'Seven trumpets of gold'),
('67216b47-ecad-09d6-bc46-5d87bb830252', 'de', 'Sieben Sterne in seiner rechten Hand'),
('67216b47-ecad-09d6-bc46-5d87bb830252', 'en', 'Seven stars in his right hand'),
('a7415449-e7aa-c2f2-218f-9f820ce878db', 'de', 'Sieben Schalen voll Zorn'),
('a7415449-e7aa-c2f2-218f-9f820ce878db', 'en', 'Seven bowls full of wrath'),
('324f9f16-082d-e708-6115-8992d08601de', 'de', 'Die Lehrer haben mich aufgehalten'),
('324f9f16-082d-e708-6115-8992d08601de', 'en', 'The teachers held me back'),
('2dd4e463-80db-cc08-dcec-f1eeedcaefd2', 'de', 'Wusstet ihr nicht, dass ich sein muss in dem, was meines Vaters ist'),
('2dd4e463-80db-cc08-dcec-f1eeedcaefd2', 'en', 'Did you not know I must be about my Father''s business'),
('97fbe525-7782-c7c4-7621-90236b56e022', 'de', 'Ich wollte allein in Jerusalem bleiben'),
('97fbe525-7782-c7c4-7621-90236b56e022', 'en', 'I wanted to stay alone in Jerusalem'),
('4e8cbd17-44a1-6ca9-d198-d5c6d54a6a2e', 'de', 'Ich habe den Weg nach Hause verloren'),
('4e8cbd17-44a1-6ca9-d198-d5c6d54a6a2e', 'en', 'I lost the way home'),
('e3a6d156-75bd-cf29-24a2-a72c395e7ce7', 'de', 'Ein Engel mit feurigem Schwert'),
('e3a6d156-75bd-cf29-24a2-a72c395e7ce7', 'en', 'An angel with a fiery sword'),
('a2783484-0ab6-6d9c-9710-d34dfa81164f', 'de', 'Ein König mit goldener Krone'),
('a2783484-0ab6-6d9c-9710-d34dfa81164f', 'en', 'A king with a golden crown'),
('48732b0e-4142-ba7d-ae01-581a2df99ad3', 'de', 'Der Hochbetagte mit weißem Gewand und Haar wie reine Wolle'),
('48732b0e-4142-ba7d-ae01-581a2df99ad3', 'en', 'The Ancient of Days, with a white robe and hair like pure wool'),
('8b9cb49d-6070-8d9d-f3e9-71a976b9f551', 'de', 'Der Menschensohn allein'),
('8b9cb49d-6070-8d9d-f3e9-71a976b9f551', 'en', 'The Son of Man alone'),
('afa49d81-78bf-7d36-3054-bd26e001aa44', 'de', 'Ihm ihr letztes Lamm zu schlachten'),
('afa49d81-78bf-7d36-3054-bd26e001aa44', 'en', 'To slaughter her last lamb for him'),
('470546a7-dbbf-aa3b-dcca-aa85be4f5785', 'de', 'Ihm ihren Sohn als Diener zu geben'),
('470546a7-dbbf-aa3b-dcca-aa85be4f5785', 'en', 'To give him her son as a servant'),
('c5359250-1994-e476-0104-faa6a3a489a2', 'de', 'Ihm ihr ganzes Haus zu überlassen'),
('c5359250-1994-e476-0104-faa6a3a489a2', 'en', 'To give him her whole house'),
('55c50808-403f-f421-983f-ac19a413197d', 'de', 'Ihm aus ihrem letzten Mehl und Öl einen kleinen Kuchen zu backen'),
('55c50808-403f-f421-983f-ac19a413197d', 'en', 'To bake him a small cake from her last flour and oil'),
('5cce8b7f-576f-b884-d74e-cc44349e61d9', 'de', 'Die Erde tat sich auf und verschlang sie'),
('5cce8b7f-576f-b884-d74e-cc44349e61d9', 'en', 'The earth opened and swallowed them'),
('52ed40fd-c77a-ba48-e300-c182d488ec36', 'de', 'Sie wurden von Feuer verzehrt'),
('52ed40fd-c77a-ba48-e300-c182d488ec36', 'en', 'They were consumed by fire'),
('ae37a439-ead7-de2b-3cf6-83ac3f550923', 'de', 'Sie starben an einer Plage'),
('ae37a439-ead7-de2b-3cf6-83ac3f550923', 'en', 'They died of a plague'),
('783954fa-8d07-f9ac-c0bb-de8b335826da', 'de', 'Sie wurden gesteinigt vom Volk'),
('783954fa-8d07-f9ac-c0bb-de8b335826da', 'en', 'They were stoned by the people'),
('cadcd9ad-a1e7-a6ef-c1a8-d766dd01c7d3', 'de', 'Eine Magd im Hause seines Vaters'),
('cadcd9ad-a1e7-a6ef-c1a8-d766dd01c7d3', 'en', 'A maid in his father''s house'),
('cbdaad42-5563-200b-ae22-e39d9d2580b2', 'de', 'Die Tochter des Stadtfürsten von Gaza'),
('cbdaad42-5563-200b-ae22-e39d9d2580b2', 'en', 'The daughter of the city ruler of Gaza'),
('e7a0d35d-7f03-6f39-5bbb-d54a226565e1', 'de', 'Delila durch tägliches Drängen und Klagen'),
('e7a0d35d-7f03-6f39-5bbb-d54a226565e1', 'en', 'Delilah through daily pressing and complaining'),
('7c6a741c-1dc8-de47-76be-7d75877b3062', 'de', 'Seine erste philistäische Frau'),
('7c6a741c-1dc8-de47-76be-7d75877b3062', 'en', 'His first Philistine wife'),
('06578757-ccc5-0246-cc5c-f654a4e26aeb', 'de', 'Ziklag'),
('06578757-ccc5-0246-cc5c-f654a4e26aeb', 'en', 'Ziklag'),
('05d809a8-3c02-3686-1bf4-b823ed53082f', 'de', 'Gat'),
('05d809a8-3c02-3686-1bf4-b823ed53082f', 'en', 'Gath'),
('4e06c52b-e1e5-f3a6-4bb7-749e8e14f124', 'de', 'Aschkelon'),
('4e06c52b-e1e5-f3a6-4bb7-749e8e14f124', 'en', 'Ashkelon'),
('0e3fb360-b4d2-2555-0fbc-283ba42b1508', 'de', 'Keïla'),
('0e3fb360-b4d2-2555-0fbc-283ba42b1508', 'en', 'Keilah'),
('93dd4e7b-a642-ec9a-0fac-afff480b2a23', 'de', 'Milch in einer Schale'),
('93dd4e7b-a642-ec9a-0fac-afff480b2a23', 'en', 'Milk in a bowl'),
('76c161a9-5bec-c1df-7b60-bf9c66596b82', 'de', 'Wasser aus einem Krug'),
('76c161a9-5bec-c1df-7b60-bf9c66596b82', 'en', 'Water from a jug'),
('230bfaa9-f7ba-20cc-c741-e601e17056db', 'de', 'Essig auf einem Schwamm'),
('230bfaa9-f7ba-20cc-c741-e601e17056db', 'en', 'Vinegar on a sponge'),
('7e254970-fee5-c32f-9ff6-19cd087b6f2c', 'de', 'Wein vermischt mit Honig'),
('7e254970-fee5-c32f-9ff6-19cd087b6f2c', 'en', 'Wine mixed with honey'),
('5ca55f21-c5a9-166d-5c4c-679fa3030ba9', 'de', 'Er ist ohne Hoffnung'),
('5ca55f21-c5a9-166d-5c4c-679fa3030ba9', 'en', 'He is without hope'),
('25a7c75a-f246-77f2-d1fe-856a9ad61c2a', 'de', 'Er steht unter dem Gesetz'),
('25a7c75a-f246-77f2-d1fe-856a9ad61c2a', 'en', 'He is under the law'),
('bfba266d-4804-8639-cd16-270b810a0086', 'de', 'Er bleibt der alte Mensch'),
('bfba266d-4804-8639-cd16-270b810a0086', 'en', 'He remains the old self'),
('cd8c7a78-b19d-651c-a202-b9d1c1ba8961', 'de', 'Er ist eine neue Schöpfung'),
('cd8c7a78-b19d-651c-a202-b9d1c1ba8961', 'en', 'He is a new creation'),
('c4df1e4c-6ee3-fed5-2ade-1e2eb6e8870f', 'de', 'Mit einem großen Stein'),
('c4df1e4c-6ee3-fed5-2ade-1e2eb6e8870f', 'en', 'With a large stone'),
('e30236ac-d061-d53c-e7fb-abc1fbadb3eb', 'de', 'Mit einem eisernen Tor'),
('e30236ac-d061-d53c-e7fb-abc1fbadb3eb', 'en', 'With an iron gate'),
('29eb9a45-578a-8072-8ebe-d72520f361ff', 'de', 'Mit einem schweren Vorhang'),
('29eb9a45-578a-8072-8ebe-d72520f361ff', 'en', 'With a heavy curtain'),
('41671df7-c9d9-2c33-9a75-6ae39019cb3e', 'de', 'Mit einer Mauer aus Lehm'),
('41671df7-c9d9-2c33-9a75-6ae39019cb3e', 'en', 'With a wall of clay'),
('a4975d2a-ac15-5ce1-ca48-268233b03bec', 'de', 'Er ging hinab in die Tiefe der Erde'),
('a4975d2a-ac15-5ce1-ca48-268233b03bec', 'en', 'He descended into the depths of the earth'),
('40b10d74-e6f6-2b24-bbd1-197a5fb7c1e7', 'de', 'Er wurde emporgehoben in den Himmel'),
('40b10d74-e6f6-2b24-bbd1-197a5fb7c1e7', 'en', 'He was lifted up into heaven'),
('f404f25c-4f90-1f64-92eb-2882f8f28f67', 'de', 'Er verschwand in einer Feuersäule'),
('f404f25c-4f90-1f64-92eb-2882f8f28f67', 'en', 'He disappeared in a pillar of fire'),
('48382a50-8461-5ddf-03c4-c4f5d116187a', 'de', 'Er entschwand im Glanz des Tempels'),
('48382a50-8461-5ddf-03c4-c4f5d116187a', 'en', 'He vanished in the splendor of the temple'),
('b7cf3e46-625f-a1da-48f4-2a04149fb907', 'de', 'Er wurde sechs Jahre im Tempel verborgen'),
('b7cf3e46-625f-a1da-48f4-2a04149fb907', 'en', 'He was hidden in the temple for six years'),
('28bedf50-e27a-2f64-1d1f-62e2a532b563', 'de', 'Er versteckte sich bei den Aramäern'),
('28bedf50-e27a-2f64-1d1f-62e2a532b563', 'en', 'He hid among the Arameans'),
('96013d66-c645-dea5-28d3-30421cc8aaee', 'de', 'Ein Engel verbarg ihn in einer Höhle'),
('96013d66-c645-dea5-28d3-30421cc8aaee', 'en', 'An angel concealed him in a cave'),
('5cdb5472-ce3f-2fb9-23eb-7325d21b2b88', 'de', 'Er wurde nach Ägypten gebracht'),
('5cdb5472-ce3f-2fb9-23eb-7325d21b2b88', 'en', 'He was taken to Egypt'),
('4d33e516-56eb-54f2-5ffa-a7445556131a', 'de', 'Eleasar, der Priester'),
('4d33e516-56eb-54f2-5ffa-a7445556131a', 'en', 'Eleazar the priest'),
('c1a9dc74-6067-2202-84ba-5fcaaef3cc4b', 'de', 'Hobab, der Midianiter'),
('c1a9dc74-6067-2202-84ba-5fcaaef3cc4b', 'en', 'Hobab the Midianite'),
('00161056-6dcf-15db-1229-6b6f0fba4e8f', 'de', 'Bileam, der Seher'),
('00161056-6dcf-15db-1229-6b6f0fba4e8f', 'en', 'Balaam the seer'),
('6a8e0777-ec4a-2247-7c04-4e44d4d7661f', 'de', 'Balak von Moab'),
('6a8e0777-ec4a-2247-7c04-4e44d4d7661f', 'en', 'Balak of Moab'),
('28889e65-34f9-7f17-377f-5b1f85b6ab33', 'de', 'Das Korn auf dem Markt zu verkaufen'),
('28889e65-34f9-7f17-377f-5b1f85b6ab33', 'en', 'To sell the grain at the market'),
