('e5ac4e76-fbe7-3c82-7497-c1e781029ef9', 'de', 'Zwei große Chöre zogen dankend auf der Mauer entlang'),
('e5ac4e76-fbe7-3c82-7497-c1e781029ef9', 'en', 'Two great choirs marched along the wall giving thanks'),
('d7fae723-77a2-8201-80c5-9d9c3958131e', 'de', 'Sie zogen schweigend zum Tempel hinab'),
('d7fae723-77a2-8201-80c5-9d9c3958131e', 'en', 'They went down silently to the temple'),
('596c54e6-02d6-fa74-18fb-c30313b003f8', 'de', 'Sie hielten ein stilles Fasten von einem Tag'),
('596c54e6-02d6-fa74-18fb-c30313b003f8', 'en', 'They held a silent fast for a day'),
('e3e88ae8-4716-9de8-a9dc-7cc0774452c7', 'de', 'Sie rissen die alten Tore endgültig nieder'),
('e3e88ae8-4716-9de8-a9dc-7cc0774452c7', 'en', 'They finally tore down the old gates'),
('bcce3cd2-69fe-b5b8-a982-ef0fc1f02571', 'de', 'Er hatte aus dem Vorratshaus gestohlen'),
('bcce3cd2-69fe-b5b8-a982-ef0fc1f02571', 'en', 'He had stolen from the storehouse'),
('6cd88943-9e2a-8c14-9026-dde58935ccfd', 'de', 'Potifars Frau beschuldigte ihn fälschlich'),
('6cd88943-9e2a-8c14-9026-dde58935ccfd', 'en', 'Potiphar''s wife falsely accused him'),
('5b6cc2fd-36d1-e649-7aa1-a01325366577', 'de', 'Er war beim Verkauf von Korn betrogen worden'),
('5b6cc2fd-36d1-e649-7aa1-a01325366577', 'en', 'He had been cheated in selling grain'),
('2c86164e-26d4-4810-cbbc-d63331c92142', 'de', 'Er hatte den Pharao beleidigt'),
('2c86164e-26d4-4810-cbbc-d63331c92142', 'en', 'He had insulted Pharaoh'),
('52f11e31-1f55-ce92-7ece-532584450d12', 'de', 'Sie solle Vorräte im Tempel lagern'),
('52f11e31-1f55-ce92-7ece-532584450d12', 'en', 'She should store provisions in the temple'),
('3eed7d6b-ea00-1b92-55e2-46dd93448abd', 'de', 'Sie solle zum König nach Samaria ziehen'),
('3eed7d6b-ea00-1b92-55e2-46dd93448abd', 'en', 'She should move to the king in Samaria'),
('593cbef6-0b40-c8dc-aa7b-e8624a982d22', 'de', 'Sie solle das Land verlassen und in der Fremde wohnen'),
('593cbef6-0b40-c8dc-aa7b-e8624a982d22', 'en', 'She should leave the land and live as a foreigner'),
('6226f4bf-c25d-9f2a-eded-3405e91b6767', 'de', 'Sie solle Felder am Jordan kaufen'),
('6226f4bf-c25d-9f2a-eded-3405e91b6767', 'en', 'She should buy fields by the Jordan'),
('d3dfa583-8529-e45c-3805-95b17cae0c92', 'de', '… der Weise meidet seine Mauern'),
('d3dfa583-8529-e45c-3805-95b17cae0c92', 'en', '… the wise avoid its walls'),
('eda84e0f-1157-65c1-9806-43501125777a', 'de', '… der König thront auf seiner Höhe'),
('eda84e0f-1157-65c1-9806-43501125777a', 'en', '… the king is enthroned on its height'),
('def38901-26f7-8465-f521-f4f9f43f08d0', 'de', '… der Reiche baut darauf sein Haus'),
('def38901-26f7-8465-f521-f4f9f43f08d0', 'en', '… the rich build their house on it'),
('2707f831-3dd1-6c1f-2354-ee00b99b12de', 'de', '… der Gerechte läuft hinein und ist geborgen'),
('2707f831-3dd1-6c1f-2354-ee00b99b12de', 'en', '… the righteous run into it and are safe'),
('b81a122a-ea5b-c39a-3839-0432ca72c38d', 'de', 'Drei Tage und drei Nächte'),
('b81a122a-ea5b-c39a-3839-0432ca72c38d', 'en', 'Three days and three nights'),
('279ef99d-d437-f225-e4b0-135a84273820', 'de', 'Zwölf Tage und zwölf Nächte'),
('279ef99d-d437-f225-e4b0-135a84273820', 'en', 'Twelve days and twelve nights'),
('deb806d1-36a7-a388-a5dd-e3168b0b7abb', 'de', 'Vierzig Tage und vierzig Nächte'),
('deb806d1-36a7-a388-a5dd-e3168b0b7abb', 'en', 'Forty days and forty nights'),
('49020b4a-c944-4c12-548c-58491cd5f52c', 'de', 'Sieben Tage und sieben Nächte'),
('49020b4a-c944-4c12-548c-58491cd5f52c', 'en', 'Seven days and seven nights'),
('c19bbba0-479d-5cc2-0301-b857c7233284', 'de', 'Er gab ihm nur die Weisheit, sonst nichts'),
('c19bbba0-479d-5cc2-0301-b857c7233284', 'en', 'He gave him only wisdom, nothing else'),
('bfad90d1-c771-88ed-301b-4b7949ecfd27', 'de', 'Er tadelte ihn für seine Anmaßung'),
('bfad90d1-c771-88ed-301b-4b7949ecfd27', 'en', 'He rebuked him for his presumption'),
('7dee9581-693e-d599-acf9-95a9c0294886', 'de', 'Er gab ihm zusätzlich Reichtum und Ehre, die er nicht erbeten hatte'),
('7dee9581-693e-d599-acf9-95a9c0294886', 'en', 'He also gave him riches and honor he had not asked for'),
('f5ac1dbf-7f78-6c87-d460-8ef0424e8060', 'de', 'Er forderte zuerst ein Opfer von tausend Rindern'),
('f5ac1dbf-7f78-6c87-d460-8ef0424e8060', 'en', 'He first demanded a sacrifice of a thousand oxen'),
('26fa1dd3-0363-3e98-36f2-b59bd0fb3d3a', 'de', 'Er streckte die Hand aus und rief: Ergreift ihn!'),
('26fa1dd3-0363-3e98-36f2-b59bd0fb3d3a', 'en', 'He stretched out his hand and cried: Seize him!'),
('0bce6b25-7259-3924-7ad2-e2bb2c8319f9', 'de', 'Er fiel betend zu Boden'),
('0bce6b25-7259-3924-7ad2-e2bb2c8319f9', 'en', 'He fell down praying'),
('ae26f517-3429-bcd5-cdbf-bd4aa43da2f5', 'de', 'Er floh aus der Stadt'),
('ae26f517-3429-bcd5-cdbf-bd4aa43da2f5', 'en', 'He fled from the city'),
('2da063bb-9dea-2d92-7b4b-70c2bd2a96f6', 'de', 'Er ließ den Altar abreißen'),
('2da063bb-9dea-2d92-7b4b-70c2bd2a96f6', 'en', 'He had the altar torn down'),
('455be1f3-333a-4590-4fd4-ff2c82a66a11', 'de', 'Lebe für den heutigen Tag allein'),
('455be1f3-333a-4590-4fd4-ff2c82a66a11', 'en', 'Live for today alone'),
('62763985-38d3-d73a-64e4-eaaedeae6ab9', 'de', 'Suche die Weisheit über alles'),
('62763985-38d3-d73a-64e4-eaaedeae6ab9', 'en', 'Seek wisdom above all'),
('10070ce3-c1a9-69b8-41f6-0d88e921f0a4', 'de', 'Sammle Reichtum und genieße ihn'),
('10070ce3-c1a9-69b8-41f6-0d88e921f0a4', 'en', 'Gather riches and enjoy them'),
('35c5a5f7-d818-0a68-50e0-9d5924c1cdb4', 'de', 'Fürchte Gott und halte seine Gebote'),
('35c5a5f7-d818-0a68-50e0-9d5924c1cdb4', 'en', 'Fear God and keep his commandments'),
('b2b6b446-50aa-adc8-6952-4442709c6b90', 'de', 'Im Haus seines Vaters'),
('b2b6b446-50aa-adc8-6952-4442709c6b90', 'en', 'In his father''s house'),
('b11c8d53-d617-4c36-eca3-964f2570b6d1', 'de', 'Hinter dem Altar'),
('b11c8d53-d617-4c36-eca3-964f2570b6d1', 'en', 'Behind the altar'),
('a2ba0775-de44-98c6-a5d8-052e7c2a877c', 'de', 'Zwischen dem Gepäck'),
('a2ba0775-de44-98c6-a5d8-052e7c2a877c', 'en', 'Among the baggage'),
('2c1396f5-c490-6e8f-662e-0114558839c4', 'de', 'In einer Höhle'),
('2c1396f5-c490-6e8f-662e-0114558839c4', 'en', 'In a cave'),
('1c63932e-0db1-70d1-73a0-b1d38debc4bb', 'de', 'Es wachse wie der Weinstock am Hang'),
('1c63932e-0db1-70d1-73a0-b1d38debc4bb', 'en', 'Let it grow like the vine on the slope'),
('e4544c14-6db5-b4b3-d412-4e3a26078d68', 'de', 'Es stehe fest wie die Berge Zions'),
('e4544c14-6db5-b4b3-d412-4e3a26078d68', 'en', 'Let it stand firm like the mountains of Zion'),
('25ee8e20-8cb1-5174-c7e5-13caffc6b369', 'de', 'Es ströme wie Wasser und wie ein nie versiegender Bach'),
('25ee8e20-8cb1-5174-c7e5-13caffc6b369', 'en', 'Let it roll down like waters and an ever-flowing stream'),
('bf8783a4-068c-9d2c-3ba4-c8f36b52973c', 'de', 'Es leuchte wie die Sonne am Mittag'),
('bf8783a4-068c-9d2c-3ba4-c8f36b52973c', 'en', 'Let it shine like the noonday sun'),
('e1a405d7-d50e-bc6d-802a-45723f5ca454', 'de', 'Das Passa in den Ebenen von Jericho'),
('e1a405d7-d50e-bc6d-802a-45723f5ca454', 'en', 'The Passover in the plains of Jericho'),
('771a6927-c568-808a-e4ec-6110dc8f171e', 'de', 'Das Passa in Silo'),
('771a6927-c568-808a-e4ec-6110dc8f171e', 'en', 'The Passover at Shiloh'),
('5a9f3d4d-d597-ca51-6488-7d888d5b0314', 'de', 'Das Passa am Sinai'),
('5a9f3d4d-d597-ca51-6488-7d888d5b0314', 'en', 'The Passover at Sinai'),
('ea03682f-2574-a6b9-3f87-683a9dab1344', 'de', 'Das Passa in Ägypten'),
('ea03682f-2574-a6b9-3f87-683a9dab1344', 'en', 'The Passover in Egypt'),
('23be63fb-8b99-6d08-fb30-49314e73f551', 'de', 'Ich richte die Tür mit dem Schwert'),
('23be63fb-8b99-6d08-fb30-49314e73f551', 'en', 'I judge the door with the sword'),
('d1eb6ce3-fe36-52a7-3dbc-7bf1d9752ca6', 'de', 'Ich verschließe die Tür mit dem Siegel'),
('d1eb6ce3-fe36-52a7-3dbc-7bf1d9752ca6', 'en', 'I shut the door with the seal'),
('1796beb4-392b-c0b1-3382-fd8f823c58c6', 'de', 'Ich öffne die Tür mit dem Schlüssel Davids'),
('1796beb4-392b-c0b1-3382-fd8f823c58c6', 'en', 'I open the door with the key of David'),
('23e25743-52f7-adf9-bd1c-aef74ce56194', 'de', 'Ich stehe vor der Tür und klopfe an'),
('23e25743-52f7-adf9-bd1c-aef74ce56194', 'en', 'I stand at the door and knock'),
('60ea322c-22bc-7c71-61d4-2b8b27b70109', 'de', 'Getragen von ihren eigenen Priestern'),
('60ea322c-22bc-7c71-61d4-2b8b27b70109', 'en', 'Carried by their own priests'),
('7a8cca6a-6f32-a64d-5c99-a6b545db9114', 'de', 'Auf einem Wagen, gezogen von zwei säugenden Kühen'),
('7a8cca6a-6f32-a64d-5c99-a6b545db9114', 'en', 'On a cart drawn by two milk cows'),
('a3691b7f-d697-cb6c-7ed9-253f5689d5cd', 'de', 'Begleitet von einem Heer als Geschenk'),
('a3691b7f-d697-cb6c-7ed9-253f5689d5cd', 'en', 'Escorted by an army as a gift'),
('88f1cecf-6874-16af-4365-f65e99c8e5ba', 'de', 'Auf einem Schiff über das Meer'),
('88f1cecf-6874-16af-4365-f65e99c8e5ba', 'en', 'On a ship across the sea'),
('136a2e52-b657-5f85-2728-a12ba39d1ab5', 'de', 'Es ist nur durch viele Opfer erfüllt'),
('136a2e52-b657-5f85-2728-a12ba39d1ab5', 'en', 'It is fulfilled only by many sacrifices'),
('25107661-04a4-dd99-fd6c-fe8118dab3ef', 'de', 'Es ist in einem Wort erfüllt: Liebe deinen Nächsten'),
('25107661-04a4-dd99-fd6c-fe8118dab3ef', 'en', 'It is fulfilled in one word: love your neighbor'),
('838a0898-55bd-d45c-e6a2-bef5043688e3', 'de', 'Es ist durch die Beschneidung erfüllt'),
('838a0898-55bd-d45c-e6a2-bef5043688e3', 'en', 'It is fulfilled by circumcision'),
('d7d62619-0d4d-b3dd-f9b0-923195ee46c1', 'de', 'Es kann von niemandem erfüllt werden'),
('d7d62619-0d4d-b3dd-f9b0-923195ee46c1', 'en', 'It can be fulfilled by no one'),
('16a7e891-05f6-e45e-38f3-c41424267829', 'de', 'Sie betete länger als alle anderen'),
('16a7e891-05f6-e45e-38f3-c41424267829', 'en', 'She prayed longer than all the others'),
('aae8c18d-0552-ecbe-6ba5-623d60954467', 'de', 'Sie hatte von ihrer Armut alles eingelegt, was sie hatte'),
('aae8c18d-0552-ecbe-6ba5-623d60954467', 'en', 'She put in everything she had out of her poverty'),
('2ef22f34-0ca8-1017-499f-8b612db1e7c8', 'de', 'Sie sang die schönsten Psalmen'),
('2ef22f34-0ca8-1017-499f-8b612db1e7c8', 'en', 'She sang the most beautiful psalms'),
('32d79307-637e-b22a-d973-806c8097377a', 'de', 'Sie brachte das größte Opfertier'),
('32d79307-637e-b22a-d973-806c8097377a', 'en', 'She brought the largest offering animal'),
('dee304c3-3760-4872-4d1b-6bced1f771c0', 'de', 'Israel wird in Knechtschaft fallen'),
('dee304c3-3760-4872-4d1b-6bced1f771c0', 'en', 'Israel will fall into bondage'),
('80adb72d-0815-a025-190a-a8d1b9aebeac', 'de', 'Die Stämme werden sich zerstreuen'),
('80adb72d-0815-a025-190a-a8d1b9aebeac', 'en', 'The tribes will be scattered'),
('f6dfc6c5-14fa-7044-b1fa-64c624f5bb96', 'de', 'Ein Stern wird aus Jakob aufgehen'),
('f6dfc6c5-14fa-7044-b1fa-64c624f5bb96', 'en', 'A star shall rise out of Jacob'),
('e5d4b425-2b9d-c7e0-2a2e-be6d253bbc49', 'de', 'Moab wird über Israel herrschen'),
('e5d4b425-2b9d-c7e0-2a2e-be6d253bbc49', 'en', 'Moab will rule over Israel'),
('a3331eb7-d779-06ee-1383-572ebb494325', 'de', 'Ich bin gekommen, Jerusalem zu richten'),
('a3331eb7-d779-06ee-1383-572ebb494325', 'en', 'I have come to judge Jerusalem'),
('4574795c-802d-a105-9fe6-788f0a137b59', 'de', 'Der Menschensohn ist gekommen, zu suchen und zu retten, was verloren ist'),
('4574795c-802d-a105-9fe6-788f0a137b59', 'en', 'The Son of Man came to seek and to save the lost'),
('c5569b96-0d05-d7ab-bd07-ec0c4a4eace5', 'de', 'Ich bin gekommen, das Gesetz aufzulösen'),
('c5569b96-0d05-d7ab-bd07-ec0c4a4eace5', 'en', 'I have come to abolish the law'),
('9b5f5b3f-e239-d050-695c-d5b0152daace', 'de', 'Ich bin gekommen, die Reichen zu mahnen'),
('9b5f5b3f-e239-d050-695c-d5b0152daace', 'en', 'I have come to admonish the rich'),
('6b59a822-ced9-bf89-8df9-90c26360b46e', 'de', 'Sei treu bis in den Tod, so gebe ich dir die Krone des Lebens'),
('6b59a822-ced9-bf89-8df9-90c26360b46e', 'en', 'Be faithful until death, and I will give you the crown of life'),
('1cc1301c-234a-7692-be19-0602a1b62e05', 'de', 'Du sollst eine Säule im Tempel sein'),
('1cc1301c-234a-7692-be19-0602a1b62e05', 'en', 'You shall be a pillar in the temple'),
('a7214894-e048-7f33-5630-54b0597db7ae', 'de', 'Du wirst gespeist vom verborgenen Manna'),
('a7214894-e048-7f33-5630-54b0597db7ae', 'en', 'You will be fed with the hidden manna'),
('d728aaca-ae5e-19fc-19a3-8caa351aca3e', 'de', 'Du wirst über die Völker mit eisernem Stab herrschen'),
('d728aaca-ae5e-19fc-19a3-8caa351aca3e', 'en', 'You will rule the nations with an iron rod'),
('2adea027-2410-11bf-b626-2c3d4b67ef4e', 'de', 'Ein goldenes Standbild'),
('2adea027-2410-11bf-b626-2c3d4b67ef4e', 'en', 'A golden image'),
('143d0dbe-7bb6-e013-a1cd-b7da0753e071', 'de', 'Ein zweites Tier'),
('143d0dbe-7bb6-e013-a1cd-b7da0753e071', 'en', 'A second beast'),
('9d30f89b-6d4f-a868-4c52-fcf53969aba0', 'de', 'Ein flammendes Schwert'),
('9d30f89b-6d4f-a868-4c52-fcf53969aba0', 'en', 'A flaming sword'),
('23c79a83-e88d-53f4-0890-9512e03f280c', 'de', 'Ein kleines Horn mit Augen und einem prahlenden Mund'),
('23c79a83-e88d-53f4-0890-9512e03f280c', 'en', 'A little horn with eyes and a boasting mouth'),
('3d09ea59-b4ae-7c33-9ba9-b1d7c77f1d59', 'de', 'Der Glaube kommt aus den Werken'),
('3d09ea59-b4ae-7c33-9ba9-b1d7c77f1d59', 'en', 'Faith comes from works'),
('c03521cd-96b0-800d-fb13-6d5db94d9d3e', 'de', 'Der Glaube kommt ohne das Wort'),
('c03521cd-96b0-800d-fb13-6d5db94d9d3e', 'en', 'Faith comes without the word'),
('1a0aa923-0295-b027-08c9-3904c9c9f4f7', 'de', 'Der Glaube kommt aus dem Hören der Botschaft'),
('1a0aa923-0295-b027-08c9-3904c9c9f4f7', 'en', 'Faith comes from hearing the message'),
('ea6a40cd-107a-fbc1-643c-ce24d1d0c1ef', 'de', 'Der Glaube kommt aus dem Gesetz'),
('ea6a40cd-107a-fbc1-643c-ce24d1d0c1ef', 'en', 'Faith comes from the law'),
('3f34876e-6ff4-a6ee-eef3-3fc923ef75a4', 'de', 'Um Regen für das Land zu erbitten'),
('3f34876e-6ff4-a6ee-eef3-3fc923ef75a4', 'en', 'To ask for rain on the land'),
('f8637808-9630-051d-5eca-7f02f76688d4', 'de', 'Um Krieg gegen Juda zu führen'),
('f8637808-9630-051d-5eca-7f02f76688d4', 'en', 'To wage war against Judah'),
('2116a4f0-1b32-d3d9-8e8f-881d90ec58ca', 'de', 'Um zu erfragen, ob er von seinem Sturz genesen werde'),
('2116a4f0-1b32-d3d9-8e8f-881d90ec58ca', 'en', 'To inquire whether he would recover from his fall'),
('57162815-8fea-db57-a982-392ce06b7c46', 'de', 'Um einen Erben zu erflehen'),
('57162815-8fea-db57-a982-392ce06b7c46', 'en', 'To plead for an heir'),
('97492c29-9e2c-9cd9-9f31-03fe7295f95d', 'de', 'Er werde als Prophet dem Herrn vorangehen, ihm den Weg zu bereiten'),
('97492c29-9e2c-9cd9-9f31-03fe7295f95d', 'en', 'He would go before the Lord as a prophet to prepare his way'),
('f67f1f60-23f2-fcf8-8df7-87d3c5496408', 'de', 'Er werde das Volk aus Ägypten führen'),
('f67f1f60-23f2-fcf8-8df7-87d3c5496408', 'en', 'He would lead the people out of Egypt'),
('76d50419-8dec-b1fe-a5e9-1e269315efad', 'de', 'Er werde ein König über Israel sein'),
('76d50419-8dec-b1fe-a5e9-1e269315efad', 'en', 'He would be a king over Israel'),
('f3904242-a83f-5b3a-f0ef-c3ef3556e71c', 'de', 'Er werde Hoherpriester im Tempel werden'),
('f3904242-a83f-5b3a-f0ef-c3ef3556e71c', 'en', 'He would become high priest in the temple'),
('a740b620-6c5a-b764-a7dd-85669cd62ab9', 'de', 'Den Staub von ihren Füßen schütteln zum Zeugnis'),
('a740b620-6c5a-b764-a7dd-85669cd62ab9', 'en', 'Shake the dust off their feet as a testimony'),
('6de31748-8aa4-16aa-1922-1cc494537cef', 'de', 'Über die Stadt einen Fluch sprechen'),
('6de31748-8aa4-16aa-1922-1cc494537cef', 'en', 'Speak a curse over the city'),
('eaba6607-e091-0b20-ffaa-3cc0243e4c3d', 'de', 'Sofort zu Jesus zurückkehren'),
('eaba6607-e091-0b20-ffaa-3cc0243e4c3d', 'en', 'Return at once to Jesus'),
('3a148ecf-9b9e-e7a8-adfe-911b5f2b9808', 'de', 'Drei Tage vor dem Tor warten'),
('3a148ecf-9b9e-e7a8-adfe-911b5f2b9808', 'en', 'Wait three days before the gate'),
('7c0f175e-7f86-0433-4ae2-5c3f0dfac68a', 'de', 'Vater, warum hast du mich verlassen'),
('7c0f175e-7f86-0433-4ae2-5c3f0dfac68a', 'en', 'Father, why have you forsaken me'),
('63172a84-f605-7a30-1031-1d76b58d315e', 'de', 'Es ist vollbracht'),
('63172a84-f605-7a30-1031-1d76b58d315e', 'en', 'It is finished'),
('f40d92a8-61cb-4e24-b941-696da876a2d4', 'de', 'Herr, rechne ihnen diese Sünde nicht zu'),
('f40d92a8-61cb-4e24-b941-696da876a2d4', 'en', 'Lord, do not hold this sin against them'),
('5955de0d-4b08-be50-2fbd-5068d67aa5d0', 'de', 'Herr, sende dein Feuer herab'),
('5955de0d-4b08-be50-2fbd-5068d67aa5d0', 'en', 'Lord, send down your fire'),
('19d81a0a-738e-e4af-f470-39c1c0b93553', 'de', 'Er zeigte ihnen die leere Grabhöhle'),
('19d81a0a-738e-e4af-f470-39c1c0b93553', 'en', 'He showed them the empty tomb'),
('76ed962e-246d-b03f-c1bd-958ae5920479', 'de', 'Er legte ihnen die Hände auf'),
('76ed962e-246d-b03f-c1bd-958ae5920479', 'en', 'He laid his hands on them'),
('39007bb0-7c26-5156-5b61-bdfc6e963ba0', 'de', 'Er entzündete ein Feuer vor ihnen'),
('39007bb0-7c26-5156-5b61-bdfc6e963ba0', 'en', 'He lit a fire before them'),
('846198f3-a750-4566-68e1-4192c3a7bf91', 'de', 'Er zeigte seine Hände und Füße und aß ein Stück Fisch'),
('846198f3-a750-4566-68e1-4192c3a7bf91', 'en', 'He showed his hands and feet and ate a piece of fish'),
('3b177714-dac1-9c80-b20e-ea7227273441', 'de', 'Er trocknete ihre Füße mit Asche'),
('3b177714-dac1-9c80-b20e-ea7227273441', 'en', 'He dried their feet with ashes'),
('97ed7796-e800-c624-8d6c-79bac1f4c1d3', 'de', 'Er bekleidete ihre Füße mit Sandalen'),
('97ed7796-e800-c624-8d6c-79bac1f4c1d3', 'en', 'He shod their feet with sandals'),
('9945a786-8ed2-2b34-c6b5-364ef753c309', 'de', 'Er wusch ihnen die Füße'),
('9945a786-8ed2-2b34-c6b5-364ef753c309', 'en', 'He washed their feet'),
('554d69f5-92d9-8bcc-0446-89769cce62e1', 'de', 'Er salbte ihnen die Füße mit Öl'),
('554d69f5-92d9-8bcc-0446-89769cce62e1', 'en', 'He anointed their feet with oil'),
('a5652714-51c1-2616-f236-7f81657f31b2', 'de', 'Jonadab, sein gerissener Vetter'),
('a5652714-51c1-2616-f236-7f81657f31b2', 'en', 'Jonadab, his crafty cousin'),
('122c682c-23af-d8e3-30b1-0655c3a97df1', 'de', 'Ahitofel, der Ratgeber'),
('122c682c-23af-d8e3-30b1-0655c3a97df1', 'en', 'Ahithophel, the counselor'),
('235e2dd4-dd33-19c3-bebf-8cb58e2eb2e9', 'de', 'Joab, der Heerführer'),
('235e2dd4-dd33-19c3-bebf-8cb58e2eb2e9', 'en', 'Joab, the army commander'),
('9699ac2e-898b-987a-03d4-f0e6f0ec66b2', 'de', 'Absalom, sein Bruder'),
('9699ac2e-898b-987a-03d4-f0e6f0ec66b2', 'en', 'Absalom, his brother'),
('d8053cca-f018-fda2-255b-914cb2ac0a14', 'de', 'Eine Stimme aus dem Feuer'),
('d8053cca-f018-fda2-255b-914cb2ac0a14', 'en', 'A voice from the fire'),
('b45ab305-9962-767e-3aba-78c0eb288fa7', 'de', 'Der verstorbene Samuel'),
('b45ab305-9962-767e-3aba-78c0eb288fa7', 'en', 'The deceased Samuel'),
('f8225093-d0ed-b014-bf3e-4f943edc82bb', 'de', 'Ein Engel des HERRN'),
('f8225093-d0ed-b014-bf3e-4f943edc82bb', 'en', 'An angel of the LORD'),
('d82f78d5-8626-0792-0f96-3c9905915435', 'de', 'Der Geist Elis'),
('d82f78d5-8626-0792-0f96-3c9905915435', 'en', 'The spirit of Eli'),
('5e2c6acb-667c-ed0f-9188-eb776d9532b4', 'de', 'Licht kam aus der Finsternis hervor'),
('5e2c6acb-667c-ed0f-9188-eb776d9532b4', 'en', 'Light came forth out of the darkness'),
('e6ea9453-8002-264f-a8ec-8a15c0f9c3d4', 'de', 'Leben sprang aus dem toten Holz'),
('e6ea9453-8002-264f-a8ec-8a15c0f9c3d4', 'en', 'Life sprang from the dead wood'),
('4c97862f-6338-a0da-4ca8-388a4b7bd1b8', 'de', 'Speise ging vom Fresser aus, Süßigkeit vom Starken'),
('4c97862f-6338-a0da-4ca8-388a4b7bd1b8', 'en', 'Out of the eater came food, out of the strong came sweetness'),
('4d9ead83-fc8f-9fd6-5ba7-944745e9cdce', 'de', 'Wasser floss aus dem dürren Stein'),
('4d9ead83-fc8f-9fd6-5ba7-944745e9cdce', 'en', 'Water flowed from the dry stone'),
('d1bf7a10-62c3-b86f-bd87-f8b81bef8ed6', 'de', 'Verdammnis trotz des Glaubens'),
('d1bf7a10-62c3-b86f-bd87-f8b81bef8ed6', 'en', 'Condemnation despite faith'),
('68d1bd95-a6e8-d101-6814-4e8b0e64a535', 'de', 'Verdammnis für alle Menschen'),
('68d1bd95-a6e8-d101-6814-4e8b0e64a535', 'en', 'Condemnation for all people'),
('fcb473fb-02ed-77e8-6b77-92a0b2b01736', 'de', 'Keine Verdammnis für die in Christus Jesus'),
('fcb473fb-02ed-77e8-6b77-92a0b2b01736', 'en', 'No condemnation for those in Christ Jesus'),
('106a1f3d-09e7-da8a-4a63-5bbbd3b3beff', 'de', 'Verdammnis für die Schwachen'),
('106a1f3d-09e7-da8a-4a63-5bbbd3b3beff', 'en', 'Condemnation for the weak')
insert into public.answer_option_translations (option_id, lang, text) values
('a8ccc365-9296-39ce-9ca0-82edaafe49e8', 'de', 'Verwerft alles ohne Prüfung'),
('a8ccc365-9296-39ce-9ca0-82edaafe49e8', 'en', 'Reject everything without testing'),
('bf29e798-a027-f0b0-711d-5085cabd91ff', 'de', 'Nehmt alles ohne Prüfung an'),
('bf29e798-a027-f0b0-711d-5085cabd91ff', 'en', 'Accept everything without testing'),
('c1f5af7c-3209-dec3-6ee1-bf438bc096ec', 'de', 'Prüft alles und behaltet das Gute'),
('c1f5af7c-3209-dec3-6ee1-bf438bc096ec', 'en', 'Test everything and hold fast what is good'),
('899a1eb5-9fd7-161c-3dc3-fc7490b7e32f', 'de', 'Behaltet das Böse und verwerft das Gute'),
('899a1eb5-9fd7-161c-3dc3-fc7490b7e32f', 'en', 'Hold fast the evil and reject the good'),
('1f6a72a9-997e-d9b6-c336-54c36533b65d', 'de', 'Alle Dinge wenden sich gegen sie'),
('1f6a72a9-997e-d9b6-c336-54c36533b65d', 'en', 'All things turn against them'),
('4b8dfc2a-96b1-04a3-463c-451874792724', 'de', 'Alle Dinge dienen ihnen zum Guten'),
('4b8dfc2a-96b1-04a3-463c-451874792724', 'en', 'All things work together for their good'),
('3a8bffa4-2b76-a729-7f4f-d8cbb0b543fd', 'de', 'Nur das Gesetz dient ihnen zum Guten'),
('3a8bffa4-2b76-a729-7f4f-d8cbb0b543fd', 'en', 'Only the law works for their good'),
('ca6aa397-4aa8-6215-3551-e4f236319a04', 'de', 'Nichts kommt ihnen zugute'),
('ca6aa397-4aa8-6215-3551-e4f236319a04', 'en', 'Nothing benefits them'),
('e1618fe6-1502-1265-b34e-8dfbccf2856f', 'de', 'Das Passahfest'),
('e1618fe6-1502-1265-b34e-8dfbccf2856f', 'en', 'The Passover'),
('385aaf7b-fd28-0a54-38c3-320d75446752', 'de', 'Das Fest des Posaunenblasens'),
('385aaf7b-fd28-0a54-38c3-320d75446752', 'en', 'The Feast of Trumpets'),
('a374c770-85df-e422-fdfb-abb2ddf2359d', 'de', 'Das Wochenfest'),
('a374c770-85df-e422-fdfb-abb2ddf2359d', 'en', 'The Feast of Weeks'),
('2cc2120e-9b2d-bac0-f0e3-aa9b42a1afcd', 'de', 'Der Tag der Erstlinge'),
('2cc2120e-9b2d-bac0-f0e3-aa9b42a1afcd', 'en', 'The Day of Firstfruits'),
('eff3988c-c666-e123-bef9-940bd19e38f5', 'de', 'Gott habe ihn zum Hohepriester gemacht'),
('eff3988c-c666-e123-bef9-940bd19e38f5', 'en', 'God had made him high priest'),
('536b792c-621e-81bf-fd9f-32920ff20c51', 'de', 'Gott werde fortan nur in diesem Tempel wohnen'),
('536b792c-621e-81bf-fd9f-32920ff20c51', 'en', 'God would now dwell only in this temple'),
('45c234b5-d0b8-3ebe-4717-3a625771704c', 'de', 'Selbst der Himmel könne Gott nicht fassen, wie viel weniger dieses Haus'),
('45c234b5-d0b8-3ebe-4717-3a625771704c', 'en', 'Even heaven cannot contain God, how much less this house'),
('2fbadab4-227e-edd7-0bf8-e78849e39190', 'de', 'Gott habe den Tempel für ewig verlassen'),
('2fbadab4-227e-edd7-0bf8-e78849e39190', 'en', 'God had forsaken the temple forever'),
('fcf15e32-a823-fd6f-c8ae-ed9c3712fa54', 'de', 'Er hat niemanden erwählt'),
('fcf15e32-a823-fd6f-c8ae-ed9c3712fa54', 'en', 'He chose no one'),
('76a3ad4f-28ee-5501-04e7-a8d7245aa3b8', 'de', 'Er hat uns erst am Ende erwählt'),
('76a3ad4f-28ee-5501-04e7-a8d7245aa3b8', 'en', 'He chose us only at the end'),
('9de11fff-128a-fcbf-ac62-69b7d3a61cc0', 'de', 'Er hat uns vor Grundlegung der Welt erwählt'),
('9de11fff-128a-fcbf-ac62-69b7d3a61cc0', 'en', 'He chose us before the foundation of the world'),
('d310660b-3f28-5f06-3a9a-bf1b76064e2b', 'de', 'Er hat uns nach unseren Werken erwählt'),
('d310660b-3f28-5f06-3a9a-bf1b76064e2b', 'en', 'He chose us according to our works'),
('8835fce4-1fa1-5341-1fc8-c6b18263be18', 'de', '… aber der HERR lenkt seinen Schritt'),
('8835fce4-1fa1-5341-1fc8-c6b18263be18', 'en', '… but the LORD directs his steps'),
('838c156b-09bf-1793-78e2-2b57190b2939', 'de', '… aber der Mensch geht stets recht'),
('838c156b-09bf-1793-78e2-2b57190b2939', 'en', '… but man always goes rightly'),
('b971af7a-9353-a0d9-0a4b-5ae3c7db5909', 'de', '… aber niemand kennt den Ausgang'),
('b971af7a-9353-a0d9-0a4b-5ae3c7db5909', 'en', '… but no one knows the outcome'),
('b8dc4156-efc1-0cdd-acd2-7a35ad66cfb8', 'de', '… aber der Reichtum bestimmt den Weg'),
('b8dc4156-efc1-0cdd-acd2-7a35ad66cfb8', 'en', '… but riches determine the way'),
('234d2c93-0e5c-4ca7-e4cf-e1b9319b51d5', 'de', 'Nach Westen, Norden und Süden'),
('234d2c93-0e5c-4ca7-e4cf-e1b9319b51d5', 'en', 'Westward, northward, and southward'),
('cff1654a-0fad-c101-7de2-b66a065bba0e', 'de', 'Nur nach oben'),
('cff1654a-0fad-c101-7de2-b66a065bba0e', 'en', 'Only upward'),
('ca916822-c985-a710-f8db-ea8f7580dc2c', 'de', 'In alle vier Himmelsrichtungen'),
('ca916822-c985-a710-f8db-ea8f7580dc2c', 'en', 'In all four directions'),
('c834cb9c-e783-a23a-0059-d225924ecc8e', 'de', 'Nur nach Osten'),
('c834cb9c-e783-a23a-0059-d225924ecc8e', 'en', 'Only eastward'),
('c8b037b4-c434-eab9-947e-8fc742bbf16a', 'de', 'Bringt mehr Brandopfer auf dem Altar dar'),
('c8b037b4-c434-eab9-947e-8fc742bbf16a', 'en', 'Offer more burnt offerings on the altar'),
('c56c408f-5687-5d49-e343-f67e954eed55', 'de', 'Lernt Gutes tun, schafft dem Bedrängten Recht'),
('c56c408f-5687-5d49-e343-f67e954eed55', 'en', 'Learn to do good, seek justice for the oppressed'),
('3589225c-1990-bc58-5cfa-e3cc5dcd7067', 'de', 'Singt lauter eure Loblieder im Tempel'),
('3589225c-1990-bc58-5cfa-e3cc5dcd7067', 'en', 'Sing your praises louder in the temple'),
('4ca63594-b1f6-aa66-df42-2eca5f3b323c', 'de', 'Versammelt euch zahlreicher an den Festen'),
('4ca63594-b1f6-aa66-df42-2eca5f3b323c', 'en', 'Gather in greater numbers at the feasts'),
('f4cd721a-5d99-808b-6814-1ddb7bed3173', 'de', 'Pinhas, der Sohn Eleasars'),
('f4cd721a-5d99-808b-6814-1ddb7bed3173', 'en', 'Phinehas, son of Eleazar'),
('229e7f89-2543-1981-8881-49efdaaf469d', 'de', 'Kaleb, der Sohn Jephunnes'),
('229e7f89-2543-1981-8881-49efdaaf469d', 'en', 'Caleb, son of Jephunneh'),
('8481ec60-e349-1f7b-8403-e44442eb0233', 'de', 'Josua, der Sohn Nuns'),
('8481ec60-e349-1f7b-8403-e44442eb0233', 'en', 'Joshua, son of Nun'),
('c7a77060-3e27-7e45-a0c3-806ecf460107', 'de', 'Eleasar, der Sohn Aarons'),
('c7a77060-3e27-7e45-a0c3-806ecf460107', 'en', 'Eleazar, son of Aaron'),
('afb89820-dcd6-00a5-42d8-c4c42c2245fc', 'de', 'Mose warf Ofenruß in die Luft'),
('afb89820-dcd6-00a5-42d8-c4c42c2245fc', 'en', 'Moses threw soot from a furnace into the air'),
('a5596154-0617-8828-9daa-23f150f2afd2', 'de', 'Mose schlug auf den Staub der Erde'),
('a5596154-0617-8828-9daa-23f150f2afd2', 'en', 'Moses struck the dust of the earth'),
('11b61cc8-93f8-b5f7-5c72-eb8746383f78', 'de', 'Mose goss Wasser auf den Boden'),
('11b61cc8-93f8-b5f7-5c72-eb8746383f78', 'en', 'Moses poured water on the ground'),
('04862a71-78c9-5fbe-cded-808eec376831', 'de', 'Mose streckte den Stab zum Himmel'),
('04862a71-78c9-5fbe-cded-808eec376831', 'en', 'Moses stretched the staff toward the sky'),
('2ed7eda9-5517-2ce9-8e93-2552e5f1b5bf', 'de', 'Sie solle nach Ägypten weiterziehen'),
('2ed7eda9-5517-2ce9-8e93-2552e5f1b5bf', 'en', 'She should go on to Egypt'),
('e163ae2f-d89a-0492-9e87-c374bc72ff01', 'de', 'Sie solle zu ihrer Herrin zurückkehren'),
('e163ae2f-d89a-0492-9e87-c374bc72ff01', 'en', 'She should return to her mistress'),
('9090e0d3-a1c0-0164-c855-95e0efc7093b', 'de', 'Sie solle einen Brunnen graben'),
('9090e0d3-a1c0-0164-c855-95e0efc7093b', 'en', 'She should dig a well'),
('47d81a8c-b951-1565-25c2-ddca0beec9b5', 'de', 'Sie solle den Sohn in der Wüste lassen'),
('47d81a8c-b951-1565-25c2-ddca0beec9b5', 'en', 'She should leave the son in the wilderness'),
('f29caa1f-c3e8-fda5-cfc7-ca25c1acedc1', 'de', 'Eine Finsternis bedeckte das ganze Land'),
('f29caa1f-c3e8-fda5-cfc7-ca25c1acedc1', 'en', 'A darkness covered the whole land'),
('bc0ef829-e1b9-46ec-b0c7-d94229cd65d7', 'de', 'Ein Sturm zerbrach die Bäume'),
('bc0ef829-e1b9-46ec-b0c7-d94229cd65d7', 'en', 'A storm broke the trees'),
('d3838773-fcab-1f94-1322-90fe311e3990', 'de', 'Ein Tau fiel auf die Felder'),
('d3838773-fcab-1f94-1322-90fe311e3990', 'en', 'A dew fell upon the fields'),
('37e269b3-6e21-ed63-bca6-d034a38bda49', 'de', 'Ein Regen löschte die Feuer der Stadt'),
('37e269b3-6e21-ed63-bca6-d034a38bda49', 'en', 'A rain quenched the fires of the city'),
('2d287f6c-5f38-eafe-a888-436aa3bf7469', 'de', 'Der Geist der Buße und der Reue'),
('2d287f6c-5f38-eafe-a888-436aa3bf7469', 'en', 'The spirit of repentance and remorse'),
('69a0bd9a-fbd4-2fc7-da8f-f59a0d541421', 'de', 'Der Geist des Eifers und des Zorns'),
('69a0bd9a-fbd4-2fc7-da8f-f59a0d541421', 'en', 'The spirit of zeal and of wrath'),
('70f31c01-ea50-c577-9899-75ce42ed4d88', 'de', 'Der Geist der Weisheit und des Verstandes'),
('70f31c01-ea50-c577-9899-75ce42ed4d88', 'en', 'The Spirit of wisdom and understanding'),
('7f30d336-4726-22da-983f-62d465e8fd22', 'de', 'Der Geist der Sanftmut und der Geduld'),
('7f30d336-4726-22da-983f-62d465e8fd22', 'en', 'The spirit of meekness and patience'),
('09bbbafd-6d77-b8de-eec4-c5267dbd3e20', 'de', 'Der gerechte Richter, der die Völker prüft'),
('09bbbafd-6d77-b8de-eec4-c5267dbd3e20', 'en', 'The righteous judge, who tests the nations'),
('42b7e967-dd72-350f-4d74-b3d18249c493', 'de', 'Der starke Held, der die Feinde zerschmettert'),
('42b7e967-dd72-350f-4d74-b3d18249c493', 'en', 'The mighty hero, who shatters the enemies'),
('72222085-cdfe-f756-869e-2b148ecef4fb', 'de', 'Der treue Hirte, der seine Herde sammelt'),
('72222085-cdfe-f756-869e-2b148ecef4fb', 'en', 'The faithful shepherd, who gathers his flock'),
('41c931cf-52cb-b38e-a6ad-16a10abe2a0f', 'de', 'Der ewige Gott, der die Enden der Erde geschaffen hat'),
('41c931cf-52cb-b38e-a6ad-16a10abe2a0f', 'en', 'The everlasting God, who created the ends of the earth'),
('0b3574be-d336-d051-fae4-9fb28060dda3', 'de', 'Sie verbarg die Münze sorgfältig'),
('0b3574be-d336-d051-fae4-9fb28060dda3', 'en', 'She carefully hid the coin'),
('0440ddd8-3f68-1778-63fa-6da687e93147', 'de', 'Sie gab das Geld den Armen'),
('0440ddd8-3f68-1778-63fa-6da687e93147', 'en', 'She gave the money to the poor'),
('eb559794-32cf-38d9-b7fa-371b084477c6', 'de', 'Sie rief Freundinnen und Nachbarinnen zur Freude zusammen'),
('eb559794-32cf-38d9-b7fa-371b084477c6', 'en', 'She called friends and neighbors together to rejoice'),
('877b9fd8-672b-a504-cc01-ffa2c2fe796f', 'de', 'Sie ging damit zum Tempel'),
('877b9fd8-672b-a504-cc01-ffa2c2fe796f', 'en', 'She took it to the temple'),
('6387a305-20b2-83c0-272f-54d0af627643', 'de', 'Er heilte einen kranken Diener'),
('6387a305-20b2-83c0-272f-54d0af627643', 'en', 'He healed a sick servant'),
('8db5972c-9d03-7ffd-2af4-399695943fe5', 'de', 'Er speiste die Gäste mit wenigen Broten'),
('8db5972c-9d03-7ffd-2af4-399695943fe5', 'en', 'He fed the guests with a few loaves'),
('4266c4ce-5dd4-78cc-ec01-4258184cffed', 'de', 'Er verwandelte Wasser in Wein'),
('4266c4ce-5dd4-78cc-ec01-4258184cffed', 'en', 'He turned water into wine'),
('b8e449aa-8cdc-0313-dd83-12f95621a0f6', 'de', 'Er stillte einen plötzlichen Sturm'),
('b8e449aa-8cdc-0313-dd83-12f95621a0f6', 'en', 'He calmed a sudden storm'),
('42a7d320-6937-3866-915f-ca0fa381e7e0', 'de', 'Den Priestern des Tempels'),
('42a7d320-6937-3866-915f-ca0fa381e7e0', 'en', 'The priests of the temple'),
('3bed825c-ab85-3b46-bfad-5361af7a705f', 'de', 'Den Propheten aus Bethel'),
('3bed825c-ab85-3b46-bfad-5361af7a705f', 'en', 'The prophets from Bethel'),
('5e089fd4-8aa8-b7ce-5eff-e0ade525335b', 'de', 'Den Ältesten seines Vaters'),
('5e089fd4-8aa8-b7ce-5eff-e0ade525335b', 'en', 'The elders of his father'),
('a2869f8e-3c4f-f9f6-8c81-5dc72adc77af', 'de', 'Den jungen Männern, die mit ihm aufgewachsen waren'),
('a2869f8e-3c4f-f9f6-8c81-5dc72adc77af', 'en', 'The young men who had grown up with him'),
('730cff4f-3fc7-a553-7ef0-0eff9de3a630', 'de', 'Gott wird sie nach Edom verbannen'),
('730cff4f-3fc7-a553-7ef0-0eff9de3a630', 'en', 'God will banish them to Edom'),
('c92b60be-a42a-35d8-6f53-643282e93461', 'de', 'Gott wird sie an Assyrien verkaufen'),
('c92b60be-a42a-35d8-6f53-643282e93461', 'en', 'God will sell them to Assyria'),
('9dc3542c-b9ca-47bb-9650-0bb7b63bf420', 'de', 'Gott wird über ihnen jubeln mit Freude'),
('9dc3542c-b9ca-47bb-9650-0bb7b63bf420', 'en', 'God will rejoice over them with gladness'),
('e3ca50e1-8557-4793-5737-7b4a89601efd', 'de', 'Gott wird ihre Städte verbrennen'),
('e3ca50e1-8557-4793-5737-7b4a89601efd', 'en', 'God will burn their cities'),
('2060d787-c264-1b2c-79b3-5e8cb93e82e6', 'de', 'Überlasst das Richten den Ältesten'),
('2060d787-c264-1b2c-79b3-5e8cb93e82e6', 'en', 'Leave judging to the elders'),
('7d91f57c-a834-e0ec-e2c1-cdbb73385bfe', 'de', 'Richtet die Schuldigen vor dem Volk'),
('7d91f57c-a834-e0ec-e2c1-cdbb73385bfe', 'en', 'Judge the guilty before the people'),
('fa729b3e-ccfb-7fbe-6ef9-97581bee9b9e', 'de', 'Richtet nicht, damit ihr nicht gerichtet werdet'),
('fa729b3e-ccfb-7fbe-6ef9-97581bee9b9e', 'en', 'Judge not, that you be not judged'),
('e8b362d3-da6c-8bb6-7baa-ac1f75fe270e', 'de', 'Richtet streng, damit Recht geschehe'),
('e8b362d3-da6c-8bb6-7baa-ac1f75fe270e', 'en', 'Judge strictly, that justice be done'),
('cddd34d2-1f34-78cc-ffe2-7341fedb0a9f', 'de', 'Sie auf den Feldern verbrennen'),
('cddd34d2-1f34-78cc-ffe2-7341fedb0a9f', 'en', 'Burn them in the fields'),
('d8671ab2-60ea-c88e-ae99-6910f5da9a7a', 'de', 'Sie an die Nachbarvölker verteilen'),
('d8671ab2-60ea-c88e-ae99-6910f5da9a7a', 'en', 'Distribute them to neighboring peoples'),
('f02da693-50db-f416-cf84-07f837a68fb6', 'de', 'Sie für Notzeiten aufbewahren'),
('f02da693-50db-f416-cf84-07f837a68fb6', 'en', 'Store them for times of need'),
('54a4cbfc-5962-6919-f24e-d4974eb0999a', 'de', 'Sie in einem Korb zum Heiligtum bringen'),
('54a4cbfc-5962-6919-f24e-d4974eb0999a', 'en', 'Bring them in a basket to the sanctuary'),
('265c7b24-89e5-b53a-fa2d-962889efcf31', 'de', 'Sie bauten ihre Häuser, doch das Gotteshaus lag wüst'),
('265c7b24-89e5-b53a-fa2d-962889efcf31', 'en', 'They built their own houses while God''s house lay in ruins'),
('9d3e3064-d98f-958b-69f3-ecc9ae15cb76', 'de', 'Sie hatten Babylon vertraut'),
('9d3e3064-d98f-958b-69f3-ecc9ae15cb76', 'en', 'They had trusted in Babylon'),
('a9a19fc8-2abe-c069-516e-3790c75d1cad', 'de', 'Sie hatten die Beschneidung vergessen'),
('a9a19fc8-2abe-c069-516e-3790c75d1cad', 'en', 'They had forgotten circumcision'),
('9a2dcadb-1051-a9e7-04c9-e09460b458f8', 'de', 'Sie hatten falsche Propheten gehört'),
('9a2dcadb-1051-a9e7-04c9-e09460b458f8', 'en', 'They had listened to false prophets'),
('d5600569-2ec3-49b3-879c-4c94cf5d9292', 'de', 'Sie wurden den Priestern zum Gebrauch gegeben'),
('d5600569-2ec3-49b3-879c-4c94cf5d9292', 'en', 'They were given to the priests for use'),
('af432eb6-7023-407a-f94e-5583f3a53f26', 'de', 'Sie wurden zu Blech für den Altar gehämmert'),
('af432eb6-7023-407a-f94e-5583f3a53f26', 'en', 'They were hammered into plating for the altar'),
('02238760-e235-7656-b1a8-e38562916d28', 'de', 'Sie wurden im Feuer eingeschmolzen und verworfen'),
('02238760-e235-7656-b1a8-e38562916d28', 'en', 'They were melted in fire and discarded'),
('6cbbdd7b-ad4e-2425-d7eb-83f75733af41', 'de', 'Sie wurden im Lager vergraben'),
('6cbbdd7b-ad4e-2425-d7eb-83f75733af41', 'en', 'They were buried in the camp'),
('89ccf03d-011c-cff3-53f6-7a06cb33432f', 'de', 'Auf ihre Reiterheere'),
('89ccf03d-011c-cff3-53f6-7a06cb33432f', 'en', 'On their cavalry armies'),
('2b2fe89a-f139-1e16-e4b9-00880c698e85', 'de', 'Auf ihre Wohnung in den Felsenhöhen'),
('2b2fe89a-f139-1e16-e4b9-00880c698e85', 'en', 'On their dwelling in the heights of the rock'),
('d346ddaa-a244-96ae-85c1-39258b601c34', 'de', 'Auf ihre goldenen Tempel'),
('d346ddaa-a244-96ae-85c1-39258b601c34', 'en', 'On their golden temples'),
('bb4c8587-65eb-7808-8ffc-20c0a8f766e1', 'de', 'Auf ihre Bündnisse mit Ägypten'),
('bb4c8587-65eb-7808-8ffc-20c0a8f766e1', 'en', 'On their alliances with Egypt'),
('64196402-81b3-a3b2-7e71-43d1346c690a', 'de', 'Sie wurden gesteinigt und verbrannt'),
('64196402-81b3-a3b2-7e71-43d1346c690a', 'en', 'They were stoned and burned'),
('1f2bfeca-64fb-4a87-b005-af9894341de4', 'de', 'Sie wurden den Gibeonitern übergeben'),
('1f2bfeca-64fb-4a87-b005-af9894341de4', 'en', 'They were handed to the Gibeonites'),
('e6c35ff0-1448-fe2b-f077-aa1d63c19ed4', 'de', 'Sie wurden ins Ausland verkauft'),
('e6c35ff0-1448-fe2b-f077-aa1d63c19ed4', 'en', 'They were sold abroad'),
('78fb6564-5c5f-6406-4388-d385e1ed4fa0', 'de', 'Sie wurden aus dem Lager verbannt'),
('78fb6564-5c5f-6406-4388-d385e1ed4fa0', 'en', 'They were banished from the camp'),
('87106b82-5288-5077-fdf3-107c19ce6f25', 'de', 'Mein Haus soll über Israel herrschen'),
('87106b82-5288-5077-fdf3-107c19ce6f25', 'en', 'My house shall rule over Israel'),
('eefa87a8-8916-8f33-b98e-d2076c4c641d', 'de', 'Ich werde nie von hier weichen'),
('eefa87a8-8916-8f33-b98e-d2076c4c641d', 'en', 'I will never depart from here'),
('fa90e8be-8727-eeca-8fb0-20f0e33b8ce4', 'de', 'Ich übergebe alles in eure Hand'),
('fa90e8be-8727-eeca-8fb0-20f0e33b8ce4', 'en', 'I hand everything into your hand'),
('9be82b5f-4c0d-4da6-71aa-c1b6a29ea0ff', 'de', 'Ich aber und mein Haus, wir wollen dem HERRN dienen'),
('9be82b5f-4c0d-4da6-71aa-c1b6a29ea0ff', 'en', 'But I and my house, we will serve the LORD'),
('0408d99d-3126-7a4d-6548-a71f823a3a8e', 'de', 'Sie behielt alle Worte und bewegte sie in ihrem Herzen'),
('0408d99d-3126-7a4d-6548-a71f823a3a8e', 'en', 'She kept all these words and pondered them in her heart'),
('247f1877-2c35-f355-fa15-76e40ff7aa32', 'de', 'Sie fragte sie nach dem Weg zum Tempel'),
('247f1877-2c35-f355-fa15-76e40ff7aa32', 'en', 'She asked them the way to the temple'),
('8d611a5b-ece0-a109-6e8c-25bf6f1980e7', 'de', 'Sie bat sie um Schweigen'),
('8d611a5b-ece0-a109-6e8c-25bf6f1980e7', 'en', 'She begged them to keep silent'),
('690bf12f-b36e-cf03-67b7-8fcd3849707a', 'de', 'Sie schickte die Hirten wieder fort'),
('690bf12f-b36e-cf03-67b7-8fcd3849707a', 'en', 'She sent the shepherds away again'),
('91f93e96-a32c-c613-161d-9b5ec3ccaaf8', 'de', 'Wer ihnen den Stein wegwälzen werde'),
('91f93e96-a32c-c613-161d-9b5ec3ccaaf8', 'en', 'Who would roll away the stone for them'),
('558d5fb3-89df-56d0-cfb8-a5c1b55265c9', 'de', 'Wo sie Salben kaufen könnten'),
('558d5fb3-89df-56d0-cfb8-a5c1b55265c9', 'en', 'Where they could buy spices'),
('d575c8b1-ea0e-3d1b-9705-fee54d092526', 'de', 'Ob der Sabbat schon vorüber sei'),
('d575c8b1-ea0e-3d1b-9705-fee54d092526', 'en', 'Whether the Sabbath was already over'),
('128d9ba1-0923-2548-a9d2-e91cbc21068f', 'de', 'Ob die Wache sie aufhalten werde'),
('128d9ba1-0923-2548-a9d2-e91cbc21068f', 'en', 'Whether the guard would stop them'),
('50383a02-c228-fc9c-f9e5-2a2d8e2f2355', 'de', 'Er floh in die Wüste und verbarg sich'),
('50383a02-c228-fc9c-f9e5-2a2d8e2f2355', 'en', 'He fled into the wilderness and hid'),
('44b79e98-83c7-20eb-fdc1-0518e3bec012', 'de', 'Er verfluchte den Tag seiner Geburt sofort'),
('44b79e98-83c7-20eb-fdc1-0518e3bec012', 'en', 'He immediately cursed the day of his birth'),
('ff177ddf-59f8-5ba4-a3ba-f05056935491', 'de', 'Er fiel zur Erde nieder und betete an'),
('ff177ddf-59f8-5ba4-a3ba-f05056935491', 'en', 'He fell to the ground and worshiped'),
('bf0b02c4-5e84-6009-76f3-7c7835a813a6', 'de', 'Er forderte Gott vor Gericht heraus'),
('bf0b02c4-5e84-6009-76f3-7c7835a813a6', 'en', 'He challenged God to a court trial'),
('c56ff4b1-f121-580c-ca8e-b102637be109', 'de', 'Wer hat den Regen je zurückgehalten?'),
('c56ff4b1-f121-580c-ca8e-b102637be109', 'en', 'Who has ever held back the rain?'),
('7ed751d3-a197-f6fd-7fe6-c0aba1dd6f2c', 'de', 'Wer ist der Vater des Regens und wer zeugt die Tropfen des Taus?'),
('7ed751d3-a197-f6fd-7fe6-c0aba1dd6f2c', 'en', 'Who is the father of the rain and who begets the drops of dew?'),
('14a81c02-ae46-a334-ae83-d857c57518bb', 'de', 'Wer hat den Regen rot gefärbt?'),
('14a81c02-ae46-a334-ae83-d857c57518bb', 'en', 'Who has colored the rain red?'),
('c85c6a51-e127-b4c0-4060-ffd4effc080d', 'de', 'Wer kann den Tau zählen am Morgen?'),
('c85c6a51-e127-b4c0-4060-ffd4effc080d', 'en', 'Who can count the dew in the morning?'),
('776a32c9-37c2-0a5d-7b3a-5c3cdcae60d9', 'de', 'Ich verachte alle eure Gaben'),
('776a32c9-37c2-0a5d-7b3a-5c3cdcae60d9', 'en', 'I despise all your gifts'),
('8f172ad2-8672-b96f-9f38-9bc7deaa7b1a', 'de', 'Ich will Brandopfer am Morgen'),
('8f172ad2-8672-b96f-9f38-9bc7deaa7b1a', 'en', 'I want burnt offerings in the morning'),
('4755d165-fc3e-eb78-bb89-9800261517ec', 'de', 'Ich habe Wohlgefallen an Liebe und nicht am Opfer'),
('4755d165-fc3e-eb78-bb89-9800261517ec', 'en', 'I desire mercy and not sacrifice'),
('98abceca-1c45-34d5-ba19-5ce14e7190a0', 'de', 'Ich nehme nur fehlerlose Tiere an'),
('98abceca-1c45-34d5-ba19-5ce14e7190a0', 'en', 'I accept only unblemished animals'),
('6123c428-717a-3b10-074d-d4701ba13b58', 'de', 'Er war sein Onkel'),
('6123c428-717a-3b10-074d-d4701ba13b58', 'en', 'He was his uncle'),
('d5258a3a-e63b-58df-6870-a5fec2a96421', 'de', 'Er war sein Lehrer aus Ägypten'),
('d5258a3a-e63b-58df-6870-a5fec2a96421', 'en', 'He was his teacher from Egypt'),
('fb8b7730-8479-fd39-b3c3-7d8567dcb614', 'de', 'Er war sein älterer Bruder'),
('fb8b7730-8479-fd39-b3c3-7d8567dcb614', 'en', 'He was his older brother'),
('6dade1ff-903c-5e5f-d9fc-49c0ebce1f22', 'de', 'Er war sein Schwiegervater'),
('6dade1ff-903c-5e5f-d9fc-49c0ebce1f22', 'en', 'He was his father-in-law'),
('2ba0a349-fa09-c24f-4ee3-c17a2652be24', 'de', 'Eine Wolke über dem Tempel'),
('2ba0a349-fa09-c24f-4ee3-c17a2652be24', 'en', 'A cloud over the temple'),
('ec11b8de-d5f7-63c2-3bc7-5ec04df01a8d', 'de', 'Das Tor des Paradieses'),
('ec11b8de-d5f7-63c2-3bc7-5ec04df01a8d', 'en', 'The gate of paradise'),
('6d103225-a9fc-c242-5bdf-01b72004795a', 'de', 'Den Himmel offen und Jesus zur Rechten Gottes stehen'),
('6d103225-a9fc-c242-5bdf-01b72004795a', 'en', 'Heaven opened and Jesus standing at God''s right hand'),
('392dde0f-b6a5-30c8-2217-2a0d80bd82a8', 'de', 'Einen Engel mit einem Schwert'),
('392dde0f-b6a5-30c8-2217-2a0d80bd82a8', 'en', 'An angel with a sword'),
('b68ab144-1985-6466-8f03-98f084552f51', 'de', 'Allein das Tier kehrt zum Staub zurück'),
('b68ab144-1985-6466-8f03-98f084552f51', 'en', 'Only the beast returns to dust'),
('b4a869ac-c2f7-5d35-aa4c-272cd50da512', 'de', 'Der Mensch lebt ewig, das Tier vergeht'),
('b4a869ac-c2f7-5d35-aa4c-272cd50da512', 'en', 'Man lives forever, the beast perishes'),
('9a0c8f3d-9a60-1ef9-ce48-32460353b8b8', 'de', 'Ein Geschick trifft Mensch und Tier, denn alle haben einen Odem'),
('9a0c8f3d-9a60-1ef9-ce48-32460353b8b8', 'en', 'One fate befalls man and beast, for all have the same breath'),
('6476b94d-734e-78d5-a093-aeca364d12ad', 'de', 'Der Mensch kennt kein Ende seiner Tage'),
('6476b94d-734e-78d5-a093-aeca364d12ad', 'en', 'Man knows no end of his days'),
('bca5a432-568b-ce3f-abc7-ad34a9683ac0', 'de', 'Sie berieten, wie sie ihn umbringen könnten'),
('bca5a432-568b-ce3f-abc7-ad34a9683ac0', 'en', 'They plotted how they might destroy him'),
('2e5980ff-88ce-7738-9a10-2492ebf9178c', 'de', 'Sie folgten ihm als Jünger nach'),
('2e5980ff-88ce-7738-9a10-2492ebf9178c', 'en', 'They followed him as disciples'),
('3aed2830-e5ea-1c4e-e3ed-9c15053dd7e5', 'de', 'Sie baten ihn um weitere Zeichen'),
('3aed2830-e5ea-1c4e-e3ed-9c15053dd7e5', 'en', 'They asked him for further signs'),
('bb945867-729d-faf1-af7c-db41d4ce0f26', 'de', 'Sie priesen Gott für das Wunder'),
('bb945867-729d-faf1-af7c-db41d4ce0f26', 'en', 'They praised God for the miracle'),
('8bbe21c7-4f62-ae96-1339-381feb00e452', 'de', 'Er verkaufte sie an die Philister'),
('8bbe21c7-4f62-ae96-1339-381feb00e452', 'en', 'He sold her to the Philistines'),
('e340d0d0-0b7b-9ad7-e0db-1097a368117e', 'de', 'Er klagte sie fälschlich des Diebstahls an'),
('e340d0d0-0b7b-9ad7-e0db-1097a368117e', 'en', 'He falsely accused her of theft'),
('44d2d074-ecca-17e1-3ab8-932be958aa97', 'de', 'Er verstieß sie aus dem Palast'),
('44d2d074-ecca-17e1-3ab8-932be958aa97', 'en', 'He drove her out of the palace'),
('e12becc1-dae9-c4c4-dd3f-8af0d75ec989', 'de', 'Er stellte sich krank, lockte sie zu sich und vergewaltigte sie'),
('e12becc1-dae9-c4c4-dd3f-8af0d75ec989', 'en', 'He feigned illness, lured her to him, and raped her'),
('6c1dab9d-16b9-f54f-36ed-cf9001db1d84', 'de', 'Es leuchtete wie die Sonne'),
('6c1dab9d-16b9-f54f-36ed-cf9001db1d84', 'en', 'It shone like the sun'),
('e6fb321c-beb4-a6c6-4c84-38746fa8d76a', 'de', 'Es wurde von Tränen bedeckt'),
('e6fb321c-beb4-a6c6-4c84-38746fa8d76a', 'en', 'It was covered with tears'),
('629111e8-73e4-f9da-4c52-df5b630cf0de', 'de', 'Es wurde bleich wie der Mond'),
('629111e8-73e4-f9da-4c52-df5b630cf0de', 'en', 'It grew pale like the moon'),
('5faf8b3b-4df3-b837-7df8-1a2f2d780fb4', 'de', 'Es verbarg sich in einer Wolke'),
('5faf8b3b-4df3-b837-7df8-1a2f2d780fb4', 'en', 'It hid itself in a cloud'),
('661d79ee-e188-ed64-e62f-252935076529', 'de', 'Er hinkte wegen seiner verrenkten Hüfte'),
('661d79ee-e188-ed64-e62f-252935076529', 'en', 'He limped because of his dislocated hip'),
('a2d89575-826d-bea3-7cd0-6759cbf153e9', 'de', 'Seine Stimme wurde heiser'),
('a2d89575-826d-bea3-7cd0-6759cbf153e9', 'en', 'His voice became hoarse'),
('f88f587d-dc6d-1da1-656b-1ad1078a72c7', 'de', 'Er verlor sein Augenlicht'),
('f88f587d-dc6d-1da1-656b-1ad1078a72c7', 'en', 'He lost his eyesight'),
('35f81107-0a6f-63aa-af10-b6bbc0155ad8', 'de', 'Seine Hand blieb gelähmt'),
('35f81107-0a6f-63aa-af10-b6bbc0155ad8', 'en', 'His hand remained paralyzed'),
('c565c2b7-a7c0-b4fd-15c1-7bebf6ccba21', 'de', 'Ich bin nicht wert, deinen Namen zu nennen'),
('c565c2b7-a7c0-b4fd-15c1-7bebf6ccba21', 'en', 'I am not worthy to speak your name'),
('1b9a4a33-cf70-0e98-a1e2-ae6fbabd97bc', 'de', 'Herr, vergib mir meine Schuld'),
('1b9a4a33-cf70-0e98-a1e2-ae6fbabd97bc', 'en', 'Lord, forgive me my guilt'),
('b2484d2c-076c-0fd2-83c5-909201e044dc', 'de', 'Gott, sei mir Sünder gnädig'),
('b2484d2c-076c-0fd2-83c5-909201e044dc', 'en', 'God, be merciful to me a sinner'),
('dbd89049-88e0-b41d-03c4-9ef751692537', 'de', 'Ich danke dir, dass ich nicht bin wie die anderen Menschen'),
('dbd89049-88e0-b41d-03c4-9ef751692537', 'en', 'I thank you that I am not like other people'),
('ff1fe905-b673-5fc6-afa9-1535f05b9996', 'de', 'Hundert Jahre'),
('ff1fe905-b673-5fc6-afa9-1535f05b9996', 'en', 'One hundred years'),
('d44bb7d5-1b25-45b0-422a-68b111a1516a', 'de', 'Vierzig Jahre'),
('d44bb7d5-1b25-45b0-422a-68b111a1516a', 'en', 'Forty years'),
('b5176191-0306-01c5-3de8-526bb028859e', 'de', 'Siebzig Jahre'),
('b5176191-0306-01c5-3de8-526bb028859e', 'en', 'Seventy years'),
('43cd7f32-47f7-3b38-d984-d4279bfe2b0d', 'de', 'Sieben Jahre'),
('43cd7f32-47f7-3b38-d984-d4279bfe2b0d', 'en', 'Seven years'),
('6ca4461b-fa47-6874-c9aa-bca725463c64', 'de', 'Feuer fiel auf das Lager'),
('6ca4461b-fa47-6874-c9aa-bca725463c64', 'en', 'Fire fell on the camp'),
('7ce8ea6d-9b4f-eb7e-ad75-7feb6edb0dc4', 'de', 'Eine Hungersnot kam über sie'),
('7ce8ea6d-9b4f-eb7e-ad75-7feb6edb0dc4', 'en', 'A famine came upon them'),
('1bc08960-2713-9525-9fe0-efe79edf2781', 'de', 'Eine Plage brach aus und tötete Tausende'),
('1bc08960-2713-9525-9fe0-efe79edf2781', 'en', 'A plague broke out and killed thousands'),
('2124d7a6-2eae-15ea-9f42-847c333b188b', 'de', 'Die Wolke wich von ihnen'),
('2124d7a6-2eae-15ea-9f42-847c333b188b', 'en', 'The cloud departed from them'),
('cb4b95a1-f565-0311-359d-676456041c43', 'de', 'Joab und Abischai'),
('cb4b95a1-f565-0311-359d-676456041c43', 'en', 'Joab and Abishai'),
('83ad02fd-846c-9e52-2b56-e15b43ce761a', 'de', 'Hofni und Pinhas'),
('83ad02fd-846c-9e52-2b56-e15b43ce761a', 'en', 'Hophni and Phinehas'),
('c86ce09e-d77f-b29a-20c2-42bf84ea4299', 'de', 'Nadab und Abihu'),
('c86ce09e-d77f-b29a-20c2-42bf84ea4299', 'en', 'Nadab and Abihu'),
('60e5ca0b-a2f5-132e-1b08-0cccc7ee5e8a', 'de', 'Abinadab und Malkischua'),
('60e5ca0b-a2f5-132e-1b08-0cccc7ee5e8a', 'en', 'Abinadab and Malchishua'),
('22727599-ccc8-f4bc-3ede-0aaa6667c13e', 'de', 'Er hat allein die Heiden berufen'),
('22727599-ccc8-f4bc-3ede-0aaa6667c13e', 'en', 'He has called only the Gentiles'),
('b5bb8c4e-69ec-9724-d866-fe82e388b536', 'de', 'Er hat die Trennmauer erhöht'),
('b5bb8c4e-69ec-9724-d866-fe82e388b536', 'en', 'He has raised the dividing wall higher'),
('cff3cfd8-45b5-354b-2ae0-cae5602d8622', 'de', 'Er hat aus beiden eines gemacht'),
('cff3cfd8-45b5-354b-2ae0-cae5602d8622', 'en', 'He has made the two into one'),
('7749bfca-0fd4-b763-3faa-210bf0eae47b', 'de', 'Er hat sie für immer getrennt'),
('7749bfca-0fd4-b763-3faa-210bf0eae47b', 'en', 'He has separated them forever'),
('572a8c1c-40fd-ae00-980c-78fdaa1dc38d', 'de', 'Gott fordert das ganze Vermögen'),
('572a8c1c-40fd-ae00-980c-78fdaa1dc38d', 'en', 'God demands one''s whole estate'),
('0d5fd432-927e-4e81-3cc8-a60f5ef91f78', 'de', 'Gott segnet nur den reichen Geber'),
('0d5fd432-927e-4e81-3cc8-a60f5ef91f78', 'en', 'God blesses only the rich giver'),
('dc7cb12b-b168-7259-3633-d0d826f6036c', 'de', 'Einen widerwilligen Geber lobt Gott'),
('dc7cb12b-b168-7259-3633-d0d826f6036c', 'en', 'God praises a reluctant giver'),
('f9275e96-5dcf-dd1c-707d-fc341e23f473', 'de', 'Einen fröhlichen Geber hat Gott lieb'),
('f9275e96-5dcf-dd1c-707d-fc341e23f473', 'en', 'God loves a cheerful giver'),
('27166664-3b6c-7a5b-2b5f-8ad8d0263947', 'de', 'Mit kostbaren Teppichen aus Tyrus'),
('27166664-3b6c-7a5b-2b5f-8ad8d0263947', 'en', 'With costly carpets from Tyre'),
('cc85e2b7-2e7f-c215-e238-2e90d5bcc365', 'de', 'Mit Münzen aus dem Tempelschatz'),
('cc85e2b7-2e7f-c215-e238-2e90d5bcc365', 'en', 'With coins from the temple treasury'),
('020bfae9-c44c-6f8f-604c-e7ef40f4a4ce', 'de', 'Mit Kleidern und Zweigen von Bäumen'),
('020bfae9-c44c-6f8f-604c-e7ef40f4a4ce', 'en', 'With cloaks and branches from trees'),
('b1ce46f8-5c29-cf27-e0b0-1f39f311ae8d', 'de', 'Mit gestreutem Weihrauch und Myrrhe'),
('b1ce46f8-5c29-cf27-e0b0-1f39f311ae8d', 'en', 'With scattered incense and myrrh'),
('1f702415-28bf-eb38-4f1a-56065d3457fd', 'de', 'Gott hat alles dem Zufall überlassen'),
('1f702415-28bf-eb38-4f1a-56065d3457fd', 'en', 'God has left everything to chance'),
('546400fb-e7c6-4df3-7e36-37d56bd574a2', 'de', 'Gott hat nur das Gute geschaffen'),
('546400fb-e7c6-4df3-7e36-37d56bd574a2', 'en', 'God created only the good'),
('96c0ef88-f767-c4b6-e36c-d79068c8c8f6', 'de', 'Gott hat alles schön gemacht zu seiner Zeit'),
('96c0ef88-f767-c4b6-e36c-d79068c8c8f6', 'en', 'God has made everything beautiful in its time'),
('89192f39-4d16-8d60-6403-57058a8aae8d', 'de', 'Gott hat dem Menschen die Zeit verborgen gehalten'),
('89192f39-4d16-8d60-6403-57058a8aae8d', 'en', 'God has hidden time from man entirely'),
('4497e5dc-be43-aed5-978a-d63c6c2b69a6', 'de', 'Hiram, der König von Tyrus'),
('4497e5dc-be43-aed5-978a-d63c6c2b69a6', 'en', 'Hiram, the king of Tyre'),
('2e7ad9bf-7f99-ea59-539a-5360e35385e8', 'de', 'Hadad, der König von Edom'),
('2e7ad9bf-7f99-ea59-539a-5360e35385e8', 'en', 'Hadad, the king of Edom'),
('555fcca3-c904-00fd-0ec3-cd4932469be7', 'de', 'Ben-Hadad, der König von Aram'),
('555fcca3-c904-00fd-0ec3-cd4932469be7', 'en', 'Ben-Hadad, the king of Aram'),
('eb7ffd68-a943-cc57-e2d5-82894228ba53', 'de', 'Pharao, der König von Ägypten'),
('eb7ffd68-a943-cc57-e2d5-82894228ba53', 'en', 'Pharaoh, the king of Egypt'),
('51bdc48f-be71-b662-ec2a-c82712db8243', 'de', 'Er erkannte niemanden mehr'),
('51bdc48f-be71-b662-ec2a-c82712db8243', 'en', 'He no longer recognized anyone'),
('ec2bbc75-241f-6d76-8748-c94bf0d202f3', 'de', 'Er fiel sogleich tot zurück'),
('ec2bbc75-241f-6d76-8748-c94bf0d202f3', 'en', 'He at once fell back dead'),
('ea38a071-3728-bd1e-85d3-f3fac29ce91a', 'de', 'Er konnte nicht sprechen'),
('ea38a071-3728-bd1e-85d3-f3fac29ce91a', 'en', 'He was unable to speak'),
('87f767d8-1ff8-48e6-683c-5f07a820f622', 'de', 'Er war mit Grabtüchern umwickelt'),
('87f767d8-1ff8-48e6-683c-5f07a820f622', 'en', 'He was wrapped in grave clothes'),
('ec4a9348-a4e9-35b7-cd4e-07d44f2052ec', 'de', 'Du Narr, diese Nacht wird man deine Seele von dir fordern'),
('ec4a9348-a4e9-35b7-cd4e-07d44f2052ec', 'en', 'You fool, this night your soul will be required of you'),
('bc0b4f3e-9446-8dd2-4a87-a47fbc2ce469', 'de', 'Verteile sofort, was du gesammelt hast'),
('bc0b4f3e-9446-8dd2-4a87-a47fbc2ce469', 'en', 'Distribute at once what you have gathered'),
('fe460543-cfde-2dea-a090-302fdfe443fb', 'de', 'Deine Scheunen werden niemals voll sein'),
('fe460543-cfde-2dea-a090-302fdfe443fb', 'en', 'Your barns will never be full'),
('eaa9d57e-6e01-5a8b-1421-2608e2fbd930', 'de', 'Deine Ernte wird verderben'),
('eaa9d57e-6e01-5a8b-1421-2608e2fbd930', 'en', 'Your harvest will spoil'),
('757c747a-a451-1117-be7a-e7f50abe7492', 'de', 'Er verbot jegliches Opfern im ganzen Land'),
('757c747a-a451-1117-be7a-e7f50abe7492', 'en', 'He forbade all sacrifices in the whole land'),
('b80f5347-bead-4d9f-dcc3-e675b2962846', 'de', 'Er ließ die Straßen nach Jerusalem sperren'),
('b80f5347-bead-4d9f-dcc3-e675b2962846', 'en', 'He blocked the roads to Jerusalem'),
('f99d6328-25b5-5558-ac91-dc9b5a73e298', 'de', 'Er baute einen neuen Tempel in Sichem'),
('f99d6328-25b5-5558-ac91-dc9b5a73e298', 'en', 'He built a new temple in Shechem'),
('17d8ad0d-77f8-0b84-1eb9-b582054ab7b3', 'de', 'Er machte zwei goldene Kälber und stellte sie in Bethel und Dan auf'),
('17d8ad0d-77f8-0b84-1eb9-b582054ab7b3', 'en', 'He made two golden calves and set them in Bethel and Dan'),
('0e31066b-d84b-996f-f48c-fb0dee415499', 'de', 'Er befahl es ihm als König ausdrücklich'),
('0e31066b-d84b-996f-f48c-fb0dee415499', 'en', 'He expressly ordered it as king'),
('b948a5a8-a77d-579e-df19-0a5346ee1312', 'de', 'Er versprach ihm Gold und Land'),
('b948a5a8-a77d-579e-df19-0a5346ee1312', 'en', 'He promised him gold and land'),
('f275d5c1-db8d-b53e-5972-0b508caaf5b2', 'de', 'Er drohte ihm mit dem Verlust seines Amtes'),
('f275d5c1-db8d-b53e-5972-0b508caaf5b2', 'en', 'He threatened him with loss of his office'),
('0b95ac76-463a-9cff-42ce-be7f56e21a81', 'de', 'Er machte ihn betrunken, doch Uria ging dennoch nicht heim'),
('0b95ac76-463a-9cff-42ce-be7f56e21a81', 'en', 'He made him drunk, yet Uriah still did not go home'),
('c565c50c-dffd-1392-4a2f-37f611ec411a', 'de', 'Ein Gewand aus Sackleinen'),
('c565c50c-dffd-1392-4a2f-37f611ec411a', 'en', 'A garment of sackcloth'),
('39e32290-40ac-8bf1-4a03-216ea3df4707', 'de', 'Einen schwarzen Trauermantel'),
('39e32290-40ac-8bf1-4a03-216ea3df4707', 'en', 'A black mourning cloak'),
('720a445a-baf1-1887-53e1-d5e492bba56f', 'de', 'Einen Purpurmantel'),
('720a445a-baf1-1887-53e1-d5e492bba56f', 'en', 'A purple robe'),
('2c0862bb-37bd-7622-e777-cda5f4edd1f5', 'de', 'Ein weißes Priestergewand'),
('2c0862bb-37bd-7622-e777-cda5f4edd1f5', 'en', 'A white priestly garment'),
('00d995a5-cadc-467e-7c4d-c484d5ec6073', 'de', 'Du sollst nicht ehebrechen'),
('00d995a5-cadc-467e-7c4d-c484d5ec6073', 'en', 'You shall not commit adultery'),
('5e30a6b5-4c37-370d-6f5d-8eb664f32b29', 'de', 'Du sollst dir kein Bildnis machen'),
('5e30a6b5-4c37-370d-6f5d-8eb664f32b29', 'en', 'You shall not make for yourself a carved image'),
('d879af5c-c025-489e-5a14-002b6e2d16e2', 'de', 'Du sollst nicht töten'),
('d879af5c-c025-489e-5a14-002b6e2d16e2', 'en', 'You shall not kill'),
('62f4742b-dabf-36d3-1717-ca17001ecc05', 'de', 'Du sollst nicht stehlen'),
('62f4742b-dabf-36d3-1717-ca17001ecc05', 'en', 'You shall not steal'),
('c583594b-cb07-6248-30bc-7f92cd1f460e', 'de', 'Die Mauern bleiben unversehrt'),
('c583594b-cb07-6248-30bc-7f92cd1f460e', 'en', 'The walls remain unharmed'),
('38e2779c-a3e0-f367-68a5-1b2b3817a65f', 'de', 'Die Stadt ergibt sich kampflos'),
('38e2779c-a3e0-f367-68a5-1b2b3817a65f', 'en', 'The city surrenders without a fight'),
('0018a992-1923-3bcc-5caf-ecf56873f09a', 'de', 'Die Bewohner ziehen friedlich aus'),
('0018a992-1923-3bcc-5caf-ecf56873f09a', 'en', 'The inhabitants leave peacefully'),
('bda77e4b-4700-c913-b3e6-652f55cfbd64', 'de', 'Die Flusstore öffnen sich und der Palast vergeht'),
('bda77e4b-4700-c913-b3e6-652f55cfbd64', 'en', 'The river gates open and the palace dissolves'),
('0fc84a39-1b99-b48e-e65c-a33a575b642b', 'de', 'Er war stark und mächtig wie ein Held im Krieg'),
('0fc84a39-1b99-b48e-e65c-a33a575b642b', 'en', 'He was strong and mighty like a hero in war'),
('ce86a110-7039-b6aa-8ab1-6a2a09183653', 'de', 'Er erschien in Licht gekleidet wie die Sonne'),
('ce86a110-7039-b6aa-8ab1-6a2a09183653', 'en', 'He appeared clothed in light like the sun'),
('852bc670-dcde-32eb-0bbb-80349455318a', 'de', 'Er kam in großer Herrlichkeit, dass alle ihn lobten'),
('852bc670-dcde-32eb-0bbb-80349455318a', 'en', 'He came in great glory, that all praised him'),
('1b19eecf-c4ac-07f5-e0ab-1352e5397520', 'de', 'Er hatte keine Gestalt noch Schöne, dass wir Gefallen an ihm gehabt hätten'),
('1b19eecf-c4ac-07f5-e0ab-1352e5397520', 'en', 'He had no form or beauty that we should desire him'),
('4d43cab9-a001-73ca-da95-7bf95c321278', 'de', 'Der Helm des Heils'),
('4d43cab9-a001-73ca-da95-7bf95c321278', 'en', 'The helmet of salvation'),
('21a5a628-173c-9f6a-b54b-e8d2218b4137', 'de', 'Die Krone des Lebens'),
('21a5a628-173c-9f6a-b54b-e8d2218b4137', 'en', 'The crown of life'),
('a53aff30-b1a4-ee39-7e77-7c0f47dc435f', 'de', 'Der Mantel der Weisheit'),
('a53aff30-b1a4-ee39-7e77-7c0f47dc435f', 'en', 'The cloak of wisdom'),
('9c8b51bc-e96e-7c8d-8b71-112f56560bf2', 'de', 'Der Stab der Stärke'),
('9c8b51bc-e96e-7c8d-8b71-112f56560bf2', 'en', 'The staff of strength'),
('251ba36f-7171-bbb9-29df-0e63cf5c4659', 'de', 'Er wurde zum Hofpropheten ernannt'),
('251ba36f-7171-bbb9-29df-0e63cf5c4659', 'en', 'He was made a court prophet'),
('a2eabc7c-271f-4cfa-7186-d7cafb45250f', 'de', 'Er wurde aus dem Land vertrieben'),
('a2eabc7c-271f-4cfa-7186-d7cafb45250f', 'en', 'He was driven out of the land'),
('33dd93d4-8cd7-9499-6440-ec87cc5ef9ac', 'de', 'Er wurde mit Steinen verjagt'),
('33dd93d4-8cd7-9499-6440-ec87cc5ef9ac', 'en', 'He was chased away with stones'),
('a2324624-704b-f198-b6b7-bfd426010999', 'de', 'Er wurde ins Gefängnis geworfen und mit wenig Brot und Wasser gespeist'),
('a2324624-704b-f198-b6b7-bfd426010999', 'en', 'He was thrown into prison and fed scant bread and water'),
('f7f17515-535f-2676-ae84-0c7b2d8e8866', 'de', 'Verkaufe alles, was du hast'),
('f7f17515-535f-2676-ae84-0c7b2d8e8866', 'en', 'Sell everything you have'),
('1d828994-a2f6-f5f9-4e53-c9ce19ddd718', 'de', 'Glaube, und du wirst gerettet'),
('1d828994-a2f6-f5f9-4e53-c9ce19ddd718', 'en', 'Believe, and you will be saved'),
('0bc9a73b-bfff-0c60-0a87-01999c9ca608', 'de', 'Sündige hinfort nicht mehr, dass dir nicht Schlimmeres widerfahre'),
('0bc9a73b-bfff-0c60-0a87-01999c9ca608', 'en', 'Sin no more, that nothing worse may happen to you'),
('8d222d1e-eede-887e-426c-c0c6dbbd693d', 'de', 'Geh und zeige dich den Priestern'),
('8d222d1e-eede-887e-426c-c0c6dbbd693d', 'en', 'Go and show yourself to the priests'),
('b7002964-34a7-e34b-69d2-0b62f51c7881', 'de', 'Hiskia werde sofort sterben'),
('b7002964-34a7-e34b-69d2-0b62f51c7881', 'en', 'Hezekiah would die at once'),
('a64b450f-5832-3417-f685-39b4717af277', 'de', 'Jerusalem werde noch in jenem Jahr fallen'),
('a64b450f-5832-3417-f685-39b4717af277', 'en', 'Jerusalem would fall that very year'),
('b311b228-7b46-48f6-567b-2d5d06cdacfa', 'de', 'Sein Sohn werde nie regieren'),
('b311b228-7b46-48f6-567b-2d5d06cdacfa', 'en', 'His son would never reign'),
('4d555c20-9d5c-2209-d65c-15e10cb11e96', 'de', 'Alle Schätze würden einst nach Babel gebracht'),
('4d555c20-9d5c-2209-d65c-15e10cb11e96', 'en', 'All the treasures would one day be carried to Babylon'),
('3881230d-dd84-034b-3175-00392f3fbeb9', 'de', 'Das Gras verdorrt, aber das Wort Gottes bleibt ewig'),
('3881230d-dd84-034b-3175-00392f3fbeb9', 'en', 'The grass withers, but the word of God stands forever'),
('9a73d631-6ec8-2e0d-893b-b7fe443e6cab', 'de', 'Das Gras wächst, und das Wort Gottes mit ihm'),
('9a73d631-6ec8-2e0d-893b-b7fe443e6cab', 'en', 'The grass grows, and the word of God with it'),
('89fab0b6-4905-5570-0423-32972c8ad740', 'de', 'Das Gras steht fest wie das Wort Gottes'),
('89fab0b6-4905-5570-0423-32972c8ad740', 'en', 'The grass stands firm like the word of God'),
('277c3d6a-fcb6-5c4d-0594-c78b2ccba502', 'de', 'Das Gras blüht, doch das Wort Gottes vergeht'),
('277c3d6a-fcb6-5c4d-0594-c78b2ccba502', 'en', 'The grass blooms, but the word of God passes away'),
('5ecbd9f9-468f-7a20-f748-9e2ef61115d3', 'de', 'Er befahl Davids Verhaftung'),
('5ecbd9f9-468f-7a20-f748-9e2ef61115d3', 'en', 'He ordered David''s arrest'),
('c5dbfb7a-a76a-dbc4-74a9-7c48d6c31720', 'de', 'Er floh aus dem Palast'),
('c5dbfb7a-a76a-dbc4-74a9-7c48d6c31720', 'en', 'He fled from the palace'),
('521df650-3dd1-0515-0f95-b29fca05731b', 'de', 'Er zerbrach Davids Harfe'),
('521df650-3dd1-0515-0f95-b29fca05731b', 'en', 'He smashed David''s harp'),
('a8529021-9351-ac7c-6327-bb043549da8e', 'de', 'Er warf zweimal den Speer nach David'),
('a8529021-9351-ac7c-6327-bb043549da8e', 'en', 'He hurled his spear at David twice'),
('97de5380-0e91-98d8-86c7-75d4188c75bd', 'de', 'Daniel hatte es selbst verlangt'),
('97de5380-0e91-98d8-86c7-75d4188c75bd', 'en', 'Daniel himself had requested it'),
('4ed1886b-1c25-fdc8-6a07-212de7747763', 'de', 'Die Königin verbot es'),
('4ed1886b-1c25-fdc8-6a07-212de7747763', 'en', 'The queen forbade it'),
('b61aa3b5-a45f-3827-3ef1-7cc626954cf9', 'de', 'Das Volk hätte sich erhoben'),
('b61aa3b5-a45f-3827-3ef1-7cc626954cf9', 'en', 'The people would have revolted'),
('2678b6b7-fe39-f69b-6c72-9b4a86dea0a1', 'de', 'Die Gesetze der Meder und Perser waren unwiderruflich'),
('2678b6b7-fe39-f69b-6c72-9b4a86dea0a1', 'en', 'The laws of the Medes and Persians were irrevocable'),
('21f09aa3-0cd9-003e-6472-d7d81cbd5fee', 'de', 'Die Häuser und Zelte'),
('21f09aa3-0cd9-003e-6472-d7d81cbd5fee', 'en', 'The houses and tents'),
('bc8efc45-3cb9-f3b6-ea12-1d9384510c3b', 'de', 'Alles Grün, das der Hagel übrig gelassen hatte'),
('bc8efc45-3cb9-f3b6-ea12-1d9384510c3b', 'en', 'All the greenery the hail had left'),
('19caf394-9ba5-3ff5-a5d5-c8c47ff1659e', 'de', 'Das gesamte Vieh der Ägypter'),
('19caf394-9ba5-3ff5-a5d5-c8c47ff1659e', 'en', 'All the livestock of the Egyptians'),
('855cfe09-7016-c44d-7f44-f11b68f28202', 'de', 'Die Vorräte in den Speichern'),
('855cfe09-7016-c44d-7f44-f11b68f28202', 'en', 'The stores in the granaries'),
('281ce1e1-cfe3-e29f-3f08-7a6bace8777d', 'de', 'Wie ein Lamm, das zur Schlachtbank geführt wird, tat er seinen Mund nicht auf'),
('281ce1e1-cfe3-e29f-3f08-7a6bace8777d', 'en', 'Like a lamb led to the slaughter, he did not open his mouth'),
('446e92a7-7a7b-05d9-39bb-cb385bc979a9', 'de', 'Wie ein Adler, der schreit, klagte er sein Leid'),
('446e92a7-7a7b-05d9-39bb-cb385bc979a9', 'en', 'Like an eagle that cries, he lamented his pain'),
('7c38e762-b10f-ffff-1a59-52fe3e49d91d', 'de', 'Wie ein Sturm, der tobt, schrie er zum Himmel'),
('7c38e762-b10f-ffff-1a59-52fe3e49d91d', 'en', 'Like a storm that rages, he cried to heaven'),
('6e42be73-89b0-bf8a-06cf-29ed5de6d24d', 'de', 'Wie ein Löwe, der brüllt, erhob er seine Stimme'),
('6e42be73-89b0-bf8a-06cf-29ed5de6d24d', 'en', 'Like a lion that roars, he raised his voice'),
('936d1b15-a150-def7-1b5d-47a1abe2732a', 'de', '… aber er erlangt so die Weisheit'),
('936d1b15-a150-def7-1b5d-47a1abe2732a', 'en', '… but he gains wisdom thereby'),
('ebd267af-744a-1133-028f-821ea0382fe6', 'de', '… aber wohl dem, der sich der Elenden erbarmt'),
('ebd267af-744a-1133-028f-821ea0382fe6', 'en', '… but blessed is he who is kind to the needy'),
('d52c806e-ae42-a200-b4e7-6327ca4a7854', 'de', '… aber er wird dennoch geehrt'),
('d52c806e-ae42-a200-b4e7-6327ca4a7854', 'en', '… but he is honored nonetheless'),
('1c0eef8c-a86d-580d-88d8-52a668e37bec', 'de', '… aber er wird dadurch reich'),
('1c0eef8c-a86d-580d-88d8-52a668e37bec', 'en', '… but he grows rich by it'),
('b8c94499-d2cf-9728-9c4b-b4216d1b1952', 'de', 'Bist du der König der Juden?'),
('b8c94499-d2cf-9728-9c4b-b4216d1b1952', 'en', 'Are you the King of the Jews?'),
('59def63b-b67d-4ab0-ef7d-59356ef01f10', 'de', 'Wo sind deine zwölf Jünger?'),
('59def63b-b67d-4ab0-ef7d-59356ef01f10', 'en', 'Where are your twelve disciples?'),
('23fd8606-25e5-c1fb-7d5b-5996e53bc57c', 'de', 'Hast du den Tempel zerstört?'),
('23fd8606-25e5-c1fb-7d5b-5996e53bc57c', 'en', 'Did you destroy the temple?'),
('ce34b1d2-608f-76de-cae6-b4fcf2362119', 'de', 'Bist du der Sohn des Zimmermanns?'),
('ce34b1d2-608f-76de-cae6-b4fcf2362119', 'en', 'Are you the son of the carpenter?'),
('a7ec4ea9-d436-391a-efbf-00b830abc062', 'de', 'Gelobt sei der Hohepriester'),
('a7ec4ea9-d436-391a-efbf-00b830abc062', 'en', 'Blessed be the high priest'),
('6caf0908-314b-1efa-8c0e-fb13324ad138', 'de', 'Friede über die heilige Stadt'),
('6caf0908-314b-1efa-8c0e-fb13324ad138', 'en', 'Peace upon the holy city'),
('687eeb4e-bff6-bc2c-ca16-29ce17670b41', 'de', 'Heil dem König der Römer'),
('687eeb4e-bff6-bc2c-ca16-29ce17670b41', 'en', 'Hail to the king of the Romans'),
('26e821dc-661e-5ce5-2f5e-667265706632', 'de', 'Hosanna dem Sohn Davids'),
('26e821dc-661e-5ce5-2f5e-667265706632', 'en', 'Hosanna to the Son of David'),
('6daa924e-0f09-adb3-e893-f54312dde3b3', 'de', 'Ein Kerkermeister in Philippi'),
('6daa924e-0f09-adb3-e893-f54312dde3b3', 'en', 'A jailer in Philippi'),
('b78f027c-be15-7aa6-5715-f8e227e82e21', 'de', 'Ein Hauptmann der italischen Kohorte in Cäsarea'),
('b78f027c-be15-7aa6-5715-f8e227e82e21', 'en', 'A centurion of the Italian cohort in Caesarea'),
('96781f83-4c3c-0ea6-4fcc-770f0fbb1a2b', 'de', 'Ein Hoherpriester in Jerusalem'),
('96781f83-4c3c-0ea6-4fcc-770f0fbb1a2b', 'en', 'A high priest in Jerusalem'),
('7b41e847-9559-ea03-a84d-a0fc5b160491', 'de', 'Ein Statthalter von Zypern'),
('7b41e847-9559-ea03-a84d-a0fc5b160491', 'en', 'A governor of Cyprus'),
('55bfb43f-7726-7a3a-16cd-4dfcc781a6f8', 'de', 'Es verwandelte sich in einen Menschen'),
('55bfb43f-7726-7a3a-16cd-4dfcc781a6f8', 'en', 'It turned into a man'),
('d7100667-b3b8-3c1e-09f6-6614d70b6412', 'de', 'Es wurde gekrönt'),
('d7100667-b3b8-3c1e-09f6-6614d70b6412', 'en', 'It was crowned'),
('12aea732-59bb-85d5-a14e-8d5619c2573d', 'de', 'Es wurde getötet und dem brennenden Feuer übergeben'),
('12aea732-59bb-85d5-a14e-8d5619c2573d', 'en', 'It was slain and given to the burning fire'),
('26e6c69f-9ea8-6eec-3f0c-b6cb531825aa', 'de', 'Es floh in das Meer'),
('26e6c69f-9ea8-6eec-3f0c-b6cb531825aa', 'en', 'It fled into the sea'),
('de310ebd-b834-c905-600a-e83a69fc7e8b', 'de', 'Er band ihm die Hände'),
('de310ebd-b834-c905-600a-e83a69fc7e8b', 'en', 'He bound his hands'),
('ca2cbbcf-9cc1-7588-42e5-8094abecca2d', 'de', 'Er hieb ihm das Ohr ab'),
('ca2cbbcf-9cc1-7588-42e5-8094abecca2d', 'en', 'He cut off his ear'),
('54e0fd02-b202-dd76-a7bc-24d96c6b876c', 'de', 'Er warf ihn zu Boden'),
('54e0fd02-b202-dd76-a7bc-24d96c6b876c', 'en', 'He threw him to the ground'),
('48355029-364b-bd36-fc58-6fa8a04fd290', 'de', 'Er stieß ihn in den Bach'),
('48355029-364b-bd36-fc58-6fa8a04fd290', 'en', 'He pushed him into the brook'),
('7d1336d9-9e72-788c-651a-0aabfd4285e1', 'de', 'Verzweifle, denn es ist kein Helfer da'),
('7d1336d9-9e72-788c-651a-0aabfd4285e1', 'en', 'Despair, for there is no helper'),
('f58ebd50-0f10-e1f6-f914-c9476ae4b821', 'de', 'Harre auf Gott, denn ich werde ihm noch danken'),
('f58ebd50-0f10-e1f6-f914-c9476ae4b821', 'en', 'Hope in God, for I shall yet praise him'),
('78a022ef-2a72-7f72-342e-bfe9209aedc1', 'de', 'Schweige für immer in deiner Not'),
('78a022ef-2a72-7f72-342e-bfe9209aedc1', 'en', 'Be silent forever in your distress'),
('c06f4c83-2f7e-2e6d-754b-21db6b96adfd', 'de', 'Suche Hilfe bei den Mächtigen'),
('c06f4c83-2f7e-2e6d-754b-21db6b96adfd', 'en', 'Seek help from the mighty'),
('24772ed3-9650-8da0-8ac6-810694b76b3a', 'de', 'Mit einem Gewand der Priester'),
('24772ed3-9650-8da0-8ac6-810694b76b3a', 'en', 'With a priest''s garment'),
('3baa2a33-31f6-f5bd-309e-267b5144f40f', 'de', 'Mit Kamelhaaren und einem ledernen Gürtel'),
('3baa2a33-31f6-f5bd-309e-267b5144f40f', 'en', 'With camel''s hair and a leather belt'),
('1b319e3d-e8db-2fb2-b1f9-87483868e69b', 'de', 'Mit einem weißen Leinengewand'),
('1b319e3d-e8db-2fb2-b1f9-87483868e69b', 'en', 'With a white linen robe'),
('22cce7b2-63e0-b872-ac9b-dce547ac6bb7', 'de', 'Mit einem Mantel aus Schafwolle'),
('22cce7b2-63e0-b872-ac9b-dce547ac6bb7', 'en', 'With a cloak of sheep''s wool'),
('90144ce5-f956-bbd6-652f-59724e1f075f', 'de', 'Ein gelehrter Schriftgelehrter'),
('90144ce5-f956-bbd6-652f-59724e1f075f', 'en', 'A learned scribe'),
('188f0e2e-0afb-bf77-3ae4-01f871567bac', 'de', 'Ein Aufrührer und Mörder'),
('188f0e2e-0afb-bf77-3ae4-01f871567bac', 'en', 'A rebel and murderer'),
('ed1f3ccd-3162-3920-b850-34bd466d2409', 'de', 'Ein reicher Zöllner'),
('ed1f3ccd-3162-3920-b850-34bd466d2409', 'en', 'A wealthy tax collector'),
('17afe508-6a2f-ebf5-5a27-b232c5d64419', 'de', 'Ein römischer Soldat'),
('17afe508-6a2f-ebf5-5a27-b232c5d64419', 'en', 'A Roman soldier'),
('0e28da3e-851c-6fcf-79eb-5910b13a4b0d', 'de', 'Ich habe den guten Kampf gekämpft'),
('0e28da3e-851c-6fcf-79eb-5910b13a4b0d', 'en', 'I have fought the good fight'),
('755b433a-0d6b-5eb7-086b-1a73897629a2', 'de', 'Ich habe den Glauben verloren'),
('755b433a-0d6b-5eb7-086b-1a73897629a2', 'en', 'I have lost the faith'),
('e3c28002-8f55-5a20-cf65-d1e8b2544186', 'de', 'Ich bin meinem Lauf entflohen'),
('e3c28002-8f55-5a20-cf65-d1e8b2544186', 'en', 'I have fled from my race'),
('de3f505e-9bfc-5c6a-966c-9477b64a84d7', 'de', 'Ich habe vergeblich gearbeitet'),
('de3f505e-9bfc-5c6a-966c-9477b64a84d7', 'en', 'I have labored in vain'),
('d469dfc9-c033-3165-17e5-b4744810eb2c', 'de', 'Er sandte ihm einen Engel als Wächter'),
('d469dfc9-c033-3165-17e5-b4744810eb2c', 'en', 'He sent him an angel as a guardian'),
('3e5e3961-fd57-37ec-a2b5-7a51df2c513e', 'de', 'Er gab ihm ein Schwert in die Hand'),
('3e5e3961-fd57-37ec-a2b5-7a51df2c513e', 'en', 'He placed a sword in his hand'),
('95f3c7f0-ec22-1f1b-da16-3ee86661edf5', 'de', 'Er umgab ihn mit einer Mauer aus Feuer'),
('95f3c7f0-ec22-1f1b-da16-3ee86661edf5', 'en', 'He surrounded him with a wall of fire'),
('02b3c70a-a024-5677-847b-38eec5a76a42', 'de', 'Er machte ihm ein Zeichen, damit ihn niemand erschlage'),
('02b3c70a-a024-5677-847b-38eec5a76a42', 'en', 'He put a mark on him so no one would kill him'),
('a978e269-0c9b-7946-7eca-fb5f6de612ac', 'de', 'Isai, der Vater Davids'),
('a978e269-0c9b-7946-7eca-fb5f6de612ac', 'en', 'Jesse, the father of David'),
('3d82377d-a0ab-88a0-7b82-8ae9d530ed40', 'de', 'Jesse, der Großvater Davids'),
('3d82377d-a0ab-88a0-7b82-8ae9d530ed40', 'en', 'Jesse, the grandfather of David'),
('ee601bff-bf3e-9b69-33a8-7d5edd244c1d', 'de', 'Salmon, der Vater des Boas'),
('ee601bff-bf3e-9b69-33a8-7d5edd244c1d', 'en', 'Salmon, the father of Boaz'),
('466401fd-8403-0dab-8b2c-3a5609c92acd', 'de', 'Obed, der Vater Isais'),
('466401fd-8403-0dab-8b2c-3a5609c92acd', 'en', 'Obed, the father of Jesse'),
('369c8709-de9a-357f-704f-c53e45ebb20b', 'de', 'Wegen eines Bürgerkriegs'),
('369c8709-de9a-357f-704f-c53e45ebb20b', 'en', 'Because of a civil war'),
('3f99b88e-9a96-68bf-c54c-702910e4c29d', 'de', 'Weil das Volk gegen den HERRN gesündigt und Götzen gedient hatte'),
('3f99b88e-9a96-68bf-c54c-702910e4c29d', 'en', 'Because the people sinned against the LORD and served idols'),
('eb892b04-bcf4-3ab8-f1ad-a99483e19f73', 'de', 'Wegen einer langen Dürre'),
('eb892b04-bcf4-3ab8-f1ad-a99483e19f73', 'en', 'Because of a long drought'),
('979c0deb-d27a-ca87-2b96-7fb819063263', 'de', 'Weil der König den Tribut zahlte'),
('979c0deb-d27a-ca87-2b96-7fb819063263', 'en', 'Because the king paid the tribute'),
('0a8f0202-cf32-cb92-37a7-e23f4ac8fb23', 'de', 'Warum rufst du nach mir?'),
('0a8f0202-cf32-cb92-37a7-e23f4ac8fb23', 'en', 'Why do you call out to me?'),
('0e5e1629-3b5a-2cfe-cb92-85ef124fa403', 'de', 'Wer hat dich zu mir gesandt?'),
('0e5e1629-3b5a-2cfe-cb92-85ef124fa403', 'en', 'Who sent you to me?'),
('7c3523c4-6229-056c-473c-c156383c3b93', 'de', 'Was willst du, dass ich dir tun soll?'),
('7c3523c4-6229-056c-473c-c156383c3b93', 'en', 'What do you want me to do for you?'),
('3e9189ca-7da5-c51e-edb2-85242cddbbb1', 'de', 'Glaubst du, dass ich das tun kann?'),
('3e9189ca-7da5-c51e-edb2-85242cddbbb1', 'en', 'Do you believe I can do this?'),
('dbee7fc9-06c7-81d1-b560-b04d5a4b89dc', 'de', 'Ein Feuer verzehrte die Decken'),
('dbee7fc9-06c7-81d1-b560-b04d5a4b89dc', 'en', 'A fire consumed the curtains'),
('84c91008-8940-c2f9-95aa-963d341c114b', 'de', 'Das Volk durfte sogleich eintreten'),
('84c91008-8940-c2f9-95aa-963d341c114b', 'en', 'The people could enter at once'),
('45624771-db31-8d2b-3067-05c6721e8e20', 'de', 'Die Wolke bedeckte sie und Gottes Herrlichkeit erfüllte sie'),
('45624771-db31-8d2b-3067-05c6721e8e20', 'en', 'The cloud covered it and God''s glory filled it'),
('78a2ab0a-7f9e-2d5a-d76f-245653c609e8', 'de', 'Die Lade verschwand drei Tage'),
('78a2ab0a-7f9e-2d5a-d76f-245653c609e8', 'en', 'The ark vanished for three days'),
('ec051217-f099-0621-230e-d1da5ba797e8', 'de', 'Vater, gib mir den zweiten Teil meines Erbes'),
('ec051217-f099-0621-230e-d1da5ba797e8', 'en', 'Father, give me the second part of my inheritance'),
('00fee9d2-d726-a7b7-f6d3-b850de16f82c', 'de', 'Vater, ich komme nur zu Besuch'),
('00fee9d2-d726-a7b7-f6d3-b850de16f82c', 'en', 'Father, I have only come to visit'),
('45dd9042-39bf-d735-fb90-69a8489b1b71', 'de', 'Vater, ich habe das Geld gut angelegt'),
('45dd9042-39bf-d735-fb90-69a8489b1b71', 'en', 'Father, I invested the money well'),
('f7fe4a53-d8d7-5653-c7fa-ae7af782184a', 'de', 'Vater, ich habe gesündigt gegen den Himmel und vor dir'),
('f7fe4a53-d8d7-5653-c7fa-ae7af782184a', 'en', 'Father, I have sinned against heaven and before you'),
('f1d46dbc-1608-72bb-095e-fe7af51f5815', 'de', 'Sie zu versiegeln und zu bewachen'),
('f1d46dbc-1608-72bb-095e-fe7af51f5815', 'en', 'To seal and guard it'),
('769b0ddf-2bb1-96ad-78bf-8face07a4ae7', 'de', 'Große Steine vor den Eingang zu wälzen'),
('769b0ddf-2bb1-96ad-78bf-8face07a4ae7', 'en', 'To roll great stones over the entrance'),
('87f86faf-3c7d-5879-71c7-88a0436eb68f', 'de', 'Sie sofort zu verbrennen'),
('87f86faf-3c7d-5879-71c7-88a0436eb68f', 'en', 'To burn it at once'),
('d86401a1-f84e-8261-2627-c958f73a29ef', 'de', 'Sie mit Erde zu füllen'),
('d86401a1-f84e-8261-2627-c958f73a29ef', 'en', 'To fill it with earth'),
('c245f077-7047-2f73-780b-0c192481a6a3', 'de', 'Unter dem Feigenbaum von Sichem'),
('c245f077-7047-2f73-780b-0c192481a6a3', 'en', 'Under the fig tree of Shechem'),
('91378609-984f-9d48-f50a-818e181a86c3', 'de', 'Unter der Eiche von Mamre'),
('91378609-984f-9d48-f50a-818e181a86c3', 'en', 'Under the oak of Mamre'),
('8d64a239-9fa1-b66c-0e5c-e7ddb1d0cb36', 'de', 'Unter der Debora-Palme zwischen Rama und Bethel'),
('8d64a239-9fa1-b66c-0e5c-e7ddb1d0cb36', 'en', 'Under the palm of Deborah between Ramah and Bethel'),
('b8e7a5f0-40cc-c410-1f9d-b3881b8812db', 'de', 'Unter dem Wacholder bei Beerscheba'),
('b8e7a5f0-40cc-c410-1f9d-b3881b8812db', 'en', 'Under the juniper at Beersheba'),
('b2b4837d-924c-d214-6c36-ad63023b5109', 'de', 'Er sollte sie zerreißen in viele Stücke'),
('b2b4837d-924c-d214-6c36-ad63023b5109', 'en', 'He was to tear it into many pieces'),
('45252d39-cafa-9a31-f995-ffe3c9778954', 'de', 'Er sollte sie essen und so Gottes Worte aufnehmen'),
('45252d39-cafa-9a31-f995-ffe3c9778954', 'en', 'He was to eat it and so take in God''s words'),
('143ce888-042b-f6bb-35b7-a08534394ac7', 'de', 'Er sollte sie verbrennen vor dem Volk'),
('143ce888-042b-f6bb-35b7-a08534394ac7', 'en', 'He was to burn it before the people'),
('0518d262-8837-e3ee-970e-b6e309b003d0', 'de', 'Er sollte sie vergraben am Fluss Kebar'),
('0518d262-8837-e3ee-970e-b6e309b003d0', 'en', 'He was to bury it by the river Kebar'),
('318d4a8a-7690-f316-6735-74e0245b9577', 'de', 'In eine Grube voller Löwen'),
('318d4a8a-7690-f316-6735-74e0245b9577', 'en', 'Into a pit full of lions'),
('8357d248-ae75-5551-1ffe-4896d6335321', 'de', 'In das tiefe Wasser des Euphrat'),
('8357d248-ae75-5551-1ffe-4896d6335321', 'en', 'Into the deep water of the Euphrates'),
('b5eb55c3-22d5-aa42-2afd-375c533a6400', 'de', 'In einen brennenden Feuerofen'),
('b5eb55c3-22d5-aa42-2afd-375c533a6400', 'en', 'Into a burning fiery furnace'),
('47e3df79-5af8-cc8d-601b-702fa6318424', 'de', 'In eine schlammige Zisterne ohne Wasser'),
('47e3df79-5af8-cc8d-601b-702fa6318424', 'en', 'Into a muddy cistern without water'),
('b5cf62b0-38d1-3243-4a5f-1918c2eefb08', 'de', 'Er rief es siebenmal beim Namen'),
('b5cf62b0-38d1-3243-4a5f-1918c2eefb08', 'en', 'He called it by name seven times'),
('1b297148-bf14-bda6-e8bb-c6a3a2cdd92c', 'de', 'Er bestrich es mit Öl'),
('1b297148-bf14-bda6-e8bb-c6a3a2cdd92c', 'en', 'He anointed it with oil'),
('8751263c-e7a0-baa6-4396-5c0dfde0e651', 'de', 'Er trug es zum Altar'),
('8751263c-e7a0-baa6-4396-5c0dfde0e651', 'en', 'He carried it to the altar'),
('ec389b1c-4915-07fc-f0d6-e1912bb51ec7', 'de', 'Er legte sich auf das Kind, Mund auf Mund'),
('ec389b1c-4915-07fc-f0d6-e1912bb51ec7', 'en', 'He stretched himself on the child, mouth to mouth'),
('86e10f61-6c43-9ad0-5957-654fafa55f21', 'de', 'Er las daraus vom Morgen bis zum Mittag auf einem Holzgerüst'),
('86e10f61-6c43-9ad0-5957-654fafa55f21', 'en', 'He read from it from morning to midday on a wooden platform'),
('925ed453-82ef-01c8-c645-702b93589523', 'de', 'Er verteilte Abschriften an jedes Haus'),
('925ed453-82ef-01c8-c645-702b93589523', 'en', 'He distributed copies to every household'),
('2b06e4d9-9d7f-d919-4dfb-b3123a911e34', 'de', 'Er versiegelte das Buch und legte es in den Tempel'),
('2b06e4d9-9d7f-d919-4dfb-b3123a911e34', 'en', 'He sealed the book and laid it in the temple'),
('3c78a7e2-a417-9421-7496-06b0fd8f371a', 'de', 'Er verbrannte die alten Rollen und schrieb neue'),
('3c78a7e2-a417-9421-7496-06b0fd8f371a', 'en', 'He burned the old scrolls and wrote new ones'),
('370b79fc-5c47-bca3-442a-e420d07b5b9d', 'de', 'Du bewahrst Frieden, denn man verlässt sich auf dich'),
('370b79fc-5c47-bca3-442a-e420d07b5b9d', 'en', 'You keep in perfect peace the one whose mind trusts in you'),
('be66d251-17b6-03d4-0683-eaf759475879', 'de', 'Du sendest Reichtum dem, der auf dich vertraut'),
('be66d251-17b6-03d4-0683-eaf759475879', 'en', 'You send riches to the one who trusts in you'),
('96068d3b-212b-af59-d158-278b02d94458', 'de', 'Du gibst Ruhm dem, der dich von Herzen ehrt'),
('96068d3b-212b-af59-d158-278b02d94458', 'en', 'You give glory to the one who honors you sincerely'),
('05d6935b-4f5e-5e20-991b-cae730c38833', 'de', 'Du schenkst Ehre dem, der dir Opfer bringt'),
('05d6935b-4f5e-5e20-991b-cae730c38833', 'en', 'You grant honor to the one who brings you offerings'),
('4f9a8396-e424-fd1a-ee6e-016292053450', 'de', 'Er führte es mitten nach Samaria hinein'),
('4f9a8396-e424-fd1a-ee6e-016292053450', 'en', 'He led it right into the middle of Samaria'),
('2518cc35-8f8f-4d72-d6b1-3de04b3e99f3', 'de', 'Er übergab es dem König zur Hinrichtung'),
('2518cc35-8f8f-4d72-d6b1-3de04b3e99f3', 'en', 'He handed it over to the king for execution'),
('1d257b1e-6d0b-0dc9-fa44-618c3d27d862', 'de', 'Er trieb es zurück nach Damaskus'),
('1d257b1e-6d0b-0dc9-fa44-618c3d27d862', 'en', 'He drove it back to Damascus'),
('f3090a71-79d5-17f6-8461-cad0ba4364b4', 'de', 'Er ließ es im Feld verhungern'),
('f3090a71-79d5-17f6-8461-cad0ba4364b4', 'en', 'He left it to starve in the field'),
('7493d0b1-78c7-4230-651a-6f42a3140555', 'de', 'Er versammelte sein Heer zum Gegenangriff'),
('7493d0b1-78c7-4230-651a-6f42a3140555', 'en', 'He gathered his army for a counterattack'),
('7d99ee13-c20d-f058-402c-40b0c27098e3', 'de', 'Er breitete ihn vor dem Herrn im Tempel aus und betete'),
('7d99ee13-c20d-f058-402c-40b0c27098e3', 'en', 'He spread it before the Lord in the temple and prayed'),
('f5ad7bb4-a286-1f02-146a-5d426336f4b6', 'de', 'Er zerriss ihn und warf ihn ins Feuer'),
('f5ad7bb4-a286-1f02-146a-5d426336f4b6', 'en', 'He tore it up and threw it into the fire'),
('3cc56f98-5cfc-61b9-217c-2dee43f51745', 'de', 'Er sandte Gold an Sanherib zur Versöhnung'),
('3cc56f98-5cfc-61b9-217c-2dee43f51745', 'en', 'He sent gold to Sennacherib to make peace'),
('6e4b9167-8a21-28b3-8813-f604926d13f5', 'de', 'Zum Hohenpriester Hannas'),
('6e4b9167-8a21-28b3-8813-f604926d13f5', 'en', 'To the high priest Annas'),
('ed149b2a-22a9-fbae-ba45-eff7361e6695', 'de', 'Zu Kaiser Tiberius'),
('ed149b2a-22a9-fbae-ba45-eff7361e6695', 'en', 'To Caesar Tiberius'),
('ad4762d9-a6b0-6d26-5dd4-88bb27b6e24a', 'de', 'Zum König Agrippa'),
('ad4762d9-a6b0-6d26-5dd4-88bb27b6e24a', 'en', 'To King Agrippa'),
('4098e58f-3429-50f1-38ad-4f98c986fb70', 'de', 'Zu Herodes Antipas'),
('4098e58f-3429-50f1-38ad-4f98c986fb70', 'en', 'To Herod Antipas'),
('6b7b6487-f12f-4a41-f6b9-daffb74127a0', 'de', 'Er schüttete Mehl in den Topf'),
('6b7b6487-f12f-4a41-f6b9-daffb74127a0', 'en', 'He threw flour into the pot'),
('19343de3-7d13-70dc-d75d-c71bd5f17a44', 'de', 'Er sprach ein Gebet über dem Kessel'),
('19343de3-7d13-70dc-d75d-c71bd5f17a44', 'en', 'He prayed over the cauldron'),
('85fa34df-183b-0184-53b1-bf16968f5dfb', 'de', 'Er warf Salz in das Gericht'),
('85fa34df-183b-0184-53b1-bf16968f5dfb', 'en', 'He cast salt into the dish'),
('7d71131f-8210-e28b-08cf-7669f5418af2', 'de', 'Er nahm die wilden Ranken wieder heraus'),
('7d71131f-8210-e28b-08cf-7669f5418af2', 'en', 'He took the wild gourds back out'),
('0aa235a6-e8b4-709e-a188-836f82a746ca', 'de', 'Er stellte sich ans Tor und versprach jedem ein gerechtes Urteil'),
('0aa235a6-e8b4-709e-a188-836f82a746ca', 'en', 'He stood at the gate and promised everyone a just verdict'),
('0ca7f3c8-e57f-8e57-ce91-c11a11c5bbde', 'de', 'Er verteilte Gold unter dem Volk'),
('0ca7f3c8-e57f-8e57-ce91-c11a11c5bbde', 'en', 'He distributed gold among the people'),
('ab82e832-434a-cccb-b9b6-48613ad9dd0f', 'de', 'Er besiegte die Philister im Namen Davids'),
('ab82e832-434a-cccb-b9b6-48613ad9dd0f', 'en', 'He defeated the Philistines in David''s name'),
('4027c150-31bc-905b-d875-a3357a26da3b', 'de', 'Er baute dem Herrn einen neuen Altar'),
('4027c150-31bc-905b-d875-a3357a26da3b', 'en', 'He built the Lord a new altar'),
('ef5b89e5-df37-c7e1-8f07-716f51e0e3b5', 'de', 'Weil er den Weg versperrte'),
('ef5b89e5-df37-c7e1-8f07-716f51e0e3b5', 'en', 'Because it blocked the road'),
('f5ef86b2-3c9e-e96d-9827-7206f6cd3565', 'de', 'Weil seine Früchte vergiftet waren'),
('f5ef86b2-3c9e-e96d-9827-7206f6cd3565', 'en', 'Because its fruit was poisoned'),
('9876c6f8-f47f-161b-c4a6-9d9fb988de16', 'de', 'Weil er nur Blätter und keine Früchte trug'),
('9876c6f8-f47f-161b-c4a6-9d9fb988de16', 'en', 'Because it bore only leaves and no fruit'),
('3162b67a-a83e-656d-0b05-d0ff2f41f5b5', 'de', 'Weil er im Tempelhof stand'),
('3162b67a-a83e-656d-0b05-d0ff2f41f5b5', 'en', 'Because it stood in the temple court'),
('802054b6-62b1-e3a8-5196-10e8d3133aa2', 'de', 'Ein Mahl von fetten Speisen und abgeklärtem Wein'),
('802054b6-62b1-e3a8-5196-10e8d3133aa2', 'en', 'A feast of rich food and well-aged wine'),
('8ca1fa38-7dc0-a846-a14f-71f376d73256', 'de', 'Ein Mahl von Früchten und Honig im Garten'),
('8ca1fa38-7dc0-a846-a14f-71f376d73256', 'en', 'A feast of fruit and honey in the garden'),
('a5b38c04-8b96-2f85-7c18-66be537bbfac', 'de', 'Ein Mahl von Brot und Wasser für die Armen'),
('a5b38c04-8b96-2f85-7c18-66be537bbfac', 'en', 'A feast of bread and water for the poor'),
('e37e7628-796e-3e67-cd64-2fec641deac2', 'de', 'Ein Mahl von Lämmern und ungesäuertem Brot'),
('e37e7628-796e-3e67-cd64-2fec641deac2', 'en', 'A feast of lambs and unleavened bread'),
('a7c76775-3952-24f1-0b64-7e7e17592ee4', 'de', 'Zehn Tage Fasten ohne Opfer'),
('a7c76775-3952-24f1-0b64-7e7e17592ee4', 'en', 'Ten days of fasting without offering'),
('69db2774-4d37-0f94-5951-549541c4b259', 'de', 'Ein Brandopfer aus Vögeln allein'),
('69db2774-4d37-0f94-5951-549541c4b259', 'en', 'A burnt offering of birds only'),
('f8040fdf-9416-7c74-90ab-8b4802f2ba2c', 'de', 'Eine Geldbuße an die Priester'),
('f8040fdf-9416-7c74-90ab-8b4802f2ba2c', 'en', 'A monetary fine to the priests'),
('adfe0f24-3612-a5f7-47a5-22474c3c30b3', 'de', 'Ein Sündopfer entsprechend seinem Stand'),
('adfe0f24-3612-a5f7-47a5-22474c3c30b3', 'en', 'A sin offering according to his standing'),
('d888c29d-3a91-e7f2-967f-1e9edaf26832', 'de', 'Das Lied vom Auszug aus Ägypten'),
('d888c29d-3a91-e7f2-967f-1e9edaf26832', 'en', 'The song of the exodus from Egypt'),
('f49779c1-c757-c4ea-be3c-ad71d1ad9d70', 'de', 'Das Lied vom Fels, der Israel zeugte'),
('f49779c1-c757-c4ea-be3c-ad71d1ad9d70', 'en', 'The song of the Rock who fathered Israel'),
('8729d5bb-cbd3-2cbe-f87c-0f041b0ff7d8', 'de', 'Das Lied der Quelle in der Wüste'),
('8729d5bb-cbd3-2cbe-f87c-0f041b0ff7d8', 'en', 'The song of the well in the wilderness'),
('673ab922-cbf8-5708-6bc0-b817bece4e5e', 'de', 'Das Lied vom Sieg über Amalek'),
('673ab922-cbf8-5708-6bc0-b817bece4e5e', 'en', 'The song of victory over Amalek'),
('ecfc5daf-d336-a93b-bdd7-60ce688dd274', 'de', 'Den Reinen im Herzen'),
('ecfc5daf-d336-a93b-bdd7-60ce688dd274', 'en', 'The pure in heart'),
('2a20bb17-6bdc-9a38-6200-89d94c6780d3', 'de', 'Den Armen im Geist'),
('2a20bb17-6bdc-9a38-6200-89d94c6780d3', 'en', 'The poor in spirit'),
('086f0563-677f-f425-6f3b-ce376bcf99f0', 'de', 'Den Hungernden nach Gerechtigkeit'),
('086f0563-677f-f425-6f3b-ce376bcf99f0', 'en', 'Those who hunger for righteousness'),
('f3f7ec2d-bf76-f443-d4e1-970b4b1176fd', 'de', 'Den Sanftmütigen auf Erden'),
('f3f7ec2d-bf76-f443-d4e1-970b4b1176fd', 'en', 'The meek on earth'),
('5a851321-e305-cfcf-644a-ddda69916ec4', 'de', 'Die Königreiche der Welt anzunehmen'),
('5a851321-e305-cfcf-644a-ddda69916ec4', 'en', 'To accept the kingdoms of the world'),
('c1b3f861-a2d9-b1ec-8625-2bb5c4fd4324', 'de', 'Wasser in Wein zu verwandeln'),
('c1b3f861-a2d9-b1ec-8625-2bb5c4fd4324', 'en', 'To turn water into wine'),
('f177bc4a-b083-d5d6-af98-359911ba40d7', 'de', 'Vom Tempel herabzuspringen'),
('f177bc4a-b083-d5d6-af98-359911ba40d7', 'en', 'To leap down from the temple'),
('4c47dd75-c986-dba3-548d-04e16f9ee37a', 'de', 'Aus Steinen Brot zu machen'),
('4c47dd75-c986-dba3-548d-04e16f9ee37a', 'en', 'To make bread out of stones'),
('ca1c99af-9bd8-effc-dad3-27e8ffaaaaff', 'de', 'Brennende Lampen in ihren Händen'),
('ca1c99af-9bd8-effc-dad3-27e8ffaaaaff', 'en', 'Burning lamps in their hands'),
('6259ce3a-e9ff-8104-c693-3708ceadb162', 'de', 'Räuchergefäße in ihren Händen'),
('6259ce3a-e9ff-8104-c693-3708ceadb162', 'en', 'Censers in their hands'),
('2aed6507-dcaa-360a-7703-55ffc2deb142', 'de', 'Palmzweige in ihren Händen'),
('2aed6507-dcaa-360a-7703-55ffc2deb142', 'en', 'Palm branches in their hands'),
('75691d0d-1ce2-36bc-3649-d9f03bc45eb8', 'de', 'Goldene Harfen in ihren Händen'),
('75691d0d-1ce2-36bc-3649-d9f03bc45eb8', 'en', 'Golden harps in their hands'),
('335d83e9-39c8-397b-3ca7-264c5a06e2fa', 'de', 'Dieser wird ein mächtiger König über Rom sein'),
('335d83e9-39c8-397b-3ca7-264c5a06e2fa', 'en', 'This child will be a mighty king over Rome'),
('07ea1089-5ff5-3347-c6b8-1bda76c7cfd5', 'de', 'Dieser ist gesetzt zum Fall und Aufstehen vieler in Israel'),
('07ea1089-5ff5-3347-c6b8-1bda76c7cfd5', 'en', 'This child is appointed for the fall and rising of many in Israel'),
('00bc0583-5a69-abcb-df3d-8301fa807fb8', 'de', 'Dieser wird das Volk in die Wüste führen'),
('00bc0583-5a69-abcb-df3d-8301fa807fb8', 'en', 'This child will lead the people into the wilderness'),
('b2779d40-6866-d7e8-5a83-9fca75d1a3d3', 'de', 'Dieser wird im Tempel als Hoherpriester dienen'),
('b2779d40-6866-d7e8-5a83-9fca75d1a3d3', 'en', 'This child will serve as high priest in the temple'),
('9875ac94-a951-7654-396b-939bfdb87ea5', 'de', 'Um den Tod seiner Feinde'),
('9875ac94-a951-7654-396b-939bfdb87ea5', 'en', 'For the death of his enemies'),
('5cc54154-d4cb-47fe-a5dc-ff62fb26bbbb', 'de', 'Um Sieg über die umliegenden Völker'),
('5cc54154-d4cb-47fe-a5dc-ff62fb26bbbb', 'en', 'For victory over the surrounding nations'),
('afacb997-b7a1-7942-1bdd-601ae461ed86', 'de', 'Um langes Leben und großen Reichtum'),
('afacb997-b7a1-7942-1bdd-601ae461ed86', 'en', 'For long life and great riches'),
('f127e556-c651-037c-1cf4-a9c079baea34', 'de', 'Um ein verständiges Herz, das Recht und Unrecht unterscheidet'),
('f127e556-c651-037c-1cf4-a9c079baea34', 'en', 'For an understanding heart to discern right and wrong')
